window.FWN_GODLY_STAY_HOME_DAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_STAY_HOME_DAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1601,"title":"Chapter 1601 Moving On With A Heavy Responsibility","paragraphs":["Chapter 1601 Moving On With A Heavy Responsibility","Sir sighed softly.","This sigh seemed to be mixed with the Great Domain of life.","One resonated with it.","He used to be very glorious, but now his glory was gone. He sighed with emotion about everything in the world, as if he didn’t care about anything, but he had always helped Zhang Han for some reason.","“Mengmeng, you are the Heavenly Lord. These things are all yours, but you are the little princess. As a girl, you are not suitable for these things. Therefore, it is Zhang Han’s turn to get them.”","Sir chuckled.","“I have to say, this kid is pretty lucky.”","Zhang Han was speechless.","“Fifth Mind’s thinking is quite conventional.","“Just like when I came back and saw Mengmeng, my first feeling was that I couldn’t guide her, and she couldn’t get my martial arts heritage.","“However... it is actually nice to have a daughter.”","Over the years, Zhang Han watched Mengmeng grow up and found it nice to have her as his child. The little princess was particularly clingy and obedient. Judging from the way how Chen Changqing and Chen Chuan got along with each other, Zhang Han could feel that having a daughter was different from having a son.","“Then, that means these belong to my dad,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","“Yes, it’s all his now,” Sir said. “These high-end things are his, but you have a lot of things. Except for these duplications, everything else is yours. I’m not giving them to him.”","“Well, what’s mine is my dad’s. It works the same,” Mengmeng said indifferently.","“That won’t do. You and he are not the same. You can’t allow him to use some of the treasures.”","“Then I’ll be angry.” Mengmeng snorted. “You’re sowing discord between us, aren’t you?”","“Hahahaha!”","Sir laughed out loud.","Yue Wuwei also laughed.","He deeply felt that the Fifth Mind was different.","The other minds of Sir would not be like this.","The Fifth Mind seemed to like chatting with Mengmeng very much.","After saying those words, he said to Zhang Han, “Come here. I’ll take you to experience the Immortal Body at a close distance.”","Swoosh!","The others stayed high in the sky. Sir took Zhang Han down and stopped when they were a kilometer away from the ground.","“How do you feel?” Sir asked.","“Nothing.” Zhang Han hesitated and said, “Do you have something to tell me?”","“Yes.”","Sir said, “If you have any questions, you can ask me first.”","He expressed that he could give Zhang Han some information.","Zhang Han seized the opportunity.","“What’s our relationship?” Zhang Han asked directly.","This question made Sir silent.","“We are very close, but also very far away. You don’t need to know anything else. Next question.”","“Last time, I heard that there were roughly six kinds of domains in the higher world, which were the Human Domain, God Domain, Devil Domain, Immortal Domain, Demon Domain, and Spirit Domain. The Human Domain is relatively difficult to take, but the Spirit Domain is all-encompassing. Last time, my Thunder Body came into contact and resonated with my wife. The Thunder Body is the Spiritual Body. I guess that the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure is on the way to being a Human Saint. The Land of God’s Meteorite is the Godly Body, and the Burial Land of the Immortals has the Immortal Body. I got the Golden-armored Giant Beast from the higher world. It is a Great Devil King, and I have the Great Demon Body. Does this mean that I have six bodies?” asked Zhang Han.","Sir pondered and said leisurely, “Correct. From the moment you started cultivating, I already prepared the six bodies of the Six Domains, which have terrifying growth. This is unprecedented.”","“Is my rebirth related to you?” Zhang Han asked.","“It’s related.”","“Why me?” Zhang Han asked.","“You... just regard yourself as the chosen one.” Sir began to hesitate because he could answer many questions, but he didn’t want to lay his cards on the table.","After thinking for a while, he said, “Stop asking this kind of question. Let’s talk about it when you see Eldest Mind.”","“So, do you want to take me as your disciple or something? There must be a reason.”","“Eldest Mind tell you the reason.”","“All right.” Zhang Han smiled helplessly and said, “Thank you for telling me.”","“You’re welcome,” Sir said. “You’ve long gotten all the bodies of the Six Domains. The Golden-armored Giant Beast is very strong, even stronger than what I’ve prepared. The growing space of the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure is also very large. These are all your own opportunities. It’s not bad. However...”","As soon as the word “however” was said, Zhang Han felt a little depressed.","“You’ve returned from rebirth and violated the Six Domains of Reincarnation. Your journey has been smooth, but you will not continue like this. The more smooth things are for you now, the more difficult the calamity you will have to endure in the future.”","Swoosh!","Zhang Han was shocked.","He had goosebumps all over.","It had been so many years since he had experienced the creeps as he did now.","“I’ve been cultivating for so long. The more smooth things are for me now, the more difficult the calamity I will have to endure in the future.","“That is too terrifying!”","“So what you have to do is to improve your strength as soon as possible. Take it as the Thunder Tribulation at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier. You can’t avoid it but can make it come sooner. Otherwise, there will be endless troubles.","“You bear everyone’s hope, so you can’t stop. You seem to be relaxed, but in fact, you are moving on with a heavy burden. Your rebirth is not the masterpiece of nature, nor is it a conspiracy. The Great Domain is natural. You have violated it. Get prepared for that calamity. This is also why I took you to see the Immortal Body and why the Seventh Mind took the initiative to show you the Land of God’s Meteorite.”","“I...” Zhang Han was silent for two seconds and took a deep breath. “I’m not afraid that something will happen to me. I’m afraid that my family will be in trouble.”","“Your family and friends rise with you when you succeed but fall with you when you’re in calamity.” Sir sighed softly and said, “Work hard to cultivate. Well, that’s enough to talk about today. Go back. Your Golden-armored Giant Beast is about to come out. When the time comes, you can bear the burden of the Immortal Body and come here to condense the Golden-armored Giant Beast into an Immortal Body.”","“I see.” Zhang Han cupped his hands and said, “Thank you.”","“What’s more, don’t let the Thunder Body touch Zi Yan.” The mind of Sir said, “Zi Yan’s spiritual body hasn’t awakened yet. She is very fragile and easy to be assimilated and absorbed. Do you understand?”","Swoosh!","Zhang Han’s face changed again.","“I understand.”","From now on, he would never take out his Thunder Body in front of Zi Yan.","“Your way of cultivation is very simple. You can absorb more Thunder Tribulation to evolve your Thunder Body. You can also evolve your Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure by devouring more treasure lands. As for your Great Demon Body, it’s even simpler. You can absorb the demonic Qi and Deadlands. He has a planet to nourish him. Even if you don’t take good care of him, he can also grow to the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.”","Sir reminded, “Also, don’t be too careless when devouring the tribulation thunder. There is also a trace of consciousness in the Heavenly Tribulation, but it may be a little stupid and immature.”","“I see.”","Zhang Han nodded.","It was nothing more than a battle of wits and courage with the Heavenly Tribulation.","“All right. Go back now. Come here when the Golden-armored Giant Beast succeeds.”","Sir said, “My main mind can’t appear too many times, or it will cause the Great Domain to ban us.”","“Got it.”","Zhang Han thanked him again. “Thank you for telling me, Sir.”","“Go now.”","Sir waved his hand.","Zhang Han returned to Zi Yan and the others’ side. They performed the Shadow Displacement Transposition and appeared in front of the crowd outside out of thin air.","“Dad, how are you feeling? What did you talk about?” Mengmeng asked with a smile.","“Haha, I feel great.” Zhang Han laughed and said, “I still benefited a lot from you. It’s all thanks to you. You’re amazing.”","“You bet.” Mengmeng was very smug.","Zi Yan was also smiling. Yue Wuwei stroked his beard, while the others didn’t know what had happened. They planned to ask about it later.","Only Zhang Han felt as if a huge mountain was weighing down on his heart.","But in front of his relatives, he still smiled brightly.","Under the pressure, he was willing to move forward.","He was like an ordinary father, a responsible man.","Walking to the crowd, Mu Xue ran to Mengmeng and asked, “What happened in there?”","“I won’t tell you.” Mengmeng pouted and put on a very cute expression.","“Humph.” Mu Xue curled her lips and said, “You don’t talk to me much like the time when I took you around to have fun.”","“It was nothing. He just showed us some treasures.” Mengmeng glanced at the One-horned White Horse and said, “This place belongs to my dad.”","“Alas!”","The One-horned White Horse was so sad.","“I didn’t expect this place to be their home.”","“Then can we stay here?”","“Of course. Keep and guard the gate well,” Mengmeng said.","The One-horned White Horse was lost in thought.","A few minutes ago, it was still the host of this place, but in just a few minutes, it became a gatekeeper.","But it knew that it didn’t need to think more about this matter with that figure of light and the fact that those people could enter.","“It’s good that I can live here. I’m happy to be a gatekeeper.” The One-horned White Horse felt relaxed after thinking about it.","“I can do it as well.” Azure Dragon King shouted in the distance, “Zhang Hanyang, I can also be your gatekeeper.”","“You can come here and settle down after guarding the Space Shooting Planets for ten years,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay. I’ll definitely complete the mission!” Azure Dragon King flapped his wings and patted his chest.","“Go back now. Inform the Silver Dragon Galaxy to provide the materials for the construction of the Space Shooting Planets.” Zhang Han said, “It’s time for us to go to the Center Galaxy.”","“Go to the Center Galaxy?”","Everyone gasped. “So soon?”","“Yeah.”","Zhang Han nodded and said, “There are more Tribulation Stage masters over there, and there are also a lot of treasure lands. Moreover, we need to find the lover of the Sect Leader of Illusory Sea Manor. We have to do this first, in case anything unexpected happens.”","Hearing this, Yue Wuwei perked up. “Okay, let’s pack up and go.”","“Dad, let’s go back to Earth first. I have to say goodbye to my friends,” Mengmeng said.","“Okay. There’s no hurry. Let’s go back and prepare for a few days before we set off.”","Zhang Han smiled and touched Mengmeng’s head.","He couldn’t solve the problem in a hurry, so he had a few days or even a few months to do other things.","However, before the calamity mentioned by the Sir was solved, Zhang Han would not cultivate in such a leisurely way.","He needed to improve his strength as soon as possible so that the calamity would come sooner. Only in this way could the situation not be so bad.","Thinking about it, Zhang Han was a little worried.","Yue Wuwei approached Zhang Han and said with a smile, “Shall we go out and have fun for a while this time? In the Center Galaxy?”","They would have fun by stealing tribulation lightning and absorbing treasure lands.","The terrible tribulation thunder in the past had become food for Zhang Han.","Even Yue Wuwei didn’t dare to think about it.","“That should be the case.”","Zhang Han nodded.","Hearing their conversation, Chen Changqing felt jealous at once.","“Alas. Back then, I was looking forward to going out to gain experience, explore the secret lands, get treasures, and make a breakthrough with Brother Han. However, I was taken to experience it only once. Now, Elder Yue and Brother Han, you are going out to have fun together. I can only watch you. I’m so sad.”","“You’ve improved your strength too slowly.” Yue Wuwei snorted.","Chen Changqing was speechless.","“Am I slow?","“I’m not slow. In less than 20 years, I’ve become a Void-refining Realm Dao Seeking Cultivator.","“In the whole Cultivation World, I’m one of the fastest.”"]},{"number":1602,"title":"Chapter 1602 Farewell","paragraphs":["Chapter 1602 Farewell","Everything was arranged.","The crowd set off for the Southern Mountain Area. Yue Wuwei had issued an order, and no one dared to stop him. In fact, there were not many materials that could be used to build a Space Shooting Planet in the Silver Dragon Galaxy.","Originally, every sect planned to merely build a Space Shooting Planet passage connected to another Galaxy. However, it turned out that Yue Wuwei would not give up until he got the materials.","The army marched along the Earth to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven and built the Space Shooting Planet. The three-year project began just like that.","The Vast Heaven Sect was guarded by Elder Li and his men, the Heavenly Dragon Star Province was led by Headmaster Shan, and so on. The Astral Domain of Vast Heaven only needed an intelligent system and a few experts.","In the villa that Yue Xiaonao had bought in Modu City, the dinner party was going on.","There were not many of them, including Chen Yang from West Capital, accompanied by his girlfriend.","Now Chen Yang’s girlfriend knew that Mengmeng and the others were the bosses and partners of Chen Yang. At first, she was a little jealous and uncomfortable, but she became fine with it after Chen Yang appeased her.","The main reason was that she could rest assured while she could guard Chenyang now. Moreover, the newly established company also needed her. She also knew something about Zheng Dan, Lv Zihan, and so on.","Mengmeng and the others often didn’t come to school, so even she was a little curious.","There were more than a dozen people at the table, including Lv Zihan. It was very lively.","“This time, we’ll be out for at least two to three years, or at most ten to eight years.”","Mengmeng held a glass of red wine, smiled, and said, “You are one of the few friends we have. Before we leave, Xiaonao, Nina, Felina, and I have prepared a gift for you. We hope you guys will stay happy ever after.”","The atmosphere of parting was definitely not good.","Li Muen burst into tears at once. “Why will you be gone so long this time? Mengmeng, I will be missing you so much.”","“You will be out for such a long time.” Lv Zihan pursed his lips.","Chen Yang also sighed softly, but then he adjusted the atmosphere and said, “Bosses, don’t worry. Boss Li and I will run the company well. When you come back, maybe our market value will be a billion.”","“Okay. I’m sure that will happen.”","Mengmeng also felt a little sad.","Li Xiaohao appeased Li Muen.","After a while, Nina took out all kinds of gift boxes and handed them to everyone. Everyone had a share. The girls were not familiar with Chen Yang’s girlfriend, but they give her a gift as well.","“Open it when you go back. There’s a letter inside,” Yue Xiaonao said casually. “Don’t cry. It’s not like we’re going to die. It’s just that we will be gone for a long time. Maybe when we come back, your children will have already started going to school.”","“Come on, let’s drink.”","Chen Yang asked everyone to drink.","As a result, he was the first to get drunk.","Li Muen cried so hard that her nose was covered with snot and tears while drinking.","Zheng Dan also got drunk and passed out.","In the end, Mengmeng and the other girls arranged for them to stay in their rooms.","They turned around and left.","Chen Yang’s girlfriend didn’t get drunk. When she returned to the bedroom, she curiously opened her gift box.","She held the exquisite necklace, and her eyes lit up.","It was so beautiful.","She just didn’t expect that she also had a letter.","There was beautiful handwriting on it. “I wish you and Chen Yang a happy life together. I second that. I second that. I second that.”","Looking at these beautiful words, she felt that they were written by Zhang Yumeng.","“What did they write in the letter for Chen Yang?”","After hesitating for a while, she lay on the bed and waited for Chen Yang to wake up before he opened his gift box.","Chen Yang read out loud, “You surely have a promising future as a funny guy.","“Hahaha. Sister Nao must have written this.”","There were also three “I second that”s behind those words.","As for Li Muen, she wiped away her tears as she read her letters.","There were already a lot of tissue balls on the bedside.","“For Muen, my cute kitten.”","It was a letter from Mengmeng.","“In fact, I don’t want to write anything because we have a good relationship. It doesn’t matter whether I write it or not. Then, I hope you can be happy. I am a cultivator. You know, you will definitely come into contact with it in the future. I will give you three kinds of treasures. One is my exclusive token. If there is any trouble, you can take the token to Mount New Moon. The necklace is a treasure that can help keep your youth. The last thing is a ring that can protect you. We have been together since we were children. It may take a long time for us to be separated now. I am also reluctant to part with you. Fortunately, I will come back. As I said, when you want to cultivate in the future, I will take you to cultivate.”","At the end of the letter was Zhang Yumeng’s name.","The letter was very simple. Mengmeng didn’t even want to recall the past, but Li Muen’s mind was filled with the scenes of her and Mengmeng growing up together.","They played together in kindergarten and primary school, and Li Muen became cheerful. They were still best friends in junior high school, senior high school, and college.","They were childhood friends.","There were so many people who knew Mengmeng along the way, but almost all of them gradually drifted away. Even Wang Yihan, their former sister, gradually disappeared from their sight.","Only the two of them had been together since college.","They had a deep friendship, which was not something that could be easily obtained.","But there was no such thing as a banquet that would last forever. Today, they finally parted.","It was not for a few months, half a year. They would be away from each other for a few years, even a decade.","Li Muen cried so hard that her eyes were swollen.","No matter how much Li Xiaohao comforted her, it was useless.","There were also letters from Nina, Felina, and Yue Xiaonao.","Nina wrote something in her letter. Felina’s letter was very brief. As for Yue Xiaonao, her letter made Li Muen burst into laughter for a few seconds.","“Haha.”","Li Muen smiled and continued to cry. She hugged her boyfriend and said, “Hao, my best friends are gone. I’m the only one left.”","Li Xiaohao was baffled by this. He sighed in his heart and said, “They’re not going anywhere else. They’re just going abroad, aren’t they? If you miss them, let’s go abroad and visit them. They can’t leave Earth, can they? All right, stop crying...”","What he didn’t know was that the girls were really leaving Earth.","At this time, Zhang Han and the others had already left the Southern Mountain Area and taken the Space Shooting Planets to the Center Galaxy.","It was not just Mengmeng.","Zi Yan also met some friends, including Tang Jiayi and the others.","She also gave out a lot of treasures.","Being friends with a cultivator, one could surely get a lot of benefits and live a long life.","The cultivators certainly didn’t want to face a city without friends when they came back. Even if it was prosperous, it would make people feel lonely.","Of course, most of the peak experts, who stood at the top and overlooked the world, were lonely. Zhang Han and his team were now going to travel to a big place like the Center Galaxy.","The day before they left, there were so many people on Mount New Moon.","The ones from the Wang Family, Zi Clan, Liang Clan, and Rong Clan were all gathering here.","It was a farewell party.","Zhang Li and Liang Hao, who had been traveling outside for a long time, also came back.","This time was different. The main force would be out for many years, so they would definitely follow.","Chen Changqing, Chen Chuan, Zhou Fei, and Liang Mengqi, as well as Liu Jiaran, would go with them.","Even Ji Wushuang, Lei Tiannan, the former Sect Leader of the Water Cloud Sect, and other high-position officials of the Luo Fu Sword sect were on this trip.","This time, Zhang Han only brought many core members with him, and some of them even stayed here.","The Warlord of the Chan Clan took the initiative to stay.","Zi Long and Zi Hu also stayed on Mount New Moon.","At the same time, the spiritual herbs on Mount New Moon could also be used for their cultivation. They would be cultivating in seclusion for many years.","Liu Qingfeng was guarding the Southern Mountain Area in person.","He led a large number of core members, including Sun Ming and Sun Dongheng, and they were also core helpers.","At the entrance of the Ancient Road of Starry Sky in the ancient martial arts world, Sun Ming was guarding it in person. He had installed powerful technological weapons on a large scale. Moreover, the Cosmos Formation that Zhang Han had set up himself, as well as the formation eye Yue Wuwei had taken out, had been set up. If they had no choice, they would blow up the Ancient Road of Starry Sky.","It seemed that there was no problem, but Liu Qingfeng was still quite cautious. He had installed a lot of weapons in the passages between Earth and the ancient martial arts world.","If it didn’t work, he would blow up the passage.","Yue Wuwei laughed at this.","“He’s too careful. The Warlord of Chan Clan and the others may kill whoever enters the secular world one by one.”","The suppression of the world’s rules was no joke.","Moreover, the mind of Sir was still around. Even the masters at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier didn’t dare to act rashly.","In fact, such a large force was the weakest in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","Zhang Han also told Elder Li and the others that if they encountered any trouble, they should run away. If they couldn’t handle it, they could surrender. It didn’t matter.","Everything was arranged properly.","On this day, the team set off on their journey.","The Dragon Honor, a high-end king vessel, flew from one Star Area to another by taking Space Shooting Planets.","But the Space Shooting Planets could not reach the Center Galaxy directly. The team still had a long way to go.","“The Barren Star Area is just ahead. It will take us about a year and a half to get there.”","Zhang Han was familiar with this place as soon as he arrived.","At this time, he also opened the jade slip that the Sect Leader of Illusory Sea Manor had given him.","A series of information appeared in the void under everyone’s gaze.","There was a woman with bronze skin. She was slightly fat, plump, and charming. She was wearing a blue dress and standing in the sea of flowers.","“She is that senior’s wife.” Mengmeng blinked.","The woman was not exquisitely beautiful, but she was still a beauty.","“Gu Linli.","“A member of the Poli Clan.","“Her aura is relatively dark, so you can feel it with this method.”","The voice of the Sect Master of Illusory Sea Manor rang out, and there was a set of simple occult art operating.","“321 years ago, she was taken away by the Black Spirit Wizards. I searched every corner of the Silver Dragon Galaxy. When I was about to find her, they left for the Center Galaxy. But over the years, I have collected a lot of information about Black Spirit Wizards.","“This group of Black Spirit Wizards was led by an elder of a tribe. The person who captured her was called Wei Ersi.","“They are members of the Black Spirit Clan, who are born with the ability to cast dark magic. They are very powerful. It is said that Wei Ersi is at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage, and their patriarch is at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","“When I heard the news, I was disheartened. They are one of the forces guarding the Silver Dragon Galaxy. The Black Spirit Clan is one of the top forces in the Center Galaxy.","“They have close cooperation with eight large sects.","“Because my wife, Gu Linli, has the Dark Fire and is a member of the Poli Clan, those devils would definitely absorb the energy in my wife’s body all year round to nourish the treasures that belong to them.”","“...”","The Sect Leader of Illusory Sea Manor sounded helpless and resentful from the series of news and even his tone.","He hated those people so much.","Why did they take Gu Linli away?","Why did he fail to protect his lover?","Was he incompetent?","“It’s not that he’s not capable.”","On the silent field, Zhang Han sighed softly.","“This kind of thing happens. There are many clans among humans that are of great benefit to the other clans, so it’s not strange that she was captured.”","“Alas!”","Ning Chen sighed and said, “I don’t even know the details. Now that I think about it, the Sect Master is also a poor guy.”","Li Shan said, “He said that he is not a good person, but he is very nice to us. Apart from restricting our freedom, he did nothing else inappropriate.”","“He has helped us a lot.” Zi Yan pursed her red lips slightly. “If possible, we will try our best to save Gu Linli. When the time comes...”","Zi Yan looked at Zhang Han and said, “If you want to act alone, put us in a safe place.”","“The two of us can act separately. We’d better be careful in the Center Galaxy,” Zhang Han said.","“I’m prepared for that.”","Yue Wuwei revealed a mysterious smile.","After saying that, he fell silent.","Someone asked, “How are you prepared?”","Yue Wuwei continued, “I’ve prepared a large Space Portal. As long as we are not separated by a Star Area, we can come back in an instant. Also, this spaceship is surrounded by a Bounded Domain set up by my precious treasures, which can resist the attacks of Dao Seeking Cultivators at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage for a few minutes.”","After that, he glanced at Zhang Han.","Now Yue Wuwei also enjoyed having a good time going out with Zhang Han.","Stealing thunder was really cool to him.","When Yue Wuwei recalled it, he would even laugh out loud.","“Don’t be too nervous.”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and glanced at the hundreds of people present.","“The reason why I took you to the Center Galaxy is not that it would be a long trip, but that there are more high-end secret realms here, which are suitable for you to explore. What’s more, spending a few years in the Galaxy is also very important to your experience. Compared with the tasks for Zhang Han and me, your tasks are actually more important, understand?”","“Understood.”","Zhao Feng made an obeisance by cupping one hand in the other before his chest and said with a smile, “We’ll train when everything is fine, and we won’t make trouble when something’s up.”","“Yes, that’s what I mean.” Yue Wuwei smiled faintly.","“There are also many Starry Sky Beasts or all kinds of space turbulence in the Barren Star Area. Fortunately, our spaceship is relatively high-end, so we can resist the Space Storm in advance. It’s just that it won’t work on the Starry Sky Beasts.”","As soon as Yue Wuwei finished speaking-","Buzz!","The spaceship suddenly shook and jumped out of the secondary space on its own.","“Alert. The left side is under attack.”","“Alert. The right side is under attack.”","Seeing the scene captured on the screen, everyone was stunned.","Every one of those monsters had eight legs, a snake head, and a fishtail. Each of them was about the same size as a spaceship.","There were more than a dozen of them nearby. Their eyes were shining with dim light.","“Eight-legged Snake Dragons.”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly and said, “This kind of Starry Sky Beast can sense the flow of the secondary space and launch attacks in advance. They feed on souls. The stronger the soul is, the more energy it can replenish in its body.”","At first, everyone looked serious.","But what Zhang Han said next stunned everyone.","“But the Eight-legged Snake Dragon is very delicious, especially its tail. Its meat is tender. It’s delicious and tender whether it’s used to make soup or braised. It tastes very good.”","Zhang Han laughed.","“We’re in luck today. Sixteen Eight-legged Snake Dragons can be used to make several meals.”","“Hahaha, don’t just talk. Go and kill them.” Yue Wuwei also laughed.","“You alone will be enough to finish them. Hurry up,” Zhang Han said bluntly.","“Didn’t you just have the Great Demon Body? Why don’t you try its power?” Yue Wuwei said, “Hurry up. Lest they will run away later.”","“The Great Demon Body will need to be nourished for some time,” Zhang Han said helplessly.","“Alright then.”","Yue Wuwei turned into a gust of wind, left the spaceship, and launched several palm strikes outside.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","The sixteen Eight-legged Snake Dragons were instantly killed.","“I’m going to dissect them.”","Zhang Han also left the spaceship, carrying the Seven-star Sword.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Sword lights flashed.","The tails were cut off in good condition, and part of the viscera, eight legs, and some other essence meat was cut off by Zhang Han.","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei returned to the spaceship.","Swoosh!","The spaceship cut through the void, entered the secondary space, and continued its journey to the Center Galaxy."]},{"number":1603,"title":"Chapter 1603 Eating on the Journey","paragraphs":["Chapter 1603 Eating on the Journey","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei just sat down.","Hiss!","Dahei jumped out of Mengmeng’s schoolbag. It was a miniature gorilla. It ran to Zhang Han and hugged his leg.","“It’s such a waste, host. You left so much meat over there.”","What Dahei said made everyone laugh.","This guy was also a super foodie.","Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing. “Not every piece of meat of an Eight-legged Snake Dragon can be eaten. Some parts of its body are poisonous and some parts are not nutritious. Of course, I don’t need to keep them. But I’ve taken all their inner pellets. Go ahead and eat them.”","While speaking, Zhang Han took out eight inner pellets.","“I can’t bite this thing. Second Brother, you eat it.” Dahei patted its chest very carefully.","Plop!","Zhang Han threw out a large piece of meat, about two cubic meters.","Dahei smiled and dragged the meat to roast it.","“What should we do first?”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “Cook a pot of soup and then roast some meat. It’s relatively simple.”","He did as he said.","There were kebabs on the large barbecue grill. The meat chunks were like small fists, and each kebab could almost fill an ordinary person.","Mengmeng roasted more than a thousand kebabs in person. In just a few minutes, the smell of meat rose.","Without any seasonings, just the smell of meat was enough to make people drool.","After a while, the soup was done.","“There’s too much. How about having some vegetarian dishes?” Zi Yan grinned.","Now, she liked to order vegetarian dishes at every meal.","Zhang Han was also in the mood to cook, so he cooked some vegetables.","Soon, the catering party in the secondary space began.","“Hahaha, traveling is amazing.” Ning Chen laughed heartily.","“Come on, let’s drink another jar of wine,” Li Shan said.","“Cheers!”","Zhang Guangyou’s face turned red.","Zi Qiang who came with them had already got drunk. He lay under the table and then was sent back to the room by Xu Xinyu.","Although she drank too much every time, the effect was obvious. Unknowingly, Zi Qiang was about to reach the Elixir Realm.","“This meat is delicious.” Felina ate it with relish.","“It’s really delicious. I didn’t expect that such an ugly Exotic Beast would be so delicious,” Kong Ling’er said with a smile.","Since she followed Zhang Han and became his disciple, she suddenly found that the Barren Star Area of the Cultivation World seemed to be different.","In the past, it had been quite dangerous. Whenever she encountered an Exotic Beast, she would take a detour.","But now, those horrible Exotic Beasts had become a meal. Among them, some were at the Tribulation Stage First Tier or the Second Tier. Sometimes, the crowd would encounter the ancient demonic beasts at the Tribulation Stage Third Tier.","“This soup doesn’t taste like meat soup at all.” Mengmeng took a sip and said, “It tastes a little strange. It seems to be a kind of flower fragrance?”","“It does smell like flowers.”","Zhang Han nodded and said, “The tail of an Eight-legged Snake Dragon is the essence of its body. Taking it will greatly nourish one’s body.”","The dragon tail could be used as one of the main ingredients of several kinds of medicinal pellets. But Zhang Han was too lazy to do pellet refining. Eating it directly would lose a lot of energy, but he liked to study delicacies.","Zhang Han said, “Eat them all. After eating, you will go into seclusion. You should be able to absorb them all in about a month.”","They ate soup while barbecuing. One-fifth of the Eight-legged Snake Dragons were fed to Dahei and Little Hei.","The rest was eaten by everyone.","“My whole body is hot and dry.”","“The energy is growing so fast. No, no, I have to refine it.”","“We’re cultivating in seclusion.”","“...”","The crowd went to different rooms one after another.","Originally, there were not many rooms in the king vessel. All the rooms were all kinds of halls. As for the Dragon Honor, it was a luxurious spaceship. There were thousands of guest rooms and all kinds of entertainment facilities.","It was like a private plane equipped with all kinds of services.","There was enough room for cultivation. Except for Yue Wuwei, Zhang Han, Ning Chen, and other Tribulation Stage Dao Seeking Cultivators, who didn’t need to refine the energy especially, the others all began their cultivation.","A month passed in the blink of an eye.","During this period, the spaceship stopped twice. The first time it stopped was because of the Starry Hair-wolves the crowd saw.","Zhang Han said bluntly, “Let’s go. These animals live in groups. There must be tens of millions of wolves nearby, and their meat is not delicious.”","Yue Wuwei cast a defensive supernatural power, and the spaceship successfully escaped.","The second time the spaceship stopped, the crowd saw some Azure-Winged Bulls.","There were a total of 300 of them.","Sensing the space fluctuation, the Bull King moved its horn, which almost pierced a hole in the spaceship.","“Azure-Winged Bulls are quite rare.”","Zhang Han sighed with emotion.","The King of the Azure-Winged Bulls had reached the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage, and its physical defense was invincible. Yue Wuwei couldn’t do anything about it.","The crowd had wanted to retreat, but for some unknown reason, the raging Bull King had to target the spaceship.","“The Bull King is very vengeful.”","Zhang Han said, “They like metal. Maybe they’re into our spaceship.”","“Stop studying it. Hurry up and kill a few of them so that the bull will take the initiative to escape.” Yue Wuwei was engaged in a fierce battle with the Bull King.","The others were frightened when they saw this.","“Elder Yue is too powerful. That bull is also very powerful.”","At this time, Zhang Han took action.","The Thunder Body appeared.","The Thunder Willow knocked out dozens of bulls with one move.","At this moment, they fainted.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Zhang Han slaughtered nine bulls and put them into his Space Ring.","“Moo!”","The Bull King was furious and its attacks became even more cunning and fierce. Even Yue Wuwei had to use his moves to temporarily avoid the attack.","“You little bull, don’t push your luck. Believe it or not, I’ll kill you,” Yue Wuwei glared at the Bull King.","Looking at the charging Bull King, Yue Wuwei threw out a huge piece of metal.","It was a nice treasure.","Taking advantage of the two seconds when the Bull King was in a daze, Yue Wuwei withdrew. He cast three defensive supernatural powers to make the king vessel leave.","He also knew that Zhang Han had said that the Bull King was vengeful, so it was better not to continue to fight. Otherwise, this stubborn bull would probably fight with him for a few years.","Yue Wuwei got back on the spaceship.","“This bull is really awesome.” Yue Wuwei exhaled and said, “Its defense is abnormal. Its horns are too powerful.”","“If it was at the fourth tier, it might have escaped.”","“Dad, you got a few more bulls.” Mengmeng looked at the Space Ring on Zhang Han’s hand with her big eyes.","“I got nine.”","Zhang Han said, “These bulls are nice. Their body parts are all treasures. Among the nine bulls, six are at the second tier of the Tribulation Stage, and three haven’t reached the Tribulation Stage yet.”","Ning Chen exclaimed, “Holy cow! You killed six second-tier Tribulation Stage bulls so easily!”","“It’s a big meal this time.”","Zhang Han chuckled.","He took out a bull and began to dismember it entierly.","The bulls at the second tier of the Tribulation Stage weighed about 1,500 kilograms. The parts of them each that couldn’t be eaten weighed only a dozen kilograms.","Then, the feast began.","The bulls’ bones were stewed for three hours. Under the power of the Profound Underworld Holy Fire, they were smashed into pieces.","Everyone drank the soup, Dahei ate the meat on the bones, and Little Hei ate the bones.","“Little Hei is really lucky. Nearly half of the essence of the Azure-Winged Bull is in the bones.” Zhang Han said with a smile, “Most of its essence is on the azure wings. What we are going to eat next is the wings.”","The meat was steamed, boiled, and eaten with dipping condiments. As soon as it entered the mouth, it melted. The delicious meat made one immersed in it.","Moments later, all of the wings were finished.","“I, burp, I really can’t eat anymore. I’ll go back first. Enjoy your meal.”","Zi Qiang and Xu Xinyu, who were relatively weak, couldn’t bear the energy and hurried back to digest it.","The others continued to eat because the bulls’ energy was too pure.","“Let’s have some steaks next.”","“Next, we’ll have stewed beef.”","“Now let’s eat some fried beef tails.”","They had eaten enough.","Some people also got drunk, including Dong Chen, the Grand Elder of the Heavenly Knights Sect.","He blushed and said with a smile, “Who’s going to have the bulls’ balls?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","There was silence in the field.","“I’ll eat one first!”","Dong Chen made a big fuss and finished it in one gulp.","“Well...” Zhang Mu laughed.","Zhang Han said, “There are not many people left to finish the next dish. As for the remaining viscera, let’s stew it in a pot.”","There were only more than 30 people left in the field.","The feast continued with the start of the next dish.","They ate for two whole days.","Only then did the feast come to an end.","“I feel like I’m about to make another breakthrough just as the last one ended.”","Everyone went to Zhang Han to get medicinal pellets, which were like indigestion pills, accelerating digestion and absorption.","“This is like the cheating programs.”","When there were only a few people left on the scene, Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and sighed with emotion.","Zhang Han smiled faintly and said, “Because this is already a high-end Cultivation World. Below the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, there are a lot of Tribulation Stage First Tier cultivators. It’s easy for people to reach the Tribulation Stage precisely because of these ancient demonic beasts, the secret realms that have appeared, and the spirit treasures of the place. Of course, most of them are at the Peak Stage of the Mastery Realm. They need to pass the Inner Demon Tribulation on their own to reach the Tribulation Stage. No matter how many spirit treasures they use or how many Exotic Beasts they eat, it’s useless. Therefore, most members of the super sects are at the Peak Stage of the Mastery Realm. Maybe about one in ten thousand of them could be at the Tribulation Stage.”","“That’s a terrifying number.” Zi Yan grinned. “So, the guys will soon reach the Peak Stage of the Mastery Realm, won’t they?”","“If everything goes well while we travel in the Center Galaxy for a few years, it’s possible, but it’s not necessarily true. After all, there are very few Azure-Winged Bulls in the Center Galaxy. It’s lucky for us to meet some. If others meet them, it may be a disaster,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","The Azure-Winged Bull King was very powerful. It had few opponents in the Center Galaxy.","The meat of an Azure-Winged Bull was not something that anyone could eat.","This was also the reason why Zhang Han had brought his group here. They might not be able to encounter an Exotic Beast like the Azure-Winged Bull, but what if they did?","The core members of Mount New Moon would be significantly promoted, which was also a relatively important thing on the way.","Of course, the most important thing was Zhang Han’s cultivation and the rescue of Gu Linli.","She was a member of the Poli Clan, which was rare and made her useful to Black Spirit Wizards. Zhang Han felt that she probably was still alive.","The Sect Master of Illusory Sea Manor had provided timely assistance at this critical moment.","Zhang Han kept it in mind and needed to repay his kindness.","On the way in the starry sky, the crowd didn’t encounter any high-end ingredients like the Azure-Winged Bulls again.","They met several other groups of Starry Sky Beasts that took the initiative to throw their spaceship out of the secondary space.","Zhang Han always knew when to turn Exotic Beasts into delicious ingredients.","The most important thing was that the Seven-star Sword had also changed. It was no longer a weapon to fight, but a kitchen knife.","The magnificent Profound-grade treasure, the Seven-star Sword, had become a commonly used kitchen sword.","The crowd traveled and ate all the way.","Eight months passed.","While crossing more than 3,000 cosmos chaotic flows, they encountered Starry Sky Beasts a few hundred times.","The strongest one was the Azure-Winged Bull King.","The crowd finally arrived at the edge of the Center Galaxy.","The Center Galaxy was extremely vast.","From a distance, it looked like a great river across the void.","It was like a prosperous city under the night sky.","“In the Center Galaxy, there are a total of three areas, upper, middle, and lower.","“The Human Clan’s territory in the Center Galaxy occupies less than a ten-thousandth of its area.","“There are many secret realms here. They keep appearing and disappearing.","“Your strength has improved a lot. In the following journey, when you encounter a secret realm, you can train in it appropriately.”"]},{"number":1604,"title":"Chapter 1604 Training","paragraphs":["Chapter 1604 Training","“We’ve reached the lower part of the Center Galaxy.”","“Go to some planets to inquire about the news of the Black Spirit Clan.”","The crowd approached the territory of the Human Clan.","It took them more than ten days to fly into the prosperous area.","After finding a planet and going through the security check of the space station, they came to the surface.","“Call your boss here.”","In a restaurant, Zhang Han took out a supreme-grade Thunder Yang Crystal.","The waiter’s eyes lit up. He immediately took it and ran to call the boss.","A moment later, a middle-aged man walked over steadily.","Judging from his aura, he was a Dao Seeking Cultivator at the second tier of the Tribulation Stage.","“Even an owner of a restaurant is at the second tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","“This is the Center Galaxy.”","Chen Changqing and the others sighed with emotion.","“Tribulation Stage cultivators can be seen everywhere.”","“What a grand world...”","As he approached, the boss stood beside the crowd with a smile and asked, “What can I do for you, distinguished guests?”","“Please have a seat.”","Zhang Han nodded. After the boss sat down, Zhang Han took out more than a dozen supreme-grade Thunder Yang Crystals and said, “We’re from the Silver Dragon Galaxy. We want to know the distribution of forces in the Center Galaxy.”","“Okay.”","The boss was used to it. He took out a jade slip with a smile and said, “This is a jade slip containing information about the distribution of the Center Galaxy not long ago, including the major forces in the upper, middle, and lower regions, as well as the frequency of appearance of the secret realms, and so on.”","It was no exaggeration to say that there were many Dao Seeking Cultivators from other Galaxy coming to the Center Galaxy every day. Almost all of them were Dao Seeking Cultivators at the Tribulation Stage. They came here to look for opportunities or to reach their peak and break through their bottlenecks, but most of them were led by some seniors at the Tribulation Stage.","It happened. Generally speaking, many vendors and shop owners had this kind of information jade slip on sale.","However, not everyone could afford to spend more than a dozen supreme-grade crystal stones.","“Does the Three Meridian Sect still exist?” Zhang Han asked.","“The Three Meridian Sect in the upper region?”","The boss was stunned. “It disappeared 800 years ago and was destroyed by the Thunder Light Sect. Sir, you know the Three Meridian Sect. You must have come here before, haven’t you? Conflicts often happen in the Center Galaxy. The sects change fast, and only a few sects remain standing.”","“Have you heard of the Black Spirit Clan?” Zhang Han asked another question.","“Well... I have heard of the Black Spirit Wizards,” the boss said with a smile. “Most of the Tribulation Stage Dao Seeking Cultivators stationed in the Center Galaxy know that the Black Spirit Wizards are not many in number, but they are extremely powerful. They are one of the upper-class forces that can’t be provoked. The patriarch of the Black Spirit Clan is an Immortal Master at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage. Such an expert is deeply admired by the world. They have a close relationship with the eight major forces. There are a total of nine forces called the Nine Mountains Alliance. Once they take action, it will affect the overall situation. There are tens of millions of alliances in the upper region. The Nine Mountains Alliance should be among the top five forces.”","“Where is the Black Spirit Clan?” Zhang Han asked.","“I don’t know about that. Black Spirit Wizards are very mysterious in the upper region, and it’s not easy to see their clansmen.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han thanked him, and the boss left.","The crowd also ordered food here.","It was noon.","The dishes were not bad, and some of them tasted good.","After eating and drinking, the crowd suddenly heard the people at the table next to them talking.","“A secret realm has appeared in the Hammer South Domain.”","“It is a relatively weak secret realm. Many people in the Integration Realm and the Mastery Realm have already gone there to gain experience.”","“No matter what, there must be treasures in the secret realm. Shall we go there as well? Anyway, Tenth Uncle will lead the team.”","“The Hammer South Domain is not far from here. We can go and have a look. I’m afraid it’s a trashy secret realm with not many treasures but many Exotic Beasts.”","“The Hammer South Domain.”","Zhang Han pondered for a while.","He stood up and said, “Let’s go and have a look.”","The crowd took the aircraft and returned to the spaceship. After they paid the parking fee, they left for the Hammer South Domain.","“An inferior secret realm is just enough for everyone to gain experience,” Zhang Han said.","“Is there really a secret realm here?” Mengmeng blinked and said, “What if they were bragging?”","“Not necessarily. Forget it if there isn’t one. We’ll pass by the Hammer South Domain when we go to the middle region,” Zhang Han said, “and we’ll know whether there’s a secret realm or not when we arrive at the Hammer South Domain.”","“How could the news of an inferior secret realm spread so far?” Yue Wuwei raised his eyebrows and said, “Aren’t there many secret realms in the Center Galaxy?”","“That’s true.”","Zhang Han said, “But most of them are small secret realms, which will be robbed if they are discovered. Only the news of the appearance of a large-scale secret realm would spread out so that many people can go to explore it.”","“Let’s go and have a look.” Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and did not ask anything further.","The area of the Center Galaxy was too large. A small region of it was comparable to an Astral Domain and was even much larger than an ordinary Astral Domain.","Half a month later, the crowd arrived at the Hammer South Domain.","They made some inquiries.","There was indeed a big secret realm.","Furthermore, there were people going there nonstop.","The secret realm was not a secret.","When Zhang Han and his team arrived, they saw that there were more than a thousand pale blue areas as large as Vast Heaven Star.","“Is this the secret realm?”","Kong Ling’er widened her eyes.","“It is huge.”","“No wonder it can accommodate so many people.”","All the people, including Zhao Feng, Ah Hu, and Xu Yong, were shocked.","Finally, it was time for them to gain experience.","They entered the secret realm, which was no different from the ones they had explored before.","Even Mu Xue asked curiously, “Why do I feel that it’s almost the same as the Relics on Earth?”","“They are the same.”","Zhang Han said, “But the Relics are relatively small, and this secret realm is very large. It’s hundreds of times bigger than a Relic.”","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei felt great. It directly became bigger. Stepping on the ground, it moved forward step by step with huge footprints.","Judging from its aura and physique, it already had the power of King Kong.","“When Dahei reaches the Tribulation Stage, it may evolve into a real King Kong.” Yue Wuwei said with emotion, “It’s amazing that a little gorilla can grow to such an extent.”","The crowd walked between the mountains and rivers.","This was an ordinary secret realm.","Hiss! Hiss! Hiss!","Little Hei could smell the treasures. It led the team to get a lot of spirit treasures.","Sixth-tier or seventh-tier treasures were everywhere. This was the secret realm of the Center Galaxy.","It was not that the Center Galaxy existed before the high-end secret realms. Instead, there were the high-end secret realms and then the Center Galaxy.","At first, the crowd didn’t encounter any creatures.","But when the crowd walked out of the periphery, they saw a vast sea, which was light gray.","There was an island every few thousand meters in the sea.","Each island had some four-armed stone monsters with a stone body and a humanoid appearance.","“The Mastery Realm.”","Yue Wuwei said, “There is a spring on every island. There is pure energy in it. You can have a try.”","“I’ll go first!”","Chen Changqing moved and took the initiative to fight.","“Dad, you can do it!”","Behind him, Chen Chuan stretched out his arms and cheered.","Zhang Han said with a chuckle, “The four-armed stone monsters belong to the Demon Clan. Their defense is relatively strong. Their innate supernatural power is the Giant Rock Formation. Some are the killing formations, some are the illusory formations, and there are other trapping formations. If we are not careful, it may be a little troublesome.”","When they were at the Center Galaxy, Zhang Han was like a fish in water and knew a lot.","He muttered something at the back.","He didn’t tell Chen Changqing because he wanted to see how he would deal with it.","As a result, Chen Changqing was really trapped in the illusion.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The moves of all eight drought demonic dragons were so powerful that they hit the seawater.","On the other hand, the ten-meter-tall stone monsters on the island were constantly throwing strange stones that were filled with energy.","Bam!","A stone fell in front of Chen Changqing, and the energy explosion stunned him.","Only then did he realize that he had been bewitched by illusions.","“Heaven’s Eyes!”","Chen Changqing shouted, and a light appeared between his eyebrows, breaking the illusion.","“Good boy, you’re here. Take this.”","Chen Changqing swooped down directly.","After more than ten minutes of hard fighting, he finally took down this island and obtained its essence.","The essence energy was the Hunyuan Dewdrop, which was more suitable for making high-end medicinal pellets. After the battle, everyone gave the essence energy to Zhang Han.","A series of battles began.","The crowd headed for the depths of the sea.","Gradually, the enemies they needed to deal with were not only the giant stone monsters on the island but also other Dao Seeking Cultivators who might come out to kill and rob.","“Take, take out your belongings.”","A fat man holding a wine-containing gourd ran to the front of the crowd.","“If you want to pass this road, leave behind a million crystal stones for each of you.”","Smack!","Yue Wuwei waved his arm and knocked the fat man’s wine-containing gourd away.","“How much do you want?” Yue Wuwei asked.","Poof!","The fat man spat out the wine in his mouth and looked confused. “Damn, are you an Immortal Master?”","“You’ve offended me, and what should you do now?”","“Can I pay you with some money?” the fat man said in a hurry.","He seemed to want to discuss it, but in fact, he was not too afraid.","Yue Wuwei narrowed his eyes and asked, “How much?”","Swoosh!","The fat man threw over a Space Ring, turned around, and slipped away.","“300 million crystal stones.”","Yue Wuwei glanced at them and said, “He got them by robbing others.”","Just as everyone was wondering why Elder Yue didn’t make a move and what was going on with the fat man, Yue Wuwei said, “As a fourth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator, he’s really free to rob others.”","“What? A fourth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator?”","Everyone was stunned.","“Such a powerful expert has come to rob people.","“Damn. As expected of the Center Galaxy.”","“Next is the core area. The distance between the islands here is farther, but the energy is more refined.” Yue Wuwei said, “Dao Seeking Cultivators can be seen everywhere. No matter how many resources islands there are, we have to fight for them.”","The crowd continued to move forward. On the boundless sea, they continued to fight.","They conquered the islands and even fought with many Dao Seeking Cultivators.","Sometimes, they engaged in a chaotic battle. With Ning Chen and the other eight elders as the leaders, the others also went up to fight in groups.","Sometimes, the enemies had some third-tier Tribulation Stage seniors leading the team.","With the seniors standing at the back, they were not afraid at all and were very relaxed.","“It’s time to end this.”","Every time those seniors stepped out to be the last big bosses, Yue Wuwei waved his sleeve and said, “Back off.”","Plop!","Those people were smashed into the sea.","“Holy shit!”","The other party turned pale with fright and fled in a hurry.","Yue Wuwei and Zhang Han did not kill them all.","There was no need to get involved in such a dispute. A fight was enough.","Therefore, the crowd spent half a year in the secret realm for training.","This benefitted everyone present a lot.","“I didn’t expect that I would soon reach the Mastery Realm!”","Zhang Guangyou cultivated slowly, and he was quite proud at this time.","“I didn’t expect that either.” Dong Chen sighed deeply. “The weakest one in your Zhang Clan is even better than me.”"]},{"number":1605,"title":"Chapter 1605 Targeting the Purple Cloud Sect","paragraphs":["Chapter 1605 Targeting the Purple Cloud Sect","“We can leave the secret realm now.”","Zhang Han and the others left along an exit.","“After half a year of fighting, everyone should take a rest and adjust yourselves.”","Zhang Han said with a smile, “Let’s find a recreational planet and relax.”","“Dad, are the recreational planets here fun?” Mengmeng’s eyes lit up.","“Yeah.” Zhang Han said, “There are some beautiful places. We’ll go to the Baishun Star, where there is a Rainbow Mountain. The environment there is very good, and its Exotic Beast Garden is also the largest in the lower area.”","“Nice!”","Mengmeng smiled.","She had enjoyed hanging around since she was a child.","“How old are you? Why are you still so playful?” Zi Yan rolled her eyes with a smile.","Not only did Mengmeng like to hang around. Zi Yan enjoyed doing that as well.","She got bored watching everyone fight for half a year.","“I mainly want to eat something delicious. I’ve suffered a lot in the past six months,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“It’s all because you’re too greedy for food,” Felina said.","“Hey. If you don’t know how to speak properly, then shut up. You always talk back,” Yue Xiaonao said grumpily.","Felina fell silent.","“I’m not talking back. I’m telling the truth.”","The others sitting in the back, such as Sect Leader Jiang of the Water Cloud Sect, were also chatting with each other.","“The Cultivation World is really too big.”","“It’s a small secret realm in the Center Galaxy. We’ve trained for half a year, but we’ve only covered less than 1% of its area. How many years will it take to explore all the places?”","“The thing is that the Exotic Beasts and even some plants we saw are different from before. The white tree that was more than 10 meters high we saw last time killed a Dao Seeking Cultivator in the Mastery Realm. It’s horrible.”","“The Bone Flower Tree? Didn’t we make it our meal? It tasted nice.”","“...”","The chat was very loud and noisy.","Sometimes, it was not only silence that made people feel comfortable. They found it nice to quarrel occasionally.","Zhang Han and the others were sitting together and chatting.","“Master, how long will the secret realm we’ve been through exist?” Zhao Feng asked curiously.","As soon as he said that, the others also looked over.","“At least three to five years, or at most more than a decade. It’s all possible because the energy there is stable. Of course, the secret realm won’t exist for too long. No matter how much energy there is, without the support of the outside world, the energy consumption doesn’t cease, and the secret realm will eventually disappear between heaven and earth,” Zhang Han replied.","“Then...” Mengmeng blinked her beautiful big eyes and said, “When the secret realm disappears, will the people inside be trapped?”","“Generally speaking, they won’t,” Zhang Han said. “Unless it’s an extremely special secret realm. Before the secret realm disappears, the energy of heaven and earth will quickly dry up, and there will be many reactions visible to the naked eye. Moreover, the secret realm will mostly expel foreigners, Exotic Beasts, and so on. If people encounter a situation where they are trapped in the secret realm, they don’t have to worry. There’s never a desperate situation, and they will definitely be able to find a way out. They can leave through the Space Node or open the Starry Sky Road.”","Every time Mengmeng asked a question, Zhang Han answered very carefully with certain practical methods.","The others could also learn a lot of knowledge.","Even Yue Wuwei listened carefully when Mengmeng asked questions.","“Let’s eat first. We’ve eaten up all the Exotic Beasts we caught last time.”","Zhang Han said, “We don’t have much food this time. Just treat it as a normal meal. After resting for more than ten days, we will arrive at the Baishun Star.”","The dishes were ready, including kebabs and a lot of delicious vegetarian dishes. Hundreds of people gathered in the spaceship in the secondary space, and the atmosphere was cheerful.","After the meal, they rested for a few days and finally arrived at the Baishun Star.","They didn’t expect the examination here to be even more strict.","They needed to have their identity information recorded and their levels of strength estimated.","The Baishun Star was a recreational planet and its examination was much stricter than in other places.","However, when it came to strength estimation, Yue Wuwei had only identified himself as a fourth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator, and he could still hide his cultivation level.","Even so, the guards all looked at Yue Wuwei differently. With respectful expressions, they said, “Milord, please come in. If you have any trouble, please let us know as soon as possible. We will handle it well.”","Zhang Han was detected as a Tribulation Stage Second Tier cultivator.","Ning Chen and the others were at the first tier.","The others had normal results, except for Zi Yan. The security guards detected that she was ordinary and found it strange. But when they took a look at her face, they suddenly understood.","With such a beautiful face, she didn’t need powerful strength to directly become the woman of a big shot.","Facing the sea, the Rainbow Mountain had dozens of long and towering peaks.","In the middle of the mountain, there was a series of buildings, all of which were manors. Each manor had an antique style and was full of technology.","The surrounding trees were all precious famous trees. Looking down, one could find that they were nearly 90 degrees. The leaves were very beautiful, echoing each other from a distance. There were also a sea of flowers in front of the mountain. The sea was azure, and the white beach was like a long line.","The dancing butterflies and birds made the place look like a Xanadu.","This was normal scenery.","However, when the waves roared and the water splashed in the void, they formed a rainbow.","The whole world seemed to have changed.","The seven-colored light illuminated the trees, the earth, and especially the beach. It was as beautiful as a fairyland.","“Wow!”","Mengmeng, Zi Yan, Zhou Fei, and the others didn’t even blink.","The guys, such as Chen Changqing and Ah Hu, were not so interested.","They finally understood that Zhang Han had come here specially so that Zi Yan, Mengmeng, and the other women present could enjoy the scenery.","“It’s so beautiful. Sister Mengmeng, shall we take a picture together?” Chen Chuan took out the equipment.","“Taking a picture? It is too boring, isn’t it?” Mengmeng didn’t look back until the rainbow disappeared. She then rolled her eyes.","After more than ten minutes, another more beautiful rainbow rose.","The one-minute change was intoxicating.","Of course, after they watched the beautiful scenery for a long time, they got a bit bored with it.","After staying for a day, the crowd went to the Exotic Beast Plains.","They took the special flying disk, which was like an iron plate with comfortable seats on it, and began to watch the Exotic Beasts below.","“These are Cross-legged Earth Dragons.”","“They have a dragon’s body and a tiger’s head. Their limbs are thick and strong. They like to sit cross-legged on the ground pretending to be mountains and wait until their preys take the bait.”","There were all kinds of Exotic Beasts in the various regions below.","“The Red Stone Rats are three meters long and have a fierce temper. They’re famous for their fast speed. When they see the Human Clan, they will take the initiative to attack.”","“...”","All kinds of Exotic Beasts were dazzling.","The crowd didn’t see all the Exotic Beasts after watching for a whole day and only saw more than half of them after watching for three days. Zhang Han felt that it was almost time, so they went to the Flower Sea Mountain, which had a real sea of flowers.","They ate well and lived comfortably in a beautiful environment.","The crowd went on a tour for half a month.","They had a good time relaxing.","What was even more surprising was that there was a city called Peaceful City.","The buildings and styles inside were very similar to those in ancient Hua nation.","Everyone strolled around the city for three days.","They had a good time.","After that, the group set off on their journey.","“We’ve taken a lot of Space Shooting Planets from the Silver Dragon Galaxy to here. It took eight months. How long will it take us to go to the upper region from the lower region?” Yue Wuwei chatted with Zhang Han.","“There are many Space Shooting Planets. It will take us about two months to get to the upper region. If we don’t take Space Shooting Planets, it will take us at least five years to fly there,” Zhang Han said. “Even so, there are still many places that are not suitable for Space Shooting Planets. We need to fly in the secondary space most of the time. It will take us three or four months to get to our destination if there are too many people lining up for the Space Shooting Planets.”","“There are so many Space Shooting Planets. The fee alone is already sky-high.” Zhang Guangyou was stunned.","“The resources we earned along the way are enough to cover our expenses.” Zhang Mu glanced at his own son and said, “Take the long-term view.”","Zhang Guangyou was speechles..","For a moment, he didn’t know what to say.","As the weakest of the fourth generation of the Zhang Clan, Zhang Guangyou often felt sad. “Maybe I’ll remain the weakest for the rest of my life.","“I don’t know when my granddaughter will get married. By then, she will give birth to a good-for-nothing, and I can get rid of such a reputation. Humph.”","If Zhang Guangyou voiced his somewhat funny idea, he would probably be lifted by Zhang Mu and beaten up hard.","If Zhang Han knew about this, his face would darken for some time.","The thing was that there was nothing he could do about his father being funny.","The crowd set foot on a new journey. Outside a Space Shooting Planet, they saw densely packed spaceships lining up at the space station.","They waited in line for this Space Shooting Planet for eight days.","It could be regarded as a transportation hub, so the following Space Shooting Planets were not so crowded.","When they arrived at the place where they needed to fly, it was as big as more than a dozen Astral Domains of Vast Heaven. They also encountered Starry Sky Beasts and several secret realms while flying.","They would go in and explore each secret realm.","As a result, they encountered five secret realms. Four of them were not big, but only Tribulation Stage cultivators got to explore them. After thinking about it, Zhang Han and the others all left.","They finally arrived at the middle area of the Center Galaxy.","The equipment in the upper, middle, and lower regions was almost the same. The only difference was the area. The middle was larger, and the upper was the largest.","It took the crowd more than three months to cross the middle region.","Along the way, they gathered more and more information about the Black Spirit Wizards.","Among the Nine Mountains Alliance of the upper region, in addition to the Black Spirit Clan, there were eight other sects.","The Broken Souls Abyss, the North Star Sect, the Purple Cloud Sect, and the other five sects were all famous large sects.","There were countless Tribulation Stage experts in each sect, and there were even Immortal Masters in charge of them. They were the top figures of the major alliances in the upper region.","Zhang Han and his team arrived in the upper region.","“We spent nearly three years on the road alone.”","Zhao Feng sighed with emotion, “In the Cultivation World, time flies.”","Ah Hu said with a smile, “The round trip takes six years. If there’s something up, it might have been ten years after we came out and went back.”","“We’ve explored a lot of secret realms in the past three years and went to many tourist places. Otherwise, four years’ travel would have been enough,” Xu Yong said.","“Something’s surely up. Something will surely happen on the way.” Elder Meng said in a dull voice, “It’s ten years. When I go back this time, I must marry Guoguo and then teach her how to cultivate.”","This guy hadn’t won Lu Guo’s heart yet, but they had been seeing each other for some time.","Zhang Li ran to Zhang Han and asked furtively, “Brother, brother, shall we go straight to the Purple Cloud Sect?”","“What are you trying to do now?”","Zhang Han was confused by her gaze and felt a little scared. “I’m telling you, Zhang Li, don’t make any trouble in the Center Galaxy. You can’t go out.”","Zhang Han said to Liang Hao in person via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Keep a close eye on Zhang Li. Don’t leave her.”","“I know, I know,” Liang Hao replied repeatedly.","“I’m not hanging out. I’m... Forget it. I’ll tell you after we go to the Purple Cloud Sect.”"]},{"number":1606,"title":"Chapter 1606 Bullying Us","paragraphs":["Chapter 1606 Bullying Us","They flew to the Purple Cloud Sect, which was huge.","Its interior area was like the manor of an aristocratic family. It occupied a part of the Center Galaxy, and its scale was similar to that of the Sea Dragon Star Area.","The interior was the core area of the Purple Cloud Sect, and outsiders could not enter.","This place was relatively small, equivalent to a mansion in the Center Galaxy.","On a planet on the periphery of the Purple Cloud Sect.","Yue Wuwei appeared in person and said to the person in charge of the space station, “Please report to your master that I, Immortal Master, Yue Wuwei, have come to visit.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the person in charge gasped.","“An, an Immortal Master?”","“Milord, please wait.”","The person in charge was very humble.","No matter who the visitor was, there was no need to ask about their origin. Every single Immortal Master wasn’t someone the person in charge or even the planet behind him could provoke.","He could only report it to his superior.","A protector of the inner court of the Purple Cloud Sect, who was at the second tier of the Tribulation Stage, flew over in person with a respectful look.","“Greetings, Immortal Master Yue.","“May I know why you have come to visit?”","While speaking, he glanced at the surroundings. There were hundreds of people in total, most of whom were in the Mastery Realm. There were also several others at the Tribulation Stage. Some were in the Integration Realm, the Void-refining Realm, and even the Elixir Realm. It seemed that a family had come in person.","Yue Wuwei cut to the chase and said, “I’m looking for your Sect Leader, Immortal Master Broken-mountain. I have something to discuss with him.”","“Well...”","The protector hesitated for a moment and said, “I certainly can’t inform our Sect Leader. At this time, we still need to report to the inner court. Immortal Master Yue, are you in a hurry? If not, please come to the planet for a visit. I will arrange everything for you.”","Yue Wuwei didn’t want to waste time, so he answered, “I am in a hurry.”","“Okay, then I’ll take everyone to the inner court myself.”","The protector boarded his spaceship and led the team to the nearby Space Shooting Planet, where there was no need to line up. It took the crowd three days to get to the inner court.","They came to the edge of the inner court.","It was a large industrial planet, about half the size of the Vast Heaven Star.","After the protector reported the news, the crowd waited for an entire day.","An elder came, who was at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage.","“Sect Master has just come out of seclusion and is waiting for you. Please follow me.”","The elder took another spaceship and led the team to the Space Shooting Planets. In half a day, they arrived at the center of the sect.","Immortal Master Broken-mountain had eight adjacent planets, which were the back garden in the center of the inner court.","At this time, in a hall on the edge of the planet, everyone saw Immortal Master Broken-mountain.","He was wearing white clothes and had white hair. His expression was very calm. Furthermore, he was holding a fan and looked like a scholar.","“Greetings, Immortal Master Broken-mountain.” Yue Wuwei cupped his hands.","The old man also bowed and said, “Greetings, Immortal Master Yue.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain asked, “May I know why you have come to see me?”","“I do have something to discuss with you.” Yue Wuwei nodded and said, “We are looking for the patriarch of the Black Spirit Clan. When we heard that he was from the Nine Mountains Alliance, we decided to come to you, Immortal Master Broken-mountain.”","“Are you looking for Aogu?”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain narrowed his eyes slightly and said, “Immortal Master Aogu, the patriarch of the Black Spirit Clan, is a cultivation maniac. He has been in seclusion all year round. It’s a little difficult to find him.”","“If I can contact him, I will give you the reward you deserve,” Yue Wuwei said with a faint smile.","His words made Immortal Master Broken-mountain fall silent.","“Reward?”","He still felt a little disdainful in his heart.","With the help of the Purple Cloud Sect, he got a huge amount of resources from the Center Galaxy every year.","“You’re just an outsider. How dare you talk about reward with me?”","“Of course, it doesn’t matter if we can’t reach the patriarch of the Black Spirit Clan. We just need to talk to one of their elders or someone with power,” Zhang Han said. “As for the reward, it will be ninth-tier spirit treasures.”","The eighth-tier spirit treasures in the Center Galaxy were high-end, and the ninth-tier ones were rare.","That was why Immortal Master Broken-mountain looked a little surprised.","“Very well. I can give it a try. You all can rest here for the next few days.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain waved his hand and said, “Men, arrange the rooms for the distinguished guests.”","Therefore, Zhang Han and the others settled down here.","Immortal Master Broken-mountain left in person to invite the patriarch of the Black Spirit Clan over.","In fact, the Black Spirit Clan and the Purple Cloud Sect were neighbors, but it was difficult for outsiders to know the specific location of the Black Spirit Clan.","In the core area of the Black Spirit Clan, there was only one planet, which was still an inconspicuous one. The surface of the planet belonged to the Purple Cloud Sect. However, the underground world was the territory of the Black Spirit Clan.","“Aogu.”","A few days later, Immortal Master Broken-mountain met with the patriarch of the Black Spirit Clan. “An Immortal Master wants to talk to you about something. He promised me that he would give me some ninth-tier spirit treasures as a reward. I came to ask you if you can meet him.”","“An Immortal Master?” Aogu frowned slightly. “Who is it?”","“Immortal Master Yue, I’ve never heard of him,” Broken-mountain said, “I’ve checked the information and found that he is not from the Center Galaxy. Maybe he is an Immortal Master from another small Galaxy.”","Aogu sat on the ground and asked, “How powerful is he?” His skin was tanned. To put it bluntly, he was a short and fat man in sloppy clothes.","The two’s styles were very different.","Broken-mountain replied, “I don’t know his strength, but judging from his aura, he should have just entered the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","“Is he alone?” Aogu asked.","“There are hundreds of people in total. Several of them are at Tribulation Stage First Tier, and the rest haven’t reached the Tribulation Stage yet. It’s a small team.”","“Haha.” Aogu laughed and said, “It seems that they have some treasures since they can offer some ninth-tier ones. Since they want to see me, I’ll go and see what’s happening.”","Aogu was born with an ugly face.","Judging from his smile, Broken-mountain knew at that time that this guy would definitely trick a lot of spirit treasures from the other party.","The two of them left the Black Spirit Clan’s territory.","A few days later, the two parties finally met again in the main hall.","This time, Broken-mountain and Aogu only received Yue Wuwei and Zhang Han.","In fact, they only wanted to see Yue Wuwei, but he insisted on taking Zhang Han with him. In the end, it was a four-person meeting.","“Nice to meet you, Immortal Master Yue.”","Immortal Master Aogu asked directly, “What can I do for you?”","He didn’t even bother to look at Zhang Han and ignored him. In the eyes of him and Immortal Master Broken-mountain, Zhang Han was not qualified to be here at all.","Zhang Han didn’t say anything about it and just sat aside to watch.","“Do you know Gu Linli, Immortal Master Aogu?” Yue Wuwei asked.","They were all at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","There were intrigues between cultivators at this stage, but most of them were straightforward.","“Gu Linli?” Immortal Master Aogu narrowed his eyes slightly. After pondering for two seconds, he deliberately revealed a look of understanding. “Are you talking about that member of the Poli Clan?”","“Yes. We’re asking for her.” Yue Wuwei nodded.","“She’s of great use to me. Do you want to exchange something for her?” Aogu looked a little indifferent.","He didn’t seem to be willing to hand her over.","“We have 10 kinds of ninth-tier spirit treasures, 100 kinds of eighth-tier spirit treasures, and 1,000 kinds of seventh-tier spirit treasures.” Yue Wuwei made a bid.","“Haha, her value is more than that.” Aogu was relatively short. He sat in a chair, which made him look even shorter, but there was a sly smile on his face.","“I’ll double the price. I only have these spiritual treasures,” Yue Wuwei said straightforwardly. “If it’s possible, we’ll exchange them. If not, we’ll have to leave.”","Yue Wuwei had a lot of spiritual treasures, but the ninth-tier and eighth-tier ones were not something he would spend at will. He had put in a lot of effort this time.","The key was that the Sect Leader of Illusory Sea Manor had helped him a lot back then, so Yue Wuwei was willing to offer those treasures.","In addition, if he went to the Star Sea with Zhang Han in the future, the ninth-tier spirit treasures would not be so rare there.","The real treasure was something useful to him, and the Profound-grade treasure was more precious.","As soon as Yue Wuwei finished speaking, Immortal Master Broken-mountain and Aogu looked at each other in silence.","Aogu hesitated.","“Since Immortal Master Yue wants to exchange treasures for a member of the Poli Clan, there must be something going on. Why don’t you grant his wish?” Broken-mountain persuaded Aogu.","“Fine.”","Aogu waved his hand and said, “I can agree, but I have to see if the spirit treasures are what I want. If not, forget it.”","He meant to take away the spirit treasures first.","Yue Wuwei glanced at Zhang Han.","“Let them see the treasures.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly with a poker face.","Yue Wuwei quickly took out a batch of spirit treasures, which made the eyes of Aogu and Broken-mountain light up slightly.","“Okay.”","Aogu took some treasures away directly, and Broken-mountain also chose a ninth-tier spirit treasure that was useful to him.","Aogu said with a chuckle, “Let’s bring her here.”","After the two left, Yue Wuwei said, “Could it be a trick?”","“Their forces are right here. I’m not afraid of any tricks,” Zhang Han said.","“Have you mastered that kind of supernatural power of your Great Demon Body?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“I’m close to it,” Zhang Han responded.","The Great Demon Body was born with four innate supernatural powers, which were extremely huge.","Both the Great Demon Body and the Thunder Body were comprehending and cultivating in Zhang Han’s body all the time.","This sort of cultivation speed was extremely fast.","On the other side.","Broken-mountain and Aogu were on their way to the Black Spirit Clan.","“I didn’t expect that an inferior member of the Poli Clan could exchange for so many spiritual treasures.” Broken-mountain chuckled.","“That Gu Linli is useful to me. She is something that I used to refine the Witchcraft Wood.”","Broken-mountain raised his eyebrows slightly. “You don’t want to give her to them?”","“Of course, I will do it, but I’ll give them something else.” Aogu smiled faintly and said, “Tell our brothers to gather here. If that person dares to make trouble, let’s destroy him. In addition to the 30 kinds of ninth-tier spirit treasures that we just saw, he may have more.”","“Okay.”","Judging from their expressions, they were used to cheating others.","Most of the Immortal Masters or the Supreme Experts who came to the Center Galaxy from the small Galaxies had been tricked. At least eight out of ten had been tricked.","Therefore, things were different.","On Zhang Han’s side.","The group of people, including Kong Ling’er, Mu Xue, and Zhao Feng, were still chatting.","“I didn’t expect to get her back directly.”","“The Immortal Master must have high status in the Center Galaxy to be able to meet the Sect Master directly.”","“After we pick her up, we can go back to the Silver Dragon Galaxy.”","“It’s been seven or eight years since we went back and forth.”","Everyone rested in a certain area.","They waited for ten days.","Aogu and Broken-mountain were back.","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei came to the main hall again, on the viewing platform.","Aogu and Broken-mountain were with five other people.","After seeing this, Zhang Han immediately understood something.","Yue Wuwei looked even more indifferent, and his anger was surging slightly.","“Let me introduce them to you.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain said with a smile, “This is Immortal Master Lin Ruo, and this is...”","Apart from him and Aogu, the other five were Immortal Masters.","The five of them were also the Sect Masters of the Nine Mountains Alliance.","“They heard that you’re here, so they’ve come to see you, Immortal Master Yue.”","Broken-mountain sounded nice.","“Have you brought her here?” Yue Wuwei didn’t care about these people. What he cared about was whether these people in front of him were lying and whether they wanted to fight or not.","“Yes.”","Aogu nodded and threw out a pearl.","“Her soul is inside. Gu Linli’s body collapsed decades ago.”","It was a wisp of soul, which only had a sliver of aura.","Obviously that he didn’t hand her over, but still took the treasures.","“Hahaha!”","Yue Wuwei was so angry that even his beard trembled. “So, you intend to take advantage of your power to bully us?”"]},{"number":1607,"title":"Chapter 1607 The Tribulation Clouds Run Away","paragraphs":["Chapter 1607 The Tribulation Clouds Run Away","Aogu shook his head repeatedly.","“No, no, no. We are all Immortal Masters, and you’re our guests. How could we bully you?”","After that, he looked a little conflicted.","“You’re asking for Gu Linli. She only has this little soul left. I thought you were going to use some heaven-defying treasure to resurrect her. If you wanted her entire being, you should have told me earlier, and I would’ve told you this.”","This was not a show of strength, but a blatant attitude, as if to say face to face, “So what if I bully you and lie to you?”","“Wonderful!”","Yue Wuwei slowly stood up and said, “Do you really think I don’t dare to fight here? Or do you think you’re some big shot?”","He looked like he was about to make a move.","However, the eyes of Immortal Master Broken-mountain turned cold. “Are you choosing the stick over the carrot?”","All of a sudden, the atmosphere became tense.","It seemed that a war would break out in the next second.","If a fight broke out, there would be a total of eight Immortal Masters, and the hall they were in as well as the surrounding mountains and rivers would be affected.","Just as the expressions of Immortal Master Broken-mountain and the others became colder and colder, Zhang Han suddenly said, “Forget it.”","Yue Wuwei frowned and glanced at them. After thinking for two seconds, he finally withdrew his aura.","The scene became peaceful again.","“We didn’t figure out the situation clearly. It’s okay to get a trace of her soul. Let’s go.”","Zhang Han got up and took the lead to leave.","Yue Wuwei followed him.","The others had been scanning the two aboveboard with their divine senses.","Yue Wuwei snorted and snapped their divine senses.","“Why didn’t you let me take action?” Yue Wuwei asked. “It’s easy to kill them.”","“Don’t hurt others,” Zhang Han said calmly.","Yue Wuwei was silent for a moment and said, “You’re right.”","He was confident that he could kill those Immortal Masters, but there were also things he was worried about. If he and Zhang Han were trapped, their enemies would go to deal with Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and the others.","Zhang Han and he couldn’t afford to make any mistakes, so it was not wrong to give in.","“How should we deal with them?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“Let’s leave first,” Zhang Han said flatly and turned to look at the hall behind him. “Since they like to play tricks, let’s play with them.”","“Okay.”","Only then did Yue Wuwei feel much better.","He knew very well that Zhang Han would have a million ways to deal with the other party.","Therefore, Zhang Han and his team took the aircraft to the space station and left the inner court area of the Purple Cloud Sect by a Space Shooting Planet.","“This inner court is well equipped. If we want to sneak in, we still need the One Cloud.” Yue Wuwei immediately negotiated with Zhang Han. “But it can’t accommodate so many people.”","“What happened?”","The others began to ask.","“We’ve been deceived.” Zhang Han didn’t hide anything. “The Dark Spirit Wizards and the Purple Cloud Sect rely on their great power to bully us. They asked the Nine Mountains Alliance over. So we retreated.”","“Damn it!” Mengmeng snorted angrily. “They are so hateful.”","“They are,” Lisa said indignantly. “We’ve given them so many spiritual treasures. Isn’t it enough?”","“They would rather offend an Immortal Master to do this,” Zi Yan said in a deep voice. “It seems that Gu Linli is useful to Black Spirit Wizards. They don’t want to hand her over.”","“What should we do now?”","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei.","Only the two of them could crush the people in the Center Galaxy.","“We’ll wait first.”","Zhang Han said, “Let’s just stroll around the Nine Mountains Alliance. They’ll have no Thunder Tribulation to pass recently.”","“Are you talking about stealing thunder?” Yue Wuwei narrowed his eyes.","This job was not bad.","“But how are we going to get in?” Yue Wuwei asked.","It was still the same question. One cloud could accommodate a few people, but hundreds of people would definitely not be able to fit in.","“Why don’t we find a place to settle everyone down first?” Yue Wuwei suggested.","He felt that it was not very safe. The situation in the Center Galaxy was not under his control. For safety’s sake, it was better for them to stay together.","“You’ve forgotten about Tiny Tot.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “Tiny Tot can avoid those detection devices. It has an Alternate Space, and we can rest there.”","“You’re right.”","Yue Wuwei suddenly understood.","Everyone left the spaceship one after another.","Mengmeng put the spaceship into her super-large Space Ring.","Then, Tiny Tot appeared.","“Murmur?”","It was still a little confused.","“Tiny Tot, you’ve slept for a long time. Let’s exercise.” Mengmeng picked Tiny Tot up and rubbed it a few times.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei also patted Tiny Tot on the belly.","Little Hei came over and said, “We need you for something.”","Zhang Han said, “Hide well. We’ll go to that Star Area.”","“Murmur?”","Tiny Tot flapped its wings lazily and said disdainfully, “Coo! Coo!”","“Are you ordering me?","“I’m not your spirit beast.”","Zhang Han was rendered speechless instantly.","Zi Yan couldn’t help laughing. She pinched Tiny Tot on the cheek and said, “Don’t be so naughty. We’re in the Center Galaxy. This is a dangerous place. Be careful.”","“Murmur.”","Only then did Tiny Tot transform into a huge creature that was thousands of meters tall.","The Alternate Space appeared, and everyone entered it.","It was like a platform inside.","This was a unique space for Tiny Tot. Usually, it was used to store some food, which was also a small trick.","Moments later, tables and chairs appeared.","Many ancient demonic beasts were the top mounts in the Cultivation World.","It was because they could manipulate this kind of Alternate Space at will.","“Coo.”","Tiny Tot let out a cry and instantly entered the secondary space. Its body was surrounded by black fog, and there was no aura at all.","Its cry, which was full of spirituality, attracted the detection of dozens of instruments a few seconds later.","But it didn’t help. Those instruments couldn’t find Tiny Tot at all.","At this time, Broken-mountain, Aogu, and the other Immortal Masters were having a small gathering to celebrate.","They had no idea that revenge had arrived.","“I heard that more than a dozen of your men are going to undergo their tribulations soon, Broken-mountain, especially Supreme Expert Wine Pot. After he passes this tribulation, he will become a fourth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator, which is a step closer to becoming an Immortal Master,” Aogu said.","“That’s right.” Broken-mountain said with a smile, “There aren’t many fourth-tier Tribulation Stage subordinates. Raising one of them requires a large amount of resources. It’s the same with Supreme Expert Wine Pot. He has cost me 30% of my resources. However, it’s good that he’s going to undergo his tribulation. A fourth-tier subordinate is far more valuable than these resources.”","“I also have a few subordinates who are about to go through their tribulations, but the most powerful one is at the second tier, breaking through to the third tier.”","“The more Tribulation Stage Dao Seeking Cultivators there are, the more powerful the Nine Mountains Alliance will be.”","“...”","They didn’t talk about Yue Wuwei at all. In their opinion, an Immortal Master from the Silver Dragon Galaxy didn’t matter.","Supreme Expert Wine Pot, a subordinate of Immortal Master Broken-mountain, was indeed preparing for his tribulation today.","He was in the void of the universe, surrounded by tens of thousands of people, all of whom were high-position officials of the inner court of the Purple Cloud Sect.","Many of them were Dao Seeking Cultivators at the Tribulation Stage, and most of them had reached the Mastery Stage. They were all here to experience the might of the tribulation thunder.","“Supreme Expert Wine Pot, I hope you succeed!”","“After this tribulation, you will be a fourth-tier master. I’m so envious.”","“Supreme Expert Wine Pot is amazing.”","Many people praised him, and some of them looked at him enviously.","“Hahaha!”","Supreme Expert Wine Pot laughed out loud and said, “Thanks to Sect Leader’s help, I have absorbed a lot of spirit treasure resources to pass this tribulation. I’ve been preparing for it for 80 years. Now it’s time for me to undergo the tribulation here!","“Tribulation!”","Under everyone’s gaze, Supreme Expert Wine Pot pointed his sword at the void above.","His aura burst out.","Clatter!","Soon, a layer of dark clouds gathered around him.","Tribulation thunder was coming.","The dark clouds are gathering nonstop. These tribulation clouds didn’t cover a large area, about 30 kilometers in radius.","These tribulation clouds were relatively weak.","“Supreme Expert Wine Pot has excellent aptitude. Why would he summon a Heavenly Tribulation that is only 30 kilometers in radius?”","“These tribulation clouds are too weak, aren’t they? I’m only at the Tribulation Stage First Tier. But I feel that I can safely go through the tribulation on such a small scale.”","“This shouldn’t be the case. Could it be that this is just the beginning?”","Many people were confused.","But they couldn’t understand it at all and could only wait silently. Even Supreme Expert Wine Pot looked a little confused.","“As Supreme Expert Wine Pot, how could I have attracted such small tribulation clouds?”","However, not far away, in a faint little black cloud, Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei, who were hidden inside, burst into laughter right away.","“Judging from this little Thunder Tribulation, it seems that this Supreme Expert Wine Pot is also a rookie,” Yue Wuwei said with a chuckle.","“No, no, no.”","Unexpectedly, Zhang Han looked a little serious and surprised. “This is not ordinary tribulation thunder.”","“What?”","Yue Wuwei was shocked. “Is it, is it qualitative tribulation thunder?”","“Yes.”","Zhang Han took a light breath and said, “I didn’t expect that this Supreme Expert Wine Pot had such a good aptitude that he could attract the qualitative tribulation thunder. Although it is only the weakest, he is at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","“Swallow it. Don’t hesitate. Devour it all. If he fails to pass the tribulation, without the rules of the Great Domain, it will take him at least 300 years to recover with his high aptitude to cultivate to the third tier of the Tribulation Stage again.” Yue Wuwei sneered and said, “At least make Immortal Master Broken-mountain spend more than 10 times more resources on him.”","This was not the most painful thing.","If a cultivator failed his tribulation, he might recover after taking cultivation for a period, but without the rules of the Great Domain, while cultivating, a cultivator wouldn’t get to figure things out although he had comprehended enough. That kind of feeling would make him feel uncomfortable and even depressed.","Bang!","The thunder began.","Within the thirty-kilometer tribulation clouds, a faint blue light began to shine.","The incomparably powerful might that made people tremble spread out.","“What...” The expression of Supreme Expert Wine Pot changed drastically. “This can’t be. Are these the legendary qualitative tribulation clouds?”","“My god, qualitative tribulation clouds?”","Countless people were shocked.","“Inform the Sect Leader now. Tell him that Supreme Expert Wine Pot has attracted the qualitative tribulation clouds.”","“Can he withstand them?”","In the face of doubts, Supreme Expert Wine Pot recovered from the shock and was overjoyed.","“Hahaha, as Supreme Expert Wine Pot, I am truly lucky to have attracted qualitative tribulation clouds. With my strength, what is there to be afraid of? Thunder, come to me!”","Clack!","A bolt of blue tribulation lightning condensed with a rumble.","But as soon as it condensed, it dissipated.","Then, the second bigger bolt of tribulation thunder also condensed faster.","Before it could strike out of the tribulation clouds’ range, it vanished.","The tribulation clouds suddenly surged.","Ten bolts of tribulation lightning appeared in a row.","Then, they disappeared.","Twenty more bolts appeared and then disappeared.","“I’m full. I have to digest it for a few minutes. Retreat a little first.”","Inside the One Cloud, Zhang Han was blushing. As soon as he finished speaking, Yue Wuwei immediately controlled the cloud to fly away.","At the same time, he revealed a hint of his aura.","The tribulation clouds could feel it.","Therefore, under everyone’s gaze, the tribulation clouds of Supreme Expert Wine Pot ran away."]},{"number":1608,"title":"Chapter 1608 Sect Leader What’s Going On?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1608 Sect Leader What’s Going On?","“Supreme Expert Wine Pot, why, why did your tribulation clouds run away?”","Everyone was scared out of their wits. It was the first time that such a thing had happened. They couldn’t help but feel a little dumbfounded.","“Don’t let the tribulation clouds escape.”","An old man said in horror, “If you don’t pass your tribulation, you can’t make a breakthrough!”","“What are you all still standing there for? Hurry and chase after them!” someone reminded.","Swoosh!","Supreme Expert Wine Pot came to his senses. His eyes widened and he quickly chased after the tribulation clouds. “Tribulation clouds, where are you going?!”","“Let’s help together.”","Many core disciples nearby knew very well how much the Sect Leader had paid in order for Supreme Expert Wine Pot to undergo the tribulation.","If they were to wait and see and cause Supreme Expert Wine Pot to be unable to undergo the tribulation, then no one would be able to resist the Sect Leader’s wrath.","The group of people chased after the tribulation clouds like a swarm of bees.","“Damn it, I didn’t expect these tribulation clouds to run so fast!”","Someone cursed, “Tribulation clouds, stop now, or Supreme Expert Wine Pot will kill you!”","Someone shouted at the top of his lungs.","“Tribulation thunder! You only dare to bluff in the distance. Do you dare to fight me?”","“Fuck you, tribulation thunder!”","Curses and curses rang out incessantly.","Rumble!","A dazzling bolt of tribulation lightning appeared in the world.","Everyone was quite frightened.","At the same time, inside the One Cloud, Zhang Han’s hair stood on its end.","“No, no, let’s go.”","This bolt of tribulation thunder was strong enough to almost hurt Zhang Han.","Swoosh!","Yue Wuwei completely concealed his aura.","The One Cloud quickly slipped away.","All of a sudden, the tribulation clouds could no longer feel the aura of the thief.","They heard a lot of curses behind them.","Thus, the tribulation clouds quietly came to a stop.","Clatter!","All of a sudden, they expanded a hundred times.","The tribulation clouds covered the sky within 3000 kilometers.","Clack! Clack!","A bolt of heaven-shocking tribulation lightning killed Supreme Expert Wine Pot. Several thousand bolts of tribulation lightning blasted out like crazy, annihilating all those that chased the fastest.","But the tribulation clouds had not vented their anger yet.","There was a flash of lightning and thunder. After three minutes, the tribulation clouds slowly dissipated.","Sizzle!","The last bolt of tribulation lightning pointed into the distance.","It was as if the tribulation clouds were pointing forward and saying, “Stop stealing thunder. I’ll kill you the next time I meet you.”","The wind was calm, and the void of the universe returned to normal.","However, the other members of the Purple Cloud Sect were stunned.","“Good heavens!”","“The tribulation clouds have killed them all!”","“Shit! This is not good!”","“Report it to the Sect Leader now.”","On the other side.","Immortal Master Broken-mountain and the others were still drinking.","They heard the first piece of news that Supreme Expert Wine Pot had drawn over qualitative thunder tribulation.","“Huh?”","Immortal Master Aogu said in surprise, “Well done. This Supreme Expert Wine Pot is quite capable. The qualitative thunder tribulation is something that cultivators will encounter after the seventh tier.”","Another Immortal Master stood up and said, “Since he has it, let’s go and have a look. I wonder if it’s too late.”","“Let’s go and have a look.”","They set off for the space station. As soon as they arrived, another piece of news came.","“Sect Leader, something bad has happened. Supreme Expert Wine Pot has been struck to death by the tribulation lightning!”","Clatter!","Immortal Master Broken-mountain felt his heart skip a beat, and his blood surged. He was a little dizzy. “What did you say?”","“I paid such a high price to help him go through his tribulation, but he died?”","Swoosh!","He took out the soul lamp of Supreme Expert Wine Pot and took a look. “Fuck, it’s really extinguished.”","“How could this be?” Immortal Master Broken-mountain was trembling with anger.","“He’s dead?”","The other Immortal Masters fell silent.","“It happens that people die while undergoing tribulations. Maybe this is his fate.”","Someone comforted Immortal Master Broken-mountain, which made him feel a little better.","“Sect... Sect Leader.”","Disasters piled up on one another.","The subordinate added, “In addition to Supreme Expert Wine Pot, 76 Dao Seeking Cultivators have died. Among them, 32 are in the second tier of the Tribulation Stage, and the rest are in the first tier. 360 Peak-Stage Mastery Realm experts have died.”","Poof!","Immortal Master Broken-mountain almost spat out blood. “What did you say? What the hell is going on?”","“The, the Thunder Tribulation ran away. The tribulation clouds suddenly drifted away, and then Supreme Expert Wine Pot took everyone to chase after it. For some reason, the tribulation clouds suddenly expanded ten times and struck them to death. Some elders suspect that it has something to do with their abuse of the Heavenly Tribulation.”","Broken-mountain Immortal Master said, “Fuck...”","“Let’s go and have a look together.”","The other Immortal Masters couldn’t understand it, and they were curious as well. So they set out to the scene of the incident to see if they could feel anything.","Unexpectedly, when they arrived-","“There’s nothing left.”","“They’ve been annihilated.”","“When Heavenly Tribulation rages, no one can stop it. This is the Heavenly Tribulation, terrifying to the extreme.”","“The tribulation clouds ran away. Something is wrong. Broken-mountain, do you have any subordinates who want to make a breakthrough? Let’s guard it ourselves and see what’s going on with this Heavenly Tribulation.” Aogu suggested.","Broken-mountain ordered, “Go get Supreme Expert Huasan.”","A few days later.","“Supreme Expert Huasan has come to undergo his tribulation!”","He came with auspicious clouds.","He looked aggressive as if he was going to confront the Heavenly Tribulation head-on.","He already knew what he was here for.","“Are you ready?” Immortal Master Broken-mountain asked.","“I’m ready.”","“Let’s begin.” Immortal Master Broken-mountain waved his hand.","The seven Immortal Masters stood guard around, looking at the void.","Supreme Expert Huasan began to prepare himself.","The preparation process took a day.","He had to ensure that his energy was at its peak.","After the preparation.","“Today, I shall pass the Heavenly Tribulation and reach the third tier from the second tier!”","Supreme Expert Huasan spoke in an otherworldly voice as he looked up into the void of the universe.","He began undergoing his tribulation.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","It was as if a strange breeze was blowing.","Dark clouds slowly gathered.","The ten-kilometer tribulation clouds began to churn.","Under the gaze of all the people and the seven Immortal Masters.","Clack!","The ordinary tribulation lightning struck down.","Halfway through, it suddenly dissipated.","“Eh? Why did it disappear?”","Immortal Master Aogu frowned.","“The tribulation thunder should not have disappeared. There is something strange. Let’s continue to observe.” Immortal Master Broken-mountain looked extremely serious.","Clack!","A second bolt of tribulation lightning suddenly formed.","Something unexpected happened.","Rumble!","The tribulation clouds suddenly surged.","Hundreds of tribulation lightning bolts appeared, bombarding the area.","“What...”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain and the others were dumbfounded.","“What’s happening?”","“How is this possible? There shouldn’t be any accidents in the Heavenly Tribulation.”","Not a single bolt of lightning fell.","The tribulation clouds churned.","No one knew what the clouds were thinking, which were furious at this time.","They were also angry at Supreme Expert Huasan. It was as if they were saying, “You rookie, don’t you know that there has been a thunder thief recently? How dare you show your puny strength? The power of your Heavenly Tribulation is limited. I can’t kill the thief at all. I’ll kill you...”","The Heavenly Tribulation with some intelligence was very fierce.","Seeing that it couldn’t do anything to Zhang Han, the thunder began to converge on Supreme Expert Huasan, striving to kill this rookie. Then, it would warn everyone that some rookies shouldn’t undergo their tribulations recently.","But after the tribulation lightning gathered, it couldn’t hit Supreme Expert Huasan.","It was absorbed by the thunder thief hiding in the void.","“Damn you!”","The tribulation clouds rolled for a minute and then slowly dissipated.","“It’s over?”","Supreme Expert Huasan was confused. “I didn’t do anything.”","“Yeah, why did it disappear? Is the Heavenly Tribulation out of control?” Immortal Master Broken-mountain frowned, and his face suddenly changed. “You!”","His face darkened. “Your strength and aura haven’t improved. You haven’t made a breakthrough!”","“What?”","Supreme Expert Huasan was shocked. After feeling it for a while, he said with a pale face, “Sect Leader, Sect Leader, how come I’m now like when I’ve just entered the second tier of the Tribulation Stage? My cultivation is gone.”","“This is truly terrible.”","Immortal Master Aogu took a deep breath and said, “If something happens to the Heavenly Tribulation, we will...”","“That might not be the case. Let’s try again. Supreme Expert Liaobei, you’ll undergo your tribulation!” Immortal Master Broken-mountain said in a deep voice.","“Sect Leader.”","Supreme Expert Liaobei was scared. His face was slightly pale, and he prepared himself. Three hours later, he said, ” Sect Leader, I’m too frightened to do that.”","“Trash! Get lost!”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain was so angry that he looked around at the seven or eight people present. “Which one of you dares to undergo your tribulation?”","“I do!”","After all, there was a brave man.","A Dao Seeking Cultivator at the Tribulation Stage First Tier began to adjust his state.","At this time, in the One Cloud in the distance.","“How is it? Have you digested it?” Yue Wuwei laughed slyly. “It’s so cool. The tribulation clouds are furious. There’s nothing they can do to us. Hahaha.”","“I’ve digested it.” Zhang Han exhaled.","Yue Wuwei was a little surprised. “Well done. Last time, when you absorbed the Elemental Energy Thunder, your Thunder Body made a breakthrough. Now, you are at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage, so you can digest the thunder even faster.”","“Well, it’s much faster, so that I can devour more.” Zhang Han smiled faintly.","Not only did his Thunder Body breakthrough, but what surprised him was that the breakthrough of his Thunder Body directly helped his Great Demon Body and Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure breakthrough as well!","The three Great Bodies had reached the third tier of the Tribulation Stage in a short period.","This growth rate was too terrifying.","Zhang Han was shocked.","If he could make a breakthrough in all aspects, his cultivation speed would be unparalleled.","He had thought that it would take a long time for his six duplications to make a breakthrough by themselves.","Yet now, it was actually like this, and his speed couldn’t be compared to before.","“That’s right, that’s right!”","Zhang Han was pleasantly surprised.","“The Six Bodies belong to me. Their breakthrough is also my breakthrough. I’ve made it too complicated.”","“They’re ready to break through. Let’s go there.” Yue Wuwei liked to steal thunder, so he took the initiative to control the One Cloud to float over.","More and more people were watching the tribulation.","However, they were all standing in the distance, and only Immortal Master Broken-mountain and six other people were standing nearby.","“Heavenly Tribulation, come to me!”","The man who was undergoing his tribulation roared.","However, there was no response.","“Tribulation!","“Heavenly Tribulation, come to me!","“Tribulation clouds!","“Tribulation Lightning!","“Are you coming or not?”","In the end, the man who was going through his tribulation was a little confused.","“What’s going on?","“Why aren’t the tribulation clouds here yet? I can undergo the tribulation now.”","“What’s happening?”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain and the others were also confused.","They waited for a full minute.","Only then did the tribulation clouds appear.","As a result, everyone was stunned again.","“The, the tribulation lightning is only ten meters long?”","“Is this for real?”","Immortal Master Aogu cried out involuntarily.","Above the man who was undergoing his tribulation, there was a palm-sized tribulation cloud a few hundred meters away.","It was within a radius of ten meters.","Tiny lightning bolts were generated inside.","There came a sizzling sound.","After striking out with a trace of thunder, the tribulation cloud thought to itself, “Let’s see if you can still steal this little bit of Thunder Tribulation.”","Unexpectedly, the thunder disappeared from the world.","The tribulation cloud was furious.","Sizzle!","A few more tiny bolts of lightning flashed twice before the tribulation cloud dissipated.","The tribulation clouds were not willing to appear in the Heavenly Tribulation of a Tribulation Stage First Tier cultivator.","It couldn’t do anything to the thunder thief, so why would it come out?","The man who was undergoing his tribulation was completely confused.","“Sect Leader, what’s going on?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Many people slowly looked at Immortal Master Broken-mountain.","He didn’t look very happy.","“I don’t know!","“Whom the fuck knows what’s going on?","“Get lost!","“Get lost, all of you!”"]},{"number":1609,"title":"Chapter 1609 Robbing the Ancestral Graves","paragraphs":["Chapter 1609 Robbing the Ancestral Graves","Everyone was extremely surprised. The Heavenly Tribulation was strange.","Even Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei were surprised.","“The Heavenly Tribulation has learned its lesson.”","Yue Wuwei sighed with emotion and said, “It seems that it has suffered too much. It has realized that since its strength is not strong enough, it wouldn’t show up.”","“It won’t be easy to fool it next time,” Zhang Han said softly.","He knew that only when a Dao Seeking Cultivator at the third or fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage went through the tribulation would the tribulation clouds try their best to kill him.","They didn’t bother to show anything to the cultivators at the Tribulation Stage First Tier or the Second Tier.","If the host’s strength was low, the power of the tribulation clouds would be limited.","Just as the crowd was about to disperse, an aircraft suddenly zoomed over from a distance.","“Sect Leader, Sect Leader. Something happened.”","A Dao Seeking Cultivator came down and said loudly, “Supreme Expert Fei’ou has failed his tribulation. He was bombarded to death by the Thunder Tribulation.","“He died yesterday.”","The face of the Sect Leader changed. “What did you say? Supreme Expert Fei’ou is dead?”","At first, he was a little confused, but then he was frightened.","“Heavenly Tribulation. There is definitely something wrong with the Heavenly Tribulation.”","“One might be an accident, two might be an accident, three or four are definitely not an accident!”","“Why did the Heavenly Tribulation suddenly become so brutal and irregular?”","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei hid in the One Cloud and listened casually.","Hearing the news, Yue Wuwei laughed out loud.","“Hahaha. It seems that the Heavenly Tribulation is going to explode because of anger. I’m afraid that those who are going to undergo their tribulations in this area will suffer a lot recently. There is a trace of intelligence in the Heavenly Tribulation. Since the Cultivation World is so big, it may only pay attention to the place where we will appear.”","Those people were still discussing.","“What the hell is going on?”","“Forget it. Let all the disciples who intend to break through recently come to the Purple Cloud Sect. We’ll see what the Heavenly Tribulation is about.” Immortal Master Aogu suggested.","“Okay.”","“Inform them.”","“...”","The other Immortal Masters all nodded.","Because it was really strange. If they didn’t figure it out, what should they do when they went through their tribulations in the future?","Within the One Cloud.","“These people are really cooperative.”","Zhang Han said, “The Nine Mountains Alliance has a vast territory. Even if we travel back and forth, we will miss a lot. We wouldn’t get to crush them at once if they are scattered. If they gather together, it will save us a lot of trouble.”","“The key is that the Heavenly Tribulation really cooperates with you,” Yue Wuwei said. “It has nowhere to vent its anger, so it hacks at the ones who undergo their tribulations, which scares these Immortal Masters.”","“Haha, let’s go back first. We can observe nearby.”","Zhang Han smiled slightly.","“They should’ve known this when they cheated me of my treasures.”","Yue Wuwei glanced down and said, “I’ll let them have no chance to go through the Heavenly Tribulation!”","“No chance to go through the Heavenly Tribulation.”","Zhang Han also sighed with emotion. “In the past, I didn’t even dare to imagine this.”","In the Cultivation World, no matter how talented a cultivator was, he would eventually face the strongest Heavenly Tribulation.","The more formidable he was, the more powerful the Heavenly Tribulation he faced.","Zhang Han had attracted the divine thunder over the sky. Over countless eras, there had been fewer than five people who could summon the divine thunder over the sky.","“However... why isn’t there any Heavenly Tribulation for me?”","Zhang Han sighed deeply.","“Haha, isn’t it better if you don’t have a Heavenly Tribulation? This means that your breakthrough in cultivation has nothing to do with the Heavenly Tribulation. You’re above transcendence. How great is that? When your physical energy is too high, you can directly break the shackles, make it to the Heaven Road, and ascend to the higher world!” Yue Wuwei laughed.","Zhang Han said quietly, “It’s different.”","Of course, it was different. According to Sir’s mind, the more smooth and comfortable Zhang Han’s life was now, the more difficult the calamity he would face in the future would be.","He had thought about it. If it was really the divine thunder over the sky, he would definitely devour it.","However, the fact that he didn’t have any Heavenly Tribulation indicated that the calamity he would face wasn’t a Heavenly Tribulation, but from an unknown source.","What was the most terrifying thing? The unknown.","In fact, this put Zhang Han under a lot of pressure.","It was just that he didn’t show it on normal days.","“I have to improve my strength as soon as possible and let the calamity come faster. Only in this way can I control it.”","Zhang Han murmured to himself.","“Let’s go back.”","After saying that, Yue Wuwei controlled the One Cloud to fly away.","Not far behind, Tiny Tot was floating in the void.","The two returned to the Alternate Space and sat down.","“Dad, you’re amazing.” Mengmeng gave Zhang Han a thumbs-up and said, “We’ve all seen it. Even the Heavenly Tribulation is afraid of you now and doesn’t dare to show up.”","“It seems that it will be easy for us to undergo our tribulations.” Ning Chen and the others were even more stunned.","Anyone who heard this kind of thing would be stunned for a few minutes.","The power of devouring Heavenly Tribulation was simply too heaven-defying.","Wasn’t it obvious that Zhang Han was going against the heavens?","After having a few meals, the crowd rested here. A few days later, Dao Seeking Cultivators who were preparing for their tribulations came to the Purple Cloud Sect to gather.","There were nearly a hundred people in total.","After hearing about the strange things that had happened recently, they were a little scared.","“Let’s try again.”","“Don’t worry. Even if you fail your tribulations, we will train you again.”","Several Sect Leaders and Immortal Masters wanted to do their best to study this matter.","As a result, an even larger tribulation experiment began.","“The next one to undergo his tribulation is a Tribulation Stage First Tier Supreme Expert of the Cold Water Sect. He has been preparing for it for 30 years. Everything is ready except for the arrival of the Heavenly Tribulation.”","“It’s here.”","“What’s wrong with the Heavenly Tribulation? Is it still merely ten meters long?”","Many people looked at the tribulation clouds within a radius of ten meters, which were almost invisible.","They were all very confused.","This time, Zhang Han was too lazy to take action.","He wanted to see what the tribulation clouds were up to.","There came a sizzling sound.","Several electric currents flashed by.","After that, the tribulation clouds dispersed under the gazes of everyone.","Traces of the rules of the Great Domain appeared.","“I, I broke through!”","The Supreme Expert said excitedly, “I’ve become a second-tier Dao Seeking Cultivator.”","His aura rose steadily and reached the second tier of the Tribulation Stage.","However, the rules of the Great Domain were not enough at all.","Hiss!","The aura of the second tier of the Tribulation Stage fell straight down like a deflated balloon, making this Supreme Expert drop to the first tier.","A trace of the rules of the Great Domain seemed to have taken away his cultivation over the years.","It seemed to be saying, “You don’t deserve to go through the tribulation.”","The intense resentment from the tribulation clouds was shown to other Dao Seeking Cultivators.","“The thief is a bad guy. Just wait for me to come and show my aura. How dare he still want to steal thunder!”","“Do you know what’s up with this?” Immortal Master Broken-mountain asked.","“I don’t know.” Aogu shook his head.","The other seven Immortal Masters were also a little confused.","“Then let’s try it again. How could there be a problem with the Heavenly Tribulation?”","Therefore, the second one, the third one, and then more. Until the seventh Tribulation Stage First Tier cultivators underwent his tribulation, all of them failed.","The ten-meter-long tribulation clouds appeared in a perfunctory manner.","“Ask the Tribulation Stage Second Tier ones to try.”","Three Tribulation Stage Second Tier cultivators failed their breakthroughs.","“Ask the Third Tier ones to try.”","A Supreme Expert who was about to break through to the fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage stepped forward with a sad look on his face.","“This is it!”","Yue Wuwei’s eyes lit up. “This time, the Heavenly Tribulation should come as usual.”","Unexpectedly, the appearance of the 50-meter-long tribulation clouds was still very perfunctory.","“Holy shit. They got smart. They know that the tribulation clouds that show up while one breaks through to the fourth tier can’t deal with you.” Yue Wuwei was shocked.","“Well...”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “The tribulation clouds seem to have become a little smarter. In this case, I’m afraid that only the fourth-tier and fifth-tier Heavenly Tribulations can make them take action.”","“Hold on a second!”","Yue Wuwei was suddenly shocked. “I’m about to make a breakthrough, right? I’ll break through to the sixth tier from the fifth tier. Oh no, we’ve offended the Heavenly Tribulation.”","“Wait, wait.” Zhang Han felt his scalp tingling. “When my Thunder Body reaches the fourth tier, I will definitely get to swallow your Heavenly Tribulation.”","“Since the Heavenly Tribulation is not coming, let’s get down to business.” Yue Wuwei narrowed his eyes slightly and said, “Let’s see how many Immortal Masters I can kill to make a name for myself.”","“Nine Immortal Masters.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment and said, “We can fight or wait. The nine of them are obviously at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage. According to their auras, they are not far from the sixth tier. They are at the Last Stage of the fifth tier.”","Right at this moment, a message came.","“Sirs, the secret realm of the Soul Tomb has opened!”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain and the others suddenly looked at each other.","Immortal Master Broken-mountain said in a clear voice, “Recently, everyone has heard about it. Just now, you also saw some uncontrollable situations of the Heavenly Tribulation. Now, we announce that all Dao Seeking Cultivators will be suspended from undergoing the Heavenly Tribulation. Let’s go to the secret realm of the Soul Tomb first to see if we can get the ancient souls.”","“What is the secret realm of the Soul Tomb?”","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei looked at each other.","“It should be undoubtedly a treasure land,” Yue Wuwei said. “It’s also something that you can swallow.”","“Haha, let’s take a look.”","Zhang Han couldn’t help smiling.","This really was interesting. Currently, he could devour precious lands and the Heavenly Tribulation.","Unexpectedly, his opponents were going through their tribulations, and there was a treasure land.","Yue Wuwei and Zhang Han returned to the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","The fleet in the secondary space didn’t notice that there was a cluster of black fog following them unhurriedly from behind.","How fast was Tiny Tot at its limit?","When it matured, it was even faster than the Space Shooting Planets.","Zhang Han and his team flew for more than ten days.","Finally, they arrived at a secret realm and entered it.","“The secret realm of the Soul Tomb.”","“It’s actually a great tomb.”","Looking around, they found that there were so many tombstones, which were densely packed.","Some were broken, while others were intact.","This continent was covered with tombstones, looking like an ancestral hall.","Immortal Master Aogu said in a deep voice, “Soul Tomb appeared ten thousand years ago.","“There’s a burial ground of my Black Spirit Clan here. I don’t know how long the Soul Tomb has existed. My ancestors are here.","“It is said that the Black Soul Flag, a holy object of the Black Spirit Clan, is also hidden here.","“It’s a pity that we can’t get to the center.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain laughed and said, “Haha, not only some of your ancestors are here but also our ancestors as well.”","Human Dao Seeking Cultivators shared some same origins.","“Hold on a second!","“Listen!”","One Immortal Master was suddenly stunned.","“Why is there a clear sound between heaven and earth?”","He was very confused.","Clang! Clang!","“It sounds like someone is digging something up?”","What they didn’t know was that in the depths of the secret realm of Soul Tomb, a man in a golden cloak was holding a Luoyang Shovel and digging down.","He had already dug 30 meters deep.","“It’s not easy to dig this grave. Damn it, I only dug this little in half a year, but it shouldn’t be far from the tomb. Carry on and keep digging. I got this. Dig!”","If Zhang Han and the others saw this, they would definitely be surprised.","The Devil Incarnate, Ye Longyuan, was actually robbing a tomb in the Center Galaxy. He had come here to dig up some ancestral graves.","He was also a big shot.","“Let’s go to the depths and have a look. The secret realm of the Soul Tomb only appears once every 50 years. I hope that I can find the holy object of my Black Spirit Clan this time.”","Immortal Master Aogu and the others hoped to seize the treasures here.","“Hold on a second!”","“Why, why is the energy here decreasing?”","“The Heaven and Earth energy has been absorbed by something. Is there a great treasure coming out?”"]},{"number":1610,"title":"Chapter 1610 This Is Not Fair","paragraphs":["Chapter 1610 This Is Not Fair","“Hurry up and feel it.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain said, “Look where the energy disappeared from.”","After hearing that, an Immortal Master in white waved his right hand, and all kinds of Formation Stones appeared.","“Soul Guide!”","The formation appeared. This man was skilled at the array of formations, which had reached a higher level, and he was proficient in using it.","“It’s in the depths of the continent.”","He looked ahead and said with a serious face, “The energy is disappearing faster and faster. There must be a precious treasure coming out. Let’s go quickly.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The nine Immortal Masters quickly flew forward.","A large number of their men followed them from a distance.","In the place where Ye Longyuan was.","“Eh? Why has the energy become so thin?”","Ye Longyuan was stunned. “The Demon Soil is easier to dig!”","Clang! Clang!","He was extremely fast. Like a wheel of wind and fire, he continued with his digging.","Finally, under the dull sound of the knife, he hit the cornerstone.","“Ha! I’ve found the tomb!”","Ye Longyuan laughed and said, “I’ll go into hiding!”","The power of the cloak was quite impressive. After Ye Longyuan became invisible, he broke through the stone and broke in.","He didn’t see anything else. There was a black flag in the main tomb.","It was the Black Soul Flag, a holy object of the Black Spirit Clan.","“What kind of rubbish is this? I’ve been digging for so long in vain.”","Ye Longyuan was quite dissatisfied, but his speed was not slow. He directly pulled out the flag.","Clatter!","Wisps of blue mist emerged around the stone walls.","“Shit! I need to flee now!”","Ye Longyuan ran away in a flash.","At the same time.","“Good heavens!”","Immortal Master Aogu trembled with excitement.","“I can sense it! I can sense the aura of the Black Soul Flag! A precious treasure has really appeared! The Black Soul Flag has appeared!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Immortal Master Broken-mountain and the other seven people suddenly became depressed.","“Alas, it interrupted my thoughts.”","“It’s the Black Soul Flag? Aogu, you’re really lucky.”","The nine of them were partners, and everything was equal. This was a rule that had been established in the early years.","If anyone got the treasure that appeared today, he would give the other eight people some benefits.","“To prevent any changes, let’s speed up.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain smiled faintly.","The nine of them moved even faster.","At this time, on the side of Zhang Han.","Tiny Tot turned into a penguin, which was swaying around.","They were in a gorge.","The reason why they were so fast was that Tiny Tot could break into the secondary space at any time.","However, spaceships were different. On the surface of the planet, spaceships could not break into the secondary space.","Therefore, Tiny Tot appeared in the depths of the secret realm of the Soul Tomb in an instant. It could be said that more than 90% of the Bounded Domains in this world was useless to Tiny Tot.","This was the domineering power of the king among the ancient demonic beasts.","Besides the Roc Clan, there were also King Kongs, Three-clawed Golden Crows, Ancestral Dragons, and so on. The strength of these creatures had been passed down through the ages.","“Shit!”","Ye Longyuan ran away very fast. When he turned his head, he saw that the dim light was also chasing him. Obviously, it was chasing after the Black Soul Flag.","Ye Longyuan muttered unhappily, “Why can’t I put this damned flag into my Space Ring?”","The more it was like this, the more Ye Longyuan felt that it was a precious treasure.","Although he didn’t feel anything special, he wouldn’t let go so easily.","Even the lightning-fast light caught up with Ye Longyuan.","There was a sizzle.","It hit him on the back.","Ye Longyuan felt a chill run down his spine and his body was numb.","“Holy shit!”","Ye Longyuan was startled. “What is this?","“I have to speed up.”","Ye Longyuan flew quickly to the depths of the Soul Tomb.","He didn’t dare to stop at all.","Even so, he was beaten a few times every now and then.","In the end, he felt cold and numb all over.","Even the breath he exhaled had turned white.","He spat out a mouthful of saliva, which directly turned into ice shards.","“This won’t do. If this continues, I’ll die here. What’s going on with this thing?”","Ye Longyuan couldn’t stand it anymore and was about to throw the broken flag away.","Suddenly, he saw a group of people in front of him.","“AHH!”","Ye Longyuan was dumbfounded. “Hey, why, why are you all here?”","The group of people in front of him, including Zi Yan, Zhang Mu, Zhang Guangyou, Chen Changqing and Ah Hu, Elder Meng, and even Older Martial Sister Chu Qingyi, and Mu Xue, were all his acquaintances.","“What’s going on?","“This can’t be!”","Ye Longyuan was shocked. “I must have been trapped in an illusion. They are still in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. I didn’t stop for a long time and only arrived here after a few years. How could they be faster than me?","“Impossible. It must be an illusion.","“I don’t want this damned flag anymore!”","Ye Longyuan hated it very much.","He didn’t expect that he would have to let go of the treasure he just got.","He threw the flag forward with all his might.","“An illusion. Hehe, disperse!”","Ye Longyuan gritted his teeth.","Unexpectedly-","“Hmm?”","Yue Wuwei looked a little surprised. He raised his hand and grabbed the Black Soul Flag.","“You’re going to hand this thing over to us just like that?”","Yue Wuwei didn’t understand either, but when he saw the energy chasing after him, he coughed softly.","The sound turned into waves, swept forward, and extinguished the energy.","“Brat, did you come to give us a gift?” Zhang Guangyou was amused.","It was interesting to meet old friends in a foreign place.","“What are you doing, Ye Longyuan?” Chu Qingyi asked curiously.","This guy was so cold that his face turned pale. Looking at the ghastly expression on his face, she felt a little strange.","Ye Longyuan muttered to himself, “Are, are you real? Can people communicate like this in the illusion?”","“What illusion? Have you gone stupid?” Chu Qingyi said grumpily.","Hiss!","Ye Longyuan was stunned.","He couldn’t help but gasp.","“Hahaha, he’s really dumbfounded.” Mengmeng covered her mouth and chuckled.","“Be careful. Clear my mind. Clear my mind.” Ye Longyuan couldn’t help casting a spell. “Purify my eyes and see through the illusions!”","Swoosh!","Ye Longyuan’s eyes lit up.","After looking around, he found that it was still these people.","“This, this is real?”","Ye Longyuan was dumbfounded.","He looked around and finally fixed his eyes on the Black Soul Flag in the hands of Yue Wuwei.","“That’s mine!” Ye Longyuan couldn’t help saying.","“What do you mean by yours?” Yue Wuwei said flatly, “You threw it away.”","It was impossible for Ye Longyuan to get the treasure back.","“I...”","Ye Longyuan grinned and then hurried forward. “Why are you here?”","“We’re here for something,” Chu Qingyi said. “Are you... here to dig a grave?”","Ye Longyuan scratched his head and said, “No, I’m not digging a grave. I’m robbing it. Older Martial Sister Chu, I’ve told you many times.”","“Have you dug up zombies?” Mengmeng asked curiously.","Ye Longyuan had to pay respect to the little princess of Mount New Moon.","After hearing her words, he glanced over and was immediately shocked.","“Wow, are you Zhang Yumeng? Why are you so tall and beautiful?” Ye Longyuan clapped his hands and said, “You’re indeed the daughter of Merciless Zhang and Gorgeous Zi. You’re really good-looking. Well, I’ve dug up many green-haired zombies, white-haired ones, yellow-haired ones, and black-haired ones. There are all kinds of them. The black-haired zombies are quite powerful. They almost killed me with just one look. Fortunately, I’m lucky.”","“Ewww...”","As soon as Mengmeng thought about it, she felt a little disgusted. “Stop it, stop it.”","“Where is Zhang Hanyang now?”","Ye Longyuan looked around.","“He’s cultivating,” Mu Xue said. “You’re in a very high realm. You’ve actually reached the Integration Realm.”","“Then take a look!”","Ye Longyuan looked at the void with his hands clasped behind his back.","With a trace of transcendence and emotion of the world, he sighed softly.","“Since I was in the Sea Dragon Star Area, I’ve been raiding graves. At first, I got no treasures. However, I found that the higher-end the place was, the more powerful the grave would be, and the more treasures there would be. Finally, I found a way. I robbed the graves from the Good Star Street to the Silver Dragon Galaxy, and then I came to the Center Galaxy. I’ve robbed millions of graves. My cultivation level has reached the Integration Realm. The hardship I’ve been through is not something that outsiders can understand. You won’t get it even if I tell you. Alas.”","Ye Longyuan glanced at Mu Xue and said, “Mu Xue, you are flowers growing in a greenhouse. You don’t know many things without experiencing life and death. As for me, I’m walking on the tip of the blade and in danger all the time, so I have to improve my strength quickly. I’m sorry. We were equally famous at that time. Now I’m a few steps ahead of you. You should have reached the Void-refining Realm, haven’t you? The gap between us is not big. Keep working hard.”","It was as if an elder was lecturing a junior.","Seeing that Ye Longyuan was about to continue, Chu Qingyi covered her forehead and couldn’t stand it anymore.","“Stop.”","“I’m sorry.”","Mu Xue released her aura and said, “I’m also in the Integration Realm. I’m at the Peak Stage and about to reach the Mastery Realm.”","Chen Changqing replied, “I’m the same.”","He released his great aura.","Zhao Feng said, “I was far from being your match at that time. But now, my realm is higher than yours. I’m a little ahead of you.”","Chu Qingyi said, “I’m now in the Mastery Realm.”","Kong Ling’er was a bit stunned at first, but then she realized something and said, “I’m going to reach the Tribulation Stage soon.”","Mengmeng blinked and looked at Ye Longyuan, who was in a daze. She also said, “I’m in the Void-refining Realm. My cultivation is slow. I’m at the Void-refining Realm Early Stage. You’re in the Integration Realm. I think we can have a fight. By the way, we can bet on something.”","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Zhang Guangyou patted Ye Longyuan on the shoulder.","“Young man, you are indeed fast. Keep working hard. Well, I am also in the Integration Realm.”","“...”","Poof!","Ye Longyuan was stunned.","“This group of people is bullying me!","“Good heavens!","“I improved my realm so quickly. I robbed the tombs of so many big shots and found so many supreme treasures before reaching the Integration Realm.","“How did these guys suddenly reach the Integration Realm and the Mastery Realm?”","For a moment, he questioned everything he had learned before.","Looking at him, everyone couldn’t help but laugh.","They had been a little bored, but this guy came to them. His vivid expression made people feel happy.","“Farewell.”","Ye Longyuan turned around and left. After taking a few steps, he ran back.","“What about Zhang Hanyang?”","“What about him?” Mengmeng asked.","“What realm is he in?” Ye Longyuan asked curiously.","“I won’t tell you unless you take out some treasures.” Mengmeng snorted.","Ye Longyuan was curious and at a loss at once.","He thought about it for two seconds.","He thought to himself, “According to Merciless Zhang’s strength, he should be at the Tribulation Stage. This is an opportunity. I’ve been owing him money. Will no one dare to hurt me in the future?”","“I’ll pay.”","Ye Longyuan took out a white bell and said, “This is an eighth-tier spirit treasure.”","“One treasure for one question,” Mengmeng said.","Ye Longyuan did not think too much about it. He nodded and said, “Okay.”","Therefore, Mengmeng took the spiritual treasure and said, “My dad is at the Tribulation Stage.”","“As expected.”","Ye Longyuan scratched his head and asked, “Which tier is he at?”","Mengmeng stretched out her hand and said, “This is the second question.”","Ye Longyuan was speechless.","After being stunned for two seconds, he took out another seventh-tier spirit treasure and asked, “Wasn’t that the same question?”","Mengmeng quickly put away the spirit treasure and said seriously, “It’s not the same question.”","“Well, go ahead.” Ye Longyuan curled his lips. He didn’t expect that the little princess of Mount New Moon would play such a trick.","“What did you say?” Mengmeng looked confused. “You just asked the question.”","“What?”","Ye Longyuan was stunned. After thinking for 10 seconds, he finally understood. “You, you... Sure enough, the more beautiful a woman is, the better at fooling others.”","He took out another seventh-tier spirit treasure.","“Go ahead,” Mengmeng said.","Ye Longyuan had learned to be smart this time. He gestured with his hands without saying a word.","Mengmeng saw that she couldn’t play with him anymore, so she said directly, “My dad is at the third tier.”","Poof!","Ye Longyuan fell into a daze again.","He had thought that his cultivation speed was very fast.","“But... why is the team of Mount New Moon even faster? It’s as if they’re cheating.","“This is not fair!”"]},{"number":1611,"title":"Chapter 1611 Come and Go as They Please","paragraphs":["Chapter 1611 Come and Go as They Please","Yue Wuwei observed from the side for a moment. Indeed, he could not put the flag into his Space Ring, so he asked, “Where did you get this black flag?”","It also brought Ye Longyuan back to reality. He took a deep breath, felt a little depressed, and replied in a low voice, “I got it here by raiding a great grave.”","“A grave here?”","Yue Wuwei pondered for a moment again.","There was a stream of energy flowing around the black flag. As for what it was exactly, he was unable to tell.","Zhang Han was not done with his cultivation yet. Yue Wuwei thought that he shouldn’t destroy the energy of the black flag by force since it might be useful.","He couldn’t directly disperse the energy just because he was curious.","Right then, Zhang Han said from not far away, “It’s a Soul Flag.”","Zhang Han came from outside a small mountain and said, “This kind of flag is a very useful supreme treasure of the Black Spirit Clan. Did you raid the ancestral grave of the Black Spirit Clan?”","“I don’t know,” Ye Longyuan said, “but I’ve never heard of the Black Spirit Clan. Anyway, this flag is also a good thing. Haha, Zhang Hanyang, I’ll give it to you. Take it as the interest of my debt. I’ll take my time to pay off the rest of the debt.”","“Really?”","Zhang Han smiled faintly and approached the crowd.","Mengmeng ran over and asked, “Dad, have you finished your cultivation?”","“Yeah. This secret realm is about to dissipate.” Zhang Han nodded.","Hiss!","Ye Longyuan gasped at once.","“What does his cultivation have to do with the disappearance of the secret realm?","“Holy shit! He’s consuming the secret realm!”","Ye Longyuan slightly paled.","“Merciless Zhang is still the same as before.”","“Shall we leave first?”","Yue Wuwei handed over the flag and said, “There is a layer of energy that I haven’t broken.”","“This energy is the essence of the soul and has been refined for certain years. It can be used to refine some special medicinal pellets.”","Zhang Han took the flag. As the light swirled, the surface of the Black Soul Flag kept trembling.","Right at this moment-","“Bastard, put down the Black Soul Flag. That’s a holy object of our clan!”","A roar rang out from afar.","“They’re coming.” Yue Wuwei looked ahead with indifferent eyes and said, “Shall we deal with them?”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “Let’s go first and make them worried.”","The surface of the black flag was covered with a wisp of light.","Swoosh!","The Black Soul Flag disappeared and was put into Zhang Han’s Space Ring.","“Holy crap!”","Seeing such means, Ye Longyuan felt envious.","“How come Zhang Hanyang knows everything?”","“Let’s go.”","Yue Wuwei took out the small boat.","The crowd quickly boarded the ship, which turned into a stream of light, broke through the void, and left the secret realm.","After leaving, Tiny Tot turned into a thousand-foot-long beast, and everyone came to the Alternate Space again.","Tiny Tot’s crystal stone tail trembled a bit. It broke into the secondary space and left swiftly.","A full minute passed.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Nine figures appeared. They were the nine Immortal Masters of the Nine Mountains Alliance.","“AAAAH!”","Immortal Master Aogu was so angry that his hair stood on end. He kept roaring, “That Black Soul Flag is a holy object of our clan. They stole it. I’m so angry! I must kill them! I must kill them all! Guards! Guards!”","Immortal Master Aogu had gone mad from anger.","After shouting a few times, he found that there were no subordinates around.","Immortal Master Broken-mountain sighed softly. “Aogu, calm down first. Since they showed up here, they must have targeted us.”","Another Immortal Master, Tufeng, said, “Could it be that the abnormal scenes that occurred when our subordinates undergo their tribulations have something to do with them? Don’t forget, for so many years, has there ever been a problem with the Heavenly Tribulation? This must be an external factor. That man is also an Immortal Master. Since he could offer some ninth-tier spirit treasures, maybe he also has a special treasure that causes the abnormal Heavenly Tribulation.”","Smack!","A person next to him slapped his thigh hard and said, “That’s right. A few days ago, I heard that more than 20 people in the Lan-star District nearby succeeded in undergoing their tribulations. Why do our men keep failing? There must be a reason. It’s really possible that it was that man who took action and made it happen.”","“Is he called Immortal Master Yue?” Immortal Master Broken-mountain asked doubtfully, “Does he have that kind of treasure?”","“There are all kinds of strange things in the world. Broken-mountain, don’t underestimate the foreign Immortal Masters.”","“You’re right.” Broken-mountain took a light breath and said, “If it’s him, he must be taking revenge on us. After all, we’ve taken a lot of his treasures. Now... he has the Black Soul Flag, so it’s difficult to deal with him. I’m afraid that they will escape directly, which will give us no chance to get even with them.”","“Don’t we still have Gu Linli?” Aogu was exasperated. “I’ll give her to them. Since they dare to exchange so many precious treasures for her, they’ll definitely come to us again. Damn it, if they dare to show up, I’ll kill them!”","“If they appear, they will consider a lot of things. It’s not easy to trick them.” Immortal Master Tufeng frowned and said, “We have to make a proper plan first. Inform all the members of the alliance to come to the Purple Cloud Sect to prepare for undergoing tribulations. We have to set up an inescapable trap here, as long as they dare to appear...”","After that, Immortal Master Tufeng smiled coldly and said, “They’ll have no chance of escape!”","“I’m in!”","Immortal Master Aogu said, “If I can get the Black Soul Flag this time, I will give you half of our holy water!”","“Hahaha.” Immortal Master Broken-mountain laughed out loud. “Aogu, you’ve really put in a lot of effort. Black Spirit Holy Water is a rare treasure.”","They were plotting.","At the same time, Zhang Han and his team were also making a plan.","“When that group of people found us, they must be thinking that we should go back to get Gu Linli. They must be setting up a lot of ambushes,” Yue Wuwei said.","“We have Tiny Tot,” Zi Yan said, “and we don’t need a spaceship. They can’t stop us, can they?”","“That’s right. With Tiny Tot here, we can leave or stay whenever we want.” Zhang Han didn’t keep the crowd guessing. He smiled and said, “But they think that we will go to them, they’re wrong. With the Soul Flag, we can find the Black Spirit Clan. Before they go back, we’ll go to the clan’s territory. The Black Spirit Clan should have a lot of treasures. As long as we can find Gu Linli, we’ll get our job done.”","“Can we find the Black Spirit Clan’s territory with this flag?” Yue Wuwei asked. His eyes lit up.","The other hundreds of people present looked excited.","If they could really find the Black Spirit Clan’s territory, it would be great.","“Time is of the essence. Let’s go before they react,” Yue Wuwei said.","“Soul!”","Lightning flashed in Zhang Han’s eyes, which were turned into wisps of flowing light and disappeared into the Black Soul Flag.","Sizzle!","“Origin Searching Incantation!”","The wondrous power was presented. With the power of the Black Soul Flag, wisps of the tractive force showed the direction.","Zi Yan told Tiny Tot, “Let’s go over there.”","“Coo.”","Tiny Tot wagged its tail and shuttled back and forth in the secondary space at an extremely fast speed.","A layer of light appeared in the surrounding space, which was the layer of energy channel.","With each leap, Tiny Tot grew closer to the destination, where the tractive force came from.","After Tiny Tot leaped six times, the crowd finally arrived.","Zhang Han said, “It’s under the planet.”","Yue Wuwei thought for a moment and said, “Will only the two of us go? Or will we take the team with us?”","“We don’t have much time. Let’s go down directly.”","So Tiny Tot displayed its ability again.","It sneaked down quietly.","The earth couldn’t stop Tiny Tot at all. The vast fog around Tiny Tot’s body turned it into a soul that shuttled back and forth in the earth.","“Holy shit!”","Ye Longyuan was so envious that his eyes turned red. “If I could do this, I would have robbed all the tombs in the world!”","A thousand meters underground was where the underground city was located.","The Black Spirit Clan didn’t have many members. The clansmen were either cultivating or researching the clan’s unique treasures.","“There aren’t any spiritual herbs.”","“That’s the treasury.”","“Let’s find Gu Linli first. Don’t alarm the people here. There shouldn’t be many real treasures here.”","Zhang Han’s goal was clear. He needed to find Gu Linli first.","Zhang Han and his companions wandered around and came to the back of the main hall.","A layer of energy surrounded the main hall.","Every time Immortal Master Aogu left, there would be such energy in his territory, which prevented others from stepping into it.","“If we enter, we will be discovered.”","The crowd hesitated for a moment.","“Let’s do it.”","Zhang Han looked calm.","He had experienced too many small occasions like this.","The moment the Bounded Domain was broken-","On the other side, a fleet of the Purple Cloud Sect left the secondary space.","“The Bounded Domain of my main hall has been breached.”","Immortal Master Aogu looked gloomy. “Let’s go back and see what’s going on!”","The fleet turned around and entered the secondary space again.","While traveling back, which took a few hours, Immortal Master Aogu was also frightened.","When he returned to his territory, he saw that half of the underground city had been turned into ruins.","“Grand Master, Grand Master!”","Someone cried out sorrowfully, “We’ve been attacked! The treasures have all been taken! All of the Black Spirit Holy Water has been taken away!”","“The main hall was smashed. What are those people looking for?”","“We tried to stop them, but they have an Immortal Master.”","“...”","The news almost made Immortal Master Aogu faint.","“They’ve taken away all my treasures?!”","“It’s those people.” Immortal Master Broken-mountain looked livid. “They actually beat us to it.”","“The Black Soul Flag! They used the Black Soul Flag to locate my clan!” Immortal Master Aogu gritted his teeth so hard that they were about to break. “Damn it!”","“What about Gu Linli?” Immortal Master Broken-mountain was a little worried.","If Gu Linli was taken away, they would have no way to restrict their enemies, who could leave as they pleased.","If word got out that the Nine Mountains Alliance had been toyed with by a foreign Immortal Master, the members of the alliance would be laughed at by the upper region of the Center Galaxy.","“I have Gu Linli.”","With a cold look on his face, Immortal Master Aogu waved his right hand, and a half-dead woman in a black robe who looked like a skeleton appeared.","Smack! Smack!","Immortal Master Aogu took out his soul whip and whipped the woman hard to vent his anger.","After a quarter of an hour, he stopped and took a deep breath.","“Let’s go to Purple Cloud Sect.”","“Let’s go.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain was also a little worried about his base.","After all, his treasures mattered to him much.","Logically speaking, even if he didn’t hold down the fort, he would be able to stop the enemy Immortal Master with his backup plan.","However, those enemies could come and go as they pleased in the Black Spirit Clan’s headquarters.","“This isn’t something that ordinary experts can achieve.","“If those people mean to leave, we may not be able to stop them.”","Thinking of this, the other Immortal Masters couldn’t remain calm anymore.","So they set off one after another, intending to leave and return to their own territory to guard the place.","At this moment, a piece of news came.","“Bad news, Sect Leader.”","Hearing the voice, Immortal Master Broken-mountain was shocked.","“Our treasury on the Main Mount has been robbed, as well as 18 subsidiary planets.","“Those treasure vaults have been attacked. We haven’t found out who did it.”","Immortal Master Aogu said angrily, “Who else could it be!”","“Let’s go!”","The expressions of the other Immortal Masters changed greatly.","They left immediately.","In just three days.","“Profundity Star’s treasure vault has been raided.”","“Druid Star’s treasury has been attacked.”","“...”","An invasion that targeted the Nine Mountains Alliance began.","The various defensive facilities in the starry sky and the defensive power on the surface of the planets had all become useless."]},{"number":1612,"title":"Chapter 1612 The Arrival of A Powerful Enemy","paragraphs":["Chapter 1612 The Arrival of A Powerful Enemy","“Exactly what sort of monsters are they?”","In just ten days, more than three thousand planets had been invaded.","A massive amount of resources had been lost.","On average, 300 planets were under attack every day.","“Don’t they need to eat?","“Don’t they need to rest?","“They’ve been invading the planets like this!","“Why are they so fast?","“Who can tell me why?”","The Immortal Masters of the Nine Mountains Alliance were utterly irritated.","“Inform all the planets to clear out the treasuries and put them away.”","“Inform all fleets to gather on the main planet.”","Helplessly, the Immortal Masters gave the order.","The defense of such a large Star Area had failed.","If other forces came to fight, it would be easy for them to win a large number of territories.","Fortunately, the Nine Mountains Alliance had great prestige.","Not many forces found anything unusual about the Nine Mountains Alliance.","On this day, the Nine Mountains Alliance issued another order.","“All the planets of the Nine Mountains Alliance, spread a message. Those people need to come to the Purple Cloud Sect in five days. If they don’t come, we will execute Gu Linli.”","This was their counterattack.","“This person is obviously very important since those people used so many treasures to get her back.","“You want to take your time to toy with us, but we won’t do so.","“Let’s have a real fight then.”","This news caused a huge stir in the Nine Mountains Alliance.","“Who is Gu Linli?”","“Things are tense in the alliance recently. I wonder who the enemy is.”","“I’ve heard that the treasure vaults of many planets have been attacked by unknown forces. All the planets of the Nine Mountains Alliance have been affected. Without exception, they have suffered heavy losses.”","“Who dares to mess with the Nine Mountains Alliance? Could it be another major alliance?”","“It’s so terrifying. The Nine Mountains Alliance has messed with a terrifying enemy, which forced the nine Immortal Masters to come up with such a bad idea.”","“...”","The crazy discussion made this matter the focus of the Nine Mountains Alliance.","At the same time, the news slowly spread in all directions.","“Hahaha, the Nine Mountains Alliance is under attack?”","“Interesting. I would like to know exactly who has embarrassed them to such an extent.”","There were a lot of onlookers.","They were constantly inquiring about the matter. Some of their subordinates took the initiative to deliver the news.","In short, there were more people paying attention to the Nine Mountains Alliance than before.","“Five days from now, they will execute Gu Linli.”","In the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot, Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “It seems that they got anxious.”","“It’s time for them to get anxious. We’ve raided 3,000 planets.” Yue Wuwei shook his head and said, “All our Space Rings are full.”","It wasn’t that he wanted to stop the robbery. There were still many planets that they could raid, but everyone’s Space Rings were full.","It was like a great harvest.","“It’s so cool to attack the sects in the Center Galaxy!”","Ye Longyuan had also obtained a lot of treasures, so he was overjoyed.","But he was still a little conflicted. “But I still have to raid... the graves. I can’t lose my dream.”","He thought that following Zhang Hanyang was no different from getting treasures without making any effort.","“Others can do it. They don’t have a proper career, but I do. I’m a graverobber.","“Forget it, forget it.","“When Zhang Hanyang and the others leave this area, it will be time for me to part with them.”","“We’re almost ready. Let’s go and have a look,” Zhang Han said.","“Just watch me fight this battle.” Yue Wuwei narrowed his eyes slightly and smiled faintly. “Finally, I can have a decent opponent.”","Zhang Han said, “There’s no need to rush. We’ll see what happens after we get Gu Linli.”","His first goal in coming to the Center Galaxy was not to cultivate but to bring Gu Linli back.","The crowd set off for the Purple Cloud Sect.","Five days passed in the blink of an eye.","There were no outsiders in the inner court of the Purple Cloud Sect, but Immortal Master Broken-mountain and the others had all set up an inescapable trap.","“We’ve set up the trap.","“Do those people dare to come?”","In fact, they were not sure.","The nine Immortal Masters gathered together on the main star of the Purple Cloud Sect.","But all their faces were darkened, and the atmosphere was depressing.","“The fifth day will pass soon. They haven’t arrived yet.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain said, “Have they left just like that?”","“If they have left, I’ll really kill Gu Linli!” Immortal Master Aogu made up his mind.","Many subordinates in the Tribulation Stage stayed in the distance and did not dare to approach at all.","“Immortal Master is so furious recently.","“He hits people at any time...”","“They’re here!”","“Sect Leader, Immortal Master Yue is here.”","A subordinate flew over in a hurry.","“What?”","Aogu suddenly stood up. The others followed closely behind with excited expressions.","“They’re really here? Where did they come from?” Immortal Master Broken-mountain asked.","“They appeared directly at the space station,” the subordinate replied.","“They, they appeared directly?” Immortal Master Broken-mountain gasped.","“No wonder they could attack various planets. With their strange and unpredictable means, they can gain a foothold in the Center Galaxy.”","“Since they dare to appear, let them stay.”","Immortal Master Aogu’s face was full of ferocity.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They tore through the air and quickly flew toward the space station.","Soon, they saw two people not far from the space station.","“Wonderful.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain said coldly in the distance, “What grudges do we have against each other?! This is insane! You destroyed 3,000 stars of our Nine Mountains Alliance!”","He questioned the other party as soon as he arrived.","He did it due to the suppressed anger in his heart recently.","Hearing what he said, Yue Wuwei put his hands behind his back and said, “Don’t you know the reason?”","“Since you all dared to come here today, there is no need for you to say anything. Today is the day of your death.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain sneered.","“Hahahaha!”","Yue Wuwei laughed and said, “I just feel very nice to look at your sad expressions. Let’s cut to the chase. Hand her over.”","“Do you think I’ll hand her over just because you want me to?” Immortal Master Aogu asked coldly.","“Then take a look at this.”","Zhang Han casually took out the Black Soul Flag and clenched his right hand. “This is a holy object of your Black Spirit Clan. It’s useless to me. You can choose not to use her to get it back. In that case, I can break this flag right on the spot.”","He hit the nail on the head.","Immortal Master Aogu looked terribly gloomy.","“I will hand her over, and you will hand over the Black Soul Flag!”","Immortal Master Aogu was more concerned about the holy object. He said those words straightforwardly and showed Gu Linli, who was half-dead.","At this moment, Zhang Han frowned slightly.","He didn’t expect Gu Linli to become like this. It was impossible for her to revive. Even if her remnant soul recovered its consciousness, she wouldn’t live for long.","He remembered that the Sect Master of Illusory Sea Manor still had about 40 years to live.","He was silent for a moment.","Perhaps this was their fate.","However, even though decades were a very short time for a cultivator, he still wanted to fulfill the wish of the Sect Master of the Illusory Sea Manor.","“Give her to us, and you can take the flag,” Zhang Han said straightforwardly.","“We’ll do it at the same time.”","Immortal Master Aogu was not afraid of their tricks. He directly threw Gu Linli at Zhang Han as if he were throwing some trash.","Judging from the aura, Zhang Han made sure that it was Gu Linli.","Zhang Han also threw over the Black Soul Flag in his hand.","“You’ve been tricked!”","When Immortal Master Aogu got the flag, he laughed and said, “Today is the day of your death. You’ll be dead no matter what!”","“Is that so?”","Yue Wuwei looked calm, and his eyes were shining. “Coincidentally, I want to kill a few Immortal Masters.”","“Black Soul Flag!","“This is our clan’s holy object!”","Immortal Master Aogu enjoyed it very much. He held the Black Soul Flag and sighed softly. “You shouldn’t have given me the Black Soul Flag. Since I have it now, my combat capability will be improved by at least 50%!”","The others, such as Immortal Master Broken-mountain, also looked relaxed.","“Since you’ve shown up, you will die.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain said, “Alas, no one can save you today.”","“Heh.”","Zhang Han smiled faintly, feeling a little emotional. There was a hint of sarcasm in his smile. “You can’t even tell whether your own holy object is real or not. Your way of Tao as a Black Spirit Wizard is too shallow.”","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Aogu’s pupils contracted.","Upon closer inspection, he found that it was indeed the Black Soul Flag. It was the one.","However, when he used the unique strength of a Black Spirit Wizard to activate the spell-","Poof!","The Black Soul Flag suddenly turned into a faint mist that dissipated.","“I’ve been tricked!”","Immortal Master Aogu’s face instantly turned red.","“Give me my Black Soul Flag back!”","He shouted angrily, moreover rushing over. “Kill them!”","Zhang Han didn’t hesitate. He stored Gu Linli, the half-dead, in a Space Treasure.","Before he did anything, Yue Wuwei rushed forward.","He struck out with his palm from thousands of feet away.","He performed Thousand Overlapping Palm the supernatural power.","There were thousands of golden palm prints in the sky, which looked like waves that kept slapping in the void.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Muffled sounds continued to ring out as Yue Wuwei displayed his ultimate strength.","With just one move, Immortal Master Aogu was forced to retreat hundreds of meters, looking a little shocked.","“He’s actually at the Peak Stage of the fifth tier!”","“Let’s attack him together!”","Clatter!","Yue Wuwei stood alone in the void and fought against the nine Immortal Masters.","All kinds of moves and lights were shaking the void of the universe, and the might was overwhelming.","The many disciples watching the battle in the distance were in a state of shock.","“Oh my god, that man is so powerful.”","“Even our nine Immortal Masters can’t defeat him.”","“Who is he? Where does Immortal Master Yue come from? Is he from the Star Sea?”","“However, no matter how strong he is, he is still at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage. There is a limit to the energy in his body. Our nine Immortal Masters will eventually win. They will definitely...”","Before that man finished his words, Yue Wuwei put up a good fight, and his figure kept pressing forward.","The nine Immortal Masters were forced to retreat.","One of the Immortal Masters at the fifth tier spat out two mouthfuls of blood.","“How dare you challenge me with your meager strength?”","Yue Wuwei said coldly, “You can’t even stop half of my means. How dare you talk big?”","Boom!","Without using any weapons, Yue Wuwei completely suppressed the nine people with merely his supernatural powers.","“What... He has too many supernatural powers.”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain looked gloomy. “He is stronger than us.”","“Even so, you will still die today!” Immortal Master Aogu said angrily, “You underestimate our Nine Mountains Alliance!”","Bam!","Yue Wuwei gave Immortal Master Aogu another slap and sent him flying.","He appeared invincible and unparalleled.","Yue Wuwei gave off an earth-shattering aura.","“I need to try out my battle power.”","Zhang Han also felt the desire to fight. He moved and flew forward quickly.","“Hahaha!”","Yue Wuwei laughed and said, “Today, we will kill the nine of you. You asked for it!”","Yue Wuwei wanted to kill them.","As for Immortal Master Tufeng, he said coldly, “You’ll regret it.”","At this moment, Zhang Han just rushed over and was ready to fight.","The power of the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure was finally about to be revealed.","However, before he could make a move-","“Alas!”","A sigh spread across the void.","Swoosh!","As if teleporting, an old man in a white shirt suddenly appeared in front of Zhang Han.","He seemed to have been separated from time and space. He stretched his hand and gently punched.","Boom!","Zhang Han was smashed into pieces.","“Is, is he killed by a single punch?”","Yue Wuwei was suddenly dumbfounded.","Immortal Master Broken-mountain and the others were completely relaxed.","The faint blood mist floating in the void condensed suddenly.","Zhang Han reappeared.","However, his breath was a little disordered.","Swoosh!","Zhang Han retreated quickly and looked at the old man in white seriously.","“This man is definitely not just at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage!","“He’s even more powerful than most of the sixth-tier cultivators. He’s likely to be a Dao Seeking Cultivator at the peak of the sixth tier or above!”"]},{"number":1613,"title":"Chapter 1613 Defeated by the Heavenly Tribulation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1613 Defeated by the Heavenly Tribulation","“Huh?”","The old man in white let out a soft cry of surprise and said, “You’re not dead? You’re a Body Cultivator. Well, your physique is not bad.”","He was very relaxed and casual. This was incomparable confidence, as well as an unmatched posture.","“Retreat,” Zhang Han said to Yue Wuwei via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","Yue Wuwei gave up attacking the nine suppressed Immortal Masters. Instead, he quickly retreated and came to Zhang Han.","The old man in white didn’t seem to be in a hurry to make a move.","“It’s rare to see someone who can withstand my punch and survive in the Star Sea. It seems that you are also someone with great opportunities.”","The old man in white looked Zhang Han up and down.","“Hahaha!”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain and the others relaxed.","They watched coldly from the side.","Even Immortal Master Aogu burst into laughter.","After laughing, the nine people cupped their hands.","“Greetings, Immortal Master Hetu!”","The white-clothed old man was called Immortal Master Hetu.","He waved his hand and didn’t even look at them. It was obvious that he didn’t attach much importance to them.","“Do you think you’ve won?”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain looked coldly at Yue Wuwei and said, “But since we dared to say that, how could we not be prepared? Immortal Master Hetu is a great Dao Seeking Cultivator in the Star Sea. In recent years, he has been traveling in the Center Galaxy. I’m lucky to know him. It’s the greatest honor of the Nine Mountains Alliance to have invited him. If he takes action, you’ll have no chance of escape!”","“No matter how strange and unpredictable your body movements are, you can’t escape. Immortal Master Hetu has advanced to the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage. How can you two stop him?” Immortal Master Aogu snorted.","Who knew how much they had paid to invite Immortal Master Hetu here?","Many people had heard about the Nine Mountains Alliance. It was indeed a blow to their morale.","However, the reason they’d paid a high price to invite Immortal Master Hetu over wasn’t just to strengthen the momentum of the alliance, it was mostly because they were truly unable to take this insult.","If they didn’t fight back, it would become an unforgettable stain on their life, which they would never be able to get rid of.","Therefore, they made a move and asked Immortal Master Hetu for help.","They had to tell the world that if they were provoked, they would be able to invite a powerful backer.","Immortal Master Hetu didn’t respond to their flattery at all.","It was just that the nine Immortal Masters had given him a few useful spirit treasures, so he showed up to kill a few people. It was just a small deal.","They respectfully called him a seventh-tier master, but in fact, he was at the peak of the six-tier.","Immortal Master Hetu hadn’t dared to undergo the Heavenly Tribulation yet.","He had to be prepared, even though he had been preparing for three thousand years.","The higher the tier of the Tribulation Stage a cultivator was at, the more fierce the Heavenly Tribulation would be, and the more preparations needed to be made.","For example, Zhang Han was an extraordinary man who had reached the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier in 500 years.","He was one of the few people who could achieve that in the vast Star Sea.","Some reached the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier in a few decades, and their natural talent was unparalleled. Most cultivators were like Immortal Master Hetu, who needed hundreds or thousands of years to reach that level.","“Little guy, what kind of constitution do you have?”","The old man in white said lightly, “If you perform well, I will spare you.”","“Do you want to know?”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","When Zhang Han was powerful, he could kill people like Hetu with a blow of his breath.","However, things were different now. He had just been destroyed once by his opponent.","Fortunately, he had three bodies. As long as they didn’t die at the same time, he wouldn’t die even if he was killed thousands of times. However, if he died too many times, it would damage his foundation.","“I’m just a little curious.”","Immortal Master Hetu put his hands behind his back, and his immortal aura was awe-inspiring. He said flatly, “A Dao Seeking Cultivator should be curious about something in his life. It’s his nature. You are all Dao Seeking Cultivators at the Tribulation Stage, and it’s not easy to reach this stage. If you cooperate, I can guarantee that you won’t be killed.”","“Is that so? What should I do to cooperate?” Zhang Han raised his eyebrows.","“He is just putting on airs.","“But what he said is true. In the current situation, we are at a disadvantage and are at his mercy.”","“Just come here and let me have a look.”","Immortal Master Hetu spoke indifferently.","“And then you can prepare to possess me upon seeing that I have an excellent physique?” Zhang Han shook his head. “You think I’m a frog at the bottom of a well. In fact, sometimes, you are the frog at the bottom of the well. Only you don’t know that.”","Immortal Master Hetu wasn’t embarrassed at all when his thoughts were exposed, and he clapped his hands. “Alright, then I’ll kill all of you.”","“How dare you rebel!”","“How dare you speak to Immortal Master Hetu in such a way!” Immortal Master Aogu cursed furiously. “Who gave you the courage to do so?”","“I can kill a puny Supreme Expert like him,” Immortal Master Broken-mountain said. “Immortal Master Hetu, don’t dirty your hands. I’ll handle it!”","“You’re so arrogant.”","Yue Wuwei said with a cold face, “If this old thing hadn’t suddenly appeared, the nine of you would have been beaten to death by me. How could you still be in the mood to talk about this?”","Supreme Expert Tufeng smiled. “We don’t know if we’ll live or die, but it’s true that you’ll all die.”","“You minions have become arrogant now,” Yue Wuwei said.","“Even minions can deal with you. It’s just that we didn’t go all out just now!” someone said stubbornly.","“Heh.”","The nine Immortal Masters of the Nine Mountains Alliance argued with Yue Wuwei like shrews cursing in the street.","The tens of thousands of people around were stunned.","“Are they still the aloof Immortal Masters we used to know?”","Yue Wuwei was no longer as aloof as he used to be. No matter what the other party said, he would talk back.","It was because they were at the same level.","It was also because Yue Wuwei was under pressure at this time.","As for Zhang Han, he was standing next to them with a calm look, as if he was not worried at all.","“Then you can do it.”","Immortal Master Hetu suppressed Yue Wuwei with his mind and said, “Let me see how many times this little guy can be resurrected.”","“Thank you, Lord Hetu, for giving us this opportunity!”","The nine Immortal Masters were excited. With ferocious smiles on their faces, they rushed over.","Zhang Han frowned slightly and suddenly said, “We can’t have our families worry. Let’s start directly.”","“Okay.” Yue Wuwei nodded.","“What the hell is going on?”","Immortal Master Aogu and the others were stunned.","“Pretentious!”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain laughed coldly. “You still want to play tricks. Are you trying to draw our attention before using your strange body movements to escape? Dream on! Lord Hetu is here, so not a single one of you can escape!”","“Hahaha, is that so?”","Yue Wuwei laughed and looked ahead. “Hetu? Doing trash talk is all you can do. Come and kill me if you can!”","What Yue Wuwei said was enough to show his despise for the enemy.","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Hetu raised his brows. “You’re just a nobody. How dare you clamor in front of me?”","He moved at an extremely fast speed.","Right at this moment-","Buzz!","An incomparably powerful aura suddenly shook the entire void.","Clatter!","Yue Wuwei’s eyes lit up, and his momentum soared.","A thick tribulation cloud suddenly appeared in the sky.","When it appeared, it was very normal. It was only about a few dozen miles in size.","It had been like this when the members of the Nine Mountains Alliance underwent their tribulations in recent days.","But when the tribulation cloud found that it was Yue Wuwei-","“Fuck, it’s him! How dare you undergo your tribulation here?”","Therefore, the Heavenly Tribulation got excited.","The tribulation cloud within several dozen miles suddenly expanded by a thousand times.","“Hahahaha.","“This man is breaking through to the sixth tier from the fifth tier. I’ll see how that thunder thief resists me!”","The wind howled.","Lightning flashed and thunder rumbled.","Within the black clouds, fiery-red lightning began to form.","This was the process of an ordinary Thunder Tribulation evolving into a Qualitative Thunder Tribulation.","Under the control of the will of the excited Heavenly Tribulation, the process was forcibly shortened to a second.","It was just a normal bolt of lightning. It had just flickered, but when it ended, it had turned fiery red.","“Qualitative... Qualitative Heavenly Tribulation?”","Immortal Master Hetu was suddenly shocked, and he hurriedly stopped moving and retreated.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Immortal Master Aogu and the other eight people didn’t dare to get close to the field.","“This kind of Qualitative Thunder Tribulation is tens of thousands of miles long. It’s kind of scary. If it accidentally strikes us to death, we’ll be doomed.”","“Are you going to undergo your tribulation here?","“You’re not prepared at all. You deserve to die!”","Immortal Master Broken-mountain cursed in the distance.","He was still a little upset that he couldn’t kill his opponent with his own hands.","“Tribulation clouds!”","Yue Wuwei pointed his sword at the sky and said, “You can only make noises above. If you are capable, you can strike some powerful thunderbolts at me. Let’s see if I will crush you or not. I’ve made a lot of preparations for this tribulation. There is even a seventh-tier Tribulation Stage master watching from the side!”","There was nothing wrong with those words in the ears of Immortal Master Aogu and Immortal Master Hetu.","It seemed that Yue Wuwei had been preparing for undergoing his tribulation for a long time. And when he encountered such a situation, he was sure that he could break through to the sixth tier and fight against the others.","However, that is not the case according to the tribulation cloud’s will.","“This thunder thief is too arrogant!","“Does he think that there is a seventh-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator here? Bah! Seventh-tier? That’s bullshit. He’s just a piece of sixth-tier trash! I’ll hack you to death today.”","Clatter!","The fiery-red tribulation lightning had changed again.","Similarly, the tribulation cloud expanded rapidly by 10 times.","The hundreds of thousands of kilometers of tribulation cloud completely covered this area.","Even the tens of thousands of spectators in the distance were covered.","Looking at the huge round-shaped tribulation cloud, Hetu was slightly dazed. “What scale of Heavenly Tribulation is this?”","He suddenly became cautious.","“In this case, wouldn’t the fifth-tier cultivator who is breaking through to the sixth tier be hacked to death in an instant? And he’ll be dead for sure.”","“I’ll do it.”","Zhang Han took a light breath.","Rumble! Rumble! Rumble!","The fiery-red tribulation cloud gradually turned pale white.","“This is...","“The Tae Baek Spiritual Thunder.","“This tribulation thunder is quite powerful. Very good.”","Zhang Han smiled.","Just as the tribulation thunder was about to strike down-","“Let’s go!”","Yue Wuwei quickly took out the One Cloud and tried his best to cast it. He and Zhang Han hid in it.","The tribulation cloud was dumbfounded.","“Are you toying with me?","“How could you do that?”","It couldn’t vent its anger and was extremely displeased.","Sizzle!","Right at this moment, Zhang Han’s Thunder Body showed up, which turned into an electric current and wandered in the void of the universe.","The Heavenly Tribulation took a look.","“Damn it! How dare you turn into lightning to piss me off!","“I can still recognize a thunder thief like you if you turn into ashes.”","Rumble!","A pale white-colored tribulation thunderbolt that was a thousand meters thick suddenly descended.","It went straight to the electric current at an extremely fast speed.","Zhang Han’s Thunder Body ran to Immortal Master Hetu.","“What?”","Immortal Master Hetu watched as the two bolts of tribulation lightning, one big and one small, shot straight at him.","He was so scared that he trembled all over.","“I, I, this is not my tribulation!”","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Hetu turned around and fled.","However, no matter how fast he was, there was no way he could be faster than the Heavenly Tribulation.","“Is he trying to run away?”","The Heavenly Tribulation paid attention to the trajectory of Thunder Body.","It wasn’t far from Immortal Master Hetu.","Thus, the Heavenly Tribulation was enraged.","Thousands of thunderbolts suddenly flashed in front of Immortal Master Hetu and turned into a big net.","Immortal Master Hetu was completely in a daze.","“Is it trying to kill me?","“Defend!”","He took out more than a hundred defensive treasures.","However, he was still struck by the pale white tribulation of lightning.","Zhang Han’s Thunder Body couldn’t resist it at all and was directly turned into ashes.","As for Immortal Master Hetu-","Poof!","He had been struck by a portion of the tribulation lightning.","Blood sprayed from his mouth, and his aura dropped sharply. Fortunately, he had a precious treasure, so he managed to escape.","He looked as if he had seen a ghost.","“What kind of Heavenly Tribulation is this?","“I need to flee now!”","Immortal Master Hetu felt as if he’d escaped with his life, and he fled without looking back.","At the same time, the nine Immortal Masters who were left in the area locked down by the Heavenly Tribulation were dumbfounded."]},{"number":1614,"title":"Chapter 1614 I’m Back","paragraphs":["Chapter 1614 I’m Back","“Hahaha!”","The tribulation cloud was rolling and surging happily.","It was in a good mood.","“I finally killed that thunder thief. This is nice!","“But where is the other helper hiding?","“I have to search carefully. If necessary, I’ll hack this place down and dig a hundred feet out.”","The One Cloud is indeed the strongest among the Profound-grade treasures.","Not even the Heavenly Tribulation could detect it.","This was enough to prove its origins.","It was made by Sir.","Zhang Han also guessed this, so he was not worried.","As for the Thunder Body that had died once, it was nothing serious. Zhang Han had only used half of his energy to condense a portion of the Thunder Body.","It didn’t matter if the Thunder Body died a few more times.","Therefore, a streak of pale blue lightning appeared again.","The tribulation cloud was confused.","“He’s not dead!","“Then I shall continue to hack.”","Boom!","Another massive bolt of tribulation lightning descended.","At the same time, Immortal Master Aogu and the other eight experienced the horror that Immortal Master Hetu had experienced just now.","Two bolts of tribulation lightning, one big and one small, flew straight toward them.","“What should I do? What should I do?”","“It’s over. We’re doomed.”","They were completely panicked.","“Where to run?”","They didn’t have as many life-saving magic treasures as Immortal Master Hetu.","Boom!","But the result was unexpected.","The pale white tribulation lightning unexpectedly did not strike them.","Within the One Cloud.","“It didn’t hack them.”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “Shit, the tribulation cloud has become a little smarter.”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and said, “Is it because it often fights with us in terms of intelligence and courage?”","Zhang Han said, “It’s possible. It didn’t kill those people, but the aftermath scared them a lot and injured them. Well, I’ll use the Great Demon Body and the Thunder Body to kill them all.”","“Can, can you kill fifth-tier Immortal Masters?” Yue Wuwei was shocked at that time.","“I may not be able to kill them myself, but with the help of the tribulation thunder, they can’t afford to perish together,” Zhang Han replied.","Yue Wuwei was instantly lost in thought.","“Indeed, they can’t afford to do that.”","Yue Wuwei said in a muffled voice, “I feel that you’re deceiving them. But killing them is indeed what you should do.”","“I’ll do it at the right moment.”","Zhang Han was still waiting for the right moment.","He condensed a portion of his Thunder Body with less will and lured the Heavenly Tribulation to take action.","This time, the tribulation cloud was smarter. The energy of the tribulation thunder had been greatly reduced. It was bombarding the area around Immortal Master Aogu and the others without hurting them at all.","It finally understood that these people were the enemies of the thunder thief, so it couldn’t kill them easily.","Immortal Master Aogu and the others were scared silly.","“Shit. It’s bombarding us again.”","“The Heavenly Tribulation is toying with us.”","“What should we do? Flee! Let’s flee!”","“Don’t, don’t run,” Immortal Master Broken-mountain said, shivering. “It hasn’t killed us yet. Look at Immortal Master Hetu. He got hit by the Heavenly Tribulation and almost died. There’s no way we’ll survive.”","“What should we do? Just wait here?” someone asked in confusion.","“What if we don’t wait?”","“...”","A huge discussion began.","As for Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei, they were also discussing it.","“Is my tribulation over?” Yue Wuwei asked. “If we keep hiding, I may drop to the Early Stage of the fifth tier.”","“Theoretically, that’s true.” Zhang Han sighed softly. “But if you can survive, you can get back to your current stage again.”","The two of them hadn’t been prepared for that.","However, since they had seen Immortal Master Hetu, they could only come up with such a plan.","It was Pyrrhic victory.","“We might not necessarily fail.”","Zhang Han continued, “The energy of the Heavenly Tribulation you summon when you break through to the sixth tier from the fifth tier is not infinite. There’s a limit. After killing those people later, I’ll divide up my Thunder Body. When the tribulation lightning is almost done, you should succeed in undergoing the tribulation. Under the Qualitative Thunder Tribulation, you’ll get more Great Domain rules.”","Yue Wuwei laughed at once and said, “So, if I succeed, I can get a lot of benefits?”","“Yes.”","Zhang Han nodded.","“Can your Thunder Body handle it?” Yue Wuwei hesitated for a moment and said, “Don’t lose more than you gain.”","“It doesn’t matter. Some of my Source Energy may be damaged. But I’ll recover after swallowing more Heavenly Tribulation,” Zhang Han said.","It was easier said than done.","With the consumption of the Source of the Thunder Body, the speed and quality of absorption of the tribulation thunder in the future would decline.","His aptitude would be weakened.","However, Zhang Han had not only the chance to die several times unscathed but also had the Thunder Tower, the supreme treasure.","The Thunder Tower could make up for the Source he had consumed.","That was enough.","It also meant that the Thunder Tower would be consumed.","It would definitely dissipate in the future.","As long as Zhang Han learned enough thunder supernatural power, the disappearance of the Thunder Tower would not be a big deal.","During this period, in the void near the tribulation cloud, a black shadow kept flashing.","It was Tiny Tot.","In the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot, everyone could see the things outside without a blind spot.","“This Heavenly Tribulation is too terrifying.”","“Elder Yue is undergoing the tribulation again. Immortal Master Hetu has run away.”","“It’s good that my dad is fine.” Looking at the thunderbolts that kept appearing before, Mengmeng breathed a sigh of relief and patted her chest.","“Your dad has the Thunder Body. He should be fine.” Zhang Guangyou comforted her.","Zhang Mu said, “Good people are blessed by God.”","He sounded like a believer.","“What...”","Ye Longyuan was dumbfounded when he saw the scene.","“Zhang Hanyang dares to fight against the Heavenly Tribulation?","“He’s amazing!","“It has been a really wise choice for me to owe him money. Those nine idiots will be killed by Zhang Hanyang. Hahaha, the Nine Mountains Alliance is doomed. Zhang Hanyang is famous all over the world. When I go out in the future, I’ll tell everyone that I owe Zhang Hanyang crystal stones. Tut-tut.”","Ye Longyuan was glad that Zhang Hanyang had used some magical skills and supernatural power on him, which allowed him to make a breakthrough and obtain Interest-on-interest Magic. It was definitely the best deal in his life.","“Let’s do it!”","Zhang Han divided his Thunder Body into three parts, which were struck to death by the Heavenly Tribulation that seized this opportunity.","Then, the Thunder Body and the Great Demon Body that Zhang Han burst out with all his strength suddenly appeared.","In a flash, they came to Immortal Master Aogu and the others.","“What’s that?”","“That insignificant Supreme Expert?”","“He still dares to come here!”","“Kill him!”","Several people glared at the Thunder Body.","They were also a little flustered. “If he is here, which irritates the Heavenly Tribulation, we will all die together.”","“Thunder Willow! Suppress!”","The Thunder Body fully activated the Thunder Willow’s supernatural power.","“Wind of Lightning!”","Clatter!","The Wind of Lightning was displayed.","A gale suddenly appeared, and countless tiny thunderbolts condensed like a sandstorm.","At the same time, the power of the Great Demon Body was displayed.","It was one of the four great supernatural powers.","Buzz!","The Great Demon formed a seal with both hands.","A series of low murmurs emerged in the void.","An extremely mysterious and profound aura spread out.","Sizzle!","A 10,000-foot-tall shadow of the Great Demon appeared behind the Great Demon.","The giant was also making a casting gesture with both hands and displaying a supernatural power.","“Soul Nightmare!”","It was one of the four great initial supernatural powers.","The Soul Nightmare appeared.","Under the spell, in front of the Great Demon, a huge demonic shadow appeared. The black fog was like a tail. It was a Demonic Ghost with hands like knives and a ghost-like body.","Buzz!","Invisible fluctuations, mixed with countless soul incantations and supernatural powers, poured toward Immortal Master Aogu and the other eight.","After the initial mastery, the means the Soul Nightmare could use were these soul incantations and supernatural powers.","He couldn’t use the most powerful devil voice yet.","Even so, Supreme Expert Aogu and the others were still terrified by the power.","Except for Immortal Master Aogu, the patriarch of the Black Spirit Clan, the others were all injured. The most seriously injured one had a weak soul defense, while he was in the middle of these two attacks.","He almost died.","In the team, he opened his eyes slightly and saw the void not far away.","An enormous bolt of tribulation lightning had arrived.","When the tribulation cloud saw how arrogant the thunder thief was, how he ignored it and even came out to deal with others, it got furious.","It struck out with all its might.","It was the tribulation lightning that heavily injured Immortal Master Hetu.","Soul Nightmare, the Great Demon’s shadow, and even the Great Demon Body, the Thunder Body, the Wind of Lightning, and the Thunder Willow were unable to withstand this bolt of tribulation lightning.","It could be seen how terrifying it was.","Zhang Han lost his two bodies.","At the same time, the nine Immortal Masters who were still fighting with Zhang Han were also stunned.","“No!’","Immortal Master Aogu left his last roar in the world.","“Thunder Tribulation, why did you do this? NOOO!” Immortal Master Broken-mountain roared angrily.","Although he was unwilling, there was nothing he could do. He was struck to death by the tribulation lightning.","The Immortal Master, who was almost killed by Zhang Han, was unconscious and died naturally. He didn’t feel anything.","As for the others, no matter how many life-saving means they had, no matter how many defensive supreme treasures they had, they were all useless in the face of the Qualitative Thunder Tribulation summoned by Yue Wuwei.","The light dissipated.","That area also returned to normal, but the nine Immortal Masters were missing.","“Sect, Sect Leader is dead?”","The disciples of the Purple Cloud Sect widened their eyes in disbelief.","“What happened?”","“Sect Leader was hacked to death.”","“The, the tribulation thunder killed all the Sect Leaders of the Nine Mountains Alliance.”","“It’s over. The Nine Mountains Alliance is doomed.”","“Run, run!”","“The enemy will come to destroy this place.”","Since their leaders had fallen, they scattered and fled.","These guys had never thought about taking revenge. At the first possible moment, they wondered how much they could get.","The sect was so large, and there were many treasures in it. The trusted subordinates could only lead the team away to seek development from other sects. That was all they could do.","Without an Immortal Master, a force would eventually perish. The Nine Mountains Alliance had quite a few enemies.","“Flee now!”","“The Heavenly Tribulation has gone mad!”","Countless people were fleeing into the distance.","Of course, there were many who, after escaping from the Heavenly Tribulation’s range, stayed behind to observe the situation.","The tribulation cloud didn’t disperse for a long time. Lightning flickered about, and many streaks of lightning wandered about within the tribulation cloud.","What was it waiting for?","“Are those two dead?”","Many people felt that Yue Wuwei and Zhang Han had also died.","But what happened next made them tremble physically and mentally.","Tiny thunderbolts appeared one after another, constantly drawing the tribulation lightning.","Rumble!","The bombardment lasted for five hours.","The tribulation cloud began to thin out.","At the same time, the power of the lightning gradually decreased.","“It’s about time.”","Zhang Han was a little tired. He waved his hand and said, “Go.”","“Thank you for your hard work.”","Yue Wuwei thanked Zhang Han. Then, he flew out of the One Cloud cloud and looked at the tribulation cloud with an arrogant attitude.","“I’m back!”","Buzz!","The tribulation cloud churned continuously. Obviously, it was quite enraged.","If it could speak, it might say, “I’m not a human, but what you two did is truly inhuman!”","The energy of the Heavenly Tribulation where Yue Wuwei broke through to the sixth tier from the fifth tier was about to reach the upper limit.","No matter how strong the will of the Heavenly Tribulation was, it could not break the rules of the Great Domain.","Clack!","The tribulation cloud struck down dozens of thunderbolts indignantly, but they were all blocked by Yue Wuwei.","The tribulation cloud directly vanished just like Immortal Master Hetu who’d fled without even turning around.","Hiss!","The rules of the Great Domain descended.","Yue Wuwei could feel that his aura was rising steadily."]},{"number":1615,"title":"Chapter 1615 Retreat After Success","paragraphs":["Chapter 1615 Retreat After Success","Yue Wuwei exuded an earth-shattering aura of the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","At this moment, Yue Wuwei fully experienced the baptism of the wonderful power after undergoing tribulation.","“This is great!","“It feels so nice!”","Yue Wuwei exhaled a long breath and turned his head.","Tiny Tot appeared in the void.","It was thousands of feet long and completely black. In addition to its small wings and tail feathers being crystal blue, it also had big bright eyes, which were also very distinctive.","However, this guy enjoyed showing up as a penguin, which was small and delicate.","After transforming, Tiny Tot followed Dahei and Little Hei and walked around.","Obviously, it had woken up and needed to exercise for a while.","“Dad, you’ve made a breakthrough!” Yue Xiaonao shouted.","“Yes.”","Yue Wuwei nodded and said, “I’ve made a breakthrough. This time, we can relax in the Center Galaxy.”","He reached the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage successfully.","Of course, he didn’t rule out the possibility of encountering Immortal Master Hetu.","“Did you all see that?”","Yue Wuwei thought for a moment and said, “The enemy we met just now was a super expert at about the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage. Even Zhang Han was crushed by that punch.”","“Huh?”","Mengmeng was taken aback.","“Was he crushed just now?","“I didn’t believe it at all!”","“Dad, does it hurt?” The considerate young girl immediately came to Zhang Han and looked him up and down. Only then she felt a little relieved.","“No.”","Zhang Han touched the head of Mengmeng with a smile and said, “It’s just that it’s quite unexpected. I’m a powerful Body Cultivator. It’s very difficult for me to die.”","“Then you’d better not let anyone crush you again,” Zi Yan said.","“Yeah.”","Zhang Han said with a smile, “It’s just that I didn’t expect those people to get a powerful expert. Fortunately, Elder Yue can undergo his tribulation at any time. Otherwise, it would be quite hard for us to escape. This is the Center Galaxy. Not to mention the seventh-tier ones, even eighth-tier and ninth-tier Tribulation Stage Dao Seeking Cultivators often pass by here.”","“There is always someone better than us. We’d better be careful,” Yue Wuwei said in a deep voice.","The expressions of everyone present became serious.","In particular, Ye Longyuan, who worked alone, felt his scalp go numb.","If he was not careful, he might die when he met such a powerful opponent.","“Good people will be blessed by God. Good people will be blessed by God...”","Ye Longyuan comforted himself.","“This trip has been a success. We can set off on the way home now,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay.”","Hearing what Zhang Han said, Mengmeng took out the king vessel from her Space Ring and started it. All the energy cabins began to operate.","It would cost a lot of crystal stones and a huge amount of Energy Stones to go back to the Silver Dragon Galaxy from here.","“Shall we ride Tiny Tot back?” Mengmeng asked.","It cost many crystal stones to take the spaceship, but it wasn’t the same while taking Tiny Tot.","“We’ll take our time by spaceship.”","Zhang Han glanced at Tiny Tot and said, “Before it grows up, it can’t always travel through the void. I heard that it won’t grow bigger if it keeps traveling.”","“Alright then.”","Mengmeng grabbed Tiny Tot and rubbed its white belly a few times. “You can’t grow bigger? You’re so big now.”","“How is Gu Linli’s situation?”","Yue Wuwei also remembered this matter. He asked, “Is she... dead since she can be put into the Space Ring now?”","Hearing this question, everyone looked at Zhang Han.","“She’s half-dead.”","Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “Fortunately, there is enough Black Spirit Holy Water to refine the Soul Fixing Pellet. Even so, Gu Linli can at most regain consciousness for decades before she dies.”","“Before she dies...”","The atmosphere on the scene suddenly became depressing.","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and looked into the distance. “The Sect Leader of Illusory Sea Manor is also at the end of his life. The two of them will end up together.”","“This is fate,” Zhang Mu said in a low voice.","“Fate?”","Zhang Han was silent.","“When will my calamity descend?”","He hoped that all the tribulations would be on him. After all, his way of cultivation was heaven-defying. He didn’t want to implicate his family.","Without any thoughts or clues, Zhang Han felt a little depressed.","If this matter wasn’t solved, it would remain troublesome.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Everyone boarded the king vessel.","“Just go. You’ve already crushed the Nine Mountains Alliance. Aren’t you going to rob them?” Ye Longyuan shouted from the side.","“There’s no more profit.”","Zhang Han glanced at him.","“This guy seems to be very tempted.”","“If you don’t go, I’ll go do it.”","Ye Longyuan laughed and cupped his hands. “Everyone, see you next time. Zhang Hanyang, I know how much I owe you. Older Martial Sister Chu, see you next time. Little Princess of Mount New Moon, goodbye.”","After a simple farewell, Ye Longyuan took out a small king vessel, which was almost the same as an aircraft. It was completely black and not eye-catching at all. Then, it flew away in a flash.","“Let’s go. On the way back, we’ll raid all the secret realms we encounter.”","Zhang Han waved his hand.","The spaceship sailed toward a Space Shooting Planet.","It waited in line and leaped across the cosmos.","When the team arrived at the area where there was no Space Shooting Planet, they began to fly in secondary space. They would do it every once in a while.","They had heard that there were a lot of secret realms. In the upper region of the Center Galaxy, they had already encountered 16 secret realms. They had all gone through 11 secret realms together.","Even Yue Wuwei and Zhang Han went to a high-end secret realm and got a lot of treasures.","They reached the middle and lower regions.","They left the Center Galaxy.","The auras of all the people present rose again.","All the resources they obtained also turned into various kinds of medicinal pellets and were taken.","The most important thing was to refine the Soul Fixing Pellet.","Unexpectedly, with the technique of Zhang Han, the furnace exploded for the first time.","He succeeded in the second attempt and gave the Soul Fixing Pellet to Gu Linli.","Her soul recovered a lot, and it couldn’t be stored in a Space Treasure. It was placed in a room.","Everyone began to prepare the recovery medicinal pellets.","Zhang Han said, “The amount can’t be too much.","“Xiao Xue, you’re in charge of this matter. Gu Linli is weak, so you have to maintain the measure strictly at the beginning. You should apply the medicine all over her body every three hours. She should take a white Soul-pacifying Pellet every four hours and take the other medicinal pellets every five hours.”","It was as if they were treating a patient according to the treatment plan.","With the resources at hand, Gu Linli could only recover in this way.","If she had a heaven-defying supreme treasure, she might be able to recover in just a few seconds.","However, such a supreme treasure could only be chanced upon by luck. Even Zhang Han had only obtained a few of those in his previous life.","The crowd set foot on the Barren Star Area.","They encountered that kind of situation again. Many Starry Sky Beasts directly drove the king vessel out of the secondary space, intending to slaughter it.","“What kind of creature is this?”","Yue Wuwei looked at the black thing in front of him, which was about the same size as a wolf, and was a little confused.","“Let’s go!”","Unexpectedly, Zhang Han’s face changed slightly.","“These are Soul Devouring Rats.","“These things are not easy to deal with. If we hit them, I’m afraid they’ll chase after us all the way.”","His words made Yue Wuwei, who was about to attack, immediately withdraw his supernatural power.","Swoosh!","The spaceship kept breaking into the secondary space and barely escaped by the 10th time.","At first, no one knew what was going on.","Zhang Han told the story.","“The Soul Devouring Rat is one of the horrible community creatures. It has tens of millions of members and is very vengeful. Its speed is very fast, and it can cast soul injury supernatural power in groups. Moreover, all the flesh on its body is highly toxic, and there is not a single part of it that is edible.”","At first, everyone was very serious and thought that the Soul Devouring Rats were a very powerful opponent.","But as they listened, Zi Yan touched her forehead and said, “Why do I feel that the last sentence is the main point?”","“Haha, that’s right. Because it’s not edible, we’ll just escape.” Zhang Guangyou laughed.","Even Mengmeng smiled and said, “My dad is a real foodie.”","Seeing that everyone was suddenly relaxed, Zhang Han didn’t know what to say.","After thinking for a while, he added, “We can’t eat the Exotic Beasts at will. Well, some meat is not delicious...”","“That’s right,” Yue Wuwei said. “From the beginning to the present, we haven’t slaughtered any Exotic Beast randomly. It’s they who took the initiative to drive us out of the secondary space and pose a threat to us. That’s why we resisted. It’s not recommended to take the initiative to kill them. When we see them again, we’ll kill them. There’s no problem with that.”","“Why do you care about karma?” Zhang Han glanced at him.","“It’s not about karma.”","Yue Wuwei said, “In the Center Galaxy, I’m just afraid that those Exotic Beasts have a powerful backer.”","The appearance of the Immortal Master Hetu really gave Yue Wuwei a fright.","If it weren’t for the fact that he could summon the Heavenly Tribulation, he would’ve been in real danger.","Zhang Han had duplications, so he wouldn’t die easily.","If Yue Wuwei was hit, he would really die.","The king vessel was shuttling through the secondary space in the incomparably vast starry sky.","Occasionally, the crowd would come across a secret realm.","Occasionally, they would encounter a Starry Sky Beast.","Battles were everywhere.","After Zhao Feng did the statistics, during this trip to the Center Galaxy, apart from Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei, they fought 1,634 times.","Everyone’s realm had a qualitative leap.","“It turns out that it’s so easy to reach the Tribulation Stage.","“Hee hee, thank you, Master.”","Kong Ling’er reached the Tribulation Stage halfway.","When she was undergoing her tribulation, Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei hid themselves well.","They waited for the Heavenly Tribulation to descend before absorbing it.","The tribulation cloud was furious. “This is so not cool!","“Damn you!”","So it struck a dozen times perfunctorily.","Kong Ling’er had officially become a Tribulation Stage First Tier Dao Seeking Cultivator.","Kong Ling’er said to Zhang Han, “Do I get any gifts since I’ve reached the Tribulation Stage?”","“No.”","“Then make me an official disciple,” Kong Ling’er said.","Zhang Han hesitated for a moment.","In the end, he nodded and said, “Okay.”","To his surprise, Kong Ling’er was quite happy to merely stop being a nominal disciple.","She was also the first Tribulation Stage Dao Seeking Cultivator among Zhang Han’s disciples.","At the same time, Zhao Feng, Mu Xue, and Jiang Yanlan also began to cultivate quickly.","“We’re close to the Silver Dragon Galaxy.”","“This round trip took ten years.”","When everyone saw the Silver Dragon Galaxy, they felt as if they were in their hometown.","In the past ten years, Zhang Han had devoured a lot of tribulation lightning and secret realms.","He had officially reached the fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","It was said that one’s cultivation level was not easy to attain, but Yue Wuwei was envious of the way Zhang Han cultivated.","“He made it so easily.","“This is so unfair.”","Yue Wuwei often sighed with dissatisfaction.","When he reached the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage, his speed also slowed down.","In the past, he was so much stronger than Zhang Han.","Now, they were almost evenly matched.","The key was that Zhang Han had incredible combat capability so that Yue Wuwei didn’t even dare to say, “Shall we a competition?”","It would be terrible if he lost.","Nothing unexpected had happened in the Silver Dragon Galaxy in the past ten years.","The Heavenly Group and the Vast Heaven Sect had been developing rapidly in the Southern Mountain Area.","At the same time, the Starlight Divine Sect was the strongest.","Because of the suppression of Yue Wuwei, the major forces in the central region no longer asked about the Southern Mountain Area."]},{"number":1616,"title":"Chapter 1616 Smelling Perfume","paragraphs":["Chapter 1616 Smelling Perfume","“You’re finally back.”","Liu Qingfeng looked radiant. He had gained more than five kilograms. “The deployment of the Southern Mountain Area has been completed. We can’t go to the center for development for the time being. I’m bored here.”","“Hello, Uncle Liu.”","“Dad.”","People, including Liu Jiaran, Ah Hu, and Zhao Feng, greeted each other.","“You’ve been out for 10 years. Haven’t you given birth to any child yet?” Liu Qingfeng glanced at Liu Jiaran and said, “Don’t think that I can’t control you just because your cultivation level is higher than mine. You’ve been married for so many years, but you still don’t have a child. What are you thinking?”","Liu Jiaran gritted her teeth as she said, “Why did you scold me as soon as I came back?”","Ah Hu smiled as he said, “Well, Dad is right. We’ll try our best.”","He couldn’t afford to offend his father-in-law.","Xiao Ling smiled happily on the side.","Liu Jiaran said at that time, “Dad, are you so bored that you want us to have a baby? I think you can have one with my stepmother.”","Xiao Ling blushed.","Liu Qingfeng said grumpily, “How dare you say that? Even if we want to have a baby, we have to wait until your child is born.”","It seemed he did have an idea.","In this way, he could give a real home to Xiao Ling. Being a stepmother would not be good for her. She didn’t have any biological child yet.","In their family, the stepmother had a good relationship with the daughter.","“Let’s go back to Earth and rest for a few days. When Gu Linli wakes up, let’s go to the Ocean Astral Domain,” Zhang Han said.","Liu Qingfeng and the others also knew who Gu Linli was.","The Ancient Road of Starry Sky on Earth and the Southern Mountain Area were very ordinary. Liu Qingfeng and the others could travel back and forth between the two places at any time.","When they went to the ancient martial arts world, the crystal stone mine had been excavated.","There were a large number of elemental crystal stones. After ten years of recuperation, what they had consumed in the battle of the Southern Mountain Area had already been replenished. Now their treasures were even more.","Although they became richer, they had more people. The number of people grew more and more every day in the Vast Heaven Sect of the Southern Mountain Area.","Many of those people from back then had become the backbone.","“You’re finally back.”","Everyone was happy and eager to return home.","After going out for a long time, they really missed home.","Especially Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were in a hurry to see their friends.","They followed the ancient martial arts world back to the secular world.","Ah Hu took a deep breath. “Oh! The air smells the same.”","It was a special smell, mixed with some car exhaust gas and so on.","“Let’s go back to Mount New Moon.”","Swoosh!","The spaceship hid in the void and arrived at Mount New Moon in about ten minutes.","Ten years had passed. Those kids on Mount New Moon grew up.","“I, Chen Chuan, am back!”","Chen Chuan became a handsome young man in his early twenties.","His relationship with Nina also became ambiguous.","“Wow!”","“Brother Chen Chuan.”","“Sister Mengmeng is back.”","“Boss and the others are back.”","Suddenly, Mount New Moon became lively.","They arranged a huge banquet.","“I’ll show you something fun, Nina.”","Mengmeng and the others were drinking the juice that they hadn’t had for a long time.","Chen Chuan ran over, took Nina by the hand, and slipped away.","“Hey! Haven’t you seen us chatting?” Mengmeng said discontentedly.","“Ha...” Chen Chuan responded with a silly smile.","“Your sister is about to be taken away. Are you going to see aside?” Mengmeng looked at Felina again.","However, Felina stroked her beautiful hair and said nonchalantly, “Hasn’t she been taken away a long time ago?”","Mengmeng was speechless.","Yue Xiaonao rolled her eyes.","“I’ll call Li Muen. Let’s go and see her after dinner. Ten years passed. I don’t know how she’s doing.”","Mengmeng muttered, took out her mobile phone, and dialed a number.","Ring! Ring! Ring!","The other party answered the phone.","Li Muen, whose voice was excited and more mature than before, said, “Oh my god! Are you Mengmeng?”","“Yes.”","“Wow! You’re back! My God! You’re finally back. Where are you? I’m going to find you now,” Li Muen said excitedly.","“Calm down.”","Mengmeng smiled and asked, “Are you in Xiangjiang now?”","“No. I’ve settled down in Lin Hai with Li Xiaohao. ”","“Oh! Send me your address. We’ll go and find you at about seven or eight p.m.,” Mengmeng said.","“I’m at Villa 35, Bay No.1,” Li Muen immediately replied. “Why are you back so late? I’ve been waiting for you to come back and hold a wedding. I’ve waited for you for ten years.”","“What?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“Li Muen is so kind to us. She waited for us to come back before holding the wedding.”","“Mummy.”","Suddenly, she heard a child’s voice on the phone.","Mengmeng was stunned again. “Who is it?”","“My son.”","Li Muen said, “Li Xiaohao and I have a child. He is six years old. Come on, Little Jie! Call her Auntie.”","“Hello, Auntie.”","“Ha... Good boy.” Mengmeng gave a hollow laugh and said, “Well, Muen, see you tonight. Wait at home.”","“Should I arrange a dinner?” Li Muen asked.","“No. I’ll bring more fruits there,” Mengmeng said. “The fruits on Mount New Moon smell better than before.”","“Okay! I’ll wait for you,” Li Muen said happily.","Then they hung up the phone.","Li Muen was also excited.","Mengmeng was bored.","“Let’s go shopping in the afternoon. I haven’t bought clothes for ten years,” Mengmeng said.","“Let’s go. Aunt Zi and the others set off just now,” Yue Xiaonao said.","They tidied up and went out.","They strolled around the bustling city.","Each of them bought a cup of milk tea. They didn’t drink enough. Then they bought some ice cream.","When three beautiful women went shopping, they attracted a lot of attention.","Some handsome young men drove luxury cars and asked.","“Hey, beauty, may I know your name?”","“Can I add you to the chat software?”","Some of them were bold.","They were in the current harmonious era, so it was much more peaceful than before.","When these young men didn’t get the contact information, many of them sighed secretly but didn’t show it too exaggeratedly.","There were also some funny men who followed the beauties.","“Beauty, why are you so beautiful? You are such a natural beauty.","“Let’s go shopping together. I’m weak and helpless. I need a beauty to lead the way.”","These men could relieve their boredom.","After shopping for a while, the beauties returned to Mount New Moon at five p.m.","The banquet was being arranged.","The dinner party began on the lawn at 6 p.m.","It was rare for Mount New Moon to be so lively.","“I don’t know when Gu Linli will wake up.” Zhao Feng glanced at the villa on the side.","Gu Linli was lying on the bed like a person in a coma.","Fortunately, the person’s soul was slowly recovering without stopping.","It wasn’t too far from awakening.","The banquet was lively. Mengmeng and her group were the most eye-catching. The young men and women in their early twenties had gathered together. They were the most lively scene.","“Let’s go to pick some fruits.”","Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, Nina, Felina, and Chen Chuan went to pick the fruits in person.","The others didn’t know what Chen Chuan had gone to do with Nina.","When the two came back, Nina looked a little ruddy.","“Let’s go to Lin Hai City.”","After picking several baskets of fruits, they passed through the Space Portal and left.","They found Li Muen ‘s villa and pressed the doorbell in the luxurious residential quarter of No.1 Bay.","“Ah, Mengmeng!”","Mrs. Li opened the door. It was August now, and the child was on holiday, so she came to help take care of the child.","“Who is it? Is it Mengmeng and the others?”","Swoosh!","Li Muen quickly ran out from inside, looking as imposing as if she were attending a competition, running a hundred meters.","“You’re a mother now, but you don’t know how to be prudent,” Mrs. Li said grumpily.","But at this time, Li Muen didn’t care so much.","“Mengmeng, Xiaonao, Nina, and Felina!”","Li Muen rushed over.","He took a big step forward and hugged Mengmeng first.","She was as happy as a child.","“I missed you so much.” Li Muen looked very excited.","They hadn’t seen each other for ten years.","Li Muen was no longer immature. She had become much more mature. At this time, she was wearing a set of pink pajamas at home, and she was wearing the necklace Mengmeng had given her.","Because of this, Li Muen looked quite young. She was one of the most representative hot-tempered mothers in this era.","“Mummy.”","Li Jie was only six years old. He stood at the door and curiously looked outside.","“Oh! The little guy is quite handsome.”","Seeing this, Mengmeng said with a smile, “Come here. Let Auntie have a look.”","“Little Jie, come here,” Li Muen called out.","Only then did Li Jie run over and stand next to Li Muen. He wasn’t afraid at all. He raised his head to look at the beauties and greeted them. “Hello, ladies.”","“Call me Auntie.”","Mengmeng raised her hand and pinched Li Jie’s nose. “Why are you so cute?”","Li Jie chuckled and didn’t say anything.","“Come on! Auntie has prepared a gift for you.” Mengmeng directly took out a crystal stone wristband.","“Auntie Xiaonao also has a gift for you.” Yue Xiaonao followed closely behind.","“This is Aunt Nina’s gift for you.” Nina smiled as she presented the gift.","“It’s yours,” Felina said simply.","“Hurry up and thank Aunties,” Li Muen said.","“Thank you, Aunties.”","“Please come in.” Li Mu’s mother smiled and said, “Thank you for your fruits.”","“These are fruits from the mountain of my clan. They are organic, nutritious, and delicious. I’ve arranged for someone to send some food ingredients to you regularly,” Mengmeng said.","“You’re too courteous, Mengmeng.”","Li Muen smiled.","They entered the villa and sat on the sofa in the hall.","Li Jie fiddled with his toys a few times.","“Go and play the piano for Aunties,” Li Muen said.","Li Jie happily ran to the piano.","Li Muen said with a smile, “My son has been very smart. His father taught him to play the piano.”","“Where is Li Xiaohao?” Mengmeng asked.","“He is working.”","Li Muen felt a little awkward. She said, “He has been busy with work recently. He can’t come back until 10 o’clock every night.”","“Why is he so busy with work?” Yue Xiaonao curled her lips and said, “Has he been honest all these years? Has he been promiscuous in sex relations?”","“No.” Li Muen didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. “He loves me very much.”","Li Muen looked a little hesitant.","Mengmeng turned her head and looked at Li Muen’s mother. She was helping beside the piano. Mengmeng leaned over to Li Muen and whispered, “What happened? You look a little unnatural.”","“Really?” Li Muen blinked quickly, looked around, and finally said in a muffled voice, “I smelled perfume on Li Xiaohao’s clothes a few days ago.”","Mengmeng and the others were speechless.","“Is the nose so useful?”"]},{"number":1617,"title":"Chapter 1617 The Old Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 1617 The Old Master","“Didn’t you ask him about it?” Yue Xiaonao said, “I think Li Xiaohao is a good man. But maybe men like new girls and beauties.”","“My Daddy is different,” Mengmeng immediately retorted.","“That’s because Aunty Zi is the most beautiful,” Felina said.","“You’re good at speaking now,” Yue Xiaonao grinned. “Mengmeng, if Aunt Zi weren’t so beautiful, Uncle Zhang wouldn’t have pursued her.”","Mengmeng didn’t know what to say. After thinking for a while, she directly called her father.","“Dad, if Mummy weren’t beautiful back then...”","“I know what you mean as soon as you began to speak.” Zhang Han didn’t wait for her to finish. He laughed and said, “What you said is a hypothesis. There is no hypothesis in this world. But I am willing to analyze it for you. If your Mummy were not beautiful, I wouldn’t have been with her. Hey! Why do you pinch me? I’m telling the truth. It’s because you are too beautiful. Beep...”","Mengmeng slightly twitched the corners of her mouth.","“Okay.”","“Although my mother is beautiful, my dad can resist the temptation outside,” Mengmeng snorted and said.","“That’s true. There are so many beautiful women around. Uncle Zhang only favors Aunt Zi,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“And me.” Mengmeng rolled her eyes.","“Well. We’re talking about Muen now.” Nina covered her mouth and chuckled.","Chen Chuan listened with a smile and was quiet.","Although he was paid much attention, he was still noticed. Mengmeng said, “Go and play by yourself. What are you doing here?”","“Okay.”","Although Chen Chuan was in his twenties, he was in his prime and eager for competition.","When facing his Sister Mengmeng, he always listened to her.","He got up obediently and ran to the piano.","“You can also play the piano. Little guy, you’re amazing.” Chen Chuan said with a smile.","On the other side, Mengmeng and the others were discussing.","“Really? Could you smell the perfume?”","“It’s true, but I believe in him,” Li Muen said. “He has been a little strange recently.”","“Humph! Has he revealed his true nature as a scumbag?” Yue Xiaonao snorted.","“Let’s go and see him. It’s getting dark, but he hasn’t come back yet. If we catch him, I won’t spare him,” Mengmeng said.","After chatting for a while, they were about to go out.","“Let’s go to his company and see him.”","Li Muen said, “I’ll go upstairs and change my clothes first.”","She also wanted to go out for a walk with Mengmeng and the others. These years, if she had nothing to do, she would stay at home and take care of her son. No, she could finally go out and walk with them.","“Little Jie, what snacks do you want to eat? Mummy and Aunties will go to the supermarket,” Li Muen said.","“I want to eat French fries.”","Then Li Jie mentioned several kinds of snacks.","In the end, he might not eat any of them.","Several people went out happily.","A luxury car came out from the garage.","Chen Chuan was the driver. The car was heading for the Eastern District.","“Don’t use the navigation system. Use your brain, okay?” Mengmeng said to Chen Chuan.","Chen Chuan touched his forehead and suddenly understood what she meant. He could explore the way with his soul sense.","But he didn’t know Li Xiaohao.","He couldn’t find the person.","“Let’s go to his company,” Mengmeng said.","“Okay! Distinguished passengers, please fasten your seatbelts. This trip will take about half an hour,” Chen Chuan said with a smile.","He started the car and drove on the bustling street.","It was past seven p.m., and the street was not very crowded.","“When Li Xiaohao sees you, he’ll probably be shocked.” Li Muen said with a smile.","She was looking forward to seeing the confused expression of Li Xiaohao.","As soon as they arrived at the company, they saw a black luxury car turning right. Then they saw the license plate.","“Isn’t this Li Xiaohao’s car?”","Li Muen found it strange. “Why didn’t he tell me to go home after work?”","“Could it be that he really has a secret?”","Yue Xiaonao was taken aback.","She could sense with her soul sense that a beautiful woman in her thirties was sitting in the passenger seat of the car. Judging from the wrinkles at the corner of her eyes, she seemed to be two years older than Li Xiaohao.","Moreover, she was dressed like a domineering lady and looked pretty.","Did he cheat on Li Muen?","Even Mengmeng was a little dazed.","They had observed Li Xiaohao for a long time in the past. They thought he had a good character and was qualified to be Li Muen’s husband.","But now... Would all men change?","“I’ll give him a call.”","Of course, Li Muen didn’t know that someone else was sitting in the passenger seat of Li Xiaohao’s car.","“No.”","Yue Xiaonao grabbed her and didn’t know what to say.","She didn’t know what to do either. If Li Xiaohao and the woman had an intimate relationship, Li Muen would be heartbroken.","Yue Xiaonao glanced at Mengmeng.","However, Mengmeng was also dizzy. Her beautiful big eyes were unblinking, and no one knew what she was thinking.","Suddenly, the atmosphere was a little awkward.","Li Muen was stunned. She had a bad feeling.","Chen Chuan was not afraid of anything except for Mengmeng.","“Let me go!”","Chen Chuan got out of the car and walked over.","“Chen Chuan, where are you going?” Yue Xiaonao called out, but Chen Chuan didn’t stop.","Mengmeng wanted to say something but finally said nothing.","“Humph! I’ll let him come over and ask him!”","Felina snorted.","Boom!","Chen Chuan didn’t show any respect for Li Xiaohao at all. He kicked Li Xiaohao’s car in the back, leaving a deep pit.","It was as if the car had been hit by another car.","Maybe there would be headline news about it tomorrow.","A lot of people were watching the fun.","Chen Chuan went straight to the driver’s seat.","Li Xiaohao was also stunned.","He thought he had met a thug and didn’t dare to open the door at all.","Li Xiaohao didn’t open the door. Chen Chuan grabbed the door handle and pulled it hard. The door was broken.","“How dare you look for another woman behind your wife? Are you courting death?” Chen Chuan glared at him.","He was very fierce.","He was really strong, at least in the God Transformation Realm.","Li Xiaohao had never experienced the pressure of such a figure. His face became a little pale.","But in the eyes of Mengmeng and the others, he felt guilty.","“It’s over!","“Li Xiaohao, we thought so highly of you back then, but you turned out to be like this.”","“Who are you?” Li Xiaohao suppressed his nervousness and asked.","“Come out.”","Chen Chuan grabbed Li Xiaohao by the arm. When Li Xiaohao saw the car behind his car, he suddenly understood and relaxed a lot. However, he looked a little helpless.","The woman in the passenger seat opened the door and stood next to the car. She lit a thin white cigarette as if watching a show.","When Li Muen saw the woman, she suddenly felt depressed.","Li Xiaohao opened the front passenger door and got in.","“Huh?”","Li Xiaohao said in surprise, “Mengmeng and Xiaonao, you’re back. That’s great. Muen has been talking about you for so many years.”","“Ha... We encountered such a thing as soon as we came back. Young Master Li, aren’t you going to explain?” Mengmeng curled her lips.","Of course, she had to give Li Xiaohao a chance to explain. What if it was a misunderstanding?","“You’ve gone back late recently. Is it because of her?” Li Muen was even more confused. She was obviously angry, but she didn’t show it.","Perhaps she would throw a tantrum when the two of them were alone at night.","“Yes.”","Li Xiaohao admitted it in person and said with a wry smile, “I planned to tell you later because I’m not ready.”","Clatter!","Li Muen was scared out of her wits.","“He found another woman and planned to tell me later.”","“That woman is...”","Li Xiaohao knew he had to make it clear at this time, so he braced himself and said, “Actually, she is my sister. She is the child of my father and his ex-girlfriend. My father didn’t know at first. Later, he married my mother. Now, his ex-girlfriend is seriously ill. I have to clean up his mess. My father doesn’t dare to tell the family.”","“Huh?” Mengmeng was stunned.","Yue Xiaonao was taken aback.","Nina touched her forehead in confusion.","Felina cut to the chase. “Really?”","“Of course. They have done the paternity test,” Li Xiaohao said. “Recently, I’ve been to the hospital to visit the patient after work every day. My dad can’t come, so I’ve been there more often.”","Li Xiaohao turned to Li Muen and explained, “Honey, I didn’t mean to hide it from you. It’s a little embarrassing. I didn’t handle it well, so I didn’t tell you.”","“Am I an unreasonable person?” Li Muen glared at him and said, “If you tell me, I can’t stop you.”","Li Xiaohao narrowed his eyes. “Yes. You know my status in the family.”","Li Muen was speechless.","She was both angry and amused.","“How could you say those words?”","Li Muen rebuked, “Don’t talk nonsense. I’m so gentle. What nonsense are you talking about?”","Mengmeng was a little suspicious. “Muen, do you always bully Li Xiaohao?”","“Not always.” Li Muen quickly defended herself.","Yue Xiaonao said. “Well, what should we do? Li Xiaohao, go ahead and do your work.”","“Okay, I’ll talk to her later. Then I won’t go today. Let’s get together outside,” Li Xiaohao said with a smile.","“We can go back later,” Li Muen said. “Mom is at home.”","“That’s fine.”","Li Xiaohao got out of the car and looked at his car.","He saw the deep pit and the broken car door.","“The car door can’t be closed.”","Li Xiaohao said helplessly, “The car broke down. How about taking the car behind?”","“Forget it. I’ll go back by myself.”","The woman glanced at him indifferently.","“No. It’s getting dark. Let’s go take a look, sit down, and retreat,” Li Xiaohao said.","Was he afraid of being misunderstood?","The woman frowned slightly and finally nodded.","Li Xiaohao made a phone call. Three minutes later, a person got out of the company and drove his car away.","The two of them got into the car behind.","Li Xiaohao showed them the way.","It was quiet. The woman was a little surprised by Mengmeng and the others.","She didn’t expect there to be several beautiful women.","Chen Chuan was 1.75 meters tall. He was well-proportioned and a little thin, but he was powerful.","Soon, the car arrived at Lya Private Hospital.","“Are you all going up?” Li Xiaohao asked.","“You and Li Muen can go upstairs. We’ll go to the cafe across the street to have coffee.” Mengmeng pointed to the opposite side of the street.","“Okay.” Li Xiaohao smiled, “See you then.”","“Should we bring some gifts?” Li Muen whispered to Li Xiaohao.","“No need.”","Li Xiaohao shook his head.","They walked into the ward of the hospital.","There was not only the mother of the woman but also a middle-aged man.","The man was dressed plainly.","He was a middle school teacher, and he had long known about this. When he married her, the child had been born.","At first, she was unwilling to leave Li Xiaohao’s father, and she wanted to make a comeback. But later, her husband treated her very well, so she gave up that idea.","Now, she had a terminal illness and was about to pass away.","She also wanted Li Xiaohao’s father to make up for it. At the very least, her daughter and her husband would not have to worry about money after she died.","“I can’t stand this kind of thing.”","These people were chatting in the room. After observing them for a while, Yue Xiaonao felt that they were all good people. She said, “I want to save her. They’ll be happy as long as she’s alive.”","“How to save her?” Mengmeng asked.","“I’ll exchange the medicine.”","Yue Xiaonao hid and left quickly. Two minutes later, she came back.","When receiving drip infusion, the woman’s mother looked better and better, and her face became ruddy.","The doctor was shocked.","He quickly checked all the indicators.","“Eh? All kinds of indicators are improving.”","“This is a medical miracle.”"]},{"number":1618,"title":"Chapter 1618 Sweetness","paragraphs":["Chapter 1618 Sweetness","“It’s a miracle.”","Chen Chuan clapped his hands and said, “Sister Xiaonao, you’re amazing.”","“Don’t flatter me. It’s useless.” Yue Xiaonao snorted.","“They are back.”","Li Xiaohao and Li Muen came back.","Li Xiaohao looked overjoyed. “I didn’t expect her condition to improve so much in such a short time. This is a medical miracle. If this continues, she may recover.”","“A miracle?”","Li Muen turned her head, winked at Mengmeng, and asked with her eyes, “Did you do this?”","Mengmeng also quickly blinked a few times. “Yes.”","“You’re formidable.”","Li Muen grinned with an exaggerated expression.","“Ha...”","Mengmeng chuckled and said, “Let’s go have some street barbecue, okay?”","They wanted the atmosphere.","“I’ll be under too much pressure by having a street barbecue with you.” Li Xiaohao sighed softly. “Alas! If I’m surrounded by a group of beautiful women, it’s easy for me to get beaten up.”","“What’s there to be afraid of? I’m here.” Chen Chuan chuckled. “I’m a hatchet man for my sisters. Although Mengmeng and the others are beautiful, they are like thorny roses. They can prick people!”","Li Xiaohao remembered Chen Chuan’s combat capability. He broke the car with a single kick. He was very powerful.","“Let’s go. I know a good food stall.”","Li Xiaohao smiled and drove for half an hour to the food stall.","Its business was booming, and the atmosphere was noisy.","They sat together and attracted other people.","It was unknown how many people’s eyes were on them.","“Oh!”","As he ate, Li Xiaohao was suddenly stunned!","“Are you okay?” Li Muen looked at him in confusion.","“We can get married soon.” Li Xiaohao was a little excited. “Since Mengmeng and the others are back, can’t we get married?”","“Yes.” Li Muen nodded. “You finally remembered it. Humph! Why did you remember it so late?”","“I didn’t forget at first. Didn’t I explain that thing to you at first?” Li Xiaohao said.","“Our son can attend our wedding,” Li Muen said with a smile.","“So what?” Mengmeng immediately had the right to speak. “I also attended my parents’ wedding.”","“People like you are rare and special,” Li Muen said. “I didn’t expect my son and Mengmeng would have the same experience. Is it fun to attend parents’ weddings?”","“Yes.” Mengmeng thought of the scene at that time and said with a smile, “Anyway, it’s interesting.”","“Then let’s pick a good date.” Li Xiaohao had always been looking forward to the wedding.","Therefore, they began to call.","Li Muen called her father.","“Dad, I’m going to hold a wedding. Mengmeng and the others are back. Let’s choose a day.”","“Wait! I will find someone to calculate it.” Li Kai said.","After that, they hung up the phone.","Li Xiaohao didn’t say anything. He thought that his father-in-law would tell them after he decided.","Li Xiaohao felt confused as he said, “Why do I feel like I’m a live-in son-in-law? Shouldn’t the issue be solved by my family?”","“What era are we in? Why are you still so particular about these things? Now two sides discuss these things together.” Li Muen rolled her eyes.","About half an hour later, Li Kai called back.","“Let’s hold the wedding on July 28th, the auspicious day. Would you like it to be held in Shang Jing or Xiangjiang?”","With Li Kai’s temper in the past, he wants them to hold it in Xiangjiang. However, the Li Family in Shang Jing was also powerful. The two sides needed to negotiate.","Li Xiaohao’s parents also said Li Muen could handle everything, and Li Xiaohao and she could discuss it themselves.","Therefore, Li Kai began to ask them for their opinions and said, “You and Li Xiaohao decide whether to hold the wedding in Xiangjiang or Shang Jing.”","“Where are we holding the wedding?” Li Muen asked.","“How about holding it in Lin Hai?” Li Xiaohao asked.","He thought if they held the wedding in Shang Jing, he would feel sorry for his father-in-law. If they held it in Shang Jing, the Li Family would be unwilling. It would be better for them to hold it in Lin Hai City. Now that he had company here, no one could find fault with them.","“Let’s hold it in Lin Hai City on July 28th. I’ll book a hotel,” Li Muen said. “Mengmeng and the others can help me.”","“Have fun with your good friends.” Li Kai said with a smile, “Where’s my grandson?”","“We’re having a barbecue outside. He’s at home. Mom is watching him.”","“Okay.”","They chatted for a while and hung up the phone.","Li Xiaohao also began to inform his family.","“Dad, Muen and I are going to hold our wedding. Yes. Mengmeng and the others are back. We won’t go back to Shang Jing. We’ll hold the wedding in Lin Hai City on July 28th.”","There was still more than a week before the 28th.","The parents of both sides were ready to fly to Lin Hai City the next day to prepare for the wedding.","At the same time, invitations were sent out one by one.","The Li Family was quite influential in Shang Jing City. Although Li Xiaohao was not the patriarch of the family, he had the best career in the Li Family. He did not compete with his elder brother for the heir. Therefore, his family was one of the more peaceful families.","Li Kai had only one daughter, so his business would depend on the couple in the future.","Li Kai also had good connections in Xiangjiang.","The news spread out.","However, there came a problem.","“What? All the banquet halls are full? Can’t I get the largest one?”","In the H Hotel, Li Muen asked at the front desk.","“I’m sorry, Madam. All the banquet halls have been booked,” the receptionist replied.","“What should I do?” Li Muen said tentatively, “I can add some money for it.”","“Madam, it’s not about money. There’s no place for you.” The receptionist shook her head.","“It seems we have to go to another hotel.” Li Muen looked at Mengmeng hesitantly. Actually, it didn’t matter where she held the wedding. This hotel was not far from her home. It was convenient for her and Li Xiaohao to go here, and it was high-end.","“I’ll ask first. Don’t worry.” Mengmeng took out her mobile phone and looked at the receptionist. “What’s your boss’s name?”","The receptionist was stunned. “I don’t know. I’m a newcomer.”","Mengmeng didn’t say anything and made a phone call. “Little Qiang, who is the owner of the H Hotel? I want to book the best wedding hall. Help me contact the person.”","Five minutes later, the receptionist’s phone rang.","She picked up the phone and said, “Hello, Madam. Our largest and best wedding hall is ready for you.”","The manager ran over in a hurry, sweating.","“Hello, distinguished guests. Please go this way. I’ll show you around the luxurious hall. Our boss will be here in ten minutes.”","Sometimes, things that couldn’t be solved even with more money could be solved by a phone call to some people.","Mengmeng was respected.","Half an hour later, everything was arranged.","The hotel owner didn’t want to accept their money, but he was afraid that the other party would be dissatisfied. Therefore, he gave them many discounts.","Then Li Muen and Li Xiaohao were busy preparing for their wedding.","Soon, it was the night before the wedding.","Actually, it had already begun.","Li Muen and Li Xiaohao’s parents lived in their villa. Li Muen, Mengmeng, and the others were staying in the wedding suite of the H Hotel.","“Ha... With a few bridesmaids here, let’s see how they will get through tomorrow.”","“The best men of Li Xiaohao are also powerful.”","“Humph! They can’t even stop one of my fingers,” Mengmeng snorted.","It was the first time for them to experience the wedding of their good friends and be bridesmaids.","Mengmeng ‘s phone rang.","“Daddy?”","“Muen’s wedding will be held tomorrow. Your Mummy and I will go and have a look tomorrow.”","After hanging up the phone, Mengmeng turned around and said, “Muen, you don’t mind the wedding has more guests, do you?”","“What do you mean?” Li Muen was stunned.","“My Daddy and Mummy will come tomorrow,” Mengmeng said.","“Wow!”","Yue Xiaonao said, “I’m afraid that it will cause an uproar.”","“Uncle Zhang and Aunt Zi will come. That’s great.” Li Muen was a little hesitant. “But there won’t be too many people, will there?”","“It’s different.”","Chen Chuan stood next to them and said casually, “My dad and his people, Uncle Liu, and the Rong Clan will also come. Just wait and see. Many people will come uninvited tomorrow.”","The next day, Li Xiaohao went to pick up the bride.","Mengmeng and the others took a large number of red envelopes before letting them go.","Even so, each best man was miserable.","They had used the poker cards to pass flour, drank vinegar, squeezed plastic boards with their faces, and danced on finger pressure plates.","It was not easy for them to pick up the bride and went back to the villa. The parents gave the bride and the groom red envelopes, and they changed the way they addressed the other party’s parents, and so on.","When they arrived at the hotel and looked, they were shocked.","“Oh, my god.”","Li Xiaohao was a little confused. “So many people?”","There were many people.","“The patriarchs of the Rong Clan, the Mi Family, the Wang Family...”","Zhang Han and Zi Yan were sitting in the front.","On the side stage, there was a group of stars waiting for the next stage.","“Today is a good day.”","The emcee’s palms were sweaty.","He was stressed. He had seen many big shots below on TV before.","Just as he continued, someone came.","“The instructor of the National Security Agency, Ye Tianlang, arrives.”","An announcement came from the door, interrupting the emcee.","“What the hell is the instructor of the National Security Agency?”","“Hello, Instructor Ye.”","Unexpectedly, all the aristocratic families cupped their hands and greeted him.","Ye Tianlang walked to the front and said, “Congratulations to the bride and the groom. I wish you a long life together. This is a small gift as a token of respect.”","He put the gift on the exclusive table, where the gifts almost piled up.","Then he greeted Zhang Han and the others on the side.","“Hong Wushuang arrives.”","Hiss!","The person was Hong Wushuang, the new king of martial art in Lin Hai City!","“Nice to meet you, Chiefs.”","He bowed respectfully to Zhang Han and gave his blessings to the bride and the groom. He left them a valuable gift.","Then he could only sit in a corner on the side.","“Qian Tianji arrives!”","Qian Tianji was the No.1 in the martial art circle in the South!","There was another sensation.","He walked over quickly as if he were flying.","“Nice to meet you, Chief Zhang. Nice to see you, everyone. May the two of you have a baby soon and a happy life together for a hundred years.”","Everyone’s blessing words were similar.","He left behind a valuable gift and sat down aside.","The patriarch of the Li Family and the parents of Li Xiaohao were excited.","This proved that Li Xiaohao had risen to prominence!","There was no need for anything else. As long as the people of Mount New Moon sat there, it proved everything.","“Huh?”","The emcee was anxious. It was almost past the auspicious hour.","“Everyone is so enthusiastic. Ha...”","The emcee smiled and was interrupted again.","“The Sect Leader of the Radiant Sect arrives!”","Even a foreigner came.","In the next hour, many magnates arrived one after another.","They usually didn’t have the chance to see Zhang Han and the people from Mount New Moon. When they heard the news, they rushed over without stopping.","Of course, this was not the most important.","The emcee waited for a minute. When no one came, he opened his mouth and let everyone interact for three minutes.","“Our bridesmaid will send a sweet song as the opening of this wedding!”","Dressed in a red dress, Mengmeng went on the stage, holding a microphone.","She was too beautiful and blocked the bride’s charm, but the bride didn’t care.","“A sweet old song for my good friend.”","Her voice was light and pleasant.","It was intoxicating.","“Sweet honey, your smile is sweet, like a flower blooming in the spring breeze, in the spring breeze...”"]},{"number":1619,"title":"Chapter 1619 Finally Meeting","paragraphs":["Chapter 1619 Finally Meeting","“Good.”","Clatter!","After the song was finished, the audience burst into thunderous applause.","The emcee’s electronic voice was somewhat covered.","Fortunately, the applause lasted for more than ten seconds and stopped.","After all, they couldn’t steal the limelight from the new couple, so they sat there quietly.","All the dishes were served, but no one began to eat.","The people from Mount New Moon didn’t eat. Who would dare to eat and drink here?","Not to mention whether the people from Mount New Moon cared or not, even the hostile eyes of the others were horrible.","“There is a special child.","“He’s the son of Li Xiaohao and Li Muen. Actually, it’s a pure friendship.","“The reason why the wedding is held now is that the new couple were waiting for the return of their good friends. They are the bridesmaids. Friendship...”","He uttered many words.","Under everyone’s applause, Li Jie walked onto the stage slowly.","“I wish my parents a happy wedding.”","His lovely appearance made Mengmeng laugh happily under the stage.","She remembered the scene when she attended her parents’ wedding.","At that time, she was a little kid.","Now, she had grown up.","She was in her twenties, but she was spoiled like a little princess.","Mengmeng was always glad that she could be the daughter of Zhang Han and Zi Yan.","The grand wedding ended just like that.","Many important figures didn’t have seats and stood for more than two hours.","However, they had no complaints. They were even proud to be able to come here.","The people present had seen too many big shots today.","Many people were curious about Zhang Han and his group. Why did every big shot greet them as soon as they arrived?","After the wedding was over, a series of luxury cars and many limited edition cars were driven away from the crowded hotel parking lot.","More than half of the field was cleared.","Li Muen and Li Xiaohao were officially together.","Zhang Han, Zi Yan, and the others from Mount New Moon left by private plane.","There was another gathering for other martial art practitioners that day.","Of course, it had nothing to do with Mengmeng.","Mengmeng and the others were still busy in the villa and would go out for a drink in the evening.","“Mengmeng, I always thought Uncle Zhang was powerful, but I didn’t expect him to be so powerful. So many major forces from other countries came today,” Li Muen said to Mengmeng.","“My dad always keeps a low profile.” Mengmeng waved her hand.","Li Xiaohao was coaxing the child and pricked up his ears to listen.","It was too shocking.","Even now, his legs were still a little weak.","All the big shots had taken the initiative to shake hands with him enthusiastically.","It was like a dream.","“We have received many gifts.”","Mengmeng said, “Don’t take off the jewelry I gave to you even if you see more beautiful jewelry in them.”","“The jewelry you gave to me is the most beautiful. It’s as beautiful as you. I’ve been wearing it all the time,” Li Muen said with a smile.","“Do you want your son to learn martial arts?”","Yue Xiaonao suddenly said, “It’s good for his health, and he won’t be bullied in the future.”","“Learning martial arts?” Li Muen suddenly fell silent. She thought for a moment and said, “It’s a sudden question. I don’t know for the time being.”","“When you decide, tell us. If we are not here, you can go to find the Rong Clan. Anyway, you have settled down in Lin Hai, haven’t you?” Mengmeng said, “You don’t have to be so courteous to them. They are my grandma’s immediate relatives.”","“Thank you, Mengmeng.” Li Muen chuckled.","Moments later, Chen Yang and his girlfriend, Zheng Dan and Lv Zihan walked in from outside.","“Send them back and complete the task.”","Chen Yang smiled and said, “Bosses, if I had known it would be so grand, I would have held my wedding later. Is it too late to hold another wedding now?”","“It’s too late.”","Mengmeng rolled her eyes and said, “Sit down. Let’s talk for a while before we go out for dinner.”","“Today’s banquet smells so good,” Chen Yang said. “Why don’t we have dinner together tonight?”","“That guy is only focused on eating,” his wife said with a smile.","“Ha... You won’t be able to eat it even if you want to,” Chen Chuan said. “The ingredients for lunch were all delivered from Mount New Moon this afternoon. They’re from Sister Mengmeng.”","Chen Yang said, “The ingredients in Mengmeng’s home are so delicious. Oh, I’m so envious.” Chen Yang covered his forehead.","The atmosphere here was lively.","In the evening, everyone gathered together again.","Li Jie obediently followed his grandmother.","The group of people and Li Xiaohao’s friends, including the best men today, all gathered together.","If it were in the past, this group of coquettish groomsmen might rush up to pursue the beautiful women.","Now, they were well-behaved.","Of course, they also told jokes.","It was lively for two days.","“We’ll go back to Xiangjiang in a while.”","Mengmeng and the others were about to leave.","“Why did you go back so soon?” Li Muen asked reluctantly.","“A senior has woken up. We’ll go back and have a look,” Mengmeng said. “It won’t be long if we go out again. We’ll be back in about two years.”","“Are you going out again?”","Li Muen was a little hesitant.","Where on earth did they go?","She was curious, but she didn’t dare to ask. She was afraid that she would know some wonderful places and step into the martial arts world.","She was a little soft-hearted and didn’t dare to do that.","Moreover, she had a home now. With a child, her mentality was more stable.","Of course, Mengmeng and the others would not force her to do anything.","If she wanted to cultivate, they could bring her together. If she didn’t want to, it was nothing serious. It depended on her will.","After a while, they returned to Mount New Moon.","There were many people standing around the pavilion under the Thunder Yang Tree.","“Gu Linli is awake!”","“Let’s go and see her.”","As they approached, Zhang Han turned around and said with a smile, “You’re back.”","“Yes.” Mengmeng blinked her big eyes and looked at Gu Linli curiously.","She was wearing a black robe, and her body was a little stiff. She sat there, and her eyes were occasionally dull.","“I’m Gu Linli.” After a while, she spoke.","Zhang Han said, “Your current memory is fragmented. It’s normal for it to be intermittent.”","“What do you remember? Do you remember that you were taken away?” Zi Yan asked.","“I was taken away.” Gu Linli said in a daze, “Who took me away?”","“Black Spirit Wizard,” Lisa said.","“Black Spirit Wizard!”","Gu Linli suddenly became irritable. Her aura surged, and she fainted.","“She just regained consciousness and can’t stand the intense emotions.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment and said, “Take a course of medicinal pellets and check the time of consumption. Recently, we can set off to the Ocean Astral Domain to send her back for reunion.”","“Let’s do it as soon as possible. Let’s set off now,” Mengmeng said.","The little princess also wanted them to get together earlier.","After all, there wasn’t much time left.","But from another perspective, ordinary people could only live for about eighty years. The Sect Leader of the Illusory Sea Manor and Gu Linli could probably live for about forty more years. The time was not short.","“Then let’s go back and prepare. We’ll set off in an hour,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","Soon, their schedule was confirmed.","Many people were happy to follow Zhang Han out.","The group set off.","After crossing the Boundless Sea, the Silver Sea, the Clear Stream, and the Screen Waterfall, they arrived at the Sea Dragon Star Area.","The place was dominated by the Heavenly Group.","There were not many core members.","The construction of the Space Shooting Planets was very successful.","Everyone went to take a look at the Land of the Immortal Grave.","Sir’s mind did not appear.","The little white horse and the others lived happily here.","Azure Dragon King and the Demon Clan guarded the Space Shooting Planets nearby and were arrogant. After all, they were in the Star Province, and there were no powerful opponents for them. Azure Dragon King showed off its power and was fearless. It was well-known in the Star Area of the wilderness.","It was said that there was an evil dragon over there.","The Astral Domain of Vast Heaven was developing smoothly.","After the last war, the entire Astral Domain was recovering.","Zhang Han gave a lot of resources to the branch of the Vast Heaven Sect to enrich the treasure house.","Then, the group of people set off for the Ocean Astral Domain.","They passed by various Astral Domains on the way.","Zhang Han was not in a hurry to go.","They visited many recreational planets and scenic places.","Therefore, they didn’t go fast.","In three months, they had only finished half the way.","After seeing various scenery and many races, they had a good understanding of the Cultivation World.","Zhang Han was as knowledgeable and talented as ever and knew almost everything.","“I’m Gu Linli.","“I remember now.","“I’ve experienced too much since I was born. I don’t want to see him. Let me go.”","Gu Linli was very agitated.","“Why? He’s been looking for you for so many years.” Mengmeng was puzzled.","She was about to reach home but refused to go back.","“My body and my soul have been tarnished. How can I see him?”","That was the reason.","“Your body is a new one.” Lisa said, “Your previous body has been weak for a long time. It’s a revived body.”","But her words didn’t work.","Gu Linli cried, “Please let me go.”","“He will die.”","What Elder Bai said made Gu Linli fall into a daze.","“He has 30 or 40 years to live. He has fought in battles for many years and searched for you in the Silver Dragon Galaxy. His body has long been broken, and he could only live a few decades next. If you don’t go back, he will die with a grievance.”","Ning Chen said angrily, “If you leave, you’re too selfish. How many years has he been waiting for you? Do you want him to die in despair?”","Gu Linli’s face was slightly pale, and she was a little dumbfounded. “Will he die? Is this true? No!”","“How could we joke about this kind of thing?” Li Shan looked calm. “It’s true. And I don’t mind telling you that although you’ve recovered, you only have about 40 years to live. Both of you are the same. Do you still want to leave now? Can you bear to do that in the last stage of his life?”","Gu Linli cried.","After crying for half a minute, she said, “I’ll go back.”","“That’s right.”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and said, “Let’s go at full speed.”","The king vessel set off again.","After one month, they finally arrived at the Illusory Sea Manor.","They didn’t expect the Illusory Sea Manor, which had lost so many forces and was now developing well, was still one of the major forces in the Ocean Astral Domain.","“Little Li.”","In the hall of the Illusory Sea Manor of Sect Leader, tears streamed down the face of the Sect Leader of Illusory Sea Manor. He couldn’t believe his eyes."]},{"number":1620,"title":"Chapter 1620 Team Extermination","paragraphs":["Chapter 1620 Team Extermination","“Zhang Hanyang and his companions did it!”","The Sect Leader of the Illusory Sea Manor was pleasantly surprised.","He was crying tears of joy.","“You’re finally back. It’s a pity that I didn’t save you personally. I...”","“No.” Gu Linli raised her hand to cover the mouth of the Sect Leader of Illusory Sea Manor. She choked with sobs and spoke incoherently.","She didn’t know what to say at this time.","There was true love in the world.","Their love story warmed the other’s hearts.","“Let’s go out.” Zhang Han whispered.","They had to give the two of them some time. They had just met and had a lot to say.","Therefore, they turned around and walked out of the hall.","They sat down on the viewing platform in the west outside the main hall.","Ning Chen was courteous. In the name of an elder, he also ordered some servants to bring him a lot of juice and snacks.","Everyone was enjoying the scenery here.","“I have resolved the matter in my heart.”","Zhang Han said, “Now we can have a good rest and adjust our state of mind. Especially Xiaofeng and the others have children when you are free.”","Everyone was speechless.","They were a little stunned and fell into silence.","They had thought that Zhang Han asked them to work hard on their cultivation. After all, they were not far from the Tribulation Stage.","However, this guy let them have children.","“Instructor Liu and Jiang Yanlan are the same.”","Zhang Han said, “Lili and Liang Hao, Liang Mengqi and Zhao Feng, and Ah Hu and Liu Jiaran. Elder Meng, be quick to marry Lu Guo after you go back.”","He spoke as if he were a matchmaker.","“We’re not in a hurry,” Jiang Yanlan said.","“Why don’t you have a child earlier? You’ve been married for so many years, but you haven’t given birth to a child. Ha...” Mu Xue snorted.","Zhang Han said, “You are still single, don’t talk about them. When will you find a man to marry? I don’t want to see you affect my mood all day.”","“Master, are you bullying me?” Mu Xue snorted discontentedly.","“Kong Ling’er, why are you smirking?” Zhang Han shifted his target to Kong Ling’er and said, “I was also reminding you.”","“Ah? I’m not laughing. No,” Kong Ling’er hurriedly waved her hand.","“How could you talk about us like that? Master, do you want a son-in-law?” Mu Xue countered.","“Ha... I want to spar with you.”","Zhang Han’s face darkened.","Mu Xue immediately slipped away. When she ran in the distance, she was startled.","She thought that her master would make a move just now.","They chatted and laughed, sitting here for six hours.","Only then the Sect Leader of the Illusory Sea Manor and the woman walked out from the main hall.","“Thank you!","“You really did it, Zhang Hanyang. Thank you. From now on, you’re Li Te’s benefactor forever.”","The Sect Leader of Illusory Sea Manor was called Li Te. He had never mentioned it before. At this time, he cupped his hands and said with a smile.","“You’re welcome. This is what I promised you.” Zhang Han shook his head.","“Thank you.” Gu Linli said.","Li Te was very straightforward. He said, “I have nothing precious enough to repay you with. Little Li and I only have forty years left. In a very short period of time, we don’t have anywhere to go. We may find a beautiful place to build a small house and enjoy ourselves. I want to give the Illusory Sea Manor to you.”","“There’s no need.” Zhang Han laughed. “Forty years seem to be short. But from a certain point of view, it’s not short.”","“Senior.”","Mengmeng rolled her eyes and suddenly came up with an idea. “You can go to a secular world, which is the world of ordinary people. I think it’s very interesting. Their average life span is about 80 years. You are just middle-aged people there.”","“An ordinary world? Such a place is too difficult to find. But we can give it a try,” the Sect Leader of the Illusory Sea Manor said with a smile.","At this time, Zhao Feng and others looked at each other.","“You don’t need to look for it. There’s a secular world in our hometown,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Yes.” Mengmeng nodded.","The Sect Master of the Illusory Sea Manor hesitated for a moment and looked at Gu Linli.","At this moment, Gu Linli had a timid and lovable attitude.","He seemed to have made up his mind. “That’s better. We’ve stayed in the Ocean Astral Domain for too long. An ordinary world is indeed attractive to us. Thank you very much.”","Speaking of this, Li Te had decided to follow Zhang Hanyang to the so-called ordinary world.","The secular world also had its unique charm.","“Zhang Hanyang, Elder Yue, please come with me.”","After chatting for half an hour, Li Te took Gu Linli’s hand, got up, and said, “I’ll take you to a special place.”","“I’ll go too.”","Mengmeng wanted to follow him.","Zi Yan, Lisa, and Yue Xiaonao got up and followed them.","“I want to have a look too.”","Chen Chuan ran over.","Zhang Guangyou, Zhang Mu, Zhao Feng, and others were a little curious and wanted to have a look.","Li Te said, “I’ll take these people to go first. I can’t lead too many people there, or we won’t be able to see it.”","“Okay.”","The others sat down again.","Zhang Han and the others followed Li Te, the Sect Leader of the Illusory Sea Manor, into the main hall. In the back hall, there was a secret passage that led down the stone steps.","Unexpectedly, there was a long way to go.","After walking for ten minutes, they still couldn’t see the bottom.","“We’ll reach soon.”","On the dark road, there was light ahead.","When they walked over, they discovered that they were at the edge of a cliff. A beautiful gorge was in front of them.","Within the gorge, the leaves seemed to be colorful. There were red, white, purple, and blue colors, covering the leaves.","“They are all butterflies. There are more than ten thousand butterflies here.”","Li Te said, “Every year, there are several times that tens of thousands of butterflies dance together, and some Towering Sky Dew can be obtained every time. This is also a good eighth-tier spirit treasure. Except for this, you can see the scenery.","“They are sensitive to sound. When I open the Bounded Domain, everyone, don’t make a sound.","“They are also sensitive to the Dao Seeking Cultivator of the Human Clan. We are not many. We just need to hold our breath and cover up our auras.”","Then Li Te pressed a button next to him.","This was a gift he had specially prepared for Gu Linli. At this time, there were a few more people enjoying it.","“Wow!”","Mengmeng exclaimed and immediately raised her hand to cover her mouth.","She couldn’t make a sound.","After opening the Bounded Domain, Li Te took out a colorful ball and threw it out. Then it bloomed in the air.","Clatter!","More than 10,000 butterflies were dancing gracefully, constantly converging into various patterns.","The scene was extremely beautiful and wonderful. It was like a scene from a dream, intoxicating people.","There were many trees and leaves shining with fluorescent light below.","This was the Towering Sky Dew that Li Te had mentioned.","Zhang Han was clear about the function of this thing. It was rare among eighth-tier spirit treasures.","It was one of the main ingredients for refining several kinds of high-quality medicinal pellets.","The Skyscraping Flower Dew was not small.","This was Li Te’s gift to them.","It was clear that Li Te stood aloof from worldly affairs. He didn’t even care about cultivation and his sect.","He wanted to enjoy the scenery. Zhang Han and the others were enjoying the scenery, and they would obtain the treasure.","“It’s a good place.”","Zhang Han displayed the power with his Thunder Body, and the layer of lightning covered everyone.","These colorful butterflies were indeed very sensitive. Once they noticed the human beings and were frightened, they would immediately hide.","It would take about a few hours for all the butterflies to dance together.","They only moved a few times a year.","The Towering Sky Dew needed time to produce. Eventually, it would settle in the empty pool below.","“There will be a lot this time. It’s also because they haven’t woken up for so many years.”","Li Te said to Zhang Han through the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Thank you, Zhang Hanyang. If you need any help in the future, just tell me.”","“You’re too courteous.”","Zhang Han replied to the other party with the same technique.","The men chatted with the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","The women present were trapped in the scenery as if they had been hallucinating. They stared blankly at the scene in front of them.","Three hours later, it was over.","“It’s so beautiful.”","“Too beautiful.”","“It’s the first time I’ve seen such scenery.”","Exclamations rang out.","Li Te fetched five kilograms of Towering Sky Dew. It was quite much.","Thus, the crowd began to proceed onward.","When they arrived at the stone platform, something frightening happened.","“Where are they?”","Dozens of people were sitting here and chatting just now. But now they disappeared.","There was only juice and snacks left on the table.","This was not the reason why they were frightened and confused.","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei probed the area within a hundred kilometers with their divine senses, but they didn’t see anyone.","“Where did they go?”","“It is strange.”","Zi Yan blinked her eyes in confusion.","“Why did they suddenly leave? Are they kidding?” Lisa was stunned for two seconds and asked.","Li Te frowned, realizing something strange.","He found that a few of his men were hiding not far away, so he said, “Guards!”","“Sect Leader.”","“Sect Leader.”","“Great! The Sect Leader hasn’t been taken away.”","They were overjoyed.","Clatter!","“Were they caught by some people?”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes.","“The matter happened in such a short time. Could the other party be my enemy?”","“What happened?” Li Te’s face was dark.","“There were so many people present, and they are all my benefactors. How could they be caught in my own territory?”","“Bad news, Sect Leader.”","“Just now, a heroine came. She said all of them have good qualifications and took them away directly. They couldn’t even refuse.”","“What?”","Hearing these words, everyone was shocked.","“Were they accepted as disciples forcibly? Who the hell is the heroine?”","“Who on earth is it?”","Li Te said, “How could this be? Who took them away?”","“I’ve never seen that person before. All I know is that the woman is special. Her lips are particularly red. She appeared two hours ago and took them away.”","“First-level alarm!” Ritter immediately gave the order. “Send out the order immediately. All members of the Illusory Sea Manor, begin to search. Even if you have to dig one meter underground, you must find them for me!”","“Okay.”","“Don’t worry, Zhang Hanyang. There is a recording crystal stone in the main hall. We can see it,” Li Te said.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han frowned.","Logically speaking, Ning Chen and the others were very close to the second tier of the Tribulation Stage.","If the person was from the Ocean Astral Domain, they would not have been taken away so easily. At the very least, they could fight.","He was afraid that the other party was a freak who traveled in the starry sky and came from the Center Galaxy or even the Star Sea.","Zhang Han and the others looked worried.","They walked into the hall.","The Sect Leader of the Illusory Sea Manor, Li Te, waved his hand and cast a spell. He controlled the crystal stone above the hall and projected the scene outside.","There was a woman with a smile in the scene. She had red lips, wearing a long white dress. A sword hanging at her waist. She was in the air and looked at everyone with a smile.","What were they talking about?","Ning Chen and the others made a move, but they were defeated with a single slap.","She waved her right hand.","It swept through the crowd, and she flew away directly.","High up in the sky, a faint trace of red could be seen leaving very fast.","Clatter!","Zhang Han patted his forehead, took a deep breath, and felt quite distressed and bitter.","“Is this actually Immortal Master Lingxi?”"]},{"number":1621,"title":"Chapter 1621 Enjoy Taking in Disciples","paragraphs":["Chapter 1621 Enjoy Taking in Disciples","“What? An Immortal Master?”","The Sect Leader of Illusory Sea Manor turned pale with fright.","Immortal Masters were powerful Dao Seeking Cultivators at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage or above.","The entire Ocean Astral Domain would be no match for an Immortal Master.","“It’s a female Immortal Master?”","Mengmeng said angrily, “What right does she have to take our people by force? It’s so despicable. Dad, let’s go and save them.”","Yue Wuwei immediately took out his boat and said, “There’s no time to lose. Let’s go. Haha, I’d like to see how powerful Immortal Master Lingxi is. How dare she take our men away?”","Both Li Te and Gu Linli were shocked at his tone.","“Is he an Immortal Master as well?","“It must be so.”","“Let’s go. What are you waiting for?”","Yue Wuwei tugged at Zhang Han but found that he couldn’t pull him at all.","Zhang Han stood there in a daze.","Suddenly, he sighed again. “Immortal Master Lingxi is at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.”","Yue Wuwei was stunned.","He choked on his saliva and kept coughing.","“Just pretend that I didn’t say anything just now.” Yue Wuwei was frightened. “Oh my god, how could someone at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier appear here?”","“Tribulation... Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier?” Li Te was scared out of his wits.","Mengmeng was also stunned.","Zi Yan looked uneasy.","Lisa bit her lip.","Yue Xiaonao opened her mouth wide and asked, “Then how are we going to take the guys back?”","The Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier was the highest level of combat capability in the Cultivation World.","At present, Yue Wuwei was only at the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage. He didn’t know how long it would take him to reach the ninth tier. Although Zhang Han had a strong combat capability, he was definitely no match for a cultivator at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier. After all, relatively, he hadn’t cultivated for a long time.","“Alas!”","Zhang Han was also quite annoyed. He touched his forehead and lowered his head slightly.","“Are you sure it’s her?” Yue Wuwei still had some hope. “What if it’s someone else?”","“It’s really her.”","Zhang Han said, “Two waves of fire have appeared in the air. They are Golden-winged Rocs, the kings of the ancient demonic beasts. They were the mounts of Immortal Master Lingxi thousands of years ago.”","“What should we do?” Yue Wuwei was anxious. “She is an Immortal Master, so she gets to be unreasonable and take our men away?”","“We, we...” Zi Yan was more worried.","Mengmeng pursed her lips. For the first time, she felt helpless.","“It’s okay. Don’t cry.”","Seeing this, Zhang Han took a deep breath, suppressed the irritation in his heart, and said, “It may not be a bad thing.","“There are two sides to everything. They were taken away. Judging from the initial situation, it’s not a bad thing, really.”","Before others asked, Zhang Han directly explained, “I don’t know Immortal Master Lingxi, but I’ve seen her twice. I’ve long heard of her reputation. She has been at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier for 5,000 years. She is a very powerful experienced expert. Of course, she doesn’t look like an old woman. She looks quite young and has quite a personality.”","As he spoke, Zhang Han relaxed a lot.","Seeing that Mengmeng and Zi Yan were in a bad mood, he made a joke.","“She likes to take in disciples very much, especially male disciples. She is beautiful, has a lot of resources, and is rich and willful. She often gives her disciples spirit treasures. She likes to flirt with them and even likes to kiss them.”","“What?”","Mengmeng was completely in a daze.","Zi Yan narrowed her eyes and said angrily, “How can you still be in the mood to joke at a time like this?”","The atmosphere suddenly became less tense.","Zhang Han sighed softly.","“I was just joking, but what I meant was that Immortal Master Lingxi, an expert at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, is very famous. She likes to take in disciples and even has some abnormal persistence. She likes to take the talented ones in and cultivate them for hundreds of years. When they become Immortal Masters, she will send them out to fight and travel. She will also send her disciples to dangerous secret realms. Therefore, many of her disciples died after becoming Immortal Masters, but before becoming Immortal Masters, they basically don’t go out of the sect.","“Thus, she has captured our guys. For the time being, and even for several decades now, they will be safe.","“I’m not comforting myself. We’ll know the fame of Immortal Master Lingxi after we head to the Star Sea and ask around.”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “It is said that she could have passed the final Heavenly Tribulation a long time ago, but she didn’t take any action. Instead, she kept taking in disciples. Many of her disciples were Dao Seeking Cultivators at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier. Some of them even passed the final Heavenly Tribulation. However, they all died. She is good-tempered. As long as her disciples cultivate diligently, she will not be stingy with the cultivation resources. She hates to slack off. As for my dad and the others, they have been working very hard with their cultivation. But I don’t know why she took Liu Jiaran and the others away.”","At that time, Liang Mengqi, Liu Jiaran, and the others were all taken away.","It could be said that the team just now had been captured.","“Sect Leader Li Te.”","Zhang Han added, “Ask someone to keep an eye on the fiery red color in the void. It may be a Golden-winged Roc. Look at its direction. That thing is faster than Tiny Tot. We...”","“Oh my god, how could such a thing happen?” Yue Wuwei was in low spirits.","It was also the first time that he had felt completely powerless.","“This is the way the Cultivation World is.”","Zhang Han said softly, “Even in a small Star Area, there may be some Dao Seeking Cultivators at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.”","Back then, he had returned to the Sea Dragon Star Area several times to find his way home.","“Dad, is there nothing we can do now?” Mengmeng asked.","“I have a way.”","Zhang Han nodded and looked up at the sky.","“I don’t know if Immortal Master Lingxi still remembers me. If she does, maybe she’ll show me some respect and send our guys back. Let’s wait here for a few days. If it doesn’t work, we can only go back and prepare. We’ll also go to Star Sea. I know where Mount Lingyun is.”","“He used to be famous?”","Hearing what Zhang Han said, Li Te was stunned.","The others present were clearly aware of what he meant.","Han Yang Immortal attracted the divine thunder over the sky and caused a large-scale fluctuation in the Star Sea.","Almost many experts knew about this.","Now, after Zhang Han was reborn, everyone also discovered a rule.","Those who knew Zhang Han before knew Han Yang Immortal, but those who didn’t know him had their traces completely erased by the rules of the Great Domain, and they had never heard of him.","Zhang Han said softly, “Logically speaking, Immortal Master Lingxi should remember me and show me some respect. After all, she wasn’t a match for me at that time.”","However, in the Alternate Space of the Golden-winged Roc, Immortal Master Lingxi sat in the front seat, eating fruit leisurely.","In addition to Zhang Guangyou and more than 50 people, there were more than a dozen people present. They didn’t know each other and were sitting somewhere else.","Zhang Guangyou and the others gathered together.","“Not bad, not bad. There are actually so many with good aptitudes.”","Immortal Master Lingxi had a happy look on her face. She said with a smile, “You’re so cute. You even tried to resist. Hahaha, resistance is useless. I’m an expert at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.”","Poof!","This frightened many people.","“Oh my god, Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.” Ah Hu widened his eyes.","Kong Ling’er said, “Senior, please let us go. We already have a master.”","“It doesn’t matter. I’ll be your second master. I don’t mind,” Immortal Master Lingxi replied.","“But we don’t want to be apprenticed.”","“Yes, you do.” Immortal Master Lingxi said, “Even if you don’t want it now, you will in a few days.”","Kong Ling’er cursed inwardly, “How stubborn and inflexible she is! She has to split hairs!”","She had forgotten that she used to be like this as well.","“Our...”","Mu Xue reacted quickly and said, “Our master is Zhang Hanyang, Han Yang Immortal.”","Poof!","After hearing that, Immortal Master Lingxi was shocked and sprayed the fruit in her mouth on the ground. “What?”","“Our master is Han Yang Immortal. Do you know him, senior?” Mu Xue was suddenly scared, and her face was a little pale.","“Oh my god, Master was a Great Demon King back then. He killed tens of millions of people.","“He must have made countless enemies in the Star Sea.","“If everyone dies because of the news leaked by me, I will be condemned throughout the ages!”","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali, Zhang Mu, as well as Zhang Li, Liang Hao, Chen Changqing, and Zhou Fei were all present. They were the ones Zhang Han and Zi Yan cared about.","If something unexpected happened, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Mu Xue broke out in a cold sweat.","“Han Yang Immortal?”","Immortal Master Lingxi got up, walked up to Mu Xue, and glanced at the others. “Haha, don’t try to fool me. Let me tell you, I don’t like disciples who lie, understand? Let me ask you again, is your master Han Yang Immortal?”","“Well, I want to ask, do you have a grudge against Han Yang Immortal?” Mu Xue asked cautiously.","“No.”","“Phew...” Mu Xue relaxed and said, “Our master is indeed Han Yang Immortal.”","“But he beat me.” Immortal Master Lingxi breathed heavily in front of Mu Xue.","There was also a mischievous look on her face.","She had lived for thousands of years. Mu Xue and the other girls were no match for her.","She could tell that these people were telling the truth.","“Isn’t Han Yang Immortal dead? He was struck to death by the divine thunder over the sky when he was undergoing his tribulation.” Immortal Master Lingxi said, “Does he have any way to save his life? It’s impossible. He must be dead. The rules of the Great Domain have descended and erased people’s memories of him. This is the first time in the history of the divine thunder over the sky has been able to involve the whole Cultivation World. How can he be alive? Does he have the kind of Profound-grade treasure that can avoid the Law? He shouldn’t be alive...”","Immortal Master Lingxi was a carefree person.","Regardless of what others thought of her, she could do whatever she wanted.","She stood in front of Mu Xue, frowned slightly, and muttered to herself.","“Tell me about the situation of Han Yang Immortal. Is he the person I know?” Immortal Master Lingxi looked at the crowd.","“Yes.”","Zhao Feng got up, cupped his hands, and said, “Our master is Han Yang Immortal you mentioned. We only know that he was reborn with an incredible supreme treasure. He is on the planet where we were just now. If possible, please let us go.”","“Humph, it’s only been a few decades.”","Immortal Master Lingxi grunted. “He was reborn, so he’s definitely not as abnormal as he was in the past. If I encounter him, then I might have to kill him. Do you still want me to send you back?”","“No, no. It doesn’t matter. Master, I want to be your disciple.”","Zhao Feng immediately admitted defeat and cupped his hands, saying, “Master, you’ll be my second master. I acknowledge you as my master.”","He was also worried that the super expert at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier in front of him would slaughter his master when they went back.","He was there in body only, but his mind was with Zhang Han.","Zhao Feng only acknowledged Zhang Han in his heart. Now that he was in Immortal Master Lingxi’s territory, he had no choice but to lower himself and acknowledge her."]},{"number":1622,"title":"Chapter 1622 Giving out Spirit Treasures","paragraphs":["Chapter 1622 Giving out Spirit Treasures","Everyone saw what Zhao Feng was doing.","They all got up one after another.","No matter what, keeping themselves safe was more important.","“We all acknowledge you as our master.”","Only then did Immortal Master Lingxi start laughing. She raised her hands. Her appearance was only around the age of 20 or 30, yet she’d lived for almost 10,000 years. She clapped and said, “Not bad, not bad. You’re sensible. I like it, and I’ll reward you.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","She threw out more than 50 ninth-tier spirit treasures at once and said, “This is the gift for you, my disciples. When we go out for a walk and return to the sect, I will give you a big reward.”","She casually gave out some ninth-tier spirit treasures. It seemed that she was a generous Immortal Master.","“Although I may not be as generous as Han Yang Immortal, that guy also has a Taoist title, Immortal Master Money God. He’s fabulously wealthy. I don’t have as much money as him, but I won’t treat you shabbily, you know. Just stick to me obediently. Sooner or later, you will become outstanding,” said Immortal Master Lingxi.","“Yes, I’ll keep it in mind.” Zhao Feng responded immediately.","Ah Hu also said loudly, “I’ll keep it in mind.”","“I’ll keep it in mind!” Instructor Liu shouted.","Hearing these words, Chen Changqing, Zhang Guangyou, especially Zhou Fei, were a little relieved.","No one could predict such an accident, but Immortal Master Lingxi didn’t seem to be hostile.","At this time, a chubby boy sitting on the side, who was in his early twenties, raised his hand and said, “Master, we’ve also taken you as our master. We don’t have any gifts.”","His voice was weak. He didn’t seem to dare to speak.","“What gift do you want? You should be grateful that I didn’t ask you for gifts.” Immortal Master Lingxi rolled her eyes.","“Why, why?” the chubby boy asked in a low voice.","“Because it feels good to take them in as my disciples, but it didn’t go the same with you. Do you get it now, Chubby? If you can make me laugh, I’ll give you treasures too. Be a good boy.” Immortal Master Lingxi appeased him as if he were a child.","Zhao Feng and Xu Yong looked at each other and thought, “Isn’t she like a human trafficker?”","“Oh, I’m so happy. Hahaha, I actually poached some talents from Han Yang Immortal, hahaha.”","Immortal Master Lingxi sat back on the sofa and lay down casually. “It’s so nice. Let me ask you, is there anyone of you that matters much to Han Yang Immortal? Don’t lie to me, or I will be angry.”","Facing an expert at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, everyone present got nervous.","They wondered if they would die if they lied to her and got discovered.","“Forget it. I’d better tell the truth. It seems that she is neither resistant nor hostile to Han Yang Immortal.”","Zhang Mu took a step forward and said, “Hello, Master. I’m Zhang Hanyang’s grandpa.”","Poof!","Immortal Master Lingxi spat out another mouthful of fruit.","“I just ate it! Ahhh!”","Immortal Master Lingxi was quite dumbfounded. Her eyes widened, and she looked confused.","However, people should never judge a book by its cover.","She was smart.","“Really?” Immortal Master Lingxi asked.","“Yes,” Zhang Mu replied.","“What realm are you in?”","“I’m just an ordinary cultivator at the Last Stage of the Integration Realm,” Zhang Mu said shamefully.","“As Han Yang Immortal’s grandpa, you’re only in the Integration Realm. Oh my god, no one will believe it. Wow, I’ve never heard of such a thing before. Hahaha, I’ll reward you with three Defense Treasures.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Three ninth-tier defensive spirit treasures were thrown over.","“Thank you, Master.” Zhang Mu was straightforward.","Everyone knew that Immortal Master Lingxi liked to hear people call her Master, so they called her Master.","“Han Yang Immortal’s grandpa is my disciple, hahaha.” Immortal Master Lingxi clapped her hands, “Nice. Wonderful.”","She then asked, “What about the rest of you?”","Zhang Guangyou stood up and said, “Well, I’m Hanyang’s dad.”","“What realm are you in?”","“I’m at the Early Stage of the Integration Realm.”","“Your realm is so low?” Immortal Master Lingxi covered her mouth and laughed. “You’re rewarded.”","She gave out another three ninth-tier spirit treasures.","“What about the rest of you?” she asked.","“I’m Zhang Hanyang’s mother.” Rong Jiali stood up.","“Not bad, not bad. You’re rewarded. And the rest of you?”","Immortal Master Lingxi liked to listen to this kind of thing very much, and her eyes were full of special brilliance.","“I’m his aunt and her biological sister.”","“Nice. You’re rewarded. And the rest of you?”","“I’m his uncle-in-law, her husband.”","“Well, here’s a reward. What about the others?”","“I’m the younger sister of Han Yang Immortal.”","“Very well, there’s even a junior. Here’s your reward. Continue.”","“I’m his brother-in-law.” Liang Hao stepped out.","“You’re rewarded.”","“I’m his uncle-in-law.”","“I’m his cousin.”","“I’m...”","Immortal Master Lingxi gave whoever stepped out three kinds of ninth-tier spirit treasures.","In the end, when she subconsciously wanted to take out some more spirit treasures, her face froze.","“Holy crap!","“I have no more ninth-tier spirit treasures left?","“Have I given them all out?”","Immortal Master Lingxi was quite dumbfounded.","She was so focused on enjoying herself that she gave out all her spirit treasures.","“What a spendthrift I am!”","Immortal Master Lingxi touched her forehead, but she couldn’t look embarrassed.","“I travel light this time. I don’t have any ninth-tier spirit treasures left. I’ll give the rest of you some eighth-tier ones. People shouldn’t rely too much on spirit treasures. Well, go on...”","She just wanted to listen to their narrations anyway. She didn’t care about the treasures.","Finally, half of the many people present got her treasures.","Then, she began to ask.","“What realm is Han Yang Immortal in now?”","“Well...”","Zhang Guangyou looked around and saw that no one else was talking. After thinking that Immortal Master Lingxi didn’t like to hear lies, he braced himself and told the truth.","“He’s known to be at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","“What?”","Immortal Master Lingxi was instantly stunned. She blinked and said with slight confusion, “Are you telling the truth?”","“Of course, I am. I’m not lying,” Zhang Guangyou said seriously.","“So fast?” Immortal Master Lingxi said in disbelief, “How could it be so fast? He has only been killed by the divine thunder over the sky for a few decades, and he has already reached the third tier of the Tribulation Stage. His strength has recovered too fast, right? This can’t be right. He’s merely known to be at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage. Hahaha, you actually didn’t make it clear. Give me one spirit treasure back!”","As soon as Immortal Master Lingxi finished speaking, she got up, floated directly to Zhang Guangyou, and stretched out her right hand.","“Okay.”","Zhang Guangyou and the others were stunned for two seconds. Then, he took out a ninth-tier spirit treasure and returned it.","“I didn’t expect her to ask the gift she gave out back.”","“Humph, make it clear next time, or you’ll be punished.” Immortal Master Lingxi snorted. “He’s known to be at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage. That’s right. In fact, his combat capability should be much lower. After all, it’s the divine thunder over the sky that crushed him.”","As soon as she said those words, everyone had strange expressions on their faces.","“How should we answer this?”","“Do you want me to answer it?” Zhang Guangyou hesitated.","“Go ahead.” Immortal Master Lingxi waved her hand.","She did have quite a personality. She had big eyes, an oval face, and an enchanting appearance. Coupled with her unique temperament, she gave off the impression of a cute experienced expert, not a terrifying one.","“Ahem, ahem. Well, it’s about his combat capability. Not long ago, he fought against nine fifth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivators and almost killed one of them after exchanging a few moves with them,” Zhang Guangyou said slowly. “I’m telling the truth. It’s absolutely true. We all saw it with our own eyes.”","“That’s right. That’s right,” Mu Xue said. “My master’s combat capability has always been terrifying. He has always fought those at a higher level.”","“Huh?” Immortal Master Lingxi was dumbfounded.","She had thought that Zhang Han was known to be at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage with low combat capability, but it turned out that his combat capability was far beyond her expectations.","“How is this possible?","“It’s so strange.","“I feel like you’re lying to me.”","Immortal Master Lingxi rubbed her forehead and said, “Alas, forget it. I actually misunderstood you just now. Consider it a small mistake of mine. I’ll compensate you with a few treasures.”","In addition to the ninth-tier spirit treasure, she took out ten kinds of eighth-tier spirit treasures and gave them to Zhang Guangyou.","“Holy crap!”","Everyone was shocked.","They felt that they might earn a lot of spirit treasures by hanging out with Immortal Master Lingxi.","“Why is he even more terrifying than before?”","Immortal Master Lingxi was puzzled. “How does he cultivate?”","“We don’t know about his cultivation,” Zhang Guangyou said. “He taught us how to cultivate, but he didn’t say anything about his own cultivation.”","Everyone knew about the Thunder Body and the Great Demon Body, but they definitely wouldn’t tell Immortal Master Lingxi about them.","“Humph!”","Immortal Master Lingxi grunted lightly as she sat back down on her chair, and then she said lazily, “It’s useless to say anything more. In any case, he hasn’t reached the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, so it’s impossible for me to send all of you back. You’ll follow obediently by my side, and you’ll become outstanding sooner or later.”","“Yes, Master!”","Zhang Guangyou, Zhao Feng, Zhang Mu, and the others all cupped their hands.","How could they not lower themselves since they were in someone else’s territory?","They just needed to repeat no matter what Immortal Master Lingxi said no matter what.","Merely based on the stunningly powerful Golden-winged Roc, they knew that Immortal Master Lingxi was a formidable figure as well.","More than a dozen people sitting aside finally understood.","“It turns out that these people have a big shot backing them.","“No wonder Immortal Master Lingxi gave them so many spiritual treasures. She knows their backer!”","“Fortunately, I’ve visited the Ocean Astral Domain twice. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have taken in so many disciples.”","Immortal Master Lingxi said, “Let’s go to the Glaze Astral Domain for a walk, and then to the major Astral Domains, the Galaxy, and finally the Star Sea. The trip will take about a few decades. When we come across any secret realm, you can go out and fight. Let me see your strength, which is the most important thing. I will make specific cultivation plans for each of you. Be serious. If you cultivate well, you will be rewarded. If you don’t, you will get punished.”","As soon as she finished speaking, everyone looked at each other again.","It seemed that she didn’t ask them for anything else other than taking them in her disciples. At the very least, they were safe for the time being.","On the other side.","Together with the main force of the Illusory Sea Manor, Zhang Han and the other few people set off for the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven in a mighty manner.","“Alas, it’s the first time I’ve encountered such a helpless situation.”","Yue Wuwei was still a little sad.","“Why is there a ninth-tier Immortal Master all of a sudden?”","“Fortunately, it’s Immortal Master Lingxi.”","Zhang Han said, “She is very kind to her disciples, so we can rest assured for the time being. Although this way, we have to pick them up as soon as possible. They can stay with her for a short time. But if they all become Immortal Masters, there will be a crisis. Among the disciples of Immortal Master Lingxi, the difficulty of training will be increased by a hundred times, and the death rate will be much higher.”","“It will take a long time for them to become Immortal Masters.” Yue Wuwei laughed again. “Before that, you must have the strength to face Immortal Master Lingxi head-on.”","“I hope so.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “I hope I can gain something when I go back this time.”","What did he mean?","The Golden-armored Giant Beast, naturally.","After returning to Earth previously, Zhang Han felt that the aura of the Golden-armored Giant Beast had become more active. It was about to break out of its shell.","Nourishing in the Land of God’s Meteorite was indeed effective.","As long as the Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared, Zhang Han could go to the Land of the Immortal Grave and take away the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","With the five bodies, his realm would have a qualitative leap.","With these things, he would be much more confident in going to the Star Sea."]},{"number":1623,"title":"Chapter 1623 Born","paragraphs":["Chapter 1623 Born","Zhang Han and the others were back in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","Elder Li was still guarding the Vast Heaven Sect.","“Sect Leader!”","Elder Li was particularly cordial when he saw Mengmeng. “Sect Leader, you’re back.”","“Yes.” Mengmeng nodded. “We’ve brought back a lot of people, all of whom are disciples of the Illusory Sea Manor. They will join the Vast Heaven Sect from now on. Elder Li, make the arrangements. Then, Dad, you can tell them about it.”","Mengmeng still didn’t want to waste time. She pulled Zhang Han by the arm.","“Elder Li, the Vast Heaven Sect had better stick to the previous rules. Take safety as our priority. If you encounter an uncontrollable situation...”","“What happened?” Elder Li looked confused.","“We may have to go on a long trip later,” Zhang Han said. “This trip will take at least 30 to 50 years, or as long as 100 years.”","“Oh, that’s okay. It’s fine as long as you can come back.”","Elder Li looked at Mengmeng and said, “Sect Leader, I’m not worried about their safety, but you should be careful while traveling outside.”","“Got it. Thank you for your concern.” Mengmeng smiled sweetly.","After arranging everything, everyone set off on their journey.","They came to the Heavenly Dragon Star Province by taking several Space Shooting Planets.","There was no need to make any special arrangements here. Everything was in order.","Comparatively speaking, the Sea Dragon Star Area, the Heavenly Dragon Star Province, and the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven were half abandoned.","Because Mengmeng and Yue Wuwei were not here, no one else could come from Earth. If they set off from the Silver Dragon Galaxy to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, it might take them eight or ten years to get there.","This was something that couldn’t be solved.","However, with the two forces of Azure Dragon King and the Demon Clan, it wasn’t much of a problem.","Zhang Han held a meeting with the Demon Clan and Azure Dragon King.","He said that he was going out to the Star Sea. When he came back, if they performed well, he would take them to the Star Sea in the future.","“Oh, that’s the Star Sea. I’ve been wanting to go there for a long time.”","Azure Dragon King had his dreams.","As for the Demon Clan-","“Alas!”","Zhang Han sighed softly and said, “I didn’t expect to appear as the Demon Overlord. I didn’t expect that you would find out. Well, before I leave, I’ll show you the real Demon Overlord.”","Swoosh!","The Great Demon Body appeared, surrounded by demonic Qi.","The aura alone was enough to make several Demon Lords tremble and almost suffocate.","“Demon Overlord!”","“Demon Overlord is invincible!”","Their blood raced. They knew very well that the Demon Overlord could kill them with a single thought since he could suppress them by several levels.","After showing off, Zhang Han left.","It was to prevent them from changing their minds over time.","This was a deterrent. Not to mention loyalty, they could leave if they wanted, but they could not break the rules of the Sea Dragon Star Area and the Heavenly Dragon Star Province.","Finally, Mengmeng opened the passage.","Everyone took another look at the Screen Waterfall, which had a unique charm.","The scenery along the way, however, left both Li Te, the Sect Master of the Illusory Sea Manor, and Gu Linli dumbfounded.","“How could there be such a place?","“This is a fairyland!”","Chen Chuan couldn’t help asking, “Uncle Zhang, are we leaving after we instructed the guys?”","In fact, he was a little anxious. After all, his parents had been taken away.","“Yes.”","Zhang Han nodded and said, “We’ll set off after everything is arranged. Boy, this trip will be the greatest training for you, Mengmeng, and Xiaonao. We won’t pick our guys up very soon because I’m no match for Immortal Master Lingxi.”","“Got it.” Chen Chuan was a little depressed.","“Of course, it will be better if you can be powerful enough to face the strength of Immortal Master Lingxi head-on and take them back in person.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “Cultivate hard, boy.”","“Okay,” Chen Chuan replied.","After arriving in the secular world, everyone returned to Mount New Moon.","“Inform everyone to go back to Mount New Moon for a meeting in a day,” Zhang Han said.","Instantly, everyone in the ancient martial arts world, the Kunlun Immortal World, and the Ancient Mine returned.","“Dad, I’m going to say goodbye to Muen and the others.”","Mengmeng pursed her lips slightly, feeling a little reluctant.","This trip was different. Because it would take too long, many people might have died of old age when they came back.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao left with Chen Chuan.","Zi Yan was also a little hesitant. “Aunty Tang and some of her friends are not young. I...”","“What should I do?","“Should I say goodbye to them directly and tell them that this is the last time we meet?”","“Hahaha, sometimes, you are so cute.” Zhang Han laughed and said, “Just like the saying, your family and friends rise with you when you succeed. Just tell your good friend that you are a cultivator, and then ask them if they want to cultivate or live for hundreds of years. They will not refuse.”","“You’re right.”","Zi Yan blinked and said, “Then I’ll go say goodbye too.”","As she spoke, she and Lisa went out.","“Let’s go to the Land of God’s Meteorite.”","Zhang Han said, “I feel that the Golden-armored Giant Beast should be born soon. I’ll ask Sir’s mind about it.”","Therefore, Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei went to the Land of God’s Meteorite.","According to Mengmeng’s search last time, there were also nodes leading to the Land of God’s Meteorite in space. Yue Wuwei could even feel them.","He and Zhang Han followed the Space Nodes to their destination.","There were still 9,999 steps above.","They couldn’t see or go up the world behind the steps.","“Sir, we’re here,” Yue Wuwei said loudly. “We have something important to tell you.”","“What’s the matter?”","The light cluster slowly condensed, but it was relatively thin. This was not the main mind, but a trace of the will of the Seventh Mind.","“We’re going to the Star Sea.”","Zhang Han said bluntly, “This trip will take dozens of years or even nearly a century. With our strength, we can’t gain a foothold in the Star Sea. I can feel that the Golden-armored Giant Beast is about to be born, so I came to ask about it.”","“Come here in three days,” said Sir’s mind.","With a wave of his hand, Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei left the Land of God’s Meteorite. The Space Nodes also disappeared.","“It’s done.”","Yue Wuwei smiled and said, “Three days later, the Golden-armored Giant Beast will be born. I’d like to see what kind of monster can be so powerful.”","Zhang Han was speechless.","“I don’t know if it’s a monster or not, but it’s my duplication.","“The Great Devil Body!”","On the other side.","Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Chen Chuan came to Li Muen’s home.","Li Muen said in surprise, “You’re back!","“That’s great. It’s only been a little over a year this time.”","For Mengmeng and the others, it was just a trip. For Li Muen, it had been more than a year since the guys went out and came back.","Mengmeng sat down and asked, “Where’s Li Jie?”","“He just finished school. Li Xiaohao went to pick him up,” Li Muen said.","“Well, I have something to tell you. You need to be prepared first.” Yue Xiaonao got straight to the point.","Clatter!","Li Muen felt as if her heart had skipped a beat. She was a little shocked.","“What, what’s the matter?” she asked.","“It’s not a bad thing.”","Mengmeng chuckled and said, “We’re going to lay our cards on the table. We’re cultivators.”","“What does that mean?” Li Muen was slightly stunned.","“We can cultivate into an immortal. We have supernatural powers that allow us to fly to the sky and hide in the ground,” Yue Xiaonao explained.","“What... Really? Are you kidding?” Li Muen laughed.","Swoosh!","Mengmeng waved her hand.","With the Shadow Displacement Transposition, everyone left the villa and went straight into the sky.","“Am I lying now?”","“We’re FLYING?” Li Muen was completely stunned.","Twenty minutes later, they were on the sofa of the villa.","“The last few times we went out, we went to other planets, such as the Star Area, the Star Province, and the Astral Domain. The universe is very big, and Earth is very small. This time, we are going to the Star Sea, which is a very far place. It may take decades to go back and forth.","“That is to say, if we are fast, it will take thirty to fifty years, if we are slow, eighty to a hundred years is possible.","“When we come back, you will be old, as well as Li Xiao Hao and Li Jie.","“As good sisters, we just came to ask you if you want to cultivate. If you do, you can call the people on Mount New Moon. We can’t teach you and will leave in two days.”","It would be another parting. Although Li Muen felt reluctant, she was experienced and could deal with it.","“Cultivation. Can I ask Li Xiaohao about it?”","“Sure,” Mengmeng said casually.","“Shall we have dinner together tonight?” Li Muen asked.","“Of course.”","At dinner time, in the private room of the restaurant.","When Li Xiaohao got the news, he didn’t know what to say.","For a moment, he questioned everything he had learned before.","Finally, he smiled and said, “We’ll consider taking cultivation later. Anyway, Mount New Moon will be always there. It’s okay. We’ll definitely wait for you to come back and get together again!”","“I won’t tell Chen Yang, Zheng Dan, and the others about it. You’ll inform them later.”","Mengmeng didn’t like the atmosphere of separation.","After seeing Li Muen, she was ready to go home to rest.","“See you later.”","“We will wait for you to come back!”","Li Muen and Li Xiaohao waved their hands and looked ahead, motionless for a long time.","The next day, the people of Mount New Moon returned.","“I have something to inform you.","“We’re going out. It will take eighty to a hundred years.","“Uncle Liu...”","The guys made some arrangements.","Yue Wuwei said, “The most important thing is the Ancient Road of Starry Sky in the ancient martial arts world. I put a Profound-grade treasure at the entrance of the ancient martial arts world and the secular world. The passage can be shut down.","“Of course, don’t do it unless there’s no other choice. Once there’s a crisis, you can blow up the entrance.”","“...”","“They’ll be leaving for so many years?”","After staying together for two days, everyone accepted this matter.","On the third day.","There were seven people in total, including Zhang Han, Yue Wuwei, Chen Chuan, Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, Lisa, as well as Zi Yan.","They took Dahei and Little Hei with them and came to the Land of God’s Meteorite.","The moment they stepped into the place.","Buzz!","Zhang Han was suddenly covered with a layer of golden light.","It was the resonance of life, the connection of souls.","Zhang Han could feel that the other body seemed to be bathing in the sun.","Clang! Clang! Clang!","But there was an obstacle ahead.","It was getting out.","It was exerting force.","After a few noises-","Crack! The Golden-armored Giant Beast broke out of its shell and appeared in the world.","It tried its best to open its eyes, but all it could see was plain.","An incomparably huge body was quietly lying on the plain.","“You’ll get a headache if you keep staring at it. You can leave now.”","Sir’s voice appeared in Zhang Han’s mind.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast flew out of the Land of God’s Meteorite.","Swoosh! Thump!","It crashed directly in front of Zhang Han.","It had a big head and a single horn on its head. Its eyes were big, bright, and energetic. It had the composure of Zhang Han.","Its four limbs were thick and short, and its little tail was wagging back and forth, looking very cute.","“Awoooooooo.”","Zhang Han was controlling it to open its mouth, but it was crying in a childish voice.","“Wow, it’s so cute,” Mengmeng said with a smile. “Dad, this is your duplication. It’s so cute.”","“Awoooooooo. Master, am I not cute?” Dahei put its arms around Mengmeng’s shank.","Mengmeng immediately said, “You’re cute too. Little Hei is cute, and so is Tiny Tot.”","“These three guys are my sweethearts.”"]},{"number":1624,"title":"Chapter 1624 The Star Sea","paragraphs":["Chapter 1624 The Star Sea","Zi Yan said with a smile, “This thing is so adorable.”","As she spoke, she walked over and stroked the head of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“It’s only half a meter high. How big can it grow in the future?”","“It should be very big.”","Zhang Han smiled faintly. He was still feeling the martial arts heritage of the Golden-armored Giant Beast. It could learn and cultivate many occult arts and supernatural powers.","“After it matures, it’ll be like half a planet.”","“That big?”","Zi Yan was stunned.","“Half a planet. Just how big is that? It will be boundless as far as the eye can see.”","However, compared to the vast starry sky, it was still very small.","“The Golden-armored Giant Beast is in good shape.”","Zhang Han chuckled.","He stretched out his right hand, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast turned into a stream of light and entered his skin.","Buzz!","With the arrival of the Golden-armored Giant Beast, the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Thunder Body, and the Great Demon Body resonated and changed in succession.","Wisps of energy were circulating with each other.","With the guidance of Zhang Han’s main soul, they finally reached a balance.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Like a roaring gale, Zhang Han’s aura rose rapidly.","He had officially reached the fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","“Phew...”","Zhang Han exhaled a long breath and opened his eyes.","The whole process of promotion only took a few minutes.","But in the next year and a half, his strength would continue to improve and stabilize.","“Everything has been arranged. Let’s go.”","Zhang Han said softly, “I don’t know when I’ll come back next time.”","“Are you going to the Star Sea?”","The cluster of light appeared again. Sir’s mind condensed and said a message.","“The Boundless Sea and the Northernmost Sea each have four Ancient Roads of Starry Sky leading to the Star Sea. There is no crisis there. If you want to go, you can take that route.”","“What?!”","Zhang Han was slightly taken aback.","He didn’t expect that he could go straight to the Star Sea from here.","He couldn’t help but ask, “What kind of place is the Heavenly Land?”","“You’ll know in the future.”","Sir’s mind didn’t seem to want to talk much. He went straight to the point and said, “You once had a Space Portal. You left Space Nodes on each planet. Within a certain distance, you can shuttle back and forth. The Space Portal’s function is acceptable, but it can only be used by one person. It’s not very convenient. So I destroyed the Profound-grade treasure, the Space Portal, and integrated some Ancient Roads of Starry Sky with it.”","Zhang Han said, “What...”","“Isn’t this a bit too terrifying?”","Although the Space Portal was powerful, it was far from crossing the long distance to reach the Star Sea.","“That is to say, we can come back at any time from the Star Sea, can’t we?” Mengmeng asked, her eyes shining.","“No.”","Sir’s mind said, “Every time you pass the Ancient Road of Starry Sky that leads to the Star Sea, it will take you ten years to trigger it again. You can feel the Space Nodes, and there are coordinates leading to the Star Sea. Feel them yourselves. Don’t come here until you reach the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","After that, the light shadow of Sir’s mind slowly dissipated.","No one knew that these Ancient Roads of Starry Sky were opened up by the Seventh Mind just now.","The power of each mind was limited, and it would dissipate when it reached a critical point.","Obviously, the Seventh Mind stayed in the Land of God’s Meteorite for its last awakening, which was its mission and the meaning of its existence.","Clatter!","Everyone appeared high up in the sky.","Mengmeng immediately took out the Heavenly Pearl and sensed it carefully. She found that there were a total of eight spots of starlight in the Boundless Sea and the Northernmost Sea. Those were the Ancient Roads of Starry Sky.","Eight words were shown, including “Qian”, “Zhen”, and “Kan”.","There were words of the Eight Diagrams on all eight light spots.","“This is truly amazing.”","Zhang Han took a deep breath and looked a little shocked. “There are eight passages in the eight outer rings of the Star Sea. It’s very convenient for us to go anywhere we want.”","“Outer rings?”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard.","He had never heard of this before.","Seeing this, Zhang Han explained, “The Star Sea is the highest-end place in the center of the Cultivation World, where Tribulation Stage experts can be seen everywhere, but it also refers to a vast area.","“It is surrounded by Barren Star Areas where ancient demonic beasts run amok. The surrounding edges form the shape of a ring.","“The Star Sea is divided into three areas, namely, the outer ring, the inner ring, and the Nine Mountains Region. The outer ring is vast. I estimate that it is as wide as ten times the distance between the Sea Dragon Star Area and the Silver Dragon Galaxy.”","Upon hearing those words, everyone was shocked.","“That huge?”","Yue Wuwei asked, “Will it take us hundreds of years to cross the outer ring?”","“There are Space Shooting Planets all over the Star Sea, so it’s convenient for us to travel. But because it’s too large, it really takes some time,” Zhang Han said. “The entire Star Sea is the territory of the Human Clan with countless small clans competing for glory. This is serious.”","“It’s too big.”","Mengmeng made a face.","Yue Xiaonao said, “Whatever. Anyway, it’s all the same. It’s made of planets with delicious food.”","“Well, Uncle Zhang, aren’t we going to save my parents and the others?” Chen Chuan asked in a low voice.","“This is also a problem.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment and said, “We have two choices. The first option is that we can go straight to the Star Sea. I know where Immortal Master Lingxi is. We can wait for her to come back. During this period, I can cultivate in the Star Sea and reach the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage as soon as possible so that I can be powerful enough to negotiate with her. There are many secret realms in the Star Sea. The second option is that we can chase after Immortal Master Lingxi. Maybe we can catch up with her when they are training.”","“Can we talk to her if we catch up with her?” Yue Wuwei asked.","Zi Yan was also concerned about this problem, as well as Mengmeng and the others. They all stared at Zhang Han without blinking.","“Well, we’ll try. At worst, I’ll get beaten up by her. She will hand our guys over.” Zhang Han hesitated.","“Huh?” Mengmeng was stunned. “Why would she beat you up?”","“Because I’ve beaten her several times before.” Zhang Han spread out his hands.","“Alright.” Mengmeng pursed her lips slightly, showing a helpless look.","“Do you have any friends in the Star Sea? Like Ning Chen and the others.” Yue Wuwei suddenly said, “If you have ninth-tier friends, you can talk to Immortal Master Lingxi.”","When he asked this question, Zhang Han felt quite helpless.","“Whoever remembers me is basically my enemy. There are only a few people like Immortal Master Lingxi. And more than a thousand years have passed. I don’t know how that group of people I used to know then is doing now.”","“Then we’d better be careful.” Zi Yan said, “Wherever we go, it’s up to you.”","“Where will we go?”","Yue Wuwei was also in a dilemma. He said, “If we go after them now, we may not be able to catch up with them. Even if we do, it won’t work. I suggest that we go to the Star Sea. The most important thing is to improve our strength. Without strength, we can’t negotiate at all.”","Zhang Han was silent for a few seconds.","He nodded and said, “Yes, let’s go to the Star Sea and improve our strength first. After that, we’ll wait for Immortal Master Lingxi to return in a few tens of years, and then we’ll go talk to her. Before we leave, we’ll head to the Land of the Immortal Grave first.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng took the initiative to set up a Space Portal. Everyone came to the Ancient Mine and came out of the Boundless Sea.","They arrived at the Land of the Immortal Grave near the Heavenly Dragon Star Province.","“Sir, Sir, it’s Yue. I’m here to see you,” Yue Wuwei shouted.","“You’re going to the Star Sea, aren’t you?” A cluster of light appeared. It was Sir’s mind.","“That’s right. We’re going to the Star Sea,” Yue Wuwei said. “Sir, you’re amazing. You know everything.”","“I can feel the Ancient Road of Starry Sky.” Sir was very straightforward. “Come here!”","Swoosh!","He took Zhang Han away.","They arrived in front of the Immortal Body.","“I’ve accelerated the development of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body with all my minds, but I still haven’t condensed it yet. That depends on you. Put the Immortal Body inside the Golden-armored Giant Beast to nourish it. In about ten years, it will come into being.”","“Thank you.” Zhang Han cupped his hands.","“You also need to speed up your cultivation. You have to gain something on this trip. You need to go all out to win, but don’t be in a hurry to get what you want.” The voice of Sir’s mind was slow and old as if it had entered the twilight. “You have a smooth journey, but you can’t avoid the calamity in the future. When your strength is higher, it can come sooner. But that calamity may not cause a big disaster. Don’t die on your way to it.”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “I’ll keep it in mind. Thank you for your training all the way, Sir. If I see Eldest Mind in the future, I will ask about the situation and take him as my master.”","Sir’s mind had already said that he wanted to take Zhang Han as his disciple and asked nothing in return. Originally, Zhang Han wanted to take the real Sir as his master, but now he was also okay with being the Eldest Mind’s disciple.","He left.","Zhang Han put the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, which was surrounded by a faint mist, into the body space of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast also had an Alternate Space.","The Land of the Immortal Grave still existed. Merely, as Sir’s mind dissipated, the power of heaven and earth also began to slowly dissipate.","In a few years, this place might become an ordinary continent in the Cultivation World.","Zhang Han and the others returned to the Ancient Mine.","“Which Cosmos Node are we going to?” Mengmeng asked.","“The Qian Node.”","Zhang Han said, “The Eight Diagrams Points are set according to the direction of the Nine Mountains Region. The Qian Node is the closest to Ninth Mountain. We will go there.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng waved her hand and conjured up a Space Portal.","The crowd stepped forward.","They went straight to the Northernmost Sea. On an island, there was sparkling starlight. They opened the Ancient Road of Starry Sky and entered it.","After exiting, they appeared in the cosmos.","“It’s over?”","Mengmeng was still in a daze. “We’re in the Star Sea now?”","She looked up and down, and everywhere she looked, there was starlight.","All kinds of nebula patterns and colors could be seen.","“It’s like dreaming. A few minutes ago, we were still on Earth.” Yue Xiaonao wiped her eyes.","“The night sky over the Star Sea is so beautiful.” Lisa sighed with emotion.","Yue Wuwei said directly, “That is to say, the more beautiful something is, the more dangerous it will be.”","Mengmeng asked right away, “So, Auntie Lisa, Mummy, I, and Xiaonao are also in danger?”","Yue Wuwei burst into laughter.","“Yeah. Explain what you mean.” Lisa looked a little sullen.","She knew that he was joking to adjust the atmosphere here.","Lisa was very reasonable.","“In a sense, it’s indeed very dangerous,” Yue Wuwei said seriously. “Think about it. Wouldn’t you be in danger when some unknown men get close to you? It’s not the first time that this kind of thing has happened.”","“How can you make such an explanation?” Lisa laughed.","“I don’t dare to offend you.” Yue Wuwei shook his head repeatedly.","“What are we going to do now?” Mengmeng asked.","“Let’s mix in the outer ring first,” Zhang Han said. “We’ll calm down, eat and drink as we like, and cultivate as we like. Just take this place as a training ground.”"]},{"number":1625,"title":"Chapter 1625 Devouring","paragraphs":["Chapter 1625 Devouring","Yue Wuwei asked, “What is the outer ring, the inner ring, and the Nine Mountains Region?”","He wanted to know more about the Star Sea.","He wouldn’t know much if he only knew the name.","Zhang Han knew this place well.","He said straightforwardly, “The outer ring is the outer area, and the inner ring is the inner area of the Star Sea. The internal area is relatively small compared with the outer ring. The Nine Mountains Region is the name of the Nine Star Areas. The Nine Star Areas look like nine mountains. Each of those Star Areas is larger than the Silver Dragon Galaxy. In fact, it is very large. Star Sea is in the Ninth Mountain Star Area, which is our destination. However, we are not in a hurry to go there. We need to train and improve our strength first.”","“So that’s how it is.”","Yue Wuwei looked enlightened and said, “Why do I suddenly feel that the Star Sea is much smaller?”","“The Star Sea can be big or small because, in our Cultivation World, there is only one Star Sea. There are many Galaxies, and there are countless ones like the Center Galaxy. But there is only one Star Sea, so our Cultivation World is not big. This is also the reason why many Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier cultivators want to go through the final Heavenly Tribulation and ascend to the higher world.”","“What’s outside the Cultivation World then?” Chen Chuan asked curiously.","“No one knows what’s outside the Cultivation World. The Human Clan has not gone very deep into it. In the Barren Star Areas, there are many... Let me put it this way. The further out one goes, the more Deadlands there are, the more turbulence in the universe, and the greater the danger one will face. Moreover, there will be more ancient demonic beasts there.”","Zhang Han said softly, “This is the whole Cultivation World. In fact, many Dao Seeking Cultivators can’t cover all the areas in it in their lifetimes. But from the general aspect, we know how big it is. The universe is boundless, but the territory of the Human Clan is limited. In the past, even I thought that one can reach the world of immortals by making it to the Heaven Road, ascending to the world of immortals, and breaking the rules of the world. However, Sir’s mind told me that it is the higher world, which is the real vaster world. This is too profound.”","“The real world.”","Yue Wuwei frowned and said, “Does it make our world just a dream?”","“That’s not what we can pay attention to now.” Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing. “It’s not too late to think about it when we reach the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.”","“Hahaha, that’s right.” Yue Wuwei laughed and said, “Let’s go!”","After the king vessel appeared, Mengmeng and the others walked into it.","Zhang Han said, “Without a Star Map, we can fly forward directly. More than 70% of the planets in the outer ring are Barren Stars. Let’s stop at any planet we pass by and see if there is any precious metal.”","The intelligent system of the spaceship said, “The order is received. Entering the secondary space in three seconds.”","Mengmeng was curious at once. “Why are we looking for rare metals?”","“It’s for the Golden-armored Giant Beast.” Zhang Han was still a little unaccustomed to the existence of the Golden-armored Giant Beast. “This thing has to eat metal. It has just been born. It’s too hungry.”","“Hahaha, that little thing can even eat metal,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","She found it funny.","Zi Yan and Lisa couldn’t help laughing.","This made Zhang Han a bit bewildered. He didn’t know why they were laughing.","“What’s so strange about the Golden-armored Giant Beast?”","It was half a meter tall, petite, and lovely, especially when it was a newborn.","The women present all liked it very much.","“Take it out. We want to see it.”","Zi Yan winked at Zhang Han.","“What’s there to see?” Zhang Han said grumpily.","“Come on.” Mengmeng also said, “It’s so funny.”","“My host, I want to see it too.” Dahei blinked and echoed.","“It’s not a treasure. Just let us see it,” Yue Wuwei said. “It also needs to come out and fight in the future.”","“Alas!”","Zhang Han was mentally exhausted.","After he ran his power a bit, golden light flowed out of his right hand.","Plop!","A cute thing sat down on the ground.","After Zhang Han injected his mind into the Golden-armored Giant Beast, its big eyes became bright, and its mouth moved.","“Awoooooooo.”","It didn’t speak in human language.","“It’s so cute.”","Mengmeng squatted down and rubbed the head, belly, and arms of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“It’s so hard. Its skin is covered with scales.” Mengmeng grinned and said, “It’s not as soft as Tiny Tot.”","As for Zi Yan, she squatted down and kept looking at the beast with her beautiful big eyes. She checked its front legs, back legs, and finally the middle of the back legs.","“Good. It’s private part is not revealed.”","Although this Golden-armored Giant Beast was cute, it was also a duplication of Zhang Han. Zi Yan certainly did not like it to have its private part revealed.","She took a look and found that there was nothing wrong with the beast, which was covered in scales.","“How can this thing get a partner?”","All of a sudden, Zi Yan was a little confused.","She shook her head and stopped thinking about it. Soon, she was also intoxicated by the cute appearance of the small Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“Can it do somersaults?” Mengmeng muttered, “Dad. Dad?”","She looked up at Zhang Han.","“Wait a minute,” Zhang Han said.","“Awooo!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast moved its arms and legs and clumsily turned around.","“Ahah.”","“Hahaha...”","All the people present began to laugh.","“Its meat looks delicious. Host, shall we eat it?” Dahei ran over and hugged Zhang Han’s leg.","“Eat it? It’s my duplication.” Zhang Han raised his hand and flicked Dahei’s forehead.","“It hurts.” Dahei touched its forehead, sat down on the ground, looked at the beast, and laughed.","“What realm is this thing in?” Yue Wuwei asked with a smile, “I should get something like this in the future.”","However, what Zhang Han said brought him back to reality.","“The fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","“What the...” Yue Wuwei was stunned. “It’s a newborn, and it is already at the fourth tier??”","He was dumbfounded.","“Yes, it’s a newborn fourth-tier beast, so its cultivation speed won’t be slow,” Zhang Han said. “All right, all right. The Golden-armored Giant Beast has just broken out of its shell, so it can’t exercise for too long.”","“Put it away then.”","Mengmeng and the others were done with seeing it.","Zhang Han put the Golden-armored Giant Beast away.","“I have to find some metal to feed it as soon as possible.”","Zhang Han said, “It’s getting more and more hungry.”","The system said, “Beep! The spaceship has arrived on the planet and is about to leave the secondary space.”","Swoosh!","The spaceship flew straight to the surface of the planet.","This was a Barren Star, a planet with many lands and lakes all over. The plants here were normal, the spiritual Qi was thin, and there were no living animals here.","“Detect the place and search for metal,” Yue Wuwei ordered the intelligent system.","“No need for that. I can feel it myself.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast leaped out of the spaceship and floated in the air. Its eyes were fixed on the ground, and there was a faint fluorescent light on its golden horn.","Zhang Han said, “There are some ordinary metals.","“Wait a moment.”","Swoosh!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast turned into a streak of golden light. No one knew if it was drilling into the ground or smashing it with its body. With a plop, it exploded like a bomb, which caused some earth to fly upward.","A deep pit appeared.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast was lying at the bottom of the pit.","It opened its mouth.","Buzz!","Countless pieces of metal rose from the underground one after another.","The mouth of the Golden-armored Giant Beast seemed to have turned into a bottomless pit, swallowing the metal pieces.","After staying for more than ten seconds, the Golden-armored Giant Beast flew back.","“There are too few metals here. Let’s go to another planet.”","Zhang Han said, “It feels very hungry. It hasn’t had enough.”","After flying for five hours, the crowd arrived on another planet.","“Eh? Spirit Treasure-level metal. Not bad.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast smashed into the ground again.","“Spirit Treasure-level metals? They are very rare,” Yue Wuwei said subconsciously. “Oh, that’s right. This is the Star Sea. It’s not strange that there would be Spirit Treasure-level metals here.”","“Right. It’s not strange. There are many palaces and other buildings, all of which are made of rare metal. Unfortunately, the most powerful metal is only the ninth-tier Spirit Treasure-level kind. I’ve never seen one at the Profound-grade level,” Zhang Han said.","“What level is the metal below?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“It’s at the third tier, but there’s a lot of it.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “This time, the Golden-armored Giant Beast should be half-full.”","Zhang Han knew the situation of the Golden-armored Giant Beast like the back of his hand. After all, it was his body.","Due to its small mouth, the Golden-armored Giant Beast ate the metal here for an entire hour.","“If it wants to cultivate fast, it must learn the devouring supernatural power and perform the Giant Mouth Image with its mouth. It needs to perform the Shadow Displacement Transposition and swallow the food into the Alternate Space in its belly.","“Oh, that’s right. I have the Immortal Body.”","Zhang Han almost forgot about this. He sensed that the Immortal Body was placed in a corner in the Alternate Space, surrounded by a vast white mist. The falling metal could not smash it, so it was fine.","After the Golden-armored Giant Beast ate the metal on this planet, the crowd set off for the journey again.","At the same time, the Golden-armored Giant Beast also began to comprehend the devouring supernatural power, the Giant Mouth Image.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast had a lot of innate supernatural powers and martial arts heritages, but after all, its soul had been changed, so it still lacked something.","Even so, there were still hundreds of kinds of supernatural powers to be cultivated. Zhang Han selected them and directly chose those that were beneficial to his cultivation.","The defense of the Golden-armored Giant Beast was extremely powerful. It couldn’t be killed easily. Together with Zhang Han’s other duplications, it would be difficult for him to die.","“We need to improve our strength as soon as possible.”","Zhang Han and his group began to raid the metals on each planet.","This was an opportunity for cultivation. The Golden-armored Giant Beast had just started devouring, so it had a lot of room for growth. When it finished devouring, it could rest for some time.","“This thing digests its food too fast. Even the third-tier metal can’t satisfy its needs.”","Zhang Han felt quite troubled.","Perhaps the Golden-armored Giant Beast would cost most of his belongings.","“Look at Tiny Tot, Dahei, and Little Hei. Can’t you learn from them?” Zhang Han commented helplessly.","The others couldn’t help laughing. “Aren’t you complaining about yourself?”","The cultivation of the Golden-armored Giant Beast had begun. What surprised Zhang Han was that as the Alternate Space in his body was half-full, there was a faint golden light. The golden light would accelerate the absorption of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","In just ten days, the Golden-armored Giant Beast was already three meters tall.","This was just the beginning.","The strange thing was that the faint golden light in the Alternate Space was often absorbed by the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","It seemed that it could also speed up Zhang Han’s cultivation.","Zhang Han was looking forward to the development of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","After all, after so many years of cultivation, what kind of experience would it be to have an Immortal Body now?","On the other side.","In the Alternate Space of the Golden-winged Roc, Immortal Master Lingxi taught everyone to cultivate.","“We’ve arrived at the Astral Domain of Engravement. Eh? There happens to be a secret realm. Let’s go there. Show me your combat capability.”","After leaving the Alternate Space, the Golden-winged Roc turned into a red wristband and circled around the wrist of Immortal Master Lingxi.","“Let’s go and check it out.”","Immortal Master Lingxi cast a spell and led the team forward at an extremely fast speed. She directly tore open an entrance in the secret realm.","They entered it.","“I still have some spirit treasures. Don’t go after the treasures here. Just fight with someone.”","Like a gang boss, Immortal Master Lingxi led the team forward and saw a battlefield. It was a battlefield of two sects, each with thousands of people, and the most powerful one was at the Tribulation Stage First Tier.","“Which one of you will go first? Zhang Hanyang’s grandpa, you go first.”","Immortal Master Lingxi commanded. “Don’t worry, I’ll be watching from here. You won’t get hurt.”","With a calm face, Zhang Mu nodded, cupped his hands, and flew down.","Although his aura was steady, in fact, he felt a little dizzy.","“Who should be my opponent?”","He glanced around and finally fixed his eyes on a man at the Middle Stage of the Mastery Realm who was sneaking around the periphery and trying to launch a sneak attack.","Zhang Mu shouted, “What are you doing?!”","“AHH!”","The man was taken aback.","He looked up at the person in the air behind him and got angry."]},{"number":1626,"title":"Chapter 1626 Highest Clouds Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 1626 Highest Clouds Palace","“Kill!”","With a murderous look, the middle-aged man rushed up with a broadsword in his hand.","Zhang Mu was now in the Early Stage of Mastery.","With many moves taught by Zhang Han, he fought against this expert in the Middle Stage with ease. He used various frequently.","“Huh?”","Immortal Master Lingxi was a little confused. “He knows a lot of moves, and his growth rate is very high. Han Yang Immortal must have taught him. Humph! Don’t think that I don’t have anything to teach you.”","Immortal Master Lingxi was not convinced. She turned to look at the crowd and said, “Han Yang Immortal is just a little guy who has been famous in the Cultivation World for a few years. He is a person who secretly cultivated for many years and broke out suddenly. I am different. I have been at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier for six thousand years. My knowledge is extensive. I have countless powerful techniques of supernatural power. Don’t think that you can be arrogant just because you have learned a few years from Han Yang Immortal. You are too weak in front of me! Too weak!”","The expressions of Mu Xue, Zhao Feng, and the others were a little numb.","They could see the displeasure of Immortal Master Lingxi. She had been beaten by their Master. They had to be careful.","Zhao Feng wiped his cold sweat and said, “We will learn from Master Ling.”","Everyone called her Master Ling, but she hadn’t taught them anything yet.","At the same time, they all knew if she wanted to teach them more powerful techniques, these techniques must be trump cards.","This caused Immortal Master Lingxi to be displeased.","How valuable these trump cards were! She almost hadn’t taught other people these things. However, the batch of disciples she had accepted was a bit unusual.","“But it’s understandable. After all, he is the Grandpa of Han Yang Immortal. It’s normal for him to have so many powerful techniques.”","Immortal Master Lingxi felt as if something had hit him. She said, “Come back! The next one!”","Zhang Mu nodded slightly. After repelling his opponent, he flew straight to the place where Immortal Master Lingxi and the others were hiding.","Phew!","The middle-aged man was furious. “What’s the point of running away after the fight? Let’s fight another 300 rounds if you can!”","Swoosh!","A few seconds later, Zhang Guangyou flew over and chose him.","“I’m Zhang Guangyou, at the Early Stage of Mastery.”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","They had another fierce battle.","“He knows a lot. The next one!”","Immortal Master Lingxi sighed lightly. She was displeased that she was about to teach them some of her trump cards.","Zhang Guangyou flew away.","The middle-aged man exhaled and thought to himself, “He’s so fucking fierce.”","But he couldn’t lose in speaking. “Why are you running away? Keep fighting if you can!”","Swoosh!","A woman came down.","“Rong Jiali, at the Peak Stage of the Integration.”","“Ha... I’m sure I can defeat her.”","The middle-aged man laughed to himself.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","They were locked in a stalemate.","The other party moved unimaginably fast. He couldn’t catch her at all.","The middle-aged man went crazy.","“Change.” Immortal Master Lingxi pointed to a person, “You’re the next.”","Ah Hu answered excitedly, “Okay!”","Ah Hu had just broken through to the Early Stage of Mastery.","“Why did you run away? Get down here!”","The middle-aged man was angry at first.","He stretched out his hand and cast a technique of supernatural power, trying to pull Rong Jiali back.","However, the other party suddenly flashed, and a man stood in front of the middle-aged man.","“What happened?”","“I’m Ah Hu!”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","“I’m Xu Yong.”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","“I’m Elder Meng.”","“I’m Zhao Feng.”","“Chen Changqing.”","“Mu Xue.”","“Ahem, just call me Sect Leader Jiang.”","“I’m Yun Feiyang.”","“Remember my name, Kong Ling’er. I’m in the Tribulation Stage First Tier.”","The middle-aged man was in a mess in the wind.","“Even the person in the Tribulation Stage comes to fight against me.”","After she beat him up for a while, she left.","“Ha... Why do you run away?”","The middle-aged man said weakly, “Kill me if you can!”","He was arrogant.","Finally, he lived in peace because his sect had lost.","“It’s finally over.”","The middle-aged man breathed a sigh of relief, patted his butt, and got up. He left from the side, ready to take a detour to meet with the people in his sect who escaped.","“I’ve learned your general strength and moves.”","Immortal Master Lingxi was a little depressed in the air. “Let’s go to another planet.”","It was time to relax.","She found that if she taught the group of people who had been taught by Han Yang Immortal before, she had to teach them some good moves. If she didn’t teach them good moves, wouldn’t they lose to Han Yang Immortal?","“Humph! I can’t lose to that guy who beat me up a few years after his debut.”","Immortal Master Lingxi glanced at the place where there were about a dozen people. She taught them some Cultivation Methods and occult art.","“Cultivate these for the time being.”","“As for you.”","Her eyes fell on Zhang Guangyou and the others. “I want to investigate for a while. Don’t hurry.”","Then they wandered around the places of the Astral Domain very fast. It might only take more than ten minutes for them to stay on each planet. After Immortal Master Lingxi investigated, they would leave.","There was no one whom Immortal Master Lingxi felt satisfied with in the entire Astral Domain.","Therefore, they set off again and took the Golden-winged Roc to travel through the starry sky extremely fast.","Zhang Han and his companions finally arrived at a slightly prosperous area in the outer ring from the periphery of the Star Sea.","“This is the Qian Wind District, and there are many storms in the starry sky.” Zhang Han said.","“Where are we going next?” Yue Wuwei asked.","Along the way, not only did Zhang Han devour all the treasures, but he also encountered nine secret realms. He experienced the seven of them, and one of the secret realms contained a treasure land. Zhang Han devoured its essence.","Even he often sighed with emotion that it was a little strange to say that cultivation depended on devouring.","“There is a branch hall of Highest Clouds Palace in the Qian Wind District.”","Zhang Han said, “Highest Clouds Palace is a force that issues tasks and masters all kinds of information in the Star Sea. They generally have information about the secret realms, the other experts, the treasure lands, and even the rare metals that appear on the planets.”","“Are we going to buy some news?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“No! Let’s join it.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “In the Highest Clouds Palace, we can start from the One-star Emissary to the highest-ranking Six-star Emissary after passing the exam. The higher the level of the emissaries, the more tasks they can take, and the more information they will know.”","“Is the Highest Clouds Palace very powerful?” Mengmeng patted Dahei on the belly and asked curiously.","“Yes. I once learned about Highest Clouds Palace. It has more than 100 Palace Masters in the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, and its force is not bad. Especially the other forces are not opposed to its operation method. Therefore, Highest Clouds Palace has branches in more than 60 percent of the Star Sea.”","Zhang Han answered Mengmeng very carefully, “As for the emissaries, to put it bluntly, they are very similar to the people working for the Highest Clouds Palace. They are equivalent to temporary workers. If they want to take on a task, they can go there. They have to do a task assigned by the Highest Clouds Palace every ten years. Then, they will be free. In Highest Clouds Palace, in addition to the Palace Masters, there are Hall Masters. There is also management. It contained guardians, managers, and supervisors.”","“Have you participated in it before?” Zi Yan asked.","“No.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “But I’ve bought some news. Now it may take decades for Immortal Master Lingxi to come back. If I join the Highest Clouds Palace, my cultivation will be greatly improved. You can screen the secret realms and experience. Actually, you don’t need to experience much. It will be great if you meet her on the way.”","They flew in the Qian Wind District. The area was extremely vast, comparable to the Center Galaxy.","They rode the Space Shooting Planets and finally arrived at a branch of the Highest Clouds Palace.","It occupied a planet, and it was called Highest Clouds Palace’s 311 Star Palace.","As far as the eye could see, there were more than a hundred space stations in the area. There were many flying ships. It was extremely lively.","“It seems we will wait in line for a long time.” Yue Xiaonao curled her lips and said, “I hate waiting in line the most.”","“It’s not good to be impatient,” Yue Wuwei said.","After three days in line, they took Highest Clouds Palace’s aircraft to the palace on the ground.","There were a total of thirty-five thousand palaces on the planet.","They were arranged to stay in the 78th branch.","Each palace was comparable to a prosperous city, and every street was filled with people coming and going.","There were all kinds of buildings around the palace outside. There were not only the residences of the emissaries from the Highest Clouds Palace, but also many hotels, where some Dao Seeking Cultivators were waiting to accept tasks.","They had lined up in front of the mission window for a day.","Finally, it was their turn.","“I’m going to apply for an emissary,” Zhang Han said.","Only Zhang Han did it, and the others didn’t need to.","“Please wait.”","“Fill in the form.”","“Submit your identity information.”","“Confirm your identity information.”","“The deposit is 100 million crystal stones.”","“Please choose a task within one minute. If you pass the task, you will become a One-star Emissary. If you fail, you will lose your qualification, and the crystal stones will not be returned.”","After a series of procedures, he got a mission form. There were 100 tasks on it.","“Assassinate Ke Ge, a fourth-tier Supreme Expert.”","“Find the dog of the Immortal Master Hu Bei in the Flowing Sea District.”","Zhang Han was recorded as a fourth-tier expert in the Tribulation Stage, and tasks that came from the system were around his level.","Among the 100 tasks, there were many trivial things.","But soon, about ten seconds later, Zhang Han locked onto a character.","“Bring back three Red Snow Gemstones in or beyond the seventh tier from the Underwater Abyss World of the Keriduo Planet in the Safen District.”","Red Snow Gemstone?","The Red Snow Gemstone was a metal gem that contained rare energy. It had a wide range of uses, but it was rare.","This mission could be considered the best one out of a hundred.","“I have finished choosing.” Zhang Han said.","“These are the basic requirements of the mission and the basic sets you need for training.”","After handing over some things, Zhang Han and the others left directly.","They took the aircraft back to the space station and headed for the Safen District, which was not far away from the Qian Wind District.","“What’s the mission?” Chen Chuan asked curiously.","Zhang Han activated the jade slip and showed the information.","“The Red Snow Gemstone is a kind of rare metal gem. There are not many of them in the Underwater Abyss World of the Keriduo Planet.”","“There are local Dao Seeking Cultivators at Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier guarding the center of the abyss. There are often third-tier and fourth-tier Dao Seeking Cultivators wandering around the periphery. The probability of Red Snow Gemstones appearing in the periphery is low. The estimated time of completion of the task is 50 years.”","“You must wear the basic suit throughout the mission, which can cover your clothes. You must wear the smart wristband.”","The mission set was a set of black clothes like a set of close-fitting pajamas. The smart wristband would record the scenes of the mission and so on.","However, Zhang Han completely ignored them and left them in the Space Ring.","After reading the information, Yue Wuwei fell silent.","“It’s just an entry-level task. How could you face the people of the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier head-on?”","“Isn’t this too terrifying?”"]},{"number":1627,"title":"Chapter 1627 The Ancient Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 1627 The Ancient Battlefield","“No.”","Zhang Han laughed. “According to the information, the task is that I should get the Red Snow Gemstones on the periphery of the Underwater Abyss World. It may take at most 50 years for me to get them, but there are other ways. For example, I can exchange for the Red Snow Gemstones from some Dao Seeking Cultivators. Waiting silently for the appearance of the Red Snow Gemstones is the worst way.”","“Then what’s the best way?” Mengmeng asked mischievously. “Is it to rob them?”","“It will be quicker.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “But we are not vicious people. We can find Dao Seeking Cultivators with Red Snow Gemstones and reason with them to agree.”","“That makes sense.” Mengmeng stuck out her tongue.","She felt that Zhang Han’s reasoning was a little different from what she had imagined.","Everyone resumed their journey.","They didn’t ride Space Shooting Planets.","On the way to every Space Shooting Planet, there were quite a few uninhabited areas.","There were also planets with rich resources being to the major sects here. Some planets had no lords. There were specific teams of people to patrol there.","They might find some special secret realms or crystal stone mines.","Now, the Golden-armored Giant Beast needed to devour metal.","Zhang Han was not used to hunger all the time.","At the very least, he wanted to be full.","As a result, the journey took five months.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast was full.","The effect was obvious. The Golden-armored Giant Beast grew to be more than ten meters tall now, but it still looked quite cute.","“We can take the Space Shooting Planets now.”","Zhang Han gave an order to the auxiliary system of the spaceship.","They went to the nearest Space Shooting Planet and went straight to their destination.","“Aren’t you going to devour metal?” Chen Chuan asked curiously.","“It’s enough now. It’s better to go directly to the Underwater Abyss World than to stay in the barren area. A Red Snow Gemstone should be enough to make the Golden-armored Giant Beast half full,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“Really?” Yue Wuwei was surprised.","“That’s not all.”","Zhang Han showed a mysterious smile.","The Red Snow Gemstones were relatively rare. Zhang Han had some before, but he hadn’t studied them in detail or absorbed them.","He could try this time.","It took them a year to reach the two small areas of the Star Sea.","He looked at the Keriduo Planet on the screen.","Its outer appearance was similar to that of the Barren Star, but there were very few space stations.","It was a masterless planet.","Ten percent of its area was continent, and ninety percent of its area was sea. At the bottom of the sea, there was another world called the Abyss World.","“Let’s go straight there.” Zhang Han said casually.","After coming to the Star Sea, his experience was fully used.","He put away the spaceship, took the small boat of Yue Wuwei, and entered the sea.","Zhang Han casually cast a few formations to isolate the fluctuation of his aura. Even though there were many Exotic Beasts in the sea, and even the fish were in large groups, they didn’t notice Zhang Han and his companions.","Yue Wuwei was quite envious of Zhang Han’s hiding means.","“Teach me when you have time,” Yue Wuwei said.","“No problem.” Zhang Han smiled.","“The sea here looks a lot like the Boundless Sea.” Chen Chuan looked around.","They dived down and passed through the beautiful scenery of the shallow sea. When they came to the deep sea, it was pitch-black. Then there was light again.","When they were near the bottom of the sea, they saw a layer of lines blocking the sea. After crossing the range of the sea, they became high up in the sky as if the sea they had just passed by was void of the universe.","It was a wonderful feeling.","The view was almost the same as that of the earth.","They saw seven or eight cities.","“Let’s find a city to see if there are any people selling the Red Snow Gemstones,” Yue Wuwei said.","“We can’t enter the city for the time being.”","Zhang Han said, “Look at the people lining up in the city. They have six fingers on each palm and dark green skin. They are from the Black Sky Clan. They hate people from other races very much.”","“Black Sky Clan.”","Yue Wuwei was speechless for a while.","“It turns out to be the territory of some special clans.”","“Judging from their auras, most of them are in the Integration Realm and at the Mastery Realm. It means that this is the peripheral area. Let’s take a walk in the wilderness and make the situation clear first,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay.”","Yue Wuwei controlled the boat to fly elsewhere.","They landed in a valley, put away the boat, and observed the surroundings.","“There doesn’t seem to be anything special. It’s weird that there is sunlight here, but I can’t see the sun,” Mengmeng muttered.","“A layer of light blocks the sea. The space energy is like a Bounded Domain. I don’t know how much light energy it has absorbed. The sunlight is also because of it.” Zhang Han explained, “There are too many special circumstances in the Star Sea. Of course, we can’t meet special circumstances easily. For example, the secret realm ahead suddenly appeared.”","Hearing the last sentence, everyone was a little stunned.","Even Zi Yan couldn’t help laughing.","They probed forward with their minds and found that above a river more than 10 kilometers away, the space seemed to have been torn apart. Then, a vast fog appeared, and the secret realm appeared in the world.","Coincidentally, it was not far from the upstream of the river. Some clansmen of the Black Sky Clan immediately took out their communication devices to inform the higher-ups of the discovery.","“Let’s go over.”","Would there be a lot of Red Snow Gemstones in the secret realm that suddenly appeared?","Everyone was curious about it. If some Red Snow Gemstones had appeared as soon as they arrived, they would be too lucky.","However, Zhang Han didn’t think so.","The vast fog covered an area of five kilometers.","It could be entered in each direction.","They entered the range of the fog and moved forward. A few seconds later, they entered the secret realm.","“The space energy in the secret realm is not stable. It may dissipate in a few days.”","Zhang Han frowned slightly and said, “The aura is dark, so there shouldn’t be many treasures.”","“Maybe there are no treasures at all.” Yue Wuwei stroked his beard, took out the small boat again, and took the Profound-grade treasure to move forward.","“There are many Yin souls, most of whom are in the Mastery Realm.”","“There are some at the Tribulation Stage First Tier,” Yue Wuwei analyzed. “Could there be some soul-type treasures in such a place?”","“It doesn’t matter. Let Tiny Tot have a meal.” Zhang Han said.","“Come out for a meal, Tiny Tot.”","Zi Yan moved her mind slightly.","After Tiny Tot appeared, it saw the surrounding Yin souls.","“Coo.”","As soon as its real body appeared, it opened its mouth and swallowed the Yin souls in the Mastery Realm within a radius of thousands of meters quickly. The Yin souls at the Tribulation Stage First Tier succeeded to resist the devouring power. However, they still shivered and did not dare to fight back because Tiny Tot was born to restrain them.","“Hic!”","Tiny Tot burped and got into Zi Yan’s wrist.","The realm of this batch of Yin souls was relatively high. Although Tiny Tot didn’t eat much, they were very useful.","“There’s a sword.”","Chen Chuan had sharp eyes. He looked around and saw a half of a sword under a withered tree not far away.","“Huh?”","Yue Wuwei and Zhang Han exclaimed at the same time.","They didn’t feel any treasure at all.","The surrounding mountain ranges were endless, but the trees were all black. There were a lot of withered grass and flowers. Everything showed that this was a Deadland.","Logically speaking, there shouldn’t be any special spirit treasure in such a place.","But there were no absolutes in the world.","“Ancient Magic Sword.”","After Zhang Han pulled out the long sword, the sword shone brightly and contained monstrous killing intent.","“This place is an ancient battlefield!” Zhang Han was surprised. “If it’s an ancient battlefield, there may be a lot of weapons.”","“What’s the function of the magic sword?” Lisa asked.","“The Ancient Magic Sword is a kind of special spirit treasure. In my opinion, its greatest function is probably equivalent to a bomb. It’s a disposable item with extraordinary power. If you perform the supernatural power of Myriad Swords and explode them at the same time, it will be powerful,” Zhang Han said.","“A bomb?” Mengmeng eyes lit up. “I like throwing bombs.”","“Then I’ll find more for you to play with.”","Zhang Han smiled.","Thus, the crowd began to search for the Ancient Magic Swords.","The first batch of people who entered the secret realm always got the most.","In the beginning, they could find a sword every few kilometers in the peripheral area.","After entering the secret realm, they saw a flat swamp, where many ancient magic swords were inserted in various rotten woods.","“Wow! What a great harvest!”","Mengmeng picked up the treasures with a smile.","Everyone was in charge of an area.","They collected the magic swords very fast.","Then they got more and more of the magic swords.","Mengmeng liked to play, so most of them were stored in her Space Ring.","“Let’s give it a try.”","Mengmeng threw out a magic sword and shouted, “Explode!”","Rumble!","The magic sword exploded in the air.","In addition to the energy fluctuations, there were also fragments of swords, which turned into hidden weapons and attacked in all directions.","This was just an ordinary magic sword. If she used a sword formation, the effect would be more fierce.","The sword was almost as powerful as an ordinary fireball thrown by Mengmeng.","“It’s so interesting,” Mengmeng said with a chuckle.","“Sister Mengmeng, here you are. I picked up more than 50.” Chen Chuan controlled dozens of the Ancient Magic Swords with his mind.","It felt like a great harvest.","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei were guarding the center of the group.","“Ancient Magic Swords are weapons used by ancient cultivators to fight, right? What’s the definition of ancient times?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“Ancient times refer to the remote ages of each planet. It can be traced back to at least 10,000 years ago. More than 60% of the spiritual treasures that have been passed down from ancient times are not very useful. They can only be used as a consumable. But the power is extraordinary. It also makes the price of Ancient Magic Weapons not low. They can be regarded as treasures that can save our strength, similar to talismans.”","“Oh.” Yue Wuwei nodded and suddenly asked, “How long has the Cultivation World existed?”","“No one knows. According to some ancient books, the martial arts heritage of predecessors that someone has obtained can be traced back to 90 million years ago. The person who left the martial arts heritage of predecessors has passed the ninth-tier Thunder Tribulation and ascended to the higher world,” Zhang Han replied.","“Alas!”","Yue Wuwei sighed with emotion and said, “At my age, I’m like a kid in the Cultivation World. I’m not envious of those who went through the Tribulation Stages and ascended to the higher world. Now I envy that you can devour the tribulation’s thunder and make a breakthrough on your own without Heavenly Tribulations.”","“You can’t learn this.” Zhang Han spread out his hands.","“I can’t learn it, so I’m envious.”","After Yue Wuwei finished speaking, his expression suddenly changed slightly. “There is something ahead.”"]},{"number":1628,"title":"Chapter 1628 The Sand Time Giant Beast","paragraphs":["Chapter 1628 The Sand Time Giant Beast","“What is it?”","Zhang Han waved his hand and said, “Come back, everyone.”","The detection range of his divine sense was not as far as that of Yue Wuwei.","Yue Wuwei was in the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage, and he was very outstanding. Zhang Han hadn’t surpassed Yue Wuwei yet in terms of ability yet.","“It’s a huge city. I feel that there seem to be some ancient demonic beasts inside. I can feel the stridor,” Yue Wuwei said in a strange tone. “But it looks like a city of death.”","“What happened?”","Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Chen Chuan came back and were confused.","“There is a city of death ahead. Let’s go and have a look,” Zhang Han said. “Let Tiny Tot come out.”","Tiny Tot ran out again and felt a little confused.","“I’ve just been full. Shouldn’t I have a good sleep? Why did you call me out again?”","“We’ll go ahead and have a look. Please protect us.” Zi Yan said with a smile.","Tiny Tot transformed. It led the others to swim through the void and shuttle forward.","In the blink of an eye, they were near the city of death.","The city was huge and lifeless. It was a big city full of death aura.","The city wall was in tatters, and most of the buildings inside had collapsed.","However, when Tiny Tot arrived, something strange happened.","“Ow! Ow!”","A soul roar suddenly descended.","“You are so noisy!”","Dahei, sitting next to Mengmeng, glared at the other party and was about to leave the secondary space to fight with the other party.","“Don’t be impulsive!”","Zhang Han slightly changed his expression and said, “Watch the front. Tiny Tot, step back 2.5 kilometers.”","Tiny Tot obediently retreated.","A faint black shadow slowly appeared above the huge city, blocking the sky and the sun and covering the entire city.","“The soul of a Sand Time Giant Beast? How could there be such a thing?” Zhang Han narrowed his eyes.","“What? A Sand Time Giant Beast?” Yue Wuwei was shocked. “No wonder I felt the aura of sixth-tier Tribulation Stage.”","“What is it?” Mengmeng asked in a low voice.","Everyone could feel the soul of the giant beast in front of them was not easy to deal with.","“The Sand Time Giant Beast is a kind of an ancient demonic beast that is extremely proficient in illusions. It has powerful supernatural power and likes to live in the desert. It looks like a giant Scorpion.”","Before Zhang Han said more, Yue Wuwei said, “Its name includes the word, time. That is because its illusions can make people lose their way for hundreds of years. In that way, people can’t feel time passing. It is very strong and difficult to kill. Even if you kill it, its body and soul are useless, so it is difficult to deal with. I knew it in an ancient book. This is the first time I’ve seen its soul.”","“Daddy, can’t you deal with it with your illusions?” Mengmeng blinked her beautiful big eyes and stared at the shadow above the huge city in front of them.","The Sand Time Giant Beast was staring at Tiny Tot.","Although it was also a king of the ancient demonic beast, the Ancient Cursed Roc was much more powerful than it.","Its expression showed it wanted to make a move but didn’t dare to for fear that Tiny Tot would take action and swallow it.","Since it wanted to fight, its fighting capability wasn’t low.","Zhang Han added, “Most importantly when we investigate the Sand Time Giant Beast, we can feel its realm is the same as ours. Therefore, Dahei tried to fight against it when it felt that the other party was in the same realm as it. I observed that the other party was in the fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage. Elder Yue thought that it was in the sixth tier. Pretending to be weak is one of its means. Only when it takes action can we feel its real realm.”","“Do you think there are any treasures in this city of death? Otherwise, how could it appear so fast?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“Maybe.”","Zhang Han slightly lit up his eyes and said, “Since its soul has lived here, maybe there is a treasure land.”","“Should we take action?”","Yue Wuwei hesitated for a moment and said, “Let me try its power, okay?”","“Don’t be in a hurry.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “There may be other crises in the city. Let’s wait for the local army to come and check the situation first.”","“Okay.”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard.","“Let’s pick up Ancient Magic Swords around. We’ve almost collected 10,000 swords,” Mengmeng said.","“Ha... Let’s go pick up the treasures.” Zhang Han said with laughter.","Tiny Tot stared at the Sand Time Giant Beast’s soul with some envy. However, it also felt that the other party’s realm might be much higher than its. It was not easy to deal with, so Tiny Tot left reluctantly.","“Ow! Ow!”","The Sand Time Giant Beast let out a soul roar and slowly dissipated between heaven and earth.","Everyone began to search for treasures around again.","A day later, they noticed the first local group.","Yue Wuwei took out his boat, and they hid in the void.","This boat was a Profound-grade treasure. It had the ability to conceal the auras. Coupled with the formation that Zhang Han had launched, it was useful.","Yue Wuwei was reluctant to use One Cloud often. One Cloud also needed time to recover its energy. It was a treasure specially used to deal with Heavenly Tribulations. If he lost it, he would not be able to devour Thunder Tribulations in the future.","The next day, they found three more groups of local people searching around.","A group of people discovered the city of death.","“Let’s go have a look.”","“Enter the city and explore!”","A team of more than 300 people began to enter the city.","This time, the Sand Time Giant Beast did not appear quickly.","However, there was no sound from this group of people after they entered the city. Their figures slowly walked into the vast fog. A moment later, they let out a few surprised roars. Then the city became quiet.","The expressions of the more than 100 people who had stayed outside the city changed drastically.","“How could it be?”","“The leader is Chief Ao. He is in the third tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","“The place is strange. Let’s retreat quickly and wait for the elders to come.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","This group of people was so scared that they didn’t dare to approach. They set up camp 10 kilometers away. More than a dozen people left in different directions to inform their chiefs.","Zhang Han and the others were hiding at a low altitude not far away.","They sat on the boat and waited quietly.","“Sure enough, this Sand Time Giant Beast is not easy to deal with. Even the person in the third tier of the Tribulation Stage died quickly. The person might let out the roars just now. He could detect it but couldn’t deal with it.” Yue Wuwei took a deep breath and said, “The Sand Giant Beast is at least in the fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","“It’s also possible that it’s fifth-tier or sixth-tier.” Zhang Han said with some emotion, “In the Star Sea, it’s very easy to encounter something beyond our strength. Mengmeng, don’t relax. When you’re outside, you should be on guard.”","“Okay. I’m on guard,” Mengmeng responded obediently, but she didn’t look so serious. She muttered to herself, “Anyway, I don’t have to worry since you have been on my side.”","Zhang Han shook his head and laughed.","On the fifth day, a big army arrived.","There were thousands of people, led by a sixth-tier person in the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage.","Moreover, there were seven groups. They gathered outside the city of death from all directions.","“Did they disappear without a trace?”","“Yes, Elder.”","“What kind of power made them disappear?” The elder frowned. “Attack the city wall.”","Rumble!","The order was issued.","A team of 500 people attacked in unison. It was a team attack. Each of them exerted strength. All the strength converged into a realm that was beyond what they deserved. They launched extraordinary attacks. Red waves of fire covered the city wall.","The entire city wall collapsed, sending dust flying everywhere.","The soul of the Sand Time Giant Beast hadn’t appeared yet.","The groups in the other directions also broke through the city wall like this.","“Move forward!”","The large enemy force was bearing down upon the border. Although they only had about four to five thousand people, most of them had passed the Tribulation Stage. Some of them were at the third or fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage. Moreover, their leader was in the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage. They explored the city of death together, and their power was not low. It seemed they had attached great importance to it.","Their way of doing things would often reduce the losses.","“Destroy!”","After the order was issued, a series of buildings were destroyed. At this rate, the entire city of death would be turned into ruins in five or six days. At that time, there would be nothing hidden in it that could hide.","After only five hours, the Sand Time Giant Beast’s soul couldn’t sit still.","Clatter!","An invisible fog covered all the vanguard groups.","The battle between the Sand Time Giant Beast’s soul and the outsiders had begun.","“Retreat orderly!”","The groups were unhurried. They used many methods to resist the fog and retreated cautiously one after another.","After all, there were elites in the team.","Almost immediately, they noticed something strange.","“It’s strange!”","“Stop!”","“We’re not retreating. We’re advancing!”","“The Shadow Displacement Transposition?”","“Stay where you are and wait for orders. Open the defensive energy cover.”","A total of seven groups began to fight against the other party in front of Zhang Han and his companions.","“This is the standard operation of teams exploring secret realms.”","Zhang Han took a light breath and said, “They are not panicked when anything happens, and then...”","Mengmeng asked mischievously, “Then, will they take out their mobile phones and shoot a short video?”","Zhang Han was speechless.","He was amused and flicked Mengmeng’s forehead lightly. Then he said, “No. When they encounter something, they calm down and perform their defensive means according to the current situation. Isn’t there a vast fog around them? Look at the moves of the seven groups. They are all expelling the fog and various defensive energy layers. If the enemy doesn’t move, they won’t move. They’ll wait for the surroundings to be calm before continuing to deal with the other party.”","“Oh? Is there any way to solve the problem?” Mengmeng was curious again. “They can’t feel anything inside.”","“The best way is to wait for the enemy to show up because they don’t know what the enemy is inside,” Zhang Han said. “Of course, if they have any means, they can devour the fog directly.”","It seemed he was addicted to devouring.","Everything could be devoured.","Zhang Han felt that it was really cool to devour.","However, his current cultivation method was quite awesome. He could devour Heavenly Tribulations, treasure lands, and metals. He improved his cultivation by devouring. As the saying goes, the Great Domain was the simplest.","“They are more or less in trouble in the face of the soul of the Sand Time Giant Beast,” Yue Wuwei analyzed. “It is not easy to deal with.”","“As long as they are not chaotic, it will not be a big problem. I’m afraid that the illusions created by the Sand Time Giant Beast’s soul will be too fierce.”","As soon as Zhang Han finished speaking, the seven groups all took action. They seemed to have detected the enemy from the vast fog, and various attacks began.","At the same time, they didn’t realize that their positions were changing.","The distance between each group was getting closer and closer.","When fake things were regarded as real ones, people couldn’t distinguish them anymore.","Soon, the seven groups attacked each other and consumed their energy.","Half an hour later, they were ordered, “Stop attacking!”","“All-out defense!”","Some teams reacted and stopped attacking.","“We are trapped in an illusion. We should strengthen the outer defense and those who are proficient in illusions go to crack it.”","The seven groups were gradually not in chaos.","The Sand Time Giant Beast definitely didn’t want to see this.","However, it couldn’t use the same move anymore. They had learned their lesson.","It didn’t matter. It still had many moves.","The seven groups were covered with a vast fog. Under the gaze of Zhang Han and others, the light inside was shining like thunder and lightning in the dark clouds, constantly flashing.","They fought for three hours.","Finally, some people began to scream one after another.","“Some teams are in danger.”","Yue Wuwei narrowed his eyes slightly.","He didn’t expect the Sand Time Giant Beast’s soul to be so powerful.","Fortunately, another group flew over from a distance. There were more than 10,000 of them. The elder leading the team had a seventh-tier aura!","“Demonic God shocks the void!”","He launched a big move as soon as he came up and dispersed a lot of the fog.","“Retreat!”","His stern shout made the members of the seven groups tremble physically and mentally. When they came to their senses, they all fled the moment the illusions were destroyed.","There were more than half were dead or injured in three groups of seven. The other four groups were just physically and mentally exhausted and did not suffer any casualties.","“I didn’t expect that there would be a soul of a Sand Time Giant Beast here.”","The seventh-tier elder was holding an old stick of wood.","“A Profound-grade treasure.” Yue Wuwei said in a low voice.","Clatter!","As he spoke, the soul of the Sand Time Giant Beast condensed again, covering the sky and the sun. It looked at the seventh-tier elder angrily."]},{"number":1629,"title":"Chapter 1629 Meeting Acquaintances Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 1629 Meeting Acquaintances Again","“It seems to be very angry.” Mengmeng blinked and said.","“It’s angry because it regards this place as its own territory. It wants to kill all the outsiders here,” Zhang Han said. “But I feel that it’s no match for that elder. After fighting for a while, it may have to escape. Without it, the city of death will become a place for the other teams to compete for treasures.”","“Should we go there later?” Mengmeng asked in a low voice.","“Wait here. I’ll go explore with my Thunder Body.” Zhang Han said.","Zhang Han had a lot of means now.","Although the moves of the Thunder Body were not many, they were powerful. Moreover, even if the Thunder Body died, it could be condensed easily with a little loss of Source. The loss was not irreparable. Zhang Han could swallow more Heavenly Tribulations to make up for it.","Heavenly Tribulations were many. He could devour a lot of them by finding some places where some people were undergoing Tribulation Stages.","If Heavenly Tribulations knew what Zhang Han was thinking, they would probably grow the spiritual intelligence of Qi and swear.","“The soul of the Sand Time Giant Beast is only at the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage. Let me fight with you.”","The elder at the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage held a Profound-grade treasure, a magic stick, in his hand and flew into the city of death extremely fast.","Clatter!","The Sand Time Giant Beast’s soul dissipated, and it was replaced by an even thicker fog.","The fog surrounded the whole city.","“You’re courting death!”","“If your Original Body were here, you might be able to deal with me. But you are just a part of a soul. How dare you be so fierce in front of me?”","He shouted, “Go to hell!”","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","Various lights appeared in the vast fog, and the fluctuations were intense.","Clatter!","Five minutes later, the fog quickly dissipated. The Sand Time Giant Beast’s soul turned into a stream of light and fled to the depths of the secret realm.","The seventh-tier elder wanted the power of the soul. He wanted to destroy its consciousness and absorb its essence. He chased after it directly.","“You can’t escape.”","His tone showed his invincible posture and disdain.","As a result, the entire city became empty, and the deathly aura no longer existed.","“It turns out to be a part of a soul.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment and said with a serious look, “That’s very likely. This is a cultivation method of the Sand Time Giant Beast. If he chases after it, will he catch up with the Original Body of the Sand Beast?”","He thought about it and could not rule out this possibility.","Seeing that everyone had entered the city, a small bolt of lightning quickly entered the city from the side.","The groups present did not come from the same force. Zhang Han disguised himself as the Original Body and hid the essence of the Thunder Body. It looked the same as his Original Body.","“What on earth is in this city?”","Of course, Zhang Han didn’t know what was hidden inside.","“But the duplication is too invincible.”","Zhang Han sighed with emotion.","This kind of duplication was useful to explore some secret realm, and it didn’t fear death.","Zhang Han had seen a lot of Replication Techniques in the Cultivation World, but all of them had no exception. The duplication was weaker than the Original Body and had to consume a supreme treasure after death.","However, Zhang Han might only consume a few bolts of tribulation thunder. He could recover by devouring them.","When they went deeper into the city, they felt the atmosphere became more wonderful.","At the same time, one or two Dao Seeking Cultivators appeared around them from time to time. They looked at each other and showed no hostility. Even if they found that Zhang Han was not their clansman, it didn’t matter.","There were also some resident outsiders in the Abyss World.","“Huh?”","Not far away, an elder with a white beard and a pointed nose inadvertently glanced at Zhang Han. Suddenly, his pupils contracted.","“How is this possible?”","His face was full of shock, and he couldn’t believe his eyes.","He secretly followed Zhang Han not far away and secretly observed him.","Zhang Han discovered the other party at once.","He glanced around and didn’t find anything special about the person.","But why was the person focusing on Zhang Han?","Zhang Han paid attention to the other party in his heart.","Then he continued to walk forward.","Rumble!","At the heart of the city was an ancient palace. The palace was half-destroyed. After someone sensed the intruders, a terrifying fluctuation spread.","“How dare you disturb my slumber?”","Swoosh! A pitch-black figure, tens of thousands of meters tall, suddenly condensed. The aura was at its peak. He held a long broadsword in his right hand, and his killing intent was awe-inspiring.","“Ninth-tier Tribulation Stage!”","“No! Run now!”","That invincible aura represented the power of the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage.","The people in the city of death were scared out of their wits.","Even Zhang Han felt his scalp go numb.","“How could a city of death in a secret realm have someone in the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","At this time, everyone showed their special prowess to escape.","Zhang Han also quietly retreated.","But as he walked, his heart skipped a beat.","“It’s strange!”","“The Sand Time Giant Beast’s soul is far from reaching the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage. How dare it be here?”","“It’s unusual! Maybe it’s just a figure with the aura the a ninth-tier Tribulation Stage.”","“Should I go over or not?","Zhang Han suddenly turned around. He was not afraid of death at all now. He quickly flew back.","Unexpectedly, there was also a small group of Dao Seeking Cultivators among more than 10,000 noticed it.","They were so nervous that cold sweat broke out on their foreheads.","At the same time, they also noticed something strange. They acted in the opposite direction. They activated various defensive spiritual treasures and rushed to the huge figure.","Among them, the sharp-nosed elder was still staring at Zhang Han.","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han frowned slightly.","“Is there something wrong with this person?”","Swoosh!","He moved very fast and disappeared into the shadow. Then he could see a precious pearl in the heart of the shadow.","“A Profound-grade treasure.”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes and said, “It can simulate an aura. Not bad.”","He rushed forward, grabbed the pearl in his hand, and quickly.","When he was leaving, the other six people also came in.","“Put down the treasure!”","“Outsider, you’ve crossed the line!”","They shared a bitter hatred of the enemy and all gathered around. The leader was a fifth-tier Immortal Master.","Just as Zhang Han was about to retreat, the sharp-nosed elder said, “He’s from our Mountain River Sect.”","His eyes were sharp as he said, “The Mountain River Sect is not an outsider. Whatever treasures he gets, it’s up to our Mountain River Sect to decide. You are not qualified to snatch the treasure from him. Do you want to start a war in the Abyss World?”","In the face of the old man’s doubt, the expressions of the six people were slightly dark. The leading Immortal Master cupped his hands.","“It turns out that he is from the Mountain River Sect. Then, he can be regarded as one of us. But we came in because our Immortal Master Red North drove away the Sand Time Giant Beast. Don’t you think you should repay something?”","He meant since they had obtained the precious treasure, they should hand something over.","“Ha... All right. Follow the rules.”","The elder took out a ninth-stage spirit treasure and said, “This is for you.”","After scattering a few more eighth-tier spirit treasures, he turned around and approached Zhang Han.","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","He seemed to have heard of Ke Chen’e somewhere, but he didn’t remember where it was.","“Well, I’ll see who he is.”","“Lord, let’s go.”","Ke Chen’e cupped his hands and took the lead in flying out.","Right at this moment, there was a violent roar in the distance.","“Retreat!”","The horrible voice of Immortal Master Red North came from afar.","Not far behind him, the Original Body of the Sand Beast was chasing after him.","At this time, Immortal Master Red North no longer had the invincible momentum of chasing. Now, he was in a mess. Even his hair was messy in the wind. He was running for his life quickly.","“Let’s leave!”","There was no time for them to explore, and they fled one after another.","The sharp-nosed elder followed Zhang Han closely.","“That’s great, Han Yang Immortal. I’m very glad to see you!” Ke Chen’e said excitedly, “I’m Ke Chen’e, Little Ke. My brother is Ke Chentao. We’re biological brothers. Back then, you gave us cultivation methods, many occult arts, and a lot of spiritual treasures. All these let us reach this level. I’ve always remembered your kindness. Today, I finally see you. It’s great that you’re still alive.”","“The Brothers surnamed Ke?”","Zhang Han suddenly remembered the two brothers. At that time, the elder brother was about ten years old, and the younger brother was four years old. They were very cute. The two brothers lived alone under great pressure. Zhang Han passed by and lived in their town for a month.","At that time, the person was just a kid. He would play with Zhang Han whenever he had time and relieve Zhang Han’s boredom, so Zhang Han gave him an opportunity.","“It turns out to be you. I didn’t expect you to reach the fifth-tier Tribulation Stage.” Zhang Han smiled faintly.","He was also emotional about the wonders of life.","He had given other people a lot of treasures, but how many of them could remember him?","There was no absolute thing in the world. Zhang Han didn’t know Ke Chen’e very much now, but the person looked quite friendly.","“It’s all thanks to you,” Ke Chen’e said with a smile. “Mr. Zhang, why did you come to the Abyss World? I almost didn’t recognize you at first. Your aura is different from before.”","“Yes.”","Zhang Han said, “The divine thunder over the sky has a great impact on me.”","“You’re the first person who can resist the divine thunder over the sky and survive.” Ke Chen’e said with admiration, “You triggered the change of the rules of Great Domain. Many Dao Seeking Cultivators don’t remember you, Han Yang Immortal, but we have a deep impression of you. For so many years, my brother and I have also found a fact that those who have come into contact with you more than three times and know you have an impression of you. All of the others don’t remember.”","“I see.” Zhang Han nodded and said, “How many years have you been in the Abyss World?”","“More than 700 years. We are members of the Mountain River Sect. My brother is the First Elder,” Ke Chen’e said with a smile. “If my brother knew you were here, he would be happy. Would you like to go to our place, Immortal Master?”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han said, “Let’s go and have a look. I also want to tell you something.”","He didn’t know what the two brothers had experienced in the past more than a thousand years. If he stayed here longer, he might encounter an Immortal Master more than the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage.","Even if they didn’t say anything, the other members of their sect might make trouble for them. It would be troublesome.","Therefore, Zhang Han’s Original Body said to Yue Wuwei and the others, “I meet an acquaintance. You follow us.”","He wanted to see if he could exchange for some Red Snow Gemstones.","“Great! Please follow me.”","Ke Chen’e said with a smile and took out a small aircraft.","The two of them entered it and flew into the void. After a while, they left the secret realm and headed for the depths of the continent."]},{"number":1630,"title":"Chapter 1630 Repay Kindness With Vengeance","paragraphs":["Chapter 1630 Repay Kindness With Vengeance","The Underwater Abyss World was also vast.","There were mountains and rivers. During the day, there was sunshine. At night, three bright moons could be seen. One of them was big, and the other two were small.","The moonlight illuminated the entire land. Comparatively speaking, it was not dark on such a night. When dark clouds blocked the three moons at the same time, it would be really dark.","They passed by one city after another.","Half a month later, they finally arrived at the Mountain River Sect.","It was located in the depths of the continent and occupied a mountain range with pleasant scenery.","During this period, they talked a lot.","Zhang Han had some understanding of the situation of the two brothers.","However, in the peaceful chat, Zhang Han didn’t tell the other party about his experiences, and Ke Chen’e didn’t tell Zhang Han specific information about him and his brother.","Ke Chen’e told them that Ke Chenchao was now at the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage, while he was at the fifth tier, not far from the sixth tier.","He had stayed in the Cultivation World for more than a thousand years. He was also a skilled hand.","“Daddy, we can’t go there. How’s the situation over there?”","Yue Wuwei parked his boat in a canyon and concealed their existence. Zhang Han had set up more than a dozen kinds of Heaven-earth Formations.","During this period, Mengmeng asked curiously.","“We’ve entered the Mountain River Sect,” Zhang Han said.","“Why can’t we go there?” Yue Xiaonao said casually, “If they meet an old friend, they will treat you well.”","“Are you kidding me?” Yue Wuwei glared at Yue Xiaonao and said seriously, “Do you think we are on Earth? This is not our territory, so we have to be particularly careful. Look at your Uncle Zhang. His choice is very reasonable. There are seventh-tier, eighth-tier, and ninth-tier Tribulation Stage people. If any of us is in danger or meets some trouble, it will be bad.”","“Yes,” Lisa said. “Don’t always be careless. You’ll be at a disadvantage in the future, understand?”","“It’s always right to be careful,” Zi Yan echoed. “He met Ke Chen’e and Ke Chentao when they were young. Now more than a thousand years have passed. It’s impossible to say that they haven’t changed. As the saying goes, one shouldn’t hurt others but should always be on guard against others.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han laughed and said, “Even if they are good people, we have to be on guard against the other members of the Mountain River Sect. It’s not easy for them to gain a firm foothold in the Abyss World.”","“I was just saying. In fact, I’m just greedy. I want to eat delicious food,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“I also want to eat delicious food.” Mengmeng pouted.","“Then I’ll cook for you. I guess I’ll arrive there after cooking.” Zhang Han smiled.","He also specially brought a pot and others used for cooking with him. Mengmeng controlled the fire and fried the vegetables. After a while, eight dishes and one soup were ready.","“It smells so good.” Chen Chuan licked his lips.","“host, where are ours?” Dahei put on a pitiful look.","Zhang Han took out two pieces of meat, each of which was equivalent to an adult beef in weight.","“Third brother, come out and roast the meat.”","Dahei was busy.","“Come out.”","Zi Yan smiled and contacted Tiny Tot with her mind.","Tiny Tot was dizzy. As soon as it woke up, it subconsciously began to roast meat. When the smell of meat came out, it drooled a lot.","When eating, Zhang Han suddenly said, “We arrived.”","“Tell me what’s going on.” Mengmeng blinked her curious eyes.","Therefore, Zhang Han acted like a reading machine and began to tell them what he had seen.","Actually, the image could be projected. But once Zhang Han used the magic power, the connection between his Original Body and the Thunder Body might be felt.","The First Elder of the Mountain River Sect, Ke Chentao, lived alone in a palace.","“Ha...”","In an ancient courtyard in the manor, on the side of the palace, Ke Chentao laughed heartily and said, “Han Yang Immortal, you’re finally here. Come on! Please have a seat. I have cooked by myself and prepared some home-cooked meals for you.”","“Thank you.” Zhang Han smiled.","“You are our benefactor. Without you, how could we have grown to be like this?” Ke Chentao laughed heartily.","He also had a pointy nose, but his face was square, while Ke Chen’e’s face was oval. They looked slightly different.","“Mr. Zhang, we are so lucky to see you. I thought you had died under the divine thunder over the sky. Alas! It’s so good to be alive,” Ke Chentao said. “It gives us a chance to repay your kindness. Please stay in the Abyss World. We brothers will repay your kindness. No matter what you need, we will try our best to help you.”","“You don’t have to be so polite.” Zhang Han shook his head and said, “I’m just traveling here. I may leave in a few days.”","“Traveling?” Ke Chentao was stunned.","“Don’t just talk. Mr. Zhang, have a taste of the food and the good wine that my brother specially prepared.” Ke Chen’e said.","“Okay.”","The three of them had a drink together.","After Zhang Han drank a glass of wine, Ke Chen’e and Ke Chentao suddenly looked much more relaxed.","“Mr. Zhang, may I know why you’re here?” Ke Chentao asked.","“I do have something to do here.” Zhang Han said, “I’m here for a batch of Red Snow Gemstones.”","“Red Snow Gemstones?” Ke Chentao raised his eyes slightly and asked, “How many do you need?”","“The more, the better,” Zhang Han replied.","“I have some.”","Ke Chentao waved his right hand, and more than 40 Red Snow Gemstones appeared.","More than twenty were sixth-tier, more than ten were seventh-tier, and there were six in eighth-tier.","“The Red Snow Gemstone is a kind of unique treasure in the Underwater Abyss World of the Keriduo Planet. It’s rare.”","Ke Chentao said, “It’s a rare metal gem. It has a lot of uses and is deeply loved by some ninth-tier Immortal Masters. There are also Red Snow Gemstones in our sect’s treasure vault. Some of them are ninth-tier. I can’t take them out of the treasure vault. If there is something in exchange for them, I’ll inform our Sect Leader.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “No need. These are enough.”","After that, Zhang Han put away the Red Snow Gemstones.","He also took out dozens of kinds of eighth-tier spirit treasures. “Please accept these.”","Ke Chen’e and Ke Chentao looked at each other.","According to what Ke Chen’e told him and the fact that he didn’t want to see the Sect Leader now, the two people seemed to have confirmed something.","“Mr. Zhang, the divine thunder over the sky has a great impact on you, right?” Ke Chen’e laughed.","“That’s right.”","“You’d better keep the spiritual treasures. Your strength is still recovering. You need them,” Ke Chentao said.","“It doesn’t matter.”","Zhang Han chuckled and said, “These are just weapons and spiritual treasures. They are not important to me.”","“Ha... Everyone knows that Han Yang Immortal is also called Immortal Master Money God. You are as rich as a country and have countless spiritual treasures.” Ke Chentao laughed and said, “Actually, I also want to see how many spirit treasures you have.”","“Oh?”","Zhang Han said with a faint smile, “Haven’t you seen so many spiritual treasures before?”","“I haven’t.” Ke Chen sighed.","Ke Chentao sighed. “We’ve been outside for so many years but haven’t seen so many spiritual treasures yet. Moreover, spiritual treasures are very important for our cultivation. Immortal Master Money God, since I’ve given you so many Red Snow Gemstones, shouldn’t you repay us with some better spiritual herbs and spiritual treasures?”","“I see.”","Zhang Han sighed softly and said with some emotion, “I still remember that you were innocent at that time. Sure enough, you have changed after so many years.”","“Ha,” Ke Chen’e said. “I’m flattered. Also, we don’t like to be innocent. Is it equal to saying we were stupid? Han Yang Immortal, we are not young and ignorant anymore. We know how rich you are. The wine you just drank contains the ninth-tier poisonous herb’s invisible dew. It makes your cultivation level unable to be used in a short time. That’s enough. Take out your spiritual treasures, and we can consider sparing your life.”","“Are you not afraid of me?” Zhang Han shook his head gently and said, “Are you sure that I’m not a ninth-level Immortal Master?”","“Of course, we can feel it from all kinds of details,” Ke Chen’e said. “First of all, when you went to the secret realm, you kept a low profile and hid in the crowd. It is not in line with your identity as an Immortal Master in the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage. Secondly, the speed and aura you showed were far from the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage. Thirdly, you were lucky enough to survive the divine thunder over the sky. You couldn’t recover and reach your Peak-Stage cultivation. In addition, all kinds of details along the way explain everything.”","“You have good insight.” Zhang Han took another sip of wine and said, “You are cautious.”","“No. I just wanted to have a chance to obtain a huge amount of spiritual treasures. You’re just an Immortal Master who is thought to have died. It doesn’t matter even if you really die,” Ke Chentao said flatly. “This world is different. Han Yang Immortal, hand over the spiritual treasures quickly, or I’ll take action.”","“Why are you so sure that the wine is useful to me?”","Zhang Han suddenly revealed a mysterious smile.","Ke Chen’e’s heart skipped a beat.","“Go to hell!”","Ke Chentao was more straightforward. As a cultivator in the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage, he attacked very fast. The long sword in his right hand pierced Zhang Han’s dantian at lightning speed.","Sizzling!","However, Zhang Han dodged.","The Thunder Body didn’t get hurt.","He suddenly turned into a small bolt of lightning and flew away.","“What kind of supernatural power is this?” Ke Chen’e’s pupils contracted.","“Seal the sect!”","Ke Chentao’s expression was dark and crushed a command token.","Buzz!","The Heaven-earth Formation on the periphery of the whole sect rose layer by layer and sealed off the sect.","“Sure enough, he doesn’t have high strength.”","Ke Chentao’s eyes were cold. “Kill!”","He chased after Zhang Han.","The seventh-tier Tribulation Stage was indeed powerful.","Zhang Han was fourth-tier. He was no match for the other party with the Thunder Body.","However, it was not easy to catch the Thunder Body.","Zhang Han turned into lightning and covered the sky.","After a while, the Immortal Masters of the Mountain River Sect flew out one after another and began to catch Zhang Han within the range of the sect formation in the sky.","However, even if they used incantations, illusions, sharp sword light, and supernatural power, they couldn’t find Zhang Han at all.","The bolt of lightning was very slippery. It was difficult to deal with.","Ke Chentao laughed coldly. “With such explosive energy, let’s see how long you can last!","“Inside the sect, those above the Immortal Master continue to besiege and kill!","“This thief is our enemy. If you can catch him, I’ll reward you handsomely!”","Now, Zhang Han had nowhere to hide in the sky.","Ke Chentao firmly believed that he wouldn’t be able to escape for long.","Zhang Han’s supernatural power could turn his body into thunder and lightning. Although it was indeed powerful, what was the use of it?","“All your spirit treasures will be mine.”","Ke Chentao and his brother looked very excited.","This was the joy because of the imminent victory!"]},{"number":1631,"title":"Chapter 1631 Raiding Everything","paragraphs":["Chapter 1631 Raiding Everything","“How detestable!”","On the other side, Zhang Han told everyone about the situation over there.","Mengmeng said angrily, “Aren’t they repaying kindness with ingratitude?”","“It’s normal for people’s minds to change.” Yue Wuwei touched his beard and said, “Even if they’re close, it happens. For example, Ning Chen and the others might have become Zhang Han’s enemies back then.”","“Well, they didn’t, did they?” Chen Chuan said.","“I’m just talking about that possibility. There are no absolutes in the world, so Ning Chen and the others are trustworthy, and it’s also related to their personalities.” Yue Wuwei said, “These two brothers are a bad example.”","Seeing Zhang Han close his eyes for a while, Zi Yan couldn’t help asking, “How’s it going over there?”","“It’s okay. I can’t be caught for the time being, but if I want to escape, I need to break the sect’s grand formation.”","Zhang Han frowned slightly and said, “There are some Red Snow Gemstones in their treasure house. I’ll go and get them.”","Swoosh!","Zhang Han leaped forward.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared.","Not only did it have a strong defense, but it also had strong innate abilities. For example, it could dig holes and hide its aura.","Under everyone’s gaze, the Golden-armored Giant Beast flew into the distance and kept shrinking.","This was the first time the beast had gone out.","Clack! Clack!","When the Golden-armored Giant Beast arrived at the periphery of the Mountain River Sect, it gnawed on the Bounded Domain on the top of a mountain. Energy fluctuations were frequent. In just five seconds, a gap appeared in the barrier without anyone noticing.","It then entered the sect.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast hid underground without any movement, so it was difficult for others to detect it.","As for the two duplications, the Thunder Body kept fleeing in the air. According to its understanding of the sect’s terrain, the Golden-armored Giant Beast kept digging holes and moving forward.","It would take at least a few months to find the treasure vault by searching the halls one by one.","“Kill him! Kill him!”","On a tree, a young Dao Seeking Cultivator clenched his fists and shouted excitedly, “Kill the enemy! Let him see how powerful the Mountain River Sect is! I only hate that I haven’t reached the Tribulation Stage yet, otherwise, I must...”","“Awooo!”","Suddenly, a golden light broke out of the soil. A figure more than 10 meters tall opened its mouth and swallowed the Dao Seeking Cultivator at the Peak Stage of the Mastery Realm.","“So disgusting!”","Zhang Han felt quite disgusted although he didn’t eat that man and just absorbed him into another Alternate Space, digested his flesh, and refined his soul.","“The treasure house is over there, guarded by an elder at the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","Zhang Han pondered for a while.","He looked to the right. “I’d better be careful. The Thunder Body will attract the firepower. I’ll lure him out before raiding the treasure house.”","Sizzle!","Zhang Han’s Thunder Body was constantly attacked, and some of the enemies’ moves could indeed hit him.","“Kill him!”","“Military formation. Form a military formation and kill the enemy together!”","The elders above summoned another group of cultivators at the second and third tiers of the Tribulation Stage. There were more than 800 of them. In just one second, they formed a military formation.","The First Elder, Ke Chentao, ordered via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Let’s focus on trapping him. I’ll kill him myself!”","“If he is directly beaten to death and his Space Ring explodes, all those treasures will be lost into the void.","“Dammit! Why is he still able to move?!”","Ke Chentao was furious.","“He’s clearly poisoned, but he can still move freely.","“He deserves to be called Han Yang Immortal!","“His means are amazing. I’m impressed.","“But he still stands no chance of escape today!”","Ke Chentao felt that it would be very troublesome for his enemy to return the spiritual treasures. But now that they had fallen out with each other, he had no choice but to kill the other party, even if he gained nothing.","“Heaven Covering Net!”","Nearly a thousand cultivators at the Tribulation Stage performed a fierce supernatural power.","A dense red net targeted Zhang Han.","It seemed to be covering heaven and earth, and its target wouldn’t get to escape.","Zhang Han turned into lightning and fled in all directions. When the big net came, he directly broke through the energy and flew out of many holes in the net.","The net didn’t work on him at all.","Ke Chen’e launched a supernatural power that Zhang Han had once used, the Star Plucking Hand.","The huge palm composed of energy slapped Zhang Han.","The energy contained in it was earth-shattering.","Poof!","The Star Plucking Hand hit Zhang Han’s Thunder Body.","The Star Plucking Hand, with the help of the military formation, made the Thunder Body slow down a little. If it were the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, it would be more difficult to escape.","After all, the Thunder Body was a spiritual body, a being that transcended the Cultivation World.","Even though it had just begun to grow, its power was definitely not something that a fourth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator could compare to.","Therefore, an unprecedented pursuit began in the Mountain River Sect.","“Kill, kill him!”","“You can’t escape!”","Five hours passed.","“Damn it, why is he so difficult to deal with?”","No matter how hard those people tried, they couldn’t hit Zhang Han, which made them feel uncomfortable.","“Come here!”","An Immortal Master shouted angrily, “Little thief, you only dare to escape in the sky. Do you dare to fight me head-on?!”","“Trash, you’re nothing.”","Someone cursed, “If you dare, fight me head-on.","“If you win, you can leave!","“Do you dare to stop?!","“...”","But no matter how they cursed, it was useless.","At this point, words had lost their effectiveness.","Living was the most important thing.","As for Zhang Han, there was a reason why he didn’t take action for a long time.","“This is it.”","The Thunder Body slightly narrowed his eyes and looked at a hall below. The back hall was where the treasure house was.","“After fleeing for so long, it’s time to make things a little difficult for you.”","Zhang Han smiled faintly.","The Thunder Body took human form.","“I told you, you can’t run away.”","Ke Chentao slowed down from a distance and clasped his hands behind his back. “You’re no longer the powerful one you used to be, and I’m no longer the weaker one I used to be. You’d better not force me to be ruthless. Come over obediently and tell me what I need to know. Then, I’ll consider leaving you alive. Otherwise, you’ll end up dead.”","The other Immortal Masters and low-ranking Immortal Masters in the military formation grew closer.","“Hahaha!”","Ke Chen’e laughed and said, “Are you finally out of strength? Keep running. I’d like to see how long you can run. The sect’s formation has been activated. You’re just a bird in a cage now, and you will die today!”","“Heh.”","In the eyes of the public, as well as the tens of thousands of Mountain River Sect disciples watching the battle in the mountains below, Zhang Han suddenly smiled faintly.","He put his hands behind his back and said slowly, “You two are really an eye-opener. I didn’t expect that I would encounter this.”","“What do you mean?” Ke Chen’e frowned. He didn’t want others in the sect to know the specific reason, so he said in advance, “I kindly took you back to the sect. I saw that you were talented, so I wanted to cultivate you. But I didn’t expect that you would repay kindness with ingratitude and try to steal our treasures, as well as the Profound-grade treasures I got from the secret realms. You’re such an ungrateful bastard. I’ll definitely kill you today!”","He made unfounded countercharges and sounded sincere.","He had succeeded. At the very least, everyone in the Mountain River Sect believed in Ke Chen’e and Ke Chentao. No matter what Zhang Han said, it would be useless.","But he didn’t intend to tell the truth out loud. He just sighed with emotion.","“It’s time to have some fun.”","Zhang Han pointed forward with his right hand.","Buzz!","His eyes turned into two thunderbolts.","“Thunder Willow! Suppress!","“Thunderbolt Crocodile!","“Thunder Sea!","“Wind of Lightning!”","He unleashed all four of his supernatural powers.","“It’s the Thunder Control Technique.”","Ke Chentao said in a deep voice, “Defense!”","Up ahead, the sky within a radius of five kilometers was filled with lightning.","The incomparably huge Thunder Willow whipped in all directions.","The Thunderbolt Crocodile attacked Ke Chentao, restricting his other moves.","The Thunder Sea attacked the battle formation.","As for the Wind of Lightning, it attacked the onlookers in the mountains below.","“Defense!”","Ke Chen’e roared angrily.","He also felt quite desperate. He didn’t expect that the attack power of Han Yang Immortal was close to that of the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage.","“He’s even more powerful than me.","“Fortunately, I’ve been careful on the way. Otherwise, I’ll probably end up dead if I give myself away.”","Han Yang Immortal was the formidable man who had destroyed 10 super sects and slaughtered countless people at the Tribulation Stage.","At first, they didn’t notice the Wind of Lightning below.","When they detected it-","“Shit!","“Retreat!”","Ke Chentao roared angrily, “Stop right there!”","The Wind of Lightning, like an ordinary breeze, reached the mountain range below. Suddenly, countless tiny lightning bolts like blades appeared and poured down.","Before many people could react, the breeze arrived in front of them.","This supernatural power could kill at least thousands of disciples.","However, was it really impossible to defend against it?","Ke Chentao looked in the direction of the treasure vault hall.","“You’ve gone too far by attacking ordinary disciples.”","A soft sigh spread across the area.","The seventh-tier Tribulation Stage expert guarding the treasure vault hall had appeared.","“Immortal Master Liangmu!”","Ke Chentao cupped his hands together.","Immortal Master Liangmu was known as a seventh-tier Tribulation Stage master. But in fact, he had already made a breakthrough. As early as decades ago, he had already reached the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage, but he had never made a move. Many disciples of the sect did not know about it.","But as the First Elder, Ke Chentao was very clear about this.","“Your Thunder Control Technique is the most exquisite one I’ve ever seen.”","Immortal Master Liangmu slowly rose into the air. Dressed in cloth robes and with white hair, he said in a faint tone, “Hand over the Thunder Control Technique, and I can send you out of the Keriduo Planet.”","Swoosh!","Ke Chentao’s eyes flickered with unwillingness, but he didn’t dare to say anything.","The elder group of the Mountain River Sect consisted of many high-position officials, but the Law Enforcement Hall was superior to the group.","Therefore, Ke Chentao, the First Elder, did not have a particularly high status. He was equivalent to the CEO of the company with a group of board members superior to him.","“Even if you’re sent out, I can still hunt you down.” Ke Chentao sneered in his heart.","Han Yang Immortal was too famous.","Ke Chentao felt that Zhang Han would agree to the request of Immortal Master Liangmu, which was the only way for him to survive.","However, things did not go as Ke Chentao had expected.","Plop!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast broke through the ground in the treasure house. The defensive layer was useless to it.","Its eyes were very dexterous, and Zhang Han injected a lot of his soul sense into them.","“There are so many spiritual treasures.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast blinked.","“I’ll swallow them!”","The Giant Mouth Image appeared.","Many treasures were absorbed into the Alternate Space.","It was a pure raid.","“Red Snow Gemstones?","“There are more than 300 of them, as well as 26 ninth-tier Red Snow Gemstones.","“Hahaha, this trip is not in vain!”","Zhang Han didn’t show any courteousness and raided the treasure vault."]},{"number":1632,"title":"Chapter 1632 Chase Into the Starry Sky","paragraphs":["Chapter 1632 Chase Into the Starry Sky","After all, it was a sect in the Underwater Abyss World.","Although some of the treasures were in the Space Rings of the elders or the Sect Leader, there were many nice treasures in the treasure vault.","In particular, there were more than 300 Red Snow Gemstones, which showed the strength of the sect.","“I’ve gained quite a bit.","“It’s time to retreat!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast turned around, burrowed into the ground, and quickly slipped out.","At this moment, the face of Immortal Master Liangmu also changed, because he felt that there was a strange fluctuation in the treasure vault.","He flashed back.","When he saw the empty treasury, he was stunned on the spot.","“Who, who did this?!”","He was furious. He turned around and went out, staring at Zhang Han in the sky. “Was it you?”","“What do you mean?” Zhang Han smiled faintly.","“Humph! Lock down the entire sect. This villain colluded with others to raid the treasure vault of the sect. Capture him!”","As soon as Immortal Master Liangmu finished speaking, he moved and rushed to Zhang Han.","The expressions of the others changed completely.","“What?!”","“The treasure vault has been raided?”","Ke Chentao’s expression was gloomy. “He actually has helpers?”","Ke Chen’e frowned and said, “That shouldn’t be the case. There were only the two of us all along the way, and no one else followed us. Moreover, he’s always acting alone. Could it be that there’s a spy in the sect?”","Ke Chentao said to Ke Chen’e via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “No matter who it is, we must lock down the entire sect and capture him!”","At this point, Ke Chentao was determined to kill Zhang Han.","“If I don’t kill him, with his terrifying growth and previous experience, it won’t be difficult for him to return to the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier. But what about the two of us? We still have a long way to go before we reach the ninth tier.","“The further we cultivate, the harder it will be to make a breakthrough and the more terrifying the Heavenly Tribulation will be. Unless it is a safe situation, who would dare undergo the Heavenly Tribulation?”","“Get down!”","Immortal Master Liangmu stretched out his right hand.","The power of the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage was on full display. The incomparably terrifying fluctuations were spreading like a breeze. Before his move hit his target, the Qi had already spread out.","A huge cloud hand quickly condensed and slapped down from the side.","Clack! Clack! Clack!","The space was sealed, and there was no way to escape. Only a head-on fight could block this move.","For ordinary Dao Seeking Cultivators, this might be a dead end.","After all, an eighth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator was formidable.","However, Zhang Han wouldn’t get hurt by many attacks with his soul body.","“It’s not that easy to kill me.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly. Before the attack hit him-","Hiss!","Like a fast loach, he ran straight to another place.","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Liangmu was slightly taken aback. Then, he smiled faintly and said, “No wonder you dared to come to the Mountain River Sect. You do have some skills. But you just keep running away. This is what you get to do only before you die.”","Boom!","In an instant, Immortal Master Liangmu caught up with Zhang Han at an incredible speed, which was 20 times faster than the speed of sound.","“Surround and eliminate this man. We must capture him!”","Ke Chentao roared angrily.","The Immortal Masters around rushed up.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Immortal Master Liangmu kept launching his attacks at the back.","He was trying to see what kind of move could make the strange Dao Seeking Cultivator stop.","Finally, he found the right way.","“Space Sealing Jade.”","Profound energy covered the sky and the earth. Zhang Han felt that his speed had been greatly restricted by this kind of immortal method as if he had fallen into the water.","“Fortunately, I’m not too far from the outer layer of the sect.”","Zhang Han’s eyes narrowed slightly.","He divided his attention to controlling the Thunder Body and the Golden-armored Giant Beast at the same time to flee quickly in one direction.","Gradually, a team of attackers appeared in front of him.","Boom!","Immortal Master Liangmu once again broke Zhang Han’s Thunder Body with his sword-commanding skill.","Thunderbolts flickered and gathered again.","The Thunder Body’s aura was much weaker.","The more this was the case, the more interested Immortal Master Liangmu was.","“This Thunder Control Technique is truly powerful.","“Don’t kill him. Catch him.”","Immortal Master Liangmu gave the order.","As soon as he said that, Ke Chentao and Ke Chen’e looked at each other and smiled bitterly in their hearts.","They might not have a chance to get Han Yang Immortal’s many spiritual treasures.","“We’ve done so much work, but our efforts are in vain?”","At this time, the two of them had the same thought. They hoped that Zhang Han could escape from the sect area. Only in this way could they chase him for a long time.","Immortal Master Liangmu was very powerful, but he couldn’t keep chasing after Zhang Han. He was still very busy with the affairs of the sect.","Thus, Ke Chentao and Ke Chen’e slowed down and reduced the frequency and energy of their attacks.","“But can he really escape?","“The chances are slim!”","Ke Chentao felt a little indignant.","“Couldn’t he just take out the spirit treasures earlier?","“As Han Yang Immortal, Immortal Master Money God, can’t he be more straightforward?”","He vented all his anger on Zhang Han.","Just like that, the pursuit had begun.","A few hours later, Zhang Han’s aura was 30% weaker than before.","“This Immortal Master Liangmu is very powerful. He almost destroyed the Thunder Body several times. I’ve lost 30 percent of my Source Energy. Fortunately, I still have the Thunder Tower.”","If it weren’t for the constant replenishment of the Source Energy in the Thunder Tower, Zhang Han would have lost his Thunder Body a long time ago.","Although he could afford to lose it, it would not be necessary. Zhang Han could completely condense his Thunder Body into his Original Body.","However, the Thunder Body also held a Profound-grade treasure that could simulate an aura, as well as dozens of Red Snow Gemstones.","As long as he could hold on, Zhang Han would.","Finally-","“Is he trying to get close to the outer layer?”","“Is the Heaven-earth Formation something you can break through?”","Immortal Master Liangmu sneered from behind. “You underestimate our Mountain River Sect too much.”","As soon as he finished speaking-","“Seal!”","Holding the token in his hand, he controlled the Heaven-earth Formation. The surging energy turned into a cage and rushed toward Zhang Han.","Right at this moment when everyone thought that Zhang Han was going to be caught.","Clack!","Under everyone’s gaze, a gap appeared in the solid Heaven-earth Formation. A golden light could be seen there. It flickered and then disappeared from the ground.","“What is that?”","Sizzle!","The Thunder Body seized the opportunity, turned into a bolt of lightning, and rushed out at an extremely fast speed.","“Shit!”","Ke Chentao was delighted in his heart but showed a darkened look on his face. “We can’t let him escape! Immortal Master Liangmu, I’ll take the lead and chase after him!”","Immortal Master Liangmu frowned, glanced at him, and did not go back. Instead, he took the lead in opening the Heaven-earth Formation and looking at the layer of lightning in the sky not far away.","“Go after him!”","He personally led the team to chase after Zhang Han.","Ke Chentao’s eyes darkened.","He suddenly took out something. It was a palm-sized skull.","It was not a natural magic treasure, but the skull of a clansman of a rare clan, the Mordosard Clan.","It could be refined into a supreme treasure according to its unique nature and ability.","“Soul Source Incantation!”","Ke Chentao was quite capable.","With the help of the supreme treasure, he cast a spell that targeted the soul.","Clatter!","There was suddenly a layer of red mist around Zhang Han’s Thunder Body. It quickly approached Zhang Han as if it was going to leave a seal on him.","“Incantation?”","Zhang Han frowned slightly.","If the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure were here, he would be able to break this kind of incantation easily.","However, the Thunder Body was not easy to deal with this kind of soul-type incantation.","It could not harm the Thunder Body, but it could locate it.","“Soul Connection.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment. Looking at the red light printed on his arms, he injected half of his mind into the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“Hmm?”","Sure enough, Ke Chentao was stunned.","“Why are there two soul targets?”","This incantation locked onto the enemy’s soul.","Zhang Han could also control the number of his soul senses in his duplication to confuse the enemy.","“Forget it. If they chase after me, I’ll be able to kill them.”","Without hesitation, Zhang Han focused 80% of his mind on the Thunder Body and fled to the sky.","“Let’s go!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast returned to Yue Wuwei’s boat, turned into a streak of golden light, and disappeared into Zhang Han’s arm. Zhang Han said, “The Mountain River Sect is hunting me down. Let’s leave Keriduo Planet first and follow aside.”","“If you dissipate your Thunder Body, won’t you be able to escape directly?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“It won’t help.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “It will take us several years to fly back to the Highest Clouds Palace. Those two people will probably hunt me down for a long time. When the time comes, let’s find an opportunity to kill them.”","“Okay, okay.”","Yue Wuwei said in high spirits, “We’ll find an opportunity to get rid of the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage man and then get rid of the two guys who bit the hand that fed them.”","Swoosh!","Yue Wuwei controlled the boat to fly into the air at the same time in the distance.","His boat was also a Profound-grade treasure, which was faster than Zhang Han’s Thunder Body.","Almost at the same time, they dived into the bottom of the sea, passed through the dark deep sea, came to the shallow sea, and broke out of the water.","Immortal Master Liangmu was still chasing after Zhang Han. Ke Chentao and Ke Chen’e followed closely behind, and the other teams of Immortal Master were at the rear.","“Where do you think you are going?”","Immortal Master Liangmu was furious.","He could feel that Zhang Han was only at the fifth-tier Tribulation Stage but was still able to escape in front of him. If the news got out, it would not do good to Immortal Master Liangmu.","Most importantly, he really wanted to learn his opponent’s incredible Thunder Control Technique.","If Zhang Han didn’t say it, no one would know that he was not controlling thunder, but that his Thunder Body did all the work.","But there was nothing Immortal Master Liangmu could do about it.","If he used special methods, he might not be able to keep the other party. He would have to consume some ninth-tier spiritual treasures. The loss outweighed the gain.","“Amazing, truly amazing.”","He saw the other party break through the clouds and enter the void of the universe.","Immortal Master Liangmu stopped and sighed softly. “I’m impressed. You’re amazing.”","After that, he turned around and was about to leave.","“Immortal Master Liangmu, let’s continue our pursuit!”","Ke Chentao said angrily, “He deceived us. I can’t take it lying down. We must kill him.”","“The chance of catching up with him is very slim, but... it’s up to you.”","Immortal Master Liangmu hesitated for a moment and did not say anything more. Although the First Elder was his subordinate, he still had some dignity in the sect, so it did not matter to Immortal Master Liangmu if he was willing to chase after Zhang Han.","Ke Chentao said to Zhang Han via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “You can’t escape, Han Yang Immortal. Don’t even think about it. My incantation can last for ten years. In your current state, can you escape for ten years?”","“Are you scared?” said Zhang Han.","“How can I be scared?” Ke Chentao said.","“Are you afraid that I’ll kill you after my strength recovers?” Zhang Han said in a flat tone, “You two brothers were once in power, but you remain nobodies. After cultivating for more than a thousand years, you’ve only reached the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage, and your aptitude is ordinary. If you two leave now, I may not bother to kill you without seeing you any longer.”","He told the truth.","If they escaped, Zhang Han would not be in the mood to deal with them.","However, to Ke Chentao, what Zhang Han said showed that he was timid."]},{"number":1633,"title":"Chapter 1633 Attack","paragraphs":["Chapter 1633 Attack","“You can’t hold on for long!”","Ke Chentao’s killing intent surged.","At the same time, Ke Chen’e went to a king vessel with more than 20 Immortal Masters.","They entered the secondary space and appeared in the distance in front of Zhang Han.","They also began to use all kinds of offensive means or seals within the spaceships to attack.","As expected, it didn’t affect Zhang Han at all.","“As expected, he’s amazing.”","Ke Chentao sighed in his heart.","“He deserves to be called Han Yang Immortal. The gap between our strengths is so big, and he was even able to escape from Immortal Master Liangmu. Now he has various ways to deal with our attacks.","“However, he won’t get to escape.”","Ke Chentao’s eyes were cold as he chased after Zhang Han. Occasionally, he launched a few attacks.","At the same time, Zhang Han sent part of his will into his Original Body.","Zhang Han opened his eyes and said, “That’s it for now. The Thunder Body is fleeing outside. We will do what we should do.”","“Isn’t it a waste of time?”","Yue Wuwei said, “I think I should go slaughter Ke Chen’e’s spaceship. With my strength, Ke Chentao can’t do anything to me.”","“Be careful. There’s no hurry,” Zhang Han said. “The Golden-armored Giant Beast has begun to devour the Red Snow Gemstones. The effect is very good. It’s not far from making a breakthrough. Let’s wait a little longer.”","“Dad, you should be careful.” Mengmeng reminded him.","“Don’t worry.”","Zhang Han touched Mengmeng’s head. He then looked at her and said with a smile, “I’ll deal with the nobodies outside after the breakthrough. A Thunder Body is enough for them to chase for several years.”","“I believe that you will defeat them, Uncle Zhang.” Chen Chuan cheered from the side.","Yue Wuwei glanced at him and said, “Compared with focusing on cheering, you have to speed up your cultivation.”","“Well, okay.”","Chen Chuan nodded honestly.","They had talked about it last time. Now, Chen Changqing and the others were still on their way back to the Star Sea. It would take decades for them to meet their old acquaintances. Although it would be a long time, if they worked hard to cultivate, decades would pass quickly.","Now that Chen Chuan was an adult, Yue Wuwei asked him if he wanted to stand out. The answer was yes. So Yue Wuwei taught him a lot of things about cultivation in person.","Zhang Han had already taught Chen Chuan cultivation methods, and Yue Wuwei had taught him the ways of cultivation.","Chen Chuan was quite hard-working and had been cultivating diligently.","Mengmeng and Yue Xiaonao were no exception.","They didn’t have much to do in Yue Wuwei ‘s boat, so they could only cultivate to relieve their boredom.","However, Zi Yan and Lisa were quite idle.","They had nothing to do but drink tea, chat, or watch TV series with electronic devices.","As for Zhang Han, he was experiencing the transformation of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“I didn’t expect the effect of the Red Snow Gemstones to be so good.”","Even Zhang Han himself was a little shocked.","The Red Snow Gemstones contained a special metal Elemental Energy.","Every time the Golden-armored Giant Beast absorbed and digested a piece, its strength wouldn’t improve much, but the energy it emitted would make its Alternate Space bigger.","“A ninth-tier Red Snow Gemstone can enlarge the Alternate Space by hundreds of meters. This kind of energy integration is too terrifying.”","There was always a saying that the more suitable the spiritual treasure, the better it would be. It was not about its level.","Obviously, the Red Snow Gemstone was one of the most suitable supreme treasures for the Golden-armored Giant Beast at this stage of growth.","There were some that were much better than it, but Zhang Han was already very lucky to have obtained hundreds of Red Snow Gemstones.","“There’re 26 pieces of ninth-tier Red Snow Gemstones. One is about 500 meters long.","“After they are absorbed, the Alternate Space will be very big by enlarging by 13 thousand meters. I can devour more metals at one time, and the absorption speed will be faster.","“Unfortunately, the amount I can absorb each kind of treasure is limited. I may not be able to absorb more than ten thousand.”","Zhang Han calmed down.","He let the Golden-armored Giant Beast begin its absorption.","The second Red Snow Gemstone was still about 500 meters long. The third one, the fourth one, and the tenth one had become more than 400 meters long.","The effect was decreasing, which was not strange.","20 ninth-tier gems had been absorbed.","But the Golden-armored Giant Beast was still hungry.","The hunger it brought made Zhang Han a little uncomfortable.","“Fortunately, the treasure vault of the Mountain River Sect has a lot of eighth-tier and ninth-tier metals.”","In the Alternate Space of the Golden-armored Giant Beast, the energy was surging. Apart from the Red Snow Gemstones, the energy began to devour the metal placed not far away.","Clatter!","It was like a harvesting machine harvesting straw in the soil. The metal turned into dregs at a speed visible to the naked eye.","The majestic energy began to fill the Golden-armored Giant Beast and ease its hunger.","“This is great!","“Nice.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast was hidden in Zhang Han’s skin. It turned over comfortably and continued to absorb the metal energy.","From hunger to fullness, it began to digest the metal. After digesting it, the Golden-armored Giant Beast grew bigger and bigger rapidly.","“How terrifying.","“After all, it is from the higher world. Its growth speed is much faster than that of Tiny Tot.”","Zhang Han himself was the Golden-armored Giant Beast, so he had experienced a lot.","“I’ll continue to absorb the Red Snow Gemstones.","“The metal should be enough to eat three more times. After that, I’ll start devouring the metal outside.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment and continued to absorb the Red Snow Gemstones.","After the ninth-tier ones were absorbed, he began to absorb the eighth-tier ones. During this period, he felt hungry for the second time.","The Alternate Space was more than several times larger. When the Golden-armored Giant Beast’s stomach became bigger, it would eat more.","Zhang Han had thought that the metal was enough for him to eat three times, but he finished off more than half of it in one go.","“Next time, I might have to go out and look for more metal after taking a few bites.”","Zhang Han smiled bitterly to himself.","“This thing requires a huge amount of resources. It will cost me a lot.”","After another round of absorption, the Golden-armored Giant Beast was already a thousand meters tall.","It was much smaller than Tiny Tot, but its combat capability was even more terrifying.","“I can’t resist the hunger. Among my duplications, you’re the most troublesome. Whenever you’re hungry, you’ll make a scene.”","Zhang Han took a light breath.","If the Golden-armored Giant Beast had its own consciousness, it might have said with some grievance, “That’s bullshit. The Great Demon Body has a planet’s nourishment, which is enough for it to absorb the energy to reach the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier. The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure is not short of food. The Extreme Purity Immortal Body hasn’t appeared yet. The Thunder Body can just swallow the tribulation thunder. I have nothing. Why can’t I eat any metal?”","If it had its own unique ideas, Zhang Han would probably be scared out of his wits.","Both the duplication and the Original Body were Zhang Han.","The feeling of hunger originated from the depths of his soul.","“It’s time to go out and exercise.”","Zhang Han said, “Let’s go back to the king vessel and look for metal.”","So everyone returned to the king vessel.","“Beep! Beep! Beep! The detection shows that there is no main planet ahead. The metallic energy accounted for 46 percent.”","Although the metal was not high-quality and was only at about the level of a third-tier spirit treasure, there was a lot of it.","“After swallowing this planet, the Golden-armored Giant Beast should be able to make a breakthrough.”","Zhang Han’s eyes lit up slightly.","Under the gaze of Mengmeng and the others, the thousand-meter-tall Golden-armored Giant Beast turned into a stream of light and smashed into the surface of the planet like a ball, stirring up dust.","The amount of metal on the planet began to drop.","The entire cultivation process took more than half a year.","There were not many Red Snow Gemstones left.","In the outside world.","“I truly never expected that you would be able to escape for over half a year.”","Ke Chentao took a deep breath.","He cursed in his heart. “I’m tired, but you’re not at all tired?”","But he showed admiration on his face. “You deserve to be called Han Yang Immortal. I’m impressed. But in this way, I will have to kill you. If you don’t die, my brother and I will never have peace.”","“Is that so?”","Zhang Han spread out his hands and said, “You can have a try.”","“There’s no hurry. Even if it takes five years or ten years, I will hunt you down.”","Ke Chentao took out another medicinal pellet and took it. Then, he sped up and chased after Zhang Han.","The king vessel circled around. Ke Chen’e and the others were all dispirited. From time to time, they would curse.","“You can only run away. Come and fight me if you can!”","“You’re just an ant to us. If we fight head-on, I’ll cut off your head within three moves!”","“...”","They cursed and launched a few attacks from time to time. Since they didn’t work, those people just watched from the side.","The pursuit lasted for two days.","“Why is he going around in circles?","“What’s going on?","“Is he toying with us?”","Some people were angry, and another round of attacks began.","At this time, the Golden-armored Giant Beast was rapidly devouring the mental energy.","Its aura was also rising steadily.","When it reached a certain critical point-","Buzz!","Without the Heavenly Tribulation, the Golden-armored Giant Beast naturally made a breakthrough.","It reached the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","At the same time, in the spaceship, the energy of Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Great Demon Body inside him, and even the Thunder Body had changed.","They made a breakthrough at the same time.","“What a powerful feeling.”","Zhang Han was sure that since the Golden-armored Giant Beast was covered with golden scales, Ke Chentao could not break its defense.","Its formidable defensive ability was what made it stand at the top of the Cultivation World.","“It’s time to counterattack.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly opened its eyes. Its huge eyes were pale golden and full of spirituality.","Swoosh!","The devouring was over.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast soared into the sky and easily broke into the secondary space.","When it arrived at the spaceship, it had already turned into a small one-meter-high figure.","“It’s time for exercise, Elder Yue.","“Honey, call Tiny Tot out. You’ll be very safe in its Alternate Space.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast spoke in human language.","It was even called Zi Yan honey.","Zi Yan grinned and felt very awkward. “Can’t you let your Original Body speak?”","“Ahem, I forgot.”","Zhang Han’s Original Body smiled awkwardly.","“Hee hee, it’s fun.” Mengmeng ran to the Golden-armored Giant Beast and looked it up and down. “You can speak now, not howl.”","“It has grown up a little,” Zhang Han said with a smile. “Let’s go to Tiny Tot’s Alternate Space.”","Mengmeng put away the king vessel. After Tiny Tot appeared, Zhang Han, Zi Yan, and the others entered the Alternate Space.","“Coo? Coo?”","Tiny Tot looked at the Golden-armored Giant Beast next to it and was lost in thought.","“What... what is this thing?","“It seems to be quite powerful. I’ve never seen it before!","“Can I eat it?”","“What are you looking at? I’m your host’s husband.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast opened its mouth and spoke in human language.","“Coo!”","Tiny Tot was startled. Its eyes were wide open, and its face was full of confusion.","“What the hell?","“This is unbelievable.","“Oh my god, it is also an Exotic Beast.”","“Just watch from the side.”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and said with a smile, “We’ll go and kill some enemies. It’s been so long, and it’s now time to take action.”","“Let’s go.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast, 1,500 meters tall, flew forward at an extremely fast speed.","Yue Wuwei was next to it. Suddenly, he showed a strange look.","“Well, Tiny Tot has an Alternate Space, and so does the Golden-armored Giant Beast, right? Why don’t I stay in it for a while? You can fly faster.”","“What Alternate Space? There isn’t one.”","Zhang Han said grumpily, “Don’t even think about it. This is my duplication, not your mount.”","The Alternate Space could accommodate people.","However, it was filled with all kinds of metal energy and was not suitable for people to stay in it.","There was still an essential difference between the Golden-armored Giant Beast’s Alternate Space and that of Tiny Tot.","Tiny Tot used its Alternate Space to store food. The Golden-armored Giant Beast used it to devour and digest all kinds of metals.","It was essentially different.","Of course, even if it was possible, as a human being, Zhang Han would feel uncomfortable riding on the duplication of an Exotic Beast."]},{"number":1634,"title":"Chapter 1634 Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 1634 Battle","“You can’t escape, Han Yang Immortal. My Soul Seal is locked on you, and there is no way to break it.”","Ke Chenchao felt that the soul energy of Zhang Han’s Thunder Body was somewhat erratic.","He thought that Zhang Han was casting a spell to resist the Soul Seal.","He couldn’t help but sneer.","His Soul Seal was a move that he had studied for hundreds of years. How could it be broken so easily?","The seal would only last for ten years or so, once the time was up, it would dissipate. Once it was performed, those who were branded would have no way of undoing it.","At the very least, he felt that there was no way of undoing it.","In fact, this was just that Zhang Han’s sense had left the Thunder Body for the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","At this time, his Thunder Body had also been advanced to the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","It was very easy for the Thunder Body alone to kill Ke Chen’e and the others.","“I’ll take action when the duplication of the Golden-armored Giant Beast and Elder Yue are here.”","Zhang Han had a cold look in his eyes.","After dodging two killing moves, he suddenly adjusted his direction and flew toward Elder Yue, which would save him a lot of time.","At the same time, not far from the chasing area, a jet-black spaceship the size of a shark suddenly appeared.","In the central control room of the spaceship, there were about a dozen people. The leader was dressed in a black cloak. He was 2.5 meters tall, very burly, and had long arms.","A subordinate next to him cupped his hands and said, “Hall Master, this place is not far from our Qian Wind District. It’s also a barren area. I’m ready to undergo my tribulation. This time, I’ll live up to our expectations and become a fifth-tier Tribulation Stage expert!”","“Okay. It’s good to make a breakthrough as soon as possible. I’ve been the Hall Master of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Qian Wind District.” The Hall Master’s tone was a little emotional.","His name was Jiang Lijia, an eighth-tier Tribulation Stage master.","The Highest Clouds Palace had all its branches in the outer ring of the Star Sea. The Hall Masters were all at the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage. Starting from the inner ring of the Star Sea, the Hall Masters were ninth-tier Immortal Masters. As for the Palace Master of Highest Clouds Palace, he was at the Peak Stage of the ninth tier and was located in the Seventh Mountain Star Area, where the Highest Clouds Palace was one of the upper-tier forces. The Palace Master, Immortal Master Waterheaven, had a lot of influence. He was a big shot in that area.","“Hall Master.”","Another person laughed and said, “This time we’re going to the R12 branch in the inner ring of the Star Sea to have a meeting. Hall Master Li values you very much. I feel that when Palace Lord Li goes somewhere else, you may take over the R12 branch.”","“It’s still too early to say that.” Hall Master Jiang Lijia looked calm. “The development progress of the Highest Clouds Palace’s branches is very fast. Hall Master Li may go to a new district. Although he values me, if I can’t become a ninth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator, I can’t enter the inner ring of the Star Sea. This is the rule.”","“Hall Master, you’ve been at the eighth tier for more than a thousand years,” one of his subordinates said.","“The Heavenly Tribulation is terrifying. It isn’t that easy to overcome.” A hint of fear flashed across the depths of Jiang Lijia’s eyes.","Last time, he almost died from the seventh-tier Heavenly Tribulation where he broke through to the eighth tier. Now that he thought about it, he still had a lingering fear. After the tribulation, he had woken up from his dreams countless times.","Terrifying was the synonym for Heavenly Tribulation.","“Since ancient times, countless powerful figures have died under the Heavenly Tribulation. Before undergoing tribulation, you must be well prepared. You can go out and start it now.”","Hall Master Jiang Lijia waved his hand at his subordinate.","“Yes, Hall Master!”","The subordinate, who had been preparing for many years, left the spaceship and began to make preparations.","He prepared himself for three hours.","“Heavenly Tribulation, come to me!”","His momentum reached its peak.","The tribulation clouds slowly condensed at a very slow speed.","In fact, when many people were going through their tribulations, there were many situations. It took some people five or eight days to gather the tribulation clouds, while it took some others only a few seconds.","Was it because of the weather or other factors?","It had always been a mystery in the Cultivation World.","No one knew why there was a difference, but they all knew that the strength of the tribulation clouds represented the overall strength, talent, and other abilities of the tribulation takers.","“The tribulation clouds are gathering slowly. I’m afraid it will take a few days.”","Hall Master Jiang Lijia shook his head slightly.","He waited silently. A few days was equivalent to a blink of an eye.","However-","Sizzle!","A small bolt of lightning flashed in the tribulation clouds.","The Heavenly Tribulation seemed to have sensed something.","“Damn it, it’s that thunder thief!”","Therefore-","Clatter!","The tribulation clouds spread to dozens of miles wide in just two seconds.","Lightning flashed and thunder rumbled. It was as if the end of the world had arrived.","Lightning flickered, lighting up this entire world.","Even the spaceships in the hundreds of millions of miles around could sense this horrible fluctuation.","“Holy shit. The tribulation clouds are gathering so fast!”","“Why is the tribulation lightning flashing so quickly?”","“Not good. This is strange.”","Clatter!","Even Hall Master Jiang Lijia’s heart skipped a beat.","He immediately said, “Retreat! Order the spaceship to retreat a hundred miles!”","Swoosh!","The spaceship left quickly.","As for the subordinate who was undergoing the tribulation, he was dumbfounded and at a loss. He looked at the spaceship in a panic.","“Hall Master, what should I do?”","“Go all out to fight against the tribulation thunder!” said the Hall Master via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique from afar.","He calmed down a lot.","Of course, he was calm because he wasn’t the one undergoing the tribulation.","However, after waiting for a while-","“Hall Master, it’s been two hours. Why hasn’t the tribulation lightning appeared yet? Why is it striking randomly in the tribulation clouds? Isn’t it just a bluff?”","“How would I know?” Jiang Lijia’s tone was not very kind.","“How would I know the answer?","“Who in the entire Cultivation World would know about the Heavenly Tribulation?”","However, Zhang Han was very clear about that, because he felt it at this time.","“Someone is undergoing tribulation.”","As early as two hours ago, Zhang Han had sensed the aura.","Now two hours had passed.","Zhang Han chuckled and said, “It keeps the tribulation thunder from striking down, and its aura is bursting. It’s seducing me to go there. It seems that the tribulation cloud’s intelligence hasn’t grown much. It thinks that I will go there directly just because its performance is ordinary. It’s so naive.”","However, Zhang Han indeed planned to go there.","Now that he was at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage, it was no problem for him to deal with this tribulation cloud.","“It just so happens that my Thunder Body is hungry.”","Zhang Han breathed a sigh of relief, and his eyes lit up slightly.","He suddenly looked at Ke Chentao at the back and said, “Ke Chentao, Ke Chen’e, I’ve given you a chance.”","“Hahaha!”","Ke Chentao laughed wildly and said, “Are you bluffing? Do you think I’m scared of you? Listen! With your temper, Han Yang Immortal, if you could, you would have attacked us long ago. Why would you wait until now? I think you’re at the end of your rope and can’t continue your escape. Hand over the Space Treasures obediently, and I will spare you!”","“Is that so?”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “How could you be so courageous?”","“With your meager strength, how dare you put on airs with us?”","Ke Chen’e’s curse came from the king vessel not far away. “Han Yang Immortal. Bah! You’re just a nobody in our eyes. If you dare to stop, I can crush you with one hand. You...”","Boom!","Before he could finish his words, the entire king vessel burst into flames suddenly.","It was smashed into pieces.","Ke Chen’e’s voice was also buried in the waves of fire.","Hiss!","“What’s that?”","Ke Chentao’s pupils constricted. “Chen’e!”","He let out a scream.","“Could it be that Ke Chen’e is dead?”","“Brother, save me!”","Ke Chen’e’s scream came from inside the king vessel.","Buzz!","A wisp of golden light appeared and illuminated everything. Even the flames were unable to conceal its domineering nature.","The huge Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared. Its horn was shining and turning into a stream of light to slaughter everything around it.","Both the spaceship and the other Immortal Masters were slaughtered by the golden light.","“Ow!”","The great might of the Golden-armored Giant Beast shook the starry sky, and it looked at Ke Chentao with cold eyes.","“They’re... dead?”","Ke Chentao’s face darkened.","“Ke Chen’e and the other Immortal Masters in the spaceship are all dead?","“They got defeated in one move?","“How can a fifth-tier Exotic Beast be so powerful?”","Ke Chentao felt desperate. “What is it?”","Ke Chentao knew a lot about the ancient demonic beasts, but he had never seen such a golden and powerful thing.","“This is your mount?” Ke Chentao looked at Zhang Han in shock.","He was really shocked.","Ke Chen’e’s death made him very angry, but he had to accept the reality.","However, when he turned around, he suddenly felt pleasantly surprised.","This huge Exotic Beast must be a Holy Beast among the ancient demonic beasts. It was only at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage, so he had a good chance to tame it.","He was both angry and surprised.","Ke Chentao was about to make his move.","“How dare you kill my little brother? I will burn your soul for ten thousand years to vent the hatred in my heart!”","Ke Chentao rushed straight to Zhang Han’s Thunder Body.","After flying for three seconds, he suddenly stopped.","Because he saw an old man with his hands clasped behind his back appear beside the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“A helper?","“Is he at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier?”","Ke Chentao became vigilant.","Zhang Han said to Yue Wuwei via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Elder Yue, someone nearby is undergoing tribulation. I’ll go absorb the tribulation lightning first. My Thunder Body is a little tired.","“Let the Golden-armored Giant Beast play with him. After devouring the tribulation lightning, we’ll come back and kill him.”","“Hmm?”","Yue Wuwei nodded and said, “Okay.”","Originally, he wanted to pretend to be unfathomable. But at this time, he was worried that Ke Chentao would escape, so Yue Wuwei revealed his aura and said, “Which son of a bitch dares to chase after my junior?”","Ke Chentao was stunned for a moment, and then he said angrily, “You’re just a sixth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator. How dare you pretend to be a senior in front of me?”","“Haha, I won’t play with you for now. Let’s go.”","Yue Wuwei took out the small boat and waved at Zhang Han. Then, he said to the Golden-armored Giant Beast next to him, “Lil Beast, go and kill the enemy.”","Zhang Han was speechless.","“This guy is so disrespectful.”","“Let’s go!”","Zhang Han was very fast. In a flash, he came to Yue Wuwei and the two of them boarded the small boat.","“See you later.”","Yue Wuwei cupped his hands to Ke Chentao.","“Don’t even think about escaping. I’ll kill you!”","Ke Chentao also had his own thoughts.","Zhang Han had a Soul Seal on him, so Ke Chentao could still catch up with him. “If they leave, won’t the golden ancient demonic beast be mine?","“If I can get such an Exotic Beast, it will greatly improve my combat capability. At the very least, it can instantly kill a cultivator in the same realm as it.","“It’s a pity that my brother has died!”","Thinking of Ke Chen’e, Ke Chentao felt a little distressed.","In addition to his heartache, he could only find a way to make himself stronger and get more.","Boom!","Ke Chentao made three exaggerated attacks.","He watched as his opponent transformed into a stream of light and fled into the distance.","Ke Chentao sneered in his head.","“You’ll regret it.”"]},{"number":1635,"title":"Chapter 1635 Fierce","paragraphs":["Chapter 1635 Fierce","Ke Chentao looked at the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","As for the Golden-armored Giant Beast, it blinked, its eyes filled with disdain.","“From now on, you’ll be my mount!”","Ke Chentao’s voice was indifferent. He took out a stick, for fear that he would accidentally kill the Exotic Beast with his sword.","He seemed to have overestimated his own strength.","The stick smashed down.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast raised its claws to fight back.","It was a very ordinary move, which was simply waving its claws.","Clack!","The stick became more than a hundred meters long and was directly broken by a claw strike.","“What?!","“My Black Mountain Stick!”","“It’s an eighth-tier spiritual treasure. How could it be broken by a claw strike?”","His heart ached for the spiritual treasure.","But Ke Chentao was more surprised than heartbroken.","“Your claws are so sharp? Wonderful. From now on, you will follow me. I promise you will eat well!”","“Huh.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast blinked. Zhang Han almost mocked Ke Chentao.","He thought about it. “In fact, if I want, the Golden-armored Giant Beast can follow him.","“I’ll kill him when it uses up his treasures.","“He’ll be utterly confused before he dies.”","But Zhang Han didn’t intend to do that.","It was despicable to repay kindness with ingratitude.","What Ke Chentao did disgusted Zhang Han. He didn’t intend to let him live too long.","“A man who has just reached the seventh tier is already so arrogant. After so many years of cultivation, he has really forgotten that there is always someone better than him,” Zhang Han said sarcastically in the small boat. “Elder Yue, you should be able to kill him with your sixth-tier strength.”","“What do you mean by ‘should’? Of course, I can, right?”","Yue Wuwei said discontentedly, “You’re only at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage, but you can already fight with him. Can’t I, a sixth-tier cultivator, kill him?”","“There’s no comparison.” Zhang Han felt helpless.","What did he have?","He had the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Great Demon Body, the Thunder Body, the Demon Body Golden-armored Giant Beast, and the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","They were all extremely terrifying beings.","The Tribulation Stage was just the beginning.","Zhang Han was developing now. When he reached the mature phase, he would be invincible in the whole Cultivation World.","“I can’t compare with you.”","Yue Wuwei snorted and said, “Boy, you’re blessed by nature and are deeply favored by Sir. It’s all thanks to Mengmeng.”","“That’s true,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“Eh? I feel the Heavenly Tribulation.” Yue Wuwei looked ahead and could vaguely see a glimmer of light. It was the place where someone was undergoing tribulation.","“It knows we’re here.”","Zhang Han said, “It’s deliberately seducing us.”","“Hahaha!","“One Cloud!”","Yue Wuwei laughed out loud and said, “Let’s go and devour the tribulation thunder!”","The One Cloud appeared. The two of them entered and quickly approached the tribulation cloud.","“Hmm?”","The tribulation cloud was very annoyed. “That One Cloud can actually block the aura I sense. Damn it, how could there be such a disgusting treasure?”","It was waiting for an opportunity. The tribulation thunder surged.","“It’s been five hours, and the tribulation thunder hasn’t fallen yet. Is this a bluff?”","Jiang Lijia, the Hall Master of the Highest Clouds Palace’s branch in Qian Wind District, took a deep breath.","He felt a little strange. “What’s going on?”","“It’s coming!”","“It’s coming!”","Many of his subordinates were actually a little excited when they saw a bolt of earth-shattering tribulation thunder falling from the tribulation cloud.","“The tribulation thunder has finally descended. He’s beginning his tribulation!”","“Wait, why is this tribulation thunder the kind when one breaks through to the sixth tier from the fifth tier?”","“Shit, he’s in danger!”","“I wonder if he can hold on!”","Feeling the might contained in the tribulation thunder, all the people present, including Jiang Lijia, the eighth-tier Hall Master, looked terrified.","However, something strange happened.","“Hey, why did the tribulation thunder stop when it’s halfway here?”","Under the watchful eyes of everyone, the tribulation clouds descended by half and dissipated directly into the void. No one knew where they went.","What the crowd didn’t know was that the Heavenly Tribulation was quite irritated at this time.","“Damn it, how did this thunder thief become more powerful?","“This fourth-tier Dao Seeking Cultivator is too weak. It limits my ability. I’m so angry!”","The Heavenly Tribulation was furious.","From beginning to end, it had been trying various methods to kill the thunder thief but to no avail. “He dares to disobey me and escapes the tribulation thunder. This is so hateful!”","“Haha, it’s delighting that you’re irritable and helpless.”","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei felt great.","“A little more.”","Zhang Han had fled for so long, and his Thunder Body was empty. He needed a lot of tribulation thunder.","Clack! Clack!","At the same time, 10 bolts of tribulation lightning rumbled down.","Zhang Han absorbed all of them.","“This is great!”","Seeing this, Yue Wuwei felt even more satisfied. He applauded and praised, “Bravo!”","Thus, he swaggered forward, opening a gap in the One Cloud. Their auras were completely exposed in front of the tribulation clouds.","“Damn it!”","The tribulation clouds surged violently. They erupted with anger. At the same time, a hundred bolts of tribulation lightning descended.","Swish! Swish! Swish!","All of them were absorbed by Zhang Han’s Thunder Body.","“Condense!”","An even stronger aura that contained a trace of qualitative tribulation thunder quietly descended.","The Heavenly Tribulation had become smarter. It hid its qualitative aura. It looked ordinary on the surface, but it had a killing move in the dark.","But in the face of a fifth-tier Thunder Body, that didn’t work.","As a result, Hall Master Jiang Lijia and the other spectators, including the tribulation taker, were all utterly terrified under the tribulation clouds.","“What the hell is going on?”","“Are you toying with me?”","Suddenly, the alarm in the king vessel went off.","“Alert. There is a battle fluctuation 300 miles away by coordinates 23.22 in the northwest.”","“Capture the scene.”","A probing missile flew out.","One minute later.","“The scene was captured successfully.”","“Project it.”","Hall Master Jiang Lijia and the others didn’t care about any battles at all.","The Star Sea was so big that there were battles happening all the time. There was nothing strange about it.","But at this moment.","“Hall, Hall Master, look, what’s that?”","The subordinate next to him cried out in horror, as if he had been frightened.","“How impatient.”","Jiang Lijia frowned. Why did his subordinate act as if he had never seen the world?","But when he turned his head-","Poof!","He choked on his own saliva.","He saw the majestic momentum of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“Oh my god, what kind of ancient demonic beast is this?","“This is definitely a high-end ancient demonic beast!","“That man is actually fighting the Exotic Beast?”","Jiang Lijia immediately instructed the system. “Hurry up and analyze the information.”","The intelligent system said, “Start analyzing the intensity of the attack.","“Analysis finished. The Dao Seeking Cultivator of the Human Clan is at the Early Stage of the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage. The unknown Exotic Beast is at the Early Stage of the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage and has an amazing defensive ability.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast had just reached the fifth tier. It could easily be detected by the spaceship system as a sixth-tier beast. It was born to fight those above its level. That was its aptitude.","Hiss!","Jiang Lijia gasped.","In the Star Sea, the value of ancient demonic beasts, even though it was their corpses, was very high, let alone underage ancient demonic beasts.","The value of this kind of ancient demonic beast was too high.","“Lock on it.”","Jiang Lijia soon calmed down. After pondering for a moment, he said, “Lock on to the target and don’t move for the time being. Let’s see what they are up to. An underage ancient demonic beast has come to the outer ring of the Star Sea. It has a strong aura. If it’s a mount of a big shot and we go there rashly, we’ll be in trouble.”","“But someone is attacking it. After all, there’s a realm gap between them. If it’s captured... you won’t be able to obtain it, Hall Master,” one of his subordinates said.","“Don’t be hasty.” Jiang Lijia said in a low voice, “Let’s wait and see. Let’s go there after he finishes his tribulation.”","This branch leader’s way of doing things was still to be steady. It had not been easy for him to become a branch leader. In the future, when he broke through to the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, he would be able to become a branch leader of the inner ring. His life would be unrestrained and wonderful, and he would be just like a local tyrant.","Everyone focused on the tribulation clouds again.","“What the hell is going on?”","“Why is there something wrong with the Heavenly Tribulation?”","“If it’s not about the Heavenly Tribulation, then... maybe there’s a Cosmos Formation hidden in this area?”","They began to analyze the situation.","No one would have thought that someone had secretly swallowed the tribulation thunder.","Boom!","A total of several hundred tribulation lightning bolts are striking down nonstop.","However, they didn’t work.","The Heavenly Tribulation gave up.","“Such a useless host!”","It couldn’t wait to hack the tribulation taker below to death, but the energy of the tribulation clouds was used up.","“I’ll leave!","“Thunder thief, I’ll definitely kill you next time.”","The tribulation clouds dissipated in one second.","“Hey, did I succeed or fail?”","The tribulation taker was confused.","However, sensing some rules of the Great Domain, he advanced to the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage in a very ordinary way.","“I feel great. Let’s go.”","Zhang Han exhaled a long breath and said, “I was only half full after a Heavenly Tribulation.”","It was a very comfortable feeling.","Yue Wuwei couldn’t wait any longer, either.","“Let’s go and kill Ke Chentao. Someone here may pay attention to the battle on our side. If they see the Golden-armored Giant Beast, it may cause us more trouble.”","“It doesn’t matter. No one should know it, but it will attract a lot of attention,” Zhang Han said calmly.","The two of them took the small boat and flew quickly to the battlefield.","At this time, the tribulation taker returned to the king vessel.","“Hall Master, I succeeded.” A look of surprise and confusion was on his face.","“How did you succeed?”","“Did you use a trick?”","“I also want to go through my tribulation here, but unfortunately, I’m still not up to the standard of the Tribulation Stage.”","Fortunately, he couldn’t undergo his tribulation. Otherwise, he would have suffered a lot under the wrath of the Heavenly Tribulation.","Hall Master Jiang Lijia said, “Let’s go over there and see what’s going on.","“Capture the scene.”","The king vessel cut through the void and sailed rapidly.","Two more people appeared on the screen.","Of course, they were Yue Wuwei and Zhang Han.","“Thunderbolt Crocodile!","“Thunder Willow!","“Wind of Lightning!”","In addition to these moves, Zhang Han made a new supernatural power.","“Crushing Lightning Blade!”","The enormous lightning blade was filled with a sharp aura.","“Ke Chentao, I told you that if you ran away, perhaps I wouldn’t be bothered to pay attention to you, but you stayed.”","“Hahaha! You want to kill me?”","Ke Chentao was furious.","“Binding Heaven and Earth.”","Yue Wuwei’s white beard fluttered as he cast a supernatural power and then began to show his trump card.","“Martial Spirit Incantation!","“Three thousand Weak Water!”","“...”","Zhang Han displayed his supernatural powers one by one with his Thunder Body and the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","The intensity of the attack was simply too ferocious.","“What...”","In the king vessel, Hall Master Jiang Lijia frowned slightly and said, “That old man has just reached the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage and is about to die. With such strong attacks, he won’t be able to hold on for long.”","Just as he expected.","“This is impossible!","“I’m sorry, Han Yang Immortal. I know I was wrong. Please let me go.","“I’m willing to be your slave! Han Yang Immortal, let me go! Damn it, you deserve to die...”","Amidst the curses, Ke Chentao was unable to escape, so he resolutely chose to detonate himself.","The energy was earth-shattering. It bloomed like a ray of sunlight, illuminating all directions.","Perhaps, it wouldn’t be long before one could see specks of starlight in the sky on the nearby planets.","“He’s dead.”","“Great, I’m satisfied.”","Yue Wuwei laughed and said, “This is the real battle. It’s just that he doesn’t know many supernatural powers and occult arts. Otherwise, we would have had a good fight.”"]},{"number":1636,"title":"Chapter 1636 Six-star Emissary","paragraphs":["Chapter 1636 Six-star Emissary","“There is a spaceship coming over. Let’s leave.”","Zhang Han turned around and looked into the distance. Jiang Lijia’s spaceship was rapidly heading this way.","Swoosh!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast, Thunder Body, and Yue Wuwei flew into the distance. After a while, they disappeared into Tiny Tot’s Alternate Space and left.","The spaceship couldn’t detect Tiny Tot at all.","It was like the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","Jiang Lijia sighed repeatedly and said, “It’s definitely a Holy Beast of the ancient demonic beasts. It can easily break into the secondary space and travel through the void. Some Holy Beasts can be used as a Space Shooting Planet. It’s so terrifying. Unfortunately, it’s too difficult to catch such a powerful ancient demonic beast.”","“Forget it. Let’s go back to the Qian Wind District.”","Jiang Lijia didn’t think too much about it at first. When he saw the other party leave, he felt a little pity, but he wasn’t annoyed. He broke into the secondary space and returned to the Qian Wind District.","Zhang Han returned to the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","“Dad, Elder Yue, you’re amazing!”","Mengmeng said admiringly, “You killed the other party at once.”","“Ke Chentao has just entered the seventh tier. It can be seen that he doesn’t often go out to gain experience, so his foundation is not strong enough. The combat capability of this kind of Dao Seeking Cultivator is much weaker than that of ordinary Dao Seeking Cultivators,” Zhang Han said.","“Then why couldn’t you defeat him before?” Mengmeng asked curiously.","“I just passed the fourth-tier Tribulation Stage. I was three tiers lower than him.”","Zhang Han found it funny and said, “In the Tribulation Stage, even a tier is a great difference, let alone three.”","Moreover, the Thunder Body, the Great Demon’s Figure, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast were all born not long. They were equivalent to five or six-year-old children. They were still growing, and their combat capability had not taken shape yet.","“When Immortal Master Lingxi comes back, I will beat her up and take my people away.” Zhang Han smiled slightly.","His most terrifying ability was the growth rate of each duplication.","He was out of the Cultivation World. It was reasonable for him to cultivate in an overbearing way.","“You are indeed powerful.”","Yue Wuwei sighed with emotion and said, “Now I’m only in the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage, and I can only fight against an ordinary seventh-tier person in the Tribulation Stage. Zhang Han is only in the fifth-tier, but he can already fight against a seventh-tier person in the Tribulation Stage. Alas! His combat capability can be a match for mine.”","“You should cultivate harder,” Yue Xiaonao said casually. “Don’t fall behind Uncle Zhang too much.”","“Yes. I have to cultivate harder.” Yue Wuwei nodded. “In the next few decades, I’ll also speed up my cultivation and strive to reach the eighth-tier of the Tribulation Stage. Anyway, I will have no shortage of spirit treasures as long as I follow him.”","As the housekeeper of the Heavenly Land, he possessed a lot of resources and high aptitude.","“Let’s go back to the palace of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Qian Wind District first. After being recognized as a One-star Emissary, I can take on a lot of tasks. We can go to some metal lands or treasure lands. Moreover, we’ll have some time to take a walk in some fun places.”","As soon as he said that, Zi Yan and Lisa laughed.","Lisa said, “We are looking forward to going shopping.”","“Ha...” Zhang Han laughed.","They took the king vessel, entered the secondary space, came to the nearest Space Shooting Planet, and began to return.","Then they arrived at the planet where the palace of the Qian Wind District was located.","The palace was still bustling with people.","The Highest Clouds Palace was truly powerful.","It was not one of the super sects in the Star Sea, but it was a first-class force. It had branches all over the region. Many super sects couldn’t be a match for it in terms of the number of branches.","“Hello! I have finished the task.”","Zhang Han took out three seventh-tier Red Snow Gemstones and ended the task.","“The scan is successful.”","“Congratulations on completing the training task. You will become a One-star Emissary of the Highest Clouds Palace. The formalities will begin.”","The waitress was in the Mastery Realm. She was sitting by the window with a calm look.","She had served many people like this.","Some of them were even seventh or eighth-tier Tribulation Stage experts.","Zhang Hanyang in front of her was just a One-star Emissary. He couldn’t arouse her interest at all.","However, a majestic voice came to her mind. “Come to the office.”","“Okay!”","It was an order from her superiors.","The woman said to the window, “Please wait for a moment.”","Then, she stood up and left without even looking at Zhang Han.","Some people in the line behind Zhang Han complained and waited in silence.","It didn’t matter if they waited for long. They would just be bored.","She walked into the office and saw the person inside. The woman’s pupils contracted, and she hurriedly saluted.","“Greetings, Hall Master.”","At this time, the Hall Master, Jiang Lijia, was smiling.","He didn’t expect he would meet such a surprise. One of those people would become a One-star Emissary of the Highest Clouds Palace.","“You let Zhang Hanyang outside become a Six-star Emissary. Find an excuse to tell him.”","The Hall Master gave the order.","He guessed the other party’s purpose in coming here. The person seemed to want to get some information.","But it didn’t matter. If the other party wanted to take on tasks, the one-star tasks were too easy for them. However, the six-star tasks would take around a hundred years.","He wanted them to stay here for a longer time.","As a result, it became like this.","When the woman came back, the way she looked at Zhang Han changed.","“Hello.”","She smiled sweetly and said, “You are the 10 billionth emissary of our 311 Star Palace of the Highest Clouds Palace. You are at least in the fourth-tier Tribulation Stage, so you are the lucky emissary. According to the rules of our palace, you will be promoted to a Six-star Emissary. Congratulations.”","“Oh?”","Zhang Han raised his eyebrows slightly, looking a little surprised.","It meant he was a lucky emissary.","Of course, he didn’t know the true sense of it, but this was a good thing. As a Six-star Emissary, he could read much information about tasks. He could choose a task casually. He could explore many secret realms and metal planets along the way.","He didn’t intend to complete tasks. He wanted to devour metal and treasure lands to increase his strength.","Creatures grew the fastest when they were young.","His duplications were too young.","Now that he had reached the fifth tier, Zhang Han felt that he could quickly advance to the seventh tier or even the eighth tier.","He decided to cultivate quickly before Immortal Master Lingxi came back tens of years later.","“If I reach the seventh tier, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body will appear. At that time, I’ll have five bodies with me, and I should be able to fight seventh-tier Immortal Master Lingxi. Then, I will be qualified to go back to the Land of God’s Meteorite. When the Godly Body appears, I will have six bodies and six ways of cultivation, and my body will change greatly. If I reach the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage, I will easily beat Immortal Master Lingxi.”","After all, he had beaten Immortal Master Lingxi. Zhang Han also knew her strength well.","“The procedures have been completed. You are now a Six-star Emissary. This is your smart wristband. After verifying yourself, you can take on tasks on it and so on. You can learn how to use the wristband from the prompts in the intelligent system. But many tasks need you to return to the palace after you complete them.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly, took the wristband, and turned to leave.","Seeing his back, the woman was envious.","In her eyes, the person had won the favor of the Hall Master and risen to the top.","She also wanted to rise to the top in one go. She wanted to have a high status and power.","However, if she knew the inside story, she would shake her head and didn’t want to be like him anymore.","It looked like a pie falling from the sky. But in fact, it was still a trap.","“Seal and compress the images we captured and report it to the higher-ups. I have something important to report to the Palace Master.”","The Hall Master, Jiang Lijia, revealed a smile.","This kind of news was too valuable for the Palace Master. If the Palace Master could get that giant beast, Jiang Lijia would probably be promoted to the Hall Master of the inner ring of the Star Sea. At that time, he would live a better life.","It could be said that his value would increase by a thousand times!","“Okay!”","Some of his men immediately went to work.","Jiang Lijia said, “Moreover, pay attention to Zhang Hanyang’s wristband all the time. See what task he is going to take and locate him all the way.”","“Okay!”","The Star Sea was so big. There were billions of Dao Seeking Cultivators in such a small corner.","The Hall Master saw Zhang Han killing Ke Chentao.","Was this the tribulation Zhang Han was worried about?","If Zhang Han knew about this, he would probably shake his head, “The Highest Clouds Palace is not even a super sect. How could it be called a tribulation?”","“Let’s go on our way.”","“Let’s see what kind of task we can take.”","Zhang Han controlled the smart wristband and bound it with his identity information. Then a series of tasks came.","He saw the tasks in the Qian Wind District from Six-star to One-star and found more than one hundred thousand numbers in the catalog.","They were new tasks issued today.","He checked the previous tasks. It seemed hundreds of thousands of tasks would be added to the previous ones every day.","“A Six-star task! Kill Ao Liben, a Dao Seeking Cultivator at the peak of the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage.”","“A Six-star task! Go to the secret realm of Lingshui District to rescue a Dao Seeking Cultivator called Zuo Shan.”","“A Five-star task! A rare metal mine has been found in Helong District, go to guard it for ten years.”","After he clicked on a task, he received information about its location, coordinates, what he needed to do, rewards, and points from the Highest Clouds Palace.","The points in the Highest Clouds Palace could be exchanged for treasures or purchase information in the treasury.","“Accept it.”","Zhang Han took on the task of the rare metal mine.","That was impossible for him to guard it for ten years. He just wanted to take a look at the specific coordinates of the metal planet in Helong District. He would go over and swallow it directly.","There were a total of three Six-star Emissaries who had chosen the task.","Zhang Han was the third one.","The other two were both Dao Seeking Cultivators in the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage.","When they saw a fifth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator choose the same task, both of them were stunned.","“How can a fifth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator be a Six-star Emissary?”","“Are you kidding me?”","One of the Six-star Emissaries immediately sent a message to Zhang Han.","The wristband beeped.","He heard the message.","“How can a fifth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator be a Six-star Emissary? It’s so strange! I’ll give you three hours to prepare. You have three hours to gather in the palace and set off.”","Zhang Han was speechless.","The other party’s words were not courteous at all.","Zhang Han didn’t want to reply.","“Covers all the planet’s coordinates.”","The information on the major regions and coordinates of the Star Sea was sent to the system of the king vessel through the wristband.","Then Zhang Han threw the smart wristband into his Space Ring, which isolated the ring from the outside world. No one could detect it.","“Let’s go to the Di Ermu Planet.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “Let’s go faster. After swallowing the metal, we can play on the way back.”","“Okay!” Mengmeng responded with a smile.","The little princess also wanted to go out and have fun.","Swoosh!","The spaceship entered secondary space and flew toward the nearest Space Shooting Planet.","It had to be said that with the status of the Six-star Emissary, it was much faster to queue up on the Space Shooting Planet.","The upper echelons of the major sects in the Qian Wind District all had VIP passages. They could save them several times more time than ordinary passages."]},{"number":1637,"title":"Chapter 1637 The Mine Was Lost","paragraphs":["Chapter 1637 The Mine Was Lost","Someone was reporting in the branch palace of the Highest Clouds Palace.","“He accepted a five-star task, to guard the planet with rare metals. Then, they used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique. After that, Zhang Hanyang left. We didn’t receive any signal.”","“The second time I found him appear on a Space Shooting Planet, heading for the destination.”","“What does Zhang Hanyang want to do?”","The Hall Master, Jiang Lijia, pondered for a moment and glanced at his subordinates, saying, “Pay attention to him all the time. Report to me if anything unusual happens.”","“Okay!”","After a month, they quietly approached their destination.","There was a temporary space station on a Barren Star with dozens of spaceships.","They were preparing for the construction and sending various facilities to the continent.","“Wait here. I’ll go first. I’ve already sensed the aura of metal. See you in a few days.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast smiled, ran out of the spaceship with wide eyes, and went straight into the secondary space.","The next second, it appeared in the sea of the planet.","There were some Exotic Beasts in the sea.","Seeing the Golden-armored Giant Beast, they were a little confused.","“What kind of monster was this? It can swim back and forth here.”","It swam to the shore and burrowed straight into the ground.","“There are really some rare metals.”","“The area of the metals is wide. There are three places. Start to devour.”","Zhang Han was very familiar with it.","In the duplication of the Golden-armored Giant Beast, metal became delicious food.","Hiss!","It passed through the ground easily.","Then it came to a metal area.","Sizzling!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast began to devour.","“The Alternate Space is not big enough.","“Half of the metals are left. Its storage capacity is amazing.","“Fortunately, I brought six Space Rings with me.","“I’ll take all the metal away. I can devour it after getting back.”","Zhang Han began to collect the metals.","After three days of hard work, he had finally collected all the metals on the three continents.","“It’s not nice to take all the metals away. I’ll leave some spiritual treasures for you.”","Zhang Han left a ninth-tier spiritual treasure and several eighth-tier spiritual treasures in each metal mine.","They were all obtained from the treasure house of the Mountain River Sect. They were many. There were not many ninth-tier spiritual treasures. Eighth-tier spiritual treasures were much more.","Then he slipped away and went back to the spaceship.","“How do you feel? Are you full?” Mengmeng asked with a smile.","“Yes.”","Zhang Han answered, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast returned to his wrist.","Then, his Original Body opened its eyes and said, “This trip is worth it. The metals’ reserves are amazing. Let’s go and play on some planets on the way back.”","“I can finally go out to play.”","Mengmeng couldn’t wait any longer.","When they left, the other two Immortal Masters had just arrived.","“Where is Zhang Hanyang?”","“How dare a fifth-tier Immortal Master be late?”","They said a few words to vent their dissatisfaction.","Then they arrived at the task site.","On the third day, the engineering team explored the metal mine again.","“Oh, my god! What happened?”","“The metal mine is gone.”","“Be quick to report this to the superior!”","The final result was that the task was canceled.","The two Immortal Masters came here in vain.","Zhang Han had gained a lot and was on his way to play.","After such a long time of cultivation, everyone was a little tired. It was different from being in seclusion. They sometimes rested, adjusted their mentality, and so on. Such things were also important in their cultivation career.","Zhang Han had cultivated for about 500 years, so he was relatively lonely. He had looked for fun himself in the past 500 years. Therefore, he helped Ke Chen’e and the others.","“This is Anuoman Planet. Its world is filled with seawater. There are a total of 100 Sky Cities.”","Zhang Han said with a smile, “The underwater Exotic Beasts here have been trained to perform. They are not strong but have their own characteristics. Its fun lies in the water world. With our cooperation, some entertainment facilities can temporarily block our cultivation levels. In this way, we can feel like ordinary people. We haven’t been ordinary people for a long time.”","“Huh?” Mengmeng was slightly stunned.","She didn’t expect the place to be so fun.","“How can we block our cultivation levels?” Yue Wuwei was shocked. “Doesn’t it mean that our lives will be controlled by others?”","“Our cultivation levels will just be blocked. They won’t disappear. You can use your moves with a stir of your mind,” Zhang Han said with amusement.","“I see. Okay.” After Yue Wuwei understood it, he suddenly became interested. “There is such a wonderful place in the Star Sea.”","The spaceship approached the space station.","“The deposit is one billion crystal stones per person. This is the storage wristband. You can refund it after playing.”","When hearing these words, Yue Wuwei shook his beard.","Zi Yan and Lisa looked at each other.","The deposit seemed to be a little expensive.","“Five billion crystal stones for each of us.” Zhang Han handed over the crystal stones.","The crystal stones were all medium-grade crystal stones or top-grade crystal stones.","Everyone took out their wristband and took the aircraft prepared by the space station to the 36th Sky City.","“Oh, my god. A spaceship costs 100 million crystal stones a day?”","After seeing this, Mengmeng said discontentedly, “If I had known this, I would have put away the spaceship.”","“It doesn’t matter. If you put away the spaceship here, everyone will know you have a super-large spirit treasure. Then you have to worry about someone coveting it.” Zhang Han chuckled and said, “The consumption here is relatively high. The seven of us will have to spend about 20 billion crystal stones.”","Zhang Han gave a brief explanation inside the aircraft.","This planet looked simple. But in fact, it was complicated. It contained a lot of ninth-tier spiritual treasures, rare gems, and so on.","It was also a high-end amusement park in the outer ring.","“A good room in a hotel costs 500 million crystal stones a day. It’s a robbery!”","Yue Wuwei muttered with dissatisfaction.","The Sky Cities were beautiful. The cities floating in the air made Mengmeng and the others feel wonderful.","They booked rooms in the most luxurious hotel in the outer layer.","There were various facilities that they even hadn’t imagined before.","There were a lot of tourist things in the hotel. They were free for the guests, and they could also eat a lot of famous delicacies.","They rested in the hotel for a day.","It was prosperous around. After walking around the area, Zi Yan, Lisa, Mengmeng, and Yue Xiaonao all felt satisfied.","They enjoyed buying things.","The next day, they lined up for the water world.","There was an enormous water curtain passageway.","They hadn’t felt weightlessness and uncontrollable feeling for a long time.","It was so exciting.","“Ah! Ah! Ah!”","“Oh.”","“Wow!”","Many exclamations and screams came one after another.","Zi Yan also exclaimed. Then she burst into laughter.","They hadn’t been relaxed for a long time.","Exciting games were rare for the cultivators. Although the secret realms and danger could stimulate them, they were also dangerous. They must feel very different from the relaxing mentality in entertainment.","“Nice!”","Yue Wuwei had a tour of the underwater passage. He went from the high altitude to the deepest place. It took him five minutes to reach the bottom of the sea. It blocked his cultivation level and made him feel thrilled.","Most people screamed in the part of the underwater passage.","“I feel so happy. If my parents, Grandpa Zhang, and Nina were all here, it would be better.” When Chen Chuan felt happy, he also missed his parents.","“Don’t worry.” Zhang Han said with a smile, “With Immortal Master Lingxi aside, they will be fine. Except for the Star Sea, there will be no high-end secret realms of life and death in other places. Although Immortal Master Lingxi has forcibly taken in disciples, she is good to her own people and also protective of them. We just need to wait here for them. They will come back in decades. Cultivate hard and surprise your father.”","“Okay.”","Chen Chuan nodded and felt relieved, but he came up with another problem.","“After Nina became my girlfriend not long, we got separated. I’ll be 50 or 60 years old in a few decades. I will get married at such an old age.”","“Ha...” Zi Yan couldn’t help laughing.","Time flies fast. Little Chen Chuan was now at the age when people in the secular world were talking about marriage.","“That’s nothing serious.”","Zhang Han said, “In the Cultivation World, especially the Star Sea, those under 100 years old are considered minors. There are many competitions requiring Dao Seeking Cultivators under a hundred years old.”","“Then, are you the most ruthless one among them?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“Not necessarily.”","They all felt that Zhang Han was powerful.","Unexpectedly, Zhang Han said, “With my current strength, it’s hard to say. It’s said the fastest person has only taken 40 years to reach the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage.”","“You’ve only cultivated not long,” Yue Wuwei said. “After another ten or twenty years, maybe we’ll be able to gain a firm foothold in the Star Sea. With your incredible speed of growth...”","Zhang Han smiled and was silent.","“Come here, Chen Chuan.”","Yue Xiaonao winked at Mengmeng. Then, she pulled Chen Chuan to a place seven or eight meters to the side and set up a sound-proof cover.","“When did you become Nina’s boyfriend?” Yue Xiaonao asked with curiosity.","“Well, it was two years ago.” Chen Chuan scratched his head, feeling a little embarrassed.","“How is your relationship with your girlfriend?” Yue Xiaonao asked curiously, “Have you two reached the last stage?”","“Sister Nao, I don’t think it’s good to tell you that.” Chen Chuan blushed a little.","“What’s not good? Tell me,” Mengmeng urged.","Her words made sense.","Chen Chuan braced himself and said, “We kissed, and then... Except for the last step, we did what we should do.”","“Oh, my god!”","Mengmeng grinned and said, “You have secretly captured Nina.”","Chen Chuan thought, “How could we be straightforward? If you two saw what we had done, you would be the strongest third wheel in history.”","“Ha...”","Mengmeng laughed and said, “Little Chen Chuan is not bad. He has become our good friend’s boyfriend. Xiaonao, do you think Nina will have to call us elder sisters when they get married?”","“Probably. Ha...” Yue Xiaonao said with a smile. “According to seniority... No, Uncle Zhang and Uncle Chen are friends. They’re not relatives. You and Chen Chuan are of the same generation. He and Nina don’t have to call us elder sisters at all.”","Mengmeng was stunned. “It seems so.”","“Let’s continue to play. We’ve just had fun in the underwater passage. There are so many interesting games.”","Yue Xiaonao turned her attention to the games and said, “Wow, there are so many games. I feel like we’ll have to play for a week.”","“I may not be able to have enough fun in seven days.”","Mengmeng chuckled.","Then the group relaxed here for a few days.","They played all the games and went shopping in many places. They wanted to buy too many things.","As a result, they spent too much money.","The 35 billion crystal stones they had stored were not enough at all.","In a total of ten days, they had spent 50 billion crystal stones.","Zhang Han did not store more crystal stones later. Instead, he took out some spiritual treasures he got from the Mountain River Sect and exchanged them for crystal stones.","After all, it was the place with high consumption in the Galaxy.","Just when they were about to leave, the Hall Master, Jiang Lijia, received the news in the branch of Highest Clouds Palace in the Qian Wind District.","“Zhang Hanyang didn’t care about the other two teammates of the task and took the lead in going out alone. There was no signal on the wristband on the way. When he arrived at the destination, the metals of the three metal mines disappeared in a few days, replaced by some spiritual treasures.”","Jiang Lijia narrowed his eyes. “Could it be that he needs rare metals?”","“They are now resting on a recreational planet.”","“Don’t be in a hurry. Let’s wait until they accept another task.”"]},{"number":1638,"title":"Chapter 1638 Big Business Comes","paragraphs":["Chapter 1638 Big Business Comes","Time flew by fast.","After three years, Zhang Han was hanging out in the outer ring and cultivating.","He had been to many places, including the Qian Wind District and more than a dozen small areas nearby.","One day, Jiang Lijia, the Hall Master of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Qian Wind District, was reading the pieces of news having been sorted out.","“The second task for the Six-star Emissary, Zhang Hanyang, is to go to the Gupoluo Star. The rare metal mine there has also disappeared. Some spiritual treasures were left there.”","“The third task is to explore the treasure land in the Anling District. As a result, the treasure land disappeared and became an ordinary continent.”","“The fourth task is to rescue Immortal Master Nan Gong from the Land of Night Devils on the Haohuduoer Planet. However, the Land of Night Devils disappeared.”","“He took on four tasks in four years. One is five-star, and three are six-star. It is too fast. Therefore, the treasures or metals that have disappeared are because of Zhang Hanyang?”","“It’s basically certain. He has the ancient demonic beast. It is still growing. We should report this matter to our Palace Master in detail.”","Jiang Lijia thought to himself, “Our Palace Master has wanted an ancient demonic beast to be his mount for so many years, but he has never gotten what he wanted. Maybe he can make a breakthrough on Zhang Hanyang.”","“Come here.”","Jiang Lijia ordered his man, “Contact the five major districts nearby. Send their tasks about rare metal mines, treasure lands, and places full of demonic Qi to our system. Send them our corresponding tasks to them at the same time.”","“Okay!”","Beep! Beep!","After about five hours, Zhang Han and the others were living in the manor exclusive to the Six-star Emissaries.","His wristband suddenly rang.","This was the quest prompt.","“Huh? There are more than 300 more tasks?” Zhang Han took a look.","They were about rare metals, treasure lands, and various other things.","Zhang Han was interested in more than 20 of them.","“A Six-star Emissary can only accept three tasks at a time.”","“Accept three first.”","After the screening, Zhang Han accepted three tasks.","Yue Wuwei said with a smile, “It seems you’re going to be busy again. I didn’t expect the Highest Clouds Palace’s Six-star Emissaries to have such high status.”","“Daddy, are we going out again?” Mengmeng asked.","In the past, she might have asked, “When are we going to the inner ring of the Star Sea to have a look?”","However, the Star Sea was too big. There were tens of thousands of districts in the outer ring. They had only traveled in a small number of places and more than a dozen districts.","“I’ve accepted three tasks, two of which are related to the metal mines, and one is about a treasure land,” Zhang Han said.","“You’ve swallowed so many metals recently. When will you reach the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage?” Zi Yan asked.","Seeing her blinking big eyes, Zhang Han laughed. “It’ll take a long time for me to reach the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage. The Golden-armored Giant Beast grows very fast, but it needs too many resources. It’s like a bottomless pit.”","Among his duplications, the Thunder Body could easily devour the Tribulation Lightning, but it grew slowly. It would take the Thunder Body several months to digest every time.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure could devour the energy of treasure lands, but its energy conversion efficiency was not as good as that of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","The Great Demon’s Figure had a planet’s nourishment. It was enough for it to use. However, it broke through more slowly.","The growth rate of the Golden-armored Giant Beast was high, but it needed a lot of money.","At this speed, Zhang Han would be poor sooner or later.","Zi Yan asked this question because Zhang Han said they would have a good rest and go to another interesting place after the next breakthrough.","Zi Yan was looking forward to it.","The trip to Sea World last time had left them endless aftertastes.","“It will take more than a year to complete the three tasks. Let’s go to the Sea World after that. Last time, there were two cities that we didn’t have fun in. This time, we’ll go there and have a look,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay!” Mengmeng responded with a smile.","She liked going out to play the most.","The first task was to guard and dig a metal mine.","“The metal mine disappeared. The task is canceled.”","The second similar task began.","At this time, a spaceship with a distinctive appearance. It seemed to be decorated with diamonds all over. The spaceship slowly landed in the branch of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Qian Wind District.","“Palace Master!”","Jiang Lijia’s expression was excited as he personally welcomed the other party.","The Immortal Master Waterheaven was the Palace Master of the Highest Clouds Palace. He had some fame in the seventh region.","He arrived in front of Jiang Lijia.","He looked like a middle-aged man. He was thin, had a long face and big eyes, and looked a little cold.","“I saw the information you sent.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said flatly, “The information is precious. Very good. That ancient demonic beast is suspected to be the Star Demon Dragon King. That’s a Holy Beast of the ancient demonic beasts.”","The Star Demon Dragon King’s skin should be black or dark green. However, the skin was golden in the video. Immortal Master Waterheaven invited many experts to have meetings and discussed it for 81 days. Finally, he learned a record from an ancient book that there was a dragon in the northern wilderness, it was called Star Demon, and its skin was dark...","According to the record, it was very likely to be a mutated Star Demon Dragon King. It was incomparably powerful.","Immortal Master Waterheaven was surprised for a while. Then he immediately set off and came here.","“Where is the person?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked.","“He is in the middle of a task.” Jiang Lijia was excited and said, “I have not acted rashly and alerted him yet. I was afraid that he would escape, so I was waiting for your order.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven frowned. “What are you talking about? He is the Six-star Emissary of our palace. Do you want to bully your subordinate, or do you want to win my favor by playing tricks on him?”","The cold tone of Immortal Master Waterheaven made Jiang Lijia sweat.","Too many people in the Star Sea had snatched treasures, so he was used to it.","There were also many people who were chivalrous and righteous.","Immortal Master Waterheaven was not a good guy, but he was quite friendly to the disciples of the Highest Clouds Palace.","“I was wrong. I should have been punished.” Jiang Lijia cupped his hands.","“Don’t mention it again.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven softened slightly. “You have done a good job in this matter. After this matter, go to R12 Palace to conduct three-year cultivation. Take good care of yourself. Those with evil intentions will only go astray. Remember! Our Highest Clouds Palace has never done evil things. Don’t violate the taboo.”","“Okay. I understand. I’ll keep it in mind.” Jiang Lijia lowered his head.","“Take me to him.” Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded slightly.","Jiang Lijia went on the spaceship of Immortal Master Waterheaven. It was like a large round disc. It was white and shining like silver sand, whistling in the void.","Those who saw it couldn’t help exclaiming, “Isn’t this our Palace Master’s Crystal Stone Spaceship?”","“The hulls are made of rare metals, equipped with 3,000 formations. The energy cabin requires at least medium-grade crystals to burn. It is said that this spaceship is priceless.”","“It’s too expensive. It costs trillions of crystal stones.”","A few days later, Zhang Han had just arrived on the planet where he should complete his task.","“Guard this place and wait for the engineering team to mine the metals.”","Zhang Han checked the place and said, “Not bad. The metal mine is indeed rare and covers a large area. These metals are enough to eat for at least two months.”","Devouring metal didn’t mean increasing his cultivation level. At least, he wouldn’t be hungry.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast was in its growth period and had a good appetite.","Of course, it also grew every day.","Now, it was more than 5,000 meters tall, not far away from ten thousand meters.","Seeing its body shape, Dahei felt a little afraid. It took the initiative to ask for a lot of medicinal pellets and meat. After eating them, it absorbed and digested them in the school bag. Little Hei even swallowed countless gems and lay down beside the school bag to sleep.","Their auras rose frequently. They had slept for more than two years.","“This planet is so ugly.”","Mengmeng glanced outside and said, “Its shape doesn’t look good.”","“You’re right. It’s like a strange floating stone,” Zi Yan commented.","“Although it is ugly, there are treasures inside,” Lisa said with a smile.","“It looks like a continent that has fallen from another big planet. It has no rules, no ecological environment, and is drifting in the universe.”","Zhang Han said, “If we can find the main planet, maybe we can find more metal mines.”","“In this case, is it more likely that the main planet has been blown up?” Yue Wuwei touched his beard and asked.","“Yes.” Zhang Han nodded.","Swoosh!","Just as they were about to leave the spaceship and take a look at the surface of the continent, a huge spaceship shining with bright light broke out of the void not far away.","“Ah! This spaceship is so beautiful.” Mengmeng blinked.","Zi Yan and Lisa also turned to look at the screen.","“It’s good. The metal of this spaceship is so good.” Zhang Han narrowed his eyes.","He immediately sensed the metallic aura on the spacecraft. It was profound, rich, and fragrant.","Beep! Beep! Beep!","The wristband rang.","Zhang Han frowned slightly.","“It’s the Hall Master of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Qian Wind District. Elder Yue, let’s go and have a look. The others stay behind and enter the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot immediately if something unusual happens,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay! Don’t worry.” Zi Yan nodded cautiously, ready to summon Tiny Tot at any time.","Swoosh! Swoosh!","“Wait here, Elder Yue, in case there is an enemy.”","“Okay. You’re not afraid of death, but I am.” Yue Wuwei nodded.","Zhang Han was a little speechless and flew forward for a few kilometers.","Two figures quickly came from the shining spaceship.","One was a man in green, Jiang Lijia, and the other was the man in white, Immortal Master Waterheaven, the Palace Master of the Highest Clouds Palace.","“Zhang Hanyang.”","Jiang Lijia said, “This is Immortal Master Waterheaven, the Palace Master of the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“Hello.” Zhang Han cupped his hands and said.","The emissaries did not belong to Highest Clouds Palace’s direct disciples. Therefore, he didn’t need to bow.","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled and said, “Good. You are young and promising. As a Six-star Emissary, you are very efficient in completing tasks. Hello, I am Immortal Master Waterheaven.”","He made another introduction to show his kindness.","Zhang Han nodded, looked at him, and waited for the other party to continue.","“I’ll get straight to the point.” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked.","“Go ahead,” Zhang Han replied.","“When he went back to the Qian Wind District, he saw you fighting with someone. You have an ancient demonic beast, the Star Demon Dragon King. I like ancient demonic beasts very much, so I came to ask you if you can transfer it to me. I can give you a satisfactory price for it,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","He wanted to buy the ancient demonic beast directly, not rob it.","Having managed the Highest Clouds Palace in the Star Sea for so many years, the resources he controlled were unimaginable.","Especially the Highest Clouds Palace was engaged in business deals. He might have more resources than Zhang Han at his Peak-Stage.","“What if I don’t sell it?” Zhang Han said with a faint smile.","“Really?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was silent for a moment, and he shook his head, “Then I can only say it’s a pity, but I don’t think you will refuse. I came with determination. It doesn’t matter even if I have to spend more spiritual treasures and other resources.”","His words showed he was really wealthy.","“Don’t you want to sell it? I’ll increase the price until you agree.”","“Really?”","Zhang Han suddenly fell silent.","He came up with a good idea."]},{"number":1639,"title":"Chapter 1639 Success","paragraphs":["Chapter 1639 Success","The Golden-armored Giant Beast was a very powerful duplication of Zhang Han. Their souls were connected, so he was not afraid that it would recognize another person as its host by the soul brand or other things.","More precisely, the Golden-armored Giant Beast was like a bottomless pit. It should take too many resources to cultivate a Golden-armored Giant Beast. Now that Zhang Han didn’t have so many resources, what should he do? He could only accept tasks one by one to fill the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“How about giving it to the Palace Master of the Highest Clouds Palace to nurture for some time?”","Zhang Han had his own thoughts.","“What do you want?”","Seeing that Zhang Han didn’t speak, Immortal Master Waterheaven, the master of the Highest Clouds Palace, smiled and said, “The territory of planets? I can give you 3,000 planets as your territory. The 3,000 planets with rich resources are all part of the Highest Clouds Palace’s resource base. All the resources are yours. As long as the Highest Clouds Palace exists, it will protect you.”","“Or do you want to go to the Nine Mountains Region? I still have some influence in the seventh mountain. I can send you to the holy land of the seventh mountain to cultivate. You can stay there for more than a thousand years, and I’ll provide you with resources.","“I think the value of a living ancient demonic beast is far higher than that of an ordinary spiritual treasure or a Profound-grade treasure. If you want treasures, you can take whatever you want from my treasure house.”","Hearing this, Yue Wuwei, who was in the rear, swallowed hard.","There were definitely quite a number of treasures in the treasure house of the Palace Master of the Highest Clouds Palace.","The other party was a ninth-tier Immortal Master. Yue Wuwei was very afraid. He only dared to listen from a distance and did not dare to approach. Otherwise, he would be doomed if the other party made a move.","Judging from the other party’s attitude, he was rich and wanted to buy it directly, not rob it.","“Alas!”","Yue Wuwei used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique to Zhang Han, saying, “Hurry up and refuse. If Immortal Master Waterheaven gets angry later, it will be hard to wind this matter up.”","“It doesn’t matter.”","Zhang Han was calm and still pondering.","“Therefore, feel free to tell me what you want. I’m here with sincerity,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","“Zhang Hanyang.”","Jiang Lijia felt that his chance had come. He sighed softly. “You are an excellent Six-star Emissary of my palace. You have a chance to soar to the heavens in one go. You need to think about it carefully.”","Speaking of soaring to the sky in one step, Immortal Master Waterheaven added, “If you want, I can let you be the Vice Palace Master of the Highest Clouds Palace. You won’t get as many resources as you get directly, but it will be more worthwhile in the long run.”","“Actually.”","Zhang Han was also a wily old bird. With an embarrassed look, he said, “I caught the cub of an ancient demonic beast by chance. It’s the Star Demon Dragon King, a more precious mutated beast.”","Zhang Han felt a little strange when he said that one of his duplications was mutated.","“I’ve tried to let it recognize me as its host for more than ten years, but I’ve never succeeded yet. Sometimes, I want to give up, but I’m not reconciled to it. It’s definitely not good for my cultivation.” Zhang Han sighed softly.","“The cultivation?” Immortal Master Waterheaven was silent for a moment. “In terms of cultivation, you can choose to go to the holy land to cultivate. You can temper your heart by yourself.”","“That’s why it can’t recognize me as its host. There’s always a barrier in my heart,” Zhang Han said.","“Do you want to sell it or not?” Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “No one can help you refine your heart.”","“It’s hard for the Star Demon Dragon King to recognize a host.” Zhang Han reminded him again, “I’m also worried that you would vent your anger on me if you had failed to let it recognize you as its host for a long time.”","“No! You can rest assured about that,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a smile. “You can inquire about my reputation in the seventh mountain. The reputation of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Star Sea was the same. We’re not people who go back on our word.”","Seeing the other party did not understand the hidden meaning of his words, Zhang Han said, “I wonder what Immortal Master Waterheaven thinks of renting it?”","“What? Renting?” Immortal Master Waterheaven was stunned, “Yes, of course.”","He was willing to rent or buy it.","He thought he could rent it all the time.","“You exchange 3,000 planets for rent, okay?” Zhang Han said, “The deadlines are the same. If you succeed, it will be converted into an exchange. If you fail, the 3,000 planets will still belong to the Highest Clouds Palace, and I can leave with the golden Star Demon Dragon King. What do you think of this method?”","“I think it’s great.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said in a surprised tone.","“I also think it’s great!”","Zhang Han laughed to himself.","He was worried that the Golden-armored Giant Beast had a big appetite, but the person who fed it came uninvited.","“Since you are so straightforward, I’ll give you three thousand planets, regardless of whether I’ll succeed or not,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said straightforwardly.","“No.” Zhang Han shook his head and said, “We have to follow the rules. This is the Hall Master Jiang Lijia’s suggestion for our emissaries.”","“Ha... Really? Jiang Lijia, you have done a good job,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a laugh.","Jiang Lijia looked at Zhang Han with excitement and exclaimed in his heart, “He is really my good subordinate!”","“It’s all thanks to the Palace Master’s teachings,” Jiang Lijia said shyly.","“As you said, how long is the time limit?” Immortal Master Waterheaven looked at Zhang Han again.","“Twenty years for the first time. If Immortal Master Waterheaven fails in twenty years, I’ll take it and try again. If I fail, let’s make the next deal,” Zhang Han suggested.","“Okay. If I succeed, the 3,000 stars will be yours, and you’ll become an elder of my Highest Clouds Palace,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said. “Let’s swear an oath to the Great Domain.”","Speaking of the solemn topic of the oath of the Great Domain, Zhang Han felt ashamed.","“But it’s good for you to give it a try. What if you succeed?”","It was rare for Zhang Han to hypnotize himself.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast didn’t even have a strand of a soul. How could the other party possibly succeed?","After making the oath, Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “Where is the Star Demon Dragon King? Can you let me have a look first?”","“You can take it with you. It’s over there.”","With a stir of his mind, a golden light appear in the spaceship where Mengmeng and the others were in the distance.","Swoosh!","The golden light flew over and came in front of them. The Golden-armored Giant Beast was more than 5,000 meters tall. It looked majestic, and its face was cold.","“Hiss!”","“Okay!”","“Is it so obedient?”","“Isn’t it fierce to you? Ha... It’s so handsome and domineering.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was a little excited.","His wish over the years had finally come true.","“Cutie, let me touch you.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven looked at the little cutie with gentler eyes than looking at his women.","However, Zhang Han had goosebumps all over his body.","He couldn’t stand it.","“Bro, I’ll trouble you to stay inside by yourself for a period of time.”","Zhang Han sealed a trace of his soul in the body of the Golden-armored Giant Beast. Then he took the initiative to block the perception.","If the other party wanted to touch it, he could continue. Anyway, Zhang Han didn’t feel anything now.","Zhang Han comforted himself and couldn’t help reminding the other party.","“Immortal Master Waterheaven, the Star Demon Dragon King has a violent temper. Sometimes, it is very fierce. It likes to devour metals and sleep. It doesn’t like to be disturbed often. The fewer people staying around it, the better. It is in the fifth-tier Tribulation Stage now. It’s very difficult to let it recognize someone as its host. Even if it has been with me since it was a cub, I haven’t succeeded in letting it recognize me as its host.”","“Of course.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven touched the nail on one of the toes of the Golden-armored Giant Beast. “It’s so sharp.”","He continued, “The Star Demon Dragon King has only appeared twice in the past 10,000 years. It is an extremely rare Holy Beast among the ancient demonic beasts. It will be able to grow into the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage. It doesn’t matter if it doesn’t want to recognize me as its master. If I can live in peace with it, be its friend, and it sometimes listens to me like you, it’s worth it.”","Even if he couldn’t become its host, he could show off to some of his old friends.","“That’s not a problem.”","Zhang Han said, “As long as it is fed and full, it will not make trouble, and its relationship with the feeder will get closer and closer. It has a good appetite.”","“Ha... I will satisfy it,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a smile. “I’ll keep an eye on it and feed it. Don’t worry.”","Seeing that the matter was settled, Jiang Lijia looked very happy.","He said, “I was wondering why the rare metal tasks always failed recently. It turns out that the metals have all been eaten by this guy.”","“I’m ashamed. I don’t have enough metals to feed it,” Zhang Han said with shame.","“Ha.” Jiang Lijia shook his head indifferently. “In the future, it will not be hungry anymore.”","Yue Wuwei was dumbfounded behind them.","He thought to himself, “Zhang Han is so cruel!” What a brilliant move!","If it was not hungry anymore, would it run out of the resources of Immortal Master Waterheaven after twenty years?","“How about talking on the spaceship? I’ll take you directly to your territory later. It’s in the inner ring of the Star Sea.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “It’s so big. It’s not easy to carry it.”","“It can shrink.”","Zhang Han said, “Lil Beast, Lil Beast, become smaller and follow Immortal Master Waterheaven. He can feed you well.”","“Ow!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast roared with a fierce look in its eyes. It raised its big claws, ready to attack.","“Oh, the little fellow is quite fierce. Ha...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven laughed and raised his hand. The energy surged.","At this time, the Golden-armored Giant Beast withdrew its aura and began to shrink. Finally, it became two meters tall.","“Tut-tut, it’s so cute.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was very happy.","Zhang Han thought to himself, “I wish you a happy life in 20 years.”","It was a sincere blessing.","“Let’s go. Abandon your little flying ship. Let Jiang Lijia bring it back. I’ll help you exchange it for some crystal stones,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","“Thank you.” Zhang Han beamed.","Suddenly, he felt Immortal Master Waterheaven was very good.","“Why didn’t I know such a passionate person like Immortal Master Waterheaven before?”","“Let’s go.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven couldn’t wait to take out 1,000 cubic meters of ninth-tier metals from his Space Ring. “Little guy, have a meal first.”","Swoosh!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast opened its big mouth and began to devour.","“It indeed has a good appetite.”","Under the gaze of Immortal Master Waterheaven, Mengmeng, Lisa, Zi Yan, and the others also flew over.","He looked at Zi Yan and Mengmeng for a while and said, “They are more beautiful than my women. Zhang Hanyang, you are so lucky.”","Then, he immediately withdrew his gaze and looked at the Golden-armored Giant Beast beside him. His eyes were filled with tenderness.","Many men’s love for beautiful women was deeper than love for their territories.","However, Immortal Master Waterheaven loved the Exotic Beasts much more than the beauties.","He was a typical man who regarded beautiful women as pink skeletons.","This kind of person was not rare among the ninth-tier Immortal Masters."]},{"number":1640,"title":"Chapter 1640 The Host of the Wolf Fang","paragraphs":["Chapter 1640 The Host of the Wolf Fang","“It’s so beautiful.”","“It’s like a gift from heaven. This perfect ancient demonic beast is amazing.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was intoxicated.","He moved closer to the Golden-armored Giant Beast and reached out to stroke its scales.","“They are thick and sharp. It deserves to be a mutated Star Demon Dragon King. The aura of these scales is ancient. It seems to have caused me to fall into the void and be unable to extricate myself. Its defense is just too strong.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven didn’t care about others at all.","He was intoxicated.","Mengmeng grinned, revealing two white teeth. She felt that her face was a little stiff and glanced at Zhang Han.","“Oh, my god!","“My dad betrayed himself.”","Zi Yan showed a strange look. Lisa covered her mouth and chuckled. Chen Chuan was in a daze. Yue Xiaonao was also a little confused.","Only Zhang Han seemed to be a little embarrassed.","“Ow!”","With a stir of his mind, the Golden-armored Giant Beast turned its head, opened its bloody mouth to Immortal Master Waterheaven, and roared.","The intoxicating Immortal Master Waterheaven was slightly shocked. The energy in his body circulated, and he almost defended himself.","“Ha...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven took a step back and said, “I won’t touch you anymore. Don’t be angry. I will be your new host for the next 20 years. Be obedient. I’ll give you metals to eat.”","Swoosh!","He put out another large piece of ninth-tier metals.","Swoosh!","After swallowing it, the Golden-armored Giant Beast narrowed its eyes with a look of enjoyment and became quiet.","This time, Immortal Master Waterheaven went to the front of it again and mischievously touched the claws of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","It didn’t react.","“What a cute little guy.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was supremely satisfied.","“Ahem. Ahem. Ahem.”","Mengmeng almost couldn’t hold back her laughter and could only cough a few times to restrain herself.","At this time, Immortal Master Waterheaven stepped back and looked at them.","“Why are you all standing there?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven glanced at the six men not far away, “Why is there no one serving?”","“Hiss! It’s my dereliction of duty.”","They immediately came over.","“Forget it.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven waved his hand and said, “Let’s go to your territory. The 3,000 planets in the Wolf River District in the inner ring all have rich resources. There are about 300 million disciples of the Highest Clouds Palace there, and they will all obey your orders. They can be regarded as the people that I have lent to you. If I succeed to become its host, they will belong to you. It will take about a year for you to get there. I’ll take you to Furong Hall first, and you can rest there.”","“Okay! Thank you, Immortal Master Waterheaven.” Zhang Han nodded.","“You’re welcome.” Immortal Master Waterheaven was in a good mood and very kind. He led them to Furong Hall in person.","After they left, the six men looked at each other.","“Palace Master, what should we do with it?” The captain of the guards pointed at the Golden-armored Giant Beast and asked.","Immortal Master Waterheaven patted his forehead and looked at Zhang Han. “Can I put it here?”","“It’s okay. It likes to sleep when it’s full.” Zhang Han said seriously, “It’s easy to be hungry. If it’s hungry, it will make a scene.”","Zi Yan and Mengmeng were speechless.","“Okay. Once it’s full, it will be quiet.” Immortal Master Waterheaven turned his head and said solemnly, “I’ll go to Furong Hall to talk to the guests first. You guys keep an eye on it. As long as it opens its eyes, feed it the ninth-tier metals.”","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Waterheaven directly threw his Space Ring to the back.","He couldn’t be bothered to take it himself.","“It won’t be hungry in a short time. It can hold on for half a month or even a month if you feed it once,” Zhang Han said.","“Ha... To let it recognize me as its host, I can’t treat it badly. Zhang Hanyang, just wait to become the real host of the 3,000 planets.” Immortal Master Waterheaven was very confident in himself.","“It seems Immortal Master Waterheaven knows a lot about the ancient demonic beasts,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“I like your confidence.”","“Yes. You will know more about me after staying longer in the Star Sea,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","After passing through a corridor filled with blue light, they arrived at Furong Hall. It was not small, covering an area of more than a thousand square meters. There were also several corridors and various kinds of rooms around it.","“There are 16 rooms. You can live here as you like. If you want to have meals, contact the guards in charge here.”","Then Immortal Master Waterheaven motioned for everyone to sit on the sofa.","Then, he began to ask.","“What are the usual habits of the Star Demon Dragon King? Should I send it out to fight?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked.","“It’s still growing, and it’s not very willing to fight. It just likes to eat and sleep. I think it’s very lazy.” Zhang Han sighed softly.","“That’s normal. It’s still growing.” Immortal Master Waterheaven understood it and said, “Will it resist if I brand its soul and make it recognize me as its host?”","“It may not resist, but it will get angry,” Zhang Han said in a standard manner. “The ancient demonic beast is born to hate this. You can give it a try if you’re sure. You can’t try it often. Otherwise, it will run away one day by accident.”","“You’re right.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded repeatedly. “I have to be careful in this respect.”","After saying that, Immortal Master Waterheaven was a little absent-minded. No one knew what he was thinking.","Then he asked some more basic questions, and Zhang Han answered honestly.","After a while, Immortal Master Waterheaven left.","Judging from his fast pace, he must have gone to find the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“Will he hug Lil Beast even when sleeping?” Mengmeng blinked.","Zhang Han fell silent.","It seemed to be possible.","“We don’t have to worry about food and drink anymore.”","Zhang Han glanced around and sighed softly. “It’s good to follow HImmortal Master Waterheaven. After all, he is the Palace Master of the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“You’re good at acting.”","Yue Wuwei used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique and said, “You must be happy in your heart. You let others raise your duplication. When the time comes, you can take it back by yourself.”","“It’s so embarrassing. The Golden-armored Giant Beast eats too much,” Zhang Han responded with the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","“The Furong Hall looks quite beautiful.” Lisa and Zi Yan chatted softly.","“This spaceship is of great value. It matches Immortal Master Waterheaven,” Zhang Han said.","“That is to say, Daddy, you are about to become the host of the 3,000 planets in the inner ring of the Star Sea, aren’t you?” Mengmeng was a little interested.","“That’s right for the time being.”","Zhang Han smiled.","The 3,000 planets all had rich resources, and there were many spiritual herbs bases. The annual yield was very high.","In the future 20 years, except for a special batch of spiritual herbs still growing, he would harvest other kinds of spiritual herbs.","All in all, Zhang Han would get a lot.","During a year, no matter which Space Shooting Planet they met, with the face of Immortal Master Waterheaven, they had priority to jump. It saved a lot of time.","Finally, the spaceship arrived at the Wolf River District.","“Here is the Wolf River District. The 3,000 planets with rich resources of our Highest Clouds Palace were in the Niman District. There are 36 main celestial bodies.”","“I have already issued an order. We are heading to the Wolf Fang Star. In the next 20 years, everyone here will obey your orders.”","After arriving at the place, there were hundreds of people welcoming them. Ten people were at the Early-Stage of ninth-tier Tribulation Stage, and 81 were at the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage. The rest were at the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage.","“Greetings, Your Highness.”","Everyone cupped their hands to Zhang Han.","“Serve him for the next twenty years. Someone will often report to me about the situation here. Anyone who disobeys the disciplines will be killed without exception.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said seriously.","“Yes, Master!”","Everyone present immediately cupped their hands.","Immortal Master Waterheaven was the Palace Master, and he was a man of his word.","The way they looked at Zhang Han also changed. This person turned out to be so important.","“I’ll go back first, Zhang Hanyang. He is Immortal Master Lanfeng, and he will be your housekeeper. You can ask him if you have any questions. Of course, you can contact me through him.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “I’ll go back now.”","“Okay.” Zhang Han smiled.","Under everyone’s gaze, Immortal Master Waterheaven quickly returned to the spaceship.","Swoosh!","The spaceship turned into a stream of light and left quickly.","Zhang Han activated his mind.","He could sense the state of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","There was a trace of his sealed soul over there. It wouldn’t have any problem.","“Your Highness.”","Immortal Master Lanfeng was a slightly fat middle-aged man. He walked over with a smile and said respectfully, “From today on, you are the Host of the Wolf Fang. The three thousand planets are all your territory. I will obey your orders at any time.”","“Ahem. Ahem.”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard.","He felt strange. “Has Zhang Han gotten a group of eighth-tier and ninth-tier Tribulation Stage subordinates?”","“Can you use these people to deal with Immortal Master Lingxi?” Yue Wuwei asked Zhang Han by the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","“They can’t be a match for Immortal Master Lingxi at all. The gap between the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage is the biggest among all the tiers. A large number of people at the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage are still far from the Peak-Stage,” Zhang Han replied with the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","Even two people in the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage had a big difference.","Immortal Master Lingxi was in the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. Her strength was very strong. She was also respected on the ninth mountain.","“Even Immortal Master Waterheaven is no match for Immortal Master Lingxi,” Zhang Han used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique again.","“It turns out to be like this.”","Yue Wuwei suddenly came to a realization. “It seems that Immortal Master Lingxi is a ruthless person.”","He thought about it carefully and was terrified. Zhang Han had once defeated Immortal Master Lingxi. At that time, he seemed to be even more ruthless.","“Let’s patrol all the planets first.” Zhang Han said.","He had no other things to do, and he didn’t have to worry about the Golden-armored Giant Beast. His Thunder Body didn’t have to devour the Tribulation Lightning. He was relaxing, so he wanted to patrol around to see the unique environment of each planet and the spiritual herbs and other resources.","“Okay.”","Immortal Master Lanfeng cupped his hands and led the team in person. They took an aircraft into the air and boarded a large king vessel. Moreover, a fleet of defensive ships began to set off with them.","“The three thousand celestial bodies are led by the main star, the Wolf Fang Star.”","Immortal Master Lanfeng introduced, “There are a total of 3,021 celestial bodies. Except for the major main celestial bodies, the rest are planets with rich resources. There are a total of 2800 crystal stone mines, 36,000 spiritual herbs bases, and 56,300 mineral veins of rare metals and others.”","Hearing of this, Yue Wuwei only had a few words in his mind, “We’re rich.”","Zhang Han also smiled.","He had seen so many spiritual treasures, but none had let him be so excited.","However, he didn’t have to worry about the resources and spiritual herbs recently.","It was time to patrol the territory.","All the subordinates on the celestial bodies in Zhang Han’s territory knew that in the future 20 years, there would be a person superior to the Highest Clouds Palace in charge of the territory. He was Zhang Hanyang, the Host of the Wolf Fang!"]},{"number":1641,"title":"Chapter 1641 Everything’s Going Well","paragraphs":["Chapter 1641 Everything’s Going Well","Zhang Han had visited all three thousand stars.","He visited ten planets a day on average. Even so, it took Zhang Han nearly a year to get a clear understanding of each spiritual herb base.","At the same time, he got the gains for the first year.","A large number of spiritual herbs, crystal stones, and other resources filled the Space Rings. Even Mengmeng’s Space Ring was full. The resources also filled three treasure vaults.","In the past, these resources would be sent to the headquarters of the Highest Clouds Palace. But now, that was no longer needed. They all belonged to Zhang Han.","As for the Golden-armored Giant Beast, Zhang Han would experience it every month.","His powerful duplication crossed layers of space.","He could sense the situation over there with wonderful treatment.","Immortal Master Waterheaven personally led people to build a palace for the Golden-armored Giant Beast, which was magnificent and made of rare metal.","The palace was seven thousand meters tall.","It was very mighty with thousands of formations.","The levitating formations were set up by Immortal Master Waterheaven to prevent the Golden-armored Giant Beast from being hungry and eating the palace so that it would not be crushed by the collapse of the palace.","The palace’s metal alone cost quite a bit. The Highest Clouds Palace’s rare metals had almost been used up.","The treasure houses on the side were also full of all kinds of metals. Hundreds of people served the Golden-armored Giant Beast 24 hours a day.","The bed was hundreds of meters long and soft. It was made of rare silk.","There was even a spirit spring. The spring water was something expensive.","It was extremely luxurious.","In the Highest Clouds Palace, Immortal Master Waterheaven had more than 600 concubines, and none of them could be compared with the Golden-armored Giant Beast. The treatment they got was far inferior to that of the beast.","That made those imperial concubines secretly jealous.","“What’s so good about an ancient demonic beast?”","“Watch your mouth! Watch your mouth!” The subordinate was so scared that his face turned pale. “Not long ago, Concubine Li said that in front of the Palace Master and got banished. Palace Master loves the Star Demon Dragon King the most now and favors no one else...”","Hiss!","The concubines all gasped.","“That’s unbelievable!”","Even Zhang Han thought so.","He felt a little ashamed in his heart.","“I didn’t expect Immortal Master Waterheaven to be so kind to the Golden-armored Giant Beast. Alas, no matter how well he treats it, it’s useless.","“I’ll get him an ancient demonic beast when I can.”","Zhang Han thought to himself.","It was conceivable that Immortal Master Waterheaven had done a good job to make Zhang Han think so.","Of course, he didn’t know that what he got was a fake Star Demon Dragon King.","“We’ll stay on the Wolf Fang Star in the next few years.”","After patrolling around, Zhang Han and the others returned to the Wolf Fang Star. He said, “If you have time, take a look around this area. There are many interesting places.”","“Okay. We’ll go wherever you go,” Mengmeng said indifferently.","In their current life, they didn’t feel any horror after coming to the Star Sea. They felt that there was nothing special about it and didn’t have any particular feelings besides the worry about Zhang Guangyou and the others, who had been taken away by Immortal Master Lingxi.","They had a relaxing time.","“There are a lot of spiritual herbs.”","Zhang Han said, “We’ll take some once a year and then start pellet refining to assist in cultivation.”","He turned to look at the guards on the side who had been following him.","Among them, the ninth-level and eighth-tier Immortal Masters were very respectful to Zhang Han and his companions and loyal to them without any ill intention.","This also showed the power of Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“Immortal Master Lanfeng, go into the major areas near your territory. If there is any treasure land, inform me. If you have nothing else to do, you can do your own business or cultivate,” Zhang Han said.","“Yes, Your Excellency! I’ll make the arrangements right away.” Immortal Master Lanfeng, who was slightly fat, cupped his hands and said, “If you need anything, you can contact me as soon as possible.”","“Okay.”","After Zhang Han instructed the Immortal Masters, the aircraft arrived in a brand new manor.","This manor was built according to the idea of Zhang Han. It was not bad in size. Compared with other buildings, it might be smaller, but it was also ten times larger than Mount New Moon.","Zhang Han and the others would stay in this building area.","Zhang Han added, “I don’t need anyone in the manor without my permission.”","“Yes, Your Excellency!”","Immortal Master Lanfeng didn’t ask why and directly ordered some servants in the manor to leave.","“Move all the spiritual herbs in the first treasure house here,” Zhang Han said.","“Yes, Your Excellency!”","A few hours later, the sky gradually darkened.","Zhang Han had finished what he had to do.","The spiritual herbs piled up into a hill.","Zhang Han said, “This is enough for us to do pellet refining for some time.","“From tomorrow on, Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Chen Chuan, you will also refine pellets together.”","“What? I don’t know how to do it. Uncle Zhang, I don’t want to refine pellets. I just want to sleep in bed,” Yue Xiaonao retorted.","“How old are you? Why are you still so playful? It’s time for you to learn this. It’s not easy for your uncle to find time to teach you. How can you not cherish the opportunity?” Yue Wuwei said.","“Then you can learn it. Anyway, I’m not interested,” Yue Xiaonao said indifferently.","“Yue Xiaonao!” Lisa looked at Yue Xiaonao sternly.","Yue Xiaonao felt dispirited.","She was not afraid of Yue Wuwei but Lisa.","“Work hard on your pellet-refining skills. If you perform well, I’ll reward you with something good,” Yue Wuwei said with a smile.","“Okay.” Yue Xiaonao pursed her lips and didn’t say anything more.","“We’ll do it for fun. Even if the furnace explodes, it will be okay. There are so many spiritual herbs here,” Mengmeng muttered.","“Will it be a waste if the furnace explodes?” Chen Chuan scratched his head.","“It won’t matter even if the herbs are wasted.”","While talking about this topic, Zhang Han smiled and said, “Every pellet-refining master will experience this kind of waste that you understand. This is a learning process. Later, when your success rate of pellet refining increases, the value will make up for the waste. It’s just like an investment. You can invest 50,000 in the early stage and earn it back soon. Do you get it?”","“Got it, Uncle Zhang.” Chen Chuan nodded obediently.","“You will do pellet refining half a day every day. You still have to cultivate. Of course, you get to rest often and play,” Zhang Han said.","Only then did Yue Xiaonao show a satisfied expression. “That’s more like it. We have to balance work and rest together.”","Hearing this, Yue Wuwei said grumpily, “You do know how to rest.”","Zhang Han was not worried about cultivation.","In terms of cultivation, the Golden-armored Giant Beast was rapidly improving its strength.","According to the speed at which Immortal Master Waterheaven fed it with metal, it would break through to the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage in two years.","By then, Zhang Han’s other duplications would also make a breakthrough at the same time.","Of course, the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Great Demon Body, and the Thunder Body could not lag behind.","The duplications would only resonate with each other when Zhang Han’s total energy reached a certain level. In other words, if his other duplications were too weak, they would delay the advancement of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","To make a breakthrough, the Golden-armored Giant Beast needed the other duplications to be strong enough. Otherwise, it would be useless for the Golden-armored Giant Beast to absorb the metal. The energy it got would overflow.","“The first medicinal pellet we will refine is a fifth-tier one. The starting point is relatively low. But it’s a special kind of medicinal pellet called the Soul-guiding Pellet.”","That night, after having dinner made by Zhang Han, the crowd rested. The next morning, Zhang Han began to teach.","“With Mengmeng’s understanding of the Dao of plants and vegetation, it should be very easy for her to master it. Reviewing the past helps one to understand the present. You can start with the fifth-tier medicinal pellet. The pellet formula is as follows. Keep the control of time and heat in mind.”","They began to refine the pellet.","Mengmeng showed her skills at her first attempt, which was a direct success.","For a beginner, the success rate of this kind of medicinal pellet was about 1%, which was not simple.","While refining this kind of pellet, their mastery of the pellet-refining process and their talents could be shown.","As a result, Yue Xiaonao succeeded on the 60th try, and Chen Chuan succeeded on the 80th try.","This process alone took a whole day.","Under the moonlight, looking at the bright moon, Yue Xiaonao and Chen Chuan also felt a sense of achievement after success.","“Sister Mengmeng, you’re amazing. You succeeded on your first try.” Chen Chuan scratched his head.","“What I did is just average. It’s just that you’re too stupid. You only succeed once in 80 attempts,” Mengmeng said. “The pellet formula is so detailed.”","“Alas!”","Chen Chuan was mentally exhausted and felt quite frustrated.","Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing.","Mengmeng had the Profound Underworld Holy Fire, so she could master refining pellets. She could refine seventh-tier medicinal pellets, but now, she was refining a fifth-tier one.","Chen Chuan was still too young.","“The pellet refining will take half a day tomorrow.”","Zhang Han said, “There are 39 kinds of spiritual herbs in total for refining the Soul-guiding Pellet. I’ll teach you the basic knowledge of these spiritual herbs tomorrow.”","He was instructing the Dao of plants and vegetation to the beginners through the way of refining every medicinal pellet, which was also a way to teach pellet refining.","The next day, the crowd began to cultivate in this way.","In the morning, they studied the Dao of plants and vegetation. At noon, they practiced pellet refining for two hours and used three furnaces. In the afternoon, they cultivated. They took a break in the evening.","They would go on a trip every month to taste the local specialty tea, wine, and delicacies.","They lived a comfortable and carefree life.","Mengmeng, Chen Chuan, Yue Xiaonao, even Yue Wuwei and Lisa, and even Zi Yan, had learned a lot about pellet refining.","Mengmeng had made the fastest progress.","Everyone was advancing.","Three years passed in a flash.","They had stayed on the Wolf Fang Star for a long time.","“A treasure land has appeared in the Linlang District?” Zhang Han raised his eyebrows slightly.","“Yes.”","Immortal Master Lanfeng said seriously, “It’s a ninth-tier treasure land, which is located in a secret realm. The secret realm has only been open for a year. Rare gems are often discovered in it. In addition, the news of the treasure land has spread out. Many Immortal Masters have set off for it. It’s called Wood Dragon Treasure Land. It’s suspected to be the place where the Wood Dragon died and is full of essential energy. It’s said that there are 100 peaks in the treasure land, which can only accommodate 100 people to cultivate. It’s a place where top experts fight. Your Excellency, if you want to go, we have to hurry up. Since the Highest Clouds Palace has great prestige, we can occupy a peak and have a place to cultivate.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly.","“Let’s go.”","Mengmeng cheered. She also wanted to go out and have fun.","The crowd went out happily.","On the other side.","On the Seventh Mountain of the Nine Mountains Region in the center of the Star Sea.","“What did you say?”","The face of Immortal Master Waterheaven darkened slightly, “The rare metals in the treasure house are used up? So soon?”","“Palace Master, they’ve been used up. That, that Star Demon Dragon King eats too much,” an old subordinate said with a wry smile. “In the past three years, on average, it can absorb more than 50 tons of ninth-tier rare metals a day. It has consumed more than 50,000 tons of metals we stored.”","“I can’t believe that we’ve run out of them.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven frowned slightly and said, “We can’t starve Lil Beast. Feed it with the eighth-tier metal first.”","“Yes, Palace Master!”","“In addition, pass down the order immediately. All the branch halls of the Highest Clouds Palace need to turn in all the rare metals above the seventh tier in their treasure houses. All the protectors and other members of the Highest Clouds Palace can use their rare metals to exchange for points twice as much,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","“Yes! I’ll inform them immediately.”","“Get it done as soon as possible!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven pointed at the old man’s chest. “You can’t even do such a small thing well. How many times have I told you? We can never ever be short of metal in the treasure house!”"]},{"number":1642,"title":"Chapter 1642 Lil Beast Are You Here?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1642 Lil Beast Are You Here?","“Got it.” The old man’s forehead was covered in sweat.","He also complained in his heart.","“I’ve reminded him twice, but at that time, Immortal Master Waterheaven didn’t say anything. It was understandable because he was busy.","“However, in the past three years, Immortal Master Waterheaven had visited the Metal Hall, the Dragon Palace, for more than 800 days. Doesn’t he know that the Star Demon Dragon King is about to run out of metal?","“Alas!”","The old man sighed inwardly.","“I only go there once a month.”","But after thinking about it, he smiled again.","“With Palace Master’s fondness for the Star Demon Dragon King, I’m afraid that even those who serve the Dragon Palace will be reprimanded.”","Things were as he had expected.","After arranging everything, he went to the Dragon Palace without stopping.","He heard the roar of Immortal Master Waterheaven from a distance.","Hundreds of people stood in three rows, trembling in front.","Immortal Master Waterheaven said angrily, “I’m telling you, if it gets hungry one day, I’ll deduct half of your points! Humph! You’re neglecting your duty.”","Listening to a series of reprimands, the old man at the back smiled and did not approach.","Immortal Master Waterheaven had a nice temper. Although he scolded his subordinates, he would not really punish them severely.","When he turned around and walked to the steps of the Dragon Palace, there was a smile on his face.","Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a smile, “Lil Beast, I’m here.”","Many of the disciples behind him almost burst out laughing.","“The usually serious Immortal Master Waterheaven is really incredible when he gets unrestrained.","“He has never been so unrestrained to his women before.”","“Arrrrgh!”","Just as Immortal Master Waterheaven walked over, a heaven-shaking roar echoed out from within the Dragon Palace.","The energy was earth-shattering.","A hurricane swept in all directions.","Swoosh!","The cyan clothes of Immortal Master Waterheaven were rustling in the wind.","He felt that the aura inside was rising steadily.","“The sixth-tier Tribulation Stage!","“So fast. As expected of the Star Demon Dragon King. It broke through in three years!","“Hahaha, terrific!","“I’ll cultivate my relationship with it for a few years and then try the moves to see if it recognizes me as its owner.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was in a good mood.","On the other side, Zhang Han and the others had just set off.","Swish!","Zhang Han suddenly had an idea.","“I’ll stay in the training room for a while.”","After entering the room, he sat down cross-legged.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Great Demon Body, and the Thunder Body appeared at the same time, and their auras were also rising.","“The sixth-tier Tribulation Stage!","“Without the tribulation lightning and the rules of the outside world, it naturally reached the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","Moments later, Zhang Han opened his eyes and smiled.","“Immortal Master Waterheaven, I appreciate you more and more.","“You have fed it well.”","Without Immortal Master Waterheaven, Zhang Han thought that it would have taken the Golden-armored Giant Beast at least 20 years to make a breakthrough, where there would be constant risks.","Now, it had made a breakthrough directly after resting.","“However, the Golden-armored Giant Beast eats too much. The next breakthrough will consume more metal. I can’t just count on Immortal Master Waterheaven, the tribulation thunder, and the treasure land...”","Zhang Han thought about it.","“I need to devour the tribulation thunder and the treasure land at the same time.","“As for the Great Demon Body, I don’t need to worry about it at all. I just need it to comprehend supernatural power on its own. The nutrients on a planet will be enough for it to maintain the balance that can allow other duplications to make a breakthrough and not lag behind.","“Huh?","“I need to feel the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“In its sleep in recent years, it has comprehended several kinds of innate supernatural powers by itself.","“Not bad, not bad!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast opened its eyes in the Dragon Palace. It was much more intelligent than usual, which was what Zhang Han felt with his own senses.","“Lil Beast, this is nice. I’m very happy that you’ve made a breakthrough.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven rubbed his hands together and said with a hesitant expression, “Well, in a few days, some of my old friends will come to visit. Lil Beast, let’s discuss this. Can you display some trivial moves by then? Also, listen to me and let me have some prestige in front of my friends. That way, I can exchange some rare ninth-tier metals with them.”","His expression and tone made Zhang Han feel that he was a simp.","“Awooo!”","Zhang Han curled his lips on the other side. The Golden-armored Giant Beast cried out, but its voice was not so fierce. It nodded slightly, which made Immortal Master Waterheaven fall into excitement.","“Its spirituality is not bad, and it has an initial relationship with me. I didn’t come here for nothing in the past 800 days!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was pleasantly surprised.","“According to this progress, it will be much easier for me to display the move and make Lil Beast recognize me as its master. I can even let it display that move.","“This is great!”","“Alas!”","Zhang Han sighed in the practice room and said, “It’s rare for Immortal Master Waterheaven to be so considerate as to give Lil Beast so much metal. I guess I’ll play along.”","The trip to the Linlang District would take about two to three months.","During this period, Immortal Master Lanfeng also explained the situation of the Wood Dragon Treasure Land in detail.","The energy in the treasure land was very rich, which was very beneficial for cultivation. Judging from the degree of the secret realm, the energy could be maintained for at least 30 years.","However, the 100 peaks were almost as thin as chopsticks. Only four or five people could sit on each of them, but basically, one Dao Seeking Cultivator occupied one peak pillar over there.","At present, many eighth-tier and ninth-tier Dao Seeking Cultivators had occupied their places.","With the reputation and influence of the Highest Clouds Palace, Zhang Han and the others could also have a peak pillar. But if they were late, things would be a little more troublesome.","After all, the people who went there were also from the sects in the inner ring of the Star Sea. They had powerful backers, so they might not be afraid of the Highest Clouds Palace.","The Highest Clouds Palace was quite large, but it wasn’t a super sect. In fact, there was quite a gap between it and the huge forces.","A few days passed in the blink of an eye.","On this day, a few old friends of Immortal Master Waterheaven came over.","After the space station reported, Immortal Master Waterheaven flew out of the palace and welcomed several people in the sky. There were a total of five people, all of whom were old men.","The leading old man in a cloth gown had the best relationship with Waterheaven, and he was called Immortal Master Hedun.","At this time, he laughed and said, “Waterheaven, we haven’t seen each other for 50 years. You look good. Are you ready for the final Heavenly Tribulation?”","“Yes, I’ll go through the tribulation tomorrow.” Immortal Master Waterheaven played along and made a joke. Then, he said, “You guys reached the ninth tier earlier than me. Now we are still very far away from the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. How dare we undergo the final Heavenly Tribulation?”","“Yeah.”","When he spoke of the final Heavenly Tribulation, Immortal Master Hedun sighed lightly. “The final Heavenly Tribulation is too formidable. Since ancient times until now, countless great figures have perished prematurely in the final Heavenly Tribulation.”","The white-haired old man next to him said, “Five hundred years ago when Immortal Master Damo went through his tribulation, he attracted the yin-yang tribulation thunder. It was the most powerful Heavenly Tribulation in thousands of years, and Immortal Master Damo couldn’t resist it. That was merely the Heavenly Tribulation of the second level.”","The Heavenly Tribulations were divided into nine levels.","The first-level Heavenly Tribulation was the kind of the final Heavenly Tribulation with unitary qualitative tribulation thunder, which was the easiest Heavenly Tribulation to undergo. For example, the Demonic Wind Heavenly Tribulation contained the wind attribute.","The second-level Heavenly Tribulation was the Yin-Yang Heavenly Tribulation. The most frightening kind was the Heavenly Tribulation which involved Life and Death Energy. It was called the Life and Death Yin-Yang Heavenly Tribulation.","The third-level Heavenly Tribulation had the tribulation thunder with incredible star energy. It was the same with the fourth-level Thunder Tribulation.","Among the fifth-level to the ninth-level Heavenly Tribulations, the divine thunder over the sky was the most terrifying one of the ninth-level Heavenly Tribulations.","Immortal Master Hedun shook his head and sighed. “Two thousand years ago, Immortal Master Tigerwolf summoned the Five Elements Holy Thunder, which was the most terrifying Heavenly Tribulation in nearly ten thousand years. In the end, Immortal Master Tigerwolf couldn’t even resist the first bolt of tribulation thunder and died directly.”","“It’s not easy to become immortal and ascend to the world of immortals.” Immortal Master Waterheaven shook his head.","The white-haired old man said with a smile, “You need to be at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage to undergo the final Heavenly Tribulation. In fact, there has been one-sided news about the world of immortals since ancient times. It is said that some Grand Masters know these secrets.”","“Those are all people who have lived for more than 10,000 years,” Immortal Master Hedun said, “and they must have a lot of trump cards. For example, Immortal Master Lingxi of the Ninth Mountain has been at the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage for more than 6,000 years, but now she doesn’t dare to summon the final Heavenly Tribulation. 99% of the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage experts have died. Only one in 10,000 people can successfully go to the world of immortals.”","The horrible probability was always haunting these Dao Seeking Cultivators at the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage in the Cultivation World.","“So many Grand Masters are holding back.” The white-haired old man sighed with emotion. “Our current goal is to advance to the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, and then we will be qualified to know those secrets.”","“Let’s not talk about this for now.” Immortal Master Waterheaven chuckled and said, “Let’s go back to the palace. I’ll show you something later.”","“What is it?” Immortal Master Hedun and the others were stunned.","“Could it be some new pretty lady you got?” someone asked suspiciously.","“What pretty lady?” The tone of Immortal Master Waterheaven suddenly became a little indifferent, “Heh, that would not be worth mentioning.”","He used a disdainful tone.","“That’s hilarious! No pretty ladies can compare with Lil Beast.”","“What is it then?” Immortal Master Hedun asked.","He got even more curious. “Could it be some kind of rare treasure?”","“Oh, by the way,” Immortal Master Hedun said, “I found a secret realm in a barren area between the Eighth Mountain and the Ninth Mountain. The aura inside is very strong, and there are at least ten kinds of Elemental Sources. I’m here to ask if you want to go with me.”","When Immortal Master Waterheaven heard this, his changed slightly. “At least ten? I’m in.”","It was normal to have an aura of Elemental Source, but there might not be an Elemental Source in it. This kind of thing was very beneficial to the cultivation of a ninth-level Immortal Master, but at the same time, it could only be chanced upon by chance.","But since there might be an Elemental Source, Immortal Master Waterheaven planned to go there.","The Immortal Masters went to the palace.","Immortal Qi drifted about. Fine wines and delicacies were prepared in an extremely sumptuous manner.","Furthermore, there were over a hundred women wearing long dresses that were dancing gracefully around the palace hall. Every one of the women had relatively cute deer horns on their heads. They were all very beautiful and were from the Deerhorn Clan that were rarely seen.","The members of the Deerhorn Clan were clans that could only be observed from afar and couldn’t be offended. They only married their clansmen. If they slept in the same bed with outsiders, their appearances would age within a single day.","With the Deerhorn Clan’s members dancing, the atmosphere in the palace was extremely good.","Several ninth-level Immortal Masters had been drinking and chatting for a few hours.","After eating and drinking-","“Let’s go out. I’ll show you my cute little thing.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled and took the lead to fly out.","He directly flew into the void of the universe.","“What are we doing here?” Immortal Master Hedun was confused. “What will we see?”","“Wait a minute.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven spoke to the Golden-armored Giant Beast lying in the Dragon Palace via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","“Lil Beast, Lil Beast, are you there?","“A few of my old friends are here. Why don’t you come out and exercise? Since I’ve personally fed you with metal for more than 800 days, could you show me some respect and grant my wish?”","He sounded a little nervous.","If Zhang Han heard this, he would probably wonder why Immortal Master Heavenwater was acting like a simp."]},{"number":1643,"title":"Chapter 1643 Dragon Supreme?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1643 Dragon Supreme?","Immortal Master Waterheaven had made up his mind.","If he couldn’t summon Lil Beast with the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, he would go down and invite it in person.","One second, two seconds... ten seconds passed.","“Alas!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed in his heart, and for a moment, he felt heartbroken the way he did when he was young.","He was a little sad, feeling weak, pitiful, and helpless.","“My effort in eight hundred days is not enough. There’s still a long way to go. I need to keep working hard!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven wasn’t troubled by his bad feelings. After all, he was an experienced expert.","A few seconds later, he adjusted his mentality.","Immortal Master Hedun asked, “Where is it?”","“It will be here right away. I...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven wanted to say, “I’ll be back soon.”","However-","“Ow!","“Ow!","“Ow!”","Three incomparably intense sound waves suddenly surged out from the Dragon Palace.","It was a vicious roar.","However, at this time, in the ears of Immortal Master Waterheaven, it was like the sound of nature.","Smack!","Immortal Master Waterheaven clapped his hands excitedly.","“I’m coming, baby!”","What he said also spread to the surrounding areas.","When the trace of Zhang Han’s will in the Golden-armored Giant Beast heard this, he suddenly didn’t want to go over.","What he didn’t know was that Immortal Master Waterheaven was only one step away from being disgraced.","After thinking about how much metal it had eaten over the years, the Golden-armored Giant Beast shook its butt, left the Dragon Palace, and flew into the air.","“AHH!","“Shit! Dragon King is leaving!”","Nearly a thousand people in charge of the Dragon Palace were startled.","At this time, the voice of Immortal Master Waterheaven resounded in the air. “It doesn’t matter. I am summoning it.”","His voice was indifferent, which made him appear domineering.","Swoosh!","A golden meteor flew over from below.","Immortal Master Hedun and the others were all at the ninth tier, so they had already sensed it clearly.","“Is your little guy this Exotic Beast?”","“There seems to be nothing special about it.”","“You’re making a big deal out of nothing.”","They all shook their heads, unable to discern what was going on.","“Heh.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven looked calm and put his hands behind his back. “Lil Beast, come here.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast played along.","Clatter!","Before it could get close, its body began to expand.","It grew from 1,000 meters, 2,000 meters, 3,000 meters, and 7,000 meters to 9,000 meters tall.","Its height of nearly 10,000 meters made Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others look like sesame seeds.","“Ow! Ow!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast had a fierce look in its eyes. Its thick right front claw cut through the void, which was very sharp, and it went straight to Immortal Master Hedun.","Its might was shocking.","“What...” The pupils of Immortal Master Hedun and the others constricted.","It was rare to see such a huge ancient demonic beast.","“Hahahaha!”","The hearty laughter of Immortal Master Waterheaven spread over a hundred miles.","“Lil Beast, don’t hurt them. They’re my friends.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven waved his hand and gently dissipated the waves of attack released by the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“Take out some rare ninth-tier metal first. I’ll get you something else later.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven originally wanted to feed the Golden-armored Giant Beast with metal himself, but after feeling the Space Ring, he found that he had run out of ninth-tier rare metal and only had the ordinary kind.","At this time, what he was doing was the best for Lil Beast, which played along with him.","“Okay.”","Immortal Master Hedun looked up at the Golden-armored Giant Beast and took out a few tons of metal.","“What’s the use of this little metal? It’s far from enough for Lil Beast. Offer more, and I will definitely get you guys something nice,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said in a dissatisfied tone.","“Fine.”","Immortal Master Hedun gave a wry smile and took out 80% of the rare metals in his Space Ring.","The others followed suit. They offered so much metal that it was enough to feed Golden-armored Giant Beast three times with its current appetite.","Swish!","The Giant Mouth Image appeared and devoured all of the metal.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast blinked its big eyes and looked at Immortal Master Waterheaven kindly as if it was waiting for the next command.","“Can you grow smaller?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked tentatively.","Swoosh!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast kept shrinking until it was only 20 meters tall.","“Hahaha!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven felt so good. “Lil Beast, it’s not in vain that I’ve fed you for so many years. Go back and have a good sleep. When you wake up, I’ll give you fine metal to eat. Good boy.”","He spoke in such a gentle tone.","At this time, watching the scene below, many of the imperial concubines became more and more resentful.","Those beautiful ladies felt resentful to have been suppressed by a monster.","Swoosh!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast flew straight back to the Dragon Palace and lay on the comfortable bed, snoring loudly.","“What, what is this?” Immortal Master Hedun and the others were really frightened.","At this time, they were a little shocked.","“You’ve kept an ancient demonic beast?” The white-haired old man said in surprise, “You really got an ancient demonic beast. Judging from its figure and innate might, it seems to be very powerful. But I can’t think of what type it is.”","“Alas!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven pretended to sigh. “It’s a long story. I got it by luck.”","“What happened?” Immortal Master Hedun’s eyes lit up. “What’s the origin of this ancient demonic beast?”","“I believe all of you have heard of the Star Demon Dragon King.” Immortal Master Waterheaven clasped his hands behind his back.","“What?!” Immortal Master Hedun exclaimed.","“Star, Star Demon Dragon King?”","“Oh my god, that’s a Holy Beast among the ancient demonic beasts!”","“It will definitely grow into a terrifying Holy Beast at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, which can travel through the void of the universe!”","“This kind of Holy Beast is more valuable than a holy land.”","The shocking voices made Immortal Master Waterheaven feel great and secretly happy at this time.","He felt so nice as if he was looking down on the world.","He even felt quite complacent.","“I’m flattered, everyone.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven beamed. “It was not easy for me to get such a Holy Beast.”","“How did you get it? Is there any more?” Immortal Master Hedun immediately asked.","Everyone wanted to get a king of the ancient demonic beasts.","They all wanted to, but the ancient demonic beast was too difficult to tame, and it grew up in the barren area. Only a mature one could come to the Cultivation World for a walk.","In the entire Cultivation World, there were tens of thousands of ninth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivators, but only a handful of them had a Holy Beast, who were very lucky.","“I got it from a friend. He is a Six-star Emissary of the Highest Clouds Palace in the outer ring. At that time, Lil Beast was only at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage. It couldn’t recognize anyone as its master, so I got it by spending 3,000 planets with rich resources.” Immortal Master Waterheaven was proud.","“What?!”","The white-haired old man exclaimed, “You got it with merely 3,000 planets with rich resources. It’s so cheap. Alas, why can’t I get such a great deal? Is there something wrong with the person who sold it?”","“Watch your words!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven frowned. “That is my benefactor. Please don’t make bad comments about him.”","The white-haired old man was embarrassed. “I made a slip of the tongue. Congratulations, Waterheaven. You finally got an ancient demonic beast.”","“Ha...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled. “It’s just the preliminary.”","He wouldn’t tell them about the specific time limit of the cooperation, which was 20 years.","“It’s said that the Star Demon Dragon King is black or dark green. Why is yours golden?” Immortal Master Hedun asked.","Immortal Master Waterheaven did not hesitate and even said in a somewhat enigmatic tone, “Because it is the supreme master among the Star Demon Dragon Kings and is a Dragon Supreme. That’s why it is golden.”","“Dragon Supreme?” The others were shocked.","“So, this may also be my greatest luck.” Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed. “It’s a favor from the heavens.”","“Well, you said that just to make us envious.” Immortal Master Hedun snorted. “Cut the crap. Let’s go to the secret realm directly.”","“Take your Star Demon Dragon King with you. It’s at the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage. Let’s see what it can do,” the white-haired old man said.","“That won’t do.” Immortal Master Waterheaven immediately refused. “Lil Beast is still in the process of growing. It’s still underage. What if it gets injured when it goes out? A secret realm with an Elemental Source isn’t easy to deal with.”","Everyone was speechless.","“The ancient demonic beasts are born with supernatural power, which is most suitable for traveling in the starry sky. How could you keep yours at home?”","“All right, cut the crap. I’ll buy all your rare metals. I must leave good food for Lil Beast,” said Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“That won’t do,” Immortal Master Hedun said. “You’re merely showing off to us. How could you still want our deal done now?”","“Then I won’t pay for the metal I used just now,” threatened Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“You’re going back on your word...”","Immortal Master Hedun pulled a wry face. In the end, he handed over the metal obediently.","He took out all the metals above the eighth tier and only kept the ones that were useful to him.","Immortal Master Waterheaven also gave the others a satisfactory exchange.","After that, he arrived at the Dragon Palace.","He asked, “All the metals from the different major halls are on the way, right?”","“Yes, Palace Master. 130 major halls’ resources have arrived. The number of ninth-tier metals has reached 9,500 tons. The resources of the other 600,000 branch halls are still on the way. They will arrive in succession in three years,” the subordinate replied.","“These metals are enough for it to eat for five or six years.” Immortal Master Waterheaven relaxed a lot.","Just by listening to this terrifying number, one could tell how big the appetite of the Golden-armored Giant Beast was.","“Take good care of Lil Beast and don’t let anything bad happen to it. I’ll show no mercy if necessary, understand?” Immortal Master Waterheaven said in a low voice.","“Understood!”","Thousands of subordinates responded seriously.","They felt that taking care of the Golden-armored Giant Beast was quite easy.","In addition to eating, it would be sleeping. They didn’t need to do anything.","“Lil Beast, I’ll be back in about three years.","“When I come back, I’ll spend more time with you. I’ll bring you more metal when I go out.”","After Immortal Master Waterheaven finished speaking, he listened to the snoring of the Golden-armored Giant Beast and felt a little disappointed.","How he wished it could open its eyes and send him off.","Immortal Master Waterheaven left with the others for the Ninth Mountain.","It would take at most a year or so to travel back and forth, but it might also take a year or two to reach the secret realm.","Like Zhang Han and the others, they were all on the way.","However, Zhang Han was going to the Wood Dragon Treasure Land that appeared in the Linlang District.","The reason why it was called the Wood Dragon Treasure Land was because of the Wood Dragon’s aura.","After learning about this, Zhang Han felt that the alleged Wood Dragon was the ancient demonic beast that had died on a certain continent in ancient times. After many years, it finally transformed into a treasure land and drifted in the starry sky. Now that it had been discovered, it wasn’t strange for people to address the treasure land the Wood Dragon Treasure Land.","After all, there were many knowledgeable Dao Seeking Cultivators in the vast Star Sea.","The short journey of two months soon passed.","“Up ahead is the Wood Dragon Treasure Land.”","A faint green wave of energy gathered into the shape of a Wood Dragon.","Zhang Han suddenly realized that he seemed to have underestimated this treasure land."]},{"number":1644,"title":"Chapter 1644 A Wise Man Submits to Circumstances","paragraphs":["Chapter 1644 A Wise Man Submits to Circumstances","“Let’s go!”","There were a total of five ninth-tier Immortal Masters and dozens of eighth-tier Immortal Masters in the guard team led by Immortal Master Lanfeng.","They led the way in front in a mighty manner.","Zhang Han and his companions followed them closely, found an entrance, and entered the secret realm.","“Your Excellency, the place where the hundred peaks are located is deep in the secret realm. It may take us two days to get there.”","Immortal Master Lanfeng said in a much more cautious tone, “When the time comes, we can just occupy the seats directly. We will stand guard around you. If there are no seats, I’ll negotiate with those people. Although the Highest Clouds Palace has some prestige in the Star Sea, there are still many forces that we are afraid of.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly in response.","Zhang Han knew more about the Star Sea than Immortal Master Lanfeng did.","The Star Sea was vast, and it was the core of the Cultivation World. However, in the outer and inner rings of the Star Sea, the strength of many Dao Seeking Cultivators was limited.","The ninth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivators were almost all at the Early Stage.","There was still a long way to go before they could reach the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","Just like Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Lingxi, the gap between their strength was not small.","At this time, Yue Wuwei said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “We have Immortal Master Lanfeng and so many other Immortal Masters. There shouldn’t be many forces that our guards need to fear, right?”","“There will be many,” Zhang Han said. “I feel that we may not even occupy one of the 100 peaks.”","“Are those forces that powerful?” Yue Wuwei was stunned.","He had just learned something about the Star Sea and didn’t know much about it.","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “There are countless sects in the Star Sea. The Human Clan is a big clan. It can be said that all the clans are competing for glory. There are countless first-class forces. The Highest Clouds Palace is one of them, but it is not a super sect yet. Although the super sects are powerful, the Holy Lands are superior to them. Those Holy Lands are scattered in various secret places in the Nine Mountains Region. Just like the blessed region, they rarely appear. The Grand Master of each Holy Land is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. Many of them have lived for tens of thousands of years.”","“Is it that they don’t dare to undergo their tribulations for tens of thousands of years?” Yue Wuwei was silent for a moment.","“The final Heavenly Tribulation is very difficult to overcome.” Zhang Han sighed to himself. “The Heavenly Tribulation where one breaks through to the ninth tier from the eighth tier is not very powerful. It’s just an ordinary kind of qualitative Heavenly Tribulation. The weakest among the final Heavenly Tribulations is more than a hundred times more powerful than the one where a cultivator breaks through to the ninth tier from the eighth tier.”","“It’s incredible. Fortunately, you don’t have to undergo tribulation. I’ve offended the Heavenly Tribulation. Then, when I go through my tribulation, will there be a tough Heavenly Tribulation for me?” Yue Wuwei said in a slightly worried tone.","“Isn’t it obvious?” Zhang Han curled his lips.","Yue Wuwei was speechless.","“Needless to say, there will surely be a tough one for me. With the Heavenly Tribulation’s vengeful character, it will definitely find an opportunity to hack me to death.”","“I hope your Thunder Body can grow up quickly,” Yue Wuwei said.","“It will.”","Zhang Han smiled slightly.","His current cultivation method was much more powerful than before. It was even unheard of and unprecedented.","It was because his duplications all came from the higher world.","Zhang Han was not worried about the Heavenly Tribulation at all. He even felt that if he reached the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage, he might be able to break the void and go to the higher world with one punch.","However, he was worried about the calamity that Sir had mentioned.","The smoother things were for him now, the more terrifying his calamity would be.","Thinking of this, Zhang Han suddenly had an idea.","“Perhaps I need to cause some trouble? Some danger? Will it indirectly affect the calamity?”","Zhang Han came up with an immature idea.","“I probably will not get to affect it by doing that. Next time I go to the Land of God’s Meteorite, I’ll ask about it.” Zhang Han felt that it was better not to act rashly and to follow the normal way.","Moreover, it was not easy to find trouble. He couldn’t provoke others casually.","Two days later, Zhang Han and his companions arrived near the 100 peaks.","The mountains were filled with fog, like a fairyland.","Above the clouds, there were a hundred stone pillars. Practically every stone pillar had a person on it.","All around the stone pillars, there were groups of mountains and ravines, towering into the clouds.","But the stone pillars were higher than these mountain peaks.","The rich spiritual Qi and the essence of energy all indicated that cultivating on the stone pillars a day would be more than a hundred days of cultivating in the outside world.","As for the mystery within, people could only experience it themselves.","There were tens of thousands of people on the surrounding mountain peaks, all of whom were followers of the cultivators on the stone pillars.","It was no exaggeration to say that one could not gain a foothold on the stone pillar without power.","“There’s one more spot.”","Immortal Master Lanfeng observed for two seconds, and his eyes lit up slightly. “It’s on the outermost on the right. Your Excellency, let’s go there now.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Immortal Master Lanfeng turned into a stream of light and led the group to approach quickly.","As they grew closer, he said, “The Highest Clouds Palace will take this last stone pillar.”","“Highest Clouds Palace?”","“Highest Clouds Palace’s men are here!”","“They’re quite fast.”","“Isn’t that Immortal Master Lanfeng of Wolf Fang Star?”","“He’s also at the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage. He reached that level not long ago. The people around him are all ninth-tier. Their strength is not bad.”","“Given the status of the Highest Clouds Palace and their people, that stone pillar is indeed going to be theirs.”","Many people were discussing with each other on the peaks.","How could they not want to take up a stone pillar to cultivate?","Unfortunately, their identity and status were not high enough. It was like a gathering of a group of big shots in this place. If a person of low status occupied a seat, it was likely to attract a lot of hostility and bring disaster.","Swoosh!","Just as Immortal Master Lanfeng flew to the peak pillar, a stream of light suddenly appeared and disappeared in a flash.","A man in silver armor and holding a huge hammer stood proudly on the last peak pillar.","The expression of Immortal Master Lanfeng changed slightly. He looked straight at the man, his eyes slightly cold.","“I’ve announced the name of our sect, and yet that man is still fighting over it. This is a provocation!”","“Our Battle Lord Sect will take this peak pillar,” the armored man said flatly.","“The Battle Lord Sect?”","There was a burst of discussion around.","“They are from the Battle Lord Sect. They are a little late.”","“Battle Lord Sect is also a first-class sect. In terms of strength, they are really not afraid of the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“There’s a good show to watch.”","They would certainly judge this matter.","“Who are you?” Immortal Master Lanfeng asked, “Didn’t you hear what I said just now?”","“So what if I did?” The armored man said, “My name is Wuqing.”","“Immortal Master Wuqing?” Immortal Master Lanfeng remembered who this person was.","The man was an eighth-tier Immortal Master of the Battle Lord Sect.","However, Immortal Master Lanfeng had a powerful backer.","“I’m occupying this peak pillar on behalf of my Eldest Brother, Immortal Master Jiasibo. The Highest Clouds Palace is powerful, but it is just a sect that mainly sells information and tasks. Are you sure it can compare with our Battle Lord Sect?” the armored man said loudly.","He wasn’t afraid of the Highest Clouds Palace at all. In fact, he even looked down on them.","“The strength of the Battle Lord Sect is indeed not bad, but it’s not the same with you.” Immortal Master Lanfeng was unhappy, and his tone was full of coldness. “How dare you make noise in front of me when you’re just at the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage?”","“No, no, no, Immortal Master Lanfeng, you’ve misunderstood. I’m not making noise. I’m just telling everyone that my Eldest Brother, Jiasibo, is occupying this peak pillar. He’ll be here soon. If you’re interested, you can personally ask my Eldest Brother for a seat,” the armored man said lightly.","“What?” Immortal Master Lanfeng frowned slightly.","In terms of fame and status, Immortal Master Jiasibo was indeed much superior to him.","In terms of strength, Immortal Master Lanfeng was not confident.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","On the stone pillars, those who had been cultivating opened their eyes and greeted Wuqing.","“Jiasibo is a little late.”","“If you were a few minutes later, this seat would have been gone. You’re lucky.”","Judging from what they said, they also approved of Jiasibo, not Immortal Master Lanfeng.","“Forget it.”","At this time, Zhang Han said, “Since he’s a little late, let them have it.”","“Okay.”","Immortal Master Lanfeng nodded slightly.","For the sake of Zhang Han, although he obeyed orders, he didn’t want to have more disputes for no reason.","“Hahaha!”","The armored man laughed and said, “You’re the new lord of the Wolf Fang Star, aren’t you? Your name is Zhang Hanyang, right? Not bad, not bad. A wise man submits to circumstances. I admire you very much. If you don’t have the strength, you shouldn’t occupy a place here.”","His tone was full of praise, but his words were full of sarcasm.","“Immortal Master Wuqing, mind your words.” Immortal Master Lanfeng had a darkened expression on his face. “With your status, you’re too inferior to say that.”","“I don’t know if I’m inferior, but I think what I’ve said is true.” The armored man sneered. “My Eldest Brother will arrive in three days. I’ll take up a spot here. I’d like to see if anyone can take this position from me.”","“What do you want now? Do you want to fight me?” Immortal Master Lanfeng got a bit angry.","“There’s no need for that.”","Zhang Han chuckled and said, “Let’s go.”","Hiss!","Immortal Master Lanfeng took a deep breath, and the others in the team also glared at the armored man.","But in the end, they listened to Zhang Han and turned to leave.","“See you later.”","The armored man said that lightly and then sat cross-legged on the stone pillar to cultivate.","A few minutes later, Immortal Master Lanfeng cupped his hands and said, “Your Excellency, this matter...”","“It doesn’t matter.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “It doesn’t matter even if we have no peak pillar. I recently refined a spirit treasure and need to absorb the energy of the treasure land. I’ll use this treasure land to strengthen the treasure. We’ll leave for a while. You guys will stay here.”","Since he couldn’t hide it anymore, Zhang Han simply found an excuse.","Once they left the group, the treasure land would disappear soon after. If it happened only once, it might not be a big deal, but if it happened too many times, it would inevitably arouse suspicion.","It was better to use an excuse that he needed to refine a treasure. Although this kind of spirit treasure was rare, it existed.","“Yes, Your Excellency!”","Immortal Master Lanfeng and the others nodded and did not ask any more questions. They waited on the ground at the edge of a cliff.","They watched Zhang Han and the others fly forward and disappear in a moment.","“His Excellency even has that kind of treasure. It should be a ninth-tier spirit treasure,” Immortal Master Lanfeng murmured.","“Maybe it’s a Profound-grade treasure.”","“His Excellency has an ancient demonic beast, so he must have obtained a great opportunity.”","“The Palace Master has made his attitude clear. He wants to repay His Excellency. We are also extremely obedient to His Excellency’s orders. Don’t think too much about it,” Immortal Master Lanfeng said.","What he said won everyone’s approval.","They were all members trained by Immortal Master Waterheaven and were very loyal.","“Dad, are we going to devour the treasure land?” Mengmeng asked.","“Of course.” Zhang Han glanced at her.","“Where are we going?” Mengmeng asked curiously, “I just heard that the clouds under the peak pillars are not easy to enter. It’s dangerous in there.”"]},{"number":1645,"title":"Chapter 1645 Why Is the Treasure Land Gone?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1645 Why Is the Treasure Land Gone?","“Haha, it’s not a big deal.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “The danger they mentioned is that the energy is constantly changing. It’s kind of weird, so they can’t cultivate. Most of the people on the peak pillars are ninth-tier Immortal Masters. They must have explored under the clouds. There are no treasures or benefits there, so they are not willing to go down.”","“Well, I see.” Mengmeng blinked her beautiful big eyes and said, “I thought there would be a terrifying monster under the clouds.”","“Theoretically, it won’t happen. But accidents often happen, so we can’t conclude anything. We’ll know when we go and see it in person,” Zhang Han said.","“Alas, I’ll just follow you.”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and sighed softly. “I’m at the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage, and you’re also at the sixth tier. Your combat capability is stronger than mine, so I’m not willing to talk to you now.”","Chen Chuan, who was behind them, asked curiously, “Uncle Zhang, how powerful are you? Can you defeat that despicable armored man?”","“I don’t know exactly how strong I am.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “But there should be no problem for me to defeat a seventh-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator. As for the eighth-tier ones, I’ll only know when we fight.”","Both the Thunder Body and the Great Demon Body had been cultivating all the time to comprehend their supernatural powers. The same went with the Golden-armored Giant Beast. The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure could swallow all kinds of treasure lands and had not cultivated for days. However, the quality of the Wood Dragon Treasure Land was very high.","Consuming it could increase one’s energy by a lot.","What Zhang Han needed to do now was to focus on the Golden-armored Giant Beast. As long as his other duplications didn’t lag behind, it was fine.","According to the attitude of Immortal Master Waterheaven, Zhang Han guessed that he would keep feeding the Golden-armored Giant Beast until it reached the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage.","When the Golden-armored Giant Beast reached the seventh tier, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body would be born.","Zhang Han felt that the appearance of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body might not be able to upgrade all his duplications.","Above the seventh tier was the high-end Tribulation Stage, which required too much energy.","Even so, Zhang Han was still looking forward to what the Extreme Purity Immortal Body could bring him.","When he had the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, he would get the Godly Body when he returned. When the six bodies became one, it would be the start of his peak.","“I’ll try to reach the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage in about 30 years.”","Zhang Han was well aware of the strength of the Star Sea.","Anyone who could defeat Immortal Master Lingxi had to be at least at the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The crowd flew to the bottom of the stone pillars together.","Unexpectedly, under the clouds, the fog was so thick that they couldn’t see anything clearly. Even their divine senses were blocked a lot. They looked around and found that there were no mountains or rivers but a vast sea.","The red sea was like magma, full of the aura of the apocalypse.","“The space below seems to be very large.” Yue Wuwei frowned and said, “I feel that something is staring at us.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “As expected, the secret realm is always full of surprises. There are many creatures and Fire Demons here.”","Swoosh!","After they flew forward for a few meters, the scene in front of them suddenly became clear.","This was an endless sea of flames. A hundred stone pillars were located in the center of the sea of flames.","Something was surging on the sea from time to time.","Upon closer inspection, they found that this sea of flames was formed by countless Fire Demons.","They were so densely packed that it made one’s hair stand on end.","“So many?” Yue Wuwei took a deep breath and said, “No wonder no one came down. If we want to destroy these Fire Demons, it will take us a long time.”","“The key is that we may not be able to eliminate them.” Zhang Han shook his head and said, “Each of these Fire Demons is above the Tribulation Stage. The most powerful ones are in the seventh tier. Those people outside may not have the ability to destroy them. But since we’re here, we can’t just stand by and watch.”","Zhang Han was smiling.","Yue Wuwei felt strange. Then, he thought of something and said, “Could it be that these Fire Demons are beneficial?”","“Maybe not for us, but for my daughter, it’s a treasure.”","Zhang Han chuckled and said, “When the Fire Demon is destroyed, there will be wisps of essential energy, which are good for the fire. Mengmeng, Elder Yue and I will take action later. You can absorb the essential energy at the back to strengthen the Profound Underworld Holy Fire.”","“Oh, okay.” Mengmeng chuckled and said, “I didn’t expect to get some benefits here.”","“Cultivate hard.”","Zi Yan patted Mengmeng on the shoulder and said, “Try your best to reach the Tribulation Stage as soon as possible. If you become stronger, you can go on adventures with your dad in the future.”","“I will.”","Mengmeng nodded.","“I also want to absorb it, but I can’t,” Chen Chuan muttered.","Yue Xiaonao didn’t say anything.","Because once she spoke, she might attract attention.","“They keep telling me to cultivate faster. It can’t be rushed.”","“Ice Mountain!”","Not any attack could hurt Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, which could display all kinds of supernatural powers.","He mastered supernatural powers and occult arts effortlessly.","Zhang Han said, “To deal with the Fire Demons, we just need to use the water supernatural powers.”","“Okay.”","Yue Wuwei also launched an attack. “Backflowing Water!”","Clatter!","An energy river appeared, fell down, swept around, and flowed back. It repeated.","This was not a bad move.","“Aaaaaaaargh!”","The Fire Demons roared.","They also launched powerful attacks.","In the blink of an eye, a sea of flames was unleashed.","“Defense!”","“You’ll defend against that.”","Yue Wuwei’s expression slightly changed. The offensive power of this move was far greater than his.","It was close to the phase between the eighth-tier and the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage.","“It’s so powerful!”","“Nine Rivers Cold Ice!”","Dazzling light burst out from Zhang Han’s eyes.","He pressed his right hand forward.","Clack!","An ice wall appeared.","It was like a song of ice and fire.","The scene was mighty.","A battle had begun.","With the Fire Demons, Zhang Han was not in a hurry to devour the energy of the treasure land.","The 100 people above couldn’t absorb much energy even if they kept cultivating.","This went on.","In the blink of an eye, three months had passed.","Mengmeng said, “Dad, I can’t absorb the energy anymore.”","“Then let’s stop for a while.”","Zhang Han nodded.","They had fought for three months, but the level of the sea of fire had only dropped a few meters. It was not easy to kill the Fire Demons.","However, they made the aura of the Profound Underworld Holy Fire of Mengmeng stronger and stronger.","That was enough.","“Let’s begin to absorb the energy of the treasure land.”","Zhang Han sat cross-legged in the void, with Yue Wuwei as his protector.","All of a sudden, Zhang Han began to glow faintly. When he resonated with the essence of the treasure land-","Buzz!","It was as if the sound of heaven and earth could be heard all around.","The energy of the treasure land, starting from wisps, gathered into a wind and was constantly devoured by Zhang Han.","It dropped from 99%,98%,97%, and lower.","Furthermore, the descent speed was extremely fast.","After all, Zhang Han had the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, which had a big appetite.","Five days later, the cultivators on the 100 stone pillars opened their eyes one after another.","“Huh?”","“What happened?”","“There’s less and less energy.”","“Is there something wrong with the treasure land?”","They were all puzzled.","“That’s not right. Logically speaking, the treasure land can allow us to cultivate for 30 years. But how come it has run out of energy in just a few months?”","“Is there something wrong with the place below the clouds?”","“Let’s go and check it out.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","One by one, the Dao Seeking Cultivators set off for the place below the clouds.","“The energy is getting lower and lower.”","“Even the spiritual Qi has become thin.”","“Oh no, the energy of the secret realm has become unstable.”","“What’s going on?”","They hadn’t arrived yet.","“Crap! The secret realm is about to disappear!”","Swoosh!","Everyone in the secret realm was kicked out of the space.","The Wood Dragon Treasure Land had disappeared from this world.","“Where’s the Hall Master?”","At this time, Immortal Master Lanfeng was also very confused.","Just now, he and his companions suspected that Zhang Han had refined the treasure and absorbed the energy of the treasure land. When the energy reached a critical point, the treasure land would disappear on its own.","But now, it had disappeared in less than a few minutes. This speed was simply too fast.","“Hall Master is over there!”","Someone pointed to the void not far away.","“Let’s go!”","Immortal Master Lanfeng led the group to fly over at a high speed.","The others were much more confused than them.","They didn’t understand what was going on.","But when Immortal Master Wuqing, the armored man, saw Zhang Han and the others, he said loudly, “It’s them!","“It’s those people from the Highest Clouds Palace. They failed to occupy a position. They must have destroyed the treasure land with ulterior motives!”","“What?”","Countless eyes gradually converged on him.","People thought about it and did not rule out this possibility.","The face of Immortal Master Jiasibo darkened slightly as he questioned, “Immortal Master Lanfeng and this so-called lord of the Wolf Fang Star, will you give us a reasonable explanation?”","“Oh?” Zhang Han smiled. “What explanation do you want?”","“What do you think?” Immortal Master Jiasibo’s voice turned cold.","“You failed to occupy a stone pillar,” the other Immortal Master said, “and you left with unwillingness. It just so happens that the treasure land has disappeared in the past few months. Who will believe that it has nothing to do with you?”","“In this world, there are some spiritual treasures or Profound-grade treasures that advance by devouring the treasure land. So, do you also have this kind of treasure?”","“What’s the point of wasting time talking to them? Just tell the lord of the Wolf Fang Star to hand over the treasures.”","“Why don’t we detain them and ask Immortal Master Waterheaven of the Highest Clouds Palace to pick them up in person?”","Some didn’t mind making a big deal out of it.","Moreover, the people of the Battle Lord Sect surrounded Zhang Han and his team.","“Your Excellency, what should we do now?” Immortal Master Lanfeng said to Zhang Han via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique with a slightly gloomy face.","If a fight broke out, none of them would be a match for the Battle Lord Sect, not to mention that there were more people present.","“What else can we do?”","Zhang Han laughed lightly.","Not far away, a king vessel arrived.","“Hmm?","“They want to leave?”","Immortal Master Wuqing and the others were about to attack.","At this time, Yue Wuwei snorted and said, “You little bastards are not qualified to ask for an explanation from our Wolf Fang Star. If you want to know what the deal is, you can ask Immortal Master Waterheaven in person!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Zhang Han and the others evacuated immediately.","They immediately boarded the king vessel and broke into the secondary space.","Immortal Master Wuqing and the others’ attacks whistled past.","After all, Zhang Han and the others were far from those people, so it was easy for them to escape.","“This is the style of the lord of the Wolf Fang Star?”","“He escaped directly. Heh, he’s just a coward.”","Many people began to mock Zhang Han.","“This is great. Everyone knows that the lord of the Wolf Fang Star is a cowardly piece of trash.”","“I have to go back and inform everyone of this. If we meet the lord of the Wolf Fang Star again, we will teach him a good lesson,” Jiasibo said calmly.","Judging from his tone, they were now enemies.","But this time, he didn’t intend to pursue the matter.","The Star Sea was very large, but some high-end secret realms could easily gather the people of some major forces in nearby areas.","The Highest Clouds Palace was one of the first-tier factions. When Jiasibo met them later, he would get even with them."]},{"number":1646,"title":"Chapter 1646 Stupid Tribulation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1646 Stupid Tribulation","Within the spaceship, Immortal Master Lanfeng explained the situation as well.","“It’s nothing.”","Zhang Han was not worried about this at all. He said, “They have just reached the ninth tier. Although they look powerful now, they will be timid when they encounter Immortal Master Waterheaven.”","“That makes sense.”","Immortal Master Lanfeng nodded and said no more.","“Immortal Master Waterheaven is indeed very strong and has great prestige, but are you sure he can help you?”","He didn’t seem to know how much Zhang Han mattered to Immortal Master Waterheaven.","Zhang Han was his benefactor.","When there were only his people in the lounge, Zhang Han said, “We’d better keep a low profile while we’re at the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage. When we reach the seventh tier, we’ll have the strength to make a name for ourselves.”","Hearing this, Yue Wuwei was silent for a moment.","Zhang Han was about to reach the Tribulation Stage Seventh Tier, but he had only cultivated for decades.","Perhaps he was not the fastest one to reach the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage in the history of the Cultivation World, but he was definitely the most horrifying one.","Yue Wuwei thought for a moment and said, “I’ve been taking medicinal pellets every day recently, as well as the remaining treasures. But I still feel that I’m very far away from reaching the seventh tier.”","Undergoing tribulation was not a problem now, but the process made Yue Wuwei feel that it was too slow.","This was due to the fact that he was with Zhang Han.","The speed at which Zhang Han broke through was so fast that Yue Wuwei changed his mind.","What he didn’t know was that he had been at the fourth tier of the Tribulation Stage for many years. At that time, he didn’t dare to undergo tribulation casually, so he had been stuck in that phase.","“With your speed, you may reach the seventh tier in 10 or 20 years. There’s no hurry.”","Zhang Han said, “I may be a few years faster than you.”","The key was that Zhang Han had the Highest Clouds Palace, which was a first-rate sect with a lot of metal resources.","There were a lot of resources in the Cultivation World, but the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivators were relatively rare. People’s aptitudes were the reason.","No matter if it was the Golden-armored Giant Beast or the other duplications, they all possessed heaven-defying natural talent, and their growth rate was extremely terrifying.","Just like Mengmeng, she had extraordinary aptitude and a fast cultivation speed. Now, she was not far from the Tribulation Stage.","But the young girl was not in a hurry to reach that phase.","“After five or six years of cultivation, I’ll reach the Tribulation Stage, won’t I?” Mengmeng muttered.","“It will take you only one or two years.” Zhang Han knew Mengmeng best about her cultivation. “Your state of mind is very good. The Inner Demon Tribulation will not be a problem for you. In two years, you can also undergo tribulation.”","After saying that, Zhang Han couldn’t hide the smile on his face.","Now, his considerate daughter was about to reach the Tribulation Stage. It was really not bad.","Zhang Han said, “Recently, we’ve got a lot of resources on hand. Continue to refine pellets and take medicinal pellets.”","On the way back, they went to two recreational planets to enjoy themselves for two months. Then, they returned to the Wolf Fang Star and began to cultivate again.","On the other side.","There were nearly a hundred people in Immortal Master Lingxi’s spaceship.","“The talents in the Astral Domains are not good enough.”","Immortal Master Lingxi curled her lips and said, “I’ve visited 5,000 Astral Domains and only taken in 100 disciples. I’m not going any longer. Let’s talk about the following journey.”","She lay lazily on the sofa and said to the crowd, “We’ll go to the Galaxy next, which will save us a lot of time. I estimate that there are still 30 more years before we arrive at the Star Sea. You’d better hurry up and cultivate. It will be embarrassing for me if even a small secret realm in the Star Sea can kill you.”","“Yes, Master.”","“Got it.”","“...”","Everyone responded one after another.","Zhang Guangyou and the others had also changed their auras. Their cultivation had indeed progressed rapidly in the past few years.","Immortal Master Lingxi had led them to train in many major secret realms as well as giving them many spirit treasures and spiritual herbs.","They kept making steady progress.","Time always passed very quickly during cultivation.","Three years later, Immortal Master Waterheaven returned.","His face was slightly pale, and he was injured.","He immediately flew into the Dragon Palace.","“How has it been in recent years?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked.","“Everything is normal.”","The subordinate replied, “It’s just that... the Dragon King’s appetite is getting bigger and bigger, and it eats faster and faster. There is not much metal left in stock.”","Gurgle!","Immortal Master Waterheaven swallowed hard.","“Palace Lord, you don’t look too good,” the subordinate said with concern.","“I’m a little injured. I’ll be fine after recuperating for decades.” Immortal Master Waterheaven waved his hand and said, “There’s not much metal left. According to the plan, you need to buy some from other sects. Have you done it?”","“Yes. I’ve issued 1,000 six-star missions and contacted 2,000 sects. I’ve been carrying out the exchange calculation recently,” one of his subordinates replied.","“Well, that’s good.” Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded.","“Palace Master.”","The subordinate wanted to say something but stopped on second thought.","“If you have something to say, just say it.” Immortal Master Waterheaven was about to go to see Lil Beast. He hadn’t seen it for a long time, so he missed it very much.","“In recent years, because of Dragon King, the Highest Clouds Palace has made a lot of money in the beginning. But since last year, our total account has suffered a loss. This year, the loss is even greater. To exchange and purchase, we have used the resources in 12,000 treasure houses,” the subordinate said intermittently.","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said unhappily, “What do you mean? Are you saying that I can’t even afford to keep an ancient demonic beast?”","“No, Palace Master, That’s not what I mean. I’m just worried about the future.”","The subordinate was shocked. They had calculated the growth of the Dragon King’s appetite.","If they wanted to train Dragon King to the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage, they might have to use up more than 70% of the treasure houses in the Highest Clouds Palace.","After the Dragon King reached the seventh tier, it would be more difficult for them to train it to the eighth tier. If it advanced to the eighth tier, the Highest Clouds Palace would probably go bankrupt, not to mention that it would be even more difficult for the Dragon King to break through to the ninth tier from the eighth tier.","After a preliminary calculation, it might take the Highest Clouds Palace 13,646 times their current resources to cultivate the Dragon King to the ninth tier.","And the data was not certain.","“Phew...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven let out a long breath.","After all these years, he actually felt some pressure at this moment.","However, he planned to bear it.","“Send out the order. We will open various branches of the Highest Clouds Palace to improve performance. Not only will we keep the rare metals, but we will also purchase them with the crystal stones that we have earned. The Highest Clouds Palace will fully cooperate with several other large sects according to the second plan,” said Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“Yes, Palace Master!”","The subordinates couldn’t help but be moved.","The Highest Clouds Palace’s second plan was to fully cooperate with several other large sects, such as financing and conducting various businesses. This meant that the Highest Clouds Palace might be restricted by other forces in the future.","This was something that Immortal Master Waterheaven did not like. In the beginning, he told the elder who proposed it that he would never implement the second plan in the future.","But now, it was carried out. The reason might not be believed by many people. The reason the Highest Clods Palace was doing this was that they couldn’t afford to raise an ancient demonic beast any longer.","If it was spread out, the media might immediately spread the news that the Highest Clouds Palace, a first-rate sect, was facing the crisis of bankruptcy because of a beast.","“Humph!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven snorted.","As he walked toward the Dragon Palace, he couldn’t help thinking, “What do you know? When Lil Beast reaches the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage, I can look down on the world and travel in the starry sky. The Highest Clouds Palace can easily become a super sect!”","“Lil Beast, Lil Beast?”","After Immortal Master Waterheaven stepped into the Dragon Palace, he smiled and said, “I am back. Let me show you what I have brought for you.”","Swoosh!","A large piece of ninth-tier rare metal, about 100 cubic meters, was directly taken out by Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“Awooo!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast opened its eyes and revealed a friendly expression. Then, the Giant Mouth Image appeared and swallowed the metal into the Alternate Space.","“He’s injured?”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast blinked.","“Hahaha, I’ve been missing you since I went out for a few years.” Immortal Master Waterheaven patted the foot of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","He didn’t mind and kissed it directly since he had missed it so much.","“Holy crap!”","The eyes of the Golden-armored Giant Beast widened.","Swoosh!","It immediately withdrew its foot.","“Hahaha!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven burst into laughter.","His laugh was a little bitter.","This trip to the secret realm turned out to be a desperate one.","A total of thirty-six people went there.","In the end, only six people came out alive.","It was a very good team. Of the six people, four survived and two died.","It did make him sigh on the way back.","There were always accidents in the secret realms.","They were used to it.","After seeing Lil Beast, Immortal Master Waterheaven, who had been suppressed for a long time, was suddenly relaxed.","Buzz!","At this time, the horn of the Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly burst into a flash of light.","Wisps of essential energy flowed into the body of Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“Hmm?”","The cool and refreshing feeling made him feel that his injury had almost recovered. He didn’t need decades to recover. In such a state, he might return to his peak in four or five years.","“Lil Beast.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was so moved.","He felt that if it went on like this, it might not be long before Lil Beast could perform the move of master recognition on its own accord.","He was still a little reluctant to take the initiative to display it, for fear that it would be like how the confession he made when he was young turned out. He knew very well how affection usually ended up.","“That’s great.”","When Immortal Master Waterheaven left the Dragon Palace, he sighed with emotion.","He was more determined to develop his forces.","“All the high-position officials of the main star, go to the main palace for a meeting.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven began to get busy.","Zhang Han and the other seven people were in the void around Wolf Fang Star.","“Mengmeng, now you’re finally undergoing your tribulation. I’m so happy,” Zhang Han said with a smile. “When it is over, let’s go out and do some fun stuff.”","“Okay.” Mengmeng said with a smile, “Don’t worry. It will be easy for me to do it.”","She didn’t have to worry about the tribulation thunder. She just needed to survive the Inner Demon Tribulation.","“Tribulation!”","Mengmeng had a determined look on her pretty face. She raised her head and looked up at the sky, her aura surging.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Great wind began to blow around.","Dark clouds gathered, Heavenly Tribulation descending.","When the tribulation thunder sensed Zhang Han, it suddenly became angry.","“This thief stole thunder so many times in recent years. Damn him!","“The host is merely undergoing the level one tribulation thunder.","“I can’t hurt her at all.","“Humph!","“I won’t show up.”","At first, the tribulation cloud covered a large area, but in the end, it directly turned into a 10-meter-long tribulation cloud.","“It’s too small. Can it be normal?”","Zhang Han was disgusted. He looked up at the sky and said in a clear voice, “Heavenly Tribulation, are you a coward?”","Swoosh!","He raised his middle finger.","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei was most willing to do this. It turned hundreds of meters tall, raised its middle finger, and said, “Stupid Tribulation, come down!”","Little Hei was speechless.","“This is unbelievable.”"]},{"number":1647,"title":"Chapter 1647 Mengmeng Reaches the Tribulation Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 1647 Mengmeng Reaches the Tribulation Stage","Zhang Han put on an act and shouted, “Heavenly Tribulation, I’m here. Hurry up and retreat!”","As a result, the weak Heavenly Tribulation with intelligence got angry.","Boom!","The tribulation cloud expanded to its maximum and began to bombard the place wildly.","Zhang Han said to Mengmeng, “Feel it yourself.”","“Huh?”","Mengmeng was dumbfounded. In the face of the falling Heavenly Tribulation and his dad who was tricking her, she began to cast her supernatural power helplessly.","“Ha!","“Holy Fire!”","Who would’ve thought that the first bolt of tribulation lightning would be incinerated after the appearance of the Profound Underworld Holy Fire?","Clack!","Clack!","Dozens of tribulation lightning bolts fell.","Zhang Han thought for a moment and subconsciously took action. The Thunder Body appeared and swallowed the tribulation thunder.","Zhang Han said, “That’s enough.”","Therefore, Zhang Han swallowed all the tribulation lightning bolts.","The tribulation lightning disappeared, and the tribulation cloud continued to surge.","A beam of light bloomed in the tribulation cloud, like fireworks.","“The Inner Demon Tribulation.”","Mengmeng was in a daze. It was obvious that she had entered the Inner Demon Tribulation.","What was her Inner Demon Tribulation?","Zhang Han recalled that when he faced the Inner Demon Tribulation, he would have to face the things that scared him. He would suffer a lot if his state of mind was not strong enough or his mentality was unstable.","“What is this place?”","Mengmeng was in the cosmos, which was a manifestation of her Inner Demon Tribulation.","“It seems to be the Sea Dragon Star Area.","“Why is the Inner Demon Tribulation in the Sea Dragon Star Area? There’s nothing for me to be afraid of.”","Mengmeng muttered and looked around with her beautiful big eyes.","Swoosh!","She suddenly entered the Space Passage.","“The Screen Waterfall is still so beautiful, but it’s not as good-looking as it was in reality. A dream is just a dream. It’s not real.”","Mengmeng curled her lips. There seemed to be a thin mist around her, which made her feel unreal and illusory. Even the places she was at later were looming.","“Will there be a big monster in the Screen Waterfall?","“But I’m not afraid.”","Mengmeng was very relaxed and carefree.","She didn’t care about these things at all. Zhang Han had told her many times about the Inner Demon Tribulation.","As a result, nothing happened.","The scene changed.","“The Ancient Mine, the King’s Domain?","“This is the Kunlun Immortal World. Where is this?","“Oh, it’s Hedgen.”","The family of three was playing happily by the sea.","“Isn’t this the scene of my childhood?”","Mengmeng watched with a smile. She didn’t care about the Inner Demon Tribulation at all.","It was good to have a look at her memories.","The scene changed again.","On Langya Mountain in Shang Jing City.","A delicate and lovely little girl was standing beside a fat man. It was Mengmeng.","“Dad was really sloppy at that time. Fortunately, I saved him, humph.”","Before Mengmeng knew it, she had been attracted by the scene. The strong sense of substitution grew stronger and stronger.","“Ahah.”","Seeing that Zhang Han had won the race, Mengmeng couldn’t help laughing.","The scene changed again.","She arrived at the apartment.","“It’s not a boy?” Zhang Han was a little stunned.","“Humph, I almost forgot. In the past, he preferred boys over girls and was too conventional.”","Mengmeng snorted and pursed her pink and tender lips to express her dissatisfaction.","The image continued to change.","It was like a cycle of reincarnation.","A lot of memories and warm pictures made Mengmeng feel warm.","“I’ve grown up.”","Mengmeng sighed with emotion. “In this way, I’ve grown up without realizing it. But I’m still young. In the Cultivation World, I’m less than a hundred years old, and I’m underage.”","Swoosh!","The image slowly disappeared.","Instead, it was surrounded by a vast fog.","Gradually, images appeared around her.","It was as if someone was carving the world bit by bit.","“This is... the pavilion of the Hidden Dragon Village?”","Mengmeng looked at the pavilion not far ahead in a daze.","This place was quite interesting.","She had a little secret with her dad there.","Right at this moment, Zhang Han’s deep voice rang out.","“Mengmeng, I don’t know how many years it will take for me to come back. I want to take you with me, but I can’t. You must live a good life and wait for me to come back...”","Mengmeng suddenly felt a sharp pain in her heart as she sobbed in a low voice.","“NOOOOO!”","The next second, her voice sounded.","In the pavilion, her illusory figure appeared, with tears streaming down her face. She collapsed to the ground, stretched out her arms, and wanted to touch the person in front of her. She cried, “Dad, don’t go.”","The image disappeared.","A few seconds later, her figure in a long red dress appeared at the edge of the pavilion again. She held an envelope in her hand and cried sadly.","“Dad, you promised me that you would listen to whatever I say. As long as I put my wish in the box, it will come true. Boohoo, I won’t let you go...”","She cried pitifully and put the letter in the stone box, which made people feel distressed.","Mengmeng had been watching from the side.","Tears also fell from her eyes. She lowered her head and remained silent for a long time.","“As expected of the Inner Demon Tribulation. It’s the thing I’m most afraid of!","“Damn it!”","Mengmeng suddenly raised her head, and her eyes were filled with endless flames. She looked up at the sky with a little anger.","“Inner Demon Tribulation, you’ve gone too far!”","Clatter!","The white flames of the Profound Underworld Holy Fire burned everything and broke the illusion.","The Inner Demon Tribulation was shattered.","Mengmeng’s will returned to reality. She looked at the void around her and those people.","Mengmeng suddenly felt like crying.","She pursed her lips and ignored the thick rules of the Great Domain around her.","She had advanced to Tribulation Stage First Tier.","But she couldn’t be happy.","If it were in the past, the little princess might have cried.","But now, she sniffed and said with a little grievance, “Dad, the Heavenly Tribulation bullied me. It made me feel particularly terrified.”","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han frowned, raised his head, and said with a serious look, “How dare it bully you? From now on, I’ll eliminate all tribulation lightning. Well, I’ll deal with it slowly in the future.”","“Ha...”","Mengmeng smiled, but she soon felt warm.","“I’ve succeeded in undergoing my tribulation. Now, I’m also an expert at the Tribulation Stage First Tier. Humph, Mummy, you have to be proud of me.”","Mengmeng took Zi Yan in her arms and then took Zhang Han. She was very happy to be sandwiched in the middle.","“Come on, let’s go out and have fun.”","When they boarded the spaceship, Mengmeng turned sideways and looked at the place where the Heavenly Tribulation had just taken place.","“That kind of thing will never happen. The Inner Demon Tribulation is just the Inner Demon Tribulation!”","When the spaceship entered the secondary space, the rules of the Great Domain appeared in the place where the tribulation took place. Like the sun, they illuminated everything. It seemed that there was something horrible hidden in the light, which disappeared in three seconds.","After resting for two months, the team began to cultivate again.","There were also some tribulation lightning and treasure lands near the Wolf Fang Star.","Time passed quickly.","A few years later.","On the fifteenth year after Immortal Master Waterheaven took away the Golden-armored Giant Beast, he issued an order.","“The annual resources reward will not be distributed to the supervisors and the higher-ups above in the Highest Clouds Palace for the time being. They’ll be compensated at once in a few years.”","“Yes, Palace Master!”","The subordinate cupped his hands. He was loyal and knew the style of Immortal Master Waterheaven, so he understood a little bit of the situation.","“Alas!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven took a deep breath in the palace, glanced in the direction of the Dragon Palace, and became firm again.","In the sixteenth year, Immortal Master Waterheaven released another message,","“The Dao Seeking Cultivators of the status of protectors and above of the Highest Clouds Palace are required to take out some resources. They will be paid back double in fifty years. If we live frugally, we can still spend the resources we have for a few years.”","“Yes, Palace Master!”","Several of his subordinates wanted to say something but stopped on second thought.","If this continued, the Highest Clouds Palace would face bankruptcy.","In the seventeenth year.","“The Highest Clouds Palace, the Highest Clouds Palace...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven seemed to be planning something. He said slowly, “Everyone, hold on. Elders, hold more meetings, and then inform me at any time if there is a secret realm.”","After the order was given, many of his subordinates began to discuss behind his back.","“Two years ago, our Palace Master personally went to the secret realms to compete for resources. In order to raise Dragon King, he is about to go bankrupt.”","“That’s right. If this continues, the Highest Clouds Palace won’t be able to hold on for much longer. Quite a number of protectors have already run away.”","“That Dragon King is like a golden hole. No matter how much we feed it, it won’t be enough. A meal of rare metals is enough for me to cultivate for three years.”","“What should we do? How can we remind the Palace Master?”","Many elders were also talking about it and were a little worried.","On the main planet of the Seventh Mountain.","The group of elders held several meetings and decided.","“We will advance and retreat with the Palace Master. If there is any secret realm recently, let’s explore it together.”","“We believe that Dragon King will grow up soon. A ninth-tier ancient demonic beast is equivalent to a super sect. It’s not a big deal for us to live frugally.”","“That’s right. Keep holding on. Keep working hard!”","The core members of the Highest Clouds Palace all knew of the Dragon King’s existence. As for the others, they knew nothing.","Immortal Master Waterheaven didn’t dare to spread the news of the Star Demon Dragon King, because it would definitely attract the attention of many super sects and even the Holy Lands.","That would only add to his worries. It would be great if the Dragon King could recognize him as its master. No one else could take it away.","He was afraid that his opponents would go crazy and kill him directly.","“If Lil Beast takes the initiative to recognize me as its master, I wouldn’t have to worry about this kind of trouble.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven thought to himself, “But recently, it has become more and more sleepy and doesn’t come to me. It’s about to break through to the seventh tier. I’ll see what happens then.”","As a result, all the core members of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Seventh Mountain struggled for a while.","In the nineteenth year.","Immortal Master Waterheaven seemed to have aged ten years. He stood outside the Dragon Palace, staring at the sleeping Golden-armored Giant Beast.","There was a trace of unwillingness, a trace of disappointment, a trace of helplessness, and even more bewilderment.","In the end, his emotions turned into a sigh.","“I can’t afford to raise it.”","This was a fact.","As a first-rate sect in the Star Sea, the Highest Clouds Palace had taken away the Golden-armored Giant Beast. Over the past 19 years, the entire sect had consumed its resources to the point of almost bankruptcy.","What kind of appetite was this?","Immortal Master Waterheaven was extremely worried.","“How could this be?","“It’s really hard to raise an ancient demonic beast!”","The most important thing was that he had never heard of any other ancient demonic beast that could eat so much.","Immortal Master Waterheaven had specially consulted two super sects. The two sects answered, “If the appetite of the ancient demonic beast is very good, it means that it is in its growth period and that its strength is improving rapidly.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was even secretly happy about that.","However, if he went bankrupt and ran out of money, everything would be in vain.","“Men, go to the Wolf Fang Star and invite Zhang Hanyang here. Tell him that I have something important to discuss with him.”"]},{"number":1648,"title":"Chapter 1648 Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 1648 Power","After Zhang Han learned the news, there was a strange look on his face.","“How could it make them go bankrupt?”","“Please, Zhang Hanyang.”","The Highest Clouds Palace’s senior elder advised earnestly, “This time, you have to have a good talk with the Palace Lord. It’s best if you can take Dragon King away. Dragon King eats too much. The Highest Clouds Palace can’t handle it. Just talk to him. The Palace Lord may understand you. Even if it’s just a tiny possibility, talk to him and give us a way out.”","Hearing this, Zi Yan looked a little blushed, and her beautiful lips were tightly pursed.","She was trying her best to hold back her laughter.","As for Mengmeng-","“Hahaha, hahahaha...”","Sitting on the chair next to Yue Xiaonao, Mengmeng suddenly burst into laughter.","“What are you doing? The elder is still here. Why are you talking a joke for us? Do you think what he said is a joke?”","“Hahaha, what a joke!” Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and laughed as well.","Lisa was all smiles. “You’re so naughty. Stop joking.”","Yue Xiaonao was speechless.","She didn’t know what to say. She didn’t say anything at all.","The elder looked at them, sighed in his heart, and said, “Zhang Hanyang, have a rest first. Call me if you need anything.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han smiled and got up to see him off.","He really showed due respect for the elder’s feelings and walked him out of the hall.","Zi Yan didn’t have to hold back. She covered her mouth and laughed.","Zhang Han shook his head and said with a smile, “Stop laughing. Stop laughing. What’s so funny about this?”","“Dad, you made them go bankrupt.” Mengmeng patted her belly and said, “What the elder said is so funny.”","“He can’t wait for you to take Lil Beast away,” Zi Yan said.","“How much did it eat? A huge amount,” Yue Wuwei said enviously.","In the face of this question, Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “Well, it may make a breakthrough in the next few days. Of course, 90% of the credit should go to the Highest Clouds Palace.”","Zhang Han also planned to make a breakthrough recently.","In fact, the Golden-armored Giant Beast could have broken through seven years ago, but it didn’t.","Because Zhang Han found that the light golden energy filled with the Alternate Space in the body of the Golden-armored Giant Beast had been absorbed by the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","Therefore, in a short span of seven years, it made the Highest Clouds Palace go bankrupt.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body was like a bottomless pit that was crazily absorbing energy. The Golden-armored Giant Beast was also a bottomless pit. However, in recent years, the Golden-armored Giant Beast had only maintained a stable energy flow and could break through at any time. Its main purpose was to provide energy for the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","Zhang Han was very clear that when he broke through to the seventh tier, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body would appear.","At that time, he would not be far from the eighth tier.","“I’ll try to reach the eighth tier before Immortal Master Lingxi returns.”","That was what Zhang Han was thinking.","“So soon. We’re going to the Seventh Mountain.”","Yue Wuwei said with emotion, “The Nine Mountains Region is the core place of the Galaxy. We are now going there.”","“Yes.” Zhang Han sat on the sofa, held the slender palm of Zi Yan, and said with a smile, “The life of the Host of the Wolf Fang is over. Over the years, we have had plenty of spiritual herbs and treasures. The reserve of medicinal pellets is enough. My daughter is now skilled at pellet refining. Over the years, we have gained a lot on the Wolf Fang Star.”","This was the summary of the life of the Host of the Wolf Fang.","“It’s just that we can’t run into that Immortal Master named Wuqing last time,” Yue Wuwei said. “He was putting on airs. I want to beat him up, but I don’t have the chance to do so.”","“I can’t believe you’re thinking about him.”","Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing. “It doesn’t matter. He is also an eighth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator in the Star Sea, and we will come across him someday. The Nine Mountains Region is very large. The Seventh Mountain is relatively close to the Ninth Mountain. Immortal Master Wuqing of the Battle Lord Sect and his Older Martial Brother may go to a big secret realm when there is one. You can beat him up then.”","Hearing this, Yue Wuwei had a strange look on his face. “Why do I feel that you also want to beat him up?”","“It’s nothing like that. I don’t care about his opinion.” Zhang Han said, “But I can teach him a lesson by the way.”","“Dad, we’ve been in the Star Sea for more than 20 years,” Mengmeng muttered. “About a decade later, Grandpa and the others will come back. Then, we’ll go back to Earth. We haven’t lived on Mount New Moon for a long time. According to the time, Li Jie is already in his twenties. Xiaonao, do you think Li Muen will be a grandmother when we go back?”","“That seems to be the case.”","Yue Xiaonao looked crestfallen. “Oh my god, Mengmeng, we’re all old.”","“No, no.” Chen Chuan spoke at this time. As usual, he flattered Mengmeng. “Sister Mengmeng and Sister Nao, you seem to be 23 or 24. Aunt Zi Yan looks only 27 or 28 years old. You are all very beautiful. You’re not old at all.”","“Hahaha!”","Zhang Han glanced at Zi Yan and said with a smile, “As I said before, in the Cultivation World, those under 100 years old are still young, especially in the Star Sea. Those under 100 years old can participate in many genius battles. Mengmeng, you’re now at the Tribulation Stage First Tier. If there is a chance, you can also take part in it.”","“I can’t. I don’t dare to do that. I’ve been following you since I was a child,” Mengmeng snorted.","“I’ll go with you. I’m less than 100 years old,” Zhang Han added.","“Huh?”","Mengmeng was suddenly stunned.","Thinking about it, she found that what he said seemed to be the case.","“Holy shit. If Uncle Zhang takes part in the genius battle, he will crush others utterly.” Yue Xiaonao grinned.","“Don’t always brag about him. You might as well flatter me instead,” Yue Wuwei said grumpily.","“I can’t. You’re almost a thousand years old,” Yue Xiaonao replied.","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard in silence.","“Zhang Han is indeed much younger than me.”","“We haven’t seen each other for so many years.”","Zi Yan whispered to Mengmeng, “Your Grandparents must miss you very much.”","“They must miss you more. You are their biological daughter,” Mengmeng said.","“They miss both of you.” Zhang Han smiled and said, “But it’s been too long since we last met. There will always be accidents in the Cultivation World. But we don’t have to be separated from each other in the future after this gathering. They’ve experienced enough in decades. There’s no hurry to gain experience in the Star Sea in the future.”","Zhang Han didn’t want everyone to work so hard. He could bear anything. His family and friends rose with him when he succeeded. What Zhang Han needed to do was to ensure the stability and health of this big family.","Fortunately, the one who kept his people was not a villain, but Immortal Master Lingxi he knew. Otherwise, Zhang Han would have been very anxious at that time.","A few months later, Zhang Han and his team finally arrived at the periphery of the Seventh Mountain.","“From a distance, it does look like a mountain.”","Everyone was watching the video captured on the screen.","It was a three-dimensional image. The place looked like a towering mountain in front of them.","From a certain point of view, this magnificent scene was like that of the shocking Screen Waterfall.","However, Zhang Han was used to this.","“What a shocking scene! The area of one mountain of the Nine Mountains Region is already so huge.” Yue Wuwei took a deep breath and said, “As expected of the core area of the Cultivation World.”","“It looks quite beautiful,” Mengmeng said while eating fruit.","“We’ve arrived at the Seventh Mountain.”","The elder in charge of escorting them said with a smile, “Next, we’ll go to the main hall of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Highest Clouds District. It’s halfway up Seventh Mountain. The Highest Clouds Palace has 16 stars on Seventh Mountain. It’ll take about nine days to get there.”","A few minutes later, the spaceship entered the secondary space and continued to move forward.","The elder was considerate enough to bring them here to have a look.","Anyone who saw the Nine Mountains Region for the first time would be shocked.","However, what made the elder more curious was that Zhang Hanyang, who had once raised the Dragon King, didn’t seem to be surprised. He was quite confused.","In the lounge, Zhang Han suddenly looked shocked.","“I’m going to the training room.”","Zhang Han immediately got up. His eyes began to shine, and his body was surrounded by a profound aura.","“He’s about to break through.”","Yue Wuwei looked shocked. “He has suppressed his cultivation for so long. I can even feel that the energy he released just now is no weaker than that of some ninth-tier Tribulation Stage ones. His aura is too terrifying.”","“What do you mean?” Mengmeng blinked, put down the fruit, and said happily, “Could it be that my dad’s strength is enough to fight against a ninth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator?”","Zhang Han hadn’t fought with anyone in recent years, but only cultivated. Everyone knew his realm, but no one knew his specific combat capability.","According to previous experience, they felt that if he broke through to the seventh tier, he might really be equivalent to the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage expert.","However, there were nine tiers to the Tribulation Stage. Each tier was more advanced than the previous one, and the gap in their combat capability was huge. The ninth-tier Tribulation Stage alone was divided into three stages, namely, the first, the middle, and the last. There was also the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","“We’ll know the details when he comes out.” Zi Yan smiled.","Her husband was very powerful, and she was happy from the bottom of her heart.","In the training room, Zhang Han’s aura rose sharply, which could no longer be concealed or even controlled, whistling in the room.","If it weren’t for the fact that the surrounding metal could resist the attack of the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage, the spaceship would have been smashed by Zhang Han’s aura.","“I can’t suppress it anymore.”","Zhang Han could feel it.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure was burning hot. It was as if he was bathing in the blazing sun, making his mouth and tongue dry.","But later, the feeling of promotion was like a cool current flowing into every part of him.","At the same time, the Great Demon Body, the Thunder Body, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast in his body advanced at the same time.","“Arrrrgh!”","The roar of the Golden-armored Giant Beast spread all over the entire Highest Clouds Star, which was shocking.","“It has just broken through to the seventh tier, but it is already so powerful?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was pleasantly surprised. “As expected of the Star Demon Dragon King. It’s truly amazing. However, why isn’t there any Heavenly Tribulation? That’s right. Some of the Holy Beasts among the ancient demonic beasts do not need to undergo tribulation, to begin with. This is truly heaven-defying. They do not need to face the terrifying Thunder Tribulation.”","It was mighty.","The horrifying aura seemed to contain a gust of imperceivable profound energy.","“What is that?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven couldn’t detect it. He only felt that it was otherworldly and had a kind of hazy feeling that it was so domineering that one couldn’t reach it.","It reminded him of the past when he was still an insignificant Elixir Realm Dao Seeking Cultivator. Back then, he looked up at the Tribulation Stage masters in the void.","“Yes. Admiration!","“It’s a feeling of admiration.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven looked up at the sky, and his heart trembled a little.","What he couldn’t see was that in the Alternate Space of the Golden-armored Giant Beast, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body suddenly opened its eyes, which were shining with cyan light. There was a vast fog in the surroundings."]},{"number":1649,"title":"Chapter 1649 Can’t Afford to Keep It","paragraphs":["Chapter 1649 Can’t Afford to Keep It","Buzz!","As soon as the Extreme Purity Immortal Body came into the world, the energy it had devoured in the past seven years began to show itself.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast had just advanced to the seventh tier.","The aura was still rising steadily from the Early Stage to the Middle Stage, the Last Stage, and then the Peak Stage of the seventh tier.","It was only one step away from the eighth tier.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body, the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Thunder Body, and the Great Demon Body were all the same.","“I didn’t expect this.”","Zhang Han exhaled a long breath in the practice room and said, “The Extreme Purity Immortal Body will give back so much energy.”","Then, a strange look flashed across his eyes.","“Before Immortal Master Lingxi returns, I will reach the eighth tier!”","He was only one step away from the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","After his duplications recuperated for a period of time, he could keep devouring and advance to the eighth tier.","Although he was merely one step to that phase, he still required a lot of resources.","After all, he had five bodies, so he needed a lot in total.","“Dad, you’re out?” Mengmeng said with a smile, “How do you feel after the breakthrough?”","“Hahaha!”","Zhang Han laughed heartily and said, “I feel great. It’s all thanks to Immortal Master Waterheaven. Without him, I wouldn’t have broken through so quickly.”","“Alas!”","Yue Wuwei let out a long sigh and said, “I didn’t expect you to make a breakthrough now. You’re faster than me and have officially surpassed me. Congratulations, Zhang Han. You’re really something.”","“That doesn’t sound like a compliment.” Zhang Han was amused.","“Elder Yue is obviously envious,” Mengmeng said seriously. “Xiaonao, I feel that if Elder Yue can cut off his beard, his cultivation may be faster.”","“I think so too,” Yue Xiaonao immediately replied.","“No. I’m just a little envious. Besides, what does my cultivation have to do with my beard?” Yue Wuwei said helplessly.","“Uncle Zhang, you’re amazing.” Chen Chuan congratulated Zhang Han.","“My host is awesome.”","Dahei poked its head out of the schoolbag and woke up.","“My host is the best.” Little Hei lazily wagged its tail not far away.","“How is your combat capability now? Can you defeat a ninth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator?” Yue Wuwei asked.","All the people present were Zhang Han’s people, so it was not a big deal for him to reveal the truth.","Zhang Han pondered for a moment and said, “I don’t know my specific combat capability.”","“What do you think? I can’t spar with you now,” Yue Wuwei said, feeling a little worried.","Before he knew it, he didn’t have the power to practice with Zhang Han anymore. “Alas.”","“Of course, I don’t know the details, but I should be able to fight against someone at the Middle Stage of the ninth tier,” Zhang Han said.","“Hahaha.”","Yue Wuwei suddenly laughed and said, ” Zhang Han, you’re amazing. Hahaha, you can actually fight against those at the Middle Stage of the ninth tier. Hahaha, we can gain a foothold in the Star Sea. This is wonderful...”","“Well, he’s gone crazy.” Lisa covered her forehead.","“I’m not crazy. I’m just happy and excited. I’m not crazy. Why are you glaring at me? Don’t pull me. I’m not mad...”","When Yue Wuwei was being funny, everyone was quite dumbfounded.","“Why isn’t he acting like an immortal now?”","“Honey, honey, come here.”","Zi Yan hid her hands in her sleeves, quickly got up, and ran to the side room.","“Huh?”","Mengmeng was stunned.","“What’s wrong?” Zhang Han was also a little confused and quickly followed her.","At this time, Yue Wuwei came to his senses. He exhaled and fell silent.","Lisa raised her eyebrows and asked curiously, “What are they doing in such a hurry?”","“Are they in a hurry to have some pleasure?”","But Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Chen Chuan were also present. There were many children, so Lisa restrained herself.","In fact, she had talked about such a topic with Zi Yan in private.","In the room.","“What’s wrong?” Zhang Han approached Zi Yan and looked her up and down.","“I, I’m feeling hot.” Zi Yan gently bit her lower lip with a tempting expression.","Zhang Han swallowed and took half a step forward. When he was about to put his arms around Zi Yan’s slender waist, she raised her hands.","Her whole hands turned into shining objects, which seemed to be translucent and light blue.","“Hiss!”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes and his face suddenly changed. “How can I not feel it at all?","“How are you feeling? Do you feel uncomfortable?”","Zhang Han raised his hands and wanted to touch hers, but he didn’t dare to.","He was worried that something unexpected would happen.","“Shit! Could it be that calamity?”","Zhang Han looked a little pale. He was no longer calm and panicked.","Seeing the expression of Zhang Han, Zi Yan smiled.","“No, I just feel that my hands are a little hot, and then the energy in my body grows so fast.”","Swoosh!","As she spoke, the light extended to her entire arms.","She reached the Tribulation Stage First Tier.","“What...”","Zhang Han frowned slightly.","He couldn’t feel anything unusual about Zi Yan at all, but he could see the changes in her with his eyes.","“What the hell is going on?”","“Your strength has improved. That’s all, and there’s nothing unusual, right? Do you feel uncomfortable with your arms?” Zhang Han asked with concern.","“No. It’s still a little hot.” Zi Yan sat by the bed and blinked. She was not afraid at all.","“Could it be that the Spirit Body has awakened?”","Zhang Han touched his forehead and felt quite troubled.","He didn’t like this uncontrollable situation.","“I’ll touch your fingers gently. If you feel uncomfortable, tell me immediately, okay?” Zhang Han said seriously.","“Okay.”","Zi Yan nodded obediently and raised her right hand.","Zhang Han half knelt on the ground. Gradually, he held his breath, slowly raised his right hand, stretched out his index finger, and touched the fingers of Zi Yan.","“Do you feel anything?”","“No. It’s just a normal touch,” Zi Yan replied.","Zhang Han gradually went up, held her hand, and touched her wrist and arm.","“You don’t feel anything?”","“No. It’s just that the energy is still increasing. It’s so fast,” Zi Yan said.","“Lie down and have a rest. I’ll watch from the side,” Zhang Han said.","He sat by the bed.","Moments later.","Thump! Thump!","“I’m coming in,” Mengmeng said from outside.","“Come in,” Zhang Han said.","Mengmeng pushed the door open and walked in.","“Hey!”","The young girl was shocked and her face turned pale. “Mummy, what’s wrong?”","“It’s okay. I’m improving my strength.” Zi Yan smiled softly. “Now I’m also at the Tribulation Stage.”","“What?”","Mengmeng blinked her big eyes and hurried forward. “Are you trying to improve your strength? Are you all right? It looks so scary.”","“It’s nothing.” Zi Yan smiled and said, “When you made the breakthrough, you were much more imposing than me, weren’t you?”","“You’re right.” Mengmeng sat next to her and didn’t leave.","Three hours later, Zi Yan reached the Tribulation Stage Second Tier.","This was determined by Zhang Han based on the trace of aura Zi Yan emitted.","Four hours later, she reached the Tribulation Stage Third Tier.","Five hours later, she reached the Tribulation Stage Fourth Tier.","Eight hours later, she reached the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage. Twenty hours later, she reached the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","At this time, the light around Zi Yan’s arms dissipated a little, and her aura stopped growing.","“The sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage. That’s really fast.” Zhang Han grinned.","“Oh my god, even Mummy has reached the sixth tier of the Tribulation Stage. She’s in the same realm as Elder Yue,” Mengmeng muttered, her eyes rolling around. “Should I tell Elder Yue the good news?”","“You’d better not say it.” Zi Yan smiled and said, “Your father’s breakthrough has made Elder Yue a little worried. I’m so fast. He will question everything he has learned.”","“Hahaha, we’ll let him do that.” Mengmeng laughed and said, “The breakthrough is over. Disperse the light. It looks scary.”","“Well...”","Zi Yan was stunned. This was not something she could control.","Zi Yan said, “Honey, my arms are getting hotter and hotter.”","“En?”","Zhang Han slightly narrowed his eyes and pressed Zi Yan on her wrists.","“Your hands are so cool,” Zi Yan said.","“Then I’ll also cool you down.” Mengmeng stretched out her hands and pressed them on the left arm of Zi Yan.","“Do you feel anything?” Zhang Han asked.","“Your hands are cool. Mengmeng’s are not. They’re a little hot,” Zi Yan said truthfully.","Hearing this, Mengmeng pouted and said, “Hey, you two are really in love. Only Dad can help you.”","“It’s nothing like that.”","Zhang Han laughed and relaxed. “When your mum made a breakthrough, she couldn’t control her energy well. Then, I could absorb such energy because I have several duplications. That’s why my hands make her feel cool.”","Zhang Han could clearly feel that the connection between his major duplications had become more intimate with Zi Yan as the energy in her arms flowed in.","What did this mean?","He and Zi Yan could do Pair Cultivation together in the future.","This was a good thing.","“Then give me a massage. I may return to normal in a while.” Zi Yan curled her red lips slightly at Zhang Han.","“At your service, my Queen.”","Zhang Han began to massage her arms.","Gradually, the light on Zi Yan’s arms faded and they returned to normal.","Zhang Han could feel the intimacy between his duplications.","“Could it be because of my Thunder Body?”","Zhang Han thought to himself, “Both the Thunder Body and Zi Yan are Spirit Bodies. Their energy resonates with each other and the Thunder Body changes. Because of the nature of the Thunder Body, the duplications will be more compatible with each other. Then, I can transform my duplications faster and the circulation of my mind will be faster.","“It’s good that it’s not a bad thing. Maybe I worried too much.”","Zhang Han relaxed.","As a Spirit Body, Zi Yan could improve her strength even if she awakened. If there was something wrong with her body, Sir’s mind would talk to Zhang Han about it in advance. After all, Spirit Bodies belonged to the higher world.","After a short rest, the family of three walked out of the room.","“We’re almost there.” Zhang Han smiled.","“We’ll arrive in three days.”","Yue Wuwei nodded and looked at Zi Yan. “You look a little different.”","“How am I different?” Zi Yan asked.","“I don’t know how to describe it.” Yue Wuwei shook his head.","“It seems that your temperament has become more fairy-like,” Lisa said with a smile.","“You are also a fairy.” Zi Yan smiled.","They sat down and continued to chat.","They didn’t plan to cultivate in the next few days. They just chatted casually and ate some rare delicacies, which could be regarded as a kind of enjoyment.","Three days later.","“We’ve arrived at Highest Clouds Star.”","The elder in charge of the team came to Zhang Han and the others in person. He instructed them seriously.","“Do you remember what we talked about before, Zhang Hanyang?”","“Yeah.” Zhang Han nodded slightly.","“Then I’ll leave it to you.” The elder sighed. “We can’t afford to raise the Dragon King. It has consumed all the resources we have all these years, so it would be best if you could take it away. However, it is hard to say if you can take it away for free. I hope that you can be an elder or something in the Highest Clouds Palace. Alas, let’s not talk about this now. The matter of the Dragon King can only be decided by the Palace Master.”"]},{"number":1650,"title":"Chapter 1650 Questioning Everything He Has Learned","paragraphs":["Chapter 1650 Questioning Everything He Has Learned","“I know that.”","Zhang Han found it funny and said with a serious expression, “I will definitely persuade the Palace Master.”","“Thank you.”","The elder made an obeisance by cupping one hand in the other before his chest. After expressing his gratitude, he led the group into the space station.","They took the aircraft and slowly landed in the main hall of Immortal Master Waterheaven on the Highest Clouds Star.","In this palace, the building area was not small. In addition to the main hall in the center, there was the Dragon Palace on the side.","It was even taller than the palace where Immortal Master Waterheaven lived.","One could imagine the Dragon King’s status.","Inside the palace of Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“You’re finally here, Zhang Hanyang.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven personally welcomed him at the entrance of the hall. “Hahaha, welcome.”","“Greetings, Palace Master.”","Zhang Han cupped his hands in a friendly manner.","However, there was also a trace of shame in the depths of his eyes since he had nearly made the Highest Clouds Palace go bankrupt.","After sitting down in the side hall, Immortal Master Waterheaven asked hurriedly, “Well, how did you raise Lil Beast before?”","“Before...”","Zhang Han twitched the corner of his mouth.","Mengmeng and the others looked at each other with strange expressions.","Immortal Master Waterheaven noticed all this.","“What’s the story behind it?” asked Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“Alas!”","Zhang Han suddenly sighed and said, “I used to be the Sect Leader of a super force.”","He was talking about his armies.","Now that Mengmeng was in charge of the Vast Heaven Sect, he was certainly the master of Mount New Moon.","However, he felt that what he said was enough.","As expected, the face of Immortal Master Waterheaven changed. He sighed deeply, and his heart was full of sympathy for Zhang Han.","“I didn’t expect that he used to be the Sect Leader of a big force, but his sect failed because of Lil Beast.”","He found Zhang Han more and more pleasing to the eye. “You and I both have the same hobbies.”","“I guess so.” Zhang Han smiled.","As for Zi Yan, Mengmeng, and the others, their expressions became even stranger.","It seemed that there was a big misunderstanding.","“To tell you the truth, I’ve also encountered some difficulties that you’ve encountered.” Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled bitterly and said, “The Highest Clouds Palace is now... facing the crisis of bankruptcy. Lil Beast. I can’t afford to raise Lil Beast.”","“Well...”","Zhang Han looked distressed and sighed deeply. “Alas, it’s all my fault.”","“No, no, no. I’ve raised Lil Beast for 19 years. I feel I’m lucky,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said seriously. “It has nothing to do with you. I asked for it willingly.”","“Well, there’s still one year left in our 20-year limit. I wonder if you have succeeded in making it recognize you as its master?” Zhang Han asked.","“No.” Immortal Master Waterheaven had a smile on his face, “I haven’t taken the initiative to display the master recognition method. I think it would be an insult to Lil Beast. I am waiting for it to take the initiative to display the move, but it seems to be sleeping except for eating. Fortunately, it usually listens to whatever I ask it to do. After so many years, it has developed feelings for me.”","“Hahaha, Palace Master, you are really amazing,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","She couldn’t help laughing and took the initiative to say that.","“Thanks,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a smile. “I like this process.”","“However, there is still one year left. Palace Master, you’d better display the move as soon as possible. Otherwise, when the time is up, it will be inappropriate for Lil Beast to go with me.” Zhang Han advised.","“Brother Zhang, you don’t have to say that.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said seriously, “I’ve already figured it out, and I don’t intend to take the initiative to use those moves, but as for the one-year time limit...”","He pondered. Five seconds later, he looked a little reluctant, but he still said, “Forget it. How about this? You are also one of the people who have trained Lil Beast. You can go over and communicate with it. Maybe you can use the means of master recognition. If you succeed, it means that your fate is not over yet. If you fail, it means that I have succeeded.”","Zhang Han appreciated the thinking way of Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“He loves the ancient demonic beast so much!”","If Zhang Han could perform the master recognition move on Lil Beast, it would mean that it didn’t depend much on Immortal Master Waterheaven. If he failed in that move, it meant that Lil Beast was still partial to Immortal Master Waterheaven.","Immortal Master Waterheaven didn’t dare to take the initiative and waited passively. He spent more effort on the Golden-armored Giant Beast than wooing his women.","After the crowd sat for a while-","“Why don’t we go take a look?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded.","Yue Wuwei said with a smile, “I haven’t seen Lil Beast for many years.”","Everyone flew toward the Dragon Palace.","“It’s really spectacular,” Yue Wuwei said in shock.","Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Chen Chuan also looked at the giant Dragon Palace and remained silent for a long time.","It was very magnificent.","Only Zhang Han knew what was going on here, but he still praised, “Thank you for your hard work, Palace Master.”","“Let’s go and have a look. Lil Beast is now at the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage, and its momentum is very strong,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with excitement.","They walked into the Dragon Palace.","They saw the Golden-armored Giant Beast snoring on the incomparably huge bed.","Usually, Dahei and Little Hei would go there to play.","But at this time, both Dahei and Little Hei were sleeping in Mengmeng’s schoolbag. Previously, Little Hei couldn’t grow smaller. With its breakthrough three years ago when it ate some rare gems, it could now grow smaller.","Zhang Han had asked the two Exotic Beasts to shrink because of this trip. It was better not to have them seen by Immortal Master Waterheaven, otherwise, it was hard to say, what if he took a fancy to them.","“It’s sleeping so soundly,” Mengmeng muttered and glanced at Zhang Han.","“Isn’t this a duplication? Now, it looks like a real ancient demonic beast.”","“Ahem, Palace Master, I still don’t think what you said is appropriate,” Zhang Han said.","At this time, the elders following them all had different expressions on their faces, especially the one who brought Zhang Han here. They all looked a little nervous.","“This guy won’t go back on his word, will he?”","“What’s inappropriate?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked.","“Palace Master, even you haven’t displayed the master recognition move on it. I, I don’t think it will be appropriate for me to do so,” Zhang Han said.","“Hahaha, it doesn’t matter. It’s only about fate. Young man, you have to believe in fate, understand?” Immortal Master Waterheaven looked proud and full of confidence. “You can have a try. I am confident in Lil Beast.”","“Then I’ll give it a try.” Zhang Han hesitated.","“Just give it a try.” Immortal Master Waterheaven put his hands behind his back and looked calm.","“Lil Beast, I will just give it a try. If you like Immortal Master Waterheaven, then refuse and bounce back, and I will take back the occult art.”","Zhang Han put on an act.","The hall became quiet, and at the same time, the atmosphere became more and more tense.","The elders at the back didn’t even dare to breathe heavily as they clenched their fists.","“Succeed!","“Please succeed on one try!","“If you succeed, you will be Highest Clouds Palace’s benefactor!”","They prayed silently in their hearts, hoping that Zhang Hanyang could succeed once. This was related to the future of the Highest Clouds Palace.","If they continued to raise Lil Beast, the Highest Clouds Palace would not be able to hold on for a year. If they dropped raising it, the force could recover after a few decades and return to its peak.","“Hiss!”","Zhang Han took a deep breath.","Immortal Master Waterheaven immediately smiled. “Don’t be so nervous. Just give it a try.”","He added in his heart, “Anyway, it’s impossible to succeed.","“How could an ancient demonic beast recognize a master so easily?","“If it were that easy, everyone from the Holy Land in the Nine Mountains Region would have had one ancient demonic beast long ago.”","It was very rare to have an ancient demonic beast at the Tribulation Stage Peak Stage. This showed that it was very difficult for an ancient demonic beast to recognize a master.","Immortal Master Waterheaven had done some research. For tens of thousands of years, those who succeeded would only be recognized as masters by luck when the ancient demonic beasts were born. Then, they would be slowly cultivated. It was normal for every ancient demonic beast to consume countless resources.","Therefore, Immortal Master Waterheaven was too lazy to use the master recognition means over the years, hoping that Lil Beast could take the initiative to use it on account of his sincerity.","Therefore, Immortal Master Waterheaven was now full of confidence and looked at Lil Beast lightly.","Zhang Han made an incantation gesture with his right hand, and a seal appeared.","“Lil Beast, I’m starting.”","Zhang Han pondered and decided to show respect to Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“Awooo!”","When the seal touched the forehead of the Golden-armored Giant Beast, it woke up and opened its big eyes.","Its eyes were fierce, and its expression became ferocious as it roared madly.","“Arrrrgh!”","Its voice reverberated in all directions, and even some of the decorations were shaking slightly, causing it to seem extremely imposing.","But after Lil Beast discovered the seal-","“Ow!”","Lil Beast’s eyes were very bright. It was stunned for two seconds and then turned to look at Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“Awooo!”","It seemed to want to express something.","Clatter!","Immortal Master Waterheaven did not come to his senses.","“What does it mean by that?","“Wait!”","He seemed to have a bad feeling.","“Don’t!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven raised his hand, and his face changed.","Clatter!","Right at this moment, rays of light covered the Golden-armored Giant Beast, and a profound aura spread out. At the same time, wisps of flowing light were connected to Lil Beast and Zhang Han.","Swoosh!","The Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly shrank in size and disappeared into Zhang Han’s wrist.","“This... this... succeeded?”","Zhang Han tried his best to pretend to be surprised.","“Ah! Ah! Ah!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven patted his head and said, “No, this is not right, Zhang Hanyang. Did you see that just now? Lil Beast was looking at me. It felt that I used the means of master recognition, so it succeeded so easily. It was me, not you.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven seemed to have gone mad.","This made Zhang Han a little vigilant.","It was very dangerous when a ninth-tier Tribulation Stage master went crazy.","“Palace Master, Palace Master, calm down, calm down!”","The six or seven elders behind him immediately surrounded him.","They couldn’t hide their smiles at all. They wanted to laugh, but they tried their best to hold back their laughter.","“Palace Master, you just said that this is fate.”","“Ahem, it seems that Zhang Hanyang and Dragon King are meant to be together.”","“That’s right, that’s right. We all believe in fate. We believe that fate is like what you said.”","The elder who brought Zhang Han here even secretly winked at Zhang Han with a red face and a happy look.","“Well, Palace Master, Lil Beast seemed to be looking at me just now. Its eyes are too big,” Zhang Han said.","“No, no. It must be looking at me.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven didn’t have an imposing manner. He was disappointed and annoyed, but he was frank.","He pulled his hair and said, “You can go down and have a rest first. I always keep my word. Go and have a rest. Lil Beast is yours from now on.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han and the others were sent away by the elder who led the team before."]},{"number":1651,"title":"Chapter 1651 Legend","paragraphs":["Chapter 1651 Legend","“Get out, all of you. Leave me alone.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven sank into a state of doubt. He wanted to stay in the Dragon Palace alone.","The others all walked out.","The leading elder also led Zhang Han and the others to the residential area in the distance.","The leading elder said seriously, “I’ll arrange a small palace for you to live in for the time being, and then we’ll see what happens when the Palace Master makes up his mind.”","He didn’t say that in secret.","When they flew away, he immediately set up a sound-proof cover.","“Hahahaha... Allow me to laugh for a while, hahaha...”","The leading elder laughed nonstop. Judging from his expression, he was really surprised and happy.","A few minutes later.","“Phew, it feels good. It feels great.”","The leading elder said, “Thank you, Zhang Hanyang. You’ve saved the Highest Clouds Palace. You’re really amazing. I thought it was my own wishful thinking, but I didn’t expect you to make it on your first try. Zhang Hanyang, thank you.”","“Alas, the Palace Master is sad. I’m very ashamed,” Zhang Han said.","When Lil Beast looked back, it was like a beautiful misunderstanding that made Immortal Master Waterheaven’s imagination run wild.","At first, he couldn’t deal with parting with it. Just as he said, what if it was looking at him?","However, Immortal Master Waterheaven believed in fate. When he came to his senses, even if he was disappointed, he felt quite touched.","Zhang Han sighed with emotion. “Why haven’t I met someone like Immortal Master Waterheaven before?”","He now felt some admiration for Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“There’s nothing to be ashamed of.”","The leading elder said with a smile, “Without the Dragon King, the Highest Clouds Palace can develop normally. This is a good thing after all. Palace Master is very sad now, but he will be fine in a while. He’s an optimistic man and is very nice. Oh, by the way, you may feel troubled, because you will continue to raise the Dragon King.”","At this point, the leading elder’s tone trembled with fear. “Its appetite is too big. You, you may not be able to afford feeding it.”","“I’ll try my best.” Zhang Han sighed.","“Also, according to what I said before, over the past nineteen years, countless resources of the Highest Clouds Palace have been consumed by Dragon King. If you were to leave directly, regardless of how the Palace Master thinks about it, many Elders might be displeased,” said the leading elder.","“Let’s talk about it next time we meet the Palace Master. I can also be an elder of the Highest Clouds Palace.” Zhang Han made his attitude clear.","“Thank you.”","The leading elder cupped his hands. He appreciated Zhang Han.","Birds of a feather would flock together.","The core subordinates of Immortal Master Waterheaven were very similar to the members of the Heavenly Knights Sect in those days. They were upright people.","At the same time, these elders also liked and yearned for the ancient demonic beasts. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have held on for so many years. In the end, rationality triumphed over belief.","They had lost a lot of resources, so they naturally couldn’t hold on.","Just like that, Zhang Han and the others were taken to the small palace.","Now that there were no outsiders around, everyone began to say whatever they wanted.","“Dad, you’re so amazing. You made the Palace Master so fascinated,” Mengmeng said with a chuckle.","Zi Yan covered her belly with her right hand. She had shaken back and forth with laughter just now.","“He’s just a drama queen.” Yue Wuwei found it funny and said, “He strung the Palace Master along. Bah, what a scumbag!”","“What?” Zhang Han touched his forehead and said, “Alas, I’m really ashamed. There’s no other way to deal with this matter. What else can I do?”","“That’s right. You’re not as powerful as Zhang Han. How can you laugh at him here?” Lisa rolled her eyes at Yue Wuwei and said, “Besides, you don’t have a duplication.”","“What does it have to do with me?” Yue Wuwei said, “Now I finally completely understand that I’ll never get to defeat this man.”","“You finally understand that now? Uncle Zhang is indeed amazing,” Yue Xiaonao praised. “But Dad, you’re not bad either. Keep working hard.”","Yue Wuwei felt pleased with what she said, which was appropriate.","“Uncle Zhang is the best.” Chen Chuan gave Zhang Han a thumbs-up.","“But judging from the disappointed look of Immortal Master Waterheaven, he seems to be a little pitiful,” Zi Yan said. “He does have feelings for Lil Beast. It’s not that kind of feeling, but pure affection.”","“It’s not just a simple love.” Zhang Han shook his head. “He is so affectionate. Lil Beast matters greater than his women to him. Sometimes, Lil Beast is even more important than himself. It can be seen that he loves the ancient demonic beasts to his core.”","“Well, what should we do then? He has given us so many benefits. We have to make it up to him,” Mengmeng muttered.","“Yes.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “I’ve made up my mind. After we meet Immortal Monarch Lingxi, we’ll go back to Earth. Don’t we have a team of ancient demonic beasts? Maybe the little white horse is suitable for him.”","“Haha!”","Zi Yan suddenly laughed and said, “That smart One-horned White Horse? I feel that if the One-horned White Horse is given to Immortal Master Waterheaven, he will be fooled by it.”","“Hahaha.” Zhang Han thought of the spiritual One-horned White Horse and laughed.","Zi Yan analyzed a lot. The One-horned White Horse was unusually smart and even could be considered to be scheming. Zhang Han was sure that if he turned the little white horse into a beautiful girl and threw her into the ancient imperial harem, the One-horned White Horse might have the last laugh in a war of plotting.","“The little white horse is so smart.”","Mengmeng muttered, “It’s just that the Golden-armored Giant Beast is so domineering. The little white horse is not big, but it still has some pride.”","“Don’t underestimate that white horse.” Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing. “That white horse can lead a small group of ancient demonic beasts, so it must be very powerful.”","“That’s right.” Mengmeng blinked and said, “The key is that it has never used any means.”","“The One-horned White Horse has much room for development,” Zhang Han said, “It is an orthodox ancient demonic beast. I don’t know what level it is at exactly, but I think it is not far from a Holy Beast. Perhaps it is already a Holy Beast and is not ordinary.”","“I see. However, I can’t really tell that,” Mengmeng said.","After the crowd chatted for a while, the leading elder came over and controlled some delicious food that had just been made. The dishes floated in the air and landed on the table not far away.","“I have a bottle of treasured liquor here, Zhang Hanyang. I’m in a good mood today. Shall we celebrate together?” the leading elder said with a smile.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han nodded.","Everyone came over and sat down.","“Elder, what’s your Taoist title?” Mengmeng asked.","She felt that this elder leading the team was a little cute.","“My Taoist title is Wuluo,” the leading elder said with a smile.","“Immortal Master Wuluo.” Yue Wuwei smiled.","Immortal Master Wuluo had extraordinary strength. In the Highest Clouds Palace, he was second only to Immortal Master Waterheaven in terms of status.","He was the right-hand man of Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“I’ve been with the Palace Master for 650 years, and it hasn’t been easy for us to get to where we are. We’ve established the Highest Clouds Palace and reached the top level of the Star Sea, but there are still many forces we have to be afraid of. In the Nine Mountains Region, there are many super sects, and above the sects, there are also major Holy Lands. Alas, in fact, there is a group of people who have ancient demonic beasts, but it’s the first time I’ve seen such an ancient demonic beast with a deceptively big appetite as Dragon King.”","Elder Wuluo sighed with emotion. He took out a white liquor bottle and poured a glass of liquor for all the men present, including Chen Chuan.","“The Palace Master is kind and righteous, and he also cares about fate. Zhang Hanyang, I think you and the Highest Clouds Palace are destined to be together. I have high hopes for you.”","“Hahaha. It’s my honor.” Zhang Han smiled and showed due respect for Wuluo’s feelings.","“The Highest Clouds Palace is not in a good state right now. A few years ago, we lived frugally and tried to exchange more rare metals for Dragon King to eat. Now...”","In the secular world, Mengmeng could always watch some news on the Internet that someone’s family had run out of money.","She had never experienced a frugal lifestyle like cutting down expenses in every aspect, but she had learned something about it from the Internet. Now, she didn’t expect that the Dao Seeking Cultivators who could fly in the sky and hide in the ground would have such a situation.","“Immortal Master Wuluo,” Zhang Han said, “you don’t have to be so courteous. I can be an elder here.”","“You can just call me First Elder.” Immortal Master Wuluo beamed with joy. He increasingly appreciated Zhang Han as he said, “People are very free in the Highest Clouds Palace. I’m also worried that you might agree now and then to go to a secret realm tomorrow to leave directly.”","“I won’t do that.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","Yue Xiaonao said indifferently, “In fact, you should be worried about yourselves. It seems that all the sects that have something to do with Uncle Zhang will...”","She wanted to say, “All the sects that have something to do with Uncle Zhang will become forces under the command of Mount New Moon, the armies of Zhang Hanyang.”","But it was not the right time to say that. So Yue Wuwei continued, “Ahem, ahem, those sects all developed very well. Well, it’s like this.”","He gave Zhang Han a look.","Zhang Han was slightly stunned.","“Well, it seems to be true. For example, the Starlight Divine Sect also has something to do with me, but it doesn’t belong to my sect.”","What they didn’t know was that in Southern Mountain Area in the Center Galaxy far away, the Starlight Divine Sect and Vast Heaven Sect were discussing something.","The First Elder of the Starlight Divine Sect said, “I heard an interesting thing from your disciples. It seems that you often throw parties. Why don’t we have a party to solve the problem of the single disciples, and then we can get closer to each other?”","“What a good idea!”","“...”","Those who knew Mount New Moon well could not help thinking, “I’m afraid that the Starlight Divine Sect will only exist for a few years.”","On Zhang Han’s side.","After a few rounds of drinking, everyone was chatting happily.","Immortal Master Wuluo was like a kind old man.","People could sense a relaxed and casual aura in the Highest Clouds Palace.","“You’re from the Center Galaxy.”","Immortal Master Wuluo touched his chin. His hair was gray, but his face was neat and tidy. He didn’t look like Yue Wuwei, who has a long beard.","“The Center Galaxy is not bad, but it’s still too small and far from the Star Sea. If the Cultivation World is compared to a sphere, the Center Galaxy can be regarded as one of the typical Galaxies in the peripheral area.”","“That’s true,” Yue Wuwei said.","He enjoyed chatting with Immortal Master Wuluo, and gradually there were more and more topics.","“You’ve actually risen to prominence from a small Star Area. In that case, you must be a legend to be able to come to the Star Sea,” Immortal Master Wuluo said. “What a coincidence! I’m also from a Star Area. I’ve long been a legend in my hometown.”","“...”"]},{"number":1652,"title":"Chapter 1652 The People From the Holy Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 1652 The People From the Holy Land","After chatting for a while, they were almost drunk.","Immortal Master Wuluo suddenly sighed.","“In fact, the area of the Cultivation World is limited. It’s surrounded by Barren Star Areas, where our Human Clan Dao Seeking Cultivators can’t go deep. There are many ancient demonic beasts there. The Cultivation World is both large and small because the area we know is limited. Moreover, 800 years ago, when the Grand Master of the Likong Holy Land died, he told us a piece of shocking news.”","“What news?” Yue Wuwei asked curiously.","“He said that the Cultivation World was only so big. Even if we passed through the wilderness of the ancient demonic beasts, we would not be able to cross the space around it, which was like a cage. As for the world of immortals we pursued, it was the real world. We had to break the rules to make it to Heaven Road and ascend to the real world. However, the rules of the Great Domain would not allow people to achieve that easily. That’s why there are powerful Heavenly Tribulations such as the Holy Thunder of the Five Elements, the Eight Wild Heavenly Thunder, and even the divine thunder over the sky,” Immortal Master Wuluo said with fervor and assurance. “These are secrets. There are many secrets in the Cultivation World, which are kept by the members of various Holy Lands. It is difficult for outsiders to know them.”","“Holy Lands?”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","Back then, he had come into contact with some Holy Lands and learned some secrets, but he still didn’t know the real information. Those people wouldn’t tell him.","But the information he learned also showed that the Cultivation World was like a huge spherical starry sky, and people were pursuing the way to the world of immortals. It was not easy to achieve that because people were limited by the rules of the Great Domain.","As for the meaning of the existence of the rules of the Great Domain, there were many speculations, but no one knew who exactly it was.","“I’ll know what the higher world looks like when I see it in the future.”","Zhang Han thought to himself.","Without a doubt, his six bodies were all physiques from the higher world. Going to the higher world would be a matter of course for him.","Moreover, he was now at the Peak Stage of the seventh tier, not far from the eighth tier.","He had begun to vaguely feel that his body was a little out of tune with the hidden rules of the Great Domain in the void around him.","This meant that he was on his way to transcending natural laws.","“I’ll go back and ask for some fine liquor. We’ll have another drink some day,” Immortal Master Wuluo said with a smile.","He still planned to come back in the next few days.","It was for no other reason than to get to know Zhang Han, talk to him, and see what kind of person he was and whether he and his companions would leave without permission.","They had a good chat, which made Immortal Master Wuluo feel much more relieved.","However, to everyone’s surprise, Immortal Master Wuluo came over again the next day.","“Today, I’ll show you around the Highest Clouds Star. There are a few good places with pleasant scenery. I’ve also prepared a bottle of fine liquor. I’ve kept it for a thousand years. We can have a taste later.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han did not refuse.","During the trip, Zhang Han almost ignored Immortal Master Wuluo, so he accompanied Zi Yan and Mengmeng to relax. This was quite a relaxing time.","In this way, the crowd had fun and drank for half a month.","Immortal Master Wuluo and Yue Wuwei had a good chat. They even regretted they hadn’t met sooner.","Immortal Master Waterheaven sat alone on the bed that Lil Beast had once slept on in the Dragon Palace.","Half a month of thinking had also helped him recover from his sadness.","“Forget it, forget it.","“Lil Beast, you and I are destined not to be together.","“It’s a pity.”","Boom!","All of a sudden, Immortal Master Waterheaven took action. One giant palm after another began to smash apart the Dragon Palace, shattering it into pieces of metal.","Ripples spread in all directions.","“Holy shit, Lord of Immortal Master Waterheaven has gone mad. Will he deal with us?” Yue Wuwei, who was watching from the side of the small palace, was frightened.","“He should be fine, right?”","Zhang Han was also a little uncertain.","“Then let’s run away first,” Yue Wuwei said. “That’s the Palace Master. He’s too powerful.”","“It’s okay. Let’s wait and see.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","His attitude made Yue Wuwei fall silent.","“Damn.”","Yue Wuwei muttered in a low voice, “Now you can even compete with Immortal Master Waterheaven.”","If they had been careful, Zhang Han would have said it a long time ago. He didn’t say it or express his opinion.","Having been together for so many years, Yue Wuwei knew Zhang Han well. What Zhang Han was doing completely showed that he had the ability to fight with Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“He’s only at the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage, but he can fight an expert two tiers above him. Isn’t that too incredible?”","Yue Wuwei was discouraged.","He had completely forgotten that he, as a sixth-tier Tribulation Stage master, could fight against most of the seventh-tier Tribulation Stage cultivators.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Ten minutes later, the Dragon Palace collapsed.","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s face was calm. He put away all the metal pieces and flew over from afar.","Everyone thought that Immortal Master Waterheaven’s attitude would be colder, or that there would be a sad atmosphere.","But when he got closer-","“Zhang Hanyang.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled. “It’s been more than ten days since Lil Beast has eaten rare metals. Let it eat the Dragon Palace first.”","Zhang Han was speechless.","“Why do I feel that I’ve stolen his lover?”","“Ahem.”","Zhang Han took the Space Ring and coughed softly. “Lil Beast, come out for food.”","“Awooo!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast soon devoured one-tenth of the metal of the Dragon Palace. It blinked and looked at Immortal Master Waterheaven for a few seconds.","“Awooo!”","After letting out a cry, the Golden-armored Giant Beast immediately returned to Zhang Han’s wrist.","“Hahaha.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven laughed out loud. “Did you see that? Did you see that? That’s an ancient demonic beast. It already has feelings for me. Not bad, not bad.”","“Palace Master!”","Hearing that, Immortal Master Wuluo and more than a dozen people rushed over. He cupped his hands and said, “I’ve talked a lot with Zhang Hanyang. Well, he’s very willing to stay in the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“Wonderful!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded and said, “Zhang Hanyang is from now on... the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace.”","Three of the original Second Elders of the Highest Clouds Palace had died in some secret realms, and now the position was still vacant.","This was the highest status that could be arranged.","“Thank you, Palace Master.”","Zhang Han looked calm and nodded slightly.","“Haha, from now on, we’re on the same side.” Immortal Master Wuluo laughed and said, “Zhang Hanyang is now the Second Elder. Spread the news.”","“Let’s have some drinks. I’m satisfied that I can often see Lil Beast in the future.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed again. His heart was filled with worry about gains and losses.","“Well.”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","He was thinking about how to tell Immortal Master Waterheaven about the little white horse.","As a result, he and his daughter had a tacit understanding. Mengmeng glanced at his eyes and knew what he was thinking. She took the initiative to say, “Palace Master, you still have a chance, because we also know an ancient demonic beast, which is very handsome.”","“What...” Immortal Master Waterheaven’s pupils constricted. “What did you say?”","“That is to say, Palace Master, you may also get your own ancient demonic beast,” Zhang Han said.","“Really?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven suddenly became excited. “Then what are we waiting for? Let’s go quickly. Tell me what the ancient demonic beast you know looks like. Is it as domineering as Lil Beast?”","“Palace Master, Palace Master, calm down.”","Immortal Master Wuluo’s expression changed again and again. “Zhang Hanyang has just entered the Highest Clouds Palace, and the ceremony has not yet been held. Besides, the Highest Clouds Palace needs the Palace Master to lead it. We’d better not set off on a long journey for the time being, right?”","They had kept a Dragon King, which cost them a lot of resources before, and now they had not earned back the money they had spent yet. If they kept another ancient demonic beast now, which was still a foodie, the Highest Clouds Palace would be really doomed.","Zhang Han showed due respect for the Palace’s feelings and said, “It will be a long trip. Besides, Dragon King needs to sleep or exercise often in its current state. It’s not suitable for it to travel.”","“I see.”","After a moment’s consideration, Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded. “Indeed, we can only take a long trip after a few years. Wuluo, make the arrangements for a meeting between the high-position officials of the Highest Clouds Palace. I already have ideas on what to do next.”","“Phew...”","Immortal Master Wuluo and the others heaved sighs of relief, cupped their hands, and immediately left to make arrangements.","“In ten days, I’ll hold a ceremony for you.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven didn’t stay for long either. He sat there for a moment before leaving.","Hence, ten days later, the Highest Clouds Star was bustling with activity.","Tens of thousands of high-position officials were around, and many of them looked excited. The Palace Master was finally going to develop the Highest Clouds Palace well.","“From today on, Han Yang Immortal will be the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven had officially appointed him, giving him command medallions and all privileges.","Privileges mattered and were rare among the forces of the Highest Clouds Palace.","“Greetings, Second Elder.”","“Greetings, Han Yang Immortal!”","The news quickly spread throughout the Highest Clouds Palace.","They had another Second Elder.","However, this did not mean anything.","What was even more exciting was that the Palace Master had personally gone to get a lot of cooperation, and the missions had gradually increased. At the same time, the resources they could get had returned to normal, and they would get some of their wages in arrears from previous years.","As for the Golden-armored Giant Beast, its appetite suddenly became smaller. It had been eating the Dragon Palace for three years, which made Immortal Master Waterheaven a little suspicious. “Is it because it has recognized its master now?","“Otherwise, with Dragon King’s appetite, it would definitely eat 10,000 times more than this.","“Yes, it must be because it has recognized its master.”","When Immortal Master Waterheaven got the chance to get the rare metal, he would also send it to Zhang Han.","At the same time, Zhang Han and the others occasionally went out on missions and obtained spirit treasure resources, which provided a lot of resources to the Highest Clouds Palace.","Five years passed in the blink of an eye.","Immortal Master Wuluo often came to drink with Yue Wuwei, while Immortal Master Waterheaven chatted with Zhang Han.","Over the past few years in the Highest Clouds Palace, Zhang Han and the others lived a peaceful and leisurely life.","In the past five years, the Thunder Body had swallowed more than 700 tribulation flashes of lightning. All the high-position officials of the Highest Clouds Palace had successfully undergone their tribulations.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure had also devoured six treasure lands of decent quality.","The Great Demon Body was cultivating alone.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast ate some metal when it was free. Its main purpose was to comprehend its innate supernatural powers.","As for the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, it was still being nourished by energy and was no longer a newborn. It could participate in battle at any time.","Zhang Han only commented on the Extreme Purity Immortal Body in a few words, “This is the real Immortal Technique!”","There was no doubt that in recent years, the comprehension of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body had also touched Zhang Han a lot.","A peaceful life would be broken in the end.","On this day, a large number of high-end king vessels, about a thousand in number, arrived at the Highest Clouds Star.","Immortal Master Wuluo and Immortal Master Waterheaven were eating with Zhang Han.","Several of their subordinates quickly flew over, looking flustered.","“Palace Master, Palace Master!”","“Hmm?” Immortal Master Waterheaven raised his brows slightly.","Generally speaking, this kind of panic meant that something was wrong.","He had thought that it would be a minor problem in the Highest Clouds Palace that he needed to settle. Unexpectedly-","“Some members of the Holy Land are here.”"]},{"number":1653,"title":"Chapter 1653 Arrogant","paragraphs":["Chapter 1653 Arrogant","“It’s the Dongruo Holy Land.”","“Holy Son Yake has come in person. He also brought the members of the Sea-ring Sect, the Wind Li Sect, and the other four major sects with him.”","All the news caused the expression on Immortal Master Waterheaven’s face to change.","“What?!”","He suddenly stood up, and his expression was slightly unsightly.","“We’ve made a deal!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven gritted his teeth as he flew out alone.","“Wait a minute.”","Immortal Master Wuluo waited for more than ten seconds before nodding to Zhang Han and the others. “Let’s follow him and watch from behind.”","Mengmeng blinked and asked, “Is there any trouble?”","“It’s big trouble.”","Immortal Master Wuluo took a deep breath and said, “The Sea-ring Sect, the Wind Li Sect, and the other four major sects cooperated with the Highest Clouds Palace a few years ago because we needed to keep Dragon King. We obtained a lot of resources. But in recent years, the Highest Clouds Palace has suffered a lot of losses every year, and we even owe them a lot of resources. Palace Master talked to them a few days ago. He said that he would return a batch of resources every three years. However, they actually came here together with the Holy Land. There must be some changes.”","Immortal Master Wuluo looked a little distressed. “Alas! The Holy Land won’t reason with us first-rate forces. Since the Holy Son of the Holy Land has come in person, I suspect that something about the Dragon King might have been leaked.”","It was not hard to guess.","The Highest Clouds Palace was merely a first-rate faction. It meant nothing to the lofty Holy Land.","Moreover, the Highest Clouds Palace had nothing that attracted those people. The only thing that attracted them was the ancient demonic beast, the Star Demon Dragon King.","Zhang Han said, “Where is the Dongruo Holy Land?”","His expression was relatively calm.","In his opinion, there was nothing unusual about those Holy Lands.","“The Dongruo Holy Land is at the top of the Seventh Mountain,” Immortal Master Wuluo replied.","In the past few years, Mengmeng, Chen Chuan, and Yue Xiaonao had all learned about the branches of the Star Sea.","The Star Sea was a relatively regular spherical nebula, which was divided into the outer ring and the inner ring. At the center was the Nine Mountains Region, which looked like nine mountains.","Each mountain was divided into a mountain base, a mountainside area, and a mountaintop area.","“I’ve never heard of it.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly. He had never heard of any Dongruo Holy Land before. It might be a small Holy Land.","Zhang Han knew and had even been to some of the large Holy Lands.","“They’ve come with ill intentions.”","Immortal Master Wuluo sighed again. More and more people gathered around him. Soon, they gathered together and flew to the vicinity of the space station.","Immortal Master Waterheaven was facing thousands of people.","The six cooperative sects were led by the people from the Dongruo Holy Land. Standing in the first position was a burly man who looked to be in his thirties. He was Holy Son Yake.","“Holy Son Yake is at the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","Immortal Master Wuluo said from the side, “He’s not far from the ninth tier. But the status of the Holy Land is the highest in the Star Sea. Immortal Master Tianyi of the Dongruo Holy Land reached the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage nine thousand years ago. He is very powerful. Therefore, the Holy Sons of the Dongruo Holy Land have high authority. Look at the three hundred guards around him. They are all at the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage. More than half of them are stronger than the Palace Master.”","“How formidable!”","Yue Wuwei had a strange look on his face.","He didn’t expect that the guards of a Holy Son of the Dongruo Holy Land would all be at the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","“That’s simply terrifying.”","“Greetings, Holy Son Yake.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven cupped his hands in front of him.","The distance between the two was about a thousand meters, and it was not hard to cover that distance.","But out of habit, they had to keep a distance from each other to prevent anyone from suddenly attacking.","Immortal Master Waterheaven naturally sensed the ill intent of the intruders.","At this moment, over a hundred thousand people from the Highest Clouds Palace had gathered, and they were all standing not too far behind Immortal Master Waterheaven.","Zhang Han and the others were watching in the first row.","Seeing that Holy Son Yake didn’t respond to Immortal Master Waterheaven’s greeting, Zhang Han took the initiative to ask, “May I know why you are here, Holy Son Yake?”","Holy Son Yake didn’t seem to be in the mood to talk. He toyed with a small bird, a palm-sized Exotic Beast, in his hand. Without even looking at Immortal Master Waterheaven, he waved his left hand slightly at the person beside him.","It was obvious that he was ignoring the ones from the Highest Clouds Palace.","Immortal Master Waterheaven fell silent.","“Although your Holy Land is awesome, you, Holy Son Yake, haven’t reached the ninth tier yet. What right do you have to put on airs?”","The Sect Leader of the Sea-ring Sect smiled faintly.","“Let me talk about this as the representative of the six sects. A few years ago, the Highest Clouds Palace had deep cooperation with our six sects. We thought that we could make some money and earn some resources, but we didn’t expect that we would lose a lot of resources. According to the agreement, you have to pay for all the resources that our six sects have lost. Half a year ago, you came to us and said that these resources could be returned in batches according to the year. But we can’t wait and don’t have time to play with you.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven sneered. He really couldn’t stand this kind of person who went back on his word.","“I promised you that I would return you ten percent more of the resources, and you all nodded in agreement. Now, do you simply want to go back on your word?”","“No, no, no.”","The Sect Leader of the Sea-ring Sect shook his head and said, “Waterheaven, I forgot to tell you one thing. In fact, our six sects rely on Holy Son Yake to survive. It is because of his support that we can become first-rate forces. Therefore, the resources you owe us all belong to him. We don’t have a say in the way of getting these resources, and only Holy Son Yake does.”","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s face was darkened. “So, what do you think, Holy Son Yake? We can discuss it.”","“Bastards!”","Immortal Master Wuluo gritted his teeth. “Aren’t they bastards? They’re going back on their word because they want even more resources! Motherfucker! These disgusting bastards!”","Everyone understood what was happening.","The Sect Leaders of the six sects usually had the final say, but they could get more benefits with Holy Son Yake’s help. With the status of the Dongruo Holy Land, they could definitely get more.","This was the situation at hand.","Everyone thought that the two sides would talk about it and reach an agreement.","However, they had never expected that the attitude of Holy Son Yake would be so arrogant.","“Immortal Master Waterheaven, you’re the founder of Highest Clouds Palace, which is located on the Seventh Mountain. You have only a few planets, and your sect is the first-rate force in the Star Sea. There are tens of millions of people like you in the Star Sea, so who gave you the confidence to negotiate with me? Who do you think you are to talk to me?”","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Waterheaven looked ferocious, and his heart was full of anger. But he knew that if he dared to take action, he would be killed by the guards of Holy Son Yake.","What Holy Son Yake said was right. A first-rate force meant nothing to the Holy Land.","“He’s gone too far.”","Immortal Master Wuluo clenched his fists. “One can be killed but not humiliated.”","“Don’t be impulsive!”","Yue Wuwei nudged his arm and said, “They’re not going to take action. If we don’t restrain ourselves, they may take action.”","He communicated with Zhang Han via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","“Can you defeat them?”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","Holy Son Yake had many men with him. Zhang Han had not yet reached the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage. With so many people fighting at the same time, the situation would definitely be out of control.","However, this also gave Yue Wuwei a rough estimate of Zhang Han’s combat capability.","Now they could fight side-by-side with Immortal Master Waterheaven, but they could only defeat a few of their enemies. In the face of many ninth-tier Immortal Masters, they were not strong enough to defeat all their opponents.","“If he reaches the eighth tier, the current situation can be solved.”","Yue Wuwei thought to himself.","At this time, Immortal Master Waterheaven spoke. He took a deep breath and said, “Holy Son Yake, you’re right. If there’s nothing else, I’ll go back and prepare the resources.”","“Since you don’t show due respect for my feelings, I don’t intend to listen to you any longer.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven intended to have Holy Son Yake finish his words as soon as possible and then quickly get lost.","“Heh.”","Holy Son Yake looked away from the bird in his hand and glanced at Immortal Master Waterheaven.","He said faintly, “Some news always spreads very slowly. By chance, I heard that you began to raise an ancient demonic beast more than a decade ago. You will pay back the resources you owe with that ancient demonic beast.”","“Ancient demonic beast?”","A cold light flashed through Immortal Master Waterheaven’s eyes.","“How dare you covet the ancient demonic beast?”","He wanted to kill Holy Son Yake.","“My men can hold off those guards for the time being. I will kill him and then run away?”","That ancient demonic beast was the bottom line of Immortal Master Waterheaven.","When Immortal Master Wuluo saw this, his heart skipped a beat.","He immediately said, “I’m sorry, Holy Son Yake. The ancient demonic beast has recognized someone as its master.”","“Its master?”","Holy Son Yake said indifferently, “It will take me a few years to travel around since I left the Holy Land. Waterheaven, I don’t care what method you use. I’ll give you three years to hand over that ancient demonic beast to me. Otherwise, I’ll kill all of you.”","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Waterheaven was panting and suppressing his anger. He did not answer.","“Let’s go.”","Holy Son Yake turned around lazily and returned to his exclusive spaceship.","After he left, the six sects followed the fleet of the Dongruo Holy Land, but the remaining spaceships stayed in place and openly released a lot of high-end investigation equipment that covered the nearby void.","They were overseeing the Highest Clouds Palace blatantly.","If the headquarters of the Highest Clouds Palace mobilized all its members, someone would probably come out to stop them immediately.","“Return to the palace!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven let out a cold shout.","He led the team back to the surface of the planet.","“Palace Master, what should we do about this?”","“The ancient demonic beast is with the Second Elder, and it has already recognized him as its master. How can it be taken out? Unless its master dies, there is no way to undo the recognition.”","“They’ve gone too far! The Dongruo Holy Land is simply bullying us too much!","“He’s just a Holy Son. He’s not even at the ninth tier. He’s as arrogant as the Grand Master of the Holy Land.","“Even many Grand Masters are not arrogant. Only a dabbler like him would be so arrogant.","“‘Kill them all.’ If he dares to come up, I’ll kill him with one move.”","“...”","Many people were filled with indignation.","“This matter...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven frowned as he prepared for something.","Judging from his posture, he would rather fight than hand over the Exotic Beast.","He was too impulsive about the Exotic Beast.","Zhang Han suddenly said, “I have a plan for this matter. Don’t worry.”","Elder Wuluo asked, “What plan?”","Zhang Han, however, shook his head without saying anything.","“Everyone, let’s disperse first. We’ll come up with a plan in a few days,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","The crowd dispersed.","“What do you think?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked, “It’s impossible to hand over Lil Beast. I’d rather find a way to kill that Yake.”"]},{"number":1654,"title":"Chapter 1654 The Big Secret Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 1654 The Big Secret Realm","“Palace Master, you are too straightforward.” Zhang Han felt a little helpless.","“Since my dad said that he would solve it, he will do it. Don’t worry, Palace Master,” Mengmeng muttered.","The young girl was beautiful, charming, lovely, and lively. She appeared invincible.","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled. “How should we resolve this? I’m not sure even if you don’t tell me.”","“Let me tell you something.”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and took the lead into the palace.","When everyone was seated, he smiled and said, “After Lil Beast recognized me as its master, I could feel that its combat capability was very horrifying. It’s only a little away from the eighth tier. In three years, it will make a breakthrough and reach the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage, and its combat capacity will advance by leaps and bounds. It will also get to defeat some Grand Masters of the Holy Lands.”","“How is it supposed to fight them? It’s still far from being a match for them,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said worriedly. “If it dies...alas.”","“It won’t. Lil Beast can fight those Grand Masters for a year.” Zhang Han smiled mysteriously. “Because after it breaks through to the eighth tier, its defense will be almost invincible in the Cultivation World, unless it encounters some mysterious supernatural powers.”","“But it just so happens that the Grand Masters of the Holy Lands know all kinds of mysterious supernatural powers.” Immortal Master Wuluo let out a long sigh. “Their strength is too strong. Many of them have lived for more than 10,000 years.”","“Speaking of mysterious supernatural powers, I’ve obtained the supreme martial arts heritage, such as thunder, demonic Qi, power of stars, and spiritual force... I can defend against all kinds of supernatural powers,” Zhang Han said.","As he spoke, his mind moved slightly.","From time to time, electric currents flickered in front of his body. It was demonic Qi, then the power of stars, spiritual force, and so on. Except for thunder and demonic Qi, all other abilities came from the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","Zhang Han didn’t show the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, which was more profound. Even if he did, others wouldn’t understand.","“Defend. If we can really defend against them, we can think of a way to escape.” Immortal Master Waterheaven narrowed his eyes.","“Besides...”","Immortal Master Wuluo’s expression was slightly cold. “It’s just Holy Son Yake. We can’t draw out the Grand Master of the Dongruo Holy Land. If we can, with the defensive power that Hanyang mentioned, we can find a way to kill Yake.”","“Yes.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said seriously, “Then let’s focus on Lil Beast’s breakthrough. Can it really break through in three years?”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “I need some metal resources. A nice treasure land will do.”","“All right. Wuluo, send some men to pay attention to all the secret realms and treasure lands that appear around. If there is any high-end one, we will go there in person,” said Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“Yes, Palace Master.”","Immortal Master Wuluo withdrew and made the arrangements.","At the same time, some people from the Dongruo Holy Land arrived and suppressed Immortal Master Waterheaven.","The news spread throughout the Highest Clouds Palace.","Some of the core elders and protectors didn’t think that there was anything wrong with it. They had followed Immortal Master Waterheaven for a long time and were on good terms with him.","As for the new protectors or disciples from other regions, they were all in a state of panic.","“Heavens, what an eventful period.”","“One wave after another comes. What can we get from the Highest Clouds Palace now? Our treatment is different from before.”","“The Highest Clouds Palace has been short of resources since a few years ago. Now Holy Son Yake, who is from the Dongruo Holy Land in the Seventh Mountain, has taken action and left no room for us to survive. We’d better think about what to do next.”","“...”","Many people communicated with each other.","Everyone had to plan for their future.","However, since they had joined the Highest Clouds Palace, they would not be able to leave easily.","It was clear that even if the Holy Land would only attack the headquarters of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Seventh Mountain, they wouldn’t go all out. After all, the Highest Clouds Palace had a lot of businesses that were spread all over the various regions. The Holy Land wouldn’t put in that much effort and wouldn’t hold that much of a grudge against them.","But if those disciples and protectors left before the matter was settled, no matter which sect they joined, others would think, “People like you join a sect when it’s doing fine and leave when it’s in trouble. No sect would be glad to take in disciples like you.”","Although no internal disciples had left yet, in fact, they all had their own ideas.","Elder Wuluo had already guessed something like this, but he didn’t take any action.","He needed to stabilize the morale of the troops, which would depend on the result of the fight against the Holy Land three years later.","At the same time, Zhang Han began to watch the news of various secret realms appearing every day.","The Highest Clouds Palace was as expected of a sect with a lot of intelligence.","The secret realms discovered found every day were enough for Zhang Han to explore for a while.","However, he didn’t fancy any of those secret realms.","Some were too far away, and he couldn’t get there. The close ones were basically low-level secret realms, and the probability of a treasure land appearing was low. However, there were also many people in this area who were undergoing their tribulations. Zhang Han’s Thunder Body could eat a lot there.","In the blink of an eye, more than two years passed.","Immortal Master Waterheaven had gotten a lot of metals. Zhang Han had devoured the Thunder Tribulation. Plus, there were five treasure lands, which made him merely one step away from the eighth tier.","“Dad, when will you make a breakthrough?”","On this day, Mengmeng and the others were sitting on the sofa in the hall of the small palace. Seeing Zhang Han coming, the young girl ran over and asked, “There is still half a year left before the three-year limit.”","A drop of kindness deserved a fountain of gratitude.","It was the style of many members of Mount New Moon.","They wanted to protect the Highest Clouds Palace. Now the key was whether Zhang Han could make a breakthrough or not.","“Soon.”","Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “It should not be too late. In half a year, I will find a good treasure land or a metal place, and then I can make a breakthrough.”","“I’m afraid that such a secret realm will not appear.” Yue Wuwei took a light breath, and there was a hint of worry in his tone.","“There hasn’t been a big secret realm in the Nine Mountains Region or the areas near the inner ring for 50 years.”","Zhang Han said, “According to the previous probability, there will be a big secret realm in each area every 30 to 50 years. If we are lucky, we may encounter it. If we are unlucky, I’ll keep devouring the metal step by step...”","Zhang Han had always sought stability. At this time, he also analyzed all the conditions.","But before he could finish his words-","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Wuluo flew over at an extremely fast speed, looking quite excited.","“Hanyang, Hanyang!","“This is it!","“A big secret realm with high energy has appeared. It has reached the highest level. Some of the Holy Lands on the Seventh Mountain, Eighth Mountain, and Ninth Mountain have been alarmed. They have sent people to the big secret realm, which is located at the border area between the Eighth Mountain and the inner ring.”","Immortal Master Wuluo’s tone was full of surprise. “Is this level enough?”","A big secret realm in the Star Sea meant that there would be a lot of cultivation resources. It was very likely that there would be treasure lands or even Profound-grade treasures.","There was no doubt that since the secret realm could alarm some Holy Lands, it must have the highest level of energy with some treasure lands and some Elemental Sources.","Zhang Han’s eyes lit up. “That’s great enough!”","“The Palace Master’s spaceship has been launched. I’m here to pick you up. There’s no time to lose. Let’s go. It’ll take us a month to get there at least,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","“Let’s go.”","Everyone got up one after another and flew out of the small palace. They took the aircraft, boarded Immortal Master Waterheaven’s spaceship at the space station, and broke into the secondary space before they headed for the nearest Space Shooting Planet.","“Hahaha, there is always a way out. There’s finally a big secret realm.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled and said, “Hanyang, if you can make a breakthrough, we will be qualified to talk to Holy Son Yake about this matter.”","The status of Holy Son Yake was high, but his power was actually limited.","Immortal Master Waterheaven had the feeling that once the Highest Clouds Palace displayed some powerful strength, Holy Son Yake would retreat. By then, it wouldn’t be a big deal to give him more resources. After all, the Highest Clouds Palace earned money fast.","“Yeah.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly, and his indifferent attitude imperceptibly influenced the atmosphere.","Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Wuluo also felt this confidence.","“It’s true that the Holy Son, Yake, does not have such great power. What’s there to be afraid of? We’ll just fight him.”","“This secret realm can’t be underestimated.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said seriously, “When I got the news, I heard that 37 Holy Lands have sent people to the big secret realm, and the leaders are all super experts, who are all at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.”","At this time, Zhang Han smiled faintly.","“There are nine tiers in the Tribulation Stage, but they are often tacitly divided into ten phases. After the ninth tier, it is the Peak Stage. However, there is actually a big gap between the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage cultivators. It depends on the mastery of supernatural powers, occult arts, and the number of trump cards one has. It can be said that the more trump cards one has, the stronger one will be. At the same time, there are also some Peak-Stage Tribulation cultivators who just know a few moves. Therefore, the gap is not small. It’s just like the situation between the major Holy Lands. The Holy Lands are also like the pyramid. Many Holy Lands are low-level, and some of them are not even powerful as super sects. I’ve learned something about the Dongruo Holy Land, and it’s below average.”","“But, that’s a Holy Land, after all.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven grinned with a strange look on his face.","“Oh, Hanyang, are you too arrogant?”","He had never seen Zhang Han fight before. He thought Zhang Han was at the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage and even might not be a match for Holy Son Yake. “How could he say that in such a calm tone?”","“The spaceship has arrived on the Space Shooting Planet.”","The crowd took the first Space Shooting Planet.","The Palace Master of the Highest Clouds Palace was qualified to enter the inner passageway.","People had to line up while taking the normal passages, and there were only a dozen spaceships in front of Zhang Han and the others.","They waited silently. It was almost their turn.","Swoosh!","A batch of spaceships appeared.","“They’re from the Supreme Thunder Sect, a super sect.”","“Those people are from the Xuanyuan Sect, which is also a super sect.”","Immortal Master Wuluo took a light breath and said, “It seems that we have to wait in line for a while.”","The strong were respected, and the weak had to give way to the strong. This was also one of the major Space Shooting Planets.","The fleets from the two super sects cut in line. Zhang Han and his companions waited for three hours before they took the first Space Shooting Planet.","They flew quickly through the secondary space and soon arrived at the second Space Shooting Planet.","They had to wait for a few hours for every Space Shooting Planet. But generally speaking, the flight time was shortened a hundred times.","However, the closer they got to the secret realm, the more forces were lining up.","“On our route, we have encountered 56 super sects. It seems that there will be at least hundreds of super sects and many Holy Lands fighting over the big secret realm in the Strangepeak District. We may not be able to get anything.” Immortal Master Waterheaven felt a lot of pressure.","For the first-rate forces, such a big secret realm was just a way to get some minor benefits.","While the Holy Lands and the super sects enjoyed great benefits, others would only gain small benefits or even nothing.","“Well, don’t worry. My dad is very lucky,” Mengmeng said. “Every time he goes to a big secret realm, he can get a lot of treasures.”","“Hahaha, is that so?” Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled and shook his head. He didn’t seem to believe it.","“How is it possible to always find treasures?”"]},{"number":1655,"title":"Chapter 1655 Not Standing on Ceremony","paragraphs":["Chapter 1655 Not Standing on Ceremony","After exploring the secret realms for so many years, Immortal Master Waterheaven had not obtained any spirit treasure in over half of the secret realms, not to mention that Zhang Hanyang was only at the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage now.","Zhang Han smiled and said nothing.","In the past, with the Treasure-sniffing nose, he could always feel the aura of all kinds of treasures. It was like he had a cheating program in the secret realms.","Now, Little Hei also had a Treasure-sniffing nose. Unfortunately, Dahei and Little Hei were both asleep.","It was all because of Immortal Master Waterheaven. Mengmeng and Zi Yan were both worried that if Immortal Master Waterheaven was tempted by Dahei or Little Hei, it would also be a problem. So they directly gave the two beasts a lot of medicinal pellets, the Exotic Beast meat stored in stock, and all kinds of gems suitable for Little Hei. They let the two guys run to the corner of the schoolbag and sleep.","At that time, Zhang Han also said that when these two guys woke up, they would probably be at the level of the Tribulation Stage.","Without the Treasure-sniffing nose, Zhang Han was more or less at a disadvantage when it came to treasure hunting. However, his keen perception of the secret realms and previous experience were still comparable to some Grand Masters from the Holy Lands.","Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “I wonder how many Grand Masters of the Holy Lands will come this time.”","“I don’t think many of them will come.” Immortal Master Wuluo made an analysis. “I haven’t heard of any Grand Master taking action. Most of them are in closed-door training. The core figures of the Holy Lands will lead their teams to the big secret realm.”","“When we enter the secret realm, remember that we have to stay together all the time. It will be convenient for us to evacuate as soon as possible when something wrong happens,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said seriously.","At this time, Yue Wuwei thought for a moment and said, “To tell you the truth, Zhang Hanyang is quite proficient in secret realms. It seems that he has obtained a lot of knowledge about the secret realms from the martial arts heritage he obtained before. Palace Master, I suggest that we should listen to him after entering the secret realm.”","Since they were going to work together, it might not be very effective to let Immortal Master Waterheaven lead the team, so Yue Wuwei said those words tactfully.","“Sure. Since you’re capable, you’ll take the lead, Hanyang.” Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded.","He was usually very easygoing.","However, Immortal Master Wuluo was a little cautious.","“It’s going to be a big fight this time. We should be careful and try not to argue with others. If necessary... I mean, if there is a powerful force that goes too far in bullying us, we can consider killing them. Remember, after we kill them, we must get rid of their pieces without leaving any trace. The Highest Clouds Palace can’t afford to mess with those forces.”","As soon as he said that, Yue Wuwei was shocked. “This is the first time that I’ve found out that you are a sinister person, Wuluo.”","“I’m not being sinister but careful.” Immortal Master Wuluo’s mouth trembled slightly.","“You ARE sinister by getting rid of those people’s pieces,” Mengmeng joked with a smile.","The atmosphere was very harmonious.","In addition to them, there were also dozens of core members sitting around, all of whom were elders of the Highest Clouds Palace.","Someone said with a smile, “We have never seen the Second Elder fight before. We’ll surely pay attention to that.”","“And Dragon King. It’s so powerful, but it hasn’t made a move yet.”","As soon as the man said that, Immortal Master Waterheaven’s expression changed. “By the way, don’t take the Dragon King out so easily. Do you hear me? The appearance of the ancient demonic beast will attract the attention of other forces. Let me put it this way – as long as it shows up, someone will definitely fight for it.”","What he said was quite exaggerated.","Zhang Han knew that in fact, not many people would fight for the ancient demonic beast raised by others.","For example, Immortal Master Lingxi had a Golden-winged Roc, which was also a Holy Beast among the ancient demonic beasts. Her strength was ranked among the first class. She was powerful and comparable to the Grand Masters of the Holy Lands. Although she didn’t rule a super sect, her status was not low.","Of course, there were many who were stronger than her. The reason why people didn’t rob her ancient demonic beast was that they might get into trouble if they couldn’t get it.","In most contracts where the ancient demonic beasts recognized their masters, if the host died, the ancient demonic beast might also perish. They had to live and die together.","After thinking for a while, Zhang Han said, “In fact, the ancient demonic beasts are not that rare. My wife also has one.”","“What?!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven widened his eyes and said in shock, “Your wife also has an ancient demonic beast? What kind of beast is it? Is it also a Holy Beast like Lil Beast?”","“Poof...” Immortal Master Wuluo spat out the tea.","The others were stunned and stared at Zhang Han.","Zi Yan smiled but didn’t say anything.","She knew that Zhang Han did this because he approved of Immortal Master Waterheaven and the Highest Clouds Palace. At the same time, it was also a warning to them, in case something happened in the secret realm and she summoned Tiny Tot, which might scare them.","Zhang Han smiled and said, “It’s a Holy Beast, but it’s always sleeping. She can summon it at a critical moment. As for what it is, you’ll see later.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled bitterly. “Hanyang, where did you get these ancient demonic beasts?”","“He’s so powerful to get them.”","Thinking of what Zhang Han had told him and the fact that the former knew the ancient demonic beasts, Immortal Master Waterheaven suddenly felt tempted.","“By chance.”","Zhang Han said, “One needs an opportunity to get an ancient demonic beast.”","“That’s right. It’s a great opportunity.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others nodded in agreement.","In this way, everyone chatted or ate some delicious food during the month’s journey. The atmosphere was very relaxed.","But as they got closer and closer to the secret realm, the tense atmosphere began to spread.","“Here we are, the big secret realm!”","In the dark starry sky, they could see part of the outline of the Eighth Mountain and the Ninth Mountain. In front of them was the inner ring of the Star Sea. In a large area ahead, there was a faint light flashing. It was sometimes purple, sometimes blue, sometimes pink, and so on. It was constantly changing colors. Sometimes, the colors presented were extremely beautiful.","“The secret realm is about the size of a district of the Star Sea’s outer ring.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven frowned slightly. “The area is not small. This is the largest secret realm in 80 years.”","“It’s okay,” Immortal Master Wuluo said. “If the area of the secret realm is ten times larger, the Grand Masters of those Holy Lands will definitely appear.”","“That’s right. A secret realm as bit as a district in the outer ring will probably not attract many Grand Masters from the Holy Lands.”","“The stable entrance is just ahead. Let’s head straight there,” said Immortal Master Waterheaven.","Yue Wuwei glanced at Zhang Han.","Seeing that Zhang Han was expressionless, he didn’t say anything.","Usually, Zhang Han thought outside of the box.","The spaceship entered the secondary space and arrived at the stable passage in the secret realm in three minutes. There were some temporary space stations around that place, surrounded by all kinds of fleets.","“That’s the Flora Holy Land’s fleet.”","“That’s the Reverseflow Holy Land’s fleet.”","“That’s the Octagonal Mountain Holy Land’s fleet.”","“There are also many fleets of super sects.”","There were more than 10 million fleets in the universe, all of which were high-end king vessels.","In the nearby area, the fleets of all kinds of Holy Lands and super sects were lined up neatly. The fleets of the first-rate forces outside were as majestic as rivers.","There were some forces that had only sent over one spaceship like the Highest Clouds Palace, and they could only park at the edge.","Immortal Master Wuluo said, “Let’s fly over.”","More than 30 people set off together and flew to the entrance of the secret realm.","They arrived at the stable entrance.","Tens of thousands of guards were scattered around. They were all dressed in neat black robes. Their leader was a ninth-tier Immortal Master.","When they saw Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others approaching, the captain of the guards took the initiative to greet them and cupped his hands.","“This large secret realm was discovered by the Demon Vanquishing Sect. If first-rate forces want to enter, each person has to pay 100 million crystal stones.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was speechless.","He really wanted to say, “Do I look like I have 100 million crystal stones to you?”","“I’m so poor, but the secret realm still charges people.”","“We’ll pay.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven took a deep breath and was about to take out the crystal stones.","“I’ll do it.”","Zhang Han smiled and directly paid more than three billion crystal stones.","Charging the visitors was not rare in the Star Sea. The real purpose was to limit the number of people who could enter the secret realm.","Immortal Master Waterheaven said seriously, “That’s not so appropriate, is it?”","But he withdrew his hand from his pocket.","“I’m poor recently. You’ll pay if you want.”","Zhang Han paid with the crystal stones.","“Just follow the passage and go straight in.","“Welcome to the icy world.","“Please enter.”","The squad leader cupped his hands with a smile.","Everyone entered.","“Hiss!”","“It’s so cold!”","Mengmeng gasped at once.","“It’s too cold.” Yue Xiaonao looked around and blinked.","Endless mountain ranges covered in snow surrounded them. Those mountains were of various shapes and sizes. Snowflakes were dancing in the sky, and the temperature made everyone feel cold.","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han raised his eyebrows slightly and said, “This is what happens right after we enter. This secret realm is quite interesting.”","The heavy snow made the sky gray. It was like there was a fog all over the sky. The visibility was only dozens of meters, and even Zhang Han could only sense the surroundings within 3,000 meters with his divine senses.","“Extreme Purity Immortal Body!”","Running his power a bit, Zhang Han revealed some of the abilities of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","“I’ll explore the way with my Immortal Sense.”","It was an occult art unleashed by the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","Swoosh!","The detection distance of 3,000 meters was directly extended to 60,000 meters.","“As expected of Immortal Techniques.","“The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure is definitely no match for the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","“However, the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure has much room to develop as well. Now that it has devoured so many treasure lands, there might be more changes when there is enough energy.”","Zhang Han thought to himself.","After all, he was powerful and had to compare his duplications.","“Put on more clothes.”","Zhang Han took out two black coats made of the fur of ancient demonic beasts.","He put one on Zi Yan and then put another one on Mengmeng. He was indeed considerate.","“Come on, put it on.”","Yue Wuwei also took out two coats and put them on Lisa and Yue Xiaonao.","“These coats...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven narrowed his eyes and said, “Are they made of the fur of ancient demonic beasts?”","At this time, a feeble voice came from behind Mengmeng.","“Uncle, Uncle Zhang, I can’t take it anymore. I’m about to freeze.”","The weak and poor boy Chen Chuan was the weakest. In such a harsh environment, he was quite dumbfounded when he came in. Now, his face was red and he seemed to be out of breath.","“Here.”","Zhang Han took out another coat, helped Chen Chuan put it on, and performed a body-warming skill.","A few seconds later, Chen Chuan also felt warm.","“These are good coats. Do you have more?” Immortal Master Wuluo didn’t stand on ceremony. “Get me one.”"]},{"number":1656,"title":"Chapter 1656 Unexpected","paragraphs":["Chapter 1656 Unexpected","“I’ve given them all out.”","Zhang Han laughed and said. “I only have three. Look! I even gave them to him.”","“Ah? Uncle Zhang, are you feeling cold?” Chen Chuan asked.","“No.” Zhang Han shook his head.","Immortal Master Wuluo joked and looked at the front. His eyes gradually became serious. “It’s not easy to break in here. My divine sense can only detect things within 2,000 meters.”","“Yes.” Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded. “At such a short distance, if there’s any danger, we won’t even have time to react.”","“We came in not early. Even if there is danger ahead, maybe the people who came in before have dealt with it,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","“Let’s go straight there.” Zhang Han said casually.","Zhang Han took the lead in flying forward.","Many elders looked at him.","It seemed the Second Elder didn’t respect the Palace Master at all. As soon as he entered the secret realm, he led the team to set off.","Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Wuluo looked at each other.","The two of them still didn’t believe in Zhang Han. However, the Second Elder had just joined the sect and hadn’t taken action before. He really needed a chance to show off.","However, they didn’t expect Zhang Han could detect the situation 60,000 meters ahead.","“Don’t fly too high. There’s Blade Qi Flowing Wind in the air.”","On the way, Zhang Han immediately led the team to fly lower.","“What is the level of the Blade Qi Flowing Wind?” Immortal Master Waterheaven’s expression changed slightly.","Its name showed it had strong power.","“It can kill those at the Early-Stage of the ninth tier,” Zhang Han said.","“Hiss!”","A gasp came from behind.","“Then let’s fly lower, close to the snow-capped mountain.”","Immortal Master Wuluo’s forehead was covered in cold sweat.","“Okay.” Zhang Han nodded.","After they flew lower again, they suddenly found more than a dozen bodies lying on the snow mountain below.","These bodies were covered with wounds.","“This is caused by the power of the Blade Qi Flowing Wind!”","“Their clothes should belong to the super sect, the Xuanfang Sect.”","“How terrifying it is!”","Everyone raised their heads and looked up at the sky. The snow was falling heavily, but there was killing intent hidden in it.","“It may not be safe on the ground. Be careful.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven solemnly said, “This is the periphery of the big secret realm, but it is already so dangerous, not to mention inside. We have to be careful about those things that appear secretly.”","In the past, when he, Immortal Master Hedun, and the others went to explore a secret realm, they encountered a terrifying existence that they couldn’t sense.","When some green strands of hair fluttered in the void, they would take away a single person in their squad. There was no way to defend at all. When Immortal Master Waterheaven thought of this thing, he was still afraid.","“Dad.”","Mengmeng quietly approached Zhang Han, blinked her big bright eyes, and looked around. “Why do I feel like someone is watching us?”","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han began to explore in all directions with his mind.","“It’s me.”","Right at this moment, Chen Chuan said from behind.","He covered himself tightly with his coat, exposing only his eyes and nose. He was staring at Mengmeng.","“Why are you always staring at me?” Mengmeng rolled her eyes.","“Sister Mengmeng, I’m scared. I always feel that I’m going to get separated and fall.” Chen Chuan swallowed his saliva.","As a weak cultivator, the gap between him and those in the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage was too big. The secret realm was too difficult for him to go through.","“Do you feel you will fall?”","Zhang Han looked down. Suddenly, his pupils shrank!","“Be quick to leave!”","“Shield of Overlapped Mountain.”","Zhang Han performed the supernatural power of occult art with his Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","The heavy snow below them was blown away. The snow on a mountain was only a few centimeters high. After it was blown away, they could see a huge, dark, and bottomless pit facing them.","It was as if they were flying above a bottomless pit.","The scene caused them to shudder.","Zhang Han used the Shield of Overlapped Mountain to absorb the spiritual Qi contained in a lot of mountain stones and form a shield.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Countless threads of light suddenly formed within the crater. The snowflakes within a range that could be seen condensed into a whirlpool that was continuously absorbed.","The horrible devouring power caused the expressions of everyone present to change again and again.","“Let’s go!”","Zhang Han cast supernatural power again.","“Kuangfeng!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven also launched an occult art.","A wind came from behind, pushing everyone forward quickly.","However, they didn’t expect the devouring power to increase sharply at the edge of the bottomless pit.","Zhang Han held Zi Yan and Mengmeng in his left and right hands, with Chen Chuan on his lap. He felt as if a big mountain was pressing down on him.","“This place is not ordinary.”","Zhang Han once again cast five kinds of supernatural power used for escaping.","In the end, they left the bottomless pit.","After everyone escaped, he looked back and saw a layer of snow slowly cover the bottomless pit. It was only a few centimeters. There seemed to be a snow mountain, but there was something horrible hidden in it.","“What exactly is that deep pit?”","“I was almost scared to death. If you hadn’t pulled me back just now, I would have been devoured.”","“If we had fallen in, we would have died.”","“I sensed it.” There were some geniuses on the team. “I think I saw a woman. She was pulling me.”","The person said it seriously.","The person who spoke was a fat man with small eyes. As he recalled, he said, “She seems to look the same as the Second Elder’s wife.”","“No. I also saw something. There was a sword at the entrance of the bottomless pit.”","“I saw ninth-tier spiritual herbs.”","These three people had just entered the ninth tier.","Their words seemed to be true.","After thinking about it, everyone understood what was going on.","Swoosh!","The fat man’s face turned red.","“This guy has a crush on Zi Yan.”","Zi Yan smiled. She was used to such things.","Zhang Han shook his head and said nothing. Since his rebirth, countless people had a crush on Zi Yan.","“Humph!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was unhappy. He frowned and said in an unfriendly tone, “Elder Bu, how could you think like that? Women are just beautiful skeletons. What are you thinking? When you return to the sect, face the wall for three years!”","“Okay.”","The fat elder cupped his hands with a red face.","“It’s indeed a little embarrassing. Second Elder, don’t take it to heart. Elder Bu is usually dull and reticent, but he’s a good person. What showed below is just what he likes and yearns for. It may not be about dirty things,” Immortal Master Wuluo comforted Zhang Han.","“It doesn’t matter,” Zhang Han said. “Everyone loves beauty. It’s okay to like her secretly. Don’t take action.”","It could be regarded as half a warning.","“Second Elder, I indeed like her, but I will not have any dirty thoughts.” Elder Bu cupped his hands and said.","“Let’s go on. I was really scared just now. I don’t know what this bottomless pit is.” Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed softly. “We have just gone forward for 15 minutes. This big secret realm may be beyond our imagination.”","“The bottomless pit contains the power of the cosmos. It seems to be a natural Cosmos Formation. It has the power of space. There may be an Alternate Space in it. It also may be a way to the Deadland in the big secret realm,” Zhang Han said. “We’d better not touch this kind of thing.”","“Let’s continue.” Immortal Master Waterheaven glanced at Chen Chuan and said, “It’s all thanks to this little guy. Do you still feel like you’re about to fall?”","Since Chen Chuan had been taken here by Zhang Hanyang, he thought Chen Chuan might have some extraordinary talent.","However, he overestimated Chen Chuan.","“Yes, I’m about to lose control of Uncle Zhang’s legs.”","Everyone was speechless.","They continued to set out and fly forward.","The heavy snow made them feel as if flying in a white world.","In addition to the extremely terrible crisis in the air, there were also many bottomless pits.","Each of them was not the same size.","The most dangerous one made Zhang Han feel numb in the scalp. More than half of the whole mountain range was covered with a bottomless pit.","It was a hundred times larger than the first one they had met. The pitch-black pit seemed to contain something terrifying.","The devouring power was so overwhelming that even the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure could not resist it.","“Ow!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast saved the team.","“Good heavens!”","After leaving the range, they rested for two minutes.","Immortal Master Waterheaven still had a lingering fear. “Fortunately, Xiaojin saved us. Otherwise, I would have fallen in. I clearly felt that there were many ancient demonic beasts waiting for me below just now. Even my divine sense couldn’t detect them. What’s the level of illusions?”","“Horror.” Immortal Master Wuluo was short of breath.","Yue Wuwei was also silent. He was a little scared.","Zhang Han exhaled a long breath and relaxed.","“This kind of pit is not friendly to the Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Human Clan. But it is not very useful to the ancient demonic beasts.”","“This is the benefit of raising an ancient demonic beast.” Immortal Master Waterheaven was envious again.","“Judging from the devouring power just now, many of the teams ahead must have been swallowed by it. No one knows if they are alive or not,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","“Let’s go.”","Zhang Han said, “We’ll meet bigger ones. With Xiaojin here, we’ll be safe.”","“Ha... Let’s go!”","Speaking of the ancient demonic beast, Immortal Master Waterheaven was in a good mood.","He praised from time to time, “Xiaojin is really powerful. I wonder if the ancient demonic beast you know is so powerful.”","He began to think about the ancient demonic beast that Zhang Han had mentioned.","After chatting for a while, everyone calmed down and looked around.","They had to care about safety in the secret realm.","“Are you afraid?” Zhang Han shook hands with Zi Yan and whispered.","“With you aside, I’m not afraid.” Zi Yan gently bit her lower lip. Just now, when she saw Zhang Han struggling, her heart did skip a beat.","She was not afraid of death, but she wanted to use her special ability to become the Sea Moon Fan after the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage and fight against the bottomless pit below.","She looked like a beauty. But in fact, she could be a goddess of war!","Don’t mess with her. She was fierce.","“Are you afraid?”","Zhang Han pinched the little hand of Mengmeng.","“I’m not afraid. I know Daddy has a way.” Mengmeng shook her head.","They continued to fly.","“I’m scared, Uncle Zhang.”","A few seconds later, Chen Chuan held Zhang Han’s thighs from behind and refused to let go.","“It’s suitable to temper your courage. Don’t be afraid.”","Zhang Han said in a flat tone, “You are a man.”","Zhang Han cared about Chen Chuan. He was just a junior. But Chen Chuan didn’t treat him the same as Zi Yan and Mengmeng.","Besides them, Yue Wuwei was also comforting Yue Xiaonao and Lisa.","Originally, Yue Wuwei was in a good mood when he was about to reach the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage. But after he came to this secret realm, he became dispirited and no longer had the demeanor of an immortal.","“What’s the meaning to be like an immortal? I almost died just now.”","The group continued to fly.","Unknowingly, they had been flying in this area for a month."]},{"number":1657,"title":"Chapter 1657 One More Person","paragraphs":["Chapter 1657 One More Person","“The periphery of the secret realm is so big,” Mengmeng said.","“Yes.”","Zhang Han nodded and said, “Maybe after flying for a few years, we can’t leave the periphery. It’s hard to say. The secret realm is a space with stable energy. There must be a supreme treasure to support such a huge secret realm. Let’s wait and see. Maybe a Profound-grade treasure will appear in this secret realm.”","“It’s a pity that there are too many Dao Seeking Cultivators entering here.”","Immortal Master Wuluo said, “There are more than 3,000 entrances around the big secret realm. Hundreds of thousands of the people of the first-rate forces from the seventh, eighth, and ninth mountains may come here. Even the people of the super sects may send more than 10,000 members here. The people from the holy lands may send hundreds or even thousands of members here. There are a lot of people and very few treasures. It will be very difficult for us to get the Profound-grade treasure.”","“It’s not impossible. We should always be hopeful about things.”","Yue Wuwei smiled.","In the past month, they had experienced more than a thousand bottomless pits, big and small.","They hadn’t run into another bottomless pit as big as the one where the Golden-armored Giant Beast saved them.","Gradually, Chen Chuan got used to it. He hugged Zhang Han by the thighs and looked down at the bottomless pit.","He shouted, “The hole looks like an eyeball.","“What are you looking at? Believe it or not, I’ll bury you when I grow up.”","“You seem to have grown up.” Mengmeng rolled her eyes at him and said, “If you keep making noise, don’t hug my Daddy’s legs.”","Hearing this, Chen Chuan immediately stopped shouting.","They had stayed in the secret realm for forty-five days.","The snow began to decrease.","It became clearer and clearer up ahead.","“We’re leaving the range of the snow mountains.”","“There might be other existences at the junction. Everyone, be careful.” Zhang Han said.","“Okay.” Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded.","These days, everyone, including Immortal Master Waterheaven, was used to Zhang Han leading the team.","Not only did they have to face the bottomless pits, but they also encountered all kinds of turbulence in the air more than 300 times. Every time, Zhang Han could find them in advance and lead them to dodge.","“Second Elder is really amazing.”","Immortal Master Wuluo often said so.","“I admire you, Hanyang. You have a great opportunity and superb means. You deserve to be recognized as Xiaojin’s host.” Immortal Master Waterheaven sometimes praised him.","The others’ thoughts also changed. They didn’t think Second Elder liked to show off, and they were used to being led by Second Elder.","They all admired him. If he hadn’t been here, more than half of them might have died in the biggest bottomless pit.","After they flew for two hours, the view in front of them suddenly became clear.","There were endless snow mountains behind them. They were endless as far as the eye could see. The mountains ahead were lush with greenery, and the trees and plants were full of vitality.","At the border of the two parts, there was a river. The surface of the water was calm, without any waves. It looked like a mirror.","However, they could see faint black ghosts in the river. Furthermore, the bottom of the water was clear, and there were many craters.","Seeing this, everyone present gasped.","“It turns out that the pits we passed by were all Deadlands. The people swallowed turned into ghosts in the water and rested here forever.”","“Don’t underestimate them. They may also have offensive power.” Zhang Han narrowed his eyes and said, “Cover all our auras and cross the river.”","“Should we fly higher?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven hesitated and said, “The souls under the river may all be eighth-tier or ninth-tier Tribulation Stage Dao Seeking Cultivators. There are thousands of them in this area. If they attack together, it may be troublesome.”","“Is it safe to fly high?” Zhang Han looked up at the sky. There were no clouds for thousands of kilometers. There was even a sun in front of him. The sun was shining, and everything was full of vitality. Zhang Han said, “It’s better to face the known crisis than to face the unknown.”","“Wait! There are some people on the side.”","Immortal Master Wuluo suddenly spoke.","In the distance on their left, there were thousands of people dressed neatly in cyan gowns.","They stood beside the snow mountain on the other side of the river and hesitated.","They sent out two teams. Each of them consisted of 10 people. One team advanced high in the sky, and the other flew above the river at a low altitude.","“There doesn’t seem to be any danger.”","“They have crossed more than half of the river.”","Zhang Han and the others were observing.","Suddenly, a gentle breeze blew over.","Buzz!","The group of ten people in the sky danced gracefully. No one knew what they had seen, but they all looked satisfied.","Then, their bodies began to wither at a visible speed, like withered flowers. Then they turned into withered bones and fell into the water without causing any waves.","The river water was not ordinary either.","After the withered bones fell, countless ghosts in the river roared like fish that had jumped out of the water and devoured all the people in the air quickly.","The two teams were all killed.","They didn’t even have time to resist.","“There is really something strange in the sky.” Immortal Master Waterheaven touched his forehead. “Oh, my god! What is this place? This is definitely not an ordinary big secret realm.”","The people on the other side fell silent. How could they cross the river in the face of such a situation?","They took out a lot of spirit treasures, simulated the breath of Dao Seeking Cultivators, and threw them forward.","The ghosts in the river would still appear and tear them apart.","They took out some more treasures, hid their auras, and threw them over.","However, they were still torn apart.","“Hiding our auras is still not useful.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “Can we only charge in?”","“Kill!”","An earth-shattering roar came from the side. Nearly a thousand people formed a battle formation and crossed the river at a low altitude. Dozens of people died, and the others successfully crossed the river.","“What should we do?” Immortal Master Wuluo asked.","Unknowingly, they began to pay attention to Second Elder’s thoughts.","It seemed that he always had a way to deal with such situations.","Immortal Master Waterheaven had completely stabilized his status as a subordinate assistant.","In the face of everyone’s gaze, Zhang Han was silent for a while and finally said, “Let’s go through it.”","“Dragon King’s defense is strong. It’s useless even if they chew on it.”","Zhang Han summoned the duplication of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","It didn’t grow too big. It was about 50 meters long, and everyone was flying on its back to defend.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast flew over casually.","Clatter!","Many ghosts in the river rushed up and bit the feet and belly of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“It’s like scratching an itch.”","Zhang Han curled his lips. He looked expressionless. Actually, he was also vigilant about his surroundings.","He was still wary of whether the ghosts would fly up to them or not.","Fortunately, such a thing didn’t happen.","They crossed the river smoothly.","After they came to the other side, the situation became a little strange.","“There seems to be some fragrance in the air,” Mengmeng muttered.","“Hold your breath. Don’t breathe the air here.” Zhang Han suddenly spoke.","Everyone immediately held their breath and stared at the scenes around them.","The mountain range was endless. The flowers, plants, and trees were also beautiful.","Zhang Han made an incantation gesture with his right hand.","His eyes flickered with cyan light. Suddenly, he frowned slightly.","“As expected, there is a natural formation here.”","“Another natural formation?” Immortal Master Wuluo’s face changed. “What should we pay attention to?”","“I can’t sense anything at all. It’s too strange.” Immortal Master Waterheaven felt a little dizzy.","“Why does the Second Elder always sense danger, but I’m like a novice in the secret realm?”","“If your perception of the array of formations is sharp enough, you can feel it,” Zhang Han said.","“I seem to have sensed a little of the aura of the illusory formation,” an elder proficient in the array of formations behind him said in an uncertain tone.","“It’s mainly an illusionary formation. But we don’t know exactly what it is or if it has changed. Be careful.”","Zhang Han stretched out his right hand, and some high-level Formation Flags appeared, surrounding the team. The special energy began to draw a Heaven-earth Formation.","“Each of you, give it one drop of blood essence,” Zhang Han said.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Everyone’s blood essence gathered together to form a round blood-colored energy body. When the energy body exploded, some threads connected everyone together.","“This is the team’s heart mark. We can sense everyone’s situation with it. After entering the illusion, don’t panic. Hold the thread and follow the team automatically,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay.” Everyone responded.","They flew at a low altitude of hundreds of meters in the forest.","“It’s a natural illusory formation. It’s said to be very terrible and rare,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said. “I’ve only encountered it once in thousands of years in the secret realms. I was immersed in the illusory formation for fifty years before I woke up and fled because someone accidentally entered it.”","“That’s just a simple illusionary formation. If there is a killing formation mixed with it, it is the most terrible thing. It’s hard to guard against it,” Zhang Han said.","“The scenery here is very beautiful. It doesn’t seem to be dangerous. However, the reality is often different,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","They chatted as they walked forward.","“Huh?”","“Why is it suddenly late at night?”","After the sunset, a small moon rose up. The surroundings became dark. The faint light caused the area to be filled with a tranquil atmosphere.","For some reason, there was a faint mist in the forest.","“It is strange.”","When they passed by a pile of rubble on the top of the mountain, Immortal Master Wuluo said, “The moon is above, but we can’t see any shadow.”","“There’s no shadow.”","“Maybe it’s because of the faint mist down there.”","Everyone’s tone was relaxed.","The next moment, Elder Bu, the fat man who liked Zi Yan, said in a trembling voice. “Wait!”","Swoosh!","Many people looked over.","His face was pale.","“When we came here, there were a total of 36 people. But now, I’ve checked seven times. Our team has 37 people now.”","“Hiss!”","“What?”","Everyone’s expressions changed drastically.","When did a person sneak into the team?","Who was the extra person?","They were surrounded by an energy layer.","The person had come so easily. If the person took action, they would be in great danger.","“One, two, three...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven immediately counted. After looking around, his face turned dark. “It really is thirty-seven people. Who is this extra person? Why can’t I remember?”","These elders were all on his side, but he had completely forgotten who had come.","“Dad, I’m scared.”","Mengmeng was slightly surprised. She didn’t like such kind of weird and unpredictable things."]},{"number":1658,"title":"Chapter 1658 The Secret Realm Underestimated","paragraphs":["Chapter 1658 The Secret Realm Underestimated","Zhang Han grabbed Zi Yan and Mengmeng by the hand and said calmly, “Don’t be afraid. It’s just a trick.”","He knew a kind of supernatural power.","It was called the Shadow of Light.","It could penetrate all illusions and find all gloomy creatures.","That was the power displayed by the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","With the Supreme Purity Immortal Body, even if there was any spirituality or something revealed by the rules of the Great Domain around, it could be seen through.","With the Great Demon’s Figure, the language of the witch creatures could be apprehended.","It was of no use to use the Thunder Body to activate the technique.","It was not useful even if he used the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","His three duplications could do many things.","Therefore, Zhang Han used the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Supreme Purity Immortal Body, and the Great Demon’s Figure to activate the Shadow of Light.","“Come out!”","A white energy ball, a light black energy ball, and a green energy ball gathered together and illuminated their surroundings.","A figure with a smile slowly dissipated in the crowd.","At the same time, they could see many floating objects in all directions.","They wagged their tails and stared at the crowd like goldfish.","“They turn out to be Wizard Spirit Goldfishes.”","“The ninth-tier Wizard Spirit Goldfish is an attributeless soul between the Yin soul and the Yang soul.”","“Be quick catch them!”","Zhang Han was surprised, and his eyes lit up.","Everyone could clearly see the surroundings now. All the mist around them dissipated under the light.","“How to catch them?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven had never seen such a thing before. He asked, “What is the Wizard Spirit Goldfish?”","“It’s the main ingredient for rare medicinal pellets.”","Zhang Han said, “Use the method of dealing with souls to trap them. I’ll extract them.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others all launched various moves. Some of them had amazing auras, and some were silent. All the people in the ninth-tier Tribulation showed their supernatural power.","Zhang Han kept collecting the essence energy of the Wizard Spirit Goldfishes. These special things were valuable.","After a while, after hundreds of Wizard Spirit Goldfishes in the surroundings were killed, they set out again.","“We have passed many snow-capped mountains before. What will happen here? Judging from the intensity of the spiritual Qi, we’re still in the peripheral area,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","“Yes.”","Immortal Master Wuluo looked around cautiously and said, “The strange thing just now made me a little scared. The outer area is already so powerful. I’m afraid it will be even stranger if we go deeper into the secret realm.”","“There are both risks and opportunities,” Yue Wuwei said. “The more dangerous the place is, the more treasures there will be.”","“Although the treasures are good, our lives are more important,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said softly. “Last time, you said the Second Elder, Hanyang, had experienced a lot in the secret realms. Oh, no. You said he had obtained the martial arts heritage of predecessors of the secret realms. At first, I didn’t take your words seriously and didn’t even believe it. I have lived for so many years and have seen countless things. But I didn’t expect Hanyang’s understanding of the secret realms to be above that of us. It’s amazing. I underestimated you before.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was honest. He also had that kind of personality charm, so he made Zhang Han an elder in the Highest Clouds Palace.","It was not easy to get his approval.","“Yeah.”","Immortal Master Wuluo smiled and said, ” Hanyang, you’re the best among us in this secret realm now. You’re in the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage, aren’t you? When you reach the ninth tier, there will be countless places in the world that you can explore. Ha...”","“I didn’t say I was eighth-tier.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly. “Sometimes, I can’t even understand my realm myself.”","He felt that they must use some means to deal with this secret realm. It was too exaggerated for a Peak-Stage seventh-tier cultivator to defeat Middle-Stage or Early-Stage cultivators of the ninth tier. It was better not to make them worry.","“Let’s continue.”","Zhang Han said, “According to the difficulties we encountered along the way, maybe we will encounter a unique crisis in this area next. Be careful and listen to my instructions.”","When Zhang Han used his Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, his divine sense could detect much further away than those of the Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others.","It was also the fastest way to find something unusual.","“The night here looks a little romantic, but it’s a pity that there are dangers lurking around,” Immortal Master Wuluo said regretfully. “Otherwise, we could enjoy the moon and have a good drink together.”","“We are in a big secret realm, but you are still thinking about drinking.” Immortal Master Waterheaven shook his head.","“My Grandpa also likes to drink. He likes drinking very much.” Mengmeng blinked and said, “If you have time, Immortal Master Wuluo can drink with my Grandpa in the future.”","“Of course. May I know who your Grandpa is?” Immortal Master Wuluo’s expression changed.","“Since Zhang Hanyang is so powerful, his father must be even stronger.”","“My Grandpa is my Grandpa,” Mengmeng said in confusion. “Oh, I see. His name is Zhang Guangyou. His Taoist title is lord of battle. He is undefeated in all battles. And I have a Great-Grandpa who also likes drinking. He is called Immortal King Zhang.”","“Hiss!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven gasped and said, “The lord of battle. Immortal King Zhang. Hanyang, are you from a Holy Land?”","The expressions of the others changed after hearing his words.","“No.”","Zhang Han was amused. After he explained, his face suddenly changed.","“Be quick to fly lower. Go to the forest to find cracks in the boulders. Hurry up!”","“What?” No one understood what was going on.","At this time, Zhang Han had led the team to fly down quickly. In several seconds, he found a crack in the stones in a canyon. It was about 20 square meters. Then he took out all kinds of Formation Flags and displayed the Heaven-earth Formation in three seconds.","“Everyone, follow the Formation Flags and activate the defensive layer with all your strength to defend at the same time,” Zhang Han said.","The group of people moved.","At this time, they also felt the horror approaching quickly from a distance.","A black wind was whistling, covering the sky and the sun like dark clouds. There seemed to be some creature of Yin soul roaring in the wind. It was constantly surging.","In terms of terror, the black wind was even more terrifying than the tribulation clouds.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The wind blew the light golden energy layer that everyone made at the same time.","It could be seen that many black hands were pulling the defensive layer as if they wanted to break through it and drag everyone inside out.","“What’s this?” Mengmeng was shocked.","“I’m scared.” Chen Chuan was uncertain and flustered.","“This is a strange wind.” Zhang Han looked at it and said, “The strange wind contains all kinds of special powers. The hands exposed by the black wind are one of its attacking moves.”","Pairs of hands were pulling. But with the wind, they were constantly passing by. From a visual point of view, it seemed that there were many people waiting in line outside, and each of them had to pat on the defensive layer a few times.","“It turns out to be a strange wind. My god.” Immortal Master Waterheaven covered his forehead and sighed. “The strange wind is very horrible, and it can produce a strange wind zone. It means that there is not only the black strange wind here but also many other kinds. It seems that after we passed the zone of snow mountains, we stepped into the strange wind zone.”","“That’s right,” Immortal Master Wuluo said. “It’s not easy to break into the strange wind zone, especially when the wind comes. We can only hide from it. Otherwise, we’ll die easily. This kind of wind may blow for a long time. If it blows for several years, we can only cultivate in seclusion here.”","“What?”","Yue Xiaonao was shocked. “Can it blow for so long?”","“It’s horrible to live in this small circle for so many years. In that way, I have to cultivate in seclusion to get through the period of time.”","“I’m not sure.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment and said, “I don’t think the strange wind will blow for a long time. Maybe it will stop after a few hours. Anyway, this is the periphery of a big secret realm. The scale of the strange wind is not big.”","“A few hours is the best.” Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded solemnly. “Next, let’s follow the Second Elder’s instructions.”","He was convinced. At first, when he detected the strange black wind, he didn’t feel that it was the strange wind. After observing for a while, he confirmed it.","Slap! Slap! Slap!","Countless hands were slapping and dissipating.","They felt the next three hours like a year.","The strange black wind had blown past.","It was dawn outside now!","The surroundings were full of vitality but had no chirping of birds or insects. It was strangely quiet.","“Let’s go forward.”","Zhang Han glanced around and led the team forward.","Three days later, a second strange wind appeared. It was red, accompanied by many blade lights. Each blade hit the defensive layer. Even the ground was cracked by the blade lights.","It was strange after the countless cracks on the ground returned to normal quickly after the strange red wind went away.","“Interesting.”","Seeing this, Zhang Han suddenly smiled and said, “Just wait and see. This place is definitely a big secret realm that has been underestimated. It’s a big secret realm rarely seen in thousands of years!”","“Really?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others rubbed their foreheads, feeling a headache coming on.","Immortal Master Wuluo said, “Doesn’t it mean that it’s a little difficult for us to explore the secret realm with our strength?”","“Our strength is enough.”","Zhang Han smiled and said, “If we meet anything we can’t deal with, we just need to dodge. The strange wind is an example. Relatively speaking, what we have experienced is not bad. This kind of big secret realm is rare, but it is not very dangerous here.”","His words made everyone a little relieved.","They continued to move forward.","Two days later, another gust of strange wind blew.","After dodging for a few hours, they set foot on the journey again. They met such things several more times","They had spent a month exploring the area of the snow mountains, but they didn’t expect it would take them two months to get out of the strange wind zone.","There was a strange big river ahead, but it had more souls inside than the last river they met.","“What’s up ahead? Clouds burning? A world of flames?”","In front of them, the rocks of the mountains were all red, and there were a few withered trees. It seemed that the whole world was on fire. The sky was covered with fiery red clouds. They stretched up from the ground and illuminated the world.","“The Sky of Fires and Clouds!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed softly, “Such a strange thing can only be seen in some secret realms. The view from a distance is beautiful, but we don’t know what is hidden inside.”","“Let’s rest for two hours before crossing the river,” Zhang Han said.","They found a peak and sat cross-legged to rest.","Zhang Han took out pots, bowls, pans, and other things used to cook in the secret realm.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They began to cook.","Seeing this, Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and the others all had strange looks."]},{"number":1659,"title":"Chapter 1659 Holy Thunder Sect","paragraphs":["Chapter 1659 Holy Thunder Sect","“Second Elder, are you going to cook by yourself?”","“Dao Seeking Cultivators don’t need to eat this. Is this Second Elder’s hobby?”","“Ha... The Second Elder is good at enjoying life.”","Everyone discussed with each other for a while.","Zhang Han smiled and said, “I like to cook for my wife and child.”","“Can we have a free meal?” Immortal Master Wuluo asked, “I’ll help you cook.”","“I’ll give you a pot. You can cook with it.”","Zhang Han took a pot and a lot of ingredients.","Immortal Master Wuluo also cooked happily.","They could see the Sky of Fires and Clouds on one side and the strange wind on the other side in the big secret realm. They seemed to be eating at the end of the world.","Everyone felt much more relaxed.","“Let’s have a drink. It won’t delay anything,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","“Then let’s drink two cups each. We can’t drink too much.” Immortal Master Waterheaven made an exception.","When they explored the secret realms in the past, he had never allowed his subordinates to drink.","“Okay! Two cups are enough.” Immortal Master Wuluo smiled.","They took out the treasured liquor and began to drink.","An hour later, they saw a large group of nearly 10,000 people in the distance on one side. They built a bridge above the surface of the water in a mighty manner and crossed the bridge steadily.","“This method is not bad.”","“Even if I don’t look at them, I know they must be from a super sect or holy land.”","They chatted for a while.","After eating and drinking, they rested for a while.","“Let’s go.”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared, and they steadily crossed the river.","They arrived at the zone of the Sky of Fires and Clouds.","“It’s so hot.”","Chen Chuan was the first to feel hot and dry. He gave Zhang Han his coat and said, ” Uncle Zhang, this is your coat.”","“Okay.”","After putting it away, Zhang Han continued to observe his surroundings.","“It seems that the temperature on the ground is very high. There are red clouds everywhere in the air. There is a cluster of red clouds every few dozen meters. Is there any horrible thing in the red clouds?” Immortal Master Wuluo frowned and said, “I haven’t felt anything from a distance, but I am anxious.”","“Dad, I can’t feel hot here,” Mengmeng said in a low voice. “Is my Profound Underworld Holy Fire quite powerful here?”","Hearing this, Zhang Han was slightly moved. After thinking for two seconds, he used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique to say, “Yes. I think you are the key person to pass through this area.”","Mengmeng said with a smile, “If you need my help, just tell me. I will do a good job.”","Zhang Han smiled.","Zi Yan also smiled.","Judging from their expressions, it was obvious that the father and daughter were chatting with each other through the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","No one knew what they were talking about.","“Let’s go five kilometers to the left. Someone is leading the way ahead. Let’s see if they will encounter anything strange.” Zhang Han said.","He planned to follow them.","Zhang Han and his team sneaked over and flew hundreds of meters above the ground.","Half an hour later, they saw something special.","There was a battlefield in the air ahead.","The group with ten thousand people formed six military formations. They were dealing with something semi-transparent and like a small Golden-armored Giant Beast.","Seeing this, Immortal Master Waterheaven suddenly said, “It is the Fire Spirit of the Devil Calamity! It is highly toxic. Anyone who touches it will be poisoned in the Divine Soul. It usually nibbles away people’s spiritual will. It likes tribulation lightning. When going through a Tribulation Stage, it will break out. Every Dao Seeking Cultivator infected with the Fire Spirit of the Devil Calamity will not be able to pass any Tribulation Stage from then on.”","“You’re right.” Zhang Han nodded his head.","It was the first time he had seen this kind of thing. He had only seen it in ancient books before.","He took out some supreme-grade crystal stones and scattered them. Then, the Heaven-earth Formation appeared.","“Mengmeng, use your flames to activate the formation.”","“Okay!” Mengmeng responded with a smile.","Mengmeng eyes flashed with a white light.","The Profound Underworld Holy Fire appeared.","A pale white wave of fire enveloped them.","“Is it an Alien Fire?”","As a well-informed man, Immortal Master Waterheaven sensed its aura. After looking at it for a while, he suddenly said, “No. This is the Alien Fire of the second level, the Profound Underworld Holy Fire. Why do you have this kind of treasure?”","“Did you see that?”","Zhang Han touched the head of Mengmeng and said, “It has been discovered. Next time you use it, don’t forget to change its aura a little so that others won’t be able to know it’s the Profound Underworld Holy Fire.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was speechless.","“Okay! I got it.” Mengmeng blinked, controlled the Profound Underworld Holy Fire, and changed its aura. Sure enough, no one could detect anything.","“It is easy for us to pass through this trial.” Zhang Han smiled.","“Yes. It’s wonderful.” Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled and said, “With the Profound Underworld Holy Fire, this place is very good for Mengmeng. There are seven colors of the Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity, including red, yellow, blue, cyan, green, black, and white. Six kinds of them are poisonous. Only the cyan Fire Spirit of the Devil Calamity is a great tonic for a Dao Seeking Cultivator cultivating fires. If there are seven kinds of Fire Spirits in this area, we can break some of them and let her absorb them to enhance the energy control of the Profound Underworld Holy Fire.”","“How do we know which cloud has a Fire Spirit?” Immortal Master Wuluo asked.","The others were also curious. Many of them didn’t know about the Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity.","“It’s very easy. They are very sensitive to sound. Now, there is a formation formed by the Profound Underworld Holy Fire. They can’t discover us. Even if they can, they will not attack. The Profound Underworld Holy Fire is stronger than these Fire Spirits. We can make some noise every once in a while to find out if there are any of them around,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","“Let’s go.”","Immortal Master Wuluo didn’t expect that the secret realm could be crossed in this way.","There had been a lot of crises since the area of snow mountains, but their team was safe and sound, and no one was injured. This experience was very wonderful.","Immortal Master Waterheaven relaxed.","The team moved to the side for half an hour and moved forward.","They traversed the various clouds for three days.","They had thought that this area was filled with red clouds containing different kinds of Fire Spirits. However, they didn’t expect there to be only one kind.","Soon, they encountered black clouds.","Clouds of various sizes filled the area.","Every time they made a sound, it might draw out a few Fire Spirits from the distant clouds.","Sometimes, there would be more or no. Not every cloud had a Fire Spirit.","After getting through the black clouds, they met white, yellow, and green clouds. Finally, after ten days, they reached the range of the cyan clouds.","“This is it.”","The cyan Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity was a great tonic for the Dao Seeking Cultivator cultivating fires. However, its individual power was also very high.","“Make some noise.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","All of his subordinates began to take action.","All kinds of shouts spread in all directions.","Suddenly, someone sang a popular song in a loud voice.","They turned around and saw that it was Chen Chuan.","“There are no Fire Spirits nearby.”","They advanced for six hours.","Suddenly, they felt an earth-shattering aura.","“Some people are fighting.”","“I feel that the number of cyan Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity should not be low.”","“Let’s go over.”","They set off for the place where the fluctuation came.","It was on the ground. The mountain range under the cyan clouds was covered with grass. It was in a valley.","There were thousands of cyan Fire Spirits in the surroundings. They were close to the ground and roared, emitting unique soundwave attacks.","There was a Heaven-earth Formation in the valley, and more than a dozen people were guarding. Judging from their expressions, they had been fighting for a long time.","“Wait for an opportunity to break out.”","The middle-aged man in the lead had a gloomy face.","These people were all dressed in black, and there were lightning seals on both sides of their chests.","“The Holy Thunder Sect?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven narrowed his eyes slightly and said, “Judging from their clothes, they are from the Holy Thunder Sect. It’s a super sect. The Holy Thunder Sect is proficient in the Thunder Control Technique. It is extremely profound. There are many disciples in the sect, but I have no impression of the leader.”","“He seems to be the elder of the Holy Thunder Sect, Immortal Master Sanlei.”","One of his subordinates behind him said, “I’ve seen him once before. It’s indeed him, Immortal Master Sanlei.”","“Immortal Master Sanlei?”","Immortal Master Wuluo suddenly thought of something and said. “It turns out to be him. It’s said that his strongest supernatural power is to control three thunder balls, each of which is unpredictable and profound. Therefore, he is called Sanlei. He is well-known all over the world. His strength is equivalent to that of a Middle-Stage cultivator in the ninth tier. He can’t be underestimated. His Thunder Control Technique is very powerful.”","“Should we help them?” Immortal Master Wuluo asked.","“There are more than 5,000 cyan Fire Spirits here, each of which is equivalent to a ninth-tier Early-Stage cultivator. They are difficult to deal with,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said. “We can fight them one by one. With a layer of energy from the Heaven-earth Formation, we can pull Fire Spirits in one by one and destroy them. It’s the only way.”","After thinking about it, Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “Since we’ve run into them and we need cyan Fire Spirits, let’s help them eliminate a few hundred Fire Spirits. That should be enough to resolve their crisis.”","Sometimes, his style of doing things was similar to that of Zhang Mu.","“Then let’s begin.” Zhang Han nodded.","Surrounded by the Profound Underworld Holy Fire, the crowd slowly approached. Zhang Han controlled the Heaven-earth Formation to widen the distance between them.","They approached a cyan Fire Spirit at the outermost region.","“Pull it in!”","“Kill!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others all took action.","They pulled it in and destroyed it after a round of attacks. A pale cyan light, about the size of a fist, floated in the air.","“Absorb it as soon as possible, or it will dissipate in a few seconds,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng immediately absorbed it into her palm.","“It’s so cool.”","Mengmeng eyes lit up slightly. Absorbing this kind of essential energy made her feel comfortable. She felt as if she were bathing in a spring breeze.","At the same time, her sense of control over the Profound Underworld Holy Fire increased slightly.","Zhang Han controlled the Heaven-earth Formation, Mengmeng set the fire to assist him, and the others destroyed Fire Spirits.","They performed steadily.","One, two, three...","In just a dozen minutes, they had killed more than a dozen Fire Spirits, about one minute per Fire Spirit on average.","Time was mainly wasted on the process of pulling the Fire Spirits in.","They had to wait for more than ten seconds to take action.","“They noticed us.” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Everyone looked over. The people led by Immortal Master Sanlei on the ground were also looking over.","Although the Heaven-earth Formation could block the perception of the Fire Spirits, it did not escape the eyes of these people.","“They can quickly eliminate the Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s character graphic was released yesterday, and the three character graphics of Yue Xiaonao were released today. They were all in line with their images."]},{"number":1660,"title":"Chapter 1660 A Trap","paragraphs":["Chapter 1660 A Trap","“Ha... We have a chance to be saved!”","“Elder, I heard that the Dao Seeking Cultivators cultivating fires can absorb the cyan Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity. Are they absorbing the Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity?”","The subordinates used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique to talk to Immortal Master Sanlei.","“I know that man in cyan is Immortal Master Waterheaven, the Sect Leader of the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Sanlei narrowed his eyes slightly. “It turns out to be the small force of the Highest Clouds Palace. How could they have a way to deal with the Fire Spirits?”","“Elder, could it be that they want to use us to lure the Fire Spirits in so that they can secretly gain benefits from outside?” Someone analyzed.","“There’s no need to talk about it.”","Immortal Master Sanlei slightly raised his eyebrows. “Let’s escape first. Since they like to deal with Fire Spirits, let them do.”","After using the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, Immortal Master Sanlei looked up and suddenly said, “Immortal Master Waterheaven, are you here to help us? Or are you here to find Fire Spirits?”","After a moment of silence, Immortal Master Waterheaven replied with the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “We passed by and saw that you were trapped here. It is just a piece of cake.”","Immortal Master Sanlei laughed and suddenly stretched out his right hand. “Since you like to extinguish the Fire Spirits, I’ll give this place to you.”","Clatter!","A light breeze blew.","Immortal Master Sanlei controlled a formation and turned it into rays of light. With all kinds of cries, the light covered the energy layer around Zhang Han and the others.","Sizzling!","There was no response from the surrounding Fire Spirits, but the energy of Zhang Han’s Heaven-earth Formation was no longer stable.","The Fire Spirits could sense the auras of the Dao Seeking Cultivator of the Human Clan accompanied by their sounds.","“Thunder Breaking the Sky!”","A thunder ball appeared, exploded, and turned into a killing formation.","Seeing this, Zhang Han frowned. He took out dozens of kinds of spirit treasures, made a signet with his left hand, and launched a Heaven-earth Formation to resist.","Unexpectedly, the killing formation launched by Immortal Master Sanlei was powerful and even gathered the strength of his team. Even if Zhang Han reacted, his formation was still cut open.","In just three seconds, the gap closed.","However, the Fire Spirits sensed their auras.","The bell that had covered the surroundings of the big formation rang.","Clatter!","More than a thousand Fire Spirits immediately surrounded him and kept launching attacks.","Immortal Master Sanlei seized the opportunity to use their supernatural power to force a way out. After escaping from the encirclement, he looked back with a smile.","“Is this the way how the Holy Thunder Sect does things?” Immortal Master Waterheaven’s expression turned dark.","He didn’t expect to be set up.","Zhang Han was expressionless and looked into the distance calmly.","This kind of trick often happened in the Star Sea.","He thought it was normal, but it didn’t mean that he liked to be tricked.","“There is no need for me to explain things to you.”","Immortal Master Sanlei sneered and looked a little cold. “Besides, do you think your Highest Clouds Palace is qualified to ask about the Holy Thunder Sect?”","“Are you openly trying to frame us?” Immortal Master Waterheaven had a hideous look.","It seemed he really wanted to go over and fought the other party.","Immortal Master Sanlei laughed loudly. “How can this be called a trap? I saw that you like cyan Fire Spirits. There may be a Dao Seeking Cultivator cultivating fires in your team. I kindly gave you the Fire Spirits, but you didn’t appreciate it and bit back like a dog. You really don’t know what’s good for you. Highest Clouds Palace? Immortal Master Waterheaven?”","While speaking, he raised a finger. Seeing that some Fire Spirits were approaching, he began to retreat and sneered, “Don’t let me see you again. Otherwise, I will demand an explanation for what you did to my Holy Thunder Sect.”","The people beside him looked disdainful.","Someone said, “Highest Clouds Palace only has many branches. You have no strength. You can only rely on your humble attitude and a bit of connection to make a living. Who gave you the confidence to question Elder Sanlei?","“Don’t you know how big the gap is between our statuses?","“I advise you to leave now. If you let us meet you again, a few of you will die.”","Immortal Master Wuluo couldn’t bear to listen any longer, and he shouted in a grim voice. “The heavens are watching you. Immortal Master Sanlei, I thought you were an upright man. I didn’t expect you to be such a cunning villain!”","“Who do you think you are?” Immortal Master Sanlei said while retreating in the distance, “If I meet you next time, I will kill you.”","“Ha... If you dare to follow us, we’ll kill all the men and treat the women as toys.”","Several of his men echoed one after another, “I’m afraid that they can’t even withstand these thousands of Fire Spirits. Thank you for helping us attract the firepower.”","At this time, Zhang Han was controlling the Heaven-earth Formation with all his strength. He frowned slightly and looked forward.","Those people swaggered off after uttering some words.","“They are so despicable!”","Yue Wuwei was so angry that his face turned ferocious.","This guy had been in the top class of strength in the Sea Dragon Star Area, the Heavenly Dragon Star Province, the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven, and even the Silver Dragon Galaxy. He was the kind of hidden big shot who looked down on the world. After coming to the Star Sea, he suffered some blows to his mentality over the years. However, when he heard the other party mock them, he lost his temper.","“We should find a way to kill the person,” Yue Wuwei gritted his teeth and said.","“We wanted to rescue them, but it turned out to be a trap,” Mengmeng said unhappily.","“The Star Sea is so big. There are all kinds of people in it.” Zhang Han looked calm as he restored the stability of the Heaven-earth Formation. Then he said, “We can meet kind-hearted people like you, Palace Master, and we can also meet cunning people like Immortal Master Sanlei. Since they belong to a super sect, we will have a chance to deal with them in the future.”","He bore a grudge.","Zi Yan pursed her lips and agreed with Zhang Han in her heart.","“What should we do now?”","Immortal Master Wuluo took a deep breath and said, “We are surrounded by the Fire Spirits. They know we are here. They are still attacking the Heaven-earth Formation, trying to find our auras.”","“Just kill them.”","Zhang Han said, “Mengmeng, go all out to use the Profound Underworld Holy Fire.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng tried her best.","Clatter!","The might of the Profound Underworld Holy Fire covered the heavens and the earth.","The surrounding cyan Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity felt a little dizzy.","“What kind of fire is this?","“It seems to be purer than ours?","“I’m so scared.”","Clatter!","These Fire Spirits didn’t have any intelligence. They only possessed innate fear and drifted toward the surroundings.","In just two minutes, these Fire Spirits had forgotten what they were about to attack and could no longer feel the auras of the Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Human Clan.","“Let’s begin!”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","“Go!”","Immortal Master Wuluo organized. Every time a Fire Spirit was pulled in, they would attack together.","“Kill it!”","“Go!”","Yue Wuwei could not help but think, “What a group of cute people!”","In this way, it took them three days to deal with these Fire Spirits. After Mengmeng absorbed the thousands of Fire Spirits, she became more proficient in the control of the Profound Underworld Holy Fire. It was as if she had integrated the Profound Underworld Holy Fire into her body. Now, she could make moves with it easily.","“Daddy, I didn’t feel any specific benefits,” Mengmeng asked.","“It’s very beneficial to you.” Zhang Han said with a smile, “It’s good for some of your future situations. For example, the Profound Underworld Holy Fire will grow to the first level of the Alien Fires.”","“Hiss!”","Hearing this, Immortal Master Waterheaven gasped and said, “Hanyang, you really dare to think about it. It’s rare to hear of Alien Fires at the first level in tens of thousands of years. Some people almost died when they met one, and few of them survived. The Alien Fire at the first level is almost Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. It’s like the attributed tribulation lightning. It’s too terrible.”","“It’s always good to have dreams,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","“But dreams have to come close to reality.” Immortal Master Waterheaven shook his head.","“What if Mengmeng succeeds in the future?” Immortal Master Wuluo smiled and said, “That’s hard to say.”","“It’s rare to encounter, let alone to obtain one.”","“Palace Master, why don’t we make a bet?” Immortal Master Wuluo said, “I bet that Mengmeng’s Profound Underworld Holy Fire can advance to the first level within 10,000 years.”","“Then I’ll bet it can’t? No! You tricked me.” Immortal Master Waterheaven glared at him. “Wouldn’t I be offending them if I said these words?”","“Well, I’ll bet with you two. It won’t take that long. I think she can succeed within hundreds of years. The bet is six Profound-grade treasures.” Zhang Han smiled.","“That’s a deal.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Wuluo looked at each other and said at the same time, “Thank you for your Profound-grade treasures.”","“Ha...” Yue Wuwei laughed and said, “I’ll bet on it. It’s hard to say who will win.”","They chatted happily for a while and resolved the negative emotions caused by the previous group of people led by Immortal Master Sanlei.","It was very important to maintain a calm mentality in the secret realm. Now, Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others created a lively atmosphere and felt comfortable.","“Let’s continue.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “Let’s see how many cyan Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity we will encounter along the way.”","Everyone resumed their journey.","It was dangerous for others to pass through here, for example, the group of ten thousand people a few days ago.","The number of its people was reduced by one-third, with only about seven thousand left.","Now, they were fighting against a group of Fire Spirits.","“Watch out!”","“Don’t let them touch you.”","“Don’t panic. Keep the energy stable.”","“Damn it! We have 30,000 people here, and now there are only 7,000 left. What the hell is this place?”","It turned out more than thirty thousand of their people had come. However, more than half of them died in the peripheral regions.","“What a dangerous secret realm.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed softly and said, ” Hanyang, if it weren’t for you, many of us might have died.”","“You don’t need to be so polite.” Zhang Han shook his head and chuckled. “I’m the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace. It’s natural for me to make a contribution. Palace Master, I think you’re treating us courteously as outsiders.”","“Is that so?” Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed and said with a smile, “Maybe I’m not used to it. I don’t why, and I didn’t take you seriously as the Second Elder. But now that I hear you say this, I’m gratified.”","“Don’t be so courteous. We have to thank Mengmeng in the Sky of Fires and Clouds. Why are you so courteous?” Immortal Master Wuluo said with a smile.","“Yes. Mengmeng has made a great contribution. When we get back, the Palace Master will reward you more.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a smile.","However, he was discouraged. Mengmeng waved her hand and said, “Ha... No need, Palace Master. You may not have as many treasures as I do.”","Poof!","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s face twitched a few times."]},{"number":1661,"title":"Chapter 1661 Too Perfunctory","paragraphs":["Chapter 1661 Too Perfunctory","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled awkwardly as everyone continued to advance.","With Mengmeng around, they slaughtered their way into the Sky of Fires and Clouds.","They stayed there for a total of 19 days.","The crowd came across the azure-colored Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity at least five times. There were hundreds or even thousands of them.","Mengmeng absorbed all the essence energy after the Fire Spirits were shattered.","To her, the essence of the azure Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity was a high-end treasure.","“These Fire Spirits are no weaker than ten third-tier Elemental Source treasures,” Immortal Master Waterheaven estimated.","“I think it’s worth at least 20 third-tier Elemental Sources,” Yue Wuwei said.","“More or less.” Immortal Master Wuluo nodded.","“We are heading to the final zone of the Sky of Fires and Clouds.”","“When we pass, we will have to go to the next area. I wonder if we can reach the depths of the secret realm.”","Everyone quickly rushed forward. With the Profound Underworld Holy Fire, they were not worried about attracting the Fire Spirits at all.","Therefore, it took them eight days to completely pass through the Sky of Fires and Clouds.","When they saw the familiar great river and the area ahead, they were all stunned.","The faces of Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and the others darkened a little.","“It’s, it’s actually lightning power? What is that? Water columns are all over the sky. Lightning bolts are all over the water columns. This is truly strange.”","“The thunder is mighty and too powerful. I feel that this is the tribulation lightning that breaks through to the fifth tier from the fourth tier.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han curled his lips and said, “Some of the thunderbolts are about the same in power, but they can’t be compared with the tribulation lightning. These water columns are not water, but lightning. I see seven kinds of thunderbolts, and maybe there are more Elemental Energy Thunder inside.”","The scene ahead was very similar to that of the Sky of Fires and Clouds.","The Sky of Fires and Clouds was filled with flames.","In front of them, there were clear streams across the void, and below was a boundless swamp.","In every stream, there was lightning flashing. Those tens of thousands of streams looked like large nets put together, which made people quite terrified.","Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “This should be called the Thunder Stream Domain. Every area we come to is in crisis. There must be danger hidden here. It’s very difficult to deal with Elemental Energy Thunder. Besides, Immortal Master Sanlei and the others are also here. If we encounter them and use the Thunder Control Technique here, our combat capability will at least double.”","This was what he thought of.","They had been delayed for a few days in the Sky of Fire and Clouds, but they moved fast later. They thought that the group of people led by Immortal Master Sanlei would definitely be slow. In this way, there was still a chance for them to meet in the Thunder Stream Domain.","“Why don’t we set out a few months from now?” Immortal Master Wuluo suggested.","“Okay. The Holy Thunder Sect is the number one sect in the Thunder Control Technique on the Seventh Mountain. They are powerful and not easy to deal with. Although Immortal Master Sanlei has gone too far, we can’t kill them all in silence. If any of them escapes, it will cause us trouble.”","“It’s not worth it. They’re just trying to take advantage of the situation.”","Many people in the crowd voiced their opinions rationally.","But there were also many people who were filled with righteous indignation. They were a little angry when they thought of this. The disdain of Immortal Master Sanlei and the others toward the Highest Clouds Palace and Immortal Master Waterheaven was really displeasing.","As for Immortal Master Waterheaven, he said straightforwardly, “Immortal Master Sanlei is nothing. Even if I meet him, I’m not afraid of him, and I dare him to attack us. Let’s go to the Thunder Stream Domain and find an opportunity to kill him.”","“Okay. Let’s do it.”","Immortal Master Wuluo, who was the first to propose the suggestion to wait for a few months, was also the first to nod.","This guy was a fence-sitter.","“Let’s go!”","They had reached an agreement, and even many elders looked excited.","Since they might start a war with the elders of the Holy Thunder Sect, they couldn’t help but be in high spirits.","They were now determined to start a fight.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared again and led everyone across the river.","“Well...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven also said, “Will Lil Beast be angry if we call it out so frequently?”","“No, I guess,” said Zhang Han.","“Don’t worry, Hanyang. If it doesn’t want to, don’t let it come out. We can also use some moves to cross the river, but it will be much more troublesome,” said Immortal Master Waterheaven.","Since they had crossed the third river, they knew something about the pits and ghosts in the great river.","They could dodge soul attacks.","“It’s okay.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “It only takes half a minute to cross the river. It doesn’t matter.”","“Okay.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded.","After they crossed the river, everyone was levitating in the spiritual void of thunder stream. Looking at the stream-like water, Immortal Master Wuluo said strangely, “I didn’t expect that the water is also a kind of thunder.”","“There are tens of millions of thunder in the world.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled and explained to everyone, “The most common lightning is the lightning with various attributes. Above it is the lightning of the Heavenly Tribulation, and above it is the Elemental Energy Thunder of the Heavenly Tribulation. There are countless kinds of thunder. It’s not surprising to meet some. We just need to feel the energy contained in the lightning or the ability.”","“There are Fire Spirits in the Sky of Fires and Clouds at the back. Is there a Thunder Spirit in the Thunder Stream Domain here? That thing is also very rare,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","“Thunder Spirit?” Zhang Han narrowed his eyes.","It was indeed a treasure. When Zhang Han and Chen Changqing went to the secret realm, they accidentally found the Thunder Spirit. However, when Zhang Han absorbed it, the boat of curse appeared and destroyed the secret realm, which put Zhang Han in danger.","In those days, many Western martial artists attacked Mount New Moon. Fortunately, Zhang Han came back in time and saved the situation.","Otherwise, Instructor Liu might really die, and Zi Yan would also be in danger.","Zhang Han didn’t expect that the boat of curse would be in the state before Tiny Tot was born.","“This land of lightning is not easy to deal with. We’d better be careful,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said. “If we run into those people from the Holy Thunder Sect, we’ll leave if we can’t defeat them. If we can, we’ll fight them.”","In fact, his words also meant that he was not sure.","In the land of lightning, for the Dao Seeking Cultivators who majored in the Thunder Control Technique, their fighting ability had improved a lot.","“Don’t worry.”","Yue Wuwei chuckled and said, “Zhang Hanyang is the master of thunder. The Holy Thunder Sect is nothing to him.”","“Is that so?”","Immortal Master Wuluo had a strange look in his eyes. “I almost forgot. Hanyang, you said that you seem to know some Thunder Control Techniques, didn’t you?”","“I do know some.” Zhang Han nodded.","He was too modest.","Zi Yan pursed her lips and smiled.","“He has the Thunder Body!”","“It’s good that you know some. That’s all valuable experience. We’ll follow whatever you tell us to do,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","“Then... let’s move forward.”","Zhang Han waved his right hand and took out tens of thousands of crystal stones. He crushed them and formed a formation.","Also, lightning surrounded the formation.","Sizzle!","Wisps of electric currents made it seem as if they had fused into the Thunder Stream Domain.","Swoosh!","They moved very fast, passing through the center of each thunder stream.","They quickly passed through those layers of nets.","“It is strange.”","“The stream is completely irregular. Some places are more than 100 meters in diameter, like huge water balls, and then the stream below becomes several meters in diameter.”","“It’s a wonder. It’s rare to see something like this.” Yue Wuwei stroked his beard.","“It’s so beautiful.” Chen Chuan was no longer afraid. He looked around curiously.","This guy was now in his twenties. According to his cultivation level, he was originally a very powerful young man among his peers. However, he stuck to a group of big shots and didn’t make himself known. He considered himself a rookie. He was always cautious and had never felt the pleasure of pretending to be weak to crush the strong or reach his peak.","He could only watch the fun from the side and occasionally exclaim to express his existence.","The crowd flew for six hours.","There were no creatures on the way, and even Zhang Han didn’t feel threatened.","However, the surrounding thunder streams gave the place a restless feeling.","“If...”","Zhang Han’s eyes narrowed slightly.","“If all the thunder streams are a big net, can the Thunder Body enter the thunder and detect something?”","“Thunder!”","A small bolt of lightning flew out from Zhang Han’s right hand. He was condensing the small and exquisite Thunder Body.","Among his duplications, the Thunder Body was the least afraid of death.","At worst, he could swallow a few bolts of Tribulation Lightning to recover.","In this way, the Thunder Body explored the way and got into a thunder stream.","“Sure enough, it can detect the place.","“Let me see what’s inside this Thunder Stream Domain.”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes and said, “Let’s stop for a moment.”","In a thunder stream on the side, the Thunder Body was divided into two parts, one up and one down, and began to explore.","A moment later, a fork appeared in the stream. There were a total of sixteen paths up and down.","Zhang Han continued to disperse his soul senses and explore in all directions.","Five minutes later, Zhang Han’s soul senses could detect things far away. In this stream, Thunder Body was like a duck to water. Its divine senses were thousands of times more powerful than that of the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","In addition, if he spread out tens of thousands of wisps of his will, it would be too scattered. If he condensed them into two wisps and continued to explore, the distance detected might be many times greater.","He felt that there was only one thunder stream.","Zhang Han thought to himself and said at the same time, “Let’s go.”","The will of the Thunder Body dissipated. It flew along the thunder stream, and at the same time, it dissipated forward.","The Thunder Stream Domain was too big. Unless there was a lot of time, Zhang Han could not explore it completely. However, he could roughly deduce the situation of the entire Thunder Stream Domain through one area.","Just like that, he probed as he walked.","Three days later.","“We seem to have reached the core area of the Thunder Stream Domain.”","Zhang Han said, “Be careful. The thunder streams here are more dense.”","“Core area?” Everyone’s expressions became serious.","Suddenly-","“Got it!”","Zhang Han’s eyes lit up.","“What is it?” The expressions of Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others changed slightly.","Zhang Han was silent for two seconds.","“Should I tell them that I’ve discovered a Profound-grade treasure hundreds of thousands of kilometers ahead?","“That will be quite stunning.”","“I sensed the main vein of the thunder stream just now. Wait for me to cast a little spell and have it guide us.”","Zhang Han pretended to cast a spell.","Clack!","The huge thunderbolt flew in a certain direction.","Then, the crowd directly followed over.","“It’s such an obvious act, Dad.”","Mengmeng said with a chuckle via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Among the three of us, your acting skills are the worst. It’s too perfunctory.”","Zhang Han said with his mouth trembling slightly, “They’re all friends. I just need to fool them. I can’t say that I’ve found a treasure suitable for you from too far away. It will make them doubt their worth.”"]},{"number":1662,"title":"Chapter 1662 Encounter","paragraphs":["Chapter 1662 Encounter","“Huh? Is there a treasure?” Mengmeng was stunned.","“Yes, it’s a Profound-grade treasure. Its aura is not bad, and its color is bright, like a pink nebula. It’s a seven-meter-long ribbon. I can sense a little aura from it. It should be suitable for all kinds of supernatural power attacks. You’ve learned the Fire Whip since you were a child. If you use the treasure to display your moves, it will have a good effect. You’ll know more abilities after you get it,” Zhang Han explained in detail.","“Well, I see.” Mengmeng winked at Zhang Han.","However, Zi Yan rolled her eyes at her.","“What is this girl doing?”","Under normal circumstances, Zi Yan would say, “You don’t get to wink at your dad, girl. Only I get to do so.”","Next, it might be a war of words between the mother and daughter.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They flew very fast.","Several hours later, they finally arrived at their destination.","Right at this moment, Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly and made a gesture of casting. “Guiding Thunder Intent.”","He made a perfunctory gesture and said, “Why do I seem to have sensed the people from the Holy Thunder Sect?”","“What?” Immortal Master Waterheaven was shocked, and then his expression changed indeterminately. “Ignore them.”","He had made up his mind. If he really ran into the other party, he could test their strength.","He didn’t believe that those people would really dare to fight in this dangerous Thunder Stream Domain.","Zhang Han moved his mouth.","Judging from the other party’s direction, they seemed to have noticed the existence of the Profound-grade treasure.","Normally, they wouldn’t fight, but with a Profound-grade treasure, everything would be different.","“We have to speed up.”","Zhang Han sensed the distance between his people and the other party.","They were now twice as far from the treasure as the Holy Thunder Sect’s people.","“Fortunately, they are not very fast.”","Swoosh!","Zhang Han once again cast a formation and accelerated imperceptibly. It was just like the force pulling when the plane was about to take off. The crowd was getting faster and faster.","From a visual point of view, they were moving up and down, passing through various thunder streams. Sometimes, they were only half a meter away from the stream.","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others were terrified when they noticed that, especially Immortal Master Wuluo.","“Slow down, slow down. It’s too fast. We can’t bump into those streams.”","He reminded Zhang Han from time to time.","But their speed was not slowed down at all.","Finally, they arrived at their destination before the team of Immortal Master Sanlei.","“What, what is this?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s pupils contracted. “There’s actually a Profound-grade treasure hidden in the thunder stream.”","“It’s the aura of a Profound-grade treasure.” Immortal Master Wuluo took a deep breath. “But isn’t the thunder stream that covers the Profound-grade treasure too big?”","It was like a huge water ball with a diameter of about 10,000 meters. A small ribbon-like Profound-grade treasure was floating in the middle.","There were flashes of lightning around it, and occasionally, there seemed to be the faces of the Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Human Clan flickering. The scene was extremely weird.","“What are those flickering faces?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven frowned and said, “They are hiding in the lightning stream. I can’t tell what they are.”","“We’ll know after testing it.”","Zhang Han made a gesture of casting, and his eyes were shining.","The Thunder Body turned into a big net and disappeared into the thunder stream. Suddenly, Zhang Han had a feeling that it was difficult to move an inch.","“These are... the rules of the Great Domain?”","Zhang Han suddenly narrowed his eyes.","“This is truly terrible.”","The rules of the Great Domain would appear after the tribulation. Dao Seeking Cultivators could absorb it and have a deeper affinity and feelings for the Great Domain between heaven and earth.","This was the Source and the rules of the world. It was above everything else.","Zhang Han could control the rules of the world in the Domain of Seven Desolations, which did not exist in the Cultivation World at all. It was a purely independent world. Therefore, Zhang Han was invincible in the Domain of Seven Desolations.","And this round thunder ball actually contained the rules of the Great Domain.","This was a rather terrifying thing.","Although the Thunder Body was strong, it would be affected by the rules of the Great Domain in this world.","Among the five duplications of Zhang Han, only the Thunder Body was least affected by the rules. The second one was the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure. Every time the Golden-armored Giant Beast, the Great Demon Body, or the Extreme Purity Immortal Body appeared, Zhang Han would feel as if he was going against the rules of the Great Domain.","As a result, Zhang Han had estimated that he would get the ribbon-like Profound-grade treasure in ten seconds, but he didn’t have enough time at all. It might take him more than ten minutes or an hour. As for the details, it depended on the changes in the Great Domain rules.","The big net extended forward. Ten minutes later, the crowd was halfway to their destination.","“The energy of the rules of the Great Domain is increasing.”","Zhang Han thought to himself, spread out his mind, and noticed Immortal Master Sanlei.","“Fortunately, there’s still time.”","Zhang Han sped up as the big net was getting closer and closer to the ribbon.","But when he got closer-","Buzz! Buzz! Buzz!","An invisible buzzing sound rang out, accompanied by dozens of faces that suddenly appeared. Those faces were ferocious, their eyes were wide open, and their eyes were bloodshot.","Each of them had reached the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. They roared together, and the sound waves shattered the large net.","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han had lost his Thunder Body. “What are these?”","After he thought for two seconds, his expression changed slightly.","“Are they the legendary Face Devils?”","Zhang Han had read information about the Face Devils from an ancient book. These creatures were strange and unpredictable. Most of them existed in various kinds of energy bodies. Their means of attack were mysterious. If people encountered one, they could escape by simulating the aura of the Face Devil.","This showed that the ancient Dao Seeking Cultivator who recorded this information had not found a way to deal with the Face Devils.","However, the information revealed that simulating the auras of the Face Devils could make it difficult for them to detect the situation.","“The Face Devils are within 30 meters of the ribbon.","“After I enter that area, I will simulate their auras for three seconds. Only by taking away the ribbon in one second can I avoid the attack.","“The Thunder Body can do it.","“It’s just that I don’t have enough time.”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly. He was slowly condensing the newly-formed Thunder Body. If it died once, he would just suffer a slight injury.","This was the benefit of the Thunder Body, which could die at will.","It would have taken a lot of spirit treasures and means to escape if it had been the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","Seeing this, Yue Wuwei asked, “What’s going on?”","“It’s nothing.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “Somebody is coming.”","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others looked around them.","In the distance ahead, a group of people, surrounded by many defensive layers, were approaching carefully.","“It’s those people from the Holy Thunder Sect.” A short blade appeared in the right hand of Immortal Master Wuluo.","The elders behind him followed suit.","They spotted Immortal Master Sanlei.","At the same time, the people on the other side also noticed the situation.","“A Profound-grade treasure. It’s indeed the aura of a Profound-grade treasure. Hahaha!”","Immortal Master Sanlei was in a good mood.","At the same time, he sped up a little.","“Elder, it’s those people from the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“I didn’t expect that they could catch up with us. How could they escape from thousands of Fire Spirits? The key is that not a single one of them has died. It seems that they have some means.”","“Haha! We’ve already warned them that it wouldn’t be so simple the next time they encounter us. I never expected that this group of people would be so audacious. Not only did they follow us, but they even have ill intentions toward our elder’s Profound-grade treasure.”","Immortal Master Sanlei liked to hear that.","Indeed, he was determined to obtain this Profound-grade treasure.","“It’s a ribbon-like Profound-grade treasure, a weapon-type Profound-grade treasure. Judging from its aura, it’s equivalent to a ninth-tier spirit treasure. Coupled with its special ability, it’s a top-grade treasure.” A fat middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator, who was eager to show off, cupped his hands and said, “Elder, shall I get the Profound-grade treasure for you?”","“Okay, go ahead.” The top subordinate of Immortal Master Sanlei was also an old man. He nodded and said, “Go and get the Profound-grade treasure. We’ll meet those people from the Highest Clouds Palace.”","After the discussion-","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Immortal Master Sanlei and the others approached quickly. On the opposite side of the huge water ball, the middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator took out more than a dozen kinds of Defense Treasures, sank into the water drop, and moved carefully toward the Profound-grade treasure.","“Immortal Master Waterheaven? Highest Clouds Palace?”","Immortal Master Sanlei suddenly started talking. He said in a cold tone, “I warned you a long time ago.”","“So, what do you want?” Immortal Master Waterheaven frowned. “I haven’t got even with you for setting us up yet.”","“Puny Highest Clouds Palace. I wonder who gave you the courage to say that to me.”","Immortal Master Sanlei sneered. “I’ll give you three breaths of time to get out of my sight. If you don’t do as I said, I’ll kill you!”","He took the lead in stopping and keeping a distance from the huge water ball.","Judging from his attitude, he didn’t seem to want to fight here.","Everyone knew the reason.","The fluctuation of the battle might attract the terrifying beings in the Thunder Stream Domain or other Dao Seeking Cultivators. When others found the Profound-grade treasure, there would inevitably be competition.","Immortal Master Sanlei naturally felt that obtaining the Profound-grade treasure was more important than fighting.","“It’s just the Highest Clouds Palace. After leaving the secret realm, I can do whatever I want.”","“Do you think we’ll leave just because you asked us to?” Immortal Master Waterheaven didn’t show due respect for Immortal Master Sanlei’s feelings. He sneered and said, “Who do you think you are? If the Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect asks me to leave, I may leave, but I’ve never heard of you, Immortal Master Sanlei. What right do you have to show off your power to me?”","“What did you say?”","Immortal Master Sanlei’s face darkened. “I’m afraid you don’t know how much the fighting capacity of the people of our Holy Thunder Sect will improve in the thunder stream.”","“Even if we know that, so what?” Immortal Master Wuluo said, “We were the first to discover this Profound-grade treasure. Immortal Master Sanlei, I advise you to leave quickly.”","“Bullshit!”","The subordinates of Immortal Master Sanlei retorted one after another. “We discovered this Profound-grade treasure first.”","“The Highest Clouds Palace is a third-rate power after all. Do you want to take possession of the Profound-grade treasure after discovering it? Even if you arrive first, the Profound-grade treasure belongs to the one who gets it first.”","“There are still two breaths of time.” A thunder ball appeared in the right hand of Immortal Master Sanlei, and it kept sizzling.","He was about to make his move.","Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and the others looked at each other.","They all understood something from each other’s eyes.","“Then let me challenge you, Immortal Master Sanlei.” Immortal Master Waterheaven walked straight toward him.","At this moment, Zhang Han waved his hand, and the Thunder Body condensed into threads and fell into the water ball.","“How presumptuous! How dare you seize the Profound-grade treasure?” Someone shouted in a grim voice.","The atmosphere became tenser and tenser, and the air seemed to be filled with murderous intent.","“Quick, snatch it!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said to Zhang Han via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “It’s best if you can get the Profound-grade treasure. We’ll hold on for a few minutes. If you can’t, just retreat. There’s only one chance.”","“Don’t worry. I’ll get the Profound-grade treasure and then deal with them.” Zhang Han nodded slightly and activated his Thunder Body with all his strength.","He was much faster than the enemy Dao Seeking Cultivator.","In just half a minute, he and the middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator were the same from the ribbon-like Profound-grade treasure.","“Hahaha!”","Immortal Master Sanlei looked gloomy. “Do you really think that I don’t dare to fight here?”"]},{"number":1663,"title":"Chapter 1663 Competition","paragraphs":["Chapter 1663 Competition","Profound-grade treasures were very rare. Few Tribulation Stage masters had a Profound-grade treasure. Some people might have two or three Profound-grade treasures. As for Immortal Master Sanlei, he had been in the Cultivation World for so many years, but he didn’t have a single Profound-grade treasure. Now, when he saw this ribbon, he was quite tempted and regarded it as his own.","Seeing that Zhang Han was faster, he was ready to fight.","But at this moment, Zhang Han began to show his acting skills.","“Hmm?”","He frowned slightly, and the threads of Thunder Body controlled by the huge water ball stopped moving.","At this time, Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others approached their enemies and maintained a distance where they could fight at any time.","They were at loggerheads and might attack at any time.","However, Immortal Master Waterheaven intended to hold off the other party, and it was not too late to retreat after getting the Profound-grade treasure.","The Profound-grade treasure that appeared in the secret realm belonged to whoever got it. Even if they left the secret realm, the Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect might not say anything about it.","That was why Immortal Master Waterheaven’s goal was to wait for the other party to make a move, and then stall for time.","After all, Zhang Han had just gone in once, and his speed was much faster than that of the middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator.","“But now?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven pondered for a moment.","He suddenly realized something and looked at Immortal Master Wuluo.","Their thoughts were similar.","They didn’t expect that Zhang Hanyang, who was usually so gentle, would trick them at this time.","“Heh.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven took the initiative to cooperate. “Since there are two competitors within the water ball, let them fight over the treasure.”","“In your dreams.”","Immortal Master Sanlei sneered and said, “No matter what the result is, the Profound-grade treasure is mine. Now that the Highest Clouds Palace dares to compete with me for it, I shall kill all of you.”","“Hahaha, is that so?”","Zhang Han burst into laughter, looked ahead, and whispered, “I will get the Profound-grade treasure and kill you.”","“How dare a nobody talk to me?” Immortal Master Sanlei’s eyes were filled with ridicule.","“Who are you?”","His subordinates spoke up one after another.","It was soldiers versus soldiers and generals versus generals. Since the other side’s subordinate had spoken, it was their turn.","They had to win in terms of doing trash talk.","“Bastard, you’re so young. We are all your ancestors. How dare you even speak?”","“What an arrogant young man!”","“Look, he only used his full strength at the beginning. Now that his speed has decreased, he’s nothing more than trash.”","Under everyone’s gaze, the threads controlled by Zhang Han and transformed from the Thunder Body moved slower and slower as if they were exhausted.","The middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator on the opposite side was very nervous at first. He volunteered for this difficult task. If he succeeded, he could directly become the core subordinate of Immortal Master Sanlei, and his status would be improved many times.","The middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator was taken aback when he saw the other side perform a supernatural power at such a high speed. Now that the other side had slowed down, he laughed wildly and said, “You’re just an insignificant nobody. You’re like a contemptible clown. How dare you show off your supernatural power in front of me? Even your Original Body don’t dare to enter.”","Clatter!","As he spoke, he sped up a little more.","He was getting closer and closer to the Profound-grade treasure.","At the same time, he could hardly feel the Face Devils that had just appeared at this time. Their auras were even more concealed, but he could sense something from the energy fluctuations around the Profound-grade treasure.","“Is it dangerous there?”","The middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator got vigilant. His divine sense couldn’t feel anything, but some looming threads could be seen with the naked eye. They gathered together and formed the outline of a human face.","“What is that?”","“I accept the Profound-grade treasure. Give it to me!”","Swoosh!","Zhang Han controlled his Thunder Body and it suddenly burst out at a very fast speed. As if making a wild dash, he was getting closer and closer to the ribbon.","Soon he would surpass the middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator.","At this time, the expressions of Immortal Master Sanlei and the others changed.","“Little thief, how dare you!”","Immortal Master Sanlei roared angrily.","“Hurry up and get it! Let’s see who dares to make a move!” Immortal Master Waterheaven shouted.","Sizzle!","He held the saber with both hands and glared forward, ready to fight.","But at this time, Immortal Master Sanlei was not in the mood to fight with him. Their eyes were fixed on the situation inside the water ball.","Someone shouted, “Amo, hurry up and snatch it!”","“Amo, move a bit faster.”","Hearing the shouts outside, the middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator in the water ball became anxious.","“Calm down, calm down!”","Wisps of cold sweat flowed down his forehead. He had no choice but to use all his energy to perform the occult art much faster.","But when he was fast, his perception and defense against the surroundings grew weaker.","“Calm down... The Profound-grade treasure is floating here. There may be danger around. What’s more, what I just saw...”","The middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator forced himself to calm down.","He was fast and cautious at the same time.","Swoosh!","Unexpectedly, Zhang Han controlled the threads faster.","He was getting closer and closer to the ribbon.","“Damn it!”","The middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator gritted his teeth, took out a ninth-class pearl in his hand, crushed it, and sped up again.","When he was dozens of meters away-","“As I said, I will get the Profound-grade treasure and kill you,” Zhang Han said in a calm tone outside as if he had a well-thought-out plan.","“Hurry up!”","“Don’t let him get it.”","The middle-aged man’s teammates kept shouting.","At this time, the mentality of the middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator was more or less affected.","“I’ll get it!”","His eyes lit up, and his body expanded by three meters. He crossed more than 30 meters in one step and stretched out his right hand. “Come to me!”","Zhang Han suddenly stopped using the Thunder Body’s threads.","At the same time, he looked ahead with a smile.","“Got it!”","The middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator felt that his hand had controlled the ribbon. If he took it away, he would succeed.","“I made it!”","However, in the next second-","“AHHHHH...”","Face Devils appeared one after another. The attacks they launched directly annihilated the middle-aged Dao Seeking Cultivator, leaving only a scream echoing.","“What?!”","The expression of Immortal Master Sanlei changed, and the others also felt a chill down their spines.","If they had just entered, they might not have been able to defend themselves.","“What are those things?”","“Sure enough, there are terrifying creatures around the Profound-grade treasure.”","“...”","These people felt terrified and desperate.","Immortal Master Sanlei looked at the side of Immortal Master Waterheaven, and he looked ferocious. “Kill them!”","“Lightning Split!”","Immortal Master Sanlei kept condensing the thunder ball in his right hand into the size of a basketball. Then, he suddenly threw it forward. A thunder ball split into dozens of thunderbolts.","His attack absorbed a lot of the power of lightning in the surroundings, and his momentum became stronger and stronger. The light blue lightning also gathered into a deep blue color and charged at Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“Kill them!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven bellowed.","The two sides began to fight.","Yue Wuwei also launched attacks one by one from behind. Although his attacks were very powerful, they were not helpful in the battle against those at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.","Zhang Han didn’t make a move. He was waiting.","Inside the water ball, the ribbon was surrounded by the Face Devils, which were still flickering.","After they calmed down, Zhang Han took out the ribbon.","Boom!","The powerful attacks from both sides released all types of radiance. Clouds and mist pervaded the air, great winds stirring about, the fluctuations in this region gradually enlarging.","“That’s what the Sect Leader of the Highest Clouds Palace can do?”","Immortal Master Sanlei took out a flag and waved it. Countless long swords filled with thunder energy whistled over, mixed with a fierce aura.","Immortal Master Waterheaven was no inferior, and all kinds of attacks offset each other.","After holding on for two minutes, he finally began to retreat.","“How’s it going, Hanyang?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said to him via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “I can’t hold on much longer.”","In the outside world, they could fight, but in the Thunder Stream Domain, their enemies were proficient in the Thunder Control Technique, whose combat capability was greatly improved. Immortal Master Waterheaven got suppressed.","Zhang Han replied, “Hold on for a minute. I’ll kill them when I get the Profound-grade treasure.”","“You were still babies when I reached the ninth tier.”","Immortal Master Sanlei looked indifferent. He had made up his mind to kill the other side first, and then think about getting the Profound-grade treasure.","Most of the Thunder Control Techniques of the Holy Thunder Sect were mastered by the flag, which was sealed with many secret thunder skills that could be controlled.","Therefore, for a moment, the attacks of more than a dozen people were like a storm.","As for Immortal Master Waterheaven, he was still unable to defeat them even with his own strength.","In just half a minute, there were very few Face Devils around the ribbon.","But at this time, someone in Immortal Master Waterheaven’s team had been injured. Although they were slightly injured, it meant that they could not hold on any longer.","Seeing this, Zhang Han frowned slightly.","“Step back a hundred meters. Let me do it.”","Right after he said that-","“Ow!”","An earth-shattering roar rang out.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast turned into a thousand meters long and flew forward at a high speed. It waved its huge front claws as if it were cutting heaven and earth, sending out sharp cutting energy.","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Sanlei’s pupils contracted. “You even have an ancient demonic beast?”","He looked at Zhang Han.","Finally, his expression changed.","“His aura is only at the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage. I can kill him!”","Immortal Master Sanlei roughly felt it and thought that Zhang Han was at the eighth tier.","In fact, he was only at the Peak Stage of the seventh tier.","“Ow!”","The Golden-armored Giant Beast roared again.","The horn on its head emitted a golden light.","Zhang Han released the Golden-armored Giant Beast not to attack, but to defend.","The beast could handle much beating. When the thunderbolts hit it, it only felt a little numb. Even Zhang Han was amazed by such a defense.","However, Immortal Master Waterheaven could not bear to do so.","He said, “Let’s fight quickly. Don’t let them hurt Lil Beast.”","In his eyes, Lil Beast was still an Exotic Beast that had not grown up and needed protection.","As such, they continued to attack from behind.","For a moment, because of the appearance of the Golden-armored Giant Beast, the two sides were balanced.","“Dragon King’s combat strength is so strong.”","After observing for a few seconds, Immortal Master Wuluo couldn’t help but gasp. “It has been able to hold on for so long, but it’s still so calm and steady. Judging from its aura, it’s totally fine.”","“It’s the Dragon King!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said grumpily, “What aura? Hurry up and kill those people. If Lil Beast is injured, who knows how many years it will take for it to recover.”","With Immortal Master Waterheaven here, no one dared to slack off. They were even faster than before.","It didn’t matter if they got injured, but the Palace Master would be enraged if Lil Beast was injured.","Fortunately, they only needed to handle some of the enemy’s attacks behind the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","Right then, Immortal Master Sanlei and the others had different looks in their eyes.","“Where did they get the ancient demonic beast?”","“This guy is so fierce.”","“The Highest Clouds Palace is not qualified to own an ancient demonic beast, is it?”"]},{"number":1664,"title":"Chapter 1664 The Ancestor in Thunder","paragraphs":["Chapter 1664 The Ancestor in Thunder","Immortal Master Sanlei had another idea. He looked ahead and said, “Give me this ancient demonic beast and I’ll spare your lives.”","“You must be dreaming.” Mengmeng couldn’t help saying, “You’re so shameless.”","As soon as the young girl spoke, Chen Chuan suddenly became arrogant. He put his hands on his hips and pointed at the other party. “Fuck you! Look at your ugly face. You keep talking nonsense, and your skills are poor. I’ll kill you later.”","However, Immortal Master Sanlei ignored them.","He could kill the group of young guys who insulted him later.","Generally speaking, only when people of the same status scolded or scolded him would he feel angry.","At this moment.","“He is indeed a shameless fellow.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven mocked, “You’re an elder of the Holy Thunder Sect. People like you will be beaten to death in less than three days in the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“Hahaha!”","The expression of Immortal Master Sanlei was gloomy. “Let’s see if you can still smile when I kill you.”","At the same time, he was observing the movements inside the water ball out of the corner of his eye.","Those terrifying Face Devils had all disappeared. Only faint fluctuations could be seen. That meant that they still existed.","Swoosh!","The threads transformed from Zhang Han’s Thunder Body shuttled back and forth in two seconds, tied the ribbon directly, retreated in one second, and left the area where the Face Devils were.","To Zhang Han’s surprise, the space seal around the Face Devils began to loosen.","Without the suppression of the ribbon-like Profound-grade treasure, the Face Devils would show up in the Thunder Stream Domain.","“It’s a terrible situation.”","Zhang Han’s mouth twitched slightly.","However, this was not something that they cared about. Perhaps the people who came later would suffer.","“Elder, he got the Profound-grade treasure!”","Someone cried out in alarm.","“Kill him!”","Immortal Master Sanlei was angry.","An even more powerful attack covered the heavens and the earth.","However, they had greatly underestimated the defensive capabilities of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","Among these Dao Seeking Cultivators, the most powerful one was at the Middle Stage of the ninth tier. While facing their attacks, the Golden-armored Giant Beast did not feel much pain. Even if it felt pain, it did not care. In short, it would not get hurt. It could fight at will.","Zhang Han was casual.","He left the duplication of the Golden-armored Giant Beast in front of them, which kept roaring and fighting.","Behind the Golden-armored Giant Beast, Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others continued unleashing their attacks.","However, Zhang Han was in a leisurely state that was incompatible with the scene of the battle.","“Not bad, not bad. This ribbon is even more powerful than I could sense.”","Zhang Han observed it carefully and said, “It’s an attributeless Profound-grade treasure. It’s suitable for all kinds of Dao Seeking Cultivators and can be used to attack and defend. It’s a nice Profound-grade treasure. Take it and nourish it.”","Zhang Han handed it to Mengmeng with a smile.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng also understood this. She needed to nourish the Profound-grade treasures with her own aura so that she could use them more and more smoothly in the future.","They were speaking in an aboveboard manner.","Immortal Master Sanlei was furious when he heard them.","“Do you think it’s your Profound-grade treasure now?”","Immortal Master Sanlei asked with a cold face, “Who are you?”","“Me?”","Zhang Han finally turned his head and looked at the battlefield. He smiled faintly and said, “I’m Zhang Hanyang, the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“Haha, wonderful. Even if I can’t kill you here, even if you escape, I will destroy your Highest Clouds Palace with thousands of troops of the Holy Thunder Sect after we leave the secret realm!”","Immortal Master Sanlei’s voice was mixed with anger.","On the side of Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Wuluo, their faces were a little gloomy.","“Isn’t this obvious bullying?","“Do you think you can order the Holy Thunder Sect to start a war as you wish? You’re just an elder!”","Just as Immortal Master Waterheaven was about to mock him, Zhang Han said with a faint smile, “Who said we were going to escape?”","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Sanlei narrowed his eyes slightly. “Do you still want to fight with me? Do you dare to do that in the land of thunder streams?”","He couldn’t wait for Zhang Han to stay.","“Don’t be impulsive, Hanyang!”","Immortal Master Wuluo immediately said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Let’s retreat quickly. Immortal Master Sanlei’s fighting ability is too strong here. We are no match for him. As long as there is life, there is hope!”","“Let’s go! Don’t be willful!” Immortal Master Waterheaven said via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “Lil Beast has been attacked for a long time. If it continues to persist, I’m afraid it will be injured.”","At this time, Zhang Han smiled, shook his head, and moved slightly.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly roared and flew backward. It kept shrinking and returned to Zhang Han’s wrist.","Immortal Master Sanlei and the others stopped fighting and looked at the front coldly.","“How dare you?”","Immortal Master Sanlei had a mocking smile on his face.","“It’s just the Thunder Control Technique, isn’t it? I happen to know a lot about it,” Zhang Han said seriously.","“Hahaha, the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace is using the Thunder Control Technique. Are you kidding me?” Immortal Master Sanlei said, “If you dare to fight with me, then I can consider letting others go on the premise that you give me the Profound-grade treasure and the ancient demonic beast! Who do you think you are to compete in thunder with the Holy Thunder Sect?”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han looked calm and a little emotional. He quickly flew forward.","“Don’t!”","Immortal Master Wuluo exclaimed, “Come back!”","“Hanyang, don’t be impulsive.” Immortal Master Waterheaven wanted to stop Zhang Han.","“Surround them!”","Immortal Master Sanlei immediately gave the order.","His men moved and began to surround their enemies. As long as they could hold them back, they would win.","However, Zhang Han remained calm.","“It’s been a long time since I’ve fought.","“I’ll let you see what I can do.”","Zhang Han looked at Mengmeng and blinked. “We’re in the Star Sea, so we don’t need to keep a low profile.”","After that, he looked calmly at Immortal Master Sanlei and said lightly, “When it comes to thunder, all the sects on the cultivation of the Thunder Control Technique in the world have to call me ancestor.”","Clack!","As soon as Zhang Han finished speaking, a world-shocking thunderclap resounded through the heavens and the earth.","Countless bolts of lightning emerged from Zhang Han and spread in all directions.","The fluctuations of lightning caused one’s heart to tremble.","“What a terrifying aura.”","“What, what kind of Thunder Control Technique is this?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others fell into a state of shock.","“He said that he could control thunder, but he didn’t say that he could control thunder to this extent. It’s horrifying!”","Yue Wuwei smiled faintly and said, “You’ve shown your power. After such a long time, I can finally see you make your move.”","Even Yue Wuwei was curious about how strong Zhang Han was now.","Judging from the situation, since Zhang Han dared to take action, he should be confident. At least, he would be able to deal with the opposite Immortal Master Sanlei.","They were not the only ones who were shocked.","Immortal Master Sanlei and the others were also confused.","“What pure lightning power!”","“How could this be?”","“Oh no!”","Immortal Master Sanlei realized that the situation was not good.","He was quite vigilant, but his tone was very arrogant.","“How arrogant. How dare you claim to be the ancestor of the thunder sects? Do you know that with your words, your Highest Clouds Palace will be exterminated?”","Zhang Han ignored him.","He stretched out his right hand.","“Thunder Willow! Suppress!”","Swoosh!","A Thunder Willow was quickly formed, which even broke some of the surrounding thunder streams.","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han probed with his soul sense.","He immediately discovered that as the thunder stream was destroyed, there were terrifying creatures approaching from the distance.","“Kill him!”","Immortal Master Sanlei roared angrily.","One after another, they attacked. Some of them used Sword Qi containing lightning powers, while others were using Profound methods to cut the Thunder Willows.","But there were too many Thunder Willows.","“Thunder Sea!”","Zhang Han cast his supernatural power again.","The sea of lightning covered the surroundings and trapped those people.","“Thunderbolt Crocodile!","“Wind of Lightning!”","Zhang Han kept using his supernatural powers.","Zhang Han who was close to the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage finally showed his power. In front of the sect on the cultivation of the Thunder Control Technique, his Thunder Body was too shocking.","Immortal Master Sanlei ordered, “You guys defend. I’ll go kill him!”","However, a bolt of lightning transformed from Zhang Han’s Thunder Body among the Thunder Willows was approaching them quietly.","“I’ll let you have a taste of my new supernatural power.”","Zhang Han sneered.","He said, “To you all, the Thunder Stream Domain can increase your battle power by thirty percent. However, to me, it is like my territory.”","Zhang Han spread out his hands.","Originally, with his Thunder Body, he could not use this supernatural power.","Within the Thunder Stream Domain’s endless lightning energy, Zhang Han began to perform a move that only a ninth-tier Thunder Body could perform.","“Thunder Spirit Domain.”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","All the thunders within a thousand miles trembled and then dissipated, turning into a storm covered with the power of thunder, blowing over.","This scene frightened the other party.","“The, the thunder stream is destroyed!”","“Shit! He can steal the thunder stream’s energy!”","“Retreat, retreat quickly!”","At this moment, even Immortal Master Sanlei was stunned.","“How could he control the thunder stream’s energy?”","With this alone and the endless thunder energy around him, Zhang Han was already in an invincible position.","Hiss!","Sizzle!","The Thunder Willows dissipated, and the Wind of Lightning and Thunderbolt Crocodile also turned into smoke.","Accompanied by a huge amount of thunder energy, like enlarged tadpoles, light blue Thunder Spirits appeared one after another.","There were tens of thousands of them as they swam in the air.","They surrounded Immortal Master Sanlei and the others, letting out a silent roar.","The invisible attack fluctuations made the people of Immortal Master Sanlei feel as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","“AHHHHH...”","“Stop screaming. My head hurts!”","“Elder, Elder, save me!”","There were hundreds of defensive layers around them, but they were not damaged at all. Instead, those people were attacked.","“Elder, Elder, my energy is fading. My vitality is fading. I...”","The speaker was a Tribulation Stage master at the Peak Stage of the eighth tier. At this time, he couldn’t hold on any longer, and his body gradually faded.","Under the gaze of tens of thousands of thunder spirits, his body slowly turned into a new Thunder Spirit.","The Thunder Spirit Domain could use the supernatural power to absorb the other party’s energy, assimilate them, and turn them into a new Thunder Spirit.","This is the strength of the Thunder Spirit Domain.","Boom!","Another Dao Seeking Cultivator couldn’t stand it anymore. He roared and chose to self-detonate, but it was useless. The energy of the self-detonation quickly gathered and became a brand new Thunder Spirit.","Zhang Han didn’t need to get close to his opponents while launching the Thunder Spirit Attack. He just watched from a distance.","“I saw it.”","The face of Immortal Master Sanlei was pale. “Hahaha, I saw it.”","He found that the thousands of Thunder Spirits were connected with him by a thread. The Thunder Spirits were devouring him. His blood essence, energy, divine sense, and dantian were all being devoured.","“What kind of skill is this?”","Immortal Master Sanlei clenched his fists and kept casting supernatural powers, but he couldn’t stop the attack.","He knew that he couldn’t stop it.","“Elder, save...”","Until the last person beside him died, Immortal Master Sanlei took a deep breath.","“Well, well, well. Zhang Hanyang, Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace, I remember you. You have such a powerful thunder-controlling supernatural power, but you can’t kill me. I will just die here as a duplication that has been refined for a hundred years. Zhang Hanyang. The Highest Clouds Palace. very good! You are amazing!”","At this point, Immortal Master Sanlei gritted his teeth, and his eyes were full of resentment.","Only he knew how many resources it would take to refine a hundred-year-old duplication.","“Zhang Hanyang! The Highest Clouds Palace!","“Just you wait, just you wait. The Holy Thunder Sect will crush all of you one day!","“Hahaha, just wait for death!”","With loud laughter-","Rumble!","Immortal Master Sanlei ignited all the energy in his body."]},{"number":1665,"title":"Chapter 1665 A Way to Enter the Depths","paragraphs":["Chapter 1665 A Way to Enter the Depths","In a cultivator’s abode of the headquarters of the Holy Thunder Sect at the edge of the Seventh Mountain, the aura of a figure rose steadily.","Hiss!","He suddenly opened his eyes in shock.","“Exactly what sort of ability is that?","“Can lightning control reach that level?","“Zhang Hanyang can’t be spared.”","With resentment in his eyes, he said, “They should all be killed.”","Swoosh!","He immediately rose to his feet and headed toward the main all of the Holy Thunder Sect.","...","“It’s, it’s over?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others had puzzled looks on their faces.","“They are all dead.” Immortal Master Wuluo was questioning everything he had learned. “Oh my god, Second Elder, how, how could you be so fierce? Doesn’t that mean that you can kill all of us on your own?”","“What...”","With the words of Immortal Master Wuluo, everyone felt a chill in their hearts.","Immortal Master Waterheaven asked softly, “Are you at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage?”","From the looks of it, he was going to acknowledge Zhang Han as his leader.","“I can reach that phase here.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said calmly, “In the Thunder Stream Domain, the combat capability of those from the thunder sects can be increased by 30 to 40 percent. I’m probably dozens of times stronger than them.”","“Dozens of times?” Immortal Master Waterheaven touched his forehead.","Everyone was really a little scared.","At this time, Zhang Han frowned slightly and sensed some movements in the distance.","“Let’s go. A great terror is coming.”","Sizzle!","Before he had time to say anything more, Zhang Han waved his right hand and dissipated the Thunder Spirit Domain. Streaks of lightning surrounded the team. They quickly went down, stuck to the swamp, and shuttled forward.","Just three minutes after they went out, they could see a black fog in the distance. It kept blowing at the place where they had just been. It was like a tornado. Even from a distance, they could feel how terrifying it was.","In just a dozen seconds, the thunder stream that had just been destroyed was regathered by the black tornado.","“What’s that?” Yue Wuwei asked in a low voice. He was worried that his words would attract attention.","“Unknown terror.”","Zhang Han said, “I don’t know what’s inside, but it’s definitely not easy to deal with.”","“By the way.”","Immortal Master Wuluo sighed deeply. “Alas, according to what Immortal Master Sanlei said just now, we... still have to be prepared.”","“It’s actually a duplication that came to the secret realm, isn’t it?” Immortal Master Waterheaven frowned deeply. “If it is, will the Holy Thunder Sect really attack the Highest Clouds Palace?”","“Small trouble can always turn into a big one.” Immortal Master Wuluo said, “Even if the Holy Thunder Sect doesn’t take action, it won’t be easy for us if Immortal Master Sanlei brings people here. If a fight breaks out, as a super sect, the Holy Thunder Sect will show no mercy to the Highest Clouds Palace. Maybe they will still take action.”","His tone was full of worry about the future.","“It doesn’t matter.”","Zhang Han said in a deep voice, “When Lil Beast breaks through here, we will be safe and sound after we go out.”","“Lil Beast will be at the eighth tier after its breakthrough. Will we be able to deal with them?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked uncertainly.","“Yes.”","Zhang Han gave a positive answer.","He was now at the Peak Stage of the seventh tier.","If he broke through to the eighth tier, he would be able to defeat Immortal Master Lingxi, who was comparable to a Grand Master of the Holy Land. He would be in the upper reaches among those at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","As for the Sect Masters of the Holy Thunder Sect and the other super sects, most of them were at the lower level of the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. Zhang Han was powerful and still had strong confidence, which came from his trump cards.","“It will be great if they come here. It will be a good chance to test the power of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.”","Zhang Han made up his mind.","After that, the group didn’t stay here any longer and continued moving forward swiftly.","They also had a certain idea about how to deal with Immortal Master Sanlei.","When they left the secret realm, they would go directly to inquire about the news and send people to negotiate with the Holy Thunder Sect. Immortal Master Sanlei tried to harm them. They would ask for an explanation and turn the passive position into the active one.","To Immortal Master Waterheaven, the most important thing right now was to search for rare metals.","“This secret realm is so large that there are Profound-grade treasures in the peripheral areas. There must be more Profound-grade treasures in it, and there may also be a lot of rare metals.”","“Our primary goal is metal. Letting Lil Beast break through is the only way to resolve the crisis.”","Zhang Han was so powerful that they were shocked.","But after understanding what was going on, these people’s thoughts were all about the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“Cross the river!”","After they left the Thunder Stream Domain, in front of them was another brand new area.","There was a crisis, but Zhang Han could sense it in advance every time and escape with the others.","The outer regions made people feel mentally and physically exhausted.","“Why is this secret realm so big?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was secretly puzzled.","But this seemed to be just the beginning.","They reached the seventh zone, the eighth zone, the ninth zone, and more.","They didn’t expect that they had to go through 31 zones.","Later, some people on the team were injured.","Fortunately, they did not die.","“The aura has changed.”","“We seem to have gone to the outer area.”","“But what’s going on up ahead?”","Immortal Master Wuluo and the others looked at the scene in front of them, lost in thought.","The area ahead was filled with fog, which was similar to the land of snow they encountered when they first entered the secret realm. Their divine senses could not detect far away, so their vision was not high.","The mountain range had also changed. The rivers below were extending in all directions, and in front of them were huge square stones. The area of the mountain range was replaced by these regular square rocks. They were neatly arranged as if they were deliberately set.","The great river below, which was full of ghosts, extended into the fog. The crowd felt that everything under the boulders was water.","“The aura is indeed different.”","Zhang Han sensed it carefully.","“Let’s cross the river first.”","This time, he did not take out the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","After crossing the river dozens of times, they were familiar with the attacking methods of the ghosts and knew how to defend themselves.","After crossing the river steadily, they stepped on the first stone platform.","“Everything is normal. There doesn’t seem to be anything unusual,” Immortal Master Wuluo said in an uncertain tone. “Second Elder, can you feel anything?”","“I can’t feel anything.” Zhang Han shook his head. “The energy around is denser, and I can feel more rules of the Great Domain.”","“It’s a place full of the rules of the Great Domain.” Immortal Master Waterheaven took a deep breath and said, “This kind of place is unusual and even terrifying. The rules of the Great Domain are the Laws of the world, which can’t be violated. If we are careless, we will die. People who come in may know that this secret realm has been underestimated by the world. When the news spreads out, I’m afraid that many high-position officials and even some Grand Masters of the Holy Lands will come in person.”","“Let’s take a look while we walk.”","Zhang Han said, “We didn’t meet anyone along the way, which indirectly shows that it’s easier to go through this area.”","There were so many teams entering the secret realm. At first, Zhang Han and the others could occasionally meet a few, but later, they couldn’t meet a single team. Obviously, they were very fast, and so were the others.","It was like the highway with very few cars. It was rare to see cars on the road, but when they stood still in one place, they could see a car every once in a while. The teams in the secret realm kept moving forward like cars on the highway, heading for the depths of the secret realm.","“Let’s go!”","The crowd flew dozens of meters above the stone platforms.","Gradually, they found the problem.","“The rules of the Great Domain in the sky are getting more and more serious, and flying is getting more and more difficult.”","“If this continues, it won’t be long before we’ll only be able to walk on those stone platforms. We won’t even be able to fly.”","“Is it a No-fly Zone?”","“Fortunately, each stone platform is only a dozen meters away, and we can easily jump over it.”","“Have you discovered it?” Immortal Master Waterheaven’s expression changed.","“What do you mean?” Immortal Master Wuluo asked.","“According to the arrangement of the stone platforms, the distance between each stone platform is getting closer and closer as we move forward,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said. “According to my observation, after flying for half an hour, the distance between the stone platforms has been shortened by half a centimeter.”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and said, “Palace Master, your observation is very meticulous.”","“In such a secret realm, I naturally have to be cautious.” Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled and looked at Zhang Han. It seemed that he was a little happy, and his expression was saying, “How about that? You didn’t notice, did you?”","“It’s a good habit to observe carefully.”","Zhang Han nodded and said, “Let’s go to the stone platforms. The pressure of flying is getting stronger.”","“Okay.”","So they stepped on the stone platforms, which looked like ordinary stones.","They moved quickly on the stones, jumping every moment as if they were doing parkour.","They kept advancing like that.","The distance between the stone platforms was shortening.","Gradually, the area of the stone platforms began to grow.","At first, it was a stone platform with a length of 100 meters. As they went deeper, it became 200 meters, 300 meters, 1,000 meters, 10,000 meters, and more. The number was still increasing.","Soon, ten days had passed.","The fog around them also became thinner.","The sun hung high in the blue sky.","They could see very far away.","The current stone platform was as large and heavy as the continent.","“There’s a crowd ahead.”","“It seems that there are a lot of people.”","“What are the Dao Seeking Cultivators in a long line looking at?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They sped up a little.","When they arrived nearby, they began to observe.","“They are not from the same force.”","“Let’s take a look at the periphery first.”","There were about seven or eight rows of people standing in front of them. It was very crowded.","This was the real No-fly Zone. The Laws of the sky were everywhere. Even those at the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage could not fly more than five meters high.","The view in front of them was blocked.","The troop of the Highest Clouds Palace headed to the side. A few people turned around and glanced at them. They knew some of the forces present, but there were no acquaintances.","After walking for five hours, they finally found a place with fewer people.","“Is that Immortal Master Orna?”","Immortal Master Wuluo’s eyes lit up, and he explained via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","Immortal Master Orna was also a member of a first-rate force, similar to the Highest Clouds Palace. Since Immortal Master Wuluo knew him, he could ask him and get to know about the situation.","Zhang Han and the others walked over.","“Immortal Master Orna, it’s been a long while.” Immortal Master Wuluo greeted him.","“Oh? Wuluo?”","The Dao Seeking Cultivator with the appearance of a middle-aged man turned his head and said with a smile, “You are also here.”","“Well, what are you doing here?” Immortal Master Wuluo asked.","“We’re waiting for the sky bridge.”","Immortal Master Orna said, “Do you see the line on the edge?”","He was pointing at a black straight line at the edge of the stone platform, about one meter away from the platform.","“This line is called the Line of the Law. When you walk over, you can see the real scene in front of you. Inside the line, you can only see the blue sky and white clouds,” Immortal Master Orna said.","“Really?”","Immortal Master Wuluo pondered for a moment and looked to the side. He felt that there would be a place close to the edge after a few kilometers.","Seeing this, Immortal Master Orna instructed some of the elders of his sect, “Guys, make way for them.”","He had to show respect to Immortal Master Wuluo.","Zhang Han and the others walked over. When they crossed the black silken thread, the scene in front of them changed.","Without the stone platform, it was like a cliff. The bottom couldn’t be seen, and there was a layer of white clouds surging. In front of them, there were dense sky bridges. When Dao Seeking Cultivators stepped on each bridge, the bridge and the stone platform were cut off and extended forward.","At the same time, many people flew back from the front of the stone platform.","After observing for a while, the crowd reatreated.","Immortal Master Orna said, “You came from that place. That side is occupied by super sects or Holy Lands, because the sky bridges over there appear fast, and the ones on this side appear slowly. We have to enter the depths of the secret realm through the sky bridges. One bridge can accommodate no more than 100 people at a time. Dao Seeking Cultivators will become ordinary people on it. It’s like a running game. The bridges are broken. Some of the faults are two meters, five meters, ten meters long, and even tens of meters long. Some bridges are completely broken. We can’t jump over it in this case. When we fall into the air, our energy will be restored, and we can fly back. This is the rule of the Great Domain. There is no crisis. Whether we can cross the bridges or not depends on luck.”","“Is that so?”","Zhang Han’s expression changed slightly.","They finally understood what they had just seen.","Those who flew back from the front were the Dao Seeking Cultivators who fell from the sky bridges or didn’t jump over the overpass.","Standing on the bridge, one was an ordinary person. This was the rule of the Great Domain. It could make anyone a mortal. This was the law of the Great Domain that existed in the entire Cultivation World. It was supreme.","“There are too many rules of the Great Domain here.”","“This sky bridge is also known as the Bridge of the Law.”","Immortal Master Orna sighed with emotion. “Whether one can go to the depths of the secret realm depends on luck. Only those who can cross the bridge are qualified to step on the land on the other side of the sky bridge.”","“Why do I feel that it’s like a game?” Chen Chuan muttered, “It’s like a track race.”","“Well, it is indeed like a track race.” Mengmeng blinked.","“If there are some Exotic Beasts or special magic weapons...” said Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“They won’t work. The Exotic Beast can only turn into a small figure and fall asleep on the sky bridge. All kinds of spirit treasures will be useless.” Immortal Master Orna shook his head and said, “We’ve been here for two months and seen countless people trying all kinds of methods. It’s useless. This is the Bridge of the Law. We can only jump over it with our own strength. Maybe this is also a game of jumping.”","“Have you tried it?” Immortal Master Wuluo asked.","“I’ve tried more than 300 times, but I fell.” Immortal Master Orna shook his head and said, “In the past two months, I’ve only seen two groups of people succeed. Both groups are made up of 100 people, and some of them haven’t passed the test yet. It’s said that those who have crossed the bridge have jumped over 30 meters. It’s a little terrifying that they have achieved that with mortal bodies. They want to say something on the other side of the fault when they look back. Unfortunately, the sound failed to reach here, and no one knows what happened. It’s difficult to cross the bridge unless you’re lucky and there are fewer faults, and then you can cross it.”","After that, Immortal Master Orna sighed softly. “Only those great figures know where the sky bridges would appear more frequently. Our success rate is much lower.”","“Thank you, Immortal Master Orna.” Immortal Master Wuluo cupped his hands and said goodbye. “We’ll go to the side and observe for a while.”","“Okay.”","Immortal Master Orna also cupped his hands and watched them leave.","One of his men said, “There are too few bridges in their direction. If they want to find a good place, they can only line up. Looking at the number of people lining up, I don’t think there is much chance.”","“They got here too late.” Immortal Master Orna shook his head.","In this secret realm, of course, every force only cared about themselves. It was impossible for them to give up their positions unless they were beaten into submission.","The Highest Clouds Palace’s group walked to the side and finally found a spot.","After crossing the black silk thread, they stood on the edge of the platform and observed for two hours.","“The place where we came from just now was indeed the place where the sky bridge appears most frequently.”","“There are a lot of people going back and forth. They keep flying back, and no one succeeds.”","“When the sky bridge appears, are we going to start running by stepping on it?”","“It seems that they are running very hard.”","“...”","They kept observing the situation and learned more about it.","The sky bridge was indeed the Bridge of the Law. After it appeared, the connection between the bridge and the stone platform disappeared.","“It’s so pitiful here. The sky bridge doesn’t appear here.”","Mengmeng pouted and sounded a little dissatisfied.","“It’s been so long, but one hasn’t appeared.”","“If we walk to the right and walk a bit further, will we be able to reach a place where there are many sky bridges?” Immortal Master Waterheaven suddenly asked."]},{"number":1666,"title":"Chapter 1666 Bridge of the Law","paragraphs":["Chapter 1666 Bridge of the Law","“Maybe not. No one can say for sure.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled in understanding.","In the secret realm, anything could happen.","“The sky bridge here is rarely seen. Are you still waiting here? Has anyone gone to the side to look for other places?”","Immortal Master Wuluo asked a group of Dao Seeking Cultivators not far away.","He didn’t think it was a good idea to wait here. He might as well go somewhere else to try his luck.","How, the team on the side looked depressed, and someone answered, “Alas, we came from there.”","What he said revealed the depression of many of them. They spoke one after another.","“It’s the same over there. People from super sects and Holy Lands are everywhere in the places where the sky bridge appears frequently. Only the peripheral areas may have a chance.”","“We’ve been to two places, and it took us a month to reach a place where there are many sky bridges. Besides, there are more people in those places, and people need to line up in the areas where the sky bridge shows up rarely.”","“It’s okay here. Although we are on the edge, there will be a sky bridge in one or two days.”","“It’s your first time here and you are already in such a good place. You’re so lucky.”","“...”","There was a hint of envy on their faces.","Someone sighed and said, “This is the helplessness of our first-rate forces. When a big secret realm appears, the Holy Lands and the super sects can get the greatest benefits. Sometimes, even the first-rate forces can’t get anything.”","Zhang Han and the others looked at each other.","They had no choice but to wait here for the time being.","“Well, we’ll wait for a sky bridge to appear and try it out.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven nodded.","Immortal Master thanked those people, and both sides waited silently.","In the dense area, there was a high probability that the sky bridge would appear. However, there were more people who failed. Up to now, they had not seen success.","They didn’t know how the previous two teams crossed the bridge.","The strange thing was that among the two teams, only a small number of people had succeeded. The majority of them had failed.","What was the reason?","“Could it have something to do with one’s constitution and karmic luck?” Immortal Master Waterheaven frowned.","“Or is it related to the cultivation method?” Immortal Master Wuluo said, “When they crossed the bridge, they used some cultivation method, and then their energy resonated with the sky bridge. That is, the resonance of the Great Domain, so they could cross the bridge.”","“Guessing wouldn’t help.”","Zhang Han chuckled and said, “Almost everyone else has thought of and tried what we can think of. After all, they have been here for months.”","“Yes, calm down, and let’s just watch the fun.” Zi Yan smiled.","In her opinion, treasures were not important. It was fine as long as everyone was safe.","Although it was dangerous in the secret realm, the aura Zhang Han inadvertently emitted was very stable, as if everything was under his control.","He was her powerful guardian.","“Yes. Calm down. Let’s go to the sky bridge to play later,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","“Be serious.”","Zhang Han pulled a wry smile. “Although we have to calm down, the sky bridge is the Bridge of the Law and is made up of the rules of the Great Domain. We can’t control the situation on the bridge. We will all be ordinary people there, so let’s relax and watch the fun now. When we get on the bridge, we have to be careful.”","Zhang Han only said that they should be careful about what they needed to pay attention to, which was enough.","“So we’re going to watch the fun now?”","Mengmeng blinked and quickly took out a few bags of snacks and some fruits.","Under the gazes of Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and the others, two tables and some chairs appeared.","Mengmeng, Zi Yan, and Lisa were sitting together. There were snacks and fruits on the table. Yue Wuwei was making tea, while Zhang Han was sitting there and handing out some small stools.","He said casually, “Everyone, take a seat. We’ll have to wait here for a while before the sky bridge appears.”","“Uh... Second Elder, you’re in such a good mood.”","“I like it. Haha, shall we have a drink?”","As soon as these words were spoken, Immortal Master Waterheaven’s indifferent gaze shifted over, and that person covered his face.","In the secret realm, people couldn’t drink. He almost forgot the rules.","However, it was okay to drink tea.","Therefore, everyone sat there, drinking tea and watching the show.","Seeing this, some teams around began to imitate.","All of a sudden, many first-rate forces on the right side of the bridge were sitting on the edge, having tea and snacks. They looked at the crowd flying back from the middle area, talking and laughing.","It felt as if they were silently expressing, “Go ahead with your work. We’ll just watch. Anyway, you can’t succeed.”","“Are those people taking us for a show?”","Some people from the super sects and Holy Lands were quite dissatisfied.","But there were too many first-rate forces. They couldn’t say anything about what those people were doing, so they turned a blind eye to it.","“Palace Master, Palace Master!”","Ten hours later, Immortal Master Wuluo suddenly opened his eyes wide. “Look over there. It’s the people from the Dongruo Holy Land. It’s Holy Son Yake.”","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven looked over and saw that in the air not far from the left, Holy Son Yake and a group of one hundred people had flown back.","“Who is the leader?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s pupils constricted. “It’s the third Super Master of the Dongruo Holy Land, Immortal Master Wumo. He actually came?”","“Come on, let’s step back. Don’t be discovered by them.” Immortal Master Wuluo’s face changed greatly.","The other elders were the same. Their faces were slightly pale.","It was obvious that the other party’s background was not low, in other words, he was very powerful.","“Who is Immortal Master Wumo?”","Zhang Han looked calm, but as they moved a few meters to the left, they were blocked by the people in the team on the left.","He hadn’t broken through to the Peak Stage of the seventh tier yet, so he didn’t intend to cause unnecessary trouble.","“Immortal Master Wumo is very famous in the Seventh Mountain.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven spoke via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, and even his voice was mixed with a trace of fear.","“I really didn’t expect that he would actually come out of the mountain. Immortal Master Wumo is only second to the Grand Master of the Dongruo Holy Land, and he is also the Killing God of the Dongruo Holy Land. When that force fought for territories, countless people at the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage were killed by Immortal Master Wumo. He has slaughtered many experts and is an extremely terrible person. He has a cruel temper and is like a tyrant. He is extremely fierce and famous. He’s well known in both the Eighth Mountain and the Sixth Mountain.","“He makes everyone terrified by just hearing his name. This is Immortal Master Wumo’s power. He is too terrifying. Now, he is already at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. If he discovers us and Holy Son Yake says something to him, I’m afraid that he will kill all of us.”","As soon as he said that, Zhang Han thought for a moment and asked, “How is the strength of Immortal Master Wumo compared with that of Immortal Master Lingxi?”","“How can he compare with Immortal Master Lingxi? She is in the Ninth Mountain, and the two of them have never fought before.” Immortal Master Waterheaven was stunned.","Zhang Han was speechless.","He asked that because he only knew Immortal Master Lingxi for sure now.","“In terms of all kinds of battles, I think Immortal Master Wumo is slightly stronger than Immortal Master Lingxi. It’s mainly because she doesn’t take action very often. Based on the previous information, I personally feel that’s the case.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed softly. “Be it Immortal Master Lingxi or Immortal Master Wumo, they are people that we can’t afford to offend. The key is that Holy Son Yake still wants to deal with us, alas.”","At this moment, hearing the words of the first-class forces on both sides, many people were exclaiming.","“Immortal Master Wumo and the others are back. I thought they would succeed. They have been on the sky bridge for more than ten hours.”","“The sky bridge is difficult to cross. Immortal Master Wumo is the strongest one here, and even he has not succeeded.”","“This is actually a good thing. It also proves that luck is needed to cross the sky bridge, and not strength.”","“...”","The people next to them were talking about it. Immortal Master Wumo was like the moon surrounded by stars, and he was the focus of everyone’s attention.","On the side of the super sects, some people also cupped their hands and said with a smile, “Immortal Master Wumo, you’re back too.”","“Yes.” Immortal Master Wumo looked relatively aloof. He just nodded slightly, and his lofty posture was fully displayed.","“Damn that sky bridge.” Holy Son Yake said in an angry tone, “Even Uncle Wang can’t cross it. I really should smash this place.”","“Hahaha, Holy Son, don’t be angry.” Someone comforted him. “We’ve all failed 49 times, but you have only tried five times. Your chances are still big.”","“Humph.”","Holy Son Yake snorted and ignored him.","There were many people greeting him and the Immortal Master, but they didn’t notice Zhang Han and the others.","After all, there were too many first-rate forces on both sides. How could those people attract their attention?","...","“Palace Master.”","Immortal Master Wuluo whispered, “Immortal Master Wumo is here. Shall we leave?”","“Okay.”","Right at this moment.","Swoosh! Swoosh!","Suddenly, in front of Zhang Han, two sky bridges appeared at the same time.","After the crowd waited for more than ten hours, the bridges finally appeared once.","On the other side, Immortal Master Wumo looked indifferent. He led the team to the newly appeared bridge and ran away.","“You’re so lucky. It’s only been a dozen hours, and the sky bridges show up.”","The team on the right said with a smile, “Our sky bridges are next to each other. How about this? You only have more than 30 people, and we have more than 60 people. Why don’t we take care of each other on the bridges?”","Zhang Han slightly moved his eyes and asked, “How are we going to do that?”","“It’s easy to have faults on the sky bridges. Just like a dead end, it’s the kind that can’t be passed. But if we’re next to each other, the person on the bridge can pull someone on the other bridge over. It’s not a failure. We can go further on one bridge at the same time. After all, the sky bridge is just a way. Our purpose is to pass it. What do you think?”","“People on the sky bridges can pull each other?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others pondered for a moment.","“That’s right, but the limit is 100 people,” the leader on the right said. “We have 93 people in total. Of course, it doesn’t matter if you don’t want to. I just have a suggestion.”","The people on the sky bridges would all be mortals. This leader had more people. If there was a fight between the two sides, it was natural for the other side to be afraid.","“We’re in.”","That person felt like the other party might refuse, but Immortal Master Waterheaven agreed, causing him to laugh. “Great. Then I wish us success.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Everyone got on the sky bridges one after another.","“Palace Master, Immortal Master Wumo is here. Are we still going to cross the bridge?” Immortal Master Wuluo said in a worried tone, “If we meet him, then...”","“If he dares to attack, release Lil Beast to deal with him.” A fierce look was in Immortal Master Waterheaven’s eyes.","After communicating with Zhang Han, he learned that he could escape unscathed, so he was confident.","Although the attack of the Golden-armored Giant Beast was not very strong, Zhang Han felt that Immortal Master Wumo might hurt the Golden-armored Giant Beast. However, if they wanted to leave, Immortal Master Wumo could not stop them."]},{"number":1667,"title":"Chapter 1667 The Dongruo Holy Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 1667 The Dongruo Holy Land","A strong defense gave people great confidence.","Just as Zhang Han had told Mengmeng, they didn’t need to keep a low profile in the Star Sea.","These years, Zhang Han hadn’t fought much. He just cultivated. Now that he had a lot of trump cards, he could show them his power when fighting enemies.","“Get on the bridge!” Immortal Master Waterheaven gave the order.","Everyone stepped onto the sky bridge one after another.","“Hiss!”","“It’s true. My power disappeared.”","“I’m an ordinary person.”","“It’s amazing. The bridge of the Law is true.”","Everyone present was amazed.","Fortunately, although they only had mortal bodies now, their basic physical conditions were several times better than those of ordinary people.","“Eh? Look back.”","Immortal Master Wuluo said, “We can’t see those behind us as soon as we step on the sky bridge.”","They turned their heads and saw a blue sky. There was no stone platform at all.","“The rules of the Great Domain are supreme. When we stepped on the sky bridge, we were within the Law and could not resist. We could only act according to the Law.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “Fortunately, we could see other sky bridges.”","There were sky bridges on both sides, but there was only one sky bridge on the right and many on the left.","The bridge was far away from the bridge where the Immortal Master Wumo was. They couldn’t see it with their eyes. The people on it looked like sesame seeds. The other party also couldn’t see them. This was also reassuring.","The sky bridge was five meters wide, and there was a fault behind it. The sky bridge was still dissipating. There was a faint mist in front of them, and they could only see things about 300 meters ahead.","“The sky bridge behind us is dissipating. From the looks of it, we can only speed up quickly,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","At this time, the team on the right also shouted, “Run faster. Balance the speed of dissipation of the sky bridge’s back. The faster you run, the more time you will have to think of countermeasures in various situations. Otherwise, you will fall off the sky bridge and waste a chance.”","“Okay! Thank you.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “Let’s begin running.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","More than 30 people set off and ran quickly.","“Be quick to run.” Mengmeng smiled.","At this time, she felt like she was in a game.","“Run quickly!” Chen Chuan called out.","It only took them about five seconds to run a hundred meters.","In this way, they ran for two hours and maintained a balance with the team on the right. The distance was about four meters.","Gradually, the third hour passed.","However, the distance between the two sky bridges got farther.","They were six meters away from each other now.","“It seems that we can’t take care of each other. Six meters is too far.” The leader on the right said, “I wish you success.”","“I also wish you success.” Immortal Master Wuluo waved his hand.","After the fourth hour, they were ten meters away.","After the fifth hour, the distance between them was 30 meters. They had been getting farther and farther.","At this time, a fault appeared on the bridge on the right. At a glance, it was more than 70 meters long.","“Ah! We’re so unlucky. This is a dead bridge.” They were helpless.","They were helpless.","Zhang Han also stopped to take a look.","The fault on his side was three meters.","Was it due to luck?","“Alas!”","The leader on the right sighed, looked over, and said, “Forget it. We’ll wait for the next sky bridge. It only takes five hours to fail. We failed too fast. Generally speaking, it should at least take five hours for different faults to appear. Oh! By the way, we can also use swords, ropes, and other tools. Be careful. We’ll go first.”","After that, the team jumped off the sky bridge one after another.","Then their figures disappeared. In the next second, the sky bridge slowly dissipated.","“That’s true. Once we step onto the bridge, space will change.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly.","It was easy to jump over three meters.","However, there was more than one fault.","There were some faults four-meter, six-meter, eight-meter, ten-meter, and even twenty-meter.","There were many. Fortunately, Zhang Han and the others had good physiques, so their extreme jumping distance was about 30 meters.","As they jumped, they moved forward.","At the same time, they could see fewer and fewer bridges on the left and right sides.","“Huh?”","After running to a place, they found that the broken sky bridge in front of them was 10 meters higher than here, and there was also some distance between them. The length of the two bridges was about 30 meters. It was at the limit of their jumping.","Immortal Master Waterheaven rubbed his chin. “It’s a bit difficult.”","“We can use some tools.”","Immortal Master Wuluo said, “I have a chain, which is 50 meters long. I don’t know if we need it and if all of us can jump over it. I can throw the chain over. Then everyone can climb over it.”","He took out the chain from his Space Ring.","Boom!","There was a dull sound when it fell on the sky bridge.","“Does it weigh about 50 kilograms?” Immortal Master Waterheaven said. “It is not easy to throw it. If it’s not thrown properly, it can even carry a few people away with it.”","He pointed to the void beside the sky bridge in front of his feet.","“Don’t you have any treasures about ropes and chains?” Immortal Master Wuluo asked.","“I have one five meters long.”","“It’s eight meters long.”","“Thirteen meters.”","“Twenty meters.”","“Alas.” Upon hearing these words, Immortal Master Waterheaven said helplessly, “Without energy, treasures can’t grow any longer.”","“I have a suitable treasure.” Mengmeng chuckled and took out a ribbon. “This is 30 meters long. It’s very light, very soft, and can be stretched.”","“Ha... The Profound-grade treasure you just obtained is of use.” Immortal Master Waterheaven laughed.","He forgot about the ribbon just now.","“Let me jump.”","Zhang Han held one end of the ribbon in his right hand and looked up.","Others could jump 30 meters at most. He had to jump farther.","He stepped back dozens of meters, ran, jumped, and launched onto the platform of the sky bridge behind the fault.","“Hurry up! Climb over here.” Zhang Han said.","“We’re coming.”","Mengmeng grabbed the ribbon and said, “Mummy, you go first.”","“Okay.”","Zi Yan nodded, grabbed the ribbon with both hands, crossed her long legs, and climbed up. A few seconds later, she arrived at the opposite side.","The others climbed one after another.","The last person even didn’t have to climb. He was pulled up by the others.","“What’s going on?”","They met another fault the same as before.","“Should we continue?” Immortal Master Waterheaven looked at Zhang Han.","It could be seen that Zhang Han had the best physical strength among all the people present.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han took a light breath and said, “But I may not succeed this time.”","The distance was the same, but the approach distance was only a dozen meters this time.","“Come on! If you don’t succeed, we’ll jump down too.” Mengmeng encouraged.","“Wait a minute,” Zhang Han said.","He smiled, trotted, and jumped.","His figure was elegant, but it seemed that he would fail.","“Oh!”","Chen Chuan covered his eyes. He thought that Uncle Zhang was going to fall. But the next second, he heard the cheers around him.","He opened his eyes.","Zhang Han grabbed the edge of the bridge with one hand and turned over with all his strength.","“Wow! Uncle Zhang is so cool,” Chen Chuan said excitedly.","“Don’t talk nonsense. Come on up,” Zhang Han said on the sky bridge.","“You go first.” Yue Wuwei glanced at Zi Yan.","Zi Yan, Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, Chen Chuan, Lisa, and Yue Wuwei climbed one after another.","When he got on a new bridge again, they saw a different fault in front of them.","“Is this a cliff?”","The sky bridge in front of them was vertical, about 100 meters high. It was vertical down at a 90-degree angle.","“How could we go there?”","Everyone felt their scalps go numb.","“Look!”","Someone pointed at the cliff. “There’s a small crack or a protruding point every once in a while. Can we climb on it through these things?”","“Isn’t this climbing with bare hands?” Chen Chuan said with his lightly bright eyes “I’ve tried this before.”","“Judging from the number, we should be able to pass,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","“We can go there. But if we fall from a height of dozens of meters and fall on the bridge, we will die.” Zhang Han pointed to the bridge and said, “Within the scope of the bridge, we are all ordinary people.”","“Hiss!”","There were gasps all around.","Everyone gasped because they didn’t notice it before.","Some people in the crowd, who were thoughtful, directly took out soft treasures.","“This is the quilt I usually cover myself with. It’s made of the fur of an Exotic Beast. It’s relatively soft. Let’s take out something soft and put it on our bodies. With our physical strength, we can also bear the impact of the fall.”","Thus, the crowd took out all sorts of treasures.","Some even took out some clothes.","“The swords and broadswords can also be inserted in the cracks if we can step on them.”","“It’s a pity that there are no large gemstones. It would be more stable to pile them up into a staircase.”","“I thought the fault was simply a gap, but I didn’t expect there to be so many situations.”","A lot of people offered advice.","Zhang Han led the team forward.","Some broadswords and swords could indeed be inserted into the cracks, making it much more convenient to step on them.","However, they still felt afraid.","“I’m a little scared.” Halfway up the mountain, Zi Yan licked her red lips.","“Don’t be afraid. We have the ribbon.”","Zhang Han deliberately tied the ribbon with his wife and daughter. It would be better if Zhang Han could hold on. Or else, the three of them would fall together.","Yue Wuwei and the others were in the same situation.","“Other people’s sky bridges are not so complicated.”","The bridge on their left was less complex.","“Ah!”","Plop!","Someone fell. He was not injured, but he had to climb up again.","At the end of this journey, everyone had a special sense of satisfaction.","“We made it,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","Zhang Han’s face didn’t look very happy. “Look ahead. Do you still want to celebrate?”","“Really?”","When they saw it clearly, they found a new cliff ahead. Both the cracks and the protruding points were much smaller, and the height was three times higher than that of the cliff they had climbed.","“Climbing with bare hands? We were in the novice area just now. Now, we’re in the advanced area.” Yue Wuwei was speechless. “What does the sky bridge mean? Alas! It’s difficult to deal with it.”","“The dissipating point behind us is getting closer and closer to us.”","Zhang Han looked back and said in a deep voice, “We have to speed up.”","They took out another batch of soft things.","They took out mattresses, bedding, clothes, and so on and put them under the cliff.","They began to climb at a much slower speed this time.","In the end, everyone succeeded. It seemed to be difficult, but they succeeded without big trouble.","“There’s finally a straight road ahead. My arms are numb now, and I’m about to lose consciousness. Oh my god, it’s so difficult,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","“There is a curved bridge ahead, and the fault point is so close to us.”","There was a sky bridge on the left side of the road, only three or four meters away. The sky bridge was like a curved semicircle. The road ahead seemed to be broken, but there was no fault here. It was a straight road.","When everyone came up, someone said, “Wait! Isn’t that the team of the Immortal Master Wumo over there?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s pupils constricted. “How could it be them? How could we encounter them?”","“Are we so unlucky?” Immortal Master Wuluo’s scalp tingled.","The expressions of the others present also changed, and they were rather fearful.","Since they could see the other party, the other party could naturally see them.","“Ha... They are from the Highest Clouds Palace!”","Holy Son Yake suddenly laughed out loud. He said, “How dare you show up in front of me again?”"]},{"number":1668,"title":"Chapter 1668 Tit for Tat","paragraphs":["Chapter 1668 Tit for Tat","“Palace Master, what should we do?”","Immortal Master Wuluo’s forehead was covered with cold sweat.","None of them expected such a thing. Their sky bridge was at the periphery. How could they meet the team of the Dongruo Holy Land in the center?","Had they gotten close to the center, or had the sky bridge of the Dongruo Holy Land been crooked?","Immortal Master Wuluo looked around. He not only saw the sky bridge of the Dongruo Holy Land on the left but also the sky bridge that had appeared a few hours ago on the right.","It seemed that their sky bridge had turned closer to the center.","“We’re so unlucky.” Yue Wuwei said, his facial muscles trembling.","“Come here quickly. Didn’t you hear what I said?” The face of Holy Son Yake darkened, and he scolded.","“If it’s a blessing, it’s not a curse. If it’s a curse, it’s unavoidable.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said in a low voice.","After exchanging a look with Zhang Han, he led the team forward.","Finally, they came closer to the team of the Dongruo Holy Land. Its people were all standing on the side of the fault. The fault was so deep. They were unable to see the end of it. The other party was walking toward a dead end.","The bridge in front of Zhang Han and the others was a very long and straight path. There was not even a fault in the path ahead. The shortest distance from the people of the Dongruo Holy Land was only three to four meters.","“You finally come.”","Holy Son Yake was arrogant. He said disdainfully, “It’s almost time for the Highest Clouds Palace to take action. Have you prepared the ancient demonic beast yet?”","At this time, Immortal Master Wumo leading the Dongruo Holy Land opened his eyes. The momentum around him instantly changed.","Immortal Master Wumo who was famous and overbearing imperceptibly gave them high pressure.","“I’m asking you.”","A cold light flashed in the eyes of Holy Son Yake. He stared at Immortal Master Waterheaven and said slowly, “Next time, if you dare to answer a second late, I will kill one of you.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven gritted his teeth. He was extremely angry, but he could do nothing.","He said, “I wonder what Holy Son Yake is talking about?”","“Ha...”","One of the subordinates next to Holy Son Yake sneered and said, “You’re forgetful. The Highest Clouds Palace is interesting. Last time, you shivered when seeing us. But now, you’re pretending to be calm. You’re really not afraid of death.”","“Cut the crap. Holy Son asked you to prepare the ancient demonic beast last time. Are you ready?” Another person said.","“Holy Son Yake.” Immortal Master Waterheaven’s expression became even calmer. He said, “As I said last time, the ancient demonic beast has recognized its host, and it is no longer in my hands. Aren’t you forcing me?”","“What are you talking about?”","Immortal Master Wumo suddenly spoke.","As soon as he spoke, some of the subordinates of Holy Son Yake immediately fell silent.","“Are you kidding me? It’s okay to help our host, Yake. But if we disturb Immortal Master Wumo, we’ll be sinners.”","“Immortal Master Wumo.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven cupped his hands and said, “Not long ago, I got an ancient demonic beast. I tried to let it recognize me as its host for 19 years, but I failed. Later, it recognized a fated person as its host, so I don’t have any ancient demonic beast now.”","“Are you kidding me?”","The expression of the Holy Son Yake was ferocious. “Do you think I haven’t heard of it? Your ancient demonic beast is in the hands of the Second Elder. Who is the Second Elder? Come out!”","He looked like he was going to kill someone. If it were anyone else, the person might keep quiet out of fear.","After all, Immortal Master Wumo was famous. Even if he just stood there, he looked invincible.","Unfortunately, his opponent was Zhang Han.","“I’m the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace. The ancient demonic beast is indeed in my hands.” Zhang Han took two steps forward and said with a faint smile, “Do you have any problem?”","“No. If you take out the ancient demonic beast and give it to my Uncle, perhaps I can spare the Highest Clouds Palace.” Holy Son Yake sneered.","“What kind of ancient demonic beast is it?” Immortal Master Wumo asked indifferently.","“Star Demon Dragon King.” Zhang Han looked calm.","Hearing his words, Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and the others changed their expressions.","“It turns out to be a Star Demon Dragon King.” The eyes of the Immortal Master Wumo flickered slightly. It was obvious that he was tempted.","“You’re quite cooperative.”","Holy Son Yake said, “What are you waiting for? Hurry up and take us there. There are too many people on your side. Except for the Second Elder, everyone else should jump down.”","Judging from his attitude, he thought that he could play with the people of the Highest Clouds Palace.","“Let those women hold hands and make a bridge. I want to step on them,” Holy Son Yake said.","As soon as he said that, Zhang Han gradually withdrew the sneer. He turned his eyes to look at Holy Son Yake and frowned slightly. “How can people like you live until now?”","“What did you say?” The face of Holy Son Yake suddenly changed.","“I didn’t say anything.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and smiled. He looked at the people beside him and said, “Come on! Give them a hand and pull them over.”","“Are you kidding me?” Immortal Master Waterheaven used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique. “Will you let them come over?”","“It doesn’t matter.”","Zhang Han gave him a look.","After hesitating for three seconds, Immortal Master Waterheaven finally walked over with Immortal Master Wuluo, hand in hand.","“You go first.” Holy Son Yake looked coldly at the side and casually pointed at a subordinate next to him.","“Okay!”","The subordinate also held hands with his companion. When he reached the people on the other side, they could exchange with each other. According to the Law, the people on the other side of the sky bridge could come over, but the number of people could not exceed 100.","When the subordinates of Holy Son Yake crossed the bridge, there was a strange look in the eyes of the Immortal Master Wumo.","Holy Son Yake sneered.","However, Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said, “They still have some sense of safety.”","Swoosh!","Boom!","Just as the subordinate of Holy Son Yake arrived, Zhang Han kicked him down.","“How dare you?”","Holy Son Yake was furious. “How dare you beat my subordinate?”","“Come back!”","Immortal Master Wuluo pulled Immortal Master Waterheaven back.","They were also a little shocked. They didn’t expect Zhang Han to make such a sudden move.","It turned out that he had such a plan. However, he had offended the Dongruo Holy Land completely.","Immortal Master Wumo smiled faintly. “Aren’t you afraid of me?”","“Why should I be afraid of you?” Zhang Han said calmly.","“Ha...”","Immortal Master Wumo clapped his hands and said, “Good! You are brave. I haven’t come out for many years. It seems many people in the world don’t know me.”","“You’re courting death. I must kill you!” Holy Son Yake roared.","“Not to mention you, who do you think the Dongruo Holy Land is?” Zhang Han shook his head and said, “I, Zhang Hanyang, am here, and so is the ancient demonic beast. If you want it, come here!”","“Very good.” Immortal Master Wumo nodded. “See you on the platform.”","After that, he simply jumped off the broken bridge.","Holy Son Yake pointed at them.","Before he could say anything, Mengmeng said sarcastically, “Ugly people always make more trouble. They look so strange, and their heads seem to have been kicked by a donkey. How dare they still come out and scare people? It’s disgusting.”","“Son of a bitch!” Yue Xiaonao snapped.","“Idiot!” Chen Chuan shouted.","“Ha...” Holy Son Yake laughed out of extreme anger. When he heard those words he had never heard before, he knew they were cursing even if he didn’t know the details. He kept nodding and said, “Good! See you on the platform.”","“Remember one thing.”","Zhang Han suddenly said, “When we meet on the platform, I’ll be the first to kill you.”","“I’ll be waiting.”","Holy Son Yake was furious. He didn’t want to stay here any longer. He could see and communicate with the other party, but he couldn’t beat them. The feeling was too disgusting.","The people on his team jumped down one after another.","In their opinion, the success rate of the sky bridge was very low. Perhaps the people of the Highest Clouds Palace would return in a moment.","“Let’s go forward.”","Zhang Han didn’t bother to look at the others and took the lead in moving forward.","After jumping off the sky bridge, the vision of Holy Son Yake and the others changed. They could see a few Dao Seeking Cultivators around, and they could also see the stone platform in the distance from the rear.","“Uncle, they are too hateful. I will kill them myself later,” Holy Son Yake said.","Immortal Master Wumo didn’t say a word. He silently flew back to the stone platform and stood on the edge. He didn’t go on the newly appeared bridge but waited.","Seeing this, Holy Son Yake knew that the people of the Highest Clouds Palace were doomed!","They waited for three hours.","“Haven’t they returned yet?”","“Can they pass on their bridge?”","“Could it be that they’ve passed?”","“It’s fishy. It’s so strange. Why did they cross the bridge?”","They stood there and waited.","“Get on the bridge!”","Immortal Master Wumo frowned deeply, but his expression seemed to have thought of something, and he immediately spoke.","Holy Son Yake looked at the others from the Dongruo Holy Land and said, “When the people of the Highest Clouds Palace fly out, capture them all!”","After that, the team with more than 100 people led by Holy Son Yake and Immortal Master Wumo set foot on the new sky bridge again.","After getting on the bridge, Immortal Master Wumo said indifferently, “This is the bridge of the Law. Maybe what we see with our naked eyes is an illusion, just like the Inner Demon Tribulation. It is related to the state of mind. Keep your mentality stable, and then...”","Under everyone’s gaze, Immortal Master Wumo looked ahead and his words couldn’t be heard.","“Uncle, and then? You didn’t say anything,” Holy Son Yake asked.","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Wumo said, “Didn’t I just say? Keep your mentality...”","His words couldn’t be heard again.","“Can’t you hear me?” The pupils of Immortal Master Wumo shrank.","He suddenly realized that he had found the rules.","At this time, Zhang Han and the others were talking.","Yue Wuwei suddenly said, “Is it similar to the Inner Demon Tribulation?”","Zhang Han suddenly understood. He was stunned for two seconds and said, “I’ve experienced something about the rules of Great Domain before. Could it be that we should maintain...”","His words couldn’t be heard.","“What happened?” Zi Yan asked in a daze, “I suddenly couldn’t hear you, nor could I see your face.”","“I see.”","Zhang Han was suddenly enlightened. “I see. This is the bridge made up of the Law. This is indeed the bridge made by the Law. The law can’t be disclosed. None of us can break it. Therefore, my voice couldn’t be transmitted just now.”","“What is it? Have you found the way to cross the bridge?” Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others were somewhat perplexed.","“I’ll tell you slowly. Listen carefully.”","Zhang Han took a light breath and said, “As the saying goes, when there is a song in your heart, you can enjoy it. When the boat comes to the end of the bridge, it will go straightly. It is about a kind of free mentality. As we have all experienced the Inner Demon Tribulation, its surface may be an illusion. Then, when you see through the illusion, you can naturally pass it. The most important thing is your state of mind. This may be the right way.”","“Oh! It’s the Inner Demon Tribulation. That is to say, the sky bridge may not be...” Mengmeng said casually.","However, there was no sound in the second half of the sentence.","She understood what Zhang Han meant.","Some of the others also thought of something.","Their eyes lit up one after another.","“Could it be that when we encounter a fault, we can naturally enjoy ourselves?” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","Zhang Han nodded and said, “Maybe it’s true, or maybe it’s not. Let’s try after finding a fault.”","“If we succeed, we’ll pass the barrier in one go,” Immortal Master Wuluo said with a smile.","It was exciting to think about it.","They would be so lucky to pass the barrier in one go. Of course, this was mainly due to the experience of some predecessors.","“We may have found the starting point, but it is not easy. It mainly depends on whether we can maintain a stable state of mind. There must be other people who have found it, but many of them have failed,” Zhang Han said in a deep voice."]},{"number":1669,"title":"Chapter 1669 My Name Is Hanyang","paragraphs":["Chapter 1669 My Name Is Hanyang","“That makes sense.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven let out a soft sigh. “Some of the groups have stayed here for a few months. They haven’t gone over yet. Clearly, even if it’s related to our mental states, it will be very difficult for us to maintain them. Do you have any unique method?”","“A unique method.”","Yue Wuwei thought for a moment and said, “This method can only be tried. Generally speaking, don’t trust your eyes. Believe in your heart and keep your state of mind stable. It will be better if you can get through it. If not, it may have nothing to do with your state of mind.”","The crowd began to discuss.","Although many of the words were silenced by the bridge of the Law, everyone gradually understood.","“Find the taboo words.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","It was as if they were playing a riddle game. As they kept trying, they found a lot more. The more taboo words they knew, the closer they were to the law.","Even if they ran continuously on a straight and long road, they would meet a fault.","There was a boundless void in front of them. There was a vast fog in the distance.","“There’s no way out.”","Zhang Han thought for a moment, took the ribbon, and tied seven people together. “I don’t know if it works for the bridge of the Law. Let’s go there hand in hand at the same time. If one of us fails, we may fall off together.”","“I want to join you.” Immortal Master Wuluo approached him and said.","“They are two families. Why are you joining in the fun? Come and join us.” Immortal Master Waterheaven glared at him.","“That’s right. Don’t join in the fun here.” Mengmeng pouted.","Now that they were familiar with each other, they talked more casually.","Immortal Master Wuluo smiled and went back to Immortal Master Waterheaven. They and the others were divided into three groups and tied together with ropes.","“A total of four groups.”","After saying that, Immortal Master Waterheaven paused for a second.","He was thinking about the Dongruo Holy Land outside.","At this time, Zhang Han said, “It’s safer for us to be tied up. With one more ribbon, all of us can advance and retreat together.”","“Yes.”","Immortal Master Wuluo nodded. “If some of us are alone and caught by the people of the Dongruo Holy Land, it will be bad.”","As a result, everyone got busy. After everything was done, they could see that the sky bridge not far behind them began to dissipate.","That was to say, they didn’t have much time on the sky bridge. They only had two choices, success or failure.","It was better that such success or failure was not a crisis.","“We’ll be naturally happy when we have music in our hearts.”","“We’ll cross the bridge when we come to it.”","“Pay attention to our state of mind and don’t believe what’s in front of us.”","Zhang Han said in a deep voice, “We don’t have to wait for the bridge behind to disappear. Get ready and set off directly.”","“Let’s set off in three breaths!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven decided.","After taking a few deep breaths, they went on another journey.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","When Zhang Han stepped in, everything around him disappeared.","It seemed the space was rotating, which made people dizzy. Even if they closed their eyes, they still saw something rotating constantly like a lollipop.","“Keep my state of mind stable, and the road is under my feet.”","Zhang Han was calm and could bear the dizziness.","All of a sudden, the picture kept shaking, and it was impossible to distinguish the directions. Then a rail that seemed to be that of a roller coaster running at a high speed appeared.","“It doesn’t matter. It is just an illusion.”","Zhang Han was still calm.","He was like some players who lost their balance and fell after playing games.","However, this was just the beginning. He experienced many scenes next.","The sky fell at a high speed. He fell off the cliff. He stepped on the single-log bridge. He was in the sea. He got in the chaotic flow of the starry sky. Under all kinds of circumstances, there were even all kinds of ghosts, Exotic Beasts, and countless things affecting him.","“The feeling is real. But in fact, it’s fake.”","Zhang Han moved his lips, but his mind was still calm.","Swoosh!","Just at this time, Zhang Han suddenly felt someone was pulling him.","“Someone fell.”","Zhang Han’s mouth twitched slightly.","Then, he felt heavier and heavier. In the end, he couldn’t bear the weight anymore.","A few seconds later, the surroundings returned to normal. There were a few clouds in the azure sky. He looked back and saw the stone platform in the distance.","One of the members of the team blushed.","“I’m sorry. I felt that an ancient demonic beast was real. It wanted to attack me, so I panicked.”","“Me too.” Another person raised his hand and said, “But I faced a flying sword, not an ancient demonic beast. It was a particularly sharp flying sword.”","“I couldn’t bear it either.”","“Me too.”","“Alas! It’s all the same.”","It turned out that more than a dozen people on the team didn’t have a stable mind.","The strength of Mengmeng and Chen Chuan was low, but they didn’t meet any problems.","“Then let’s do it again,” Immortal Master Wuluo said, “In fact, I was a little scared just now. It seems that it’s difficult to maintain the stability of my mind. I couldn’t be sure that those things were fake.”","It was very important. If they felt the attacks were real, their state of mind would definitely fluctuate.","“It seems we’ll have to face the Dongruo Holy Land next.”","“What should we do?”","There was a problem.","Immortal Master Waterheaven felt a headache coming on.","“What are you afraid of?”","Zhang Han said calmly, “They are enemies.”","“That’s right.”","Mengmeng nodded in agreement. “We just need to get rid of the enemies.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was speechless.","He didn’t know what to say.","He felt that the father and daughter’s words were simple and rude.","“Okay. What sort of storm have I not seen before? Just get rid of them.” A heroic spirit rose in Immortal Master Waterheaven’s heart.","Immortal Master Wuluo reminded him in a low voice, “The other side is the Dongruo Holy Land.”","Clatter!","The muscles on Immortal Master Waterheaven’s face trembled a few times. He couldn’t help but look back. “Hanyang, are you sure?”","“Since he said those words, he is sure.”","Mengmeng answered directly.","“Then what are we waiting for? Let’s go!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven called out loudly.","In fact, except for Zhang Han, everyone else was a little nervous. After all, the Highest Clouds Palace was just a first-rate force, while the Dongruo Holy Land was the top force of the Star Sea.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They had just experienced the physical conditions of ordinary people. Now that their supernatural power had returned to their body, they felt a lot more confident.","On the way back, they talked.","“We can’t fly far around. It seems that when we land, there is also a general passage. The Law doesn’t allow us to fly horizontally.”","“This place is not easy to pass, but we have found the right way.”","“I’ll try again. I think I can hold on.”","While they were talking, they were about to reach the stone platform.","The people on the stone platform also saw them.","“Is that Immortal Master Waterheaven over there?”","“They are from the Highest Clouds Palace!”","“The Holy Son has ordered us to seize them as soon as we meet them.”","“Surround them. Don’t let them escape.”","There were over a thousand people from the Dongruo Holy Land. They attracted a lot of attention in the central region after they moved.","A super sect next to them asked happily, “Why are you in such a hurry to go there?”","“We’ll catch them!”","“Really?”","When they heard the answer, many forces looked like they were watching a show.","Some people from the super sects said, “If you need help, we can help.”","“The Dongruo Holy Land has always been close to us. I’ll see who dares to provoke the Dongruo Holy Land.”","They didn’t mind adding icing on the cake.","Their words had shown their attitude.","A small number of people from the super sects also followed them.","“The Dongruo Holy Land is in charge of business. Everyone else, stay far away.”","The leader of the Dongruo Holy Land was a middle-aged man with a black beard. He spoke coldly to the people from the first-rate forces around him.","Swoosh!","Like ebbing tides, these first-rate forces all hid far away.","Even the group of people next to the team of the Highest Clouds Palace were a little frightened at this time.","“Oh, my god! They caused trouble!”","“After such a long time, they’ve persisted for a very long time. I felt that they had passed.”","“I didn’t expect that they would fail in the end.”","“They’ve run into a tough nut. How can a force like us possibly stand a chance against a Holy Land?”","A few seconds later, Zhang Han and the others stood on the stone platform one after another. At this time, they had been surrounded.","“Immortal Master Waterheaven? Highest Clouds Palace?”","The middle-aged man with a black beard sneered and said, “Come with us. Holy Son Yake let us catch you immediately after meeting the people of the Highest Clouds Palace. Take them all away.”","“Okay!”","More than 50 people came out of the crowd of more than 300 people and walked over aggressively.","“Are they not here?”","Zhang Han looked a little surprised.","“Should we start?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked.","He planned to start the strongest fighting style as soon as Zhang Han gave the order.","“Let me do it. You can watch the show.” Zhang Han smiled.","Zhang Han decided to keep a low profile. When his name, Han Yang Immortal, was heard, there would be a group of people who remembered him. He had defeated 10 super sects with the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage and attracted the divine thunder over the sky. At that time, all his achievements would let the Dongruo Holy Land not dare to fight against him.","Therefore, in the face of dozens of people coming, Zhang Han stepped forward. His face was calm, and his tone was a little emotional.","“In fact, I don’t like to kill people now. I even like a stable life. Unfortunately, there are always some self-righteous things in this world. If you want to blame someone for your death, blame Holy Son Yake. I’ll give you three seconds. If you don’t want to die, you can leave.”","“Ha...”","The group of people seemed to have heard a joke.","“Who do you think you are?”","“Who let you have the courage?”","“He’s from the Highest Clouds Palace. Those who don’t know him might think he’s a Holy Son of some Holy Land.”","“Such a person... Hiss! What is this?”","Some people didn’t even finish their words.","Zhang Han’s body changed.","He suddenly rose by one meter. Two horns appeared on his head. His skin became slightly dark. His eyes were like those of a devil’s, and there was a faint black fog around him.","Clatter!","He waved his sleeve. More than 50 people in front of him kept twisting and finally turned into a pool of blood.","These people in the ordinary eighth-tier Tribulation Stage or the Early-Stage ninth-tier Tribulation Stage were not difficult for Zhang Han to deal with now.","He killed more than 50 people with one move.","Many people present were shocked.","“How dare you kill people from our Dongruo Holy Land?”","The black-bearded middle-aged man’s face was slightly pale. He was furious, but he was also afraid.","“Dongruo Holy Land, you’re truly impressive.","“Do you know that even your Grand Master has to bow his head to me?”","Zhang Han smiled coldly. “Remember! My name is Hanyang.”"]},{"number":1670,"title":"Chapter 1670 A Sudden Increase in Success Rate","paragraphs":["Chapter 1670 A Sudden Increase in Success Rate","Buzz!","The power of the Great Demon’ Figure was fully displayed.","For a moment, the platform was filled with the demonic Qi.","The people from the Dongruo Holy Land turned into pools of blood one after another.","The eighth-tier Tribulation Stage and the ninth-tier Early Stage couldn’t withstand the power of the Great Demon’s Figure at all.","Only those at the Last-Stage or the Middle-Stage ninth tier could hold on and retreat.","The faces of this group of people were filled with horror.","“He’s a demonic cultivator!”","“We can’t stop them. Let’s go!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Those who could run had all fled. Faced with a life-and-death crisis, how dare they step forth to stop Zhang Han? They could only watch helplessly as the great majority of the people from the Dongruo Holy Land died.","It was a one-sided battle.","Zhang Han had shown his sharpness!","“How could it...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s expression changed again and again. He had never expected that Zhang Hanyang, the Second Elder, would be so powerful, many times more powerful than himself.","“Oh, my god!”","Immortal Master Wuluo opened his mouth wide.","Zhang Han was so powerful.","So many people from the Dongruo Holy Land died. After Zhang Han went out, he might meet continuous battles. Hanyang was so bold and fierce, and the key was that his strength was so strong. He had kept a low profile before. But now, his sudden outbreak not only frightened the Dongruo Holy Land but also other Holy Lands and super sects present. Even Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others were shocked.","“Be quick to dodge!”","Many onlookers were afraid of implicating themselves, so they kept backing away.","A few seconds later, hundreds of people from the Dongruo Holy Land died. The others fled far away.","Zhang Han strolled forward alone.","The people from the major forces present all stepped back.","Zhang Han alone was enough to deal with so many people.","He had boldness beyond other heroes.","“That’s unbelievable!”","“The Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace, Han Yang Immortal.”","“They declared war on the Holy Land!”","“His move is too frightening. I didn’t expect him to be so fierce before.”","The surrounding forces were in an uproar.","Under their gazes, Zhang Han took the lead to the dense sky bridges.","The super sects that had been standing in that area avoided him.","In their opinion, the people of Cloud Palace might have gone crazy. It made no difference whether they killed one or ten people. The leaders of the super sects were all on the sky bridges. These subordinates couldn’t fight against the other party. They could only dodge for the time being.","Just like that, in the eyes of everyone, Zhang Han said calmly. “Let’s get on the bridge.”","The group of people went straight to a sky bridge.","Swoosh!","After they left, many people on the stone platform began to talk.","“How dare he!”","The people in the distance from the Dongruo Holy Land approached them. Each one of them had lingering fear in their hearts.","Their voices were also filled with anger. “Highest Clouds Palace! How dare a first-rate force dare to attack us!”","“Where is his courage come from?”","“Didn’t the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace die back then? Who knows about this new Second Elder, Han Yang Immortal?”","This thing made the people from the Dongruo Holy Land feel too ashamed.","They were from a Holy Land that stood high above the masses. In the end, they were beaten miserably by a first-rate force. They had lost close to a thousand people.","Fortunately, the other forces comforted them.","“The man named Han Yang Immortal just now was too fierce. His aura made me tremble.”","“Yes. I was a little flustered just now. I was afraid that he would kill all the people present.”","“But he is only at the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage. How could he have such horrible power? In terms of aura, I even felt that he was more terrible than Immortal Master Wumo. But reason tells me that his strength is not as good as that of the Immortal Master Wumo.”","The captain of the Dongruo Holy Land sighed after a pause. “We can only wait for our leaders to come back and make the decision. We’re no match for them, so we can only hide from them to avoid too many casualties. Since the Highest Clouds Palace dares to make a move, they must have some confidence. But they’ve underestimated the power of our Dongruo Holy Land!”","“That’s all we can do.”","After Zhang Han and the others left, many forces present breathed a sigh of relief.","At the same time, everyone was puzzled.","Why dare a first-rate force attack a Holy Land?","Under normal circumstances, this was no different from throwing an egg against a rock. But now, the scene of Han Yang Immortal displaying his power was still lingering in their minds.","“It was so terrifying. His aura was too frightening.”","The crowd was deeply impressed and discussed heatedly.","“Immortal Master Wumo and the others!”","“They’re back.”","A few hours later, many people on the stone platform were shocked.","They knew that a good show was coming!","“Chief.”","“You are finally back, Holy Son.”","When they got closer, they saw that there were much fewer people.","Seeing their subordinates’ expressions, Immortal Master Wumo narrowed his eyes slightly.","Holy Son Yake said, “What are you screaming for?”","“Bad news. After the team of the Highest Clouds Palace came back, the Second Elder, Han Yang Immortal, suddenly took action. We couldn’t resist him. He was a very powerful demonic cultivator, and 936 people of our Dongruo Holy Land died,” the subordinate replied.","As he spoke, his expression was obsequious for fear that Immortal Master Wumo would kill him out of anger.","Boom!","However, the eyes of Immortal Master Wumo turned cold. He waved his hand and sent his subordinate in front of him flying.","The person didn’t die, but he was seriously injured.","Immortal Master Wumo was silent and stood there with a gloomy face.","Judging from his expression, it was obvious that he was dissatisfied. He thought these subordinates were trash.","Holy Son Yake shouted, “Trash! You fellows can’t even capture the people of the Highest Clouds Palace. What’s the use of you?”","“Holy Son, please don’t be angry.”","“We have taken action, but Han Yang Immortal is too strong.”","“Everyone present saw it. He killed more than 900 people with one hand in a few seconds. If we hadn’t retreated quickly, we would have all died there.”","His words caused others to ponder deeply.","Han Yang Immortal? The Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace?","“How high is his cultivation?” Holy Son Yake asked.","“He is at the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage. He seems to be Last-Stage. His aura is terrifying. I feel that only Immortal Master Wumo can be a match for him. He is a very powerful demonic cultivator.” Someone replied in detail. “The power of his attack made me feel desperate.”","Hearing these words, Immortal Master Wumo suddenly smiled and said, “Is he my opponent?”","“Uncle, what should we do?” Holy Son Yake looked around and asked Immortal Master Wumo in a low voice.","“Wait.”","Immortal Master Wumo stood where they were with their hands clasped behind their backs. They narrowed their eyes slightly and waited quietly.","The face of Holy Son Yake suddenly changed, and he looked a little ferocious.","Judging from his Uncle’s attitude, he had the confidence to defeat Zhang Hanyang.","“That’s right.","“Uncle has been famous for so long. As a member at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, what is there for him to be afraid of?","“Han Yang Immortal is at most at the Last-Stage ninth tier. Even if he is at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, he is not about to be a match for us.","After all, Immortal Master Wumo was so powerful. Even if he faced a person in the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, he could easily survive.","“They’re going to fight!”","“Immortal Master Wumo is powerful. It’s said that he has long reached the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage.”","“If Han Yang Immortal is also here, the battle between the two people of the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage will be interesting.”","“I heard that Immortal Master Wumo has just reached the Peak Stage. I don’t know if it’s true or not. Even if he is at the Last-Stage ninth tier, he can be a match for the other party.”","“We are still inside the secret realm. By the time they leave the secret realm, the Highest Clouds Palace will probably be removed from the world.”","“...”","Many forces present were talking about it.","Even many leaders who had returned stayed to watch the fun.","A small number of high-position officials from the super sects and several Holy Lands didn’t stay. They left in a hurry after returning.","Judging from their expressions, they knew some ways to cross the bridge and were looking for a way to succeed.","The truth was often known by a small number of people.","The others were still confused about the sky bridge. Actually, many teams had long known that it had something to do with the state of mind. But even though they knew it, if they wanted to get over it, they still had to see if they could be stable or have some luck.","They waited for an entire day just like that.","“Haven’t they come out yet?”","Holy Son Yake said impatiently, “Logically speaking, one day is enough for them to return. Have those good-for-nothings succeeded?”","“We can’t rule out this possibility. They have already gone for a long time. Holy Son, I just inquired about the time when they returned. It was five hours later after we returned last time, so it was almost time for them to cross the sky bridge last time. They have left for a day this time. There are two hours left. If they haven’t come out, it’s very likely that they have crossed the sky bridge.”","The left people of the first group to pass the sky bridge took one day and two hours to come back.","The face of Holy Son Yake didn’t look good. Seeing the expression of Immortal Master Wumo, he gritted his teeth and said, “Then let’s wait for two hours. If they don’t come out, let’s get on the bridge. It’s no difference between killing them in the outer layer and the depths of the secret realm.”","Two hours later, Immortal Master Wumo frowned slightly. Without saying much, he stepped onto a new sky bridge.","“Let’s go!”","Holy Son Yake spoke, and the hundred-man team went up again.","Soon, they disappeared from everyone’s sight.","After they had just left for ten minutes, someone said, “Hold on a second!”","“Who are they?”","“They are Han Yang Immortal and the people of the Highest Clouds Palace. They’re back. Oh no! Let’s retreat!”","The people from the Dongruo Holy Land were startled. They immediately stepped back.","Zhang Han and the others returned to the stone platform and looked around.","Seeing the vigilant team from the Dongruo Holy Land in the distance, Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","It seemed that Immortal Master Wumo was not patient and had left again.","Zhang Han thought that he would have to battle with Immortal Master Wumo after he failed to cross the bridge this time. He couldn’t be a match for Immortal Master Wumo.","Although Zhang Han was strong, he was only at the Peak-Stage seventh tier. He could kill some ordinary people at the Early-Stage ninth tier or the Peak-Stage eighth tier with ease, as easily as an autumn wind sweeping away fallen leaves. However, in the face of Immortal Master Wumo at the Last-Stage ninth tier or the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, Zhang Han thought he couldn’t be a match for the person. Not to mention the realm, Immortal Master Wumo was the most powerful person in the Tribulation Stage. He was not in the ordinary Tribulation Stage. In this case, Zhang Han felt that he might not be able able to defeat the other party. He might have to escape and go to other places where the sky bridges converged.","Unexpectedly, when he came out, the other party was not there at all.","“It’s good. That saves me a lot of trouble.”","Zhang Han waved his hand.","“Get on the bridge!”","Under everyone’s gaze, Zhang Han and the others stepped onto the sky bridge again.","“After trying for a long time, I can tell you for sure that everything we have seen and felt is fake.”","Zhang Han said something to the Dao Seeking Cultivators at the back of the team.","The sky bridge was related to their mental state.","However, they still needed a good method.","Therefore, a day passed after they left.","Only more than 30 people from the team of Immortal Master Wumo came back.","“Chief has successfully crossed the bridge!” Some of his men said.","“Our Sect Master has also succeeded.”","A team from a super sect next to them spoke up.","“The First Elder hasn’t come back for a day and three hours. They’ve succeeded.”","“Elder Lee hasn’t come back, either. He must have passed!”","Teams passed one by one quickly.","Was it because of luck or something else?","Some wondered if the rate of passing had increased greatly because the trial of the sky bridge had almost come to an end."]},{"number":1671,"title":"Chapter 1671 The Emergence of a Ruthless Ancient Man","paragraphs":["Chapter 1671 The Emergence of a Ruthless Ancient Man","“Be quick to get on the bridge!”","Many Holy Lands and super sects seemed to have guessed something. They ordered in unison and went on some emerging bridges.","Crossing the bridge was their first choice. The enmity between the Dongruo Holy Land and the Highest Clouds Palace had nothing to do with them.","They didn’t care about the Second Elder, Han Yang Immortal, and the death of the people of the Dongruo Holy Land at all. At this time, the sudden increase in success rate must have something to do with the change in the rules of the sky bridge.","They wanted to cross the sky bridge and enter the depths of the secret realm as soon as possible!","“As far as we know, there are already three forces who have obtained ninth-tier spirit treasures in the outer area. Immortal Master Wumo has even obtained a Profound-grade treasure. We have only known these. There must be more. Even the outer area has so many treasures. There must be more opportunities in the depths of the secret realm.”","“There must be more treasures in the depths of such a big secret realm.”","“Let’s go. It turns out that the sky bridge allows people to pass when the time is almost up.”","Everyone present burst into an uproar.","Those super sects didn’t occupy any space and went up the sky bridge one by one.","It should be noted that the places they used to occupy had relatively more sky bridges. They would send people up every time, but each team didn’t have many people. Sometimes, they only sent a few people out.","Now, every a hundred people rushed forward on a sky bridge.","The people on the stone platform quickly left one group after another.","Many Holy Lands and super sects even gave up some of their places, allowing the first-rate forces to ascend the sky bridges.","All the teams on the stone platform quickly set off.","They had found the way to the depths of the secret realm.","At this time, even the people of Dongruo Holy Land forgot about the Highest Clouds Palace. Compared with the Highest Clouds Palace, the opportunities of the big secret realm were more important. They left only two people to guard the place, and the others got on the sky bridge one after another.","“Why did the faults on the bridge suddenly decrease so much?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s tone was filled with puzzlement.","They even needed to climb the sky bridges they had tried before with bare hands after so long.","But now, there was no such thing. It was almost a smooth journey.","The faults they met were only three to five meters long. It was easy to jump over.","“The sky bridge has changed.”","After observing for a while, Yue Wuwei suddenly said, “I seem to have felt some changes in its aura. Could it be that the rules have been reduced?”","“The rules of Great Domain are unpredictable. This change may be good or bad. Be careful. Instead of changing, I like the previous ones.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","There were two situations. One was known, and the other was unknown. He liked the situation he knew most.","“There are no upper and lower faults.”","Immortal Master Wuluo was puzzled. “Why do I feel the sky bridge is a smooth road now?”","“Perhaps the other sky bridges are the same. In short, let’s go take a look,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said in a low voice.","They had just found the right way and were still trying it. However, the Bridge of the Law had changed. Could it be the rules of Great Domain didn’t like to be seen through?","When they moved, time passed quickly.","Three days passed by.","The sky bridge they were on had been almost normal for three days.","The moment the fourth day began, something changed in front of them.","The sky bridge was originally in the sky, but the scene in front of them changed. Now, they seemed to be in a vast sea, surrounded by darkness. Only one road was bright, and the surging waves could be seen. The bright sea surface was about a dozen meters wide, like a corridor. It extended forward constantly.","Was it something similar to the Bridge of the Law again?","In front of them, a boat was at the end of the bridge.","It was clear that they would get on that boat. Then they would be in the wind and waves and advance on the bright sea surface.","“It might be another barrier.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven shook his head and said, “I thought we would reach the depths of the secret realm, but I didn’t expect that we would be still on the way and didn’t find the way to the depths.”","“Should we get on the boat?”","“What’s the sea ahead?”","“It must be the appearance of the rules of Great Domain. Will there be any danger?”","Just when everyone was hesitating, the shadow of an elder in cyan appeared. He was tens of thousands of meters tall. Everyone on the stone platform in the secret realm could see this mighty figure.","The person looked like an immortal. They could tell that this person was extraordinary.","“My Taoist title is Qingfeng.”","The elder’s voice was ethereal as if it came from heaven.","In his words, the Taoist title made people tremble physically and mentally.","“Qingfeng? Immortal Master Qingfeng? Who is he?”","“Wait! Immortal Master Qingfeng. My god! It is said that 30,000 years ago, he successfully passed the divine thunder over the sky, opened the Heaven Road, ascended to the world of immortals, and left a legend!”","“He is a god. Immortal Master Qingfeng is legendary. He is invincible in the world and can break the sky with one hand. The records of Immortal Master Qingfeng in many ancient books show that he is like a monarch in the Cultivation World.”","Countless people were shocked by him.","It was too terrifying. The invincible existence in the ancient Cultivation World appeared in this land of the Law today. Even if it was just a wisp of soul that had been left behind, it was very formidable. It further showed how extraordinary the place was.","Even Zhang Han had heard of him.","“It turns out to be Immortal Master Qingfeng. He was invincible in the world 30 thousand years ago.”","Zhang Han had a strange look in his eyes. He sighed with emotion and said, “He is a very strong man. I’ve seen the specific image of him on the jade slip. When he dealt with the divine thunder over the sky, he broke it with one punch.”","“What! How could he break the divine thunder over the sky with one punch?” Immortal Master Waterheaven’s eyes widened in disbelief.","“That’s the supreme existence among the tribulation lightning. How could it be destroyed by a single punch? Isn’t that an exaggeration?” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","“No. Immortal Master Qingfeng’s strength is far beyond the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. That’s why the Heavenly Tribulation had no effect on him. He broke through the shackles. He is indeed powerful.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","He had experienced the divine thunder over the sky before. As the supreme tribulation lightning, the power it contained was too terrifying.","When he failed back then, he had a deep understanding of it.","But now, the ruthless man who had successfully broken through the divine thunder over the sky 30,000 years ago appeared in the world. What did this mean?","Immortal Master Qingfeng was the synonym of an era.","Everyone looked at his tall back.","Gradually, all the discussions quieted down, and the countless sky bridges became silent.","“What on earth is the Cultivation World, the cultivation, and the immortal?”","Immortal Master Qingfeng’s voice was flat without any imposing manner but imperceptibly made people feel detached.","“Transcendent! He is really transcendent! Amazing!”","Yue Wuwei was secretly impressed.","This was the style he liked and what he pursued. He felt he always lacked a little bit. He didn’t expect when he saw Immortal Master Qingfeng’s trace of sealed spirit, there was such an aura, which made him feel refreshed.","“It’s a scam. Everything is a scam.”","“Shackles! Everything is shackled.”","“The Cultivation World is just a joke!”","“It’s a naked joke!”","“A scam! It’s all a scam!”","“We are all poor people who have been deceived.”","“Alas!”","He let out a long sigh. There was too much emotion in his tone.","His words were confusing but extremely profound. It seemed to be some kind of high-end secret. However, the people present could not solve it.","What did the scam, the poor people, the Cultivation World, the joke, and the shackles mean?","No one knew.","They waited for Immortal Master Qingfeng to continue.","But it seemed that he didn’t intend to say much.","“The Rules of the Heaven and Earth, the Law, and the Great Domain are not the rulers of this world. They are the cages of this world.","“The so-called stepping on the Heaven Road is to step on the rules of Great Domain.”","Immortal Master Qingfeng said softly, “The rules will eventually be broken.","“Here, I am the ruler of the law, and I can use the Rules of Heaven and Earth.”","“In the depths of the secret realm, there are 99 worlds, and the first world is at the core. Like rings, there are layers upon layers. The road to the 99 worlds is the boats. This barrier will test your mental state.","“Anyone reaches the first world will come into contact with the core secrets of the Cultivation World.”","Swoosh!","As soon as he finished his words, Immortal Master Qingfeng’s figure slowly dissipated."]},{"number":1672,"title":"Chapter 1672 Is He Cheating?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1672 Is He Cheating?","“Wh...what?”","“He controls the rules? My God! Immortal Master Qingfeng can actually control the rules!”","Countless people gasped and couldn’t help being shocked.","“He deserves to be a legend. He suppressed the ancient Cultivation World and crushed the divine thunder over the sky with one punch.”","“Immortal Master Qingfeng should be in the world of immortals now. His will has been sealed for so long, and he can even control the rules of the Great Domain here. It’s so horrifying.”","“What did Immortal Master Qingfeng mean by that? A scam? What scam? But judging from his tone, he seems to be a little indignant. This matter is very important. We must inform our Grand Master as soon as possible.”","“I wonder if we can send more people out. If the Grand Master can come here, he will definitely go to the First World to get the important treasures. That’s the core secret of the Cultivation World. What on earth is it!”","“The state of mind. After boarding the ship, one can rely on the state of mind to move forward, from the outermost 99th World to the core First World. The ancients said that every grain of sand makes up one world. This is real. The means of Immortal Master Qingfeng is the immortal relic!”","Among the team from the Dongruo Holy Land, Immortal Master Wumo looked awe-inspiring, and he looked a little emotional.","“A figure like Immortal Master Qingfeng has appeared, but... is it about one’s state of mind?”","In terms of the state of mind, Immortal Master Wumo thought that he was blessed by the heavens. Back then, when he was undergoing the Inner Demon Tribulation, he had easily overcome it in just three breaths of time.","Over the years, his mental state was number one in the Dongruo Holy Land, and even the Grand Master felt inferior to him.","Immortal Master Wumo were also famous all over the world.","At this time, he was even more eager to fight. In his heart, he was very proud.","Among this team that had been underestimated in the secret realm, Immortal Master Wumo felt that if he claimed to be second, no one would dare to claim to be first.","Swoosh!","He was the first to jump onto the boat.","“Hahaha, it’s not difficult for Uncle Wang to pass the test of mental state.” Holy Son Yake laughed out loud. He quickly jumped onto the boat and patrolled around. Then, he said, “This boat can only accommodate 50 people at most. Don’t make it too crowded. Let 30 people get on the boat.”","Hearing this, some of the core subordinates jumped onto the boat one after another.","Swoosh!","The people on the ship were suddenly surrounded by the rules of the Great Domain in all kinds of colors.","The body of Immortal Master Wumo was covered with a light black color. It was a kind of deep black color, which was extremely dense.","The color on the edge of the others’ bodies was much dimmer than before, which showed how high their mental states were.","“Do we need to use mental energy to row the boat?”","Seeing the double paddles on both sides of the boat, Immortal Master Wumo suddenly understood and immediately ordered, “Those with high mental states get on the boat. Make 50 people fill it.”","The hundred people on the sky bridge all gave it a try. 50 of them were selected to sit on the boat, surrounded by bright light.","Holy Son Yake said loudly, “You can row the boat with energy first. When it runs out, Uncle Wang will take his turn.”","Everyone controlled the rules of the Great Domain, took the paddles, and rowed them. They rode the wind and waves on the shining sea and moved forward quickly.","There were more than 30 people in total in the Highest Clouds Palace’s squad.","After getting on the boat, they looked at the light around them. The flowing rules of the Great Domain were stunning.","Immortal Master Qingfeng was actually able to dominate the laws of the Great Domain in a place, which was too horrifying.","Even Zhang Han felt that he was no match for him. At least, he didn’t have this ability now.","“However...”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly and thought to himself.","“Immortal Master Qingfeng is indeed very powerful, but my trump card is beyond the Cultivation World, and I have more room for development. I may meet Immortal Master Qingfeng in the higher world.","“I wonder if the mental state of my duplications works.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment and directly summoned the Thunder Body. After he condensed it, the rules of the Great Domain around the Thunder Body were three times stronger than that of the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","Blue energy ripples surrounded the Thunder Body, and the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure was light blue.","“It should be that we use energy to row the boat. This boat can accommodate about 50 people. We have fewer people. It’s a big loss.” Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed. “In fact, we should’ve brought more people here.”","“It’s okay,” Immortal Master Wuluo said. “We’ll go as far as we can. Besides, Immortal Master Qingfeng didn’t go into too much detail. Among the 99 worlds here, the First World is the core. I don’t know if we can go to the core from other worlds. If we can only stay in one world according to our state of mind, and we can’t go to other worlds, it’s equivalent to a game, not a secret realm.”","“I think so, too,” Yue Wuwei said. “If we are in the 15th world, there should be a way to go to the 14th world, all the way to the First World. Since Immortal Master Qingfeng has left behind the core secret of the Cultivation World, he must still want someone to pass the test.”","“There’s no need to analyze it. We’ll just try it out.” Zhang Han laughed.","“That’s right. No matter how hard we analyze it, it’s useless,” Mengmeng muttered. “It’s useless to analyze it. It’s better to actually try it out.”","“Let’s do it.”","Yue Xiaonao liked to play this game very much. She said, “Mengmeng, let’s go first. Each of us has a paddle. Let’s see who can hold on for the longest.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng blinked. Anyway, the order of arrival didn’t matter.","Therefore, the young girl took the initiative to run to the paddle on the left side, grabbed it with both hands, and began to use the energy of the rules of the Great Domain around her with a serious face.","The energy surrounding Mengmeng was red and deep. Yue Xiaonao was surrounded by brown energy, which looked several times dimmer than that of Mengmeng.","But whether it was related to the luster or not, they still had to try.","The two of them continuously injected energy into the paddles.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The boat sailed forward at a high speed.","“Xiaonao, you’re going too fast. Slow down. Don’t you see that we’re leaving the bright sea area?” Mengmeng said.","“Then hurry up,” Yue Xiaonao replied.","“We can take our time.”","“You’re right.”","They lowered their efficiency, and the boat slowed down a bit.","An hour passed.","In addition to the bright sea area, it was like a corridor on the sea, with darkness on both sides.","However, a glowing cloud suddenly appeared in the sky.","Moreover, a voice rang out.","“The 99th world.”","There was a fork in the road ahead, which seemed to be arranged on the highway, and there was a curved road to the right.","“So that’s how it is.”","Mengmeng looked around and said, “We can’t see what other worlds look like on the way.”","She thought she could enjoy the scenery along the way.","Zhang Han chuckled and shook his head.","“This is a game of distance competition. We’ll go as far as we can. After entering the world, we’ll reach the real core of the secret realm. At that time, we can relax and do whatever we want.”","“Okay. I’ll be super vigilant,” Mengmeng said seriously.","They continued to move forward.","The 98th world was the same as before.","They seemed to be on the highway, passing by branches of various numbers worlds one by one.","Ten hours passed.","“No, no, I can’t hold on anymore.”","Yue Xiaonao said, “Isn’t it related to mental state? Why don’t I feel it?”","Yue Wuwei stroked his beard and said helplessly, “An hour ago, the energy around your body had run out when you reached the rules. With the help of your mental state, you were only able to operate the paddle for another hour. Haven’t you felt it yet?”","“That’s too short!” Yue Xiaonao said discontentedly, “It’s only been an hour. Although I’m not as powerful as Mengmeng, I’m still a super talent. Obviously, the time is not in line with my status!”","That was what she was dissatisfied with.","But now was not the time to make trouble. Yue Xiaonao muttered a few words and then sat still.","“I’ll do it.”","Chen Chuan immediately took his turn.","Mengmeng had not used up all the energy of the rules of the Great Domain yet. It seemed that there was still half left.","Five hours later, Chen Chuan stopped rowing the paddle.","Someone else replaced him to do the work.","After another five hours, the energy on the surface of Mengmeng dissipated. They kept moving forward for another three hours.","“It’s my turn.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Wuluo also took action, and they started a new round of competition.","They passed by more and more worlds.","“81st world.”","“73rd world.”","“52nd world.”","When they reached the 40th world, not many people were rowing the paddles.","Except for Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei, all the others had lost their energy. At this time, they arrived at the 35th world.","“Dad, it’s your turn,” Mengmeng urged from the side. “Hurry up and do the job.”","“Okay. Elder Yue, let’s have a competition,” Zhang Han said casually.","Yue Wuwei glared at him and said aggressively, “Do you think I’ll lose to you?”","Yue Wuwei even had twice as much energy as Immortal Master Waterheaven.","It showed his horrifying state of mind. The so-called state of mind was related to some comprehension, thoughts, and so on. Immortal Master Wuluo always said that Yue Wuwei had great potential, but now he was a greenhorn.","“The two most important figures have come to stage.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven roared with laughter. “Let’s see how long you can last. It’s best if you can put us in the top ranks.”","Yue Wuwei said with a smile, “I’ll do my best.”","No one had expected that as Yue Wuwei ran out of his energy, Zhang Han still had a lot of energy of the rules of the Great Domain left.","“We’re now in the 29th world. We should be able to reach the 28th world.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others discussed among themselves.","“It depends on how powerful Hanyang is. The key is that his state of mind is also very powerful.”","“Hanyang is really powerful. I always thought he had reached the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage, but I didn’t expect him to be at the Last Stage of the ninth tier, almost reaching the Peak Stage.”","They all sighed with emotion. When an expert took action, others would know if he had the skills or not. Zhang Han had crushed the group of people from the Dongruo Holy Land, which shocked all the people.","However, something unexpected and shocking happened.","Swoosh!","All of a sudden, a figure, who looked exactly the same as Zhang Han, appeared.","It was the Thunder Body.","The energy of the rules of the Great Domain on the surface of its body kept bursting out and rowing the paddle.","When the energy of Zhang Han’s Original Body disappeared and Zhang Han consumed extra energy of his state of mind-","Swoosh!","The Great Demon Body appeared and stood on the left side of Zhang Han.","After another while, the Golden-armored Giant Beast appeared, followed by the white-robed Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","“This is already the 21st world.”","“My God, is Hanyang cheating?”","“That’s unbelievable!”","“His work alone got us pass so many worlds.”","“19th world. 18th world. 17th world. 16th... Damn! Can he pass the test?”","Zhang Han’s performance was very strong. When they reached the later worlds, every separated world would consume several times the energy. That was to say, Zhang Han alone had more energy than the total energy of the others on the team.","“13th world!”"]},{"number":1673,"title":"Chapter 1673 Innate Might","paragraphs":["Chapter 1673 Innate Might","“That’s all I can do.”","Zhang Han opened his eyes and shook his head slightly.","“That’s enough. You’re powerful enough. Hanyang, I didn’t expect you to be so powerful. You’ve exceeded our expectations again,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a smile.","He didn’t expect that Hanyang, a Dao Seeking Cultivator who used to be inconspicuous in the outer ring of the Star Sea, would be so powerful. They had known each other because of his ancient demonic beast.","Now, he was the second elder of the Highest Clouds Palace.","With his talent and strength, Immortal Master Waterheaven felt that even if he were to face the Dongruo Holy Land, he would still have some confidence.","“13th world. We are not far from the First World, and I feel that even if many people on the sky bridge got to enter the boat, they may not have gone so far.” Immortal Master Wuluo also laughed.","At this time, the problem came.","Mengmeng grinned, pointed at the paddles, and said, “Well, we’re at the gate of the 13th world. We haven’t entered yet.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The faces of Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others changed slightly.","If Hanyang lost his strength and the pair of paddles couldn’t move, wouldn’t they be unable to get in?","Could it be that they could only watch from the surface of the sea outside the 13th world?","“We can enter.”","Zhang Han chuckled.","As a battle-hardened veteran, how could he not have any strength left?","He rowed the paddles of the boat quickly as the boat slid quickly into the passage on the right.","The bright spot in the sea looked very short.","It was only 180 meters away. When the boat reached the edge, everything changed, as if they had entered a Space Passage. The place in front of them turned into a fog, and the boat under their feet seemed to have become a flying disk.","The boat carried the group forward, passing through the boundless mist.","In front of them was a mountain range.","The wind was gentle and the sun was bright. The spiritual Qi was rich. Wisps of the rules of the Great Domain could be felt in the air.","“Here, I rule the rules of the Great Domain!”","What Immortal Master Qingfeng said sounded like something that even Yue Wuwei envied.","Immortal energy surged, transcending the mortal world.","Wherever Immortal Master Qingfeng was, the rules of the world couldn’t affect him.","“He deserves to be called a peerless man who smashed the divine thunder over the sky with one punch.”","Zhang Han sighed again.","Only he had experienced the horror of the divine thunder over the sky.","Others would not understand the feeling of being dominated by the rules of the Great Domain without experiencing it for themselves.","The divine thunder over the sky was one of the most powerful Heavenly Tribulations. It was not just a joke.","The moment the crowd stepped on the continent, they had a strange feeling.","“Why do I feel that there are so many people watching us?” Yue Wuwei asked in confusion.","“It’s probably a hallucination,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","Just like the outside world, they were on a mountain, surrounded by green trees on all sides of the mountain range.","“It’s not a hallucination.”","Zhang Han said with the corners of his mouth trembling slightly, “What we see is just the environment.”","Then, he made an incantation gesture with his right hand, and his eyes flashed with blue light. “Break!”","Bop!","A slight sound appeared, and the surrounding scenery changed. In the distance, it was dark, like the night.","They stood on the mountain peak and could see the things within a kilometer, but the grass and trees were withered. In the darkness thousands of meters away, there were pairs of eyes staring at them. There were thousands of green and gloomy eyes, which were chilling.","“What... we’ve been trapped?”","Everyone gasped.","“Oh my god, what are those things out there?”","“It seems that they can’t come in for the time being.”","While the crowd analyzed the situation, Immortal Master Qingfeng’s indifferent voice came again.","“All the boats have been ranked.","“I didn’t expect that there would be someone with such an excellent mental state among you trial takers. Not bad.”","As soon as he said that, Mengmeng laughed at once.","Needless to say, Immortal Master Qingfeng must be referring to her father.","However-","“The highest-ranked squad is in the 12th world.","“The lowest-ranked squad is in the 56th world.","“Next, the rules of the Great Domain will let you do one thing, which is to guard your position. According to your routine of guarding your position, there will be corresponding rewards. If you can’t hold on, you can choose to give up or hold on until you die. Those who hold on for more than one day can go to the next world, on the premise that you give up the rewards you deserve as the ticket to the next world. The real place is the First World.”","The voice slowly dissipated.","After he finished speaking, from the 12th world to the 56th world, each world had a projection that could be seen clearly in the air.","The worlds mentioned by Immortal Master Qingfeng were places with thousands of square meters, surrounded by darkness.","When the scene appeared, many people were shocked.","“Immortal Master Wumo?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s face darkened slightly. “I didn’t expect that Immortal Master Wumo and the others are in the 12th world.”","“There are a total of eight teams, including six Holy Lands and two super sects in the 12th world. They have a terrifying foundation,” Immortal Master Wuluo said.","“There are more than 50 teams in the 13th world.” Yue Wuwei had a strange look. “It turns out that each team is not together, but separated. Each world is a code.”","“It seems that this is a trial left by Immortal Master Qingfeng for everyone. There are many competitors, and we have to hold on for a day before we can go to the next world. It will definitely be difficult for us to enter the First World from the 13th world.”","“...”","Everyone was discussing all kinds of situations.","The other teams were the same.","“The people of the Highest Clouds Palace can actually be in the 13th world?”","“I can’t believe it. The top thirty worlds are full of teams of Holy Lands and super sects. Only the Highest Clouds Palace is in the second tier.”","“The highest-ranked team is in the 12th world, while the Highest Clouds Palace is in the 13th world. There’s no doubt that the squads in the top twenty will all furiously head to the First World to fight for the greatest opportunity. There’s no need for us to do so. We can try to buy as much time as we can and acquire the best rewards possible.”","“This place is full of the aura of the rules of the Great Domain. Immortal Master Qingfeng is the ruler of these rules, so it’s actually beneficial to us.”","“Hahaha, they’ll compete for that position while we gain our benefits.”","“I wonder if the Highest Clouds Palace will succeed. If the Dongruo Holy Land and those people clash, a fight might break out.”","Many Holy Lands and super sects were impressed by the Highest Clouds Palace’s force.","Of course, only a small number of them knew about the conflict between the Highest Clouds Palace and the Dongruo Holy Land.","“The countdown begins.”","The light on the edge of the darkness was slowly dissipating, and a circular line blocked the green eyes. It was still unknown what kind of creature those eyes represented.","Everyone knew that the so-called countdown was to wait for the light around the safe zone to disappear. At that time, the creatures hidden in the darkness would descend.","“Prepare to defend.”","The image above was still there, but it was much more blurred. They could see which team it was, but they couldn’t see their movements clearly.","“Let’s set up some Heaven-earth Formations first.”","When the light began to dissipate, Zhang Han immediately said, “Take out all your Defense Treasures and get ready. The creatures outside must be extraordinary. The main purpose is to persist, not to kill.”","“Hanyang is right.”","These were the words that Immortal Master Waterheaven had been saying over the past few days.","He was shocked by what he had experienced.","“Hanyang is really powerful.”","Immortal Master Wuluo and the others also thought so.","Many of the elders present even approved of Zhang Han from the bottom of their hearts. They had been convinced since they chose to go through thick and thin together on the sky bridge.","“Arrrrgh!”","A low and deep roar spread far and wide, rising and falling. Those green eyes were like those of the hungry wolves that were ready to hunt.","“It’s gone!”","All the teams spoke at the same time.","When the light around them dissipated-","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The three-headed black-furred wolves rushed over with ferocious expressions. Their claws were incomparably sharp.","The fur emitted a faint fluorescent light, which covered their bodies and completely ignored the Heaven-earth Formations.","“What?!”","Many people were shocked and couldn’t help shouting.","“The Heaven-earth Formations are useless against them.”","“How is this possible?”","“What kind of Exotic Beast is this? I’ve never seen it before.”","If Sir’s mind was here, he might tell a piece of shocking news – these creatures came from the higher world.","“Oh no, the Heaven-earth Formations and the light shield of the Defense Treasures don’t work.”","“All we can do is fight.”","“Hurry up. Form a small battle formation to defend.”","Almost all the teams were in a mess at this moment.","“These three-headed wolves can’t sense any aura at all.”","“How strong are they?”","“Attack! Kill them!”","Many teams took out their swords and sabers to fight.","But they had never expected that the supernatural powers unleashed by the swords and sabers could hardly harm the three-headed wolves.","“Can we only kill them by close combat?”","The crowd gradually found that the defense of these fierce three-headed wolves was so strong that they could even avoid supernatural powers. People could only use swords and sabers to cut their bodies. Moreover, when they cut their bodies, there would be the sound of metal clashing. Clang! Clang!","“There are too many of them.”","“How can we hold on for a day?”","“Hold on! Everyone, hold on!”","Too many teams couldn’t bear this kind of great pressure.","They all retreated and formed a circle.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","From the corner of their eyes, they could see from the images above that nearly one-tenth of the people were killed by the first wave of attack from the three-headed wolves.","In a short moment, these people were killed.","“It’s not easy to kill them.”","Zhang Han held the sword with both hands. The sword kept flashing and cutting the three-headed wolves.","After fighting for ten minutes, some people began to be exhausted.","“Is this the blessing of Body Cultivators?”","Immortal Master Wuluo said bitterly, “Can we only deal with them by using physical strength?”","“Some special supernatural powers may be able to deal with them. Try it slowly. Don’t panic,” said Immortal Master Waterheaven calmly.","However, Yue Wuwei, who was watching in the center, was a little confused. “The Holy Fire of Mengmeng can crush the three-headed wolves.”","“Is the Alien Fire that effective?","“I also have an Elemental Source, but it doesn’t seem to be of much use.”","After trying again and again, they gradually figured out the attacking methods of the three-headed wolves.","Five hours passed.","Many teams were exhausted, but they still persisted.","Including Zhang Han’s team, many people were so tired that they collapsed.","The three-headed wolves could isolate themselves from most of the supernatural powers and occult arts. Only the moves that people had a deep understanding of supernatural power could kill the wolves. However, the simplest move was still to fight.","“Dad, I’m tired,” Mengmeng said listlessly. After fighting for five hours, she felt that her arms were sore.","“Then let’s rest.”","Zhang Han was still as calm as ever.","“How do we rest?” Immortal Master Waterheaven was slightly taken aback.","Then, the Golden-armored Giant Beast turned into a giant beast tens of meters tall. It directly lay down on the ground, protecting everyone under its belly.","“Ow!”","A roar could be heard, and the terrifying three-headed wolves’ soulless eyes were filled with intense fear.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They retreated hundreds of meters and ran to the dark area. Their green eyes were fixed on Zhang Han’s team, but none of them dared to move forward.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast exerted its natural might."]},{"number":1674,"title":"Chapter 1674 Leaving the Others Far Behind","paragraphs":["Chapter 1674 Leaving the Others Far Behind","If the fierce three-headed wolves came from the higher world, it meant that Immortal Master Qingfeng was indeed very powerful to have such means in the Cultivation World.","But the origin of the Golden-armored Giant Beast was even more extraordinary.","Its innate might made the three-headed wolves deeply feel a sense of oppression.","They didn’t have much consciousness, as if they were born with fear.","Only by standing in the darkness could they eliminate their fear.","They didn’t dare to take a step into the range.","The safe area around Zhang Han seemed to have become the same as before.","“It’s over?”","“They don’t dare to come in.”","“Hahaha.” Immortal Master Waterheaven laughed loudly. “Dragon King is still the best. It managed to scare off those three-headed wolves the moment it appeared.”","“I’ve never seen these three-headed wolves before. Judging from their abnormal defense, they must be the Holy Beasts among the ancient demonic beasts,” Immortal Master Wuluo guessed.","“We are safe now.”","Many people thought so.","The dozens of elders on the team felt a little ashamed.","“It feels like we’re here to watch a show.”","“The Palace Master, First Elder, and Second Elder did all the work.”","“No, no, no.” Immortal Master Waterheaven immediately shook his head. “It’s all thanks to Hanyang. If it weren’t for him, we wouldn’t even have been able to come to the 13th world. Many people might have died in the face of these three-headed wolves.”","“Yes.” Immortal Master Wuluo sighed with emotion. “These three-headed wolves attacked too fast and ignored the Heaven-earth Formations and all kinds of defensive energy rings. They are stunningly powerful.”","“You guys, stop flattering each other,” Zi Yan said with a smile. “It’s good that we’re safe. Let’s have a rest first. If those creatures rush over later, we’ll still have to fight.”","Zi Yan had also fought just now.","Mengmeng’s Profound Underworld Holy Fire could cause great damage to the enemy, and the energy fan Zi Yan made was also very powerful.","Their team killed about a hundred wolves, most of which were killed by Zi Yan and Mengmeng, and a small number of them were killed by Zhang Han.","Zhang Han didn’t kill many wolves. Instead, he tried to find a way to deal with the three-headed wolves, only to find that it was a tricky problem.","At this time, he sighed softly.","“I observed the world projection above. There is a fog covering it, but I can see the wolves that are rushing over. The wolves in the 12th world are much larger, and the wolves behind are getting smaller and smaller. Obviously, we can rely on Lil Beast here, but we may not be able to do it when we reach the depths. We still have to find the most effective means to deal with the three-headed wolves.”","“Okay. Let’s use the elimination method.”","Yue Wuwei clapped his hands and said, “The Heaven-earth Formations won’t work. The energy defense won’t work either...”","He talked for a full minute.","Immortal Master Wuluo was astounded once. “We’ve tried so many methods, but we still don’t have any way to deal with those creatures.”","“We do.”","Yue Wuwei chuckled and said, “The attacks of Mengmeng and Zi Yan are very effective. Don’t underestimate them. They are very powerful. If they attack with supernatural powers, the energy is close to the Elemental Source Energy. If you have all absorbed it, you can use that kind of energy attack. It will have more effect. As for the Elemental Source, I have some achievements.”","He was being modest and pretentious at the same time.","Zhang Han said, “I’ll put Lil Beast away and continue to try.”","Things were as they had expected.","When the Golden-armored Giant Beast disappeared-","“Aaaaargh...”","The low and deep cry was shocking.","“They stretched out their forelegs.” Immortal Master Wuluo swallowed subconsciously.","He was still a little nervous.","Right at this moment-","“Ow!”","Several wolves rushed out.","Dahei poked its head out of Mengmeng’s schoolbag.","After sleeping for several years, Dahei had changed a lot, and its fierce aura began to show.","“What the hell is this?”","Dahei curled its lips and immediately jumped out.","“What, what is it?” Immortal Master Waterheaven’s eyes bulged out as he stared unblinkingly at Dahei.","“Oh my god, did this thing just speak human language?","“Is it an ancient demonic beast?”","“Ow! Ow! Ow!”","Dahei suddenly grew taller. Because of the limited area of the area, it could only grow to more than 70 meters high. Even so, it still appeared to be able to hold up the sky and the earth.","Boom!","As soon as Dahei stepped down, golden footprints appeared around its feet.","The footprints were filled with the vicissitudes of ancient times.","“Innate supernatural power!","“Or...”","Zhang Han was surprised. “Genesis King Kong!”","It was one of the top ancient demonic beasts among the greatest ancient demonic beast.","Zhang Han completely felt the transformation from the blood of Dahei.","Sure enough, although it was not easy to get to the top, Dahei already had the blood of the Genesis King Kong, so there was a lot of room for it to advance.","The Genesis King Kong was second only to Tiny Tot.","“What... Heavens!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was so excited that his hands were trembling. He even had starry eyes.","“What a domineering King Kong. It’s the most powerful ancient demonic beast. I love it.”","Gurgle!","Immortal Master Wuluo and the others were all dumbfounded.","They couldn’t believe that such a big guy had been hiding in Mengmeng’s little schoolbag all the time.","Rumble!","Dahei stepped down and killed three wolves in an instant.","“Dahei, you’re so powerful now,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","“Yeah.”","Dahei scratched its head and looked at the three-headed wolves, scaring them away.","It smacked its lips and said, “Little Master, these things hurt my foot.”","Dahei was already very powerful to be able to trample several wolves to death. After all, the three-headed wolves came from the higher world.","The three-headed wolves at the back were scared away because of the remaining power of the Golden-armored Giant Beast. Now that there was another great beast, they were confused.","“I don’t want to fight anymore.”","Dahei saw the green eyes around it and curled its lips.","“My host is here. How dare you bastards make trouble?”","So Dahei took the initiative to shrink its body and looked around. “Second brother hasn’t woken up yet. Forget it. I’ll sleep for a while.”","“Fine. Since it’s such a big deal to you, go back now.” Mengmeng rolled her eyes helplessly.","Dahei was suddenly awakened by the sound of the three-headed wolves. It came out to show off and then went back.","“Hanyang, Hanyang.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “It’s really an ancient demonic beast. I can’t believe that you have more. What is the one just now?”","“It’s a Genesis King Kong. You may not have heard of it. The Genesis King Kong is relatively rare, and it has rarely appeared in the Human Clan’s territory,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“Where did you get it?”","“I picked it up.”","“You’re lying.”","Zhang Han was speechless.","When he told the truth, usually, no one believed him.","In all the worlds, each team was trying their best to hold on.","If they couldn’t hold on any longer, they would quit immediately and get the treasures according to the rules of the Great Domain.","At first, many teams that didn’t know the three-headed wolves’ power were killed. Gradually, fewer and fewer people died, and the situation became more and more stable.","One day passed.","Half of the teams present had been eliminated.","“There are three more squads in the 11th world.”","“A squad has advanced to the 12th world...”","One day, two days, and three days had passed.","The number of teams decreased very quickly. At the same time, many people were paying attention to who would be the first to arrive in the First World.","After all, the First World was the true core.","They thought that everyone would go there at the same time.","However, when Zhang Han came to the 8th world, there were still three teams in the 7th world.","One of them was the Dongruo Holy Land’s team, and the other two were the teams of other Holy Lands. They usually kept a low profile and only showed their power at the crucial moment.","At this time, the rules changed.","“Five days have passed.”","Immortal Master Qingfeng’s voice spread in all directions. “Eighty percent of the teams have been eliminated, leaving only a few elites. You don’t need to guard your place every day. You can attack the darkness directly. The more wolves you kill, the faster you will advance.”","Hiss!","The fierce competition began.","Immortal Master Waterheaven shouted angrily, “Hurry up and kill them!”","They found a way, but it was not very efficient.","At this time, Mengmeng and Zi Yan had become hatchet men, and they kept killing the three-headed wolves in front of them.","In the 8th world, the number of three-headed wolves was small, but they were bigger and more powerful.","However, this lessened the pressure on the crowd.","If there were too many three-headed wolves, they would be able to find the breakthrough point of the crowd’s defensive position by launching dense attacks nonstop.","If there were too few of the wolves, the crowd didn’t need to worry that much.","“Let’s begin the slaughter.”","Zhang Han smiled.","Swoosh!","The Great Demon Body, Thunder Body, Golden-armored Giant Beast, and even Extreme Purity Immortal Body attacked at the same time.","They were like reapers.","At the same time, among the team of the Dongruo Holy Land-","“Haha, are you forcing me to go all out?”","Immortal Master Wumo raised his head slightly and glanced at the wolves in front of him. A grim smile appeared on his face.","“Then... let’s start the killing!”","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Wumo rushed over at an extremely fast speed.","“Uncle Wang, the numbers are recorded.”","Everyone looked up and saw teams with even names. The number of wolves they had killed was behind the names.","“Hold on a second!”","“Isn’t the Highest Clouds Palace a first-rate faction? How could they have killed more than a hundred wolves in such a short time?”","“The Highest Clouds Palace sure has hidden their trump cards well.”","Under everyone’s gaze, the Highest Clouds Palace was ranked first.","The Dongruo Holy Land was ranked third.","The second place was the Five Axe Mountain, a super sect.","“Hmm?”","After Zhang Han found it, his expression changed slightly and he subconsciously slowed down.","When Immortal Master Wumo saw this, he raised his eyebrows slightly. Obviously, he was a little dissatisfied, and he attacked faster.","Then, Dongruo Holy Land was ranked first. Furthermore, their speed was extremely fast.","“Do you want to play?","“Okay.","“Then I’ll fulfill your wish.”","Zhang Han looked indifferent.","Originally, he wanted to keep a low profile and exert all his strength when he arrived in the First World.","He thought about it carefully.","He seemed to have forgotten something.","“I’m still at the fucking Peak Stage of the seventh tier. The Golden-armored Giant Beast hasn’t broken through yet!”","Therefore, he had to reach the First World as soon as possible and then seize the opportunity to make a breakthrough.","Only when he reached the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage could he be sure to deal with Immortal Master Wumo.","Otherwise, it would be a little difficult to kill him. Immortal Master Wumo deserved to be well-known, and his strength was quite fierce.","Therefore, when the team from the Dongruo Holy Land killed five hundred wolves, all of a sudden, the Highest Clouds Palace advanced from the third place.","And in three minutes, the number of wolves the team had killed reached 1,000.","It was far beyond the second place.","The leaders of the Holy Lands and super sects felt their hearts sink."]},{"number":1675,"title":"Chapter 1675 He’s Amazing","paragraphs":["Chapter 1675 He’s Amazing","“How could they be so fast?!”","Immortal Master Wumo had always been in a good detached state. At this moment, he looked a bit shocked, and his face was gloomy. He stared at the sky, and his movements did not slow down at all, even a little faster.","Although he didn’t say anything in words, he had a lot of thoughts in his mind.","“The Highest Clouds Palace only has around 30 men. How could they kill the three-headed wolves faster than us?","“What means did they use? It’s just an insignificant force. It doesn’t deserve to be number one!","“Did that man do it?”","A figure appeared in the mind of Immortal Master Wumo. The man looked very young, but he was the most special one on the team over there.","His attitude and expression both showed that he had some confidence.","“Is he at the Last Stage of the ninth tier? Or the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage?","“Most people say that he is at the Last Stage of the ninth tier, a very powerful demonic cultivator called Han Yang Immortal.","“However, compared to me, this achievement is like a grain of rice competing with the bright moon.","“Haha, you may have your trump card, and you may have stolen a lot of the limelight now. But so what? When we get to the First World, I’ll kill you myself.”","Immortal Master Wumo was already annoyed, and his hostility was already targeted at Han Yang Immortal.","“Since he dared to attack the Dongruo Holy Land, he must give us an explanation.","“I’ll slaughter the entire Highest Clouds Palace and him, Han Yang Immortal, to make things right!”","“What a fast speed.”","The other Holy Lands and super sects were stunned by the speed at which the Highest Clouds Palace slaughtered the three-headed wolves.","When the number of wolves killed by the Dongruo Holy Land reached a thousand, the Highest Clouds Palace had already reached 3,500.","The force suppressed the crowd with its strength and stood out from the crowd.","It became the center of attention.","Five days passed.","“They caught up to us and are in the 5th world.”","“Given their speed, they’ll probably be the first to reach the First World.”","Immortal Master Wumo listened to the discussion of his subordinates.","His expression was still calm, but he was a little angry.","What kind of person was Immortal Master Wumo?","How could he be defeated by a junior with low status?","He closed his eyes and began to calculate.","Ten seconds later, he opened his eyes and shook his head slightly.","“Forget about it. Our speed is inferior to theirs.”","His words meant that Immortal Master Wumo had more powerful trump cards, but he speculated that with the current speed of the Highest Clouds Palace, even if he went all out, he would not be able to surpass them.","The Highest Clouds Palace was sure to be the first to ascend to the First World.","“I’ll take the second place.","“When I reach the First World, find them and kill them.”","Immortal Master Wumo suddenly found that it seemed to be the first time that he was so determined to kill someone.","“We may not lose, Uncle Wang!”","Holy Son Yake said fiercely, “The men of the Highest Clouds Palace are limited in strength, and the team of our Dongruo Holy Land is the strongest. Now in the 5th world, the three-headed wolves are bigger and stronger, and their killing speed will be reduced. There are only dozens of teams now. If each team fails, the Highest Clouds Palace may not be able to hold on to the end.”","“I see.”","Immortal Master Wumo responded faintly.","Judging from his expression, it was obvious that he despised the words of Holy Son Yake.","It turned out to be true.","The fastest team to break through the 5th world was the Highest Clouds Palace.","Two hours after they entered the 4th world, the Dongruo Holy Land and the other seven powers had entered the 4th world at virtually the exact same time.","By the time the other squads were halfway through the battle in the 4th world, the Highest Clouds Palace had already entered the Third World.","When Immortal Master Wumo and the other two forces entered the Third World, the Highest Clouds Palace had already entered the Second World.","“We’re lagging behind by an entire world. How did Highest Clouds Palace manage to move so quickly?”","Many forces felt their scalps go numb when they saw this. In their eyes, maintaining a super fast speed under increasing pressure was simply unbelievable.","“Forget it. After doing the job in this world, the number of wolves we’ve killed is not low. Let’s get the rewards and leave.”","“Yes, we should stop before it’s too late. Both our spirit and physical body are exhausted. If we choose to continue, we may die or even be completely annihilated.”","“Now that we have entered a world, we can only choose to leave after the battle. In the next world, we can’t hold on. We have to leave.”","“Leave.”","“We’ll stop fighting.”","“The First World is too difficult for us. Besides, we may not get anything there. The core secrets of the Cultivation World are just secrets.”","“...”","Soon, many teams gave up.","In fact, many of them were comforting themselves by saying those words.","Because they knew that they might not be able to defeat the three-headed wolves in the next world. Instead of facing a life-and-death crisis, they might as well get the rewards and leave.","In the end, there were only five squads heading to the First World.","“They’ve entered the First World!”","When the Highest Clouds Palace successfully entered the First World, the breathing of Immortal Master Wumo quickened in an instant.","“Speed up.”","The other three teams had gone all out as well.","They all fought in the Third World. Soon, they entered the Second World as well.","That was to say, the Highest Clouds Palace team had the time to clear a world ahead of the other teams.","“What is this place?”","Zhang Han and the others were in a vast sea.","It was a real sea in the real world.","Among the 99 worlds, only the First World was real. The others were all illusory products of the rules of the Great Domain.","“We’re about to uncover the biggest secret of the Cultivation World.”","“What could it be?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and the others were so excited that they couldn’t control themselves.","“But we’re on the sea. There’s nothing around us.” Mengmeng blinked her big eyes and looked around, but she didn’t find anything unusual.","“Let’s board the boat first.”","Yue Wuwei took out the small boat and sat on it. The boat flew five meters above sea level.","Yue Wuwei observed and said, “It seems that there is no crisis, but flying is still forbidden in the airspace.”","“In the face of this situation.”","Zhang Han looked ahead and said calmly, “Let’s keep moving forward.”","“Okay.”","Yue Wuwei nodded.","The group continued onward.","There was no projection of the world in the air, no other existence, only the calm sea surface, the bright sun shining brightly, and a few clouds in the sky. The scenery was beautiful.","The team kept moving forward.","After an unknown period, they suddenly saw an island ahead of them.","It was a Sky Island levitating high in the air.","There were four huge chains hanging in four directions on the island.","It was as if the island was about to fly and was restricted by chains.","“It looks like we are going to climb up the chains,” said Immortal Master Waterheaven as he looked at the chains.","As soon as he finished speaking, they approached a chain.","Swoosh!","The figure of Immortal Master Qingfeng appeared above the island. The faint shadow was huge, and his back was still facing everyone. He raised his head slightly as if he was looking at the beautiful scenery in the sky.","“What are the rules of the world?","“What’s the Source?","“The rules of the Great Domain are also shackles. The so-called cultivation is just a way to break the shackles.","“The world of immortals is the real world. The Cultivation World is like a dream. We have all been deceived.","“On this island, there is a supreme treasure called the Pearl of Fate, which can affect the rules of the Great Domain. If you get this treasure, you can easily make it to the Heaven Road and ascend to the higher world. However, if you want to bear the impact of this treasure’s energy, you have to cross an iron chain.","“The iron chains come from the higher world and contain extraordinary energy. If you want to pass through them, you need a special method.”","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Qingfeng’s figure disappeared.","As for the four iron chains, they rippled with all kinds of colors, including red, orange, green, and white.","“It’s a special method. If he doesn’t tell us the specific method, we still need to try everything,” Mengmeng muttered.","“How could it be so easy to get it?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven looked at the chain in front of him. “Haha, let me see what sort of energy it is.”","He flew over in an instant.","At this time, Zhang Han raised his hand, but he didn’t stop him in the end.","When Immortal Master Waterheaven approached the chain, his body kept falling.","“Oh no, I’ve become an ordinary person.","“With the rules of the Great Domain, this energy can suppress my cultivation level.","“Save me. I don’t know how to swim.”","Plop!","He fell into the sea.","He said that he didn’t know how to swim, but he moved fast. “The seawater is quite warm.”","With that said, Immortal Master Waterheaven approached the chain and grabbed it.","“It’s hot.","“That’s amazing.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven immediately swam out, restored his cultivation level, and flew back.","“I’ll give it a try too.”","Immortal Master Wuluo was eager to have a try.","Then-","Plop!","He fell into the sea, touched the iron chain, and retreated.","Immortal Master Wuluo analyzed, “The iron chain contains wonderful energy. It’s too difficult to climb up in this situation. As the height increases, the pressure on the iron chain will definitely be greater.”","“Shall I have a try?” Mengmeng blinked and looked at Zhang Han.","“Nope.”","Zhang Han glanced at her indifferently.","“Huh?”","Mengmeng was slightly taken aback.","In the past, her words worked very well with her father, but now he turned her down.","Then, she looked down and found that she was still wearing a milky white dress. If she fell into the sea, she would be wet.","“It turns out to be this reason.”","Mengmeng pursed her pink lips and made a face at Zhang Han.","Immortal Master Waterheaven asked, “What should we do now, Hanyang?”","At this time, Zhang Han said, “It’s very simple. We don’t have to keep an eye on the pressure of the energy. Just swallow it directly.”","Immortal Master Wuluo was speechless.","“He’s amazing.”"]},{"number":1676,"title":"Chapter 1676 At Loggerheads","paragraphs":["Chapter 1676 At Loggerheads","Swallowing the energy was something that Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others did not even dare to imagine.","These energies were accompanied by the rules of the Great Domain.","It was not so easy to swallow the energy. Basically, when they experienced it just now, they could also feel the supreme feeling.","The rules of the Great Domain were inviolable.","They could only follow the rules.","But they overlooked one thing.","In this place, Immortal Master Qingfeng was the only supreme cultivator, and he dominated the rules.","“Rules are often to be broken.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven patted his forehead hard and said, “Yes, rules can be broken. Our consciousness is deeply rooted. But here, Immortal Master Qingfeng told us that the rules can be broken! So the energy can definitely be absorbed.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Many people fixed their eyes on Zhang Han.","Zhang Han smiled and said nothing.","What they didn’t know was that this energy happened to be the opportunity for him to make a breakthrough.","He was at the Peak Stage of the seventh tier, only one step away from the eighth tier.","The energy here was enough for him to break through once and for all, and it could also provide him with cultivation energy for a period.","That was to say, after the breakthrough, the Golden-armored Giant Beast did not need to eat metal every day. The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure and the Thunder Body did not need to devour other energy.","This was great news.","However-","“There’s not much time left.”","Zhang Han turned his head and looked back.","As soon as they entered the First World, the team of Immortal Master Wumo also entered the Second World.","They still needed one and a half days.","And they obviously couldn’t devour these four huge iron chains in a day and a half.","“Let’s begin!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, Great Demon Body, Golden-armored Giant Beast, and Thunder Body headed for the four iron chains at the same time.","Unlike Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others, Zhang Han’s four duplications didn’t fall into the sea at all. Instead, they stepped into the air, landed directly in front of the iron chains, and pressed their hands on the thick chains.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Wisps of energy were quickly absorbed by Zhang Han.","Mengmeng said with a smile, “Dad is amazing.”","“Uncle Zhang is getting stronger and stronger. It’s like he’s using a cheating program,” Yue Xiaonao muttered.","“Then take a look.” Mengmeng giggled and said, “But your dad is also very powerful. He just broke through to the sixth tier not long ago. Now, he is about to break through to the seventh tier.”","“He’s doing okay,” Yue Xiaonao said lazily.","“These two girls have grown up.”","Lisa and Zi Yan were whispering behind them.","Looking at the two young girls who were chatting casually, Lisa said with a smile, “In fact, it’s time for them to consider getting married now. If Xiaonao hadn’t met Mengmeng, she would definitely be dating someone now.”","“If Mengmeng didn’t have her dad, she would definitely try dating as well.” Zi Yan smiled and said, “Her dad is much better now. When we talked about this in the past, he would always get sulky.”","“In fact, it’s not that simple. It’s too difficult to be with Mengmeng,” Lisa said. “I feel that you’re relatively casual in this aspect. As for Zhang Han, I don’t dare to think about who can defeat him.”","“Love can’t be explained clearly. I’ll talk to him more in the future.” Zi Yan said helplessly, “In fact, sometimes I can’t bear to part with Mengmeng, but after thinking about it carefully, I found that when I was with Zhang Han and we were in a relationship, we were very happy and had a good time. I also want my daughter to have such perfect love.”","“Didn’t you two have Mengmeng before getting together?” Lisa asked curiously.","“Yes.” Zi Yan curled her lips and said, “In my opinion, fate is destined. At that time, I...”","The two of them chatted over there.","Yue Wuwei, Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and the others were standing a few meters away on the left, staring at the iron chains.","Smack!","Immortal Master Waterheaven suddenly clapped his hands.","“I see it. I see the energy flowing. Hanyang is really absorbing the energy of the chains.”","“He is a freak!” Immortal Master Wuluo gasped. “Is there anything that Hanyang can’t do?”","“It’s truly a blessing for the Highest Clouds Palace that he acts as our Second Elder.”","“The Second Elder is mighty!”","There were three small teams on the field.","Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Chen Chuan were one, while Zi Yan and Lisa were the other. The rest of the crowd gathered together and watched Zhang Han devour the energy in the iron chains with rapt attention.","Just like that, time slowly passed.","“It’s been so long, but he still hasn’t finished devouring it.”","“Judging from the energy circulation, only one-tenth of the energy has been absorbed.”","“If it goes on like this, other teams may come. We definitely can’t hold on. We don’t have time for Hanyang to absorb all the energy. What should we do?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others were somewhat worried.","“With such a superb opportunity, how could he possibly not devour all of the energy? However, we must still be careful of the other teams. None of us will be able to stop those people from the Holy Lands.”","“Hanyang!” Immortal Master Waterheaven shouted, “If possible, you should go to get the Pearl of Fate first, which is the best treasure here.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven had no choice but to shout loudly from behind.","Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure opened his eyes slightly and turned around.","“It doesn’t matter. We can’t go up until I finish devouring the energy.”","“But the others are coming.” Immortal Master Waterheaven had a bitter look on his face.","“The others?”","Zhang Han glanced into the distance and said softly, “They’re already here.”","Hiss!","“What?!”","Everyone turned their heads and looked into the distance.","A group of more than 30 people was flying quickly over the sea like sesame seeds.","There was indeed a team who had arrived.","There was no doubt that no matter who the other party was, when they saw Zhang Han devouring the four iron chains, they would definitely stop him.","A great battle was unavoidable.","The worst case scenario was that the other party was the Dongruo Holy Land’s team led by Immortal Master Wumo.","Zhang Han and his companions had hurt the people of the Dongruo Holy Land before, and Immortal Master Wumo would not let them go.","“It’s really what I was afraid of!”","Immortal Master Wuluo’s expression gradually became gloomy. “It’s Immortal Master Wumo and the others.”","It could be seen that the opposite team was made up of Immortal Master Wumo and his men.","This made many of the elders present feel a chill down their spines.","But when they were terrified, they also felt a little relieved.","Indeed, Immortal Master Wumo was one of the strongest people who entered the secret realm.","He was a well-known figure in the Seventh Mountain for hundreds of years.","He was the sharp blade of the Dongruo Holy Land, and he’d established the sect and brought enormous prestige to the Dongruo Holy Land.","He was well-known and had risen to power by killing tens of thousands of experts.","He might be at the Last Stage of the ninth tier or even a member of the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage.","“Can we really resist such a terrifying enemy?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others felt uncertain.","In particular, when Zhang Han was still trying to devour the energy, he left the heavy responsibility to them. But they all felt that they could not fulfill their duty.","“What, what should we do?”","Immortal Master Wuluo wiped the sweat on his face and said, “Why don’t we wake up Hanyang and retreat?”","“Where are you going to retreat to?”","A voice suddenly rang in his ears.","“Ah!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was given a fright.","He didn’t feel anything.","But the voice beside him seemed to have appeared out of thin air, and he had already seen a figure out of the corner of his eye.","He turned back to have a look.","“Hanyang, why... are you done? Huh???”","At a glance, he was stunned.","Behind him, Zhang Han with his Great Demon Body, his Thunder Body, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast were still absorbing energy.","“Then, what’s going on with Zhang Han, who is wearing a white shirt and long hair here?”","“Oh, Hanyang, what kind of supernatural power is this?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked intermittently.","“It’s the Replication Technique I’m practicing.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly, looked ahead, and put his hands behind his back. “Our enemies will always be enemies.”","His words represented his attitude.","He wanted to fight.","The team of Immortal Master Wumo was about to arrive.","Holy Son Yake grinned hideously.","“As expected, you were the first to discover something. Haha, we now meet in the First World. That’s good. Don’t worry, I’ll kill you gently.”","“The new Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace, Han Yang Immortal, you’re really bold and don’t know your place. You dared to attack the Dongruo Holy Land and even killed hundreds of people. Do you really think that the Highest Clouds Palace can survive?”","“How dare you try to get the treasure here? Who do you think you are?”","A lot of abuse sounded.","Immortal Master Wumo had an evil smile on his face.","He didn’t speak, but his expression showed that he was very gratified to meet his opponents.","At this moment, Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others were under a lot of pressure.","As for the white-shirted man Zhang Han, he was still looking at his enemies calmly with his hands clasped behind his back.","“Dad, you look quite handsome with long hair.”","Mengmeng was not afraid of anything. As long as her dad didn’t tell her to run away, there would be no problem.","“This is a duplication.”","Zhang Han smiled softly and said to Mengmeng via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “When the fight breaks out later, you’ll stay behind. Don’t let me be distracted.”","“Okay, I will,” Mengmeng said seriously.","Mengmeng knew that Zhang Han had five bodies. Now the four were absorbing the energy of the iron chains, and the fifth was about to fight beside them.","“Han Yang Immortal.”","Immortal Master Wumo said indifferently, “You are the first person who has aroused my killing intent in nearly a hundred years.”","“I see. Maybe I should feel honored?” Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","“That’s not relevant. I want to kill you, so meeting you now makes me feel better.” Immortal Master Wumo sighed softly. “Maybe you...”","Right at this moment-","Clatter!","On the island in the sky, the back of Immortal Master Qingfeng appeared again.","What Zhang Han and the others had experienced before was displayed again.","“What is the world?","“What’s the Source?","“The rules of the Great Domain are also shackles...”","Those words moved Immortal Master Wumo. Instead of looking at the crowd in front of him, he looked up at the scene above.","“What...”","After Immortal Master Wumo heard Immortal Master Qingfeng’s speech, his eyes lit up with surprise.","“The Pearl of Fate can influence the rules of the Great Domain. If I get this treasure, I can easily go to the higher world. The higher world! Hahahaha, God blesses me! I will take this Pearl of Fate!","“I’ll get the iron chains now!”","Immortal Master Wumo moved and was about to fly to the iron chains.","However, at first glance, he found that the four iron chains were all occupied.","“Hmm?”","Immortal Master Wumo stopped and looked at Zhang Han.","“Fine, I’ll kill you before I go get the Pearl of Fate.”","His voice was easy and casual, as if killing Zhang Han was as easy as killing a chicken.","“Kill them!”","Holy Son Yake said arrogantly, ” Uncle Wang, you will kill that Immortal Master Han. Leave the rest to me, especially those women.”","At this time, Zhang Han, who was wearing a white shirt and with long hair, glanced at him. His eyes shone slightly.","“You seem to have forgotten what I said before. I told you that the next time we met, I shall be the first to kill you!”","When the word “kill” was spoken, the face of Immortal Master Wumo suddenly changed. He wanted to make a move, but it was too late.","When the word “you” spread, it exploded in the ears of Holy Son Yake.","His mind was filled with a buzzing noise as if he were hallucinating.","In the distance, a figure in a white shirt appeared in front of him in an instant.","“This is teleportation?","“Impossible! This is an illusion!”"]},{"number":1677,"title":"Chapter 1677 Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 1677 Battle","“Can’t you believe it?” Zhang Han sneered.","His figure gradually solidified.","“How dare you!”","Immortal Master Wumo was furious, and his eyes were filled with killing intent.","He slapped forward with his right hand, and a palm-sized white circle appeared. It moved fast, flickered, and attacked Zhang Han.","On the way, the circle emitted an earth-shattering aura.","If Zhang Han didn’t leave, the space in this area would be cracked by the circle.","Immortal Master Wumo was also ruthless.","If Zhang Han dared to kill Yake, Immortal Master Wumo would kill Zhang Han. This was a small-scale attack. If it exploded, Holy Son Yanke would also die.","Immortal Master Wumo wanted to force Zhang Han to retreat.","However, Zhang Han had never been afraid.","When Immortal Master Wumo attacked again, a series of attacks covered Zi Yan and the others.","He wanted to deal with them at a time.","However, Zhang Han had already grabbed the head of Holy Son Yake.","Boom!","In an instant, the body of the Holy Son Yake turned into rays of light and dissipated. There was even no mist of blood.","This was a means for Zhang Han to deal with his enemies.","In the past, Zhang Han didn’t care about anything. When he destroyed ten super sects, there were countless broken limbs, just like the scene of the end of the world. But since his rebirth and he had his wife and daughter, Zhang Han’s means were no longer bloody.","His goals hadn’t changed. The enemies would often die.","The soul of Holy Son Yake roared, “Please save me, Uncle.”","Swoosh!","Wisps of cyan light extinguished all of the remaining soul energy of the Holy Son Yake.","Then, Zhang Han turned into a stream of light and retreated before the ring attack came.","Rumble!","Within a hundred meters, the light flickered, and the space was constantly shaking.","The strike of Immortal Master Wumo made Zhang Han frown slightly.","“The Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage.”","Zhang Han felt a little depressed.","In this case, it would be a little difficult to resist the attack of Immortal Master Wumo.","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly and said, “Today, I’ll stop you with my Supreme Purity Immortal Body.”","“Put it out.”","Zhang Han stretched out his left hand to the right.","The attacks launched by Immortal Master Wumo dissipated one after another.","The confrontation without any moves seemed to have collapsed from the inside. All the attacks Immortal Master Wumo launched on Zi Yan were extinguished one after another and turned into a breeze. It blew in all directions.","“Ha... Good.”","Immortal Master Wumo laughed out of anger. He looked straight at Zhang Han and said, “Very good. How dare you kill the Holy Son of our Holy Land in front of me?”","“Why should I not dare?” Zhang Han asked flatly, making Immortal Master Wumo speechless.","Immortal Master Wumo took a deep breath and waved his right hand. “Everyone, step back 1,500 kilometers. I want to kill him with my own hands.”","Most of these subordinates were the core subordinates of him.","With the speed of Han Yang Immortal just now, no one could stop him. He let them retreat so as not to cause more casualties.","“Okay!”","These subordinates understood and immediately flew backward.","Zhang Han didn’t make another move. Immortal Master Wumo was already on guard. If he forced his way in, he would lose more than he would gain.","Zhang Han stood in front of Zi Yan and the others, turned around, and smiled, “You should also step back.”","“Okay, Daddy, be careful.”","Mengmeng said in a low voice. Everyone stepped back, leaving a large area for the battle.","“You have good courage and insight.”","Immortal Master Wumo calmed down again. He said, “Normally, you might be able to stand out. You have made decisive moves, killed Yake while I was off guard, and completed the ruthless words you left behind before. I admire people like you. What a pity.”","“This is called Pattern Radiance. It took me a hundred years of closed-door training to comprehend it.”","While he was speaking, he began to use powerful means.","A pattern of a starry sky appeared, covering the world. The area where they fought seemed like a starry sky.","The powerful supernatural power contained some profound mysteries of illusions.","Zhang Han had thought that his estimation of the strength of Immortal Master Wumo was about the same, but he didn’t expect that he had still underestimated the other party.","Immortal Master Wumo was very strong!","He had already reached the tier of the Immortal Master Lingxi.","His strength was comparable to that of some Grand Masters of some Holy Lands.","Although he was not the Grand Master of the Dongruo Holy Land, his strength was probably about the same as that of the Grand Master.","Zhang Han hadn’t dealt with such a role for a long time.","Only a strong enemy could cheer him up.","The supernatural power, Pattern Radiance, was indeed powerful.","In the face of such a situation, Zhang Han began to exert some of his abilities with his Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","“Myriad Method!”","Zhang Han pressed his hands on both sides.","A circular white energy shield surrounded him to resist the external power.","“Three strikes.”","Immortal Master Wumo casually pointed. Three huge beams of Sword Qi appeared and attacked with monstrous momentum.","Seeing this, Immortal Master Waterheaven sucked in a breath of cold air. “This energy is too majestic.”","“Immortal Master Wumo must have reached the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage.” Immortal Master Wuluo was anxious. “What should we do?”","“Can we help?” An elder asked.","“We can’t.” Immortal Master Waterheaven shook his head. “If Immortal Master Wumo wants to deal with us, he might be able to kill us all with just a few moves. We shouldn’t cause any trouble.”","Seeing the battle, they began to panic.","On the other hand, the people of the Dongruo Holy Land were in high spirits.","“Good job!”","“Chief, you’re mighty. Your aura is on par with many of the Grand Masters of the Holy Lands. The Dongruo Holy Land will rise to a higher level under your leadership!”","“Ha... Han Yang Immortal deserves to die. How dare he kill Holy Son Yake? They are all deserved to die.”","“Face the horror of Immortal Master Wumo. Later, when this guy dies, let’s also take action.”","“Why don’t we go kill Immortal Master Waterheaven’s group now?”","“There are also a few beautiful women in the crowd. They seem to be Han Yang Immortal’s women. We can kill them and avenge the death of our people.”","Some people were eager to have a try.","Under the guidance of the captain, they made a detour from the side.","This scene also attracted the attention of Immortal Master Wumo.","He smiled faintly and said, “Your defensive moves are not bad, but you’ve already lost if you can only defend yourself. My men are going to kill your people. Can you still hold on?”","He launched three more moves of supernatural power but still failed to break through his opponent’s defense.","Immortal Master Wumo couldn’t help but curse in his heart, “What a tough guy!”","Seeing the other party moving, Zhang Han frowned slightly. He was silent, but the energy in his body quietly circulated in a way.","“I got this broadsword 300 years ago. It’s a Profound-grade treasure. Its name is Profound Opening Broadsword. It can cut through all defensive energy layers. Since I will use it to fight against you, you’re quite powerful in the Star Sea. But you shouldn’t have met me before you grew up!”","Swoosh!","A white blade light, tens of thousands of meters long, gathered in the air and slashed at Zhang Han.","“You have thought too highly of yourself.”","Zhang Han looked indifferent.","He noticed that the team from the Dongruo Holy Land had arrived on his right.","They planned to take a detour and get out of the battlefield.","They stayed away from Zhang Han. Even if he took action, they still had time to escape.","However, this was only the general situation.","“Soul Refining Sound.”","He had finally unleashed the unique power of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","Bell-like sounds echoed across the area.","More than thirty people from the Dongruo Holy Land covered their ears.","“What’s it?”","“Stop ringing.”","Their bodies began to wither quickly.","“Retreat!”","Immortal Master Wumo shouted coldly.","Because of the cultivation and the distance, many people in that group used defensive means one after another to pull back the people around them.","It was not until they were far away that the ringing stopped.","They looked at each other.","“I seem to have aged a lot.”","“What happened? What is the attack just now? It came out of nowhere.”","“Immortal Technique? Could it be an Immortal Technique?”","“Oh, my god! It’s impossible!”","The people from the Dongruo Holy Land were so scared that their complexions turned pale. They all realized that a lot of their energy of life had been taken from them. The ringing from earlier had caused enormous damage to their bodies and souls.","“Immortal Technique!”","“It’s too profound. Who on earth is he? Han Yang Immortal? How could such a figure suddenly appear in the Cultivation World?”","“The legendary Immortal Techniques are difficult to obtain. They are on the same level as the rules of the Great Domain. They transcend the Elemental Source.”","Many people were shocked and could not restrain themselves for a long time.","Immortal Techniques had appeared in legends. It was said that the Dao Seeking Cultivators who could use Immortal Techniques could compete with the rules of the Great Domain when making a move.","It was a heaven-defying ability.","The latest legend was that a cultivator at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage 100,000 years ago broke through the Heaven Road and left the Cultivation World with an Immortal Technique, leaving behind an eternal legend.","Now, the strange attack made them feel that it was an Immortal Technique.","Even Immortal Master Wumo showed a strange look in his eyes. “Did you use an Immortal Technique just now?”","“Don’t you know it?” After dodging the attacks of Immortal Master Wumo. He levitated not far away. His eyes were calm as he said, “Aren’t you standing at the top of the pyramid? Why don’t you understand this?”","“Ha...” Immortal Master Wumo clapped his hands and said, “Interesting. You are an interesting opponent. I want to kill you more and more.”","“Almost all the people who wanted to kill me are dead.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly and sighed with emotion, “You are not the first one, nor the last one.”","“Why are you so brave?”","Immortal Master Wumo suddenly slashed to the side.","The light of his broad filled the sky and went straight to Zhang Han’s Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","Buzz!","However, when the streaks of light got closer, the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure cast three layers of defense.","It offset the broadsword light.","This made Immortal Master Wumo feel a little strange.","“You turn out to know such a high-level Replication Technique. That’s a good supernatural power.”","“Perhaps a few hundred years later, you’ll be strong enough to fight me.”","“But now, you are too young.”","Immortal Master Wumo shook his head slightly.","His hands glowed with a faint black light, and a battle ax appeared in his hand.","The handle was three meters long. The axe was huge, silver, and sparkling.","It was another Profound-grade treasure.","Immortal Master Wumo looked ahead and said lightly, “This is the treasure I use in battle. It is a Profound-grade treasure, Slaying God Axe!”","“That’s a peerless name.”","Zhang Han chuckled and said, “In that case, I’ll also take out something.”","Buzz!","The Seven-star Sword appeared around the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure and cut out thousands of beams of Sword Qi in the back, forming a net.","“Sky Splitting Axe!”","Immortal Master Wumo held the axe in one hand and swung it around.","The huge axe light cut through the void and destroyed the Sword Qi.","Then, Immortal Master Wumo held the axe in one hand and went straight to Zhang Han.","It seemed the moves he had made before were just a trial. He was going to take the battle seriously."]},{"number":1678,"title":"Chapter 1678 This Is an Immortal Technique","paragraphs":["Chapter 1678 This Is an Immortal Technique","“Just take a detour and escape.”","While resisting, Zhang Han could turn his head and talk to the people behind him.","His leisurely attitude made Immortal Master Wumo a little angry.","His moves became fiercer, and the group of people behind him also attracted his attention.","“If you keep dodging, I’ll find a way that you can’t dodge!”","Unexpectedly, Yue Wuwei took out the boat, a Profound-grade treasure that could move fast.","Just as Immortal Master Wumo was thinking about something, Yue Wuwei and the others slipped away.","At this time, his four duplications were still rapidly absorbing the energy from the chains.","“Go and kill those people.”","Immortal Master Wumo commanded his subordinates.","These people set off one after another.","“Let’s kill this ancient demonic beast first.”","“That’s right. Let’s attack together and kill the closest target first.”","Buzz!","When they got closer, the horn on the head of the Golden-armored Giant Beast shone with dazzling light.","The attack was so powerful. In terms of perception, it had reached the level of Immortal Master Wumo.","“Oh no! We can’t defeat this ancient demonic beast. Let’s go!”","Everyone retreated one after another.","Then they turned around and ran towards the Great Demon’s Figure.","Swoosh!","A faint black fog covered the sky and the sun, swirling around. There were various terrifying sounds as if someone were crying, roaring, and howling like demons in the fog.","“Hurry up! Let’s leave. We can’t beat it either.”","Then they turned around and found the Thunder Body.","Crack!","Tens of thousands of lightning bolts flickered. The aura of thunder was akin to tribulation lightning.","“Be quick to leave!”","Finally, he found the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","Swoosh!","They launched more than a dozen kinds of supernatural power.","“This is comparable to our Chief’s level. We are no match for it.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The group of people turned around and retreated.","They used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique to tell Immortal Master Wumo that they could defeat none of these.","“What a bunch of trash!”","Even though Immortal Master Wumo seldom got angry, he couldn’t bear them at this time.","Obviously, the man in front of him couldn’t defeat him. The person was at most at the Last-Stage ninth tier. He felt that this man was in the Middle-Stage ninth tier. He had a lot of opportunities and means.","His duplications couldn’t maintain strong at the same time. The four duplications over there should be just bluffing.","However, his men were scared away.","“Should I let them continue to charge forward?","“Perhaps they will launch a probing attack again.”","“I didn’t expect that I underestimated you, Han Yang Immortal,” Immortal Master Wumo said as he made his move. “You’re very good. If you hadn’t killed Yake, I might have cherished your talent a little. Unfortunately, you should pay for the death of the Holy Son Yake with your life. It is the face of the Dongruo Holy Land!”","Hearing this, Zhang Han glanced at the boat where Yue Wuwei and the others stayed out of the corner of his eye.","He suddenly found another chilling scene.","Two teams, one on the left and one on the right, came from the end of the sea!","If there were too many of them, he would be unable to handle them at the same time.","“I wonder how many days I can hold on.","“If I break through, I’ll be able to hold on.”","Zhang Han glanced at the four chains.","He had only absorbed a little more than 10% of the energy.","Zhang Han predicted that he would make a breakthrough the next day. He wanted the remaining energy and the Pearl of Fate above the island.","“It seems I’m going to have to go all out with my Extreme Purity Immortal Body.” Zhang Han sighed inwardly.","If his thought was known by others, they might be shocked. Facing Immortal Master Wumo, he still had some trump cards. He was a ruthless person.","However, although he had some trump cards, they were all defensive means. He was no match for Immortal Master Wumo when facing the other party head-on.","“They are from the Taiyi Sect.”","“The Lihe Holy Land.”","The two teams arrived at the same time.","“Hmm?”","Elder Zhao, the leader of the Tai Yi Sect’s team, laughed from a distance. “Have they started to fight already?”","“It seems the people of the Highest Clouds Palace haven’t yet obtained anything,” someone from the Lihe Holy Land said.","When they got closer, the back of Immortal Master Qingfeng in the sky above the island reappeared and said the same words as before.","Elder Zhao and the others of the Taiyi Sect gasped and said, “Oh! It affects the rules of the Great Domain. Is this true? With the Pearl of Fate, we will be able to go to the higher world at will. Oh, my god! This is a supreme treasure.”","“We must get the Pearl of Fate.”","The people on the scene looked at each other.","There was only one Pearl of Fate.","These people were all enemies except for themselves.","Some plots and little tricks were useless now.","It was obvious that the four forces were fighting for the same treasure.","“I’m no match for Immortal Master Wumo.”","Elder Zhao communicated with the team beside him.","“Me neither,” the other party replied. “Take a look first. Those four chains have been occupied. Three of them look the same as the person fighting against Immortal Master Wumo. The left one is an ancient demonic beast. What’s going on?”","“I don’t know. It seems that they have been fighting for a while.”","Elder Zhao used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique and said in a clear voice, “Immortal Master Wumo, I have an idea. There is no team behind us. There are only four now, and there are four chains. Why don’t each of us take one and compete for the ownership of the Pearl of Fate with speed?”","“It’s up to you.” Immortal Master Wumo didn’t even turn around, and his voice was indifferent.","It was obvious that he didn’t want to negotiate with them.","“Do you think you’re qualified to discuss this with me?”","Then, the eyes of Immortal Master Wumo flickered slightly. He looked at Zhang Han with a faint smile and said in a loud voice, “The four chains have been occupied by Han Yang Immortal, the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace. If you want the chains, you should drive away his duplications first.”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","He saw the two teams in the rear were very tempted and had begun to approach the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","Zhang Han grinned with contempt in his eyes.","“I don’t care about your sects at all. The chains have been identified. You can try to go to the chains after I fail. If you want to go there, there is no other way but to deal with me. Of course, you can’t kill me.”","“Really?”","Immortal Master Wumo laughed. “Are you afraid that we will attack the chains and affect you?”","Swoosh!","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes.","Immortal Master Wumo instantly flew to the nearest Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","Elder Zhao and another team flew toward two targets, respectively.","They attacked at the same time.","However, Immortal Master Wumo noticed that the Extreme Purity Immortal Body of Zhang Han had a faint smile.","“Isn’t that the case?”","The heart of Immortal Master Wumo sank slightly, but he continued to take action.","Unexpectedly, a layer of the rules of the Great Domain appeared around the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure he was facing and destroyed everyone’s attacks.","“I told you, it’s useless.”","Zhang Han put his hands behind his back, looked at the people in front of him, and said in a flat tone, “You can’t try to break the chains unless you kill me.”","This was a surprise on the chains. When he absorbed 20% of the chains’ energy, he found that he could control some of the surrounding rules of the Great Domain.","He used it to defend himself and stunned this group of people.","If these people kept attacking the four duplications absorbing the chains’ energy, it wouldn’t be long before they were knocked down. Then it would affect the chains’ energy, and he wouldn’t be able to absorb it.","Therefore, Zhang Han put all his pressure on the Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","He wanted to buy more time because he was about to start his breakthrough.","With the Golden-armored Giant Beast taking the lead in breaking through to the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage, everything could be reversed.","“Highest Clouds Palace? You’re forcing me to start a massacre, aren’t you?” Elder Zhao of the Taiyi Sect shook his head and sighed. “I didn’t intend to take action. But now, it seems that I have to kill you first.”","Before the people of another sect could speak, Immortal Master Wumo frowned and said, “I don’t need anyone else to participate.”","“Immortal Master Wumo, we are all competitors now. It’s unreasonable that you don’t let us participate, right?” Elder Zhao said.","“If you want to fight, you can fight first.” Immortal Master Wumo spread out his hands.","He would not deal with Zhang Han with other people.","That was because he felt that it was simply too humiliating.","“Ha... Okay! Watch as we take his head.”","The two teams flew over together. There were nearly a hundred people in total.","At this time, the eyes of Immortal Master Wumo were fixed on Yue Wuwei and the others.","This was his goal. Once he caught this group of people, he would have the initiative.","“You always have a lot of ideas.”","Suddenly, Zhang Han’s voice appeared not far from him.","The pupils of Immortal Master Wumo shrank.","Zhang Han’s Extreme Purity Immortal Body appeared dozens of meters away, but his other duplications didn’t move.","Swoosh!","Another duplication appeared. Now, three figures were facing Immortal Master Wumo and the other two forces.","“It’s such a strange technique.","“Is it really an Immortal Technique?”","The heart of Immortal Master Wumo trembled slightly.","“It won’t be easy to kill me.”","Zhang Han smiled with a calm attitude.","“Okay. I’ll fulfill your wish!”","Immortal Master Wumo laughed and immediately took action.","Suddenly, he found that Han Yang Immortal in front of him was strange. He could always dodge Immortal Master Wumo’s attacks, and his aura was almost the same as before. The duplications that resisted the other two sects were the same.","“That’s amazing.”","“It’s truly an Immortal Technique.”","Immortal Master Wumo narrowed his eyes slightly. “Pass on this Immortal Technique of the duplications to me, and I will accept you into the Dongruo Holy Land!”","“Don’t you care about Holy Son Yake anymore?” Zhang Han asked with a faint smile.","It could be seen that Immortal Master Wumo didn’t lie to him.","“You’re right. He is only a Holy Son. You can pay with the entire Highest Clouds Palace. You don’t have to worry too much. I said I would protect you.” Immortal Master Wumo said, “From now on, you will be a member of the Dongruo Holy Land and will be my left protector.”","“You have thought too much.”","Zhang Han was a little speechless and shook his fingers slightly.","“Dongruo Holy Land is nothing in my eyes. If you want to take action, be quicker. There’s not much time left for you.”","Zhang Han calmly pointed to the four chains.","Under the gaze of Immortal Master Wumo, the four duplications suddenly rose a lot.","He had absorbed 35% of the energy.","He began to break through.","“Since you are so stubborn, I have to kill you.” Immortal Master Wumo sighed softly. “I do admire you a little and gave you a chance. But you want to go die.”","“What a coincidence.” Zhang Han said in an indifferent tone, “I have one characteristic. I have a tough life. It’s hard for me to die even if I wanted to.”","“Do you want to die? As you wish.” Immortal Master Wumo suddenly took action.","When they started to fight, the shocked voices of the other two forces came from the side.","“He’s the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace, a member of a first-rate force. How could he be so strong?”","“We can’t hit him at all. His body movements are too strange. We can’t figure out them at all.”","“The siege failed.”","“He ran away again.”"]},{"number":1679,"title":"Chapter 1679 Counterattack","paragraphs":["Chapter 1679 Counterattack","“Three hours passed. He’s still holding on.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others were on the boat. All they could do was watch from afar.","The scenes of the fierce battle always made them fall into shock.","“Four hours passed. Hanyang is so powerful. He can resist two Holy Lands and one super sect at the same time.”","“Seven hours passed. He doesn’t seem tired at all.”","“He has insisted on for a day.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others were shocked and nervous.","“My Daddy is super powerful.” Mengmeng waved her hand and said, “You’re making a fuss over nothing. It’s okay. Just watch.”","Mengmeng was very confident in Zhang Han.","She remembered that when she was a child, Zhang Han took her for a walk around. Whenever they met someone they couldn’t defeat, they would run away very fast.","If he couldn’t win, he would run away. It was his core method.","Since her father dared to stay here, she believed that he could deal with these people.","“He will be fine.” Zi Yan pursed her red lips and looked ahead silently.","Since he came to the Star Sea decades ago, he had once again become everyone’s guardian, capable of resisting all enemies.","Yue Wuwei smiled faintly and said, “That boy must have more trump cards up his sleeve. Let’s wait and see. Since he has chosen to stall for time, he must have a way to deal with those people.”","“Really?” Immortal Master Waterheaven took a deep breath. “I hope so. If he can keep all of them here, perhaps the Dongruo Holy Land won’t attack us after we go out.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven also wanted to kill these people. Unfortunately, he didn’t have the strength to participate in the battle, so he could only pin all his hopes on Zhang Han.","“Even if the Dongruo Holy Land won’t take action, the Holy Thunder Sect will,” Mengmeng reminded them. “Have you forgotten that Immortal Master Sanlei also has a duplication saving his life? He’s not dead.”","Hiss!","Immortal Master Waterheaven sucked in a breath of cold air. “I was careless. Our Highest Clouds Palace can’t defeat the Holy Thunder Sect. It’s a super sect.”","“Alas!” Immortal Master Wuluo said sadly, “I feel that we seem to have made a lot of enemies in the big secret realm. What should we do?”","How to leave the secret realm was another problem.","Now the crisis had not passed yet. There was no doubt that all of their hope was in Zhang Han.","If he could stop them, the team would be safe and sound. If he couldn’t, they would be all doomed.","The island in the sky levitated in the high sky calmly far ahead.","The wind was gentle, and the sun was bright. The scenery was beautiful. The sky was blue, and a few clouds were floating occasionally.","The four giant chains were still occupied.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Thunder Body, the Great Demon’s Figure, and the Golden-armored Giant Beast were all under the four chains, respectively.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body didn’t move up, so Immortal Master Wumo and others continued to attack it.","Zhang Han’s duplications were constantly consuming the energy of the chains over there. When the time was up, these people were equal to helping him out for free.","They didn’t expect that Zhang Han was devouring the energy in the chains.","“Let’s see how long you can hold on!”","Immortal Master Wumo had an imposing manner. In this field, he was almost invincible among the four sides.","“This person is a tough nut to crack,” Elder Zhao swore. “He doesn’t dare to fight us head-on and keeps running. If you step aside, we’ll spare your life.”","They also tried to attack the duplications several times, but they didn’t gain anything. Therefore, they gave up.","“We can’t let him live.”","Someone from the team next to him said, “He’s able to resist us now. If he grows for a few hundred years, he’ll become a formidable enemy.”","“I don’t believe he can hold on like this.” Elder Zhao nodded with a gloomy face. “Continue to besiege him.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They moved again.","Just at this time, the figure of Immortal Master Qingfeng appeared above.","“More than half of the energy of the four chains has been consumed.”","“The rules of the world are no longer stable.”","“You still have the time worth of ten sticks of incense to obtain the Pearl of Fate.”","“The tunnel to leave here is on the island in the sky.”","Then the voice dissipated.","Immortal Master Wumo and the others were too tired to move.","Their eyes all fell on the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","“How could his four duplications consume more than half of the energy of the chains?”","“There are only the time worse of the ten sticks of incense left. The countdown starts.”","They saw ten sticks of incense, 100 meters high, floating on the side of the island in the sky. The first incense stick had begun to burn.","“Judging from the burning speed, there should be about three days left.”","Elder Zhao took a deep breath as the pressure in his heart multiplied. “There’s not much time left. It’s time to fight over the ownership of the Pearl of Fate.”","He used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique with his subordinates, “We can’t defeat the Dongruo Holy Land. I’m no match for Immortal Master Wumo, but we must compete for the Pearl of Fate. When necessary, all of you defend together. I’ll get the Pearl of Fate if you can block him for three seconds!”","Another team from another super sect thought more. The leader used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique, “When the time comes for the competition, let’s attack the other teams together. Let’s leave as soon as we get the Pearl of Fate. When we get out, there are some people helping us. We are not afraid of the others.”","Zhang Han was helpless, “It seems that it’s getting harder and harder to defend.”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","People quickly flew towards the four chains.","At this time, the Golden-armored Giant Beast was still asleep.","“Where are you going?”","Zhang Han suddenly said and flashed to the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","The other three duplications could use their defensive abilities.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Rounds of attacks began.","Immortal Master Wumo was very cunning. He went straight to the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, and his aura declined quickly.","The other two teams were attacking the Thunder Body and the Great Demon’s Figure.","The two duplications withstood the pressure.","However, they also consumed energy relatively fast.","“He’s about to be annihilated.”","The team from the Dongruo Holy Land began to attack the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure nonstop.","Clatter!","Finally, under everyone’s gaze, the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure dissipated.","“It’s dead.”","Many people said in surprise.","They had finally found an opportunity to seriously injure their enemy.","However, the next second, the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure condensed again.","“How could it be?”","Even Immortal Master Wumo frowned slightly and said, admiring. “Such a duplication technique must be an Immortal Technique!”","There was a hint of excitement in the depths of his eyes.","He wanted the Immortal Technique very much. Because of this thought, he was unwilling to unleash his trump cards. He was afraid that he would kill the other party.","“Let’s continue to fight. Let’s see how many times he can resurrect it.”","Immortal Master Wumo gave the order, and the frequency of attacks became higher and higher.","Soon, the time worth of the three sticks of incense passed.","“Kill!”","Elder Zhao led the team to destroy the Thunder Body.","But soon, the Thunder Body reformed.","The Great Demon’ Figure kept motionless. The energy in his body could withstand such consumption.","There was the nourishment of a planet, and Zhang Han let them hit it at will.","No matter what they did, the Great Demon’s Figure didn’t move.","Then it continued to be attacked just like Zhang Han was beaten by the crowd.","“I was scared to death just now.” Immortal Master Wuluo patted his chest and said, “I thought his duplication had been shattered.”","“It’s impossible.” Mengmeng said with her beautiful big eyes flashing with anger, “These people will all be dealt with by my Daddy later!”","She couldn’t help going up to fight, but her strength was too weak. She was only at the Tribulation Stage First Tier, so she could only watch from a distance. She couldn’t even withstand the aftermath of the battle.","Even the strongest figure present, Immortal Master Waterheaven, was unable to participate.","There was Immortal Master Wumo at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage and many enemies at the Last-Stage ninth tier.","In this way, the Thunder Body dissipated five times. The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure was bombarded by Immortal Master Wumo and dissipated nine times, which slightly affected its foundation.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body had launched all kinds of defensive supernatural power from the side.","The supernatural power was mixed with the Immortal Technique. It turned into spots of starlight, dissipated around, and hid in the void.","“It has consumed too much energy.”","Zhang Han felt a little depressed. “If I don’t make a breakthrough in an hour, I’m afraid that my tier will become lower, and I won’t be able to make a breakthrough.”","Among his four duplications, the Golden-armored Giant Beast was in charge of making a breakthrough, while the other three had been fighting nonstop with frequent energy fluctuations.","Even Zhang Han couldn’t tell when he could make a breakthrough.","The time seemed to be enough.","Half an hour passed.","“Immortal Master Wumo.”","In the distance, Zhang Han’s Extreme Purity Immortal Body kept interfering with the battle.","“What do you want to do?”","Immortal Master Wumo glanced at him lightly. “It won’t be too late to kill you after I get the Pearl of Fate. Don’t worry.”","“No.” Zhang Han looked relaxed and smiled. “Let me tell you a piece of good news. I’m going to fight back.”","“Really?” Immortal Master Wumo sneered. “How can you fight back? You can’t even protect yourself.”","“Ha...”","Hearing this, Elder Zhao laughed wildly and said, “If you fight me head-on, I can smash you with one hand. How dare you fight back? You only dare to speak...”","“Ow!”","Before he could finish his words, the Golden-armored Giant Beast suddenly opened its eyes and roared.","Its sound waves spread in all directions.","A powerful aura filled heaven and earth.","The energy broke through the barrier of the eighth tier.","He had officially entered the eighth tier.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Thunder Body, the Great Demon’s Figure, and Extreme Purity Immortal Body broke through at the same time!","“Stop.”","Zhang Han put his hands behind his back with his Extreme Purity Immortal Body.","He looked at Immortal Master Wumo and said with a smile, “It’s my turn.”","“How do you fight back?” Immortal Master Wumo narrowed his eyes slightly.","He sensed the difference in the other party’s aura.","It was more profound than before.","“I wonder why you are so confident.” Elder Zhao sneered.","Zhang Han ignored him.","“Shadow Displacement Transposition!”","Zhang Han moved the fingers of his right hand slightly.","Swoosh!","Elder Zhao’s body was surrounded by cyan light. At the same time, there was also cyan light flowing more than ten meters away from the left side of Immortal Master Wumo.","In a short period of time, Elder Zhao’s figure was moved to the side of Immortal Master Wumo.","Elder Zhao’s expression turned dark. His eyes were filled with disbelief. “How is this possible?”","“Another Immortal Technique!”","Immortal Master Wumo looked grave. He looked around vigilantly and did not act rashly.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Zhang Han performed the Shadow Displacement Transposition and sent them to the side of the Dongruo Holy Land one by one.","“Shadow of Light.”","Zhang Han cast another spell.","A layer of cyan light enveloped everyone.","“Break!”","Immortal Master Wumo pushed forward with both hands.","A black ring appeared, shaking space.","The cyan light kept flashing as if it was going to explode in the next second.","“Condense!”","The cyan light in Zhang Han’s eyes flickered.","After the first layer of cyan light broke, the second layer appeared.","“Such means can only consume our energy. With your current aura, you are far from being able to compete with me,” Immortal Master Wumo said calmly.","However, the next second, Zhang Han said something, and his expression changed.","“I don’t need to consume too much energy. There are still one and a half hours left. When I get the Pearl of Fate, everything will be over.”","“Condense!”","Another cyan sphere of light enveloped them.","Just as everyone was in a daze, the third ring of light appeared.","He wanted to trap this group of people.","The face of Immortal Master Wumo gradually became ferocious."]},{"number":1680,"title":"Chapter 1680 Leaving Floatingly","paragraphs":["Chapter 1680 Leaving Floatingly","“Break!”","Immortal Master Wumo shouted angrily. His dark wheel suppressed everything and began to smash layers of cyan halos.","However, Zhang Han was also very fast in casting the cyan light halos.","Layers of cyan halos appeared one after another.","Almost a halo appeared every second.","“He wants to trap us!”","“Let’s break the Bounded Domain together!”","Elder Zhao and more than a hundred people from the three forces took action one after another to break through the cyan light shield.","However, at this time, Zhang Han smiled faintly.","“How could I allow you to succeed?”","“Condense!”","He suddenly stretched out his right hand.","Streaks of white light flew out of the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","Black mist emerged from the Great Demon’s Figure.","The golden aura flew past the horn of the Golden-armored Giant Beast.","The layer of light formed by thunder was about to arrive.","Rings of light that looked like chains covered each layer.","Its speed was far faster than that of Immortal Master Wumo and the others.","“Come on! Let’s go to the island in the sky and get the Pearl of Fate.”","Zhang Han used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique to Yue Wuwei.","“Okay.”","Yue Wuwei responded and controlled his boat to fly fast.","Then it got close to them.","“Here.” Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure said.","They jumped off the boat and began to climb up, following the chain of the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","“Han Yang Immortal? Ha...”","Immortal Master Wumo finally couldn’t stand it anymore. He was so angry and laughed. “Do you think you’re the only one who has the Replication Technique?”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Eighteen Immortal Master Wumo appeared at the same time and struck out eighteen black wheels.","Unfortunately, his duplications could not fight as well as his Original Body.","These wheels did speed up the destruction of the light layers, but it was also balanced with what Zhang Han had deployed.","“Attack with all our strength!”","Elder Zhao was shocked. He had never expected that Han Yang Immortal would be so powerful.","These people attacked crazily.","Time passed slowly. Soon, there was only the time worth of two sticks of incense.","At this time, Mengmeng and the others were about to climb to the island in the sky, and the more than 100 people in the light layers were anxious.","“Good. Very good.”","Immortal Master Wumo was furious.","“We can’t break it. Immortal Master Wumo, do you have any other way?” Elder Zhao smiled bitterly not far away.","“Get lost!”","Immortal Master Wumo attacked angrily and slapped Elder Zhao half to death. Elder Zhao spat out a mouthful of blood and flew backward.","“Immortal Master Wumo?”","The people of the Taiyi Sect were frightened but didn’t dare to say anything.","“Trash! A bunch of trash. What’s the use of you?”","The mentality of Immortal Master Wumo collapsed.","He understood clearly that the Pearl of Fate might end up in those people’s hands.","“The Pearl of Fate will be mine sooner or later. You can’t stop me.”","Immortal Master Wumo stopped attacking and stared coldly at Zhang Han.","However, Zhang Han did not stop. He set layers of defensive light.","The four duplications continued to devour the energy on the chains.","It caused the rules of the world to collapse even faster.","Hearing the words of Immortal Master Wumo, Zhang Han shook his head slightly and sighed softly. “I can feel that you are a Body Cultivation master with extraordinary strength, but you don’t have a chance to show yourself. I can’t kill you now. I will trap you here.”","“Ha...” Immortal Master Wumo laughed wildly. “Good plan. I was tricked by you, but this world can’t stop me!”","“It may take thousands of years for you to come out.” Zhang Han didn’t care at all.","After he was lost in the fragments of the secret realm, the energy of the secret realm would stabilize and come out again thousands or tens of thousands of years later.","Of course, there were no absolutes in the world. In history, the fastest to come out used more than 300 years.","Even if Immortal Master Wumo was fast, Zhang Han had hundreds of years of cultivation time. When Immortal Master Wumo came out, Zhang Han could kill him easily.","Zhang Han felt he would have gone to the higher world at that time.","“What realm are you in?”","Immortal Master Wumo looked straight ahead.","“I was in the Peak-Stage seventh tier. Now, I’ve reached the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage,” Zhang Han said calmly.","His words caused everyone’s expressions to change.","“That’s impossible!” The pupils of Immortal Master Wumo shrank, and he cried out involuntarily in horror.","“Eighth-tier Tribulation Stage?”","“How could he be an eighth-tier cultivator?”","Just when everyone was extremely shocked, there was only one stick of incense left.","Mengmeng climbed to the edge of the island in the sky and waved her hand, shouting, “Daddy, we’ve come up.”","“I’ll be there too.”","Zhang Han turned his head, smiled, and looked at Immortal Master Wumo. “It will take you at least the time worth of two sticks of incense to break through these 100 layers of defense.”","He put his hands behind his back, stepped on the void, and went up.","Swoosh!","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body dissipated, and the Thunder Body turned into lightning. The Golden-armored Giant Beast grew smaller and smaller, and the Great Demon’s Figure turned into a black mist. They merged into the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure at the same time.","Zhang Han stepped on the sky.","Crack!","There was not much energy left in the four chains.","The place above the island in the sky began to shine brightly, and an illusory image comparable to a star appeared.","He took a closer look and found that it was the Pearl of Fate mentioned by Immortal Master Qingfeng.","It was a supreme treasure that could affect the rules of the Great Domain!","“What is fate?”","The figure of Immortal Master Qingfeng appeared, 10 times smaller than the appearance of the Pearl of Fate. He looked up at the Pearl of Fate and said lightly, “Fate and the rules can be broken.”","“This pearl can influence the rules of Great Domain, so I named it fate.”","“The one who obtains the pearl is the destined one.”","Swoosh!","The figure slowly dissipated.","The huge projection of the pearl turned into thousands of rays of light and gathered within a hundred meters of the island in the sky. The real Pearl of Fate was about the size of a palm, floating in the void.","“Daddy, you’re finally here.”","Mengmeng was finally relieved. Seeing Zhang Han coming over, she ran over, held Zhang Han’s arm, and said with a smile, “Look! The Pearl of Fate is ours. It looks a little like the Heavenly Pearl.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han was slightly moved. “They do look a little similar. Show me the Heavenly Pearl.”","“Could these all be products of the higher world?”","Zhang Han planned to take a closer look at them.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng responded and took out the Heavenly Pearl.","Clatter!","Instantly, the Heavenly Pearl emitted a powerful fluctuation. The Heavenly Pearl above cracked and shattered in the blink of an eye.","However, the energy inside the pearl was imperceptible. A ball of red light was directly absorbed by the Heavenly Pearl.","“Is it gone?”","For a moment, Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others were stunned.","“What’s going on?” Mengmeng was also confused.","Zhang Han said with his facial muscles twitching a few times, “Nothing serious. It’s just a small accident. Well, the door appeared. Let’s go first.”","The island was ordinary. It was not very large, and the scenery could be seen at a glance.","It had an area with a radius of about several kilometers. There was a forest in the center, surrounded by a beach.","In front of them, a light door appeared at the edge of the woods. It was the entrance to leave the secret realm.","“The world has begun to collapse.” Zhang Han looked around.","The sky in the distance seemed to have been shattered, and the energy of Heaven and Earth was in disorder.","Then he glanced at Immortal Master Wumo below.","At this time, Immortal Master Wumo was looking up at him.","Under his gaze, Zhang Han shook his head slightly and turned to leave.","Crack! Crack! Crack!","Heaven and earth collapsed.","Immortal Master Wumo was furious and shouted. More than a dozen duplications appeared and attacked the people around him. “All of you, die!”","The secret realm was over.","No one knew about the Pearl of Fate. Even Zhang Han didn’t know if the Pearl of Fate had been eaten or kept by the Heavenly Pearl.","Swoosh! Swoosh!","Zhang Han and the others appeared in the void. A ball of light from the secret realm was behind them. There were many fleets resting in front of them.","“Grand Master, the light ball of the big secret realm began to dissipate. The secret realm is over.”","“No wonder I couldn’t enter it half a year ago. It turns out that the secret realm is over.”","“What did they get? This secret realm is extraordinary. There must be some precious treasures.”","“Immortal Master Wumo should be the strongest among them, but his strength is still a little weaker than mine.”","Many Grand Masters and Sect Leaders of the super sects and the Holy Lands were present.","But when they came, they couldn’t enter. They had no choice but to wait.","Whoever obtained something might have to face a struggle.","Who was not curious about such a secret realm?","“Huh?”","“A group of people comes out.”","“There are more than thirty people. They are not from the Dongruo Holy Land.”","“But the secret realm is about to disappear. Hasn’t Immortal Master Wumo come out yet?”","Many spaceships immediately captured the images of Zhang Han and his people.","“They are from the Highest Clouds Palace!”","“Surround them!”","Swoosh!","A fleet with more than a thousand flying ships rushed over.","They were approaching these people quickly.","Hundreds of people appeared, all of whom were in the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","The person in the lead was Immortal Master Sanlei.","“Damn it!”","“Highest Clouds Palace, you ambushed us in the secret realm, killed the people of Holy Thunder Sect, and killed my duplication!”","“I’ve been waiting for you for a long time!”","Immortal Master Sanlei said angrily.","Hearing this, many forces were surprised.","“Are they from the Highest Clouds Palace? They were able to kill off the Holy Thunder Sect’s team. It seems they are quite capable.”","“The big secret realm has completely disappeared, and the people inside can’t come out. Maybe Immortal Master Wumo and the others have had an accident.”","“That is to say, this group of people are the only survivors.”","The fleets of many forces gathered around.","“They’re all here.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was nervous. On this occasion, he didn’t even dare to breathe loudly.","It was the first time for him to experience such a thing. Many forces on the seventh, eighth, and ninth mountains were here. The Highest Clouds Palace was just a first-rate force but became the focus of attention. If other people had been focused, they would probably be even more nervous.","“You should be glad that you came out just now.”","Immortal Master Sanlei grinned hideously. “But now, all of you will be in despair. Since you have killed the people of the Holy Thunder Sect, your Highest Clouds Palace will have to pay a heavy price.”","“Immortal Master Sanlei, don’t be impatient.”","A First Elder of a super sect said not far away, “They are the only surviving team in the big secret realm. We still need to know more.”","“Yes.”","A Grand Master of the Holy Land said, “The big secret realm doesn’t belong to any force. Tell us about the situation inside. You can’t deal with them for the time being.”","“I think we should capture them all first,” another Grand Master said indifferently. “We’ll decide on something else after we get the information.”","His words caused Immortal Master Sanlei’s face to freeze.","However, he was also mentally prepared for this situation.","After all, only their team could leave the secret realm.","Therefore, Immortal Master Sanlei said, “Everyone, why don’t you follow me to the Holy Thunder Sect? The Sect Leader of our sect has learned about this and will openly interrogate the people of the Highest Clouds Palace in the Holy Thunder Sect.”","The Holy Thunder Sect had a good relationship with some sects.","A Grand Master of the Holy Land from the seventh mountain said, “That’s good. The Highest Clouds Palace mobilized the team of the Holy Thunder Sect. They have to give us an explanation.”","“Why don’t we talk about it here? Why should we rush to the Holy Thunder Sect?” A leader of a super sect on the eighth mountain asked.","In their eyes, the people from the Highest Clouds Palace were like fish on the chopping block, waiting to be slaughtered.","However, they were wrong.","Zhang Han suddenly chuckled and said in a clear voice, “If anyone wants to know about the secret realm, you can go to the Highest Clouds Palace and ask.”","“If you want to talk, you can stay here and talk as you please.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Tiny Tot flew out of Zi Yan’s wrist. It became big and chirped softly.","“Is this a roc?”","Many Grand Masters of the Holy Lands and the Sect Masters of super sects were suddenly shocked.","Under everyone’s gaze, Tiny Tot wagged its tail and instantly entered the secondary space to leave with Zhang Han and his companions.","There was no trace left at all."]},{"number":1681,"title":"Chapter 1681 The Arrival of the Enemies","paragraphs":["Chapter 1681 The Arrival of the Enemies","Everyone present was stunned.","“Have they left just like that?”","Many Grand Masters of the Holy Lands and Sect Masters of the super sects were slightly stunned.","There were at least 800 well-known forces present.","A small number of them were famous in the Holy Lands.","One of them was handsome and elegant, looking like an ancient man. With his hands clasped behind his back, he stood out in front of the crowd of first-rate forces.","There was a majestic griffin next to him.","He walked to the front from the rear of the first-rate forces. Then he was noticed by many people who appeared from the spaceships one after another. They greeted him from a distance.","“Long time no see, Immortal Master Mingyu.”","“Greetings, Immortal Master Mingyu.”","Seeing him, many forces were slightly shocked.","“Is he Immortal Master Mingyu from the eighth mountain? My god! I’m actually able to see his Original Body today. Immortal Master Mingyu is one of the top ten figures on the eighth mountain.”","“He has found the ancient demonic beast. The Highest Clouds Palace will have a hard time.”","“It’s just a piece of cake for Immortal Master Mingyu to deal with the Highest Clouds Palace.”","Even Immortal Master Sanlei felt slightly nervous.","“What a terrible situation.”","Immortal Master Sanlei felt helpless.","Not to mention the Highest Clouds Palace, even their Holy Thunder Sect was far inferior to Immortal Master Mingyu.","“Immortal Master Mingyu, do you know what that enormous creature is?” A Grand Master of a Holy Land said with a smile.","There weren’t any figures at the same level as Immortal Master Mingyu here. There were a few great figures whose status was a little lower than that of Immortal Master Mingyu.","At this time, it was time for the big shots to communicate.","Many first-rate forces, super sects, and ordinary Holy Lands were quietly listening.","“That creature just now has a quite strong background.”","Immortal Master Mingyu said flatly, “If I’m not wrong, it should be the Ancient Cursed Roc. It belongs to the King Clan in the Roc Clan and is at the top of the Holy Beasts.”","Hiss!","“The Ancient Cursed Roc?”","“What a powerful background.”","Many Grand Masters gasped because they knew something about the Ancient Cursed Roc.","They had never expected such a result.","“It has such a powerful background.”","Immortal Master Sanlei’s eyes lit up. “What if we capture the people and the ancient demonic beast...”","At this time, Immortal Master Mingyu sat on the back of the griffin and said, “The creatures of the Roc Clan can only have one host in their lives. You don’t have to think so much about it.”","“That’s true.” One of the Grand Masters sighed.","“I didn’t expect that I could take a look at the Ancient Cursed Roc when I passed by here. It’s a nice trip.” The handsome Immortal Master Mingyu roared with laughter. Then he rode the griffin and left in a carefree manner.","His graceful bearing charmed thousands of young women.","After Immortal Master Mingyu left, the Grand Masters of the other Holy Lands left successively.","“Forget it. Since the secret realm has disappeared, I’ll go back and cultivate in seclusion.”","“I didn’t expect I was stopped from entering because I arrived a few months later. This is destined.”","Many big shots from the eighth mountain and the ninth mountain left.","In their view, there was no need to investigate a big secret realm.","However, some Grand Masters of some secondary super sects and small Holy Lands said, “Since the Highest Clouds Palace is the only team to come out, they must give us an explanation for this matter.”","“Our teams haven’t come out yet. We must figure out what happened.”","A leader of a super sect said, “Three groups of our sect have gone to the secret realm one after another, but they haven’t come out yet. It seems that it’s necessary for me to go to the Highest Clouds Palace.”","They had underestimated such a secret realm. There must be a lot of treasures in it. As for how much they could get from the Highest Clouds Palace, it depended on their luck.","They didn’t pay much attention to it. They just wanted to get a share.","“Everyone.”","At this time, Immortal Master Sanlei stood up and said with cupped hands, “The Highest Clouds Palace killed my duplication when I was off guard. This makes me angry. My sect leader has also given me full authority on this matter. If you trust the Holy Thunder Sect, the Holy Thunder Sect will take the lead in this matter. I will personally arrest all the people of the Highest Clouds Palace.”","“That’s good.”","Someone from the Holy Land of the seventh mountain said, “The Holy Thunder Sect is also a super sect and is qualified to be the representative. I think any sect that has participated in the competition of the secret realm can send people to cooperate with Immortal Master Sanlei and go to the Highest Clouds Palace together. What do you think of it?”","All the people present were sophisticated elders.","They made a deal with a few words.","Every super sect or Holy Land that had participated in this matter sent people to join forces with Immortal Master Sanlei’s group, causing the fleets on his side to increase to more than two thousand.","“Alas!”","Immortal Master Sanlei felt helpless.","However, he was speechless. He couldn’t refuse them at all. If he angered them, it would be a blow to the Holy Thunder Sect. Even though the Holy Thunder Sect was a super sect, it couldn’t afford to offend so many people of the same level.","“Let’s head out immediately. Three years later, let’s publicly interrogate the Highest Clouds Palace,” Immortal Master Sanlei said.","Three years seemed to be long. These people would go back to rest for a few days. Once they captured the people from the Highest Clouds Palace, their disciples would inform their sects and Holy Lands. Then they arrived at the Holy Thunder Sect. The process would take about three years.","Time was simply the cheapest thing in the Cultivation World.","“Let’s go. Let’s head to the Highest Clouds Star.”","Immortal Master Sanlei’s eyes were filled with a cold light.","In his opinion, although there were a lot of people assisting him, it was natural for him to get more things because his duplication had been killed.","If he could help the Sect Leader get the ancient demonic beast, he would contribute a lot.","His future resources would be at least a hundred times more than now!","After accepting the current situation, Immortal Master Sanlei calmed down and led many spaceships into secondary space, heading for the nearest Space Shooting Planet.","It only took them about a month to arrive at the Highest Clouds Palace.","Now, Zhang Han was sitting in the Alternate Space of Tiny Tot.","The Star Map appeared. Zi Yan pointed to the location of the Highest Clouds Palace and communicated with Tiny Tot.","Swoosh!","Tiny Tot flew quickly in the Alternate Space. From time to time, it used its supernatural power to jump a long distance.","“We’ll arrive in about a month. It’s faster than using the Space Shooting Planets.”","Zhang Han said with a smile, “After we go back, we’ll have to face some enemies.”","“When we arrive at the place, they will arrive a little later than us.” Immortal Master Waterheaven scratched his head. “Let’s not go back. I’ll inform the people of the Highest Clouds Palace to leave. At worst, we can go to the first mountain to live.”","There was nothing they could do about it. There were too many enemies here. The Dongruo Holy Land would know this thing. The Highest Clouds Palace had killed their people. How could the Dongruo Holy Land let the people of the Highest Clouds Palace off?","There was also the Holy Thunder Sect. It took the lead in attacking them. Many teams of the other forces had died. They would also get the news and want to get something.","In their eyes, the Highest Clouds Palace was as small as an ant under their feet.","The key was that they were the only team that had come out.","If many teams came out, they would not be targeted. Unfortunately, there were facts in this world. The other people wouldn’t think for them.","“No need.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","“Are you sure?” Yue Wuwei suddenly smiled.","He could know it from Zhang Han’s expression.","“Daddy, are you going to lose your temper?” Mengmeng blinked her beautiful big eyes and said, “Your attacks are not as handsome as before.”","“Ahem.” Zhang Han laughed and said, “What’s the point of being handsome? If you want to see your handsome Daddy. I’ll show you this time. I’m afraid that there will be too few enemies.”","“Uncle Zhang easily defeated Immortal Master Wumo and the others,” Chen Chuan said. “I feel that he is very handsome.”","“Easily?” Yue Wuwei snorted. “Not at all.”","“I meant the last time he suppressed them,” Chen Chuan explained in a low voice.","“Yes. He looked easy at that time.” Immortal Master Wuluo was puzzled. “Why did Immortal Master Wumo give up resisting and allow himself to be suppressed in the secret realm.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han shook his head slightly.","Seeing that everyone was curious, he said, “It looks easy. But in fact, it’s not. I started to arrange when I fought against them before. The reason why the defensive layers condensed quickly and strongly is because of those arrangements.”","“How did you know you were going to trap them afterward?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked curiously.","“I didn’t have to know. It was a preventive measure. It didn’t matter even if I didn’t use it,” Zhang Han replied.","“Yes.” Immortal Master Waterheaven suddenly understood. “I’m not even as smart as before after I hung out with you. I should have thought of it.”","“With the Pearl of Fate, should we be afraid? Why don’t we go directly to the higher world?” Immortal Master Wuluo suddenly asked.","The Pearl of Fate was able to enter the higher world. It was the strongest defense means.","“I can’t go.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “The Pearl of Fate has been broken. How to use it?”","“I really can’t feel it.” Mengmeng took out the Heavenly Pearl and spun it in her palm. She could see the energy of the Pearl of Fate, but she couldn’t feel it.","“What is this?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked curiously.","The other elders were paying close attention as well.","“You won’t understand even if I tell you,” Zhang Han said grumpily.","Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Wuluo looked at each other and smiled awkwardly.","“Ahem. Let’s go back as soon as possible.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven let out a soft cough.","They had asked too many questions. How could Zhang Han casually tell others all of his trump cards?","They were familiar with each other, so they didn’t pay much attention to it.","“I’ve just made a breakthrough and experienced a big battle. I have to cultivate in seclusion for a few days.”","After saying that, Zhang Han sat cross-legged next to them and began to adjust his state.","His duplications had been destroyed several times. After the breakthrough, his realm and strength were unstable.","When he stabilized and absorbed all the energy of the four chains, his combat capability would improve a lot.","“After absorbing so much special energy, it will be enough for me to cultivate for ten years.” Zhang Han thought to himself.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body had been born not long, so he could only use a few Immortal Techniques. However, after increasing his fighting capability, breaking through, and stabilizing his strength, he would be able to perform his true power.","A month later, they returned to the Highest Clouds Palace and gathered in the main hall.","There were already a few people from the first-rate forces who secretly told them.","“The joint army of hundreds of sects, led by the Holy Thunder Sect, will arrive in half a month. Run for our lives.”","“Run?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven smiled wryly.","The entire Highest Clouds Palace was located on the seventh mountain, and it had been monitored all around.","If they wanted to leave, they could go to Tiny Tot’s Alternate Space. However, it was not large enough. There were many people in the Highest Clouds Palace. Thus, the others could not escape from so many enemies.","As the Sect Leader of the Highest Clouds Palace, how could he abandon his disciples and escape?","His morality didn’t allow such a thing to happen.","He glanced at the small palace on the side.","“Humph.”","“Hanyang will come out of seclusion soon. When you come, he’ll kill a few of you.”","“He’ll let you know the Highest Clouds Palace is not to be trifled with!”","He snorted haughtily."]},{"number":1682,"title":"Chapter 1682 Killed Right Away","paragraphs":["Chapter 1682 Killed Right Away","On Highest Clouds Star.","In the past few days, the void in its surroundings had been quite lively.","Many Dao Seeking Cultivators had rushed over after hearing the news. The Highest Clouds Palace was a first-rate power. Normally speaking, it would be worth mentioning. At the very least, people were curious as to why the Holy Thunder Sect and the other sects would join forces to capture the Highest Clouds Palace. Many were paying close attention to this matter.","“It’s been more than a hundred years since a fight broke out between the first-rate forces and those in the Seventh Mountain.”","“Let’s go and watch the fun.”","There were many people like this who liked to watch the fun, but they would immediately be refuted.","“What is there to see? Not even the Highest Clouds Palace can stop the Holy Thunder Sect, let alone hundreds of them.”","“That might not necessarily be the case. This time around, Immortal Officer Sanlei from the Holy Thunder Sect is the leader. Although there are several hundred squads, they actually did not bring many people with them.”","“Haha, who can take the Highest Clouds Palace seriously?”","“Don’t underestimate them. I’ve also heard from the Dongruo Holy Land that the Highest Clouds Palace once attacked the Dongruo Holy Land in the secret realm and killed nearly a thousand people. It’s said that the one who did it was the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace, Han Yang Immortal. He is a powerful man suspected of being at the Last Stage of the ninth tier.”","“Are you kidding me? An expert at the Last Stage of the ninth tier can’t defeat those from the Holy Thunder Sect. The gap between them is like heaven and earth.”","“...”","Many discussions spread among the first-class forces of the Seventh Mountain.","There were many people in the Seventh Mountain Region, so some of them decided to watch the fun. They all rushed to the vicinity of the Highest Clouds Star in advance.","On Highest Clouds Star, the sky was bright and clear, and the wind was gentle.","On the side of the small palace, Zhang Han was still in seclusion.","On the platform outside, Zi Yan, Lisa, and the others were basking in the sun.","Mengmeng held a glass of juice, leaned against the railing, and looked into the distance.","“It’s been so many days, but my dad hasn’t come out yet.”","“What’s the rush for? Some Dao Seeking Cultivators would cultivate in seclusion for decades,” Yue Xiaonao said indifferently.","“Alas, it’s boring.” Mengmeng took a sip of juice lazily, feeling bored.","“Sister Mengmeng, do you think my parents will arrive in the Star Sea soon?” Chen Chuan said from behind her, “I envy you. You can see Uncle Zhang doing closed-door cultivation outside. It’s not the same for me. I can’t see my parents. I’ve just been in a relationship with Nina, and we’ve been separated for decades.”","“Will you get married when you meet?” Mengmeng glanced at him.","“Yeah. We’ll get married when we’re back on Earth. I can invite a few friends to our wedding,” Chen Chuan said.","“Your friends will be old when we return to Earth,” Yue Xiaonao reminded him.","“They’ll be about in their 50s,” Chen Chuan said. “Anyway, it doesn’t matter if they find out our secret.”","“Alas, Li Muen is very old now. Maybe she is going to be a grandmother soon.” Mengmeng grinned and said, “If we were on Earth, we would all be old.”","“Look at you.” Yue Xiaonao curled her lips and said, “You have a delicate face and look like you are only 22 years old, and Auntie Zi Yan appears only 27 or 28 years old. Age doesn’t matter to cultivators.”","“Yeah.”","Mengmeng said, “When we pick them up, we can go back to Earth and see our friends. We’ve been out for so long. I miss our home on Mount New Moon.”","“Me too,” Yue Xiaonao echoed.","They chatted casually.","Buzz!","The Highest Clouds Palace Master suddenly issued an alarm.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Hundreds of people, including Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Wuluo, who were all elders of the main hall, gathered in the air on the side of Mengmeng.","Everyone looked up at the sky.","When they found that several spaceships were slowly descending with the logos representing the forces they belonged to, everyone knew that those people were there.","“It’s Immortal Monarch Sanlei’s group.”","Mengmeng snorted.","“Oh no, Uncle Zhang is still cultivating in seclusion,” Yue Xiaonao said. “Hurry up and get him here.”","“Well, my dad said that he could wake up at any time.” Mengmeng turned around, looked into the small palace, and said loudly, “Dad, the enemies are here.”","“Got it.”","Zhang Han responded to Mengmeng via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique as he began to adjust his breath with his Original Body.","In this closed-door training, he had gained a lot. Not only did he absorb the energy of the four chains in the secret realm, but he also comprehended a lot of supernatural powers.","This was the benefit of advancing to the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage.","“They came so quickly.”","Yue Wuwei sighed softly.","Recently, he was ready to break through to the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage and often cultivated. He thought that he would make a breakthrough before the enemy came, but he didn’t expect that they would arrive a few days faster than he had imagined.","“They’re all here.”","“Hiss!”","Immortal Master Wuluo took a deep breath. “Can we really stop them?”","“It’s about if Hanyang can stop them.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said in an uncertain tone, “With his means of dealing with Immortal Master Wumo, he should be able to stop them.”","“He will. We believe in Second Elder.”","Many of his subordinates spoke up one after another. They all praised Zhang Han, but in the end, what they said made Immortal Master Waterheaven a bit sad.","“Alas, I’m the Sect Leader...”","Since Zhang Han took the elders to explore the secret realm and everyone was unscathed, he seemed to have surpassed the Palace Master with his great merits.","Fortunately, Immortal Master Waterheaven didn’t care about these things at all. He was even very glad that he could build a good relationship with Zhang Han, who had promised to take him to pick an ancient demonic beast in the future.","Immortal Master Waterheaven looked forward to that greatly.","“I hope nothing unexpected happens.” Immortal Master Waterheaven’s heart was heavy.","When he saw Immortal Master Sanlei and the others getting off the spaceship one after another, more than half of the hundreds of people he could call out were from the major forces, and the weakest one was from a super sect.","With those great enemies in the sky, he felt greatly troubled.","“Holy Thunder Sect, you’re here.”","Standing in the front, Immortal Master Waterheaven said in a low voice, “In the big secret realm, many fellow Daoists know the rules. The dispute between us and Immortal Master Sanlei from the Holy Thunder Sect originated from a Profound-grade treasure. First of all, we found that Profound-grade treasure. Immortal Master Sanlei tried to fight for it. In the battle, he lost his duplication and more than a dozen subordinates.”","“Also.”","Immortal Master Wuluo said, “In the secret realm, there was an area of the Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity. Immortal Master Sanlei and the others were besieged by thousands of Fire Spirits of the Devil Calamity. We wanted to help them outside, but he cast a spell and lured thousands of Fire Spirits to attack us. He left calmly. Immortal Master Sanlei, you have to give us a reason for what you did.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Immortal Master Sanlei burst into laughter and looked at the people around him.","“How about it? Just as I said, everyone from the Highest Clouds Palace has no sense of shame and is stirring up trouble. No wonder they can only become a first-rate power. This disposition of theirs is already vile enough.","“Besides, what right does your Highest Clouds Palace have to compete with me for things? Not only did I lead a team to save you in the Fire Spirit Zone, but I also took the lead in solving the crisis when we encountered a Profound-grade treasure. Unexpectedly, you launched a sneak attack behind my back and killed my duplication. I said that I would kill you with my own hands. Today, I’m here to fulfill my promise.”","He told another story.","Who knew if it was true or not?","Immortal Master Sanlei was the only one from the Holy Thunder Sect who made it alive from the secret realm. Others might not believe what the people from the Highest Clouds Palace said.","“Such means can only be seen in first-rate forces.”","Some people from the super sects were discussing openly.","“Yes. The Highest Clouds Palace is trying to deceive others with just a few words. How could what they said be true? Why would Immortal Master Sanlei risk his duplication like that?”","“This group of people is very cunning. Don’t trust their words so easily. Capture them and bring them to the Holy Thunder Sect for an open interrogation.”","In the face of all kinds of comments, Mengmeng got upset.","When she was upset, she would say it directly. She looked up and sneered.","“Immortal Master Sanlei, you’re really shameless. I think you’re just a lying Immortal Master. You’re full of nonsense and don’t tell the truth. You’re nothing. Bah!”","“What are you looking at?” Chen Chuan shouted, “Asshole.”","“Heh.”","Unexpectedly, Immortal Master Sanlei was heartless and stubborn. He smiled faintly, looked at the crowd around him, and said in a helpless tone, “See? They are such a group.”","“Yes. The tattlers who stir up trouble are just disgusting.” A middle-aged man next to him stared at Mengmeng and said with a smile, “As for this young girl who spoke first, let me punish her.”","Swoosh!","He flew straight over in front of everyone.","Many people suddenly burst into laughter.","“Is he Immortal Master Kehu?”","“Sure enough, it’s him. I knew it long ago. Immortal Master Kehu will definitely be unable to restrain himself when he sees a beautiful woman.”","“He has countless concubines and loves beautiful women very much. In the face of such a pretty girl below, he will definitely be tempted.”","“I reckon that if he’s given those women, he will let this go even without the treasures.”","Some people discussed with each other for a while.","“What are you doing?” Mengmeng asked with a fierce look in her beautiful big eyes.","“You know who are the tattlers. Why do you have to come out and act?” Zi Yan stood up and walked to Mengmeng.","When Immortal Master Kehu saw her, his eyes lit up again.","“She’s gorgeous!”","Zi Yan figure was graceful, curvy, and well-proportioned. In particular, her face was extremely delicate.","Immortal Master Kehu was tempted.","“You still refuse to repent. I’ll punish you severely!”","Immortal Master Kehu was from a super sect, which was a little larger than the Holy Thunder Sect. Although Immortal Master Sanlei was the leader of the team, he was watching coldly from the back at this time.","At that moment-","Buzz!","In the small palace, Zhang Han suddenly opened his eyes, which were shining brightly.","His figure moved, leaving behind a series of afterimages in the void. He was originally wearing a black coat, but it quietly turned into a white gown.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body appeared.","“What are you doing?”","Zhang Han moved so fast that no one could see him clearly. In the blink of an eye, he appeared in front of Immortal Master Kehu. His eyes were indifferent, and he didn’t even bother to say a word.","He pressed his right hand forward.","“WHAT?!”","Immortal Master Kehu widened his eyes and found that he couldn’t control the energy in his body.","Immortal Master Kehu was in such a panic that he trembled.","“You still dare to fight here?","“Are you going to offend us?","“There are hundreds of forces here. Any one of us can turn your Highest Clouds Palace into ashes!”","Immortal Master Sanlei spoke out in a grim voice.","Bop!","Immortal Master Kehu turned into wisps of flowing light. Even his blood didn’t remain. The flowing light surrounded the finger of Zhang Han’s right hand and slowly dissipated.","It was like a work of art.","“Hundreds of forces?”","Zhang Han raised his eyebrows slightly and looked at Immortal Master Sanlei. “I’ve been waiting for you. Since you’re here now, I’ll kill you first.”","“Hahaha, do you want to fight me?”","The eyes of Immortal Master Sanlei were full of hatred, but he was quite vigilant in his heart. He was very afraid of the person below.","He even planned to advance and retreat with his teammates.","“I have hundreds of experts at the Last Stage of the ninth tier with me. Han Yang Immortal is nothing.”","As soon as he made up his mind.","“Are you scared?”","Zhang Han suddenly appeared behind him, and Immortal Master Sanlei felt that his shoulder was pressed down by someone.","Hiss!","Immortal Master Sanlei’s pupils constricted. “How could this be possible?”","His body began to go numb, and the energy in his body gradually froze.","“It’s the Immortal Technique.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s eyes lit up as he felt envy in his heart.","“Second Elder is skilled at Immortal Techniques!”","Clack! Clack! Clack!","“How, how is this possible? Who the hell are you?”","The body of Immortal Master Sanlei was stiff, but his life-saving method still allowed him to perform the Thunder Control Technique.","However, the thunderbolts that appeared were easily extinguished by Zhang Han.","“WHAT?!”","Immortal Master Sanlei had a look of despair on his face.","He had come to capture the Highest Clouds Palace. Why did he perish the moment he appeared?"]},{"number":1683,"title":"Chapter 1683 Overlook the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 1683 Overlook the World","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Sanlei at the Last Stage of the ninth tier, who had no strength to resist at all, was directly obliterated in the void and turned into wisps of flowing light.","When the light dissipated, it meant that another ninth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivator had died.","The people around panicked.","All the people present were at the Last Stage of the ninth tier. Since Zhang Han could kill two of them in an instant, it meant that he would be able to kill more.","“Retreat now!”","“Oh no, he’s at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage!”","“Heavens, the Holy Thunder Sect is so despicable. They actually spread false news!”","Many people didn’t think about the death of Immortal Master Sanlei and Immortal Master Kehu. They just wanted to keep themselves alive.","“He just killed them, and he may kill more people.","“Moreover, he’s at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","“How powerful is that?”","There were only a small number of people at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage in the Star Sea.","Almost all the ones at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage belonged to super sects or were Grand Masters of the Holy Lands.","They were the top figures.","The people present at the Last Stage of the ninth tier didn’t dare to think about fighting at all.","Since ancient times, there had only been about ten thousand people who had reached the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage in the entire Star Sea.","Although the ones at the Last Stage of the ninth tier and the ones at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage were all at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier, there was a gap between them. Many people in the Last Stage of the ninth tier could not reach the Peak Stage.","Without reaching the Peak Stage, there was no chance of undergoing the final Heavenly Tribulation.","Thus, at that moment, the experts present were afraid.","“We’re too close to him. He can kill whomever he wants!”","“What should we do?”","Many people broke out in a cold sweat.","Some didn’t dare to escape. They levitated where they were, their hearts trembling.","They were afraid that if they ran too fast, they would attract Zhang Han’s attention.","Some people slowly retreated, extremely vigilant. All kinds of Defense Treasures were prepared. As long as they could hold on for a few seconds, they still had a chance to leave.","“Dammit! Immortal Master Sanlei tricked us!”","Many people cursed in their hearts.","But they still had to deal with the current situation. As for what to do, it was another problem.","Not only this group of people but also Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and Yue Wuwei were all shocked with their mouths wide open.","“Damn, this kid is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage!”","Yue Wuwei swallowed subconsciously and said, “That’s incredible.”","“Peak... Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage?” Immortal Master Waterheaven couldn’t believe his eyes. He rubbed his eyes hard and looked over. When he came to his senses, he was overjoyed.","“Hahaha, Hanyang is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. Our Highest Clouds Palace will be safe!”","“This is great news.” Immortal Master Wuluo grinned from ear to ear. “Wonderful. That scourge, Immortal Master Sanlei, deserved to die. Second Elder is amazing. He’s at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. He’s too powerful. He’s my idol!”","“Second Elder is amazing!”","“Second Elder is so powerful.”","“...”","In the face of many people’s worshipful eyes and respectful words, Mengmeng curled her lips and looked very happy.","“See? I told you that my dad is always reliable.”","“Uncle Zhang is really awesome. He’s just admirable.” Yue Xiaonao said with emotion, “No matter where he goes, he will become a top big shot in a certain place in a short time.”","“That’s right.” Chen Chuan said with envy and admiration, “Uncle Zhang kills wherever he goes. Men should be like this! In the future, I will also become a powerful figure like Uncle Zhang. Well, it will be enough for me to have half of his strength.”","“Hahaha, stop dreaming. Go to sleep.” Yue Xiaonao patted Chen Chuan on the shoulder and said, “If your cultivation level can surpass Mengmeng’s, you win.”","“Huh?” Chen Chuan looked crestfallen. “I can’t surpass her.”","The atmosphere instantly became much more relaxed.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on Zhang Han.","At this moment, he was the center of focus.","Zi Yan smiled.","The man above was her husband, her guardian angel.","No matter how much glory he had, at home, he cooked for her, took care of her, and was considerate and tender.","“This is fate.”","Zi Yan looked at Zhang Han sweetly.","She was glad that she had met him back then.","Lisa also sighed with emotion. Zhang Han had developed from Earth all the way to the top of the Cultivation World.","Along the way, he had not encountered many difficulties. Everything was going well. He had always been so invincible.","He showed off his power.","Zhang Han’s Extreme Purity Immortal Body was at the Middle Stage of the eighth tier, whose power was comparable to that of a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage cultivator.","Its Immortal Technique was so powerful that its opponents were unable to resist it. In fact, they did not even dare to escape.","The people around all broke out in a cold sweat and looked at Zhang Han.","They were filled with regret, fear, and terror.","Fortunately, Zhang Han didn’t kill them.","He looked around and said, “Do all of you who have come here want to get a share of the profits?”","“No, no, no, Lord Han Yang Immortal.” Someone plucked up the courage to make an obeisance by cupping one hand in the other before his chest. “Our Seven Battles Mansion just wants to know some information about the secret realm, because our First Elder’s team failed to get out of it.”","“Yes, yes, yes. The same goes for our Dark Teleportation Sect.”","“Yes. The same goes for our sect...”","One by one, those people spoke up.","Judging from their cautious expressions, they were no longer as indifferent as they had been when they first arrived.","“Heh.”","Zhang Han smiled faintly and did not make things difficult for them.","“I’ll give you a year to ask your Grand Masters and Sect Leaders to come over in person. I want to hear their explanation, not just a few words from you.”","“Phew...”","As soon as he said that, many people breathed a sigh of relief, but at the same time, they felt a little wronged.","“Han Yang Immortal is too arrogant. He’s asking us to ask hundreds of Sect Leaders and Grand Masters to come here and explain.”","Although they felt disdainful, they didn’t dare to refuse.","“I’ll go back and inform the Sect Leader.”","“I’ll tell the Grand Master right away.”","“...”","Many people planned to slip away.","At this time, someone in the crowd frowned and said, “Han Yang Immortal, it’s not appropriate for you to ask hundreds of Sect Leaders and Grand Masters to come here.”","“Hmm?” Zhang Han looked over.","Many people around also looked over and were slightly shocked.","“He’s Immortal Master Futu, the Third Elder of the Cloud Valley Sect.”","“He has spoken. He finally can’t stand the attitude of Han Yang Immortal.”","“Immortal Master Futu has been at the Last Stage of the ninth tier for 3,000 years. He is very close to the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. Moreover, the Cloud Valley Sect is very powerful. Even if Han Yang Immortal is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, he has to be careful. After all, the Cloud Valley Sect has three Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage experts.”","Many people whispered a few words.","As for Zhang Han, he smiled faintly and said, “What’s wrong with that?”","“Han Yang Immortal.”","Immortal Master Futu flew forward for dozens of meters. He put his hands behind his back and his posture was calm. He regarded himself completely on the same level as Zhang Han.","“You’re at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, and you’re also a Dao Seeking Cultivator of the highest level in the Star Sea. Your power and status are extremely high. But every one of the sects present has a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage expert. It’s really inappropriate for you alone to force hundreds of Dao Seeking Cultivators of the same level to come to you. It’s even more likely to arouse hostility.”","After he spoke, an old man next to him nodded and said, “Yes, Han Yang Immortal, your strength has been shown, and we approve of it. In fact, you just need to give everyone an explanation about the big secret realm. No one will investigate it further. After all, there will be big secret realms in the future.”","“Yes. The dispute between the Holy Thunder Sect and the Highest Clouds Palace has nothing to do with us,” another man said. “We came here to ask about the situation of the big secret realm. There is no dispute at first, but it doesn’t make sense that you want hundreds of Sect Leaders and Grand Masters to come here. Please think twice, Han Yang Immortal.”","“If the hostility is aroused, several, or even hundreds of Grand Masters of the Holy Lands will make trouble for you. Han Yang Immortal, have you ever thought about the consequences?”","“You might be able to escape by yourself, but won’t the Highest Clouds Palace and the group of people down there be in danger?”","“Han Yang Immortal, I think you’d better talk about the situation in the big secret realm and give everyone an explanation.”","As they spoke, they suddenly realized that there was no need to be too afraid of this person.","He was at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, but there were so many forces present. Which one of them didn’t have a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage expert?","How dare he offend hundreds of people at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage alone?","Clap! Clap!","Zhang Han smiled and clapped his hands. “Marvelous.”","After he clapped a few times, the surrounding sounds quieted down, and the smile on Zhang Han’s face gradually disappeared.","Zhang Han stopped clapping, looked at Immortal Master Futu and the others, and said indifferently, “Since when do you have the right to tell me what to do?”","Swoosh!","The surroundings were deathly silent.","The face of Immortal Master Futu darkened. “So, you’re determined to go against us.”","Zhang Han did not respond.","He looked straight ahead. His eyes were shining with blue light, and rays of light surrounded Immortal Master Futu.","“What are you doing?!”","Immortal Master Futu immediately defended and tried to disperse those streams of light.","But no matter what kind of defense he used, it was useless.","He watched the flowing light enter his body and surge wildly in his meridians and soul sense sea.","His consciousness dissipated.","Before he died, he looked at Zhang Han and said, “You, you!”","Even until the moment of his death, he still couldn’t believe it. “Why does he dare to take action?”","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Futu turned into a wisp of blue light and covered all the people who spoke around him.","The blue light was like curling smoke.","This meant that more than a dozen people had died.","“Does anyone else have a problem?”","Zhang Han looked ahead calmly.","He didn’t show much might, but his aura made these people feel as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","There was dead silence in the field.","Down below, Immortal Master Waterheaven was also somewhat alarmed. He was trembling with fear.","Immortal Master Wuluo muttered in a low voice, “Oh my god, he, he is so aggressive.”","He had never expected that Hanyang, who was usually so easy-going, would be so aggressive on such an occasion.","He was like an emperor who ruled the world with his word.","Hundreds of high-position officials were shivering in fear in the void.","“Palace Master, record their information.”","Zhang Han said calmly, “I’d like to see which force dares not to come.”","Swoosh!","As soon as he finished speaking, Zhang Han flew up.","Obviously, he didn’t want to talk to these people.","As for Immortal Master Waterheaven, his scalp was a little numb.","He didn’t dare to go up alone. He looked around and said, “Let’s go together, sort out their information, and let them leave as soon as possible.”","He came to the top with dozens of elders and nodded slightly.","“Everyone, please play along. The Second Elder of our sect wants to keep your information. If any of you resists, it will be difficult for me to explain it to the Second Elder.”","His words stunned Immortal Master Wuluo and the others.","Immortal Master Wuluo even wanted to say, “Hey, wake up. You are the Sect Leader!”"]},{"number":1684,"title":"Chapter 1684 A Far-reaching Reputation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1684 A Far-reaching Reputation","At first, Immortal Master Waterheaven was indeed a bit nervous.","All of these forces were stronger than the Highest Clouds Palace. They were either super sects or Holy Lands.","However, he knew that these super sects and Holy Lands were relatively weak. Even so, every faction was much stronger than the Highest Clouds Palace.","Even the weakest super sects were dozens of times stronger than first-rate forces, mostly because some of them had Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage experts.","A Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage cultivator was very important.","Now, the Highest Clouds Palace also had a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage expert, who was their Second Elder.","“Ha...”","As Immortal Master Waterheaven looked at the people who obediently came to register, a sense of pride arose in his heart.","“Tell me your name!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven looked at the people lined up in front of him. They spoke out one after another. Immortal Master Wuluo stood next to him and recorded their names.","“Hey! Immortal Master Wangqing? You’re here too.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven let out a cold snort.","The other party looked a little embarrassed. He said, “If I say I’m here to watch the fun... I don’t think you’ll believe me. How did you get your Second Elder? He’s amazing.”","“What does that have to do with you? Register and leave,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said unhappily.","He knew this man, but he didn’t expect that Immortal Master Wangqing would come here for such a thing.","Hearing Immortal Master Waterheaven’s words, Wangqing left with an embarrassed look.","He didn’t dare to say anything at all. Even if his status was higher than that of Immortal Master Waterheaven, things were different now. The Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace was at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, and he could kill people at any time. How could Wangqing dare to say anything else?","After leaving the names of their forces one by one, these people left dejectedly.","They weren’t relaxed until their spaceships entered the secondary space.","“Immortal Master Sanlei is dead.”","“The Holy Thunder Sect’s information error is simply outrageous. That man is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, but they didn’t tell us anything about that.”","“I can only say that Immortal Master Sanlei is a fool. Since that man could kill his duplication, he could kill him with ease.”","“Those people from the other sects died because of the Holy Thunder Sect.”","“It’s hard to say. If Han Yang Immortal was willing to give everyone an explanation, it would be reasonable for him to kill those who spoke in a disrespectful tone. However, Han Yang Immortal is too arrogant. He wants all the Sect Leaders and Grand Masters to come here and explain in person. What explanation does he want?”","“Heh! Originally, the Highest Clouds Palace could have avoided this calamity. Now, there is no way to end it.”","“...”","Many people from different forces communicated with each other, intending to report the truth at this time.","As for the people of the Holy Thunder Sect, they had just deployed various spaceships outside to lock down the Highest Clouds Star. No one had expected that the group led by Immortal Master Sanlei would die in such a short time.","Those spaceships also immediately evacuated.","These king vessels meant nothing to Zhang Han, who was at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","Inside the small palace.","Zhang Han and his family, Yue Wuwei, Chen Chuan, and the others were sitting next to each other.","Chen Chuan had a look of admiration on his face.","“You’re amazing, Uncle Zhang!”","“How did you reach the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage directly?” Yue Wuwei asked in disbelief.","“My dad can’t be judged by common sense,” Mengmeng said leisurely while drinking juice.","“That’s the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. There are only about 10,000 people in that level in the Star Sea,” Yue Wuwei said with emotion.","“That’s the case in terms of combat capability,” Zhang Han said with amusement. “But my realm is much lower.”","“What realm are you in?” Yue Wuwei asked. “The Peak Stage of the eighth tier?”","“I’m at the Middle Stage of the eighth tier,” Zhang Han replied directly.","“Hiss!”","Yue Wuwei gasped and said, “That’s incredible.”","“You’re at the Middle Stage of the eighth tier, and yet you can display the power of the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. Zi Yan, it seems that your man will really be invincible in the Cultivation World in the future.” Lisa was also surprised, but she wasn’t too stunned.","Because she was used to Zhang Han’s astounding strength.","Therefore, everyone quickly calmed down and talked and laughed.","“You have the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage combat capability. Then... there are hundreds of forces outside. Their Grand Masters and Sect Leaders are also at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. Can you deal with them?” Yue Wuwei asked hesitantly.","“Sure.”","Zhang Han said in an indifferent tone, “They must be arrogant when they come. After I kill a few Grand Masters, those people will behave themselves.”","“Kill a few Grand Masters???”","Yue Wuwei was dumbfounded at once.","In this regard, Zhang Han explained, “Although that Immortal Master Wumo has just reached the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, he is still stronger than some of the Sect Masters of the super sects and Grand Masters of the Holy Lands.”","“In that case...” Yue Wuwei looked a little surprised. “The hundreds of Sect Masters and Grand Masters are basically no match for you?”","The atmosphere instantly became much more relaxed.","Since they didn’t need to worry about those people, they had nothing to worry about.","“How about I adjust my state for a few days and then make a breakthrough?” Yue Wuwei asked.","Zhang Han said casually, “Sure.”","An hour later, the recording was finished.","Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others returned.","“Hanyang, do you want to have a look at the list?” Immortal Master Waterheaven approached Zhang Han.","“No.” Zhang Han shook his head and didn’t care about it at all.","“I wonder if those people will come.” Immortal Master Wuluo was a little puzzled.","“They will,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with certainty. “These Sect Leaders and Grand Masters all value their reputations. Moreover, a new cultivator at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage has appeared in the Highest Clouds Palace. They will come to see what’s going on.”","He didn’t say, “Besides, Hanyang doesn’t show respect to their forces, so those people will surely come and try to make things right.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was a little worried, but since things had come to this point, it was useless to think too much about it. He just quietly watched the Second Elder demonstrate his power.","“Luck really is a wonderful thing.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven thought to himself.","He knew Zhang Han because of the ancient demonic beast. Now, Zhang Han had risen and become the Second Elder of the Highest Clouds Palace. With his help, the Highest Clouds Palace could be said to be world-famous.","Five days later, Yue Wuwei started his tribulation.","He took a spaceship.","Not far from the Highest Clouds Palace, Yue Wuwei was about to summon the tribulation lightning. Looking at the tribulation clouds that were gathering, he sneered.","“Heavenly Tribulation, I’m here again. Are you surprised to see me, your old acquaintance?”","Clack!","What answered him was a clap of thunder.","The tribulation clouds churned violently. He was supposed to face the Heavenly Tribulation that broke through to the seventh tier from the sixth tier, but now it was the kind that broke through to the eighth tier from the seventh tier, which was a whole level higher.","If Yue Wuwei were to undergo his tribulation alone, he would be doomed.","But just as the tribulation lightning was ready, the Thunder Body appeared.","Standing above, Zhang Han said with a smile, “More.”","As a result, the Heavenly Tribulation got dumbfounded in the pitch-black void.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The tribulation lightning had advanced to the qualitative Heavenly Tribulation. However, it was useless.","It hacked randomly.","The Heavenly Tribulation suddenly discovered one thing. “This thunder thief has become fucking stronger again! Dammit!”","It had no choice. After dozens of thunderbolts with great momentum, the tribulation clouds dissipated in two seconds.","Since the Heavenly Tribulation was a bad mood, the nearby Dao Seeking Cultivators who were undergoing their tribulations were going to suffer.","So Zhang Han decisively gave the order.","“Don’t undergo tribulation in the area near the Highest Clouds Palace for the time being. Even if you want to do it, you should go somewhere farther away.”","Many people were confused by this order. However, they all obeyed it.","Now, the entire Highest Clouds Palace knew that their Second Elder was at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","In particular, the Hall Master who had found Zhang Han at that time sighed with emotion and was a little scared. He admitted that he had bad intentions after seeing Zhang Han. However, their Palace Master acted decently and did not rob him. Instead, they exchanged things. From then on, the Highest Clouds Palace had their Second Elder.","Time passed.","A month later, more and more forces heard the news.","“What? There’s a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage expert in the Highest Clouds Palace? How is that possible?”","“I’m telling the truth. The man at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage is called Han Yang Immortal. He is very aggressive and decisive. No wonder they are the only team to return from the secret realm. He’s too powerful.”","“Han Yang Immortal seckilled Immortal Master Sanlei, Immortal Master Kehu, and others by himself. Isn’t this enough to prove that he is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage?”","“He actually asked the Sect Leaders and Grand Masters of hundreds of forces to explain themselves to him in person. Oh my god, he is too bold.”","After the Sect Masters of several super sects heard the news-","“Haha, what an arrogant newcomer.”","“He actually wants all of us to go to the Highest Clouds Star to give him an explanation?”","“Very well. I’m curious as to exactly what courage this newcomer has to speak such arrogant words.”","A few people who had nothing to do were about to leave to inquire about some news.","“There’s no rush. Didn’t the Han Yang Immortal say that the time limit is one year? Let’s go there right before the deadline.”","The news spread out.","The Dongruo Holy Land also came to know about it.","“No wonder that man dared to attack our Holy Land. He’s also at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.”","The Grand Master of the Dongruo Holy Land finished his closed-door training. After hearing about these things, he said in a deep voice, “Those Holy Lands and sects who have been informed are all low-level. Our Dongruo Holy Land is at the middle level, so we don’t need to pay attention to it for the time being. It’s not too late to take action after they finish.","“Aren’t the Highest Clouds Palace and Han Yang Immortal very glorious? Let them be glorious for a while. When their affairs are over, I’ll take action.”","The man who dared to kill the people of the Dongruo Holy Land in front of everyone was also at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, so Immortal Master Tianyi could personally go and look into this matter.","For the sake of fame, wealth, the ancient demonic beast, and prestige, he had to make a trip.","As such, more and more powers began to hear about this matter.","In the entire Star Sea, there were about 10,000 people at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","It sounded like a lot, but in fact, it was very rare.","In fact, it was very difficult for ordinary people to see any of the 10,000 people who scattered across the entire Nine Mountains Region, unless it was some sort of gathering.","The Highest Clouds Palace was a first-tier faction. The sudden appearance of a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage expert did attract quite a bit of attention.","However-","In the Holy Land on the top of the Eighth Mountain.","A little girl in her teens bounced about and said, “Grand Master Diming, you’ve come out of seclusion.”","“Yeah.”","Opposite her was a long-faced man who looked about 30 years old. He was dressed in black and looked handsome and unrestrained.","If anyone else heard of the name Grand Master Diming, they would be shocked.","Because that man was the Grand Master of the top 10 Holy Lands on the Eighth Mountain. He was famous 3,000 years ago for his extraordinary means, and the number of Grand Masters who had been killed by him exceeded ten.","“Grand Master, recently, the Seventh Mountain has been very lively. A first-rate force suddenly has an expert at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. He called out hundreds of super sects and Holy Lands and asked the Sect Masters and Grand Masters to explain themselves to him in person. He’s such an arrogant person.”","The little girl chirped.","This was the biggest news recently. Every time the Grand Master came out of seclusion, she would tell him something new.","“I see.”","Grand Master Diming nodded slightly. “He is indeed quite arrogant. He has my demeanor back then. What’s his name?”","“He’s called Han Yang Immortal. I’ve never heard of him...”","“What?! Wait! What’s his name again? Who is he?”","“His name is Han Yang Immortal. Grand Master, what’s wrong?”","“Help me sit down. I feel dizzy.”"]},{"number":1685,"title":"Chapter 1685 Invisibility Supernatural Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 1685 Invisibility Supernatural Power","The little girl asked with concern, “Grand Master, Grand Master, what’s wrong? Don’t scare me. You are a Great Demon King. How can you faint?”","This little girl was not what she looked like in her teens. She was also from one of the special clans. She always looked like a little girl, and she would stay this way for the rest of her life.","She was the maidservant of Immortal Master Diming, and she needed to do nothing but to stay cute.","“Phew...”","Immortal Master Diming took a deep breath and said, “I just came out of seclusion. My brain may be short of oxygen. Well, what did you just say? Which Han Yang Immortal is it? Do you have an image of him?”","“Well, there seems to be an image. I’ll ask about it.”","The cute girl took out her communication device and contacted the people of the Holy Land. A few minutes later-","Beep!","Her smart wristband began to project images.","The scene in the image was the Highest Clouds Palace.","The scene showed that there were hundreds of people in a mighty manner, and then a strange figure in white appeared.","“Ahem! Ahem! Ahem!”","After seeing the figure, Immortal Master Diming suddenly coughed hard.","“Grand Master, what’s wrong now?” the little girl asked in confusion.","“Alas!”","Immortal Master Diming suddenly sighed. “Do you want to hear a story?”","“Yes.” The little girl nodded with a smile.","Immortal Master Diming simply sat on a stone and looked at the scenery of the valley in front of him.","He said slowly, “5000 years ago, I was just born. My talent had always been the best among my peers in the Holy Land. No one in the same generation as me in Eighth Mountain could compete with me. In the entire Nine Mountains Region, there were only five people who could compete with me.","“4000 years ago, I reached the ninth tier and began to adventure outside.","“3500 years ago, I had a great opportunity to reach the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage and became very powerful.","“3000 years ago, I came back from a barren Star Area. When the Holy Land was in trouble, I killed a lot of people. I became famous in the Star Sea with the Taoist title Diming and became the Grand Master of the Holy Land.","“After that, I had almost no opponents in the Eighth Mountain until I met a young man.","“There was something very special about him. At first, I didn’t take him seriously. But after the spar, I suddenly found that many of his abilities and skills were beyond my imagination. What kind of feeling was that? I didn’t know, but I knew that it wouldn’t be long before he surpassed me. At that time, he was at the eighth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","“However, less than a hundred years later, he became famous all over the world. We sparred again, and in the end, he beat me up with one hand.","“After another fifty years, he went through the final Heavenly Tribulation. I couldn’t believe it. He actually attracted the divine thunder over the sky. That guy is a freak. At that time, billions of Dao Seeking Cultivators went to watch the tribulation, but in the end, he couldn’t resist it. The violent divine thunder over the sky seemed to have caused a change in the rules of the Great Domain. Many people don’t remember his name at all. Only a few people who know him remember that there used to be such a powerful man.","“It’s said that he’s the most talented person in 10,000 years. Unfortunately, the world doesn’t know him anymore, but I never expected that...”","Before Immortal Master Diming could finish, the little girl cried out involuntarily in horror, “Grand Master, do you mean that Han Yang Immortal is that man??”","“That man... Yes, Han Yang Immortal is that man.” Immortal Master Diming took a deep breath.","“Oh my god, the divine thunder over the sky is claimed to be the strongest. Even the rules of the Great Domain have changed so many memories of the experts at the Tribulation Stage. But then, he is still alive, isn’t he?” The little girl questioned everything she had learned.","“This is a bit strange, but I’m not mistaken.”","Immortal Master Diming stood up and said, “I’ll wait and see what happens. His name will definitely scare many people once it’s spread. That guy was truly a formidable figure that crushed 10 super sects in a few months of time.”","“Well, it is said that the Grand Masters and Sect Masters of those hundreds of forces seem to be very dissatisfied with the arrogant attitude of Han Yang Immortal,” the little girl said.","“Those people aren’t even qualified to speak to me, let alone him.” Immortal Master Diming’s eyes were calm. “Let’s go to the Highest Clouds Palace. I want to see him in person.”","“Okay, Grand Master.”","The little girl immediately went down to make the arrangements.","...","This matter had caused quite a stir.","In the Seventh, Sixth, and Eighth Mountains, the news spread the fastest.","The situation of the two Holy Lands on the Sixth Mountain was similar to that of Immortal Master Diming.","“What?!”","“Han Yang Immortal? That’s impossible! Han Yang Immortal can’t be alive.”","After watching the video-","“It’s really him. He’s not dead. Even the divine thunder over the sky can’t kill him. This... Hurry up and give out the order to put the Highest Clouds Palace on the List of Dangerous Figures. No one in the Holy Land can mess with Han Yang Immortal.”","“Grand Master, that man is just at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. You are one of the top 20 figures on the Sixth Mountain. Why should we be afraid of him?”","“What do you know? You know nothing. Get out of here!”","“Okay.”","“...”","Several Grand Masters were shocked.","Because they remembered what had happened.","Just like Immortal Master Lingxi, they knew Han Yang Immortal and knew about the divine thunder over the sky.","However, most people in the world had no impression of it.","At this time, the Grand Masters and the Sect Leaders of the hundreds of forces had reached an agreement that they would arrive at the Highest Clouds Star on the same day when the one-year agreement expired.","They wanted to see how this newcomer at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage could be so powerful that he dared to ask for their explanation.","A year passed in the Star Sea in the blink of an eye.","As for Zhang Han and his people, they were enjoying their leisure time on the Highest Clouds Star.","Even Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Chen Chuan built their cities next to each other in different styles.","The layout was the same as that of modern cities. There were schools, hospitals, ordinary buildings, and so on, but no one lived there after the construction.","They were like building blocks.","It was a waste of resources, but it didn’t matter. Mengmeng was the little princess of the Second Elder. Now the prestige of the Second Elder was well-known in the Highest Clouds Palace.","He was a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, and he got the say in almost everything.","Gradually, the people of the Highest Clouds Palace in the outer and inner rings of the Star Sea heard the news.","“What? Our sect has a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage expert?”","“Hahaha, our miserable days are finally over!”","“With a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage expert, we can also become a super sect!”","“Back then, when the sect was in dire straits, none of us left. This is loyalty. This is meritorious service. We’ll wait. When the Highest Clouds Palace expands, we will all be founding members!”","As the sect flourished day by day, the atmosphere in the entire Highest Clouds Palace became different from before.","Those who had wanted to leave but held back were glad that they had made the right decision.","More and more people knew about the Highest Clouds Palace and heard of the name of Han Yang Immortal.","It seemed that a new star was slowly rising.","However, those in the know revealed that the Highest Clouds Palace had offended 336 major powers. They were either super sects or Holy Lands.","“Holy shit!”","Many members of the Highest Clouds Place were startled.","“We’re doomed.”","Their hearts sank.","The one-year agreement had attracted the attention of many sects in the outer and inner rings.","After all, this was a major event that had occurred in the Nine Mountains Region for the first time in a hundred years.","Would there be a fight? Would the Highest Clouds Palace be destroyed, or would they compromise and preserve their strength?","In fact, many people hoped that there would be a fight. Battles of this level were relatively rare.","Under the attention of many people, time was up.","Some people even just learned the news although it had been a year. The news did not spread very fast in the Star Sea, because it was just too big.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","On this day, the void around the Highest Clouds Star was bustling with noise and excitement.","Large fleets came one after another.","“They’re here.”","“They’re here.”","Hundreds of fleets from major forces arrived outside the Highest Clouds Star almost at the same time.","Seeing such a scene and the tens of thousands of fleets, the fleet stationed at the Highest Clouds Palace’s space station trembled with fear.","“Once they attack together, the Highest Clouds Star will be doomed.”","“Hurry and sound the alarm.”","Buzz!","News quickly spread to the ground as Immortal Master Waterheaven and the others gathered together.","When he saw the scene playing out before him, Immortal Master Waterheaven gasped. “Those people are here.”","Immortal Master Wuluo scratched his head. “Although I’ve been prepared, it’s still terrifying to see this scene.”","“Why should you be terrified? My dad is here.”","Mengmeng sat lazily on the chair aside.","In her opinion, since her dad didn’t escape, he could defeat those people.","At this time, Zhang Han and Zi Yan came from the side hall.","“Let’s go up and have a look.”","Zhang Han smiled slightly.","They quickly flew into the air. In the void of the universe, there were many fleets in front of them.","Many teams had already come out of the spaceships. Each Grand Master and Sect Leader had gathered. It was like a gathering.","They even chatted and laughed.","“I didn’t want to come, but I thought it was a good opportunity to get together, so I came to have a look.”","“Han Yang Immortal is too arrogant. He asked us to come over. I’ll ask him later what explanation he wants.”","“Haha, even if we don’t do anything, the Dongruo Holy Land will eliminate the Highest Clouds Palace. I hear their Grand Master is very stubborn.”","“Immortal Master Guangzong, you’re here too.”","Some people greeted each other. Obviously, one of them was a white-haired old man called Immortal Master Guangzong, who had the most connections.","At this time, he was also quite proud. These were all connections that he had developed over a long time.","When one reached the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, it was difficult to make any progress in one’s strength. Sometimes, it depended on one’s connections.","Immortal Master Guangzong cupped his hands and suddenly looked ahead with a sneer.","“Highest Clouds Palace’s men are here. Later on, I will consult this newcomer. Everyone, don’t fight me over this!”","“Immortal Master Guangzong, Han Yang Immortal killed the people of our Holy Thunder Sect, and Immortal Master Sanlei also died. Do you want to compete with me for this matter?” The Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect said coldly, “Today, I’m here just to kill him.”","“Well...” Immortal Master Guangzong shook his head and said, “Okay.”","He felt helpless and wanted to show off, but the Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect obviously didn’t give him a chance.","There were tens of thousands of people on one side while the Highest Clouds Palace only had a few hundred.","They reached the place thousands of meters away.","Someone spoke in a cold and questioning voice.","“Han Yang Immortal, you asked us to come here because you want an explanation. Now you can say what you want us to explain.”","“Explain?”","Zhang Han was silent for a moment and was about to say something.","The Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect suddenly flew forward.","“How dare you, a newcomer at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, swagger before us? You killed the elders of my Holy Thunder Sect. You must pay with your blood!”","The Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect roared and was about to attack.","Many Grand Masters of the Holy Lands and Sect Masters shook their heads and sighed with emotion.","“He’s too impatient.”","“At the very least, he should listen to what that man says.”","“I’m afraid it will take a few days for them to fight. It’s good to watch a battle. We can know the level of Han Yang Immortal. If it’s too low, he will give us an explanation.”","Many people calmed down and prepared to watch a wonderful battle.","“How noisy.”","Zhang Han looked indifferent.","He took action in an instant.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body appeared on his left and approached the other party at an imperceptible speed.","The Great Demon Body was on his right. He made a seal with both hands, and the huge Great Demon Image appeared. It was earth-shattering. The supernatural power of the Soul Nightmare covered the Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure cast the void-sealing skill.","The Thunder Body struck out a powerful bolt of lightning. It looked inconspicuous, but it contained terrifying power.","“Go to hell!”","The roar of the Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect echoed between heaven and earth.","But in an instant, his figure became illusory and then dissipated.","His voice was still reverberating, but he was gone.","“What kind of supernatural power is this? Invisibility?”","“It’s strange. The Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect doesn’t have the supernatural power of invisibility. Why is he gone?”","“Where is he hiding?”","“...”","The majority of the crowd was filled with confusion.","Because they really didn’t understand what the Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect was doing."]},{"number":1686,"title":"Chapter 1686 He Was Unparalleled","paragraphs":["Chapter 1686 He Was Unparalleled","Five seconds, ten seconds... one minute passed.","“He hasn’t appeared yet. Could he be...?”","Many people got nervous and were shocked.","They found that something was wrong.","“Even if he’s displaying the supernatural power of invisibility, there’s no aura at all. He hasn’t shown up for such a long time. That’s a big problem. Is he dead?”","Only then did the crowd recall the scene when Han Yang Immortal made his move just now.","They could sense a trace of extraordinary aura from his several powerful supernatural powers, but they didn’t think it was possible for the Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect to be killed.","However, they couldn’t figure out what the Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect meant by doing this.","“Hundreds of people are watching, and he is hiding?”","“Stop your search. He’s already dead.”","A calm voice swept over.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Many people turned their heads to look.","An enormous pitch-black body appeared.","It spread its wings that extended a kilometer.","Its fur was jet-black and shiny, and its claws were incomparably sharp.","“It’s the Heavenly Illusionary Divine Eagle!”","“That’s... that’s Immortal Master Diming!”","“What is he doing here?”","“He’s one of the Grand Masters of the Eighth Mountain with extraordinary combat strength. Why is Immortal Master Diming here for such a small occasion?”","Many people came to their senses one after another.","They cupped their hands and greeted him.","“Greetings, Immortal Master Diming.”","“Greetings, Immortal Master Diming.”","The Grand Masters of the Eighth Mountain were also here. They greeted Immortal Master Diming and smiled.","“I never expected that this matter would be able to make you come over, Immortal Master Diming. It’s truly surprising.”","Among them, there was a fat middle-aged man. He was the Grand Master of the Holy Land on the Eighth Mountain.","He glanced at Zhang Han and said in a mocking tone, “It seems that the luck of the Highest Clouds Palace is a little bad. Han Yang Immortal just killed the Sect Master of the Holy Thunder Sect, but you don’t know that Immortal Master Diming and the Holy Thunder Sect are acquaintances. He once took care of the Holy Thunder Sect before it rose to prominence. How dare you fight in front of him? Are you courting death?”","Many people’s expressions changed.","Only then did they realize one thing.","“The Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect is dead.”","“He was killed in one move. Han Yang Immortal is quite powerful.”","“That’s why he dared to ask us to come over. He’s confident. Unfortunately, Immortal Master Diming is here, so how could he allow Han Yang Immortal to act rashly?”","Under everyone’s gaze, the huge Divine Eagle levitated with two people on it.","They were Immortal Master Diming and his maidservant.","After they arrived here, Immortal Master Diming paid no attention to anyone.","When Zhang Han saw him, his eyes became somewhat playful.","“Immortal Master Diming?”","He put his hands behind his back and watched quietly from a distance.","For a moment, no one spoke.","If the other party were a woman, Zi Yan and the others would be wondering if something was wrong.","When Immortal Master Diming heard the discussion of the people below, he couldn’t remain calm anymore.","He opened his eyes wide, and an invisible fluctuation, like a huge wave, rushed toward the people who were talking.","Poof!","Those people were forced to retreat hundreds of meters by the overwhelming energy. They spat out blood and looked confused.","“I didn’t do anything, so why would Immortal Master Diming make a move?”","“Humph.”","Immortal Master Diming didn’t explain anything.","He just looked ahead and said in a clear voice, “Han Yang Immortal, you really survived.”","Hiss!","As soon as he said that, hundreds of people present were shocked.","“Han Yang Immortal knows Immortal Master Diming?”","“No wonder he dared to take action. In the eyes of Immortal Master Diming, the Holy Thunder Sect is nothing.”","“With the presence of Immortal Master Diming, it seems that we really have to give some explanation.”","In addition to being shocked, these people all had different ideas.","Immortal Master Diming could suppress everyone here. Even if the top Grand Master of the Seventh Mountain came, he wouldn’t be able to fight against Immortal Master Diming.","However, things were different from what they had imagined.","“Are you surprised that I’m still alive, Immortal Master Diming?” Zhang Han asked.","“Indeed.” Immortal Master Diming cupped his hands and said with a smile, “I came here for no other reason than to congratulate you.”","Swoosh!","Seeing this, the people around were all in a state of horror.","“Am I seeing things? Immortal Master Diming actually cupped his hands and saluted?”","“My God, Immortal Master Diming came here just to congratulate Han Yang Immortal?”","“What’s the relationship between them? Why do I feel that Immortal Master Diming is lowering himself?”","“Who is Han Yang Immortal exactly?!”","“We’re doomed. We might have messed with someone we can’t afford to provoke.”","These people were really shocked.","A person with a higher status than Immortal Master Diming would be too formidable. Besides the top three mountain regions in the Nine Mountains Region, there weren’t many people with a higher status than Immortal Master Diming in every single mountain region.","“Thank you, Immortal Master Diming.” Zhang Han nodded slightly.","“I didn’t dare to believe it.” Immortal Master Diming smiled and said, “After all these years, you’ve returned to the Peak Stage once more. How are you doing now? Will you be able to undergo that tribulation?”","“You’ll see in a few years,” Zhang Han said.","“Looks like you’re confident.” Immortal Master Diming swept the surroundings with his gaze. “You bunch of useless nobodies actually dare to shout at him. You truly just don’t know your place.”","“Immortal Master Diming, I’m innocent.” Someone immediately said, “What happened before was all made by the Third Elder of our sect. I came here just to get together with everyone, and I have no other intentions at all. I dare to swear to God.”","“I, I’m the same.”","Many people wanted to say something, but Immortal Master Diming waved his hand with a cold face and said, “It’s useless to tell me. Your lives are in his hands. Han Yang Immortal, I’m here just to say hello. If there’s a chance in the future, I’ll prepare some fine wine, and let’s get together.”","His pleading tone stunned many of the Grand Masters present.","“Sounds like a good idea,” Zhang Han replied casually.","He didn’t agree or refuse.","“Okay.”","Immortal Master Diming took a deep look at Zhang Han, rode the Divine Eagle across the void, and left in an instant.","He really just came to say hello.","He wanted to ask about the situation of the divine thunder over the sky, but it was obviously not the right time.","“I wonder if that guy will do me a favor. I may not get to invite him over.”","On the way back, Immortal Master Diming sighed with emotion.","After he left, all the people present behaved themselves. Without saying a word, they stood aside and kept quiet out of fear.","They suddenly found that while Grand Master Diming was there, they dared to say something. After he left, these people were afraid that Han Yang Immortal would kill them.","With the help of Immortal Master Diming, they had already regarded Zhang Han as a top Grand Master.","Although Zhang Han was powerful, he was not that strong. He knew that he could not defeat Immortal Master Diming just now.","Zhang Han’s tone and expression during the conversation were the same as before, which made Immortal Master Diming confused. He thought that Han Yang Immortal had returned to his peak.","At this time, Zhang Han didn’t care so much.","He said flatly, “One year ago, you sent people to the Highest Clouds Palace one after another. I asked you to come here in a year and give me a reasonable explanation.”","Hundreds of people looked at each other. After a few seconds of silence, someone finally spoke.","“Hello, Han Yang Immortal. I’m Immortal Master Lipeng, the Sect Leader of the Light Shadow Sect. I sent people here because we got the news that the Third Elder of our sect led the team into the secret realm and disappeared without a trace. I was worried, so I sent people here. As for this time, I followed everyone here.”","“Okay. You may leave after you leave behind 100 billion crystal stones and your fleet,” Zhang Han said flatly.","“Okay.”","The 100 billion crystal stones and the fleet he brought meant nothing to this Sect Leader.","After staying behind those things, he relaxed and left, watching the show from the distance.","“I’m...”","“Same rules.” Zhang Han waved his hand.","Another person left.","Seeing this, everyone relaxed a little. “I just need to offer some crystal stones and spaceships. It doesn’t matter.”","“Thank you, Han Yang Immortal, for giving us a chance to explain ourselves.”","Someone thanked Zhang Han after offering the crystal stones.","In his view, Han Yang Immortal just symbolically took some things and slightly punished them.","However, the total number of resources and spaceships these people had was quite large.","“We’re getting rich!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was rather excited.","Immortal Master Wuluo stared at the spaceships around him.","These fleets were quite valuable if they were added together.","This was the effect that Zhang Han wanted.","Since Immortal Master Waterheaven treated him and his people well, he would repay the Highest Clouds Palace.","Back then, Immortal Master Waterheaven had lost so much that he nearly went bankrupt.","Now Zhang Han would make the Highest Clouds Palace a super sect.","Therefore, Zhang Han asked the Grand Masters of those forces who originally wanted to get some benefits in person to explain themselves.","By doing that, they needed to offer their resources.","Finally, everyone left, and Zhang Han didn’t care about the Holy Thunder Sect anymore.","The Sect Leader of the Holy Thunder Sect had died. Without a Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage expert, the sect would still be a first-rate force. However, as far as the current scale was concerned, the Highest Clouds Palace was no match for the Holy Thunder Sect.","The Highest Clouds Palace would develop steadily. With Zhang Han in charge, the Holy Thunder Sect wouldn’t dare to make trouble.","“Let’s go back.”","Zhang Han and the others flew back to the main hall of the Highest Clouds Palace.","“I’m afraid that it won’t be long before my name is spread out.”","Zhang Han could not help laughing.","Yue Wuwei said with emotion, “At that time, I thought you were a newcomer who knew nothing. This is unexpected.”","“...”","While they were chatting casually.","In the Dongruo Holy Land on the other side.","“What? Immortal Master Diming showed up?”","“He knows Han Yang Immortal, and he even cupped his hands and saluted. He said that he would hold a banquet... Is it true? Can such a small fight attract Immortal Master Diming?”","“Who is that Han Yang Immortal?”","“Fortunately, we didn’t act rashly. Otherwise, we would’ve caused an enormous calamity,” The Grand Master of the Dongruo Holy Land gasped.","“In this case, it’s also possible that Immortal Master Wumo didn’t make it out alive because of Han Yang Immortal.”","“Watch your words!” The Grand Master of the Dongruo Holy Land looked gloomy, and his tone was cold. “Don’t talk nonsense. At least don’t spread any rumors before we know the identity of Han Yang Immortal.”","“Yes, Grand Master!”","It wasn’t just the Dongruo Holy Land. The major powers of the Seventh and Eighth Mountains were the first to learn of the matter. They were also very curious.","“What made Immortal Master Diming go over in person?”","“Who is Han Yang Immortal?”","It didn’t take long for news to spread from the Holy Land.","“According to reliable information, Han Yang Immortal was a super expert at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage a thousand years ago. He was famous all over the world, and there were not many Grand Masters who could compete with him.”","“Back then, he wiped out the top ten super sects in a few months.”","“Back then, he fought in all directions without a single defeat!”","“Back then, he went through the final Heavenly Tribulation and summoned the divine thunder over the sky!”","“When Han Yang Immortal failed to pass the tribulation and was banned by the Great Domain, many people had no memory of him. However, those who had contacted and known him still remember him.”","“Back then, he was a great merciless man in the Cultivation World. He was unparalleled!”","Pieces of news spread out one after another, like a virus, sweeping over the Seventh Mountain, the Eighth Mountain, and even the Ninth, the Sixth, and the Fifth Mountains at an extremely fast speed.","The name of Han Yang Immortal seemed to be full of magic, which shocked the Nine Mountains Region."]},{"number":1687,"title":"Chapter 1687 News","paragraphs":["Chapter 1687 News","“Han Yang Immortal is still alive!”","“Could it be that he had a method to avoid the supreme divine thunder over the sky?”","“But we saw him die with our own eyes.”","“Is it the Replication Technique? Han Yang Immortal has a lot of trump cards in the past.”","“That’s impossible. The divine thunder over the sky is the supreme tribulation. Even if he had 10,000 duplications, they should have been wiped out. Don’t forget that in ancient times, there was Immortal Master Huanshen who had 30,000 duplications. Even so many duplications couldn’t escape the bombardment of the divine thunder over the sky.”","Many major forces were talking about it.","In the Holy Land, dozens of people gathered together. Someone questioned, “Then how did he survive?”","“I don’t know!”","“Alas! We can only wait for our Grand Master to come out. Although Han Yang Immortal is strong, he is not invincible. Our Grand Master is slightly stronger than him.”","The deeds of Han Yang Immortal were widely spread in the Nine Mountains Region.","Gradually, most of the first-rate forces at the bottom of the Nine Mountains Region envied.","“The Highest Clouds Palace is so lucky to have won the favor of Han Yang Immortal.”","“Han Yang Immortal is a ruthless man at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. With him around, I’m afraid that the Highest Clouds Palace will become a super sect in a few years.”","“Ha... Its strength can be a match for the super sects now. A few years later, when the force of the Highest Clouds Palace expand and their people increase, it’ll be a real super sect.”","“I heard more than 30 Holy Lands on the fifth mountain had sent people to the Highest Clouds Palace to congratulate Han Yang Immortal on his return.”","“Not to mention the ninth mountain, there are even people from the fifth mountain. I feel that many sects in the Nine Mountains Region will go and congratulate them.”","This was indeed the case.","“Master.”","“The Hongyao Holy Land of the sixth mountain has come to congratulate you.”","Hearing that, Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and others, who were in the main hall, stood up and walked to the door. “Let them in!”","A hundred people came in.","The leader was a high-position official of the Holy Land.","“Immortal Master Waterheaven.”","They cupped their hands and greeted each other.","The big shot who used to be unapproachable was courteous to him now. He felt happy.","“May I meet Han Yang Immortal?” The purpose of these people was to see Zhang Han.","Zhang Han was not willing to meet them. He had already taken Mengmeng and the others out to have fun.","The recreational planet in the Nine Mountains Region was much more luxurious than any other place.","“My sect’s Second Elder has something to attend to and will be back in a few days,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a smile.","“That’s a pity.”","The person was not interested in talking. “This is our gift for you.”","“Thank you.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven accepted it with a smile.","This was the first time that he had gotten so many gifts.","The flying ships brought by hundreds of forces, the crystal stones they left behind, and a large number of gifts given by the people who came to deliver gifts filled the treasure house of the Highest Clouds Palace.","“Give out these things to the sect disciples.”","“Recruit more people.”","“The Highest Clouds Palace will expand!”","“A huge expansion.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was filled with enthusiasm.","In the three years, the people of his sect had doubled, the number of palace branches had doubled, and the mission workload had increased tenfold.","The number of emissaries of the Highest Clouds Palace had increased more than forty times.","That was because the Highest Clouds Palace had a person in the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. Missions were guaranteed to be more stable, and more people would like to participate.","At this time, Zhang Han and the others had come to the Star Sea for nearly 30 years.","“In another 10 years, Immortal Master Lingxi will probably return.”","Zhang Han ordered, “Pay attention to Immortal Master Lingxi of the ninth mountain. Inform me immediately if you find her.”","He had paid attention to this matter in advance and set a six-star task with a great reward. Many people accepted the mission. It was better than nothing. What if some of them met her one day?","As soon as Immortal Master Lingxi appeared, Zhang Han would get the news.","At the same time, this task drew the attention of Immortal Master Lingxi’s force.","She had a lot of disciples. After hearing this, some of them sneered.","“Who’s looking for Master? It’s even a six-star task.”","“Is the person looking for trouble?”","“Who dares to provoke our master? Beat the person to death!”","Immortal Master Lingxi had a good reputation and a force not big. However, her personal strength was strong. She was also a famous figure.","Zhang Han had come to the Star Sea for 33 years.","The Highest Clouds Palace had developed steadily. In terms of scale, the number of people, and the elders, it had officially reached the level of a super sect.","It was crowned as a super sect by the world.","The super sect, the Highest Clouds Palace, was often talked about on the seventh mountain.","“The Youth Battle is held once every a hundred years on the seventh mountain.”","“The ten big Holy Lands take charge of it.”","“However, a woman named Zhang Yumeng won first place.”","“That beautiful woman is a beauty. I want to pursue her!”","“Stop dreaming. She is the daughter of Han Yang Immortal.”","“Isn’t that better? Being the son-in-law of Han Yang Immortal will bring me to the Peak Stage of my life.”","“I’m afraid you don’t know that Han Yang Immortal has beaten the Holy Sons of the six big Holy Lands.”","“Forget it. Life is more important.”","Zhang Han and Yue Wuwei only went sightseeing recently. When they had nothing to do, they would go out for a walk.","Immortal Master Waterheaven often attended high-class gatherings.","He felt that he had reached the Peak Stage of his life.","Another few years passed.","Zhang Han had come to the Star Sea for 37 years.","After Immortal Master Waterheaven reached the Peak Stage of his life, he suddenly felt empty.","“I wonder where the ancient demonic beast that Hanyang mentioned is.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven was alone in the palace.","The Dragon Palace was gone. Zhang Han and the others lived in the city that Mengmeng and the other people had built on the side.","Normally, when they went out to play, Immortal Master Waterheaven had nothing to do on the Highest Clouds Star, and he couldn’t be bothered to read some reports.","He didn’t think it didn’t matter how many crystal stones he had earned.","“No wonder those people left the fleet and the crystal stones behind and looked so happy.”","“It turns out that the super sects are so rich.”","“Alas!”","He felt so lonely.","When he stood at the highest mountain, he felt the mountains around him were too low.","Immortal Master Waterheaven had this sort of unique insight.","“We’re back!”","Immortal Master Wuluo flew back and said, “The Second Elder and the others are back. Old Yue has broken through to the eighth-tier Tribulation Stage.”","“Really?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven laughed loudly. “We have to celebrate. Bring the wine we’ve prepared. Let’s go grab a free meal.”","Swoosh! Swoosh!","The two of them left quickly and came to the modern villa where Zhang Han lived.","“Ha... You’re finally back.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “Hanyang, when will we set off?”","“Didn’t I say we should wait until we see Immortal Master Lingxi?” Zhang Han was puzzled.","“Yes. I almost forgot to tell you. I received news recently that Immortal Master Lingxi’s disciples said she had returned. She seems to be in the outer ring of the Star Sea and hasn’t returned to the ninth mountain yet.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","“Hmm?”","Zhang Han’s eyes lit up slightly. There was finally news!","“Pay attention to this matter and send more tasks. When we find Immortal Master Lingxi, we can set off,” Zhang Han said.","“I’ve already issued over 30 tasks. We’ll obtain the news not long after she appears in the outer ring.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said seriously.","Hearing the news, Zhang Han, Zi Yan, and Mengmeng all looked a little happy.","After decades, they were finally going to meet those people. They missed the other party very much.","Within a planet near the periphery of the outer ring of the Star Sea in the Nine Mountains Region, the Golden-winged Roc was resting in a canyon, surrounded by a secret realm.","Immortal Master Lingxi levitated above the Golden-winged Roc.","There were more than 300 people behind her. They were disciples she had taken in along the way.","“Did you see that? As I said before, in the Star Sea, such secret realms can be seen everywhere. It is not big and is just suitable for you Dao Seeking Cultivators who have just passed the Tribulation Stage to gain experience.”","“Go in, all of you. With me as your protector, you’ll be safe.”","Immortal Master Lingxi spoke lazily.","Zhang Guangyou and the others were all there.","Their auras were different from decades ago.","Except for Zhou Fei, Liang Mengqi, and others, the others had all passed the Tribulation Stage.","As for those like Liu Jiaran, they had been cultivating for decades. Although they had not reached the Tribulation Stage, their strength had also reached the Integration Realm or the Mastery Realm.","But their combat capability was low. It was not in line with their realms.","“Come on! Let’s practice.” Zhao Feng said with a smile.","“I’ll have a good fight this time.” Chen Changqing said in an imposing manner.","When they entered the secret realm, they were still chatting.","“What realm do you think Brother Han is in now?” Chen Changqing asked.","“He should be in the sixth-tier Tribulation Stage at least.” Dong Chen guessed, “He has cultivated very fast.”","“I guess it’s seventh-tier.”","“I think so. My son is powerful,” Zhang Guangyou said.","Dong Chen chuckled and said, “Even you have reached the second-tier Tribulation Stage, not to mention him. Maybe Mengmeng has surpassed us.”","“That’s possible.” Everyone couldn’t help laughing. “Don’t forget who Mengmeng is.”","The Heavenly Lord was quite powerful. They knew her.","“Alas!”","Rong Jiali sighed slightly and said, “Han must be following us. He must have suffered a lot over the years. I wonder if he has received the news we left behind.”","When living so many years outside, they had left a lot of news to tell Zhang Han not to worry. They were living a good life, and Immortal Master Lingxi was very good to everyone.","She just forced them to be her disciples. Then she had never done bad things to them.","“He should have received it.” Zhang Guangyou comforted her, “Our son has supernatural power and can find us. Besides, we are now in the Star Sea. It is the highest domain of the Human Clan in the Cultivation World. Maybe by the time Han finds us, we will have already conquered a land.”","“Ha... Uncle Zhang is right.” Chen Changqing laughed and said, “When Brother Han comes, we’ll have gained a firm foothold. It’s time to show him how great we are!”","“Of course.” Zhang Mu sighed with emotion and said, “He has protected us for so many years. When we arrive in the Star Sea, we can conquer the land first. Let’s give him a stable life here.”","This was their goal.","Dong Chen said with a smile, “When Han arrives in the Star Sea, he will find we have a big force. I guess his shocked expression must be wonderful.”","“Ha... You’re right.” Chen Changqing laughed.","“You’re too careless.” Zhou Fei rolled her eyes at him and said, “Our son is dozens of years old now. The most important thing is to go back and arrange his marriage with Nina.”","Nina next to her blushed.","“I can rest assured that Chen Chuan follows Brother Han,” Chen Changqing said. “But I really miss him after so many years.”","As they chatted, they entered the secret realm.","“Start the battle.”","Immortal Master Lingxi said, “After this secret realm, let’s go directly to the Nine Mountains Region. That is the core area.”","She also wanted to go back and have a look as soon as possible. She thought that she had brought enough resources with her before traveling. However, she didn’t expect that she would give most of the resources to the relatives of Han Yang Immortal.","Immortal Master Lingxi was slightly restrained for a few tens of years. After all, she was usually extravagant."]},{"number":1688,"title":"Chapter 1688 Long Time No See","paragraphs":["Chapter 1688 Long Time No See","“There are only some small Yin souls in this big secret realm. You can go all out.” Immortal Master Lingxi said in the air.","She took extra care of the disciples with low cultivation.","She personally watched the battle below with a satisfied look.","“This batch of disciples is not bad.”","“I estimate that in a hundred, they will be able to take charge of things independently.”","Immortal Master Lingxi was wearing a long blue dress and looking above them quietly.","Every time a disciple was in danger, she would look over.","It was safer to watch them in person.","After 20 days of training in the secret realm, Immortal Master Lingxi felt it was almost time. She led the team to leave.","“Let’s head to the Nine Mountains Region next.”","Immortal Monarch Lingxi said, “Our sect is on the Red Feather Island, and it’s an island on the Red Feather Planet.”","“A small island on the Nine Mountains Region Planet.”","Everyone began to know about it.","Some people even thought that the forces on that planet were complicated. They occupied an island. It was Xanadu. The people of Red Feather Island had chivalrous spirits. They often went out to do good deeds in cyan robes and traveled around the world with swords.","No matter where they went, people would cry out in alarm. “They are from the Red Feather Island!”","The Red Feather Island was the number one sect in the world!","However, one year passed.","“We haven’t reached the Nine Mountains Region yet.”","“What a long distance.”","“We haven’t arrived on so many Space Shooting Planets yet. The Star Sea is too big.”","Many people were talking about it.","Even Zhang Guangyou and the others were quite shocked by the area of the Star Sea.","“Don’t be anxious. We’re still in the outer ring.”","Immortal Master Lingxi lay lazily on the sofa and said, “We just arrived at the main route, and we’ll go faster next. It will only take us half a year to reach the Nine Mountains Region.”","“Okay, Master.” Someone responded.","Immortal Master Lingxi waved her hand in a carefree manner.","Zhang Guangyou and the others were talking.","“We’ve arrived. I wonder if Master is following us,” Mu Xue said. “I feel he will come to the Star Sea in a few years.”","They spoke rather casually because Immortal Master Lingxi didn’t care about it at all.","Sometimes, she even participated and talked with them.","Once, she said, “Don’t wait. With his strength, he will be beaten by me if he comes to me.”","Even so, everyone was still fantasizing.","“At least ten years,” Zhang Guangyou said.","“In ten years, we’ll be famous on the Red Feather Planet,” Kong Ling’er said. “When Master comes, we’ll broaden his horizons.”","“That’s right. Ten years is almost enough. We should work harder to make a name for ourselves when Han comes!”","They all agreed on this idea.","Then they all cultivated.","Several months passed in the blink of an eye.","“We have arrived. This is the Nine Mountains Region.","Immortal Master Lingxi woke everyone up in the distance of the Nine Mountains Region.","They saw an incomparably enormous galaxy.","They could vaguely see the eighth mountain on the ninth mountain.","They had arrived at the core area of the Star Sea!","After flying for a few days, they arrived at the Nine Mountains Region. Then they went to a planet at the top of the Nine Mountains Region.","“This planet looks so big.”","“I wonder if there are many forces on this planet.”","“Huh?” Immortal Master Lingxi was slightly stunned. She looked at a boy in his teens on the edge and snorted, “No need to think about it. The whole planet is ours, and the seven surrounding planets also belong to the Red Feather Sect.”","“Wow!”","The boy’s eyes widened. “Master is amazing. You have eight planets at the top of the mountain.”","It was not that he was ignorant. He had some understanding of the Star Sea, so he was shocked.","In the Nine Mountains Region, there were many first-rate forces at the bottom of the mountains, but each force only had a few planets. The mountainside area was the territory of the super sects, and there were many Holy Lands at the top of the mountains.","Under such circumstances, Immortal Master Lingxi had several planets. Wouldn’t that mean that she was a Grand Master?","The boy finally realized how powerful his Master, who had taken him away by force, was.","“Master is back.”","“Master!”","After they arrived on the Red Feather Planet, many people greeted her from a distance.","Zhang Guangyou and his companions were shocked by the area of the island.","“Is this an island? Isn’t this a continent?”","They looked around for a while, but they didn’t think it was an island.","The planet had a large area of sea. The sky was azure, and there was only a single circular continent.","This was the Red Feather Island. Spring is very much on the island. As far as they could see, there were forests. There were no tall buildings but only manors on the mountains.","Rivers were gurgling in some mountains.","Some of the valleys were filled with flowers and plants.","There were also many special sights. Everyone witnessed the beauty of Red Feather Island along the way.","“Master went out and recruited more than 300 people this time. It’s more than the last time.”","Some senior disciples on the Red Feather Island laughed. “We have more Junior Martial Brothers and Younger Martial Sisters this time.”","“A few Younger Martial Sisters are quite beautiful.”","Hearing these voices, Immortal Master Lingxi glanced at them. “Ha! They are more talented than all of you. Why are you so complacent? Be careful! Maybe all of you will be surpassed by them in a hundred years.”","She spoke casually.","“Then we have to work hard on our cultivation.”","Many disciples greeted them on the way.","They walked to the center.","There was a large group of buildings. They were all one-story buildings. They were antique, with small bridges and flowing water. There were also sparkling lakes and rainbow bridges.","Moreover, there was wonderful scenery.","“Master!”","Several hundred people dressed in black clothes were the guards of Red Feather Island. The people here took turns guarding the island.","When Immortal Master Lingxi was relaxed, there was a team of guards to deal with things.","“Arrange for them to live in.”","“Wait for a while. I’ll give you a batch of cultivation resources later. Then you can start your closed-door training.” Immortal Master Lingxi said.","“Okay!”","Some of the guards intended to lead them away.","At that moment, the captain appeared with a strange look.","“Master, there was a team at the space station of our seventh planet a few days ago. They wanted to see you.”","“I won’t meet them.” Immortal Master Lingxi refused directly.","“They arrived three days ago,” the captain said. “It’s said that they had something important to tell you. A few years ago, the Highest Clouds Palace, the new super sect on the seventh mountain, had dozens of tasks related to you. An unknown force is looking for you.”","“Hmm? I said I wouldn’t see them. I have no time to see them.” Immortal Master Lingxi frowned her beautiful brows slightly.","“Okay!”","The guard captain nodded and left, spreading the news.","Immortal Master Lingxi immediately arrived at the treasure vault.","Forty years passed. Even though the Red Feather Sect stood aloof from worldly affairs, the treasury was quite full.","“This is not bad. These are good.”","Immortal Master Lingxi had selected a great deal of cultivation resources.","“They are that guy’s people. They’ve seen the world. I have to give them treasures of a higher grade.”","Immortal Master Lingxi secretly compared with Zhang Han.","After a comparison, the things she brought out were of a higher grade.","There were more than double the resources of the previous batches of disciples. She put these things into her purse.","They came to the residences of the new disciples, each of which was a small manor with a martial arts practice field in the center.","Zhang Guangyou and the others were all standing there.","“Next, I’ll distribute cultivation resources.”","“This is yours...”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","When Immortal Master Lingxi distributed the resources, the guards became stunned.","“So many.”","“Master has put in a lot of effort this time.”","When she heard the discussions in the surroundings, Immortal Master Lingxi had an arrogant expression.","“I can give them whatever I want. If I like this batch of disciples, I’ll give them more. I don’t care about so many things.”","She never cared whether the other people were jealous or not.","She was a free and easy person. She didn’t have many thoughts and wanted to have a good time.","This was also the reason why she often forcibly recruited disciples. She felt comfortable. It didn’t matter whether her disciples were willing or not. If they were not, she would fight them to the extent that they were willing.","On the ninth mountain, Immortal Master Lingxi was also a Grand Master with a strong personality.","“Master.”","The captain of the guards hurriedly flew over.","“I just notified them, but I couldn’t stop them. They directly broke through the barrier and flew over here.”","“If you can’t even deal with such a small matter, what’s the point of having all of you?” Immortal Master Lingxi rolled her eyes angrily.","“The other party is too powerful. One of them is in the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. We can’t stop him at all.” The captain of the guards smiled bitterly and said, “But they didn’t hurt us. It seems that they are here to visit you. They came here in advance. In fact, I have a bold guess.”","“Is he here to flirt with you, Master?”","After thinking about it, he didn’t dare to say it out loud.","The captain corrected himself, “I guess they must have something important to discuss with you.”","“It’s none of their business. If anyone dares to disturb me, I will be angry.”","Immortal Master Lingxi grunted coldly. “Lead the people up there. Let all of the new disciples watch my strength.”","People flew up one after another and waited quietly in the void of the universe.","It would take at least half an hour to get here from the outermost planet.","“Junior Martial Brothers and Younger Martial Sisters, it’s an eye-opener for you.”","A senior disciple said, “Our Master seldom makes a move. Even we have only seen her moves seven or eight times.”","“Really? Is Master a super powerful Grand Master in the Nine Mountains Region?” A new disciple asked.","At this time, Zhang Guangyou and the others were also listening carefully.","They had roughly heard of the distribution of forces in the Star Sea, but they had not sensed the specifics yet.","“Of course. Our Master is one of the top ten Grand Masters on the ninth mountain. Do you know that no matter where our people of Red Feather Island are, we are respected?” A senior disciple answered.","“Then why are there still people who dare to barge in?” Someone asked curiously.","“I don’t know. What if some Grand Master wants to pursue our Master?”","The disciples talked relaxedly. Since they dared to talk about Immortal Master Lingxi like this. It meant that Immortal Master Lingxi made them feel free and didn’t care.","“Alas! The Grand Master is one of the top 10 figures on the ninth mountain of the Star Sea. I didn’t expect her to be so powerful.”","Zhang Mu sighed with emotion and said, “We are now also disciples of a major force. If we wait here and gain a foothold, Han will arrive soon.”","“Yes.” Zhang Guangyou said, “In the past, he went out to fight for us. This time, it’s our turn. I must surprise my son!”","He even dared to speak like this.","As soon as he finished speaking, a moment later, with a swoosh, a spaceship slowly approached in the distance.","“Humph.”","Immortal Master Lingxi grunted coldly. “I want to see which ignorant fellow dares to trespass into my Red Feather Island!”","The sound waves, like a powerful attack, quickly spread forward.","At this time, the spaceship stopped, and a group of people got off.","“Eh? Isn’t that Immortal Master Waterheaven from the Highest Clouds Palace?”","The captain of the guards uttered a light cry of surprise.","A faint laugh was heard. “Immortal Master Lingxi, long time no see.”","Rumble!","Hearing the familiar voice, Zhang Guangyou and the others widened their eyes in an instant!","“Isn’t this Zhang Han here?”"]},{"number":1689,"title":"Chapter 1689 The Reckless Captain","paragraphs":["Chapter 1689 The Reckless Captain","“Oh, my god!”","“Does Master come to pick us up?”","Mu Xue was shocked.","“How fast he is!” Kong Ling’er exclaimed, her eyes shining.","“Master.” Chu Qingyi, Zhao Feng, and Jiang Yanlan couldn’t help calling out to him.","“Holy shit, he came so fast!” Chen Changqing was surprised and kept probing, “Ha... Son.”","They saw Chen Chuan.","“Dad! Mom!”","Chen Chuan shouted from a distance.","“Han!”","Zhang Guangyou and Rong Jiali were also very excited.","Zhang Mu shook his head with emotion.","This guy came so early.","As soon as they arrived, he came to pick them up before they could reach their residences.","“Yan!”","Zi Qiang and Xu Xinyu said in a trembling voice.","Ah Hu, Xu Yong, and others couldn’t restrain their emotions.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They quickly flew forward.","The guards were stunned when seeing this.","“What’s going on?” The guard captain looked left and right.","“Why do so many new disciples of Master have run away? Should I stop them or not?”","There was no need for him to remind her.","Immortal Master Lingxi became indifferent, and she snorted, “I’ve trained you for decades in vain!”","Then she looked at Zhang Han and waved her right hand.","A huge halo surrounded Zhang Guangyou and the others.","“It’s not so easy to pick them up.” Immortal Master Lingxi was a little angry and said to Zhang Han, “How dare you come to me after just decades? With your strength, let’s see if I can beat you today!”","“No! Master.” The guard captain is startled.","The other party was Han Yang Immortal, who was now in the limelight. He was even at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. It seemed that his Master didn’t know the other party very much.","Before the captain could say anything, Zhang Han shook his head slightly and sighed softly.","His breath transformed into a monstrous white mist and vanished in the blink of an eye. It dispersed the halo formed by Immortal Master Lingxi.","Shadow Displacement Transposition!","Zhang Guangyou and the others were moved to where Zhang Han was.","“You?”","Immortal Master Lingxi was stunned.","“Wait! Didn’t this group of people say that Han Yang Immortal was only at the third-tier Tribulation Stage a few decades ago?","“But the move should be from a person in the ninth tier.","“How could he improve himself from the third tier to the ninth tier in forty years?","“Did they lie to me?”","Immortal Master Lingxi’s face turned dark. “I’m slightly displeased.”","“Master! Master!”","The captain of the guards hurriedly said, “The other side is from the Highest Clouds Palace. Han Yang Immortal is the Second Elder of Cloud Palace. He is at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. He has summoned the divine thunder over the sky. He is very strong. We have to be careful.”","“The Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage?”","Immortal Master Lingxi was so angry that her breathing quickened slightly. She looked at Zhang Guangyou and the others and said, “You have lied to me. He is obviously at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage, but you said he is at the third tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","Immortal Master Lingxi was polite to Zhang Guangyou and the others and took good care of them.","Hearing that, they all smiled wryly.","“What do you mean? Is it fast for me to advance from the third tier to the Peak Stage in 40 years?” Zhang Han chuckled and said, “I was originally Peak-Stage. I have just recovered my strength. Immortal Master Lingxi, you took my family away when I was in the third tier of the Tribulation Stage. I have to say something about this.”","“Ha... What do you want to say?”","Immortal Master Lingxi sneered, “Are you kidding me? It’s not easy to survive the divine thunder over the sky. How can you return to the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage? I’ll beat you up today! You beat me three times in the past. This time, I’ll avenge myself!”","“No. Are you really going to fight?” Immortal Master Waterheaven was shocked.","“Master.” Zhao Feng thought for a moment and said, “She is very kind to us.”","“Yes, Brother Han.” Chen Changqing held Chen Chuan in his arms and echoed, “She took good care of us all the way and didn’t force us to do anything. She also gave us a lot of cultivation resources.”","“Son, why don’t you sit down, have a drink, and chat?” Zhang Guangyou advised.","Hearing these words, Immortal Master Lingxi snorted, and the anger in her heart dissipated a lot.","“No, I have to hit him!” Immortal Master Lingxi refused.","“Look.”","Zhang Han looked helpless. “I don’t want to take action, but she wants.”","“Then...” Zhang Mu thought for a moment and said, “Don’t hurt her.”","“Nonsense!”","Immortal Master Lingxi was infuriated, and she glared at them as she said, “How dare you look down on me?”","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Lingxi’s imposing aura was awe-inspiring.","The Golden-winged Roc behind her suddenly appeared.","When it saw Zhang Han, it was so angry.","It remembered the pain when it was beaten up!","Swoosh!","The Golden-winged Roc was the first to attack.","“How dare you grimace at me? I’ll eat you.”","Zhang Han glanced at it indifferently.","Creak!","The Golden-winged Roc cried out angrily.","“Let’s retreat!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven pulled everyone back into the distance.","“Let’s go!”","The guards of Red Feather Island also retreated far away. Many of the disciples that had just flown over were also extremely curious.","“Really? Will Master fight with Han Yang Immortal?”","“Why? Is there a grudge between them?”","“No. Han Yang Immortal once beat our Master up.”","“Hiss!”","After learning some things, these disciples were shocked.","They didn’t expect that their powerful Master had been beaten by Han Yang Immortal before.","In the blink of an eye, the Golden-winged Roc flew to Zhang Han, its wings as sharp as blades.","Swoosh!","A golden light suddenly grew larger.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast was tens of thousands of meters tall and had an earth-shattering aura. In terms of pressure, it had already defeated the Golden-winged Roc.","The image of the Golden-winged Roc appeared. It was also thousands of meters high. The two of them fought at the side.","Their battle was like this.","The Golden-armored Giant Beast flew around. The Golden-armored Giant Beast watched lazily and didn’t move at all.","After Golden-armored Giant Beast was hit a few times, the sounds of metal colliding could be heard.","It didn’t move at all. It was as if an egg hit a stone.","“What’s this?”","Immortal Master Lingxi’s gaze focused slightly, and she wasn’t able to discern it while a trace of shock arose in her heart.","Han Yang Immortal seemed to be more powerful than before.","“Humph.” She snorted and moved forward quickly.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","In an instant, more than a thousand duplications flew over in a semi-circle.","“Heavenly God Technique Palm!”","She used supernatural power. A huge golden palm shadow appeared from above and went straight at Zhang Han.","The aura was earth-shattering.","“Great Demon!” Zhang Han finally spat out two words calmly.","The Great Demon’s Figure appeared.","The Great Demon Image slowly rose and slapped upward with one hand.","Rumble!","The golden palm shadow was dissipated by the palm of the Great Demon’s Figure.","“Thunder, rise!”","Zhang Han activated his mind.","The Thunder Body was ready.","The Thunder Willow shook the world, and countless willow branches began to whip and destroy the duplications of Immortal Master Lingxi.","“Ice, freeze!”","Immortal Master Lingxi gritted her teeth and cast more powerful supernatural power. Even the Thunder Willow was frozen for a moment.","Crack!","It couldn’t destroy the Thunder Willow but delayed the attack. The willow branches kept shattering the surrounding ice.","“Burn!”","Immortal Master Lingxi raised her beautiful brows slightly and revealed a provocative gaze.","Flames began to burn from the bottom of the Thunder Willow.","Swoosh!","The supernatural power of Thunder Willow could not be maintained steadily and began to disintegrate.","“Humph! Han Yang Immortal, you are just so-so!”","Immortal Master Lingxi grunted coldly, and her snort contained arrogance.","She still had a lot of trump cards.","“You need a spanking.” Zhang Han sighed slightly.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body appeared.","The Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the Thunder Body, and the Great Demon’s Figure also appeared.","The four duplications attacked at the same time.","“Demonic Might!”","“Thunderbolt Crocodile!”","The Thunder Body and the Great Demon’s Figure moved swiftly.","The Extreme Purity Immortal Body moved.","They moved fast as if teleporting.","“Let me show you my Immortal Technique of duplication!”","Swoosh!","In an instant, the duplications around him changed constantly into hundreds, dozens, and thousands. All the duplications were like Stellar Flames, flickering. It was easy for people to faint when seeing them with naked eyes.","“You?”","Immortal Master Lingxi was shocked. “You’ve learned an Immortal Technique. Ha... Look at my technique, Frozen Starry Sky!”","Swoosh!","It was also an Immortal Technique, one of Immortal Master Lingxi’s trump cards.","“It’s useless.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly, and his Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure made incantation gestures. “Great Weakness Spell, Soul-snatching Incantation, Pluto Incantation!”","He made three incantations in a row. All kinds of profound energy surround Immortal Master Lingxi.","Once the energy got close to her and the incantations were formed, it would affect the fighting capability of Immortal Master Lingxi.","The Great Demon’s Figure showed its power.","“Heaven-shaking Giant Demon!”","It was the second technique of supernatural power of the Great Demon’s Figure. I was like a giant demon between the sky and the ground. It picked up an ancient tree, swung it, and smashed the ice.","Crack!","Many of the layers of ice made by the Frozen Starry Sky that Fairy Master Lingxi launched were smashed by the Heaven-shaking Giant Demon.","In the distance, the guards of Red Feather Island said, “He’s so strong. Master is at a disadvantage.”","“What should we do? Should we help her?”","“Bullshit. How can we intervene in a battle of this level?” The captain of the guards scolded, “Can’t you see that they know each other? They will care about themselves. Don’t worry. Our Master will be fine.”","“Our Master is so powerful, but she can’t defeat Han Yang Immortal. It seems that those legends are true.”","Zhang Mu and his companions were even more shocked.","“Oh, my God.” Chen Changqing was stunned, “Is this my Brother Han? How did he become so powerful?”","“I thought we had cultivated very fast, but Zhang Han is too abnormal. How did he come to the Star Sea and improve his strength so quickly?” Dong Chen was confused.","“The Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. This guy is at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage.” Zhang Guangyou burst out laughing after being shocked.","It was a big surprise.","Zhang Han’s growing speed was beyond everyone’s expectations.","Immortal Master Lingxi was also shocked.","“How did you become so strong?”","“Even more powerful than before.”","Immortal Master Lingxi started to doubt her life.","She kept attacking. However, facing Zhang Han and his three duplications, she could only retreat repeatedly.","However, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body and Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure kept striking out the sealing supernatural power, leaving her nowhere to escape.","Then the Heaven-shaking Giant Demon shrank to a height of dozens of meters, approached, picked up the ancient tree, and aimed at her buttocks.","“How dare you, Han Yang Immortal!”","Immortal Master Lingxi was angry, but she was also a little panicky.","It was too unreasonable for him to beat her up in her place.","“Why dare me not? It’s not the first time I’ve hit you,” Zhang Han said flatly.","Slap! Slap! Slap!","Under everyone’s gaze, Immortal Master Lingxi was bashed up.","“Captain, Master has been beaten. Should we still watch?” Someone asked.","“Do you dare to go up? Even Master is no match for him. What can you do up there?” The captain waved his hand and said, “She won’t get hurt. Don’t worry. He won’t kill Master. Master won’t get hurt after being beaten a few times.”","“Captain, you’re so careless.”"]},{"number":1690,"title":"Chapter 1690 Shock","paragraphs":["Chapter 1690 Shock","After fighting for two minutes, the scene suddenly changed.","“I’ll beat you to death, Han Yang Immortal!”","At first, Immortal Master Lingxi shouted angrily.","However, after shouting a few times, she found he wouldn’t let her off.","Then she began to give in.","“Han Yang Immortal, I’ve taken good care of your family. Almost all of them have gone through the Tribulation Stage. I’ve given them so many cultivation resources. Aren’t you repaying kindness with ingratitude?”","“How dare you hit me?”","“How dare you!”","“Stop hitting me. I agree to let you pick them up.” Immortal Master Lingxi said.","“Han, that’s enough.” Zhang Guangyou advised, “She is indeed very kind to us.”","“Okay.”","Zhang Han withdrew his hand and his duplications.","Swoosh!","Immortal Master Lingxi immediately went to the Golden-winged Roc.","The Golden-winged Roc’s wings were also trembling.","It beat the other party for a long time, but the other party didn’t fight back. However, its claws and wings hurt badly.","What kind of monster was that? It was too ferocious!","The Golden-winged Roc became obedient.","Immortal Master Lingxi grimaced like a tiger, but she was afraid of Zhang Han. Then she was speechless aside.","“Immortal Master Lingxi, you let me separate from my relatives for 40 years. It is reasonable that I beat you up,” Zhang Han said.","“It’s just 40 years,” Immortal Master Lingxi said with a cold face.","After being beaten up in front of so many disciples, Immortal Master Lingxi looked unpleasant.","Mu Xue thought for a moment and said, “Actually, I’m a little reluctant to part with Immortal Master Lingxi.”","“As soon as he comes, you don’t even call me Master anymore?” Immortal Master Lingxi glared at her.","“No.” Mu Xue said casually, “Anyway, we’ll all leave. You’re our senior, not our Master.”","“Why don’t we sit together, drink some wine, and eat some meat? Then let’s chat in detail,” said Immortal Master Waterheaven who also knows the situation.","“Since we’ll leave, we really have to have a meal together.” Zhang Mu nodded in agreement.","“I don’t want to stay with all of you.” Immortal Master Lingxi grunted coldly.","Zhang Han pondered for a moment and said, “I wanted to give you a good suggestion. But now, I think it’s unnecessary. Let’s go.”","After that, Zhang Han was about to leave with his people.","Now, Immortal Master Lingxi was curious about what advice Han Yang Immortal wanted to give her.","She wanted to know it.","When Zhang Han flew and was about to leave, she said, “Since we’ve been together for decades, you can stay on Red Feather Island for a few days before leaving.”","With her hands clasped behind her back, Immortal Master Lingxi, as the host, seemed to have forgotten that she had just been beaten. At this time, she became a little arrogant.","Zhang Han smiled faintly.","In the villa of Immortal Master Lingxi on Red Feather Island, the guards prepared wine and delicacies in the hall.","“You turn out to have a daughter.”","Immortal Master Lingxi looked at Zi Yan and Mengmeng and said, “I didn’t expect you, Han Yang Immortal, to get married. You are so lucky. Your wife and daughter are beautiful.”","“I’m flattered, Immortal Master Lingxi.” Zi Yan smiled.","“I want to know how you got to the Star Sea before me.” Immortal Master Lingxi asked curiously, “I came back very quickly.”","“The Ancient Road of Starry Sky,” Zhang Han replied.","At this time, Zhang Guangyou and the others suddenly understood.","It turned out to be the Ancient Road of Starry Sky. No wonder Zhang Han could reach the Star Sea so quickly.","“How many years have you been here?”","Zhou Fei and Chen Chuan were chatting in a low voice.","“We’ve been here for a long time. It’s been almost 40 years. We arrived at the Star Sea soon after you had been taken away.”","After chatting with Zhou Fei for a while, Chen Chuan ran to Nina.","“Go away. Don’t come here to join in the fun.”","Mengmeng, Nina, Yue Xiaonao, and Felina were chatting.","Zhou Fei, Liang Mengqi, and Liu Jiaran were all sitting on the side of Zi Yan and chatting with each other.","Immortal Master Lingxi was chatting casually with Zhang Han, Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Wuluo, and Yue Wuwei.","“Zhang Hanyang, you’ve returned to the Peak Stage in decades. Are you stronger than before?” Immortal Master Lingxi asked.","“I was lucky,” Zhang Han said. “I was not anxious. You and I know each other. I know that you are kind-hearted and stay aloof from the world. You just love to take in disciples, so I was relieved to know that you had taken my family away. After developing in the Star Sea for decades, my cultivation has recovered.”","“You’re powerful,” Immortal Master Lingxi said. “I’m afraid you will summon the divine thunder over the sky again this time. Are you confident?”","“Ha... Let’s see how I deal with it this time.” Zhang Han chuckled.","Yue Wuwei also smiled.","Zhang Han didn’t have to go through the Tribulation Stage. Although he couldn’t summon the divine thunder over the sky, Yue Wuwei was very talented. With Heavenly Tribulation’s bad attitude toward him, the divine thunder over the sky would come to him sooner or later.","Even if he couldn’t summon the divine thunder over the sky, Yue Wuwei believed that Mengmeng had a heaven-defying aptitude. She would definitely attract it.","“It seems that you’re confident, right?”","Immortal Master Lingxi had a strange expression.","Zhang Hanyang was indeed more powerful than before. At that time, Immortal Master Lingxi had fought with Zhang Han for at least ten minutes, but now she couldn’t even resist him for a minute.","Moreover, she could feel that his moves were powerful. His momentum was different from before. She felt it was more restrained. If he moved, he became overbearing.","“You haven’t told me the suggestion you mentioned.” Immortal Master Lingxi said.","“In the Heavenly Dragon Star Province, there is an academy called the Dragnet Academy. There is Headmaster Shan in the Dragnet Academy. There are many talented disciples from the Silver Dragon Galaxy. Maybe you can be a tutor there,” Zhang Han said.","“What fun can there be in a small Star Province.” Immortal Master Lingxi suddenly lost interest.","“You’ve not been there, so it’s fun,” Zhang Han said.","“Star Province can’t be compared with the Galaxy, not to mention the Star Sea,” Immortal Master Lingxi said. “How many geniuses can appear in a Star Province?”","“I’m from the Star Area.” Zhang Han shook his head and said, “That’s my hometown. Of course, it’s just a suggestion.”","“Your hometown?”","Immortal Master Lingxi’s eyes lit up slightly. “I want to take a look.”","She thought that Zhang Hanyang’s hometown might have some powerful talents. She wants to cultivate one or two people in the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. It would be fun for her.","Zhang Han was telling the truth. He had been at the Dragnet Academy for a long time and had found a few talented students, including Xu Xiaoqiang and Heavenly Hound. They were all talented.","Immortal Master Lingxi had taken good care of Zhang Guangyou and the others over the years. Therefore, Zhang Han gave her the suggestion.","Although she had taken Zhang Guangyou and the others away in the past, Zhang Han came to the Star Sea in advance and reached the Middle-Stage eighth tier.","Everything went smoothly.","Just as Immortal Master Lingxi had said, if someone else had captured them, the result would have been different.","“When do we set off?” Immortal Master Waterheaven was rather concerned. He could not wait any longer.","“What do you think?”","Zhang Han looked at Zhang Guangyou and asked with a smile, “Do you want to stay in the Star Sea for a few years or go back to have a look?”","“Is it convenient for us to go back?” Zhang Guangyou asked.","“A direct road,” Zhang Han replied.","“I want to go back. I’ve been out for decades. I want to go back and have a look. After I rest for a while, I want to come to the Star Sea. Since there is a direct road, the Ancient Road of Starry Sky, it’s much more convenient. What do you think?” Zhang Guangyou said.","“I also think so.” Chen Changqing said, “It’s not easy to meet my son again. I have to go back and have a look, and I want to prepare for the wedding.”","Swoosh!","Nina blushed again.","Felina curled her lips. She didn’t know why Nina liked Chen Chuan.","Other than being a little glib-tongued, this guy didn’t have any advantages. His aptitude was average, and he was just a small attendant on the team.","She seemed to have perfectly integrated into the team. Chen Chuan was a follower of the team but fierce outside the team.","Anyway, they liked each other.","“If you want to stay here, you can go to the Highest Clouds Palace. There are countless tasks for you to gain experience,” Zhang Han said. “Now that we are Dao Seeking Cultivators in the Tribulation Stage, it’s good for us to stay here if wanting to gain experience.”","The team was led by Zhang Han step by step. Now, they also had the ability to gain experience in the outside world alone.","“I want to go back, too,” Jiang Yanlan said.","Mu Xue echoed, “On the way here, Immortal Master Lingxi took us to a lot of secret realms. We have been training for decades. Of course, we have to go back and rest.”","“I’ll go back too.”","“Me too.”","“Let’s go back and take a look at those guys.”","Many people from the security group didn’t come, and they missed the group very much.","“Our cultivation is much higher than theirs now.”","“This is the fortune that Immortal Master Lingxi gave us.”","Hearing these words, Immortal Master Lingxi snorted, “Now you know how kind I am. What did you do when I was beaten just now?”","She said whatever she wanted. Her free and easy character was very likable.","Immortal Master Lingxi also had her personal charm.","“Should we return to the Highest Clouds Palace first? I’ll make the arrangements,” Immortal Master Waterheaven.","“No need,” Immortal Master Wuluo said. “I’m not going with you. Just tell me what you want to arrange.”","“Will you stay here? That’s fine. I can rest assured with you here,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a smile. “Then I won’t arrange anything. It’s up to you.”","“With the name of Second Elder, the Highest Clouds Palace will be fine.” Immortal Master Wuluo shook his head.","After the meal, they rested for two hours.","Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Lingxi followed Zhang Han and his people to leave.","“Let’s go to the outer ring of the eighth mountain.”","“The Ancient Road of Starry Sky there is the closest to our destination, the Boundless Sea.” Zhang Han said.","“What is the Boundless Sea?” Immortal Master Lingxi asked curiously.","“It’s our local specialty,” Zhang Han said casually.","A few months passed.","Immortal Master Lingxi and Immortal Master Waterheaven saw Mengmeng waving her hand casually. The power of space rose, and an Ancient Road of Starry Sky appeared.","“Oh, my god.”","Even Immortal Master Lingxi was surprised.","“Can you use the Ancient Road of Starry Sky as you please? Can you command it?” Immortal Master Waterheaven was a little stunned.","“Let’s go.”","Everyone stepped in one after another.","Swoosh!","On the Ancient Road of Starry Sky, various colorful lights moved.","After an unknown period, they came to the surface of the Boundless Sea.","“Have we arrived?” Immortal Master Lingxi was surprised. “Is your hometown so close to the Star Sea?”","“It’s about... Let me see. It’ll take us four or five years to go to the place where you took away my family from here,” Zhang Han said.","“Really?” Immortal Master Lingxi was shocked. “How could there be such a long Ancient Road of Starry Sky?”","“Nothing is absolute.” Zhang Han shook his head slightly and said nothing more.","“As far as the eye can see, the sea is a little profound,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said. “Ha... Hanyang, there’s not much spiritual Qi in your hometown.”","“Do you think it’s just like this?” Zhang Han laughed and said, “You can walk around and feel it yourself.”","“Is that necessary?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven shook his head and flew fifty meters away with a swoosh.","However, his figure disappeared into thin air.","“Huh?”","Immortal Master Lingxi narrowed her eyes and said, “It turns out that there is something wrong with the divine sense. No wonder there is a strange feeling.”","Swoosh!","She also flew out and disappeared in the blink of an eye.","“Let’s wait for them for an hour.” Zhang Han said.","Yue Wuwei took out his boat. Everyone sat on the boat and chatted leisurely.","An hour passed.","Mengmeng waved her little hand, and Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Lingxi were pulled back by her energy.","“Why is the sea so strange?” Immortal Master Waterheaven said in shock. “I was lost in it and couldn’t find an exit.”","“Your hometown is the Star Area, right?”","Immortal Master Lingxi snorted discontentedly and said, “The level of the Boundless Sea has reached the level of the secret realm in the Star Sea.”"]},{"number":1691,"title":"Chapter 1691 An Eye-opener","paragraphs":["Chapter 1691 An Eye-opener","“We are not in the Star Sea.” Zhang Han smiled faintly.","Everyone set off.","“The scenery in your hometown is not good.”","When they arrived at the continent, Immortal Master Lingxi looked around and found that the sky was dark and there was no sun.","“This is the Ancient Mine, where the Dark Shadow Clan lives.” Chen Changqing said with a smile.","“The passages ahead lead to the worldlet.”","Swoosh!","When they arrived, Immortal Master Waterheaven and Immortal Master Lingxi were both surprised.","“So many Space Passages?”","“The worldlet looks much better.”","Zhang Han led the team to the exit.","“After going out, we’ll arrive in the secular world.”","As soon as they arrived, “Ahem. What kind of place is this? It’s so foul!”","Immortal Master Lingxi rubbed her nose.","“Ha...”","Dong Chen laughed and said, “The secular world is a society of ordinary people. The spiritual Qi here is thin. The air is the smell of our hometown.”","They flew on the way back to Mount New Moon.","“Huh?”","“Isn’t this the Early-Stage world of science and technology?”","Immortal Master Lingxi observed all along the way.","Immortal Master Waterheaven was even more impatient. “Hanyang, where is the ancient demonic beast?”","“Don’t be anxious. Let’s go back to Mount New Moon first. Let’s go to find it a few days later.”","Zhang Han smiled slightly.","Then they arrived at Mount New Moon.","“The quality of this treasure land isn’t bad,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said. “This is the place I imagined you to live.”","“Oh!”","“The boss is back.”","“Zhang Han and the others come back!”","“Second Uncle is back.”","Swoosh!","All the people on Mount New Moon ran out.","Many people on Mount New Moon looked the same. After all, they were powerful. A large number of children appeared. They were the children of that group of people.","“Miss!”","“Sister Mengmeng.”","“Uncle Zhang.”","Many people cheered below.","“We’re back.” Mengmeng greeted them with a smile.","Everyone was excited. Forty years passed. They had been separated a little long this time.","“The mountain is still the same.”","Mengmeng stretched herself and said, “I haven’t slept in my little nest for a long time.”","“I’m going to prepare dinner.” Zhao Feng said and went to arrange it.","Every time they came back, Mount New Moon would have a big gathering.","They sat at the dining tables on the lawn.","Immortal Master Waterheaven competed with everyone in drinking. Immortal Master Lingxi looked around and was not used to this kind of gathering. She was just watching from the side and had nothing to do.","“Auntie Mengmeng.”","A little girl came to greet her, “Auntie Mengmeng, you are so beautiful.”","“Ha... You are so sweet. Here’s your gift for our first meeting.” Mengmeng took out a small gift.","“Thank you, Auntie Mengmeng. Nice to meet you, Auntie Yue.”","Then, she greeted Yue Xiaonao.","Yue Xiaonao said, “I’m not used to it. Little Cutie, this is for you.”","“We’re all aunties now,” Yue Xiaonao said to Mengmeng.","“Yes.” Mengmeng pouted and said, “Alas! We’re already aunties.”","“I’m fine. Maybe Li Muen is already a grandmother,” Nina said with a smile.","“That’s right. I’ll call her and ask.”","Mengmeng took out her mobile phone. However, it couldn’t be used anymore. The card could still be used. Zhao Feng soon sent her a new batch of mobile phones. She put the card into a new mobile phone and called up the person she hadn’t met for decades.","“Mengmeng, are you back?”","Li Muen sounded much more mature. Although she was surprised, she was calmer than before.","“Yes. We’re back. Where are you?”","“I’m in Lin Hai City to take care of my grandson. Ha... Mengmeng, Xiaohao and I have started to cultivate. I’ve reached the Earth Realm.”","“Good.” Mengmeng smiled and said, “We’ll go and play with you tomorrow.”","“I’ll go back to Xiangjiang later. See you tomorrow morning,” Li Muen said.","“Okay.”","After chatting for a few minutes, Mengmeng hung up the phone and began to drink juice.","They had dinner until two o’clock in the morning.","Zhao Feng sent some people to the Southern Mountain Area in the Silver Dragon Galaxy to find Liu Qingfeng and the others and bring them back.","Zhang Han and Zi Yan were strolling on the beach of Mount New Moon.","“I feel great after coming back,” Zi Yan said softly. “I’ve been out for so long, but I’m still used to living here.”","“Then let’s stay here longer. Let’s not leave and live here forever.” Zhang Han said with Zi Yan in his arms.","The two of them flirted with each other and said sweet words.","Zhao Feng and Liang Mengqi, Ah Hu and Liu Jiaran, Chen Changqing and Zhou Fei, and Elder Meng and Lu Guo were all enjoying their lives in different places, respectively.","It was early the next morning.","“Li Muen comes.”","Li Muen and Li Xiaohao looked as if they were in their thirties. But in fact, they were already more than 60 years old.","“Mengmeng, I didn’t expect you to come back so soon,” Li Muen said with a smile. “I thought I could see you many years later.”","“You’re still so young,” Li Xiaohao said with a smile. “You look almost the same as when you left.”","“Of course, cultivation will let us stay young forever,” Mengmeng said.","“That’s right. Elder Yue and Immortal Master Waterheaven both look like elders,” Nina suddenly said. “In fact, they can become younger.”","“They don’t want to change.” Yue Xiaonao said, “But he looks much better than before. In the past, my father insisted on dressing up as a man in his 70s. He thought he looked like an immortal. Anyway, he began to gain a little strength at that age. Later, he was too lazy to become younger.”","They walked to the pavilion and sat down.","Zhao Feng asked someone to bring a lot of fruit.","“You have a grandson. It’s so fast,” Mengmeng said. “How old is your grandson?”","“Five years old. My son got married late,” Li Muen said with a smile. “How are you? You’ve been out for decades. Do you have a boyfriend?”","“Ha... What do you think?” Mengmeng curled her lips and said, “Now, almost no one in the Cultivation World can defeat my father.”","Zhang Han once said people who were no match for him were not qualified to pursue his daughter.","Mengmeng had taken it seriously since she was a child. Now, she felt that she was destined to be single.","“We went out to gain experience for decades,” Felina said. “We were accidentally separated from Mengmeng and the others.”","“I see.” Li Muen nodded.","“My elder sister is getting married soon,” Felina said.","“Really?” Li Muen’s eyes lit up slightly. “Will she marry...”","She did not mention Chen Chuan.","At that time, Chen Chuan was still young. Although he and Nina liked each other. Li Muen felt their relationship was uncertain.","However, before Nina could answer, Chen Chuan quickly walked over from the side and sat next to Nina. He naturally put one of his arms around her waist.","“Nice to meet you, Sister Muen. Long time no see, Brother Xiaohao.” Chen Chuan greeted them generously.","“Congratulations, Chen Chuan. You’re going to marry Nina soon,” Li Muen said with a smile. “I’ll prepare a super red packet of money for you when the time comes.”","“Ha... Thank you in advance.” Chen Chuan laughed.","They looked very happy. They didn’t care about money but the festive events and the atmosphere.","“How’s your company?” Mengmeng looked at Li Xiaohao and asked casually.","“Just so-so. Only among the top 500 in the world,” Li Xiaohao said with a smile.","“Oh! That’s not bad,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Oh, by the way, Chen Yang’s company has developed well. The annual dividends are a large sum of money,” Li Muen said. “That guy also has a business mind.”","“Yes. He was smart when he was in college. If it weren’t for us, that guy would have sat on the fence and let Lv Zihan be his girlfriend,” Yue Xiaonao said.","Then they talked about the interesting things they had experienced in the past few decades. The morning passed when they were chatting and laughing.","“After lunch, let’s go out for a walk in the afternoon,” Mengmeng said.","Now, they were eating in the dining room.","“I haven’t had so much leisure in a long time,” Li Muen said with a smile. “We usually cultivate and occasionally go to see our grandson. There’s nothing else to do. Usually, he doesn’t go shopping with me, and I don’t have many friends.”","“Will you leave this time?” Li Xiaohao asked.","“Not for the time being. I can stay here for a long time,” Mengmeng said.","As soon as she finished speaking, Zhang Han came in from the outside.","“Mengmeng.”","He approached them and greeted them, “Hi, Li Muen, Li Xiaohao.”","“Uncle Zhang.”","“Nice to meet you, Uncle Zhang.”","The two of them spoke one after another.","“Uncle Zhang is still as handsome as ever. You look even younger than Xiaohao,” Li Muen said with a grin.","Zhang Han laughed. “When your strength increases a little, you can become younger.”","Then he looked at Mengmeng and said,","“We’ll go to the Silver Dragon Galaxy. Something happened to Uncle Liu. Do you want to play here or come with us?”","“Let’s go together.”","Mengmeng looked at Li Muen and said, “You can come with us. You haven’t left Earth yet, have you?”","“No. How long will it take to go out this time?” Li Muen and Li Xiaohao looked at each other.","“About ten days or half a month this time,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay! We’d like to go out and have a look,” Li Muen said. “I’ll make a phone call and inform my family.”","Li Muen thought for a moment and sent a voice message directly, saying that she and Li Xiaohao were going abroad for traveling. It would take about a month.","Then, the group set off on their journey.","“Will we go to the Silver Dragon Galaxy?”","Immortal Master Lingxi appeared. “You decided it so suddenly. Will it take a few years this time? Aren’t you going to take us along?”","She was questioning Zhang Han that he had brought her to Mount New Moon and left her alone. “How could he do such a thing? Where is the academy he mentioned? I haven’t seen it yet.”","“Aren’t we going to find the ancient demonic beast first?” Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “Is there something urgent to deal with in the Galaxy? How long will it take?”","“We’ll be back in a dozen days,” Zhang Han said. “I’ll solve a small problem. When I come back, I’ll take you to the place you want to go.”","“Let’s go together. Han Yang Immortal, you are so cunning. Don’t leave us and run away by yourself.” Immortal Master Lingxi snorted.","“I’m fine with that. Since I have nothing better to do, I’ll go with you and see if I can help,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said.","“Okay.”","Zhang Han led a group of hundreds of people to the ancient martial arts world in a mighty manner.","“Another Ancient Road of Starry Sky? Why do you have so many Ancient Roads of Starry Sky?” Immortal Master Lingxi was surprised again.","It was so strange. Since there were so many Ancient Roads of Starry Sky, it meant that there was a big secret in this place!","“Oh, my god! We’ve come to the cosmos!”","Li Xiaohao and Li Muen experienced such a thing for the first time, so they often got shocked along the way.","“It’s so fast.”","“There are Dao Seeking Cultivators on many planets.”","“An eye-opener! What an eye-opener!”"]},{"number":1692,"title":"Chapter 1692 Can’t Take a Single Blow","paragraphs":["Chapter 1692 Can’t Take a Single Blow","It was the first time that Li Muen and Li Xiaohao had experienced something like this, so they were the most shocked.","They had never expected that the Cultivation World was like this.","In the vast universe, there were so many living planets, and there were many such planets in each region, which could connect with each other. Dao Seeking Cultivators could fly in the void of the universe.","“No wonder, no wonder I couldn’t get through to you every time you left. It turns out that you went to another planet.”","Li Muen looked at Mengmeng in a daze.","“Ahah.”","Mengmeng chuckled and said, “My dad is happy to take me out to travel around. Every time we go to another planet.”","“Uncle Zhang is amazing.” Li Muen grinned.","At the same time, she made up her mind to take cultivation.","As a good friend of Mengmeng, she was very lucky. And she also wanted to take cultivation together with her family. The world was so big that she could go out to explore it when she could.","In the future, when she chatted with her family, they would say, “Which planet are we going on vacation on this time?”","In Li Muen’s mind, they would have a great experience on every planet they went to.","However, that was not the case.","After the crowd arrived at the headquarters of the Vast Heaven Sect.","“The Vast Heaven Sect has a total of 35,000 planets, 27,000 of which are planets with rich resources.”","“The number of disciples in Vast Heaven Sect has exceeded trillions.”","“We are already the largest force in Southern Mountain Area, and we have sub-sects in all the major regions in the center of the Galaxy.”","“We and the Starlight Divine Sect have dominated the Southern Mountain Area. We are even more powerful than the sects in the center of the Galaxy.”","“Many disciples in our sect are excellent, including Xu Xiaoqiang, Heavenly Hound, and Yun Han. They have developed very fast.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han turned to look at Immortal Master Lingxi.","“Those youngsters that he spoke of all possess decent aptitudes.”","“Okay. I’ll know once I see them.” Immortal Master Lingxi’s expression was flat.","As for Li Muen and Li Xiaohao, they didn’t even dare to breathe heavily.","A force had tens of thousands of planets. The number of disciples of the sect had exceeded trillions.","This news was a shock to both of them.","They were in the main hall, and the others had not returned yet. They listened to a subordinate’s report. Moments later-","“Sect Leader!”","“Hahaha, Sect Leader, you’re back!”","“Welcome back, Sect Leader!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","There were dark clouds in the distance. All of them were Dao Seeking Cultivators. At first glance, there were hundreds of thousands of them, which looked majestic. Mengmeng was used to such a scene, but Li Xiaohao and his wife beside her couldn’t help but swallow.","“Uncle Zhang is so domineering.”","“So many people have come to greet him in a hurry.”","Li Muen looked around.","Then, something unexpected happened.","“Hahaha!”","Heavenly Hound laughed and said, “You’re still so beautiful. Welcome back, Sect Leader.”","Xu Xiaoqiang leaned over to Mengmeng and said, “Sect Leader, I’m very powerful now. Can I woo you?”","Boom!","Zhang Han waved his hand, and Xu Xiaoqiang went straight into the sky.","“Sect Leader!”","Many people were greeting Mengmeng.","“What...”","Li Muen was standing right next to Mengmeng. She could feel that their auras were the most intense. These people were not just saying it, but calling Mengmeng Sect Leader from the bottom of their hearts.","“Mengmeng is the Sect Leader?”","Li Muen was in a daze.","Mengmeng put her hands behind her back and said with a smile, “Well, there’s no need for the courtesy. We just went to the Star Sea for a walk. We haven’t seen each other for decades.”","“Ha, decades is not a short time.” Liu Qingfeng and hundreds of others flew over from the right side.","“Hello, Zhang Han, Zi Yan, Jiaran, Ah Hu...” After greeting everyone, Liu Qingfeng laughed and said, “You are finally back.”","“Dad!”","Liu Jiaran ran over smilingly.","However, Liu Qingfeng looked around carefully and questioned Liu Jiaran, “Where is the baby?”","“What?” Liu Jiaran was at a loss.","“It’s been forty years, and yet you and Ah Hu haven’t had a baby?” Liu Qingfeng was happy, but he pretended to be upset. “Well, well. Don’t stay with me. It’s annoying.”","“Humph, YOU are annoying.” Liu Jiaran snorted and said, “I’m not going anywhere!”","“It’s great that you’re back, and I won’t have to worry about the problem here.”","Liu Qingfeng said, “Don’t just chat. I’ll tell you about it. The situation is very serious.”","While speaking, Liu Qingfeng looked serious, and the others also fell silent.","As for Immortal Master Lingxi, she looked around and glanced at Xu Xiaoqiang and the others with some interest in her eyes.","Immortal Master Waterheaven stood silently by the side.","“About twenty years ago, the Chuanfeng Galaxy consisted of a total of 36 sects. They have jointly attacked the surrounding Galaxies, burned, killed, and plundered them. They have wiped out two Star Areas and plunged all living creatures into misery. The Silver Dragon Galaxy is their third target.”","Liu Qingfeng said in a deep voice, “Except for the Southern Mountain Area, the other places have been wiped out, and their vanguard has been driven away by us. It’s estimated that their leader will come in person soon. Before that, I’m going to evacuate. There will be a lot of losses if we evacuate, but as long as there’s life, there’s hope.”","After saying that, Liu Qingfeng sighed slightly.","They had no choice but to leave.","“Why should we retreat?” Zhang Guangyou snorted. “In the face of such villains, we can just kill them.”","“How will we kill them?”","Liu Qingfeng said with a wry smile, “We can’t defeat them at all. That group of people is headed by the Dragon-subduing Sect. It is said that the Dragon-subduing Sect has a top master.”","“Ha...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven suddenly began to laugh.","There were two people at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage present, who were the real top masters.","He couldn’t help but ask, “How powerful is that top master?”","“Many sects in the Silver Dragon Galaxy have been destroyed, and some news has been leaked.” Liu Qingfeng was a little curious about who this person was. He told everyone the situation first. He said in a deep voice, “It is said that the top master of the Dragon-subduing Sect is called Immortal Master Nan Tian, who is known as King Nan Tian. He came back from the Star Sea and defeated all the people along the way. No one can stop him and he is invincible in the world.”","“Invincible in the world?” Immortal Master Lingxi raised her delicate eyebrows slightly.","Even the Grand Masters in the Nine Mountains Region did not dare to say that they were invincible. Even Zhang Hanyang did not say that he was invincible in the world.","Which Holy Land was this King Nan Tian from? He dared to say that he was invincible in the world. It seemed that he had a strong background.","“What realm is Immortal Master Nan Tian in?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked.","“The ninth-tier Tribulation Stage,” Liu Qingfeng said with a grave look on his face. “It’s the highest level of the Tribulation Stage. Apart from him, there are more than a dozen eighth-tier ones and nearly a hundred seventh-tier ones. They came prepared. We can’t resist them, so we have to retreat.”","“He said he was at the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage, right?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked.","“I got the news from the conversations of those allied forces that King Nan Tian said that he was invincible in the world and was at the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage,” Liu Qingfeng replied.","“Hahaha.”","Immortal Master Lingxi laughed coldly. “Alright, I want to see how he’s invincible in the world.”","“Well...”","Liu Qingfeng looked at Zhang Han.","He didn’t say anything, nor was he sure what to do. If they didn’t come back, Liu Qingfeng would definitely retreat. Now that Zhang Han was back, it was up to him to decide.","However, Liu Qingfeng reminded him bluntly, “We should ask the people on the front line to come back first. Otherwise, they will be in danger in a few days. We have detected that the Dragon-subduing Sect and other allied teams are rushing over from the secondary space.”","“Let’s go straight to the front line.”","Zhang Han waved his hand.","“Are we going to fight?”","“King Nan Tian is at the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage.”","“The strongest in the Cultivation World.”","“Can we fight him?”","Many disciples gasped.","They got on the spaceships one after another and were ordered to wait at the front line.","It could be said that everyone was in a panic.","“Why aren’t we retreating yet?”","“We won’t be able to leave when the enemy arrives in a few days.”","“We’re ordered to wait. They wouldn’t be using us as cannon fodder, would they?”","Many new disciples had a lot on their minds.","“Shut up, all of you. The Sect Leader is back. She brought us to the front line and told us to wait patiently.”","Many people from Vast Heaven Star, almost all of whom were captains or protectors, reprimanded the disciples a few times to stabilize the morale of the army.","Soon, Zhang Han and the others arrived at the front line and built a temporary base on a Barren Star.","Everyone waited for two days.","The enemy’s main force had arrived in a mighty manner.","However, the number of fleets on both sides was almost the same, and they kept a safe distance from each other.","Many enemies got off the spaceships one after another and assembled in square formations.","As for the people of the Vast Heaven Sect, they were also in formation.","“Haha, their courage is commendable.”","Many high-position officials of the alliance sneered.","“They know nothing about power.”","“They are brave enough to fight us head-on but still too stupid. They should run away immediately.”","“I’m afraid that more than half of these soldiers will die.”","It wasn’t just Vast Heaven Sect.","Most of the teams from the Starlight Divine Sect had arrived.","There was no need to mention how enthusiastic they were when they saw Kong Ling’er.","“Greetings, Divine Woman Kong.”","“Are you about to reach the third tier of the Tribulation Stage?”","“You’re at the Peak Stage of the second tier of the Tribulation Stage. Haha, that’s amazing.”","After they met, they all greeted Zhang Han and the others.","The relationship between the Starlight Divine Sect and Vast Heaven Sect had always been good.","They chatted for a while.","“The enemies are here!”","Many high-position officials of the Starlight Divine Sect suddenly became nervous.","They watched as the opponent’s formation took shape and came pressing down.","The pressure almost suffocated them.","“My name is Nan Tian!”","One of the enemies was an old man in a white shirt, who looked like an immortal.","Flying at the very front, he said lightly, “I’m from the Star Sea. I shall conquer the world and become the overlord. If you submit to me, you can avoid a massacre. I’m invincible in this world. Submit, or die.”","Swoosh!","His body erupted with a heaven-overflowing aura. A faint magical image appeared behind him. It was three thousand meters tall and quite impressive.","“Ha...”","Immortal Master Lingxi sneered and said, “You’re just at the Early Stage of the ninth tier. How can you be so pretentious?”","They immediately felt Nan Tian’s cultivation level.","He was a Dao Seeking Cultivator at the Early Stage of the ninth tier, but he was simply too arrogant.","“Let me fight with you!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven laughed coldly. “You don’t have to do anything, Hanyang. Leave this kind of nobody to me.”","Swoosh!","Under everyone’s gaze, Immortal Master Waterheaven flew over.","“Is he still going to fight him?”","The disciples of the Vast Heaven Sect and the Starlight Divine Sect had some doubts.","“That enemy has already said that he is at the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage. But he still insists on going up. Isn’t he courting death?”","The disciples who were close to Zhang Han were all in a state of shock.","“What did he just say?”","“He doesn’t need to trouble Zhang Hanyang to deal with such a small nobody?”","“I’m a little dizzy. What does he mean?”","They didn’t come to their senses.","When Immortal Master Nan Tian saw Immortal Master Waterheaven coming, he sighed with emotion and shook his head slightly.","“It seems that you still insist on courting death. Tell me your name. I will not kill an unknown man.”","“Oh, I’m Immortal Master Waterheaven.”","“You’re also an Immortal Master. Are you the trump card of your Southern Mountain Area? It seems that you know nothing about power. There’s a big difference between Immortal Masters.” Immortal Master Nan Tian sighed softly.","“You are quite good at putting on airs,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said. “Are you sure you came from the Star Sea? I am also from the Star Sea. How come I have never heard of you?”","“Hahaha.” Immortal Master Nan Tian smiled faintly and said, “The Star Sea is so big that it’s normal that you haven’t heard of me. When I made a name for myself in the Star Sea, you might not have been born yet. Since you want to die, I’ll fulfill your wish.”","While they were talking, they were getting closer and closer.","King Nan Tian cast a round wheel that was thousands of feet long. The light was dazzling and the energy was monstrous.","However, it merely looked fancy but didn’t have much practical use.","Immortal Master Waterheaven drew his saber with his right hand.","Clang!","A faint ray of saber light flashed, and then, under everyone’s gaze, King Nan Tian widened his eyes and spat out a mouthful of blood. He died.","“What the hell? You can’t withstand a single blow.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven grunted coldly as he looked at the numerous enemies ahead.","“Today, I will enforce justice on behalf of the heavens and beat all of you villains to death!”"]},{"number":1693,"title":"Chapter 1693 The End of the Starlight Divine Sect","paragraphs":["Chapter 1693 The End of the Starlight Divine Sect","Finally, it was his turn to show his might.","Immortal Master Waterheaven became the center of attention. He could even hear many discussions.","“He’s actually that powerful?”","“What! He killed King Nan Tian with one move?”","“Heavens, who is he?”","“Immortal Master Waterheaven. He is the real super powerful man in the Star Sea.”","“...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven had never imagined that he would be able to have such a great feeling from eliminating an enemy.","“Wonderful!”","In the past few decades when he was in the Star Sea, he had felt a little aggrieved. He had almost bankrupted his sect by keeping an ancient demonic beast. Now, he had one more enemy after another. He didn’t even dare to breathe heavily.","When his team went to the secret realm, Han Yang Immortal, the Second Elder, showed his stunning strength. Then, the status of the Highest Clouds Palace soared and it became a super sect.","However, this had nothing to do with Immortal Master Waterheaven.","He felt quite upset. As the Sect Leader, he didn’t help much.","However, he was now in the Silver Dragon Galaxy. Facing a ninth-tier Early-Stage Dao Seeking Cultivator from the Star Sea, he would definitely show no mercy.","Seeing that the other side was in a daze, Immortal Master Waterheaven raised the long saber in his hand with awe-inspiring momentum.","“Kill them!”","Swoosh!","The Vast Heaven Sect, the Starlight Divine Sect, and Kong Ling’er, as well as Yue Wuwei, and Mu Xue, all rushed over.","“How did Immortal Master Nan Tian die?”","“He, he is also from the Star Sea.”","“Crap! Could it be that Immortal Master Waterheaven is a Dao Seeking Cultivator of the inner ring of the Star Sea?”","Hearing this, Immortal Master Waterheaven roared angrily.","“Inner ring? I’m the Sect Master of a super sect in the Seventh Mountain!”","Rumble!","This piece of news was like a bolt from the blue, leaving the enemy in despair.","“A super, super sect.”","“The Seventh Mountain. He’s from the Nine Mountains Region!”","“Oh my god, he’s at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. Run! Run!”","This group of people suddenly became terrified.","They frantically flew toward the fleet behind them. As long as they could get on the spaceships, their opponents’ attacks wouldn’t reach them from such a long distance. They would be safe as long as they could enter the secondary space.","“Go, Tiny Tot.”","Zi Yan contacted Tiny Tot with her mind.","“Coo.”","Tiny Tot appeared with a huge body, which shocked Liu Qingfeng, Zhang Guangyou, and the others.","“Holy cow! Tiny Tot has grown so big!” Chen Changqing exclaimed.","Whoosh!","Tiny Tot wagged its tail and disappeared. The next second, it appeared behind the enemy. Monstrous black fog engulfed group after group of fleets.","Clack! Clack! Clack!","Explosions could be heard from many spaceships.","“An ancient demonic beast!”","“Oh no!”","“Go now!”","Everyone panicked.","The square formation couldn’t be maintained, and the warriors scattered. Seeing that the fleet was attacked, they rushed to the intact spaceships.","But there were too many people, and there were fewer and fewer spaceships in good condition.","Everything was in chaos.","The one-sided battle began with Immortal Master Waterheaven leading the charge.","Many teams tried to resist and even assembled a square formation.","However, Immortal Master Waterheaven, who had seized the opportunity, was indeed too brave and fierce.","On this battlefield, he had an invincible posture and performed all kinds of powerful supernatural powers with ease.","He was as dazzling as the sun and a ruthless figure that looked down upon everyone.","“Hahaha!”","“Kill them!”","Immortal Master Waterheaven laughed loudly as he continued to attack.","The formations collapsed one after another. No one dared to defend themselves, all of them running for their lives.","The pursuit began.","In three days the alliance forces had been almost completely destroyed. Those Dao Seeking Cultivators at the eighth tier and the seventh tier of the Tribulation Stage had been targeted by Immortal Master Waterheaven and Yue Wuwei.","Although Yue Wuwei did not show any extraordinary combat capability, he had killed more than a dozen ordinary eighth-tier Tribulation Stage cultivators.","The battle was over.","“Victory!”","“We beat them away.”","“Mighty the Immortal Master Waterheaven!”","A lot of cheers resounded through the void of the universe.","Even in the central area of the Silver Dragon Galaxy, many forces that had escaped were secretly observing from a distance.","Seeing this result, they first felt pleasantly surprised.","“The Silver Dragon Galaxy is fine now. Those guys are dead!”","“Why is Vast Heaven Sect so powerful? Who is that Immortal Master Waterheaven?”","“They are also from the Star Sea. This... It seems that Vast Heaven Sect in the Silver Dragon Galaxy is about to become the only transcendent force.”","“It doesn’t matter. They have been in the Silver Dragon Galaxy for decades. The disciples of the Vast Heaven Sect are low-key and won’t bully other forces. That’s enough.”","“Don’t forget that the Starlight Divine Sect has a close relationship with the Vast Heaven Sect.”","“No matter what, there is a force in the Silver Dragon Galaxy that can’t be provoked. Gather people and return to the sect. In a few days, I will personally visit Vast Heaven Sect in the Southern Mountain Area.”","“...”","The group of people who were secretly observing the battle left.","The members of the Vast Heaven Sect were immersed in the joy of victory.","Liu Qingfeng said loudly, “Let’s return to the sect and celebrate for five days.”","He had arranged for all these trivial matters. When Zhang Han and Mengmeng were not around, it was Liu Qingfeng who arranged Vast Heaven Sect’s affairs.","It had to be said that the team that Liu Qingfeng had drawn over was getting more and more experienced now. The business team was very complete. People like Sun Ming, Sun Dongheng, and so on were all the core members.","Everyone returned to the base camp.","There were many tables in the square, and many high-position officials of the sect were there.","Numerous disciples gathered in groups elsewhere.","In the past, when the four major forces on Vast Heaven Star won a battle, they would distribute resources, and that was all.","Now, they were used to eating and drinking after winning the battle.","“You’re Heavenly Hound, and you’re Xu Xiaoqiang, right?”","Immortal Master Lingxi sat next to Mengmeng. Their table was next to Zhang Han’s. However, there were only young people here, such as Mengmeng, Yue Xiaonao, and Chen Chuan. After eating for a while, Immortal Master Lingxi glanced at them and was also interested in talking.","“Yes.”","The two responded and looked at Immortal Master Lingxi with some curiosity.","“Who is she?","“She is in the team. Could she be a new disciple of Zhang Hanyang?”","“Your performance in the battle just now was not bad. I saw some qualifications, but it doesn’t seem to be enough. You can be nominal disciples first, and then I will observe you carefully,” Immortal Master Lingxi said directly.","She didn’t ask for other people’s opinions at all. She took in disciples as she wished regardless of whether the two agreed.","“What? Nominal disciples?” Xu Xiaoqiang curled his lips and said, “I’m a Vice Hall Master of the Vast Heaven Sect. The Vast Heaven Sect will soon become a big force in the Galaxy. I don’t have time to be a disciple. No.”","“I’m also a Vice Hall Master,” Heavenly Hound said.","Immortal Master Lingxi’s gaze was calm and emotionless. She didn’t take their refusal to heart.","However, it was also because of Zhang Guangyou and the others that Immortal Master Lingxi was more careful with the disciples of Zhang Han.","“Humph, I won’t give you the spirit treasures. I won’t give any to you for the time being.”","“Well...”","Mengmeng pursed her lips slightly. After thinking for a moment, she said, “Let me introduce her to you. She is Immortal Master Lingxi, and she is the Grand Master of the Holy Land on the Ninth Mountain of the Star Sea. As for her strength, she is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, which is the highest level in the Cultivation World. That is even more powerful than the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier.”","Poof!","At the table, many people choked on their food.","Even the people at the next table gasped when they heard that.","“Immortal Master Lingxi is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage?”","“What is the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage?”","“She is the Grand Master of the Holy Land. My God, she looks so young. I thought she was a disciple of Hanyang.”","When facing the sounds of discussion, Immortal Master Lingxi remained composed, and she was completely uninterested. Whatever others said didn’t matter to her.","At Zhang Han’s table, Immortal Master Waterheaven said with a smile, “Immortal Master Lingxi is a well-known master for thousands of years, the Grand Master of the Holy Land. Her personal strength is very strong. I may not be able to stand a blow from her.”","Hiss!","Another wave of gasps sounded.","Just now, Immortal Master Waterheaven had displayed his unrivaled might. What he said was shocking.","“Damn it, she’s so powerful.”","Heavenly Hound stared blankly at Immortal Master Lingxi.","Xu Xiaoqiang was also quite dumbfounded.","“As for the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage...”","Immortal Master Waterheaven continued, “In the Star Sea, the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage is divided into the First, Middle, and Last Stages. Above that is the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. There are also strong and weak ones at that level, such as Hanyang...”","All of a sudden, he felt the gaze of Immortal Master Lingxi.","Gurgle!","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s heart trembled. He did not dare to say that Zhang Han had beaten her, so he said, “Hanyang is also a very powerful cultivator at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.”","“What?”","“He’s at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage now?”","“It’s only been a few decades!”","Hanlong and the others were utterly shocked.","It was unbelievable that the father of the Sect Leader had already reached the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.","The Sect Leader and several elders of the Starlight Divine Sect were staring at each other.","“Immortal Master Waterheaven is a ninth-tier expert.”","“Immortal Master Lingxi is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.”","“Zhang Hanyang is at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage.”","The crowd chatted for a while.","“Mu Xue, Zhao Feng, Jiang Yanlan, Zhang Guangyou, Zhang Mu, and the young Sect Leader Mengmeng are all at the second tier of the Tribulation Stage.”","“Their development is too unbelievable.”","The Sect Leader of the Starlight Divine Sect took a deep breath and inhaled for 50 seconds. Then, he made up his mind and suddenly looked at Kong Ling’er.","He said gently, “You are the Divine Woman of our Starlight Divine Sect, Kong Ling’er. How many years has it been since you last went back to the sect? The girls that get married would occasionally go back to their homes, but you’ve never come back.”","“What?” Kong Ling’er was startled. “I get busy too often.”","“You should come back more often ten.”","The Sect Leader of the Starlight Divine Sect said, “I’ve decided. You’ll go back to the sect in a few days, and then you’ll be the Sect Leader. I’ll assist you as a Grand Elder.”","“I’m not qualified to be the Sect Leader.” Kong Ling’er immediately refused.","“I’m not taking ‘no’ as an answer!” The Sect Master of the Starlight Divine Sect said seriously, “It’s an order. Do you want to piss me off? Since I’ve asked you to be the Sect Leader, you’ll do it...”","After a heated debate, Kong Ling’er was discouraged. “Fine.”","However, Liu Qingfeng, Zhang Guangyou, and the others suddenly looked at each other with strange looks in their eyes.","“Alas, it seems that the Starlight Divine Sect has also lost its independence.”","All the forces associated with them eventually became the forces of Mount New Moon.","The Starlight Divine Sect would no longer be an independent sect. It was estimated that in a few days, there would be another branch of the Vast Heaven Sect called the Starlight Divine Hall.","This gathering lasted for an entire day.","Heavenly Hound and Xu Xiaoqiang mumbled and talked a lot with each other via Designated Voice-transmitting Technique.","But when the gathering was over, Immortal Master Lingxi was about to get up and leave.","Heavenly Hound couldn’t help asking, “Immortal Master Lingxi, aren’t you going to ask any more questions? Um, we can consider it.”","He smiled shyly.","Heavenly Hound and Xu Xiaoqiang stood aside, watching Immortal Master Lingxi.","“Ask what?”","Immortal Master Lingxi was slightly stunned. “You two are already my nominal disciples. I don’t have to ask anything else. Just wait for the experience.”","After that, she left elegantly.","The two guys fell silent.","It seemed that they hadn’t agreed from the beginning to the end.","When it was mentioned the first time, they didn’t want to agree. When it was mentioned the second time, they wanted to say yes, but she didn’t give them the chance to say that.","She took in disciples as she wished, leaving others no room for argument.","“Our Master is so domineering.”"]},{"number":1694,"title":"Chapter 1694 Miss Lingxi","paragraphs":["Chapter 1694 Miss Lingxi","“Nominal disciples at that,” Heavenly Hound said.","“Yes, yes, yes. We’re nominal disciples. We’ll try our best to become official disciples.” Xu Xiaoqiang looked happy.","“It is a pleasant surprise.”","Heavenly Hound looked complacently at Yun Han and the others around him and said, “Alas, I’m so sorry. A Grand Master at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage accidentally took us as her disciples. You need to work hard. When we become stronger in the future, I will consider taking you as my disciples.”","“Piss off, Heavenly Hound.”","As a result, they all refuted him.","During this period, of course, Li Xiaohao and Li Muen were the most shocked.","They thought that cultivators were so powerful with so many supernatural powers, who could fly in the sky and hide underground.","The two of them were also the weakest on the spot. Sitting with a group of big shots, they would definitely be nervous. Fortunately, Mengmeng and the others were with them.","“You’re the Sect Leader. That’s amazing. You’re already at the Tribulation Stage,” Li Muen chatted with Mengmeng.","At the table next to them, Zi Yan, Zhou Fei, and the others were also drinking wine with excellent taste. Zi Yan’s face was slightly flushed. She looked gorgeous and attracted a lot of attention from Zhang Han.","“She looks so hot!”","That night, Zhang Han’s room was surrounded by a layer of energy.","Only Zhang Han could appreciate the beauty of Zi Yan.","The group stayed in the Silver Dragon Galaxy for a few days.","During this period, Kong Ling’er returned to the sect to attend the ceremony for becoming the Sect Leader.","Kong Ling’er had officially become the Sect Leader of the Starlight Divine Sect.","The next day, Kong Ling’er suggested, “The Starlight Divine Sect will merge into the Vast Heaven Sect and become its fourth branch. It will be called Starlight Divine Hall.”","“Hear, hear. We’ll follow and serve the seniors.” The former Sect Leader nodded repeatedly and served as the Vice Hall Master of the branch.","The brand new Vast Heaven Sect had become a transcendent force in the Silver Dragon Galaxy.","The sub-sects were established in the center of the Galaxy one by one. Even those first-tier sects in the Galaxy had given up many planets to express their gratitude to the Vast Heaven Sect for defeating King Nan Tian.","A few days later, Zhang Han and the others left.","“Next, let’s go to the Sea Dragon Star Area,” Zhang Han said.","“Where is the Sea Dragon Star Area?” Immortal Master Waterheaven asked, his eyes shining. He had guessed something.","“It’s the residence of the ancient demonic beasts.” Zhang Han smiled faintly.","“Damn!” Immortal Master Waterheaven gasped. “Wonderful.”","“How many ancient demonic beasts are there?” Immortal Master Lingxi asked.","“Not many. Just a few thousand.”","“H-how many?”","She was really shocked.","“But most of them are ancient demonic beasts with relatively low-grade bloodlines,” Zhang Han said.","“Oh, what’s the point of that then?” said Immortal Master Lingxi grumpily.","She subconsciously thought that all the things Zhang Han said were high-end, but it turned out not. She was shocked in vain.","If the thousands of ancient demonic beasts were all Holy Beasts, it would be awesome.","The crowd traveled from the Ancient Road of Starry Sky to the ancient martial arts world and then to the secular world. They directly arrived at the Ancient Mine from the worldlet and reached the Boundless Sea.","In the Silver Sea.","“The seawater can isolate my divine sense from detection.” Immortal Master Lingxi asked in surprise, “Is there something horrible in it?”","By the Clear Stream.","“Damn!”","When Immortal Master Waterheaven saw this, he was startled. “Is the one below an ancient demonic beast?”","“If you’re interested, you can go down and have a look,” Zhang Han said.","“I don’t dare to go down. The last time I almost got lost was on the surface of the sea, much less the bottom of the sea.” Immortal Master Waterheaven shook his head repeatedly.","When they passed by the huge Screen Waterfall, Mengmeng explained to Li Muen with a smile, “Isn’t it spectacular? This is the last place on the route after we left Earth. It’s called the Screen Waterfall.”","“It’s spectacular.” Li Muen stared blankly at the scene in front of her.","Not only she but also Lingxi and Waterheaven were surprised.","“It’s another Ancient Road of Starry Sky. Zhang Hanyang, your hometown is really extraordinary!” said Immortal Master Lingxi.","“There are so many Ancient Roads of Starry Sky. There must be great mysteries within.” Immortal Master Waterheaven sighed with emotion.","“Haha.” Yue Wuwei chuckled and said, “You’ve only been here for a few days. After a while, you’ll see more.”","“Here we are. The Sea Dragon Star Area.”","They arrived at their destination.","Even Liu Qingfeng and the others had not been here for decades.","Liu Qingfeng suggested, “Let’s go to the headquarters.”","“Okay.”","The Dragon Base Star was still the same Dragon Base Star.","The Heavenly Group had dominated the Sea Dragon Star Area. Everyone was proud to join the Heavenly Group.","“The group owns 98,000 planets. Among them, there are 83,000 planets with rich resources and 100 recreational planets...”","According to the report, Li Xiaohao felt that he was short of oxygen.","“Oh my god, the forces of Uncle Zhang and his family are everywhere. They’re so powerful.”","After pausing for a moment, the crowd arrived at the Land of the Immortal Grave.","“Ow!”","“You’re back.”","Azure Dragon King looked up at the sky.","“Its figure sure is domineering.” Immortal Master Waterheaven’s eyes lit up slightly.","“It’s not the one. This dragon is too cunning.” Zhang Han shook his head.","“The Devil King is back.”","The white-winged One-horned White Horse had grown a lot in the past 40 years. It looked majestic as it led the ancient demonic beast team to arrive in a mighty manner.","“Huh?”","Immortal Master Lingxi said with surprise, “I can’t discern what this white horse is, but it feels rather unusual.”","“It should be a Holy Beast,” Zhang Han said, “but I don’t know its specific power.”","“Demon Overlord, I’m not that cunning,” said Azure Dragon King.","Zhang Han glanced at it and said, “Then are you willing to go with us?”","“Forget it, forget it.” Azure Dragon King immediately collapsed to the ground.","Immortal Master Waterheaven looked around him.","“They are all ancient demonic beasts.","“Although the white horse is a little small, it looks quite handsome.”","A smile appeared on Immortal Master Waterheaven’s face as he looked at the white horse. He looked as though he wished he could walk over and pet it.","“Where’s our king?”","The One-horned White Horse rolled its eyes.","“It’s sleeping,” Zhang Han said.","“Then why are we still here? Let’s go.” The One-horned White Horse was going back to its residence.","“I want to introduce a friend to you. He is Immortal Master Waterheaven,” Zhang Han said.","“Hello, my Taoist title is Waterheaven. It’s so nice to meet you. I will...”","“It doesn’t matter to us who you are,” the One-horned White Horse responded and led the team away.","This caused Immortal Master Waterheaven to be at a loss.","“This white horse appears quite arrogant.”","“There are a lot of ancient demonic beasts. Try whichever one you like,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“Okay. You will go back. I’ll stay here.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said, “One day, I will conquer its stubborn little horse.”","“If we go back, you won’t be able to find the Ancient Road of Starry Sky without following us. Maybe we’ll come here in a few years,” Zhang Han said.","“A few years will be okay. I can stay here by myself.” Immortal Master Waterheaven said indifferently, “It’s normal for Dao Seeking Cultivators to stay in an unfamiliar place. Not to mention a few years, even decades will be okay.”","“All right then.” Zhang Han nodded.","After he said that, the crowd left for the Space Shooting Planets to visit the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","They came to a Space Shooting Planet.","“The Demon Clan?”","Immortal Master Lingxi glanced around and found that there were tens of thousands of creatures of the Demon Clan.","“The, the Demon Clan?” Li Muen was taken aback.","Li Xiaohao was also very nervous.","“That is the Demon Clan that kills without batting an eye?”","“It’s okay. They’re our people,” Mengmeng immediately said.","At this time, all the major Demon Lords and Demon Monarchs flew over.","“Greetings, Demon Overlord!”","“Demon Overlord, you’re back. We have been guarding this place for decades. Nothing has changed.”","“Welcome back, Demon Overlord.”","Hundreds of thousands of members of the Demon Clan nearby shouted in unison.","“Oh? You’re even the Demon Overlord?” Immortal Master Lingxi was slightly surprised.","“Take these to cultivate.”","Zhang Han gave the demons a batch of spirit treasures suitable for their cultivation.","The Demon Lords were overjoyed.","With a cheer, they left.","Every Space Shooting Planet was guarded by some members of the Demon Clan, including the Stone Demons, the Blood Demons, and the Earthfiends.","This was the fastest way from the Heavenly Dragon Star Province to the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven.","“Such a big planet!”","Seeing the Vast Heaven Star, Li Muen widened her eyes.","“There are all sorts of strange things in the world.”","Mengmeng said casually, “This is the headquarters of Vast Heaven Sect. Elder Li is guarding here.”","On the way here, Li Muen learned that Vast Heaven Sect was still invincible in the Astral Domain of Vast Heaven. Every few years, a group of disciples from many subsidiary sects would participate in the trial and pass the assessment to become inner-court or outer-court disciples.","“Sect Leader!”","After meeting Elder Li, everyone learned about the situation on Vast Heaven Star. The number of disciples in the sect had increased, and a large number of them could go to the Galaxy at any time.","“There aren’t many people here.”","After careful selection, Immortal Master Lingxi only chose 16 nominal disciples.","It was better than nothing.","These disciples’ aptitudes were about the same as the ones she had taken in not long ago.","It was already very impressive that there were so many talents in an Astral Domain.","However, compared with Chen Changqing, Zhao Feng, and others, these new disciples were much weaker.","“More than 20 in total. It’s not bad.”","Immortal Master Lingxi was quite pleased.","“The next stop is the Dragnet Academy. Let’s go there for a visit.”","When the crowd passed by the Star Province, they went straight to the Space Shooting Planet.","After leaving, they took a large number of disciples of the Vast Heaven Sect to the Silver Dragon Galaxy. When they passed by the Heavenly Dragon Star Province, they saw the academy.","“It’s just an ordinary academy.”","Immortal Master Lingxi puckered her lips. “This isn’t as interesting as your place. I’ll go to your place.”","As a result, Immortal Master Lingxi took a detour and returned to Earth.","The members of the security group led the team to the ancient martial arts world and sent the disciples to the Galaxy.","The others all stayed behind.","“I’ll study the hometown of Zhang Hanyang.”","Immortal Master Lingxi lived on Mount New Moon, and Heavenly Hound and others were also there. Her twenty-five nominal disciples had nothing much to do every day, and Immortal Master Lingxi didn’t teach them much.","She planned to study this world.","She began to learn about history, culture, geography, and so on from the Internet, and her interest in this research became stronger and stronger.","“A completely ordinary society. That’s quite rare.”","Immortal Master Lingxi read with great interest. All kinds of information came into her mind, but the information on the Internet was not comprehensive, or in other words, some information was not easy to find.","She came to Zhang Han and consulted him. Zhang Han asked his men to send her all kinds of books, such as physics and so on.","However, she was most interested in history. She was not interested in professional knowledge.","“Ancient legends have a long history.","“The secular world of ordinary people is quite interesting. I won’t be taking disciples for the time being. I want to be a teacher and experience the world for myself.”","After thinking about it, Immortal Master Lingxi left Mount New Moon directly without saying goodbye.","In a classroom in a high school, she was wearing a black uniform, revealing her slender legs. Her beautiful appearance attracted warm applause.","“Hello, everyone. In the next three years, I will be your lead teacher, Lingxi. I will teach history. I hope we can spend our time happily together.”","The students said, “Hello, Miss Lingxi.”","“According to the rules, you will introduce yourselves first.”","What would happen if a master at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage became a teacher?","“I would prefer my students to be good at not only history but also other subjects.","“Zhang Xiaoguang, why are you always absent-minded?”","“Mind-clearing Technique!”","The students immediately perked up.","“All of you, study hard.","“Zhang Xiaoguang, what’s going on with you? Are you distracted again? Tell me the truth!”","“What?! Did someone bully you? Heh, come with me after school. I’d love to see which ignorant guy dares to bully you.”","After school, there were many strangers at the school gate. When they saw her, they couldn’t help teasing her.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","From then on, a powerful teacher was known."]},{"number":1695,"title":"Chapter 1695 The Nine Suns Godly Body","paragraphs":["Chapter 1695 The Nine Suns Godly Body","Immortal Master Lingxi’s life was filled with rules.","Every morning, she got up early to go to work and supervise her students’ studies.","A few single male teachers were tempted by her, but unfortunately, she turned all of them down.","In the evening, when she got off work and returned to Mount New Moon, she began to teach Heavenly Hound and the other 24 people.","“Your aptitudes are not bad.","“Cultivate hard. You can go to the Star Sea to gain experience in the future.”","Behind the mountain, Immortal Master Lingxi said, “I will teach every one of you a set of cultivation methods and ten occult arts, and you will master them within a month. If you fail the test, you will not be qualified to be a nominal disciple. Do you understand?”","It had only been a few days since she became a teacher, but she was already acting like one when she spoke.","“Yes, Master,” everyone replied.","“Very good. I hope you can work hard on your cultivation and get a good result. Good luck.”","Immortal Master Lingxi began to teach them the cultivation methods. After that, she went back to her villa and began to play online sports games.","“Who are you calling a rookie? You’re the rookie, asshole!","“Believe it or not, I’ll go over and beat you up!”","The other party said, “Don’t brag. Don’t think that I spoil women. I can beat ten women like you with one punch...”","It was apparently a troll on the Internet.","“Where are you from?”","“I’m from Longcheng District, Xiangjiang. Are you going to beat me?”","“Longcheng District?”","Immortal Master Lingxi’s senses swept over. Three minutes later, in a rented house, a barefoot man was typing on the keyboard.","“No response? Who do you think you are to argue with me?”","Thump! Thump!","There was a sudden knock on the door.","“Who is it?”","He walked over to open the door and suddenly saw a beautiful woman. Hiss!","He took a deep breath, but then-","“Why does her fist seem to get bigger and bigger?”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Zhang Han had also heard of the recent situation of Immortal Master Lingxi.","He couldn’t help laughing.","“She’s a teacher now? Perhaps it’s also her hobby. After all, she has lived for nearly ten thousand years.”","“Immortal Master Lingxi is quite interesting.” Zi Yan nodded slightly. “She is very free and unrestrained.”","“It’s the same for us, but you haven’t felt it,” Zhang Han said seriously.","“We’re different.” Zi Yan shook her head slightly.","“What’s the difference?” Zhang Han asked with a smile.","“We had Mengmeng from the beginning. We were a family of three, and she is happy by herself.” Zi Yan smiled.","“Hahaha, that’s true.”","Zhang Han said, “Do you want to go out for a walk?”","In the first few days after their return, Zi Yan, Zhou Fei, and Liang Mengqi went shopping and bought a lot of new clothes, jewelry, and bags. They also met some old friends.","After that, they had nothing to do and just enjoyed a peaceful life on Mount New Moon.","“I want to surf,” Zi Yan said. “That gives me the feeling of being at an amusement part.”","She would have an uncontrollable feeling like ordinary people by doing that.","“That’s a good idea.”","Zhang Han held Zi Yan around the waist and was about to leave the castle.","“Wait. I’ll get a set of clothes first.”","Zi Yan went to the cloakroom and took a milky white bikini from the swimming suit area.","“Put it on first.”","When the beautiful woman changed her clothes, Zhang Han stood by and watched with a smile.","After a while, Zi Yan put on her coat, and the two of them flew into the air and left.","On an island in the Peace Ocean, they were playing on the beach.","“Waves!”","Zhang Han performed the move of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, causing huge waves.","“Seal!”","Zi Yan blocked the perception of her strength, and she could enjoy the excitement.","“Ah!”","Mengmeng and Li Muen were playing mahjong on Mount New Moon.","“My parents are spending time alone again.","“Shall we go somewhere to have fun?” Mengmeng asked.","“We’ve visited all the interesting places. Let’s have some delicious food. I want to eat the smoked sausages in Morben,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“Let’s go there then.”","After saying that, they left. They took the aircraft and arrived at their destination in two hours.","They strolled on the streets in a foreign country while eating sausages.","“So this is how they travel every time.”","Li Xiaohao sighed with emotion.","“This is so free and nice!”","The relaxing days passed quickly.","A week later.","“Mengmeng, let’s go to the Land of God’s Meteorite,” Zhang Han said after breakfast.","“Okay,” Mengmeng replied.","“We should be able to get through this time,” Yue Wuwei said with a smile. “Those steps looked terrifying back then. Now that I think about it, it’s just so-so.”","Therefore, after the meal, the group of more than a dozen people arrived at the Land of God’s Meteorite.","“Let’s go. Let’s go up the stairs. This time, we can see the scenery behind the stairs.”","Yue Wuwei said loudly, “Sir, we’re coming.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he raised his foot with the intention of ascending the stairs.","However, he couldn’t take a step forward.","“What’s happening?”","Yue Wuwei was stunned.","“It’s obvious that you can’t go up,” Yue Xiaonao said.","“What’s going on?” Yue Wuwei was puzzled.","Right then-","Whoosh!","A ball of Shadow of Light gradually condensed, and Sir’s mind appeared.","“Sir, we’re back,” Yue Wuwei said with a smile. “Check out my current strength. I’ve improved a lot.”","“Yeah.”","Then, Sir looked at Zhang Han and said, “Your duplications are doing well. It seems that the Golden-armored Giant Beast has brought you a lot of benefits. You can perfectly form a Godly Body.","“The little princess of Mount New Moon is also at the second tier of the Tribulation Stage. Her strength has improved very quickly. It seems that she has some opportunities.","“The purity of the Profound Underworld Holy Fire is slightly higher. Not bad.”","His tone was full of admiration.","“I’m flattered.” Mengmeng cupped her hands in respect.","No matter where the little princess was, she was favored.","“There’s something we can’t see through,” Zhang Han said, “Have you heard of the Pearl of Fate, Sir?”","“Never heard of it.”","“Immortal Master Qingfeng named it. It seems to be an object from the higher world, which can influence the rules of the Great Domain in the Cultivation World,” Zhang Han said.","“Oh?” Sir’s mind was a little surprised. “Something that can affect the rules of Great Domain is most likely an object from the higher world.”","“But when the Pearl of Fate touched the Heavenly Pearl, it shattered and turned into energy, which was absorbed by the Heavenly Pearl,” Zhang Han said.","“Let me have a look,” Sir’s mind said.","“Okay.”","Mengmeng nodded, and the Heavenly Pearl appeared in her right palm.","This also showed that the Heavenly Pearl was completely under the control of Mengmeng. Even Sir’s mind couldn’t sense it.","“Huh?”","The Shadow of Light flickered slightly. Suddenly, it came to Mengmeng and looked the pearl up and down.","“You deserve to be the little princess of Mount New Moon. You have a great opportunity. That’s a psychic pearl. It can easily affect the rules of the Great Domain in the Cultivation World. Psychic pearls are rare and valuable in the higher world.”","When the crowd heard this, their faces lit up with joy.","It seemed that Mengmeng had obtained a very nice treasure.","They didn’t know what it was exactly and thought it was very high-end. However, they seriously underestimated the value of the treasure.","“Why did the Heavenly Pearl absorb the psychic pearl?” Zhang Han asked curiously.","“The Heavenly Pearl is the world’s essence. If the host’s strength is relatively low, he can control the world’s rules through the pearl.”","Sir explained, “In fact, the Heavenly Pearl is also a treasure. It’s two grades higher than the psychic pearl. That’s why the psychic pearl exploded and the energy was absorbed by the Heavenly Pearl.”","“What’s the function of the psychic pearl?” Zhang Han asked again.","“You have a lot of questions.” Sir’s mind smiled and said, “Don’t worry. With the energy of the psychic pearl, the Heavenly Pearl, and her pure Profound Underworld Holy Fire, the little princess can definitely be promoted to a Fire Spiritual Body.”","“Really?” Zhang Han was surprised.","“I don’t want that!”","Unexpectedly, Mengmeng’s face became darkened as she said, “I don’t want to become a Spirit Body. That’s too ugly.”","Sir’s Shadow of Light trembled twice, as if he was laughing.","Zhang Han was confused. “The Spirit Body is not ugly.”","Mengmeng blinked her beautiful big eyes, looked around, and finally whispered, “Dad, your Thunder Body is very ugly,”","Zhang Han was speechless.","He felt that the translucent body of the Thunder Body was cool, but he didn’t expect it to be so ugly in the eyes of Mengmeng.","After thinking about it carefully, Zhang Han suddenly understood.","Mengmeng had valued her appearance since she was a child. It was the same when she grew up. Women valued their appearances by nature. Of course, they would not choose to become ugly.","“Mengmeng, you’re worrying too much. Look, your mum is also a Spirit Body. Isn’t she very beautiful?” Zhang Guangyou said with a smile.","“Huh?”","Mengmeng was suddenly stunned.","She looked at Zi Yan without blinking her big eyes.","“Mum is indeed super beautiful. She is also a Spirit Body.”","“Yes.”","Sir said, “It doesn’t mean that your appearance will change when you become a Spirit Body. The so-called Fire Spiritual Body means that you will be more proficient in the energy of fire. In fact, nothing much will change. It’s just that your control of fire is innate. Of course, it depends on how much your Profound Underworld Holy Fire can be upgraded.”","For some reason, every time Sir explained things to Mengmeng, he would tell her in detail.","Sir’s Shadow of Light said, “Now, you can go first. There are some gifts for you every 100 steps.”","“Then I’m going.”","Mengmeng looked at Zhang Han.","“Go do it.”","Under everyone’s gaze, Mengmeng ran up the stairs.","Last time, she took away the treasures on 99 steps.","When she reached the 199th step, she obtained another Space Ring.","“There are so many cultivation resources.”","She kept going up to the 299th and then the 399th steps.","Until the 899th step, Mengmeng couldn’t go up.","But she was still holding on.","“You can’t go up,” Sir’s Shadow of Light said.","“Mengmeng, come down,” Zhang Han shouted.","Mengmeng held on for a few more steps and quickly jumped down. “Oh, I’m so tired.”","She wiped the sweat off her forehead.","Swoosh!","On the 999th step, a ray of cyan light suddenly burst out and then dissipated.","“The gifts here are left by Eldest Mind. They’re for you to explore,” Sir’s mind said. “Next, you should absorb these Elemental Sources first. Zhang Han, I’ll take you to condense the Godly Body.”","Five clusters of Elemental Sources were directly condensed in the air.","They were light blue, but others couldn’t tell their attributes.","“Why should I absorb this?” Mengmeng asked.","“Wait a minute. I’ll help you advance to the Fire Spiritual Body later.”","Then, Sir’s mind and Zhang Han disappeared.","They came to the steps and looked at the continent in front of them.","Every time Zhang Han looked at it, he felt a little shocked.","“What kind of Godly Body is this?” Zhang Han asked, “Why did you prepare these duplications for me?”","“You can ask these questions when you see the Eldest Mind. I can only tell you that it’s because of Zi Yan.”","Zhang Han was silent for a moment.","“This Godly Body is called the Nine Suns Godly Body.”","Sir’s Shadow of Light emitted rays of light, and nine suns rose from all directions on the continent ahead.","Light radiated in all directions as the brilliance of the nine suns sprinkled down.","In front of Sir’s Shadow of Light, a Godly Body with the same facial features as Zhang Han appeared.","When the nine suns fell one after another, they turned into monstrous energy and merged into the Godly Body.","After Zhang Han injected his soul into it, his Godly Body began to condense."]},{"number":1696,"title":"Chapter 1696 The Six Bodies","paragraphs":["Chapter 1696 The Six Bodies","It was the Nine Suns Godly Body.","Zhang Han felt the power of the Godly Body.","All the brilliance of the nine suns gathered together, burning hot. The violent energy even made him feel a sense of oppression.","“In the Cultivation World, the power of the Nine Suns Godly Body is similar to that of the Extreme Purity Immortal Body and the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","The cluster of light that surrounded Sir’s mind was reduced by half.","His voice was also softer than before, and he was a little tired.","He explained, “When you reach the higher world, the power of the Nine Suns Godly Body will be revealed. In other words, your six duplications will be restricted by the rules of the Great Domain in the Cultivation World, so they won’t be able to exert too much of their power.","“Your six duplications contain all kinds of things, including the Golden-armored Giant Beast. That’s an opportunity for you, and there are some changes to it that I’ve prepared for you. As for the specific mysteries, you’ll understand them yourself in the future.","“Also, I will disappear in a moment. When you see me again, it will be my other mind. Before that, I need to remind you.”","Sir’s Shadow of Light flickered. His tone was full of emotion and a trace of vicissitudes.","“You have six duplications. Even if you go to the higher world, you can deal with all kinds of situations. But don’t be careless. Your development is too smooth. You don’t have any Thunder Tribulation or obstacles. When your strength reaches the peak of the Cultivation World, you will have a great calamity. I told you last time that the sooner the calm comes, the better it will be for you.","“Your calamity is unavoidable. When your Nine Suns Godly Body is born, I hope that you will be able to protect the people you want to protect.”","Clatter!","Zhang Han was still focusing on the Nine Suns Godly Body.","Sir’s Shadow of Light dissipated, and he directly appeared in front of Mengmeng.","“Now that you’ve absorbed the Elemental Sources, let’s begin.”","The Shadow of Light blossomed with its last afterglow.","Clack!","After Mengmeng took out her Heavenly Pearl, cracks suddenly appeared.","“Is the Heavenly Pearl about to shatter?”","The people nearby were shocked.","Especially Yue Wuwei, who was staring blankly ahead.","If the Heavenly Pearl was broken, how could Mengmeng control the rules of the world? Did she need his subsidiary pearl to assist her?","A subsidiary pearl appeared in the palm of Yue Wuwei, which was smaller than Mengmeng ‘s Heavenly Pearl.","After Yue Wuwei took a look, he was stunned.","“Huh?”","Clack!","The pearl broke into pieces and turned into light cyan energy, which swirled around Mengmeng.","“Fire!”","The light of Sir’s mind surged.","A transparent flame that could be vaguely seen appeared.","The energy of the psychic pearl merged into the flame, and the energy surrounding the Heavenly Pearl formed a storm.","Mengmeng’s Profound Underworld Holy Fire appeared.","However, the moment it appeared, it disintegrated and turned into energy that flowed into the center of the storm.","The transparent flame was burning inside.","At this time, Mengmeng was still staring with her big eyes.","“Go.”","Sir’s mind controlled the flame and wrapped it around Mengmeng.","“Little princess, you can now advance to be a Fire Spiritual Body. Judging from your aura, you should be a Void Fire Body. Even in the higher world, it will be a Holy Fire with extremely destructive power. It’s just that it will take you hundreds of years to absorb and refine it. I’ll teach you the Heaven Fire Skill. In the evolution period of the Fire Body, once it’s started, it can’t be reversed. The cultivation method must be followed step by step. It will be divided into three levels. The energy of the fire must be stable. Remember, don’t make any mistakes. If you make any mistakes, you will hurt your soul or be obliterated.”","The voice of Sir’s mind echoed in the Land of God’s Meteorite.","Even Zhang Han, who was inside, could hear it clearly.","After saying this, Sir’s mind stopped for three seconds and then turned into starlight and dissipated between heaven and earth.","Sir’s mind had awakened several times and now helped Zhang Han condense the Nine Suns Godly Body and Mengmeng gather the Spiritual Body of Fire. The energy of the mind had been exhausted and dissipated.","The scene was deathly silent.","The charm of the Land of God’s Meteorite was gone.","The steps ahead were turned into ashes. From a distance, it could be seen that Zhang Han was sitting cross-legged on a blue stone inside. Next to him, there was a body with the same outline but surrounded by light.","Under the light, the body looked unusually holy.","“They’re all starting.”","Yue Wuwei grinned and said, “Another one of Sir’s minds has dissipated. Alas, my subsidiary pearl is gone. We can only stay here for the time being and can’t get out.”","“Then let’s wait.” Zi Yan blinked.","Her daughter was also a Spirit Body, which meant that she was the same as her.","“If Mengmeng becomes a Spirit Body, she won’t have to undergo more tribulation in the future,” Rong Jiali said with a smile. “She’ll be just like you. It will be much more convenient.”","“Yes, but we can’t find a way to cultivate.” Zi Yan smiled.","“This is a problem.” Yue Wuwei was stunned for two seconds and suddenly sighed. “Alas, I thought that Mengmeng could summon the divine thunder over the sky in the future, but I didn’t expect that she wouldn’t have to go through more tribulation since she has become a Spirit Body. It seems that I’ll have to shoulder this important task. This is the feeling of having a heavy burden.”","“What are you talking about?” Zhang Guangyou glanced at him and asked, “Elder Yue, why would you need to summon the divine thunder over the sky?”","“It’s not me. It’s Zhang Han. He wants to kill the divine thunder over the sky,” Yue Wuwei replied.","“Oh, I see.” Zhang Guangyou said with a smile, “It doesn’t matter, Elder Yue. If you can’t summon it, we’ll try our best. There are so many of us, so we still have a chance.”","“Hahaha, that’s hilarious.” Yue Wuwei shook his beard and said, “I can do it.”","“Are you looking down on me?","“Humph.”","Yue Wuwei didn’t enjoy being belittled.","In this way, Zhang Han and Mengmeng began to cultivate in seclusion in the Land of God’s Meteorite.","The changes this time would definitely be huge. It would also take some time for them to fuse these new things.","On the other side.","In the Land of the Immortal Grave.","“Little white horse, don’t go.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven followed by the white horse’s side. He said warmly, “I like you more and more. Let’s chat and make friends.”","“I don’t need human friends,” said the white horse.","Immortal Master Waterheaven was stunned for a long while.","The picture in his mind was the time when Zhang Han signed a master-binding contract with the Dragon King.","Perhaps it was useless to be reserved.","Immortal Master Waterheaven simply said, “If you don’t need human friends, do you need a human host? I think I can be one. I’m the Sect Master of a super sect.”","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The little white horse was so angry that its nostrils puffed out the white mist.","“What did you say? How dare you have such a bold idea? You, you are a pervert! Believe it or not, I’ll kill you with one kick.”","“Don’t be angry. Don’t be angry. I was just joking. Let’s be friends first,” Immortal Master Waterheaven immediately consoled.","“I don’t want friends. Stay away from me.” The little white horse ran away quickly.","Unfortunately, its speed was completely inferior to Immortal Master Waterheaven’s.","“Don’t follow me.”","“We can have a chat. I mean no harm.”","“Please behave yourself.”","“As long as you chat with me for a few years, I won’t disturb you. What do you think?”","The little white horse was furious. “You’re going too far. Brothers, beat him up.”","“Arrrrgh!”","Many ancient demonic beasts were roaring not far away.","“They’re so nice.”","With a wave of his hand, Immortal Master Waterheaven suppressed these ancient demonic beasts and prevented them from approaching. Seeing this, the little white horse was angry and helpless. It used its supernatural power, turned into a stream of light, and flew into the starry sky.","“I can’t afford to mess with him, but I can run, can’t I?”","However, Immortal Master Waterheaven followed closely behind.","A chase that made the little white horse desperate began.","On Mount New Moon.","“Cultivate step by step.”","Once in a while, Immortal Master Lingxi would give instructions to Heavenly Hound and the others, but she would spend more time on school.","“Why do so many students merely focus on one subject?”","Immortal Master Lingxi found it strange, and she started studying it once more.","In just three months, her class, from the bottom of the ordinary class, became the No.1 only second to the elite classes.","“This semester is almost over. When the next semester begins, I’ll lead the team to surpass the elite classes.”","Immortal Master Lingxi had a goal as well.","She wore glasses every day, and she didn’t think it was high-profile to drive a luxury class to school.","This made some people wonder if she had relied on her relationship, her face, and her body to rise to the top.","However, when these people attended her class as observers, they found that she gave speeches off script, gave wonderful demonstrations of academic topics, and was very passionate.","“She’s a powerful beautiful lady.”","“Impressive!”","...","As for the others on Mount New Moon, Zhao Feng and Liang Mengqi had traveled around the world alone.","Ah Hu and Liu Jiaran kept staying in Liu Qingfeng’s manor to try to have a baby.","Zhang Li and Liang Hao were still so carefree, going wherever they went.","The others also had their own things to do, either studying the array of formations or working in the company. They were relaxed while they weren’t completely idle.","More than 30 days passed.","On the day before the New Year.","In the Land of God’s Meteorite.","“Phew...”","Zhang Han let out a long sigh.","He opened his eyes, which were shining brightly.","The Nine Suns Godly Body next to Zhang Han turned into rays of light and merged into his Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","“The Godly Body has just been formed, but it is still absorbing energy. It won’t be long before it’s born.”","Zhang Han thought for a while.","“You’re awake?”","There was a reclining chair a few meters away from him, and Zi Yan was half-lying on it. After seeing this, she sat up with joy in her eyes.","“How long has it been?” Zhang Han asked with a smile.","“Thirty-five days,” Zi Yan said. “We’ve been sitting here and waiting.”","“Hahaha!”","Seeing that Zi Yan was so cute, Zhang Han smiled and said, “After this is done, there will be nothing much to do. Let’s travel around.”","“Okay.” Zi Yan smiled and said, “Let’s go and see Mengmeng. Elder Yue said that Mengmeng will wake up a little later than you, but she seems to wake up soon.”","“That girl.”","Zhang Han looked into the distance. Mengmeng was sitting cross-legged on the ground, surrounded by a little energy.","“Spirit Bodies. You two are indeed mother and daughter. Both of you are Spirit Bodies.”","When they walked over hand in hand, Zhang Han couldn’t help laughing.","“What about you?” Zi Yan blinked her big eyes and said, “You’re omnipotent to have everything.”","“Well, yes.”","Zhang Han nodded.","There was also confusion in his eyes.","When the Nine Suns Godly Body had just taken shape, the other five bodies resonated with each other. This resonance shocked Zhang Han as if it was a unique sound that had transcended the world.","It was accompanied by a strange feeling that was hard to describe.","Zhang Han had a vague feeling that it seemed to have something to do with his future cultivation.","But as for what it was exactly, he couldn’t feel it.","“I should be able to sense something when the Nine Suns Godly Body is born.”","Zhang Han thought for a while.","He walked closer to the crowd.","Zhang Guangyou, Rong Jiali, Yue Wuwei, and the others asked, “You’re awake. How are you feeling?”","“Very good. It feels perfect,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“What about your realm? Has it changed?” Yue Wuwei asked.","“It hasn’t changed much.”","Zhang Han smiled faintly.","After that, he was silent for two seconds.","Yue Wuwei had thought that there was not much change.","Unexpectedly, Zhang Han said leisurely, “I’m just at the Peak Stage of the eighth tier.”","Yue Wuwei fell into silence.","“He’s at the Peak Stage of the eighth tier. He’s about to reach the ninth tier. Hahaha, my son is really amazing.” Zhang Guangyou laughed.","Yue Wuwei calculated.","“You can defeat Lingxi Immortal Master at the Middle Stage of the eighth tier. You have the combat capability at the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage. Now you are at the eighth tier at the Peak-Stage. You should be... the top one among the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage cultivators. Even in the Star Sea, very few people can be a match for you.”","As he spoke, he was shocked.","“When you break through to the ninth tier, won’t you be invincible? If you reach the Peak Stage of the Tribulation Stage, no one in the world can defeat you!”"]},{"number":1697,"title":"Chapter 1697 New Year Comes","paragraphs":["Chapter 1697 New Year Comes","“You are right.”","Zhang Han shook his head and said, “When I broke through to the eighth tier in the Star Sea, I could already feel the suppression of the rules of Great Domain.”","Those who became out of the rules would be resisted by the rules.","Zhang Han was walking on a heaven-defying road. It was against the Rules of the Heaven and Earth of this world.","“Alas!”","Yue Wuwei sighed softly and said, “Forget it. Don’t think about it. I can’t have the feeling.”","“My daughter is about to wake up.”","While speaking, everyone looked at Mengmeng.","Mengmeng slowly opened her beautiful eyes with her long eyelashes fluttering a few times.","At first, she was a little confused. She seemed to have not woken up yet.","Then she immediately perked up.","“Daddy, are you awake too?”","Mengmeng patted her butt, got up, and stretched herself.","“Ouch! I feel a little tired.”","“Have a rest,” Zhang Han said. “Sit down for a while.”","He took out a chair.","Mengmeng twisted her body and stretched out her arms and legs.","She walked over and was about to sit down.","Then she gradually widened her eyes in shock.","“It’s over!” The little girl exclaimed.","“What do you mean?” Yue Xiaonao asked in confusion.","“What’s going on?” Zhang Guangyou looked at her carefully and said, “You haven’t changed. You’re still so beautiful.”","“That’s right.” Zhang Han laughed and said, “Don’t be like this. Don’t worry. You’re still gorgeous.”","“It’s not about that.”","Mengmeng had a bitter look on her pretty face. “Daddy, I’m finished.”","“What happened?” Zhang Han stopped smiling and looked at her seriously.","Under everyone’s curious gaze, Mengmeng pouted her pink lips.","“I’m not in the Tribulation Stage now. I don’t have the strength. My cultivation has gone.”","“What happened?”","Zhang Han immediately grabbed Mengmeng by the wrist and sensed it carefully.","“I can’t detect the energy in your body.” Zhang Han shook his head and said, “How do you feel?”","“I can feel nothing,” Mengmeng said. “It’s completely different from before. I have no strength at all.”","“That shouldn’t be the case,” Yue Wuwei said in confusion. “We’ve all heard that Mengmeng has a Fire Spirit Body. How could she not have any strength? The Heavenly Pearl, my subsidiary pearl, and a lot of energy also disappeared. Haven’t you finished cultivating yet?”","“Oh! Did you use the cultivation method that Sir taught you?” Zhang Guangyou asked.","“I followed the method of cultivation.” Mengmeng blinked.","She ran her cultivation method and tried other things, but they were all useless.","“What’s going on?” Everyone was a little confused.","“Spirit Body.”","Zhang Han pondered for a while and finally said, “Your situation may be very similar to that of your Mummy.”","“Really?”","Zi Yan pondered for a moment. She knew what everyone wanted to ask. Then she said, “That’s possible. I can’t feel any advancement, nor do I have any Thunder Tribulation. But if I want to make a breakthrough, I’ll cultivate automatically. Then I’ll make a breakthrough in a short time.”","“Oh! I understand.”","Mengmeng immediately closed her eyes and said, “Breakthrough.”","She mumbled to herself.","As a result, there seemed to be no change.","Swoosh!","Two minutes later, Mengmeng reached the Elixir Realm.","“It turns out to be like this.”","Mengmeng didn’t quite understand. She knew that it had something to do with her mind.","“Flame!”","Mengmeng tried her best to feel it. A few seconds later, she entered the state and pressed forward with her white and tender right hand.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","An invisible flame burned. People could see the outline of the flame and even feel it. Many cracks appeared in the void in front of them.","In an instant, the flame almost burned through the void.","“What kind of fire is this?” Yue Wuwei was slightly shocked.","“I don’t know, but it should be powerful.” Zhang Han took a light breath and looked happy.","“I feel it. I understand.”","Mengmeng opened her eyes and said with a smile, “I have to run the Heaven Fire Skill all the time. I can feel the flame. It is still in its embryonic form. It’s different from the Profound Underworld Holy Fire. I can also feel the Rules of the Heaven and Earth. I feel it was like using the Heavenly Pearl before.”","Hearing this, Zhang Han laughed.","This was similar to how he felt when he was in the Domain of Seven Desolations. In this world, if one could control the rules of the world, it would be invincible unless it encountered the Rules of the Heaven and Earth.","“Let’s go back.”","Mengmeng commanded with her mind.","The Space Portal appeared in front of everyone.","Boom!","When they stepped into the Space Portal, the Land of God’s Meteorite began to collapse.","This place would no longer exist.","Under the Thunder Yang Tree, everyone was stunned when they saw the scene.","It was in the middle of the night, but it was bright on Mount New Moon. Many red lanterns had been hung high, and many kinds of ornaments were dazzling.","“The New Year is coming,” Yue Xiaonao said with a smile. “It seems that we can get a lot of red packet money again.”","“How old are you? Why do you still want red packet money?” Lisa curled her lips.","“No matter how old she is, she is still your daughter. Oh, I see. Maybe you think Mengmeng and I are younger because we don’t have a boyfriend yet. Why don’t we find one?” Yue Xiaonao said.","After she said that, Zhang Han’s mouth twitched slightly.","Yue Wuwei’s face darkened.","“Ha... I think it’s okay,” Mengmeng said with a smile.","“We have red pocket money for you. Much money,” Yue Wuwei said helplessly.","“Sit down and have a rest first.”","Zhang Han controlled the fruit with his divine sense.","He also made some freshly squeezed juice and so on.","They sat in the pavilion. Many people who were still awake greeted Zhang Han in the distance. Dong Chen and the others also came over.","Heavenly Hound and Xu Xiaoqiang were cultivating in the villa area on the side.","The whole Mount New Moon was full of vitality.","“The Spirit Body is so strange.”","Mengmeng often sensed it. “It’s different from the normal way of cultivation. The pellet refining and the array of formations I have learned before are all useless.”","“They are not useless.”","Zhang Han found it funny and said, “They are useful when we fight against the enemies or experience in the secret realms.”","“Dad, I found that the previous Heavenly Pearl was not very good. I could indirectly control the rules of the world with it. Now I can feel the rules clearly, and I can also feel those hidden light doors,” Mengmeng said.","“Light doors?” Yue Wuwei was slightly moved. “Light doors have disappeared for a long time. There used to be Bone Demon in it. There used to be many Bone Demons in the past. But later, it maintained a balance. Outside the light door is a continent, the Bone Demon Continent. But I don’t know what is in the depths of that continent for so many years.”","“Should I open a light door and go in to have a look?” Mengmeng asked curiously.","Her words made the people present silent.","“Should we go to explore it or have a rest?”","After thinking for a while, Zhang Han said with a smile, “You’re just in the Elixir Realm. How dare you explore that kind of place? Focus on your cultivation, and wait for your combat capability to rise first.”","“Huh?”","Mengmeng was stunned.","“Humph.” She let out a bitter snort.","Why did he mention her sadness?","Her cultivation had dropped from the second tier of the Tribulation Stage to the Elixir Realm.","Although she had the aura of the Elixir Realm, her combat capability was not low.","“Mengmeng, if you cultivate the Heaven Fire Skill. Your cultivation will return to the Tribulation Stage soon,” Zhang Han said seriously.","“How soon?” Mengmeng asked.","“It’s only been decades,” Zhang Han replied.","“It’s so long.”","Mengmeng grinned and said, “Alas! Back then, I was also in the Tribulation Stage. Then, I went back to Earth and reached the Elixir Realm. My experience is like my Daddy’s. Can I also become a big shot if I go out for some years?”","“You’re already a big shot now. You’re in charge of the world’s rules. What else do you want?” Zhang Han didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. He said, “Besides, Mount New Moon is still here. I’m afraid you can’t go out even if you want to.”","“That’s true.”","Mengmeng was discouraged.","“Forget it. I’d better focus on my cultivation.”","“It’s Spring Festival tomorrow.”","“It must be lively on Mount New Moon this year.”","“There are the Zi Clan, the Rong Clan, the Liang Clan...”","Many people would gather together.","That night, Chen Changqing also returned to the Chen Clan in Shang Jing with Chen Chuan and Nina.","He took his future daughter-in-law home to let others know about her. That night, the Chen Clan celebrated until late at night.","The people of the Chen Clan didn’t gaze at the future daughter-in-law like an aristocratic family at all. There were only blessings. When a clan’s strength exceeded a certain level, it would be easy to deal with anything.","Even so, Nina was still a little nervous.","Seeing so many elders of the Chen Clan, her heart beat faster.","On the evening of New Year’s Eve, the celebration of Mount New Moon began.","During the day, many martial art families that had connections with Xiangjiang, such as the Luo Family, would come here to celebrate every year. After decades, Luo Shan and the others looked just a few years older.","As people who had a good relationship with Mount New Moon, they could live for many years with a few martial art resources. In addition, they often came to the dining room on Mount New Moon to have meals. The Thunder Yang Treasure Land had grown into an eighth-tier treasure land. The fruits, vegetables, and livestock that drank the spirit water on the mountain were not ordinary.","Chen Changqing, the Warlord of Chan Clan, and the present Patriarch Chen arrived at Mount New Moon. The whole Rong Clan in Lin Hai City also came to Mount New Moon.","This was also their habit.","During the Spring Festival, the core members of their clans would go to Mount New Moon.","The Liang Clan, the Zi Clan, and other forces were the same. Except for some who did business outside, the other people would all go to Mount New Moon.","In short, Mount New Moon was very lively on this day.","The New Year’s Eve dinner was sumptuous.","The next morning, Mengmeng fiddled with the money on the bed and stuffed it into the red envelopes casually. She prepared a lot of red packet money.","Then she went out.","“Happy New Year, Sister Mengmeng.”","“Happy New Year.”","“Happy New Year, Auntie Mengmeng.”","“Happy New Year.”","Mengmeng gave them red envelopes.","“Happy New Year, Sect Leader.”","“Uh?”","Heavenly Hound and Xu Xiaoqiang shamelessly ran over to ask for the red envelopes. Mengmeng was stunned.","“What are you doing here?”","“It’s festive. When in Rome, do as the Romans do. We also have to celebrate the festivals here,” Heavenly Hound said with a smile. “Is there any spirit treasure in the red envelope?”","“Ha... With the status of the Sect Leader, her red envelope should contain a seventh-tier or eighth-tier spirit treasure!” Xu Xiaoqiang laughed.","“Isn’t it that when in Rome, do as the Romans do?” Mengmeng rolled her eyes and said, “Money is what I should give you! Humph!”","After taking two steps, Mengmeng suddenly remembered something. She rolled her eyes and said in a low voice, “Oh, if you want spirit treasures, you can go and find Immortal Master Lingxi. She likes to give disciples spirit treasures, and they are all ninth-tier spirit treasures.”","“Really?” Heavenly Hound doubted.","Up until now, they hadn’t received any treasures from Immortal Master Lingxi.","“Just give it a try. Anyway, I know it’s true.” Mengmeng left leisurely.","“Let’s have a try.”","The two of them quickly ran to the residence of Immortal Master Lingxi.","“Master, Happy New Year.”","Heavenly Hound shouted outside the door, ” Master, do you have any red envelope?”","“No.”","“Do you have any gifts?” Xu Xiaoqiang asked.","“No.”","“You can give us spirit treasures or something else,” Heavenly Hound said in a low voice.","“No.”","The two looked at each other and left with their heads down.","Immortal Master Lingxi had nothing to give them."]},{"number":1698,"title":"Chapter 1698 The Final Effect","paragraphs":["Chapter 1698 The Final Effect","In the villa where Immortal Master Lingxi lived, she looked at some spirit treasures and red envelopes beside the table with hesitation.","“Should I give them?","“No!","“Should I give them?","“No!”","She was in a dilemma as if two souls were talking inside her body.","In the end, there was a winner.","“Humph.","“No!”","“Anyone who belongs to Zhang Hanyang should be inspected for a hundred years after taking in.","“I’ll give them treasures after they pass the test. Otherwise, it will be a big waste.”","Immortal Master Lingxi snorted and put away all the spirit treasures and red envelopes.","However, a moment later, a large group of children, who were around ten years old, rushed in.","“Happy New Year, Sister Lingxi.”","“Happy New Year. You’re getting younger and prettier.”","“I wish Sister Lingxi good health and good luck.”","Seeing this group of children, Immortal Master Lingxi blinked. “Ha... Thank you! I’ll give you red envelopes! One by one!”","Then the red envelopes were sent out by LImmortal Master Lingxi with a smile.","She felt happy.","After these children left, Immortal Master Lingxi felt refreshed again.","“What are you afraid of?”","With a snort, she put her hands behind her back and strolled out of the villa.","“Happy New Year, Immortal Master Lingxi.”","Someone from the security group of Mount New Moon greeted her.","“Happy New Year.”","Swoosh!","He took out a fifth-tier spirit treasure.","“Thank you, Immortal Master Lingxi.”","He didn’t expect that he would get a treasure.","Everyone knew Immortal Master Lingxi was a ruthless person who was even stronger than Immortal Master Waterheaven. She was a Grand Master of a Holy Land, so there was no need to refuse her if she wanted to give him a spirit treasure. If he refused, it would be no different from showing disrespect to Immortal Master Lingxi.","“Happy New Year, Sister Lingxi.”","“Uh.”","She gave the other party another spirit treasure.","In next to no time, her disciples saw her from afar.","“Huh?”","Heavenly Hound said in a sneaky tone, “She has prepared a lot of gifts, right? Let’s go to greet her.”","“Master, Happy New Year. I wish Master a good life, good things pairs, good news...”","He uttered some words of blessing.","Immortal Master Lingxi nodded. “Good. Use it for your cultivation.”","She threw out a Space Ring. Heavenly Hound looked very happy. After feeling it, he couldn’t even hide the smile.","“Thank you, Master.”","“I wish Master a boyfriend as soon as possible,” Xu Xiaoqiang said with a smile.","“Uh?”","Immortal Master Lingxi revealed the intention of beating Xu Xiaoqiang.","This was not a lively place.","Zhang Han was visited with no break since New Year came.","Mengmeng was the most popular girl. Both the younger generation and the elders would come to talk to her.","This was because of the attitude of Zhang Han back then.","Zhang Han doted on Mengmeng too much and attached great importance to her. Therefore, other people who attached great importance to Zhang Han would pay more attention to Mengmeng.","Mount New Moon was in a festive atmosphere for several days.","“I haven’t celebrated the New Year for a long time. I feel so comfortable.” Mengmeng lay lazily on the bed.","Yue Xiaonao and Felina were sitting on chairs next to her.","“Mengmeng, how’s your strength recovery going?” Felina asked Mengmeng.","“It’s the Spring Festival. Why do you mention such a disappointing thing?” Mengmeng rolled her eyes grumpily.","“It’s the aura of the Elixir Realm,” Yue Xiaonao said. “But that invisible flame is powerful. When it burns, even those in the Integration Realm can’t resist it. Its destructive power is amazing.”","“You’re amazing,” Felina muttered.","“By the way, we’re going to the Sea Dragon Star Area tomorrow to pick up your parents,” Mengmeng lay down and said. “When we have dinner tonight, I have to talk to Uncle Chen and ask him to give you more betrothal gifts.”","“Betrothal gifts?” Felina said casually, “There is no such rule in our Elf Clan.”","“It’s a waste not to ask for these things.”","Mengmeng said casually, “Uncle Chen is rich.”","In the evening, it was time for dinner.","“Uncle Chen, have you prepared the betrothal gifts?” Mengmeng asked directly.","“Ha... Of course, I have.” Chen Changqing laughed and said, “Girl, I’m your father’s good brother.”","“Nina is our good sister,” Yue Xiaonao said. “Please give her more betrothal gifts. Don’t embarrass the Chen Clan.”","“Sure.” Chen Changqing laughed.","Chen Chuan was standing next to them, watching Nina smirk. Nina was relatively quiet. Her face was slightly ruddy. She was sitting aside and did not say anything.","It was early the next morning.","Without the Heavenly Pearl, Mengmeng was the only one who could lead the team to the Sea Dragon Star Area and open the ancient road to the Boundless Sea.","This time, the team was composed of the core members of Mount New Moon. They were riding a king vessel and flying above the Boundless Sea.","They arrived at the Chaotic Region in the Sea Dragon Star Area.","They gave the news first. Half an hour later, they got off the spaceship and went to the palace on the continent.","“Olien, Tricia.”","Chen Changqing cupped his hands in front of his chest in the distance and said courteously, “I’m Chen Changqing of the Chen Clan. I’m here with my son to propose marriage to Nina. Please agree on the marriage between Nina and Chen Chuan.”","As he spoke, he waved his hand.","The members of the Chen Clan took out the gift boxes from their Space Rings one by one.","“These are some local specialties of our place.","“There are also cultivation resources.","“One billion crystal stones.","“999 spirit treasures.”","“...”","The gifts were dazzling.","There were even many high-end treasures.","“Brother Chen, what do you bring with so many things?” Olien said helplessly, “It’s good enough that the two love each other. Why did you bring so many gifts?”","“Brother Olien, you don’t know this. Giving gifts represents our love and recognition of Nina. This is our custom. Brother Olien, please don’t refuse.”","“Ha... Okay! I’ll accept the gifts.” Olien nodded repeatedly.","The Elemental Elf Clan and the Dark Elf Clan were now a family. Because of their relationship with Zhang Han, they lived in retirement in the Sea Dragon Star Area. They didn’t lack any resources. The resources that Chen Changqing gave them could also be shared with many outstanding disciples of the two clans.","They wanted to share joy.","The Elf Clan was decorated with lanterns and ribbons. Nina wore a sexy long dress. That night, they held a blessing ceremony in the Elf Clan.","The next day, Olien and nearly a hundred other members of the Elf Clan followed them to Earth.","“Will the wedding be in Shang Jing or here?”","Chen Changqing’s clan, Zhang Han’s clan, and Nina’s family discussed the wedding.","“Let’s hold it here,” Zhou Fei said. “It’s a large-scale wedding. It’s much more convenient to hold it here.”","“It’s convenient.” Chen Changqing nodded, “But I think we haven’t been back to the Chen Clan for so many years.”","“Don’t worry.” Warlord of the Chan Clan shook his head and said, “There are not many people in the Chen Clan. They can take a plane here. As for some friends of the Chen Clan, I think they are eager to come to Mount New Moon to have a look.”","“Okay! Let’s hold the wedding here.”","The matter was quickly settled.","The people of the Elf Clan didn’t hide anything. Even Nina and Felina pricked up their ears.","Many children on Mount New Moon were curious about them.","“It’s the Elf Clan.”","“Many members of the Elf Clan are on our Mount New Moon.”","“Nina and Felina are both princesses of Mount New Moon. Our Young Master Chen Chuan is going to marry Nina.”","“The wedding will be held in seven days.”","The Chen Clan sent out a lot of invitations for the wedding ceremony seven days later of Chen Chuan and Nina.","Some friends of Shang Jing saw the invitations.","“Are you going to Xiangjiang to get married?”","“Seven days later, I’m going to North Murica to attend a meeting. It’s a pity. Wait! Is it in the Holy Land, Mount New Moon? Hiss! Secretary, push up the meeting in North Murica for me. I’ll have a chance to Mount New Moon and have a good look.”","“It’s Mount New Moon, the Holy Land of the martial arts world. Many families and sects in the martial art circle will go there. They are inquiring about the invitation. If all of them can go there, there will be countless people.”","The next day, Mount New Moon sent out news about the wedding of Chen Chuan and Nina. The Chen Clan sent out invitations.","Those who had cooperated with the Chen Clan or had a good relationship with any person of the Chen Clan suddenly felt that the invitation card in their hands was precious.","This was a ticket to see many big shots.","If they could have a good chat, it would be an opportunity!","During these seven days, Elder Meng also took action.","“Please marry me, Lu Guo.”","In the back mountain, Elder Meng proposed to Lu Guo. He had invited many children around ten years old from Mount New Moon, who were all holding flowers. Some adults were watching the fun.","The crowd included Zhang Han and Lu Xiong. There were dozens of people.","“Teacher, don’t promise him so easily.” Mengmeng cheered, “He made you wait for so many years.”","“That’s right.” Lu Guo pursed her lips, looked at Elder Meng, and said, “I won’t agree.”","“It’s my fault. I was not ready. But I didn’t expect us to be separated for decades.” Elder Meng was clumsy, and his face was a little red. However, he said sincerely, “I have no parents. It’s said that the elder brother is no better than the father. I don’t have either. Lu Guo, if you marry me, I won’t let you down.”","“Can’t you say something romantic?” Lu Guo smiled.","Elder Meng was not good at romance, but he was sincere and a little silly. Lu Guo liked him.","“Master Lu.”","Zhang Han said at this time, “My lover and I represent the family members of Elder Meng. They have been dating for a long time. Why don’t we let them get married? Let’s settle their marriage.”","“Okay.”","Lu Xiong nodded repeatedly and said, “I’ve known Elder Meng for so many years. He’s a good guy. I can rest assured to let him take care of my granddaughter.”","“Have you agreed?” Elder Meng was pleasantly surprised.","“Idiot,” Lu Guo said angrily.","“The wedding?” Zhang Han said. “Please choose a day.”","“Chen Chuan will hold his wedding next week. Let’s hold their wedding two weeks later,” Lu Xiong said.","Time passed quickly.","A week later, the wedding ceremony of Chen Chuan and Nina was decorated with lanterns and colored banners. The atmosphere was festive. The ceremony was grand and magnificent. Many people had come to congratulate them.","The wedding had been held successfully.","Chen Changqing became a father-in-law. He said to Zhang Han happily, “When will you become a father-in-law?”","Zhang Han glanced at him and said, “How could I know it?”","Chen Changqing thought to himself, “If you don’t know it, no one knows. As long as you permit, there will be countless people pursuing Mengmeng.”","He thought about it carefully. It would take many years.","Another week came.","On the weekend, Lu Guo and Elder Meng held another wedding. It was not grand. Only some people from the White Moon Pavilion, where Lu Xiong lived, came. Elder Meng also had no other relatives there. They were not like the Chen Clan, which was a well-known clan.","“Our teacher got married.”","“Even Chen Chuan is married.”","“Alas!”","“We’re old, Mengmeng.”","Yue Xiaonao always sighed.","However, Mengmeng retorted, “If you’re anxious, just get married. No one will stop you.”"]},{"number":1699,"title":"Chapter 1699 It’s Too Heart-wrenching","paragraphs":["Chapter 1699 It’s Too Heart-wrenching","Spring passed, and autumn arrived.","Time could not leave a mark on the face of a cultivator in a short time.","Mount New Moon was always the same.","Zhang Han and the others were having a good time here. Immortal Master Lingxi didn’t leave either. She stayed here all the time. At first, she was a teacher in Xiangjiang. Later, she moved to different cities.","Zhang Han and his family occasionally went to the Sea Dragon Star Area. Immortal Master Waterheaven was very used to living in the Land of the Immortal Grave. He even built a thatched cottage, raised a few livestock, planted flowers and grass, and lived a leisurely life.","Mengmeng didn’t stay idle either. She strolled around with some other people. She, Yue Xiaonao, and even Li Muen were involved in all kinds of professions.","In the blink of an eye, thirty years passed.","As Mengmeng grew up, Zhang Han and Zi Yan had more time to be alone.","Although it was still sweet, it was not as sweet as when they first fell in love.","One day, the situation changed.","“Honey, I seem to have broken through again.”","Wearing white gauze pajamas, Zi Yan walked to the computer desk and saw Zhang Han playing an online game.","“Really?”","Zhang Han got up, looked her up and down a few times, and said with a smile, “If you break through again, you’ll be at the Tribulation Stage Ninth Tier. At that time, your cultivation will be higher than mine.”","“That’s different. I don’t have much combat capability.” Zi Yan smiled.","“How could it be? Your combat capability is terrifying,” Zhang Han said seriously, “especially in bed.”","Zi Yan rolled her eyes at Zhang Han.","While they were talking, Zi Yan’s hands shone. A strange phenomenon suddenly appeared in the room.","It was as if they were in the void of the universe.","Behind Zi Yan, a bright moon slowly rose. Its aura was extraordinary, quiet, and mysterious.","The bright moon seemed to be full of spirituality and shone pleasantly. Under the afterglow, Zi Yan looked holy, like a pure lotus that came out of the mud and was not contaminated. She looked as if she could only be seen from a distance and could not be touched.","After an unknown period of time, the light dissipated.","Zhang Han picked up Zi Yan and threw her on the bed.","“To celebrate your breakthrough to the ninth-tier Tribulation Stage, I’ll give you a ‘massage’.”","The previous holiness made Zhang Han feel restless in his heart.","As he ‘massaged’, the room was filled with romance.","However, something unexpected happened. At the critical moment, an illusory image appeared around Zhang Han.","The Nine Suns Godly Body, the Golden-armored Giant Beast, the Extreme Purity Immortal Body, the Thunder Body, the Great Demon’s Figure, and the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure all appeared.","The illusory shadows of the six bodies surrounded Zhang Han’s head. Each of them was only the size of a palm, and their auras were profound.","“What’s going on?” Zi Yan widened her eyes.","This was too awkward. It was as if someone else was watching her.","There was a faint light in Zhang Han’s eyes.","“How marvelous.”","“What do you mean?” Zi Yan asked.","“I can feel the brilliance of the moon in your body. It is echoing with my bodies. My six bodies become more compatible with each other.”","As Zhang Han spoke, his face lit up with joy. “The more compatible they are with each other, the stronger my control over my duplications will be. This is a way to increase my combat capability. After you break through to the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage, your Spirit Body will have a larger scale. Then, can we carry out Pair Cultivation together?”","“Let’s try again.”","Soon, there was an ambiguous atmosphere in the room again.","In the charming voice of Zi Yan, when the two of them were in high spirits, a strange phenomenon appeared again.","After a while, it was over.","“How do you feel?” Zhang Han asked.","“I seem to have more energy,” Zi Yan blinked and said.","He was not asking about that feeling. Instead, he was asking about cultivation.","“Ha... It seems that we will go on the road of Pair Cultivation.”","Zhang Han looked pleasantly surprised.","“Why are you so happy?” Zi Yan pursed her sexy lips.","“Of course, we should be happy. We’ll fall in love for the second time,” Zhang Han said with a smile.","“If it’s good for your cultivation, you can do whatever you want.” Zi Yan touched Zhang Han’s neck with the fingers of her right hand and said.","“Then give it another try.”","Zhang Han turned over and climbed up.","“Phew. The effect is very good.” An hour passed, Zhang Han let out a long sigh.","“Is there any substantial benefit?” Zi Yan said, “After your duplications become more compatible with each other, will it only increases your combat capability?”","“Not only the combat capability.” Zhang Han thought for a moment and said, “The more compatible they are, the more likely they are to merge with each other.”","“To merge with each other?” Zi Yan was stunned.","“Yes.” Zhang Han nodded. “It’s said that Tao is unique, and it contains both Yin Qi and Yang Qi. The intersection of Yin and Yang forms a state of harmony in which all things arise. That is to say, the ultimate destination of the 3,000 Great Domains is one. I have six duplications. They look powerful. If they can be merged, their power will be stronger.”","“Will you succeed? Will it be dangerous?” Zi Yan asked.","“I won’t start cultivating it suddenly. I used to be confused about it. But now, if we start Pair Cultivation, I can increase their compatibility. As long as we cultivate hard, my six duplications will naturally merge into one sooner or later, and the six bodies will become one. There should be amazing changes,” Zhang Han said.","“Okay. Then let’s have more Pair Cultivation.” Zi Yan said lazily, “But I’m tired now. Let’s take an afternoon nap first.”","When Zi Yan just fell asleep, Zhang Han released his aura slightly. He narrowed his eyes, left the bedroom, and entered the practice room.","“The Nine Suns Godly Body formed.”","With a stir of Zhang Han’s mind, the Nine Suns Godly Body appeared. It had the same appearance and figure as Zhang Han, except that the eyes of the Nine Suns Godly Body shone like the sun.","“When the Godly Body is born, that tribulation may come.”","“I’m about to break through to the ninth tier. Will there be any accidents after the breakthrough?”","Zhang Han’s expression was grave.","After pondering for three seconds, he released his huge will, which spread all over Mount New Moon.","“Let’s go to the Star Sea tomorrow.”","His voice shocked many people.","“Will we go the Star Sea?” Zhang Guangyou and Zi Qiang were playing chess. Hearing this, they got up and said, “Let’s go back and make preparations. We’ve rested for decades. It’s time for us to go out and gain experience.”","“I can also be a main member of this trial. Ha...” Zi Qiang laughed.","He was in the Tribulation Stage First Tier now.","In the past few decades, the leading cultivators of Mount New Moon had stepped into the fifth-tier Tribulation Stage, and they were about to enter the sixth tier. Many others had entered the Tribulation Stage.","Yue Wuwei had also become a Peak-Stage eighth-tier cultivator, not far from the ninth tier. This time, he should be able to make a breakthrough in the Star Sea.","That night, Mount New Moon became lively again.","“We’ll go to the Star Sea.”","When Mengmeng and the others came back, they began to pack up.","They didn’t know how long it would take to go out. They brought enough clothes, fruits, snacks, and so on.","After having a banquet, which could be said to be a farewell party, hundreds of people set off the next day.","“Let’s go back and see how my disciples are.”","Immortal Master Lingxi followed. “When are we coming back next time?”","Immortal Master Lingxi really liked the mortal world.","“It may take a few years or decades,” Zhang Han said.","“We have to hurry up,” Immortal Master Lingxi said. “The martial arts world in the secular world can hardly hide, and the number of martial artists has increased. The secular world is about to change.”","“Uh.”","Zhang Han nodded slightly and said, “Let’s go to the Sea Dragon Star Area first and ask Immortal Master Waterheaven if he wants to go back.”","“Okay.”","Mengmeng controlled the direction and arrived at the Land of the Immortal Grave of the Sea Dragon Star Area.","Zhang Han and the others had not been here for more than ten years.","At this time, the scene looked a little beautiful.","Immortal Master Waterheaven was strolling around the territory on the little white horse.","“Brother Bai, look! Hanyang and the others are here. Let’s go back to the Star Sea this time. I’ll take you to see how powerful our Highest Clouds Palace is.” Immortal Master Waterheaven laughed from a distance.","“You’re here.”","The little white horse’s nostrils puffed out white smoke. It felt a little embarrassed to be ridden by a person.","However, when it thought about how good Immortal Master Waterheaven was, the little while horse sighed.","There was nothing it could do. Now that it had recognized Immortal Master Waterheaven as its master, it was useless to regret this thing.","“Oh? Have you succeeded?” Immortal Master Lingxi was slightly surprised.","“Of course. Brother White and I are good friends.” Immortal Master Waterheaven had a smug look.","“You’re amazing. Only Immortal Master Waterheaven can succeed.” Zhang Han shook his head and sighed with emotion. “We’ll go to the Star Sea. Will you go with us?”","“Yes! Why not? Besides, we have to lead a team there. I want to let this group of ancient demonic beasts enjoy their life in the Star Sea,” Immortal Master Waterheaven said seriously.","“Okay.”","As soon as Zhang Han said that, many ancient demonic beasts entered three spaceships one after another.","If there were only the people, one spaceship would be enough. Unfortunately, many of these ancient demonic beasts were huge and needed only a few more spaceships.","The fleet set off.","They went back to the Boundless Sea.","“Open!”","Mengmeng controlled the Ancient Road of Starry Sky.","In the blink of an eye, they arrived at the outer ring of the Star Sea near the seventh mountain.","“I’ll break through first.”","After saying that, Zhang Han took the lead in leaving the spaceship and flying into the void of the universe in the distance.","Crack!","Under everyone’s gaze, Zhang Han’s six duplications stood in a circle. The space around them shattered and collapsed. The rules of the Great Domain within a radius of five kilometers were obliterated.","“I can’t feel any aura.”","Yue Wuwei exclaimed, “But why do I feel that it’s so scary?”","“The Collapsed Space,” Immortal Master Lingxi said, “Zhang Hanyang is too strong. He is only in the ninth tier. Oh, my god! He can definitely open the Heaven Road at will now!”","“Me too.”","Mengmeng had also reached the fifth-tier Tribulation Stage, but her combat capability had become the most powerful one on Mount New Moon, second only to that of Zhang Han, Zi Yan, and Yue Wuwei.","Mengmeng waved her little hand, and the strong rules of Great Domain appeared.","Then, the Heaven Road appeared.","“The higher world is over there,” Mengmeng said casually. “We can go if we want to. But the energy of the Great Domain is limited. It can’t take many people at one time.”","“Hiss.”","Immortal Master Lingxi gasped, and then she fell into silence.","The entire family was abnormal.","“When do you become so strong?” Immortal Master Waterheaven was stunned.","How could Hanyang and Mengmeng get things that countless cultivators had pursued since ancient times so easily?","They were so relaxed. Even if they had pretended to be a little tired, he could accept the fact more easily.","This was too heart-wrenching.","Swoosh!","Mengmeng casually dispersed the Heaven Road.","She looked at Zhang Han in the distance and said, “My father can also do it. He can break through the void easily.”","Immortal Master Waterheaven’s beard trembled once more.","“Mummy seems to be also able to do it, right?” Mengmeng said.","“I don’t know the specific method, but I can shatter the void,” Zi Yan said.","Immortal Master Waterheaven was speechless.","He sighed.","“I don’t want to hear such things anymore. Can you shut up?”"]},{"number":1700,"title":"Chapter 1700 Confront the Heavenly Tribulation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1700 Confront the Heavenly Tribulation","Mengmeng added, “But my father said we don’t need to go through Thunder Tribulations. When we take the Heaven Road, we may be hindered by the rules of the world. Now our strength is not Peak-Stage. We can take the Heaven Road when it’s safe so as not to encounter any accidents.”","“Yes. Safety first.” Zhang Guangyou said with a smile, “Besides, we are doing well in the Cultivation World. There are still many places we haven’t been to. We don’t need to be in a hurry to go to the higher world.”","“Yes,” Mengmeng replied.","“Zhang Han has reached the ninth tier. I’ll make some preparations. When he finishes, I’ll also break through to the ninth tier,” Yue Wuwei said.","After that, he flew to another place, levitating in the void. He brewed his aura and took three medicinal pellets.","About an hour later, the void around Zhang Han was once again surrounded by the rules of the Great Domain.","His other duplications entered the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure.","He opened his eyes and looked at the people in the distance.","“The Nine Suns Godly Body is powerful.","“The rules of the world are suppressing my six bodies more and more.","“I can’t control the Heaven Road.”","Zhang Han pondered for a moment. He had considered a lot of things. Although he could go to the higher world now, he had always kept what Sir had said in mind.","His journey was too smooth. The more smooth it was now, the stronger the future tribulation would be.","“Is it because I changed my fate and reincarnated?”","Zhang Han thought it was the case.","Therefore, instead of taking the Heaven Road to the higher world, it was better to stay in the Cultivation World and observe the situation.","Moreover, he had not reached the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage yet, and Mengmeng was only at the fifth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","Zhang Han was not in a hurry. Instead, he talked to Mengmeng about it.","“Zhang Han, is it convenient for me to break through now?”","Yue Wuwei used the Designated Voice-transmitting Technique to talk to Zhang Han from a short distance away. “Since I will step into the ninth tier, it will be not easy. How do you feel? I can also wait for some time.”","“It’s okay. You can break through directly.” Zhang Han smiled.","He was fearless.","With his current strength, he could easily deal with the Heavenly Tribulation that Yue Wuwei would summon.","“Then I’ll start.”","Yue Wuwei’s body made a muffled sound.","He released a violent aura. Yue Wuwei, who was in the Peak-Stage eighth-tier Tribulation Stage, easily summoned his Tribulation Stage.","The tribulation clouds churned.","“I’m back!”","Yue Wuwei looked up at the rolling tribulation clouds and said flatly, “I’ll break through to the ninth tier!”","Buzz!","The tribulation clouds expanded in size.","In three seconds, they gathered into tribulation clouds of a hundred thousand kilometers.","The area was large, and the Dao Seeking Cultivators of the Human Clan were as small as dust in front of the tribulation clouds.","The Thunder Tribulation was so arrogant!","They hadn’t seen the Thunder Tribulation for decades. How dare it be like this?","When Yue Wuwei was about to step into the ninth tier, an elemental Heavenly Tribulation came.","“This aura...”","“Four Symbols Magic Thunder!”","Zhang Han narrowed his eyes slightly.","The tribulation clouds gathered. The thunder inside was accompanied by a special aura.","It was the sounds of the Four Symbols.","“Be careful! This is the Four Symbols Magic Thunder!”","Zhang Han observed carefully, confirmed it, and told Yue Wuwei.","“What? The Four Symbols Magic Thunder?”","Yue Wuwei didn’t feel anything at first. Then Immortal Master Waterheaven on the other side cried out in horror.","“The Four Symbols Magic Thunder is a Heavenly Tribulation once summoned by someone at the Peak-Stage Tribulation Stage. Its power is second only to the Holy Thunder of the Five Elements. Moreover, the area of the Four Symbols Magic Thunder is limited, and its destructive power is extremely great!”","“It’s a great trouble.” Lingxi said, “The Four Symbols Magic Thunder is unusual. It’s difficult for him to break through to the ninth tier.”","Clatter!","Yue Wuwei was shocked.","Then he thought of Zhang Han. With Zhang Han around, he was not afraid at all.","“Ha...”","Yue Wuwei laughed and said, “No matter what happens, I won’t move!”","Then he didn’t move.","Swoosh!","Yue Wuwei quickly flew to Zhang Han and whispered, “Are you sure?”","“It’s okay.”","Zhang Han shook his head slightly, looked at the tribulation clouds, and said softly, “Go ahead!”","Rumble!","In the eyes of the Heavenly Tribulation, this was a provocation. In its territory, he dared to be so arrogant. In the past, he could run. This time, it would be difficult for them to escape.","The Four Symbols Magic Thunder was a kind of special tribulation lightning in the Heavenly Tribulation. It could break all illusions.","If it could speak, the Heavenly Tribulation would probably laugh wildly and say, “Your trash One Cloud has nowhere to hide in the face of the Four Symbols Magic Thunder. Go to hell!”","Boom!","The first batch of tribulation lightning bolts fell.","Countless thunderbolts gathered into huge cyan dragon shadows.","The tribulation of the Azure Dragon fell with a boom!","The power of heaven poured down with profound energy.","“Is he so strong?”","Yue Wuwei gasped.","He felt helpless as if he was a small sailboat in the sea.","“If I face the Four Symbols Magic Thunder, I will be doomed by the tribulation of Azure Dragon alone.”","“Come on!”","Zhang Han shone all over.","After the transformation of his Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure and Thunder Body, he rushed forward and clapped his hands. A huge thunder net shook the thunder of Azure Dragon.","Sizzling!","Under many people’s gazes, the tribulation of the Azure Dragon was continuously assimilated by the thunder net Zhang Han cast.","In their view, Zhang Han seemed to have destroyed the tribulation of the Azure Dragon. But actually, the energy of the tribulation of the Azure Dragon had been all absorbed by the Thunder Body.","“How could he manage to withstand the Heavenly Tribulation?”","Immortal Master Lingxi widened her eyes, and she was already stunned.","Even though she was always calm, she couldn’t avoid falling into a daze.","She couldn’t understand what he had used to resist the Heavenly Tribulation.","“From the past until now, there has never been anyone who could face Heavenly Tribulation head-on. How did he do it?”","Immortal Master Lingxi felt her scalp go numb. A chill ran down her spine.","“Ha... This is normal,” Mengmeng said with a smile. “My Daddy is not an ordinary person. He is the most powerful one.”","Since Mengmeng was a child, Zhang Han had been a hero and a God of War in Mengmeng’s heart.","Now that Mengmeng had grown up, she was still proud of him.","“It’s terrifying. Zhang Hanyang is too horrible,” Immortal Master Lingxi said repeatedly. “He’s much more terrifying than he used to be. This time, he can defeat the divine thunder over the sky head-on!”","She was shocked when seeing it.","“He has just broken through to the ninth tier, but he can fight against the Four Symbols Magic Thunder. How terrifying he will be in the future!”","Immortal Master Lingxi muttered with shock.","It was also the first time for Immortal Master Waterheaven to see such a scene.","The little white horse and other ancient demonic beasts were also shocked.","They stood there in a daze.","“The Great Demon King is so scary.”","The little white horse rolled its eyes and said, “Fortunately, I didn’t play tricks at that time. Or else, I would have been beaten to death.”","Phew!","Of course, Yue Wuwei was the one who felt the most energy fluctuations.","He took a deep breath and said, “If the Four Symbols Magic Thunder is so powerful, how powerful is divine thunder over the sky? The Heavenly Tribulation is still terrible.”","He felt ashamed. Because of Zhang Han, he had forgotten how horrible the Heavenly Tribulation was for so many years.","“He is indeed powerful.”","Zhang Han felt that his hands were a little numb. “The second one is coming!”","The tribulation of the White Tiger!","Zhang Han continued to fight back.","The tribulations of Vermilion Bird and Black Tortoise also came.","Zhang Han fended off all four batches of tribulation lightning bolts.","Boom!","The Heavenly Tribulation was filled with rage. Thunder surged within the tribulation clouds.","Five colors suddenly lit up.","“Holy Thunder of the Five Elements!”","Immortal Master Lingxi cried out involuntarily with astonishment. “How could this be like this?”","“Two types of elemental tribulation lightning?” Immortal Master Waterheaven opened his mouth wide. “Heavens, how could there be two types in a Heavenly Tribulation?”","It broke his previous understanding of the Heavenly Tribulation.","It was as if his world outlook had been shattered.","Mengmeng and the others were also a little stunned.","They were not very shocked because they did not know much about the Heavenly Tribulation.","Yue Wuwei was a little scared.","“The Heavenly Tribulation is so vengeful. Next time, I won’t show off. Please attack us gently. Zhang Han, can you resist it this time? Should we run away?”","Zhang Han suddenly burst into laughter.","His smile was like a spring breeze, and his voice was free and easy.","He flew up again.","The tribulation lightning of gold!","The Thunder Body gathered all its strength and punched out hundreds of times the shadow of a fist, dissipating the tribulation lightning of gold.","Then the tribulation lightning of wood, water...","Boom! Boom! Boom!","He only used five punches to completely destroy the Holy Thunder of the Five Elements.","The energy of thunder spread all over the void.","Immortal Master Waterheaven, Immortal Master Lingxi, the little white horse, and the other ancient demonic beasts were all dumbfounded.","“How could he be so abnormal?” Immortal Master Lingxi muttered in a low voice.","Boom!","The tribulation clouds churned violently.","From the looks of it, this might be the most angry Heavenly Tribulation in history.","The tribulation lightning of the two elements was far more powerful than that of a Heavenly Tribulation between the eighth tier and the ninth tier. It could only be summoned by someone with high aptitude like Yue Wuwei.","The tribulation lightning failed again.","“How could this person be so terrifying? He wasn’t even afraid of the Heavenly Tribulation!”","Even the Heavenly Tribulation was a bit confused. Its intelligence wasn’t high enough, so it knew it wasn’t the other party’s match. However, the tribulation clouds didn’t scatter, continuously releasing muffled sounds in the air.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","It seemed that it was cursing in the street. It was also like a gentleman who didn’t fight with words.","Five minutes passed just like this.","The tribulation clouds were still there, and the thunder was still loud.","“It won’t come again. Let’s go.”","Zhang Han put his hands behind his back and looked calm.","But in fact, the Thunder Body was trembling all the time.","Even though he had reached the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage, he still felt a little tired after fighting against two kinds of elemental tribulation lightning in a row.","Swoosh!","When he transformed into the Cosmic Extreme Tao Figure, the fatigue he had felt disappeared.","“It seems that the Thunder Body won’t have to devour any Heavenly Tribulation for a long time.”","After thinking for a while, Zhang Han took the lead in flying to the fleet.","“Zhang Hanyang, why are you so strong?” Immortal Master Lingxi immediately came over and said, “Please teach me. I also want to fight against the Heavenly Tribulation.”","Crack!","A thunderbolt lit up in the distance, flashing with its anger.","“Hanyang, I want to learn, too.” Immortal Master Waterheaven looked at Hanyang eagerly.","“You can’t learn it.”","Zhang Han found it funny and said, “If everyone can learn it, all the people can go to the higher world.”","“Alas!”","Immortal Master Lingxi said, “I’m convinced. I’ll not provoke you in the future. You’re too terrifying.”","“If that’s the case, you can let anyone pass the Heavenly Tribulation as you want?” Immortal Master Waterheaven suddenly thought of something.","“That is indeed the case.”","Zhang Han nodded and said, “But I won’t do that easily. It will affect too many people and burden me.”","At the very least, he could only talk about other things after he discovered and resolved the calamity directed at him that Sir had said.","This was the reason why Zhang Han came to the Star Sea. He had already broken through to the ninth tier of the Tribulation Stage.","The will of Sir had once said that when the Godly Body was born and the six duplications converged into one, perhaps the tribulation would come.","But what was that tribulation? He didn’t know it, and he had no way to know it.","Then they entered the inner ring.","“What? Was the Highest Clouds Palace destroyed?”","Immortal Master Waterheaven felt dizzy. After asking around, he obtained a lot of information.","“Immortal Master Wumo returned ten years ago. The Dongruo Holy Land joined forces with 40 Holy Lands of the fifth mountain, the sixth mountain, and the seventh mountain to attack the Highest Clouds Palace at the same time. The Highest Clouds Palace was destroyed.”","“They have been inquiring about Immortal Master Waterheaven and Han Yang Immortal.”","“It seems they want to avenge someone.”","Hearing the news, Zhang Han frowned.","“Could this be that tribulation?”","“No! That’s not right. Those several dozen forces from the Dongruo Holy Land are not qualified to become a tribulation.”","Zhang Han sighed softly, feeling that he had thought too much.","But the matter still needed to be solved. They had to inquire more about it."]}]);
